values
  ('338459057584216854', 'I Dream of Jeannie... Fifteen Years Later', 1985, 'Comedy, TV Movie', 'William Asher, Jack Whitman', null, 'Barbara Eden, Bill Daily, Hayden Rorke, Mackenzie Astin, Dori Brenner, André De Shields, John Bennett Perry, Dody Goodman', 'G', 'Jeannie has been a happily married housewife for 15 years to her astronaut husband Tony Nelson and has a teenage son, T.J. When Tony is promoted to Colonel and is about to retire from the NASA space program, Jeannie decides to give him a celebration party in their backyard. However, egged on by his colleagues to retire with a dramatic flair, Tony breaks his promise to Jeannie for one more space flight (aboard the shuttle), this time with a female astronaut, Captain Nelly Hunt.', 'Jeannie has been a happily married housewife for 15 years to her astronaut husband Tony Nelson and has a teenage son, T.J. When Tony is promoted to Colonel and is about to retire from the NASA space program, Jeannie decides to give him a celebration party in their backyard. However, egged on by his colleagues to retire with a dramatic flair, Tony breaks his promise to Jeannie for one more space flight (aboard the shuttle), this time with a female astronaut, Captain Nelly Hunt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/msmn0rVN7wRHZYJEliUGT5QxE1w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125421'),
  ('795587270685478410', 'I Dream Too Much', 1935, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Carl Dreher, Charles M. Kirk, John Cromwell', 'Edmund H. North, James Gow', 'Lily Pons, Henry Fonda, Eric Blore, Osgood Perkins, Lucien Littlefield, Lucille Ball, Mischa Auer, Paul Porcasi', null, 'Opera student Annette Monard meets composer Jonathan Street, and in a buoyant, alcohol-fueled evening, the couple marries. Sincerely falling in love, Jonathan encourages the talented Annette to sing — yet when his own attempt at an opera fails, Jonathan lashes out at Annette''s success. Despite her husband''s jealousy, Annette embarks on a successful career that allows her to secretly fund Jonathan''s opera, bringing their marriage to a crisis.', 'Opera student Annette Monard meets composer Jonathan Street, and in a buoyant, alcohol-fueled evening, the couple marries. Sincerely falling in love, Jonathan encourages the talented Annette to sing — yet when his own attempt at an opera fails, Jonathan lashes out at Annette''s success. Despite her husband''s jealousy, Annette embarks on a successful career that allows her to secretly fund Jonathan''s opera, bringing their marriage to a crisis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Whyoac7ta8uwCuP4I28Cauox1p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:218389'),
  ('697771248326264270', 'I Dreamed of Africa', 2000, 'Romance, Drama, Adventure', 'Hugh Hudson, Bernard Lutic', 'Susan Shilliday, Paula Milne', 'Kim Basinger, Vincent Perez, Liam Aiken, Daniel Craig, Eva Marie Saint, Lance Reddick, Stephen Jennings, Nick Boraine', 'PG-13', 'Inspired by the true story of indomitable Kuki Gallmann, the film tells of a beautiful and inquisitive woman who had the courage to escape from her comfortable yet monotonous life in Italy to start anew in the African wilderness with her son, Emanuele, and her new husband, Paolo. Gallmann faces great danger there but eventually becomes a celebrated conservationist.', 'Inspired by the true story of indomitable Kuki Gallmann, the film tells of a beautiful and inquisitive woman who had the courage to escape from her comfortable yet monotonous life in Italy to start anew in the African wilderness with her son, Emanuele, and her new husband, Paolo. Gallmann faces great danger there but eventually becomes a celebrated conservationist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kuDIrcsUI0duLSTUgKKLKEiEdrK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21311'),
  ('617396612589197800', 'I Dreamt Under the Water', 2008, 'Drama, Romance', 'Hormoz', 'Hormoz', 'Hubert Benhamdine, Franck Victor, Caroline Ducey, Hicham Nazzal, Christine Boisson, Hélène Michel, Éva Ionesco, Hervé P. Gustave', 'NR', 'Antoine, a handsome boy in his 20s, falls for a straight best friend who does not reciprocate, and being a junkie exits the film quite early. Enter a girl, who seems to make him happy again, after he has tried living as a rent boy with men, having some familial, financial difficulties. But the girl is a junkie too.', 'Antoine, a handsome boy in his 20s, falls for a straight best friend who does not reciprocate, and being a junkie exits the film quite early. Enter a girl, who seems to make him happy again, after he has tried living as a rent boy with men, having some familial, financial difficulties. But the girl is a junkie too.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7R9DYR3mhAzU4vW4F8yUFwRm878.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44352'),
  ('448621613737631233', 'I Drink Your Blood', 1971, 'Horror', 'David E. Durston, Jacques Demarecaux', 'David E. Durston', 'Bhaskar Roy Chowdhury, Jadin Wong, Rhonda Fultz, George Patterson, Riley Mills, John Damon, Elizabeth Marner-Brooks, Richard Bowler', 'R', 'A group of Satanic hippies wreak havoc on a small town where a young boy, whose sister and grandfather were victimized by them, tries to get even - with deadly results.', 'A group of Satanic hippies wreak havoc on a small town where a young boy, whose sister and grandfather were victimized by them, tries to get even - with deadly results.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vmqUMajGp8WTMvUexATvfabY7xx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27313'),
  ('321670698308305320', 'I due assi del guantone', 1971, 'Comedy', 'Tino Santoni, Mariano Laurenti, Alessandro Metz', 'Roberto Gianviti, Dino Verde', 'Franco Franchi, Ciccio Ingrassia, Mario Carotenuto, Ave Ninchi, Paola Tedesco, Gino Milli, Umberto D''Orsi, Giulio Rinaldi', null, 'Two waiters who work in a restaurant, whose owner is a big boxing fan, pretend one of them is a boxer and the other his manager. The supposed boxer wins his first matches thanks to set ups organized by the other but when he beats a champion from another part of town, he is severely beaten up by his supporters.', 'Two waiters who work in a restaurant, whose owner is a big boxing fan, pretend one of them is a boxer and the other his manager. The supposed boxer wins his first matches thanks to set ups organized by the other but when he beats a champion from another part of town, he is severely beaten up by his supporters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lOPp5LRkR6qCaTds1YVa65lCgs6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:260080'),
  ('280892096148549884', 'I due carabinieri', 1984, 'Comedy', 'Danilo Desideri, Paolo Costella, Albino Cocco', 'Leonardo Benvenuti, Piero De Bernardi, Carlo Verdone', 'Enrico Montesano, Carlo Verdone, Massimo Boldi, Paola Onofri, Anna Maria Torniai, Guido Celano, Andrea Aureli, Tony Brennero', null, 'Two deadbeat friends barely pass the entrance exam for the Carabinieri, the national gendarmerie of Italy, but love for the same woman gets in the way.', 'Two deadbeat friends barely pass the entrance exam for the Carabinieri, the national gendarmerie of Italy, but love for the same woman gets in the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gFHgb0I51QCLBNoKI8lhjNpfB8H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59040'),
  ('758030966808874571', 'I due toreri', 1964, 'Comedy', 'Giorgio Simonelli, Luciano Trasatti, Giuliano Carnimeo', 'Marcello Ciorciolini, Roberto Gianviti, Dino Verde', 'Ciccio Ingrassia, Franco Franchi, Fernando Sancho, Rossella Como, Silvia Solar, Maria Teresa Vianello, Elisa Montés, Carlo Romano', null, 'In Sicily Franco and Ciccio are empowered by a local mafia man to guard for a wide range of salad. In reality however this is not simple salad vegetables but marijuana; the two bungling fools and friends do not realize it at first.', 'In Sicily Franco and Ciccio are empowered by a local mafia man to guard for a wide range of salad. In reality however this is not simple salad vegetables but marijuana; the two bungling fools and friends do not realize it at first.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AfXpCfk0nhfh4bfsOARJaeykuvG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:133335'),
  ('545272994995453064', 'I due vigili', 1967, 'Comedy', 'Giuseppe Orlandini, Benito Frattari, Stefano Rolla', 'Roberto Gianviti', 'Franco Franchi, Ciccio Ingrassia, Umberto D''Orsi, Luciana Scalise, Franco Giacobini, Rosita Pisano, Britt Garland, Mario Frera', null, 'Two traffic policemen help capture a dangerous robber after unwittingly contributing to his making off with the loot.', 'Two traffic policemen help capture a dangerous robber after unwittingly contributing to his making off with the loot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oq795CpZLtqWT9bpPjitMfxi7Zg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:131289'),
  ('462210974816821615', 'I Dutifully Report', 1958, 'Comedy, War', 'Karel Steklý, Lada Vacková, Jan Roth', 'Karel Steklý', 'Rudolf Hrušínský, Svatopluk Beneš, Miloš Nedbal, Jaroslav Marvan, Fanda Mrázek, Jaroslav Vojta, Alois Dvorský, Jana Kovaříková', null, 'A comedy based on the novel of Jaroslav Hašek''s The Good Soldier Svejk happens during the World War I. I Dutifully Report: In the introduction to the second part of the film adaptation of Hašek''s novel The Good Soldier Švějk presents his main character Josef Švejk. With the distinctive traditional Czech cartoon character of a soldier Svejk, this time you meet on the way to the front and eventually right in the firing line. You can look at his famous train events, and also probably the most famous episode of the novel, Švejk''s Budějovice anabasis. Don''t miss the scene with the secretly bought cognac, the episode with Svejk as a fake Russian prisoner of war, including the court scene, and the scene in which lieutenant Dub is caught in a brothel. Despite the criticism, Steklý''s adaptation is undoubtedly the most famous and memorable at present.', 'A comedy based on the novel of Jaroslav Hašek''s The Good Soldier Svejk happens during the World War I. I Dutifully Report: In the introduction to the second part of the film adaptation of Hašek''s novel The Good Soldier Švějk presents his main character Josef Švejk. With the distinctive traditional Czech cartoon character of a soldier Svejk, this time you meet on the way to the front and eventually right in the firing line. You can look at his famous train events, and also probably the most famous episode of the novel, Švejk''s Budějovice anabasis. Don''t miss the scene with the secretly bought cognac, the episode with Svejk as a fake Russian prisoner of war, including the court scene, and the scene in which lieutenant Dub is caught in a brothel. Despite the criticism, Steklý''s adaptation is undoubtedly the most famous and memorable at present.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uOaHGpkcd2eZcQU1CiFDDfmITO5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:123514'),
  ('438851257449471185', 'I Eat Your Skin', 1971, 'Horror', 'Del Tenney, William Grefé, François Farkas', 'Del Tenney', 'Heather Hewitt, Betty Hyatt Linton, Dan Stapleton, William Joyce, Walter Coy, Robert Stanton, Vanoye Aikens, Rebecca Oliver', 'R', 'A playboy adventure novelist joins his publisher on an expedition to Voodoo Island in the Caribbean, where a cancer researcher is being forced to turn the tribes-people into zombies.', 'A playboy adventure novelist joins his publisher on an expedition to Voodoo Island in the Caribbean, where a cancer researcher is being forced to turn the tribes-people into zombies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mbBgHCs9gR6ba3oQ24FH0TZ2vbl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:93890'),
  ('522632766722718591', 'I Escaped from Devil''s Island', 1973, 'Action, Adventure, Crime', 'William Witney, Rosalío Solano', 'Richard DeLong Adams', 'Jim Brown, Christopher George, Richard Ely, James Luisi, Paul Richards, Richard Rust, Jan Merlin, Robert Phillips', 'R', 'In 1916, a group of prisoners plot their escape from the notorious fortress located in French Guiana.', 'In 1916, a group of prisoners plot their escape from the notorious fortress located in French Guiana.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ctMQ8nvwUafkNlW4KGT4ACuLKKB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84363'),
  ('915094429652302158', 'I Even Met Happy Gypsies', 1967, 'Drama', 'Aleksandar Petrović, Tomislav Pinter', 'Aleksandar Petrović', 'Bekim Fehmiu, Olivera Katarina, Velimir Živojinović, Gordana Jovanović, Rahela Ferari, Milosav ''Mija'' Aleksić, Severin Bijelić, Stojan Dečermić', null, 'The protagonist, Bora, is a charming but mean-spirited gypsy, while his older wife, Lence, is submissive. Bora is in love with the younger Tisa, who is being offered in marriage by her father. The two get themselves in trouble and eventually have to flee. Tisa rejects her husband and she and Bora get married in the church, and their adventures continue.', 'The protagonist, Bora, is a charming but mean-spirited gypsy, while his older wife, Lence, is submissive. Bora is in love with the younger Tisa, who is being offered in marriage by her father. The two get themselves in trouble and eventually have to flee. Tisa rejects her husband and she and Bora get married in the church, and their adventures continue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dmJEXrWKLcSOccoBsM0cRXjncB3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59088'),
  ('1133232143546338993', 'I Feel Good', 2018, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Hugues Poulain, Gérard Bonnet, Benoît Delépine', 'Benoît Delépine, Gustave Kervern', 'Jean Dujardin, Yolande Moreau, Joseph Dahan, Lou Castel, Jean-Benoît Ugeux, Jean-François Landon, Jana Bittnerová, Elsa Foucaud', null, 'He’s lived for too long off his parents. It’s time for 40-year-old slacker Jacques to get by on his own. One-time gigolo and a borderline bum, he knows what he wants – to become rich and famous. He even has a business plan: tourism combined with cheap plastic surgery. Jacques moves in with his older sister, Monique, who manages an Emmaus village in the south west of France. And before long, the smooth-talking chancer has convinced a group of workers to pool their meagre funds and set out on a trip to a clinic in Bulgaria, where all their dreams of a brighter and more beautiful future will all come true. If only…', 'He’s lived for too long off his parents. It’s time for 40-year-old slacker Jacques to get by on his own. One-time gigolo and a borderline bum, he knows what he wants – to become rich and famous. He even has a business plan: tourism combined with cheap plastic surgery. Jacques moves in with his older sister, Monique, who manages an Emmaus village in the south west of France. And before long, the smooth-talking chancer has convinced a group of workers to pool their meagre funds and set out on a trip to a clinic in Bulgaria, where all their dreams of a brighter and more beautiful future will all come true. If only…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4cMTOfXbpD0Z9CVuDtkBiz9kMcj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:495671'),
  ('1076903017521306099', 'I Feel in Love', 1985, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Ertem Eğilmez', null, 'Şener Şen, Nevra Serezli, Ayşen Gruda, Erdal Özyağcılar, Savaş Dinçel, Uğur Yücel, Necati Bilgiç, Sümer Tilmaç', null, 'Şakir is instantly infatuated with Sibel in a red dress whom he meets in the parking lot of the advertising agency where he works, and he is desperate to win this fascinating woman. But there is one obstacle; Şakir is married! Despite this, Şakir is determined to pursue Sibel and will try various ways to achieve his goal.', 'Şakir is instantly infatuated with Sibel in a red dress whom he meets in the parking lot of the advertising agency where he works, and he is desperate to win this fascinating woman. But there is one obstacle; Şakir is married! Despite this, Şakir is determined to pursue Sibel and will try various ways to achieve his goal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u3N38S0sDMkN2Ka0p6H96qfJAAX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:219210'),
  ('748227985237463757', 'I Feel Like Disco', 2013, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Dennis Pauls, Axel Ranisch', 'Axel Ranisch', 'Heiko Pinkowski, Christina Große, Rosa von Praunheim, Talisa Lilly Lemke, Robert Alexander Baer, Frithjof Gawenda, Hardy Schwetter, Petra Hartung', null, 'A youth in middle of self-discovery, offending with his father, just discovering his sexuality and hiding it again. A boy who''s often lonely loses a loved one and is in love with the wrong one.', 'A youth in middle of self-discovery, offending with his father, just discovering his sexuality and hiding it again. A boy who''s often lonely loses a loved one and is in love with the wrong one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ceezGJibrbk5Xmw7YS2dIKGyzsJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:241066'),
  ('654208327353685776', 'I Feel Pretty', 2018, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Abby Kohn, Marc Silverstein, Florian Ballhaus', 'Abby Kohn, Marc Silverstein', 'Amy Schumer, Michelle Williams, Tom Hopper, Rory Scovel, Adrian Martinez, Emily Ratajkowski, Aidy Bryant, Busy Philipps', 'PG-13', 'A head injury causes a woman to develop an extraordinary amount of confidence and believe she''s drop dead gorgeous.', 'A head injury causes a woman to develop an extraordinary amount of confidence and believe she''s drop dead gorgeous.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iuPs45XIxfARKPLEkCGXWUrBrTR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:460668'),
  ('343330410619014094', 'I Feel Strange', 1977, 'Drama, Romance', 'Alejo Loren, Enrique Martí Maqueda, Luis Gómez Valdivieso', 'Enrique Martí Maqueda, Rafael Herrero', 'Rocío Dúrcal, Bárbara Rey, Francisco Algora, Ricardo Tundidor, Eva León, Luis Marín, Rafael Navarro, José Antonio Ceinos', null, 'Laura, a pianist who has left home to flee her abusive husband, meets Marta, a vedette with whom she will work on the preparation of her new show.', 'Laura, a pianist who has left home to flee her abusive husband, meets Marta, a vedette with whom she will work on the preparation of her new show.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aqLKBqOnEeHBA21FPhj4zG5BG2A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:365279'),
  ('392642570001290861', 'I Fell, It''s Fine', 2026, 'Romance', 'Sigrid Andrea P. Bernardo, Boy Yñiguez, Charita Castinlag', 'Sigrid Andrea P. Bernardo', 'Glaiza de Castro, Rhian Ramos, Rafael Rosell, Queenay Mercado, Alcris Galura, Ice Arago, Elizabeth Oropesa, Elora Españo', null, 'When Anne, a guarded wellness-resort owner, meets an otherworldly woman named Chicks, her carefully controlled life begins to unravel in the most healing way.', 'When Anne, a guarded wellness-resort owner, meets an otherworldly woman named Chicks, her carefully controlled life begins to unravel in the most healing way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1KCtVONn5VpHD6nc1orKRfYRFvA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1391450'),
  ('632458688451554178', 'I Fichissimi', 1981, 'Comedy', 'Carlo Vanzina, Bruno Cortini, Alessandro D''Eva', 'Carlo Vanzina, Enrico Vanzina', 'Jerry Calà, Diego Abatantuono, Simona Mariani, Mauro Di Francesco, Renato Cecchetto, Carmine Faraco, Fabio Grossi, Barbara Herrera', null, 'Romeo and Felice lead two rival bands who constantly make fun of each other. One day, Romeo meets and falls in love with Giulietta, without knowing that she is Felice''s sister.', 'Romeo and Felice lead two rival bands who constantly make fun of each other. One day, Romeo meets and falls in love with Giulietta, without knowing that she is Felice''s sister.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pltELBB1XvRRYlMBWu4Znv8LYGF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38527'),
  ('1145426740853371679', 'I Fine..Thank You..Love You', 2014, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Kittiwat Saemarat, Parama Malakul Na Ayudhaya, Mez Tharatorn', 'Mez Tharatorn, Chaiyapreuk Chalermpornpanich, Benjamaporn Srabua', 'Preechaya Pongthananikorn, Sunny Suwanmethanon, Popetorn Soonthornyanakij, Gornpop Janjaroen, Sora Aoi, Puttachat Pongsuchat, Kunyada Tawiya, Anuparp Suriyathong', null, 'Desperate to go to the U.S. to win back his girlfriend, Yim hires a tutor to teach him English. But things don''t go according to plan.', 'Desperate to go to the U.S. to win back his girlfriend, Yim hires a tutor to teach him English. But things don''t go according to plan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9csZTLy2mOOiiH0bJjgV5nrFv9f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:332506'),
  ('113594756010847937', 'I Flunked, But...', 1930, 'Comedy', 'Yasujirō Ozu, Hideo Shigehara, Yasushi Sasaki', 'Akira Fushimi', 'Tatsuo Saitō, Kaoru Futaba, Tomio Aoki, Hiroo Wakabayashi, Ikkō Ōkuni, Kinuyo Tanaka, Hiroshi Mikura, Chishū Ryū', null, 'This bittersweet comedy tells the tale of a group of college roommates attempting to cheat their way through their exams. As the title goes, things don''t work out for our roguish main character, but his classmates soon find themselves in a similarly sorry state...', 'This bittersweet comedy tells the tale of a group of college roommates attempting to cheat their way through their exams. As the title goes, things don''t work out for our roguish main character, but his classmates soon find themselves in a similarly sorry state...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Fd6e27458LY00f7vTjybUtcxgw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88269'),
  ('825745774987500180', 'I fratelli De Filippo', 2021, 'History, Drama', 'Gisella Gobbi, Marzia Natali, Andrea Vitale', 'Carla Cavalluzzi, Sergio Rubini, Angelo Pasquini', 'Mario Autore, Domenico Pinelli, Anna Ferraioli Ravel, Biagio Izzo, Susy Del Giudice, Marisa Laurito, Marianna Fontana, Maurizio Casagrande', null, 'The story of the De Filippo brothers, children of Eduardo Scarpetta.', 'The story of the De Filippo brothers, children of Eduardo Scarpetta.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3YgvUSIr9dL2FIdgOvX1i8MbsJf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:784374'),
  ('528071545494580562', 'I Give It a Year', 2013, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Dan Mazer, Ben Davis, Bill Crutcher', 'Dan Mazer', 'Rose Byrne, Rafe Spall, Simon Baker, Anna Faris, Stephen Merchant, Minnie Driver, Jason Flemyng, Jane Asher', 'R', 'After a quick courtship, two lovers hastily decide to tie the knot. As their first year of marriage unfolds, temptation and incompatibility put their relationship in jeopardy.', 'After a quick courtship, two lovers hastily decide to tie the knot. As their first year of marriage unfolds, temptation and incompatibility put their relationship in jeopardy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hCSqxrM5Sw6AhDIRfxQ4BenPd9y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:150117'),
  ('710168086240171681', 'I Give My First Love to You', 2009, 'Drama, Romance', 'Takehiko Shinjo, Mitsuru Komiyama, Masatoshi Takeyama', 'Kenji Bando', 'Mao Inoue, Masaki Okada, Tetta Sugimoto, Yōko Moriguchi, Yoshihiko Hosoda, Natsuki Harada, Toru Nakamura, Yuki Terada', null, 'Takuma knows that his life is shorter than the others and he feels that his demise is getting near. He chose to stay away from the girl that he loves so that she can easily move on. What he didn''t know is that he is under-estimating her.', 'Takuma knows that his life is shorter than the others and he feels that his demise is getting near. He chose to stay away from the girl that he loves so that she can easily move on. What he didn''t know is that he is under-estimating her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pI0qz8FTWvQ3NhgfrvblrXIOQeD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40700'),
  ('994858279963238865', 'I Give You a Star', 1974, 'Animation', 'Fyodor Khitruk, Georgiy Martynyuk, Mikhail Druyan', 'Fyodor Khitruk, Mariya Motruk', 'Valentin Nikulin', null, 'A comedy that humorously addresses the issue of a woman''s role in the family. The film consists of four short stories, united by the same characters: a Man and a Woman, living in different eras.', 'A comedy that humorously addresses the issue of a woman''s role in the family. The film consists of four short stories, united by the same characters: a Man and a Woman, living in different eras.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o5sqRX1c7Ot3r9ejXwO4H4D9qtV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90055'),
  ('709918833705973989', 'I Gopher You', 1954, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Friz Freleng, Carl W. Stalling', null, 'Mel Blanc, Stan Freberg', null, 'Two polite twin gophers are indignant at the swiping of all their vegetables by "vandals" in trucks. They follow the trucks to a food processing plant and become caught in the machinery when they try to retrieve their property.', 'Two polite twin gophers are indignant at the swiping of all their vegetables by "vandals" in trucks. They follow the trucks to a food processing plant and become caught in the machinery when they try to retrieve their property.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bkEvEIyjo7f84KHHEjp3BvOnc2b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:235800'),
  ('343501282500739071', 'I Got Life!', 2017, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Blandine Lenoir, Pierre Milon', 'Blandine Lenoir, Jean-Luc Gaget, Océan', 'Agnès Jaoui, Thibault de Montalembert, Pascale Arbillot, Sarah Suco, Lou Roy-Lecollinet, Philippe Rebbot, Laure Calamy, Marc Citti', null, 'Aurore has separated, just lost her job, and learns that she is going to be a grandmother.', 'Aurore has separated, just lost her job, and learns that she is going to be a grandmother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gxMK7webO1uaoMWgGDfCqlbnLpr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:444291'),
  ('599422566141065321', 'I Got Plenty of Mutton', 1944, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Frank Tashlin', null, 'Mel Blanc', 'NR', 'A wolf, deprived of meat by war rationing and starving, sees an article in the newspaper about a sheepdog leaving his flock to join the army and thinks it will be easy pickings. However, if he had read the rest of the article, he would know that the flock is now guarded by the ram Killer Diller, a most formidable foe.', 'A wolf, deprived of meat by war rationing and starving, sees an article in the newspaper about a sheepdog leaving his flock to join the army and thinks it will be easy pickings. However, if he had read the rest of the article, he would know that the flock is now guarded by the ram Killer Diller, a most formidable foe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2DdRI0rjZquKPcCmftJSf9ttl5r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:158834'),
  ('823042250561833913', 'I Got the Hook-Up', 1998, 'Action, Comedy', 'Michael Martin, Antonio Calvache', null, 'Master P, Anthony Johnson, Gretchen Palmer, Ice Cube, Tommy Lister Jr., Helen Martin, Sheryl Underwood, John Witherspoon', 'R', 'Two broke buddies feel lucky when they come upon a truckload of cellular phones and begin selling them out of the back of their van. Trouble arises though, when the phones develop faults. The two friends then not only have to deal with unsatisfied customers but also the FBI.', 'Two broke buddies feel lucky when they come upon a truckload of cellular phones and begin selling them out of the back of their van. Trouble arises though, when the phones develop faults. The two friends then not only have to deal with unsatisfied customers but also the FBI.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u8kdtt80gFiqGKLTdQqdGWy9FfZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40505'),
  ('807318459352595520', 'I Graduated, But...', 1929, 'Comedy', 'Yasujirō Ozu', 'Yoshirō Aramaki', 'Minoru Takada, Kinuyo Tanaka, Utako Suzuki, Kenji Oyama, Shinichi Himori, Kenji Kimura, Takeshi Sakamoto, Chōko Iida', null, 'Tetsuo Nomoto, a young college graduate tries to find a decent job by himself. Later on, he will marry his girlfriend, Machiko, whom he hides the fact that he has no job. Hardships come quickly, which forces Machiko to find a job in a bar.', 'Tetsuo Nomoto, a young college graduate tries to find a decent job by himself. Later on, he will marry his girlfriend, Machiko, whom he hides the fact that he has no job. Hardships come quickly, which forces Machiko to find a job in a bar.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/85IRVSByltDJh6Reqb71bSu5l6g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:137118'),
  ('880724819340452876', 'I Hate Actors', 1986, 'Comedy', 'Gérard Krawczyk, Michel Cénet', 'Gérard Krawczyk', 'Pauline Lafont, Dominique Lavanant, Jean Poiret, Michel Galabru, Michel Blanc, Bernard Blier, Patrick Floersheim, Sophie Duez', null, 'A Hollywood studio is producing another spectacular when the top billed male stars suddenly show up as corpses, killed before the critics could ever put pen to paper. Under suspicion is a talent agent. Is he guilty or not? These macabre events have everyone off their feed, from the producers down to the lowest gofer.', 'A Hollywood studio is producing another spectacular when the top billed male stars suddenly show up as corpses, killed before the critics could ever put pen to paper. Under suspicion is a talent agent. Is he guilty or not? These macabre events have everyone off their feed, from the producers down to the lowest gofer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uhAqdkd2X00nu40YgAZbvsK6CwB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63979'),
  ('753455393079761826', 'I Hate But Love', 1962, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Koreyoshi Kurahara, Shigeyoshi Mine, Toshiya Fujita', 'Nobuo Yamada', 'Yūjirō Ishihara, Ruriko Asaoka, Hiroyuki Nagato, Izumi Ashikawa, Tamio Kawachi, Asao Koike, Asao Sano, Hiroshi Ichimura', null, 'A celebrity, dissatisfied with his personal and professional lives, impulsively leaves fast-paced Tokyo to deliver a much-needed jeep to a remote village. When his controlling manager, the woman he loves, follows, the two must reconcile while dodging reporters.', 'A celebrity, dissatisfied with his personal and professional lives, impulsively leaves fast-paced Tokyo to deliver a much-needed jeep to a remote village. When his controlling manager, the woman he loves, follows, the two must reconcile while dodging reporters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d0DFjT7mkz4DwVDCPbdnyyci2ZF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95506'),
  ('784970605679006440', 'I Hate Kids', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Blake T. Evans, Ken Wada, Jeff Pallotta', 'Frank Dietz, Todd Traina', 'Tom Everett Scott, Tituss Burgess, Julian Feder, Rachel Boston, Rhea Seehorn, Andrew Bowen, Julie Ann Emery, Maria de Lourdes Severny', 'PG-13', 'Nick Pearson is a life-long bachelor who is finally settling down. On the brink of his wedding he is surprised to find he has a 13 year old son who has come to find his him through the help of a psychic. The problem is Nick can''t stand kids and would happily send the boy back to live with his biological mother, except that no one has any clue who that might be. Having nowhere to turn Nick must hit the road with the boy and the neurotic, inept psychic to track down dozens of his disgraced ex-flings to whom he must ask the awkward question - with very mixed results.', 'Nick Pearson is a life-long bachelor who is finally settling down. On the brink of his wedding he is surprised to find he has a 13 year old son who has come to find his him through the help of a psychic. The problem is Nick can''t stand kids and would happily send the boy back to live with his biological mother, except that no one has any clue who that might be. Having nowhere to turn Nick must hit the road with the boy and the neurotic, inept psychic to track down dozens of his disgraced ex-flings to whom he must ask the awkward question - with very mixed results.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zD6kuWM0W2qSlqCJljRFUnByBou.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:511789'),
