  ('61576439609736282', 'I Have to Buy New Shoes', 2012, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Eriko Kitagawa, Shunji Iwai', 'Eriko Kitagawa', 'Osamu Mukai, Miho Nakayama, Mirei Kiritani, Go Ayano, Amanda Plummer', null, 'Freelance writer Aoi Teshigahara lives in Paris, France. Sen Yagami is a photographer who came to Paris, France due to his younger sister Suzume''s insistance. Over the next 3 days, Aoi Teshigahara and Sen Yagami fall in love. Meanwhile, Suzume meets her boyfriend Kango, whom they have been in a long distance relationship.', 'Freelance writer Aoi Teshigahara lives in Paris, France. Sen Yagami is a photographer who came to Paris, France due to his younger sister Suzume''s insistance. Over the next 3 days, Aoi Teshigahara and Sen Yagami fall in love. Meanwhile, Suzume meets her boyfriend Kango, whom they have been in a long distance relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jBQOARxLd9hWqfbew2nBrg85SsT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:142178'),
  ('9139220494866348', 'I Haven''t Got a Hat', 1935, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Friz Freleng', 'Friz Freleng', 'Billy Bletcher, Joe Dougherty, Bernice Hansen, Martha Wentworth', null, 'It''s recital day at the schoolhouse. First up: Porky, who recites The Midnight Ride of Paul Revere. A nervous kitten recites Mary Had a Little Lamb. The puppies Ham and Ex sing the title song. Oliver Owl plays the piano; Beans the cat puts a cat and dog inside, and they play a tune as well.', 'It''s recital day at the schoolhouse. First up: Porky, who recites The Midnight Ride of Paul Revere. A nervous kitten recites Mary Had a Little Lamb. The puppies Ham and Ex sing the title song. Oliver Owl plays the piano; Beans the cat puts a cat and dog inside, and they play a tune as well.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ikWnyu7I4TmrAfzMmTVQmypDbtx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100313'),
  ('905892331032516774', 'I Heard', 1933, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Dave Fleischer', null, 'Mae Questel, Billy Murray, Don Redman', null, 'The miners at Never Mine go to Betty Boop''s Tavern (a jazz-jumpin'' place) for lunch. Back in the mine, Bimbo delves into weird realms.', 'The miners at Never Mine go to Betty Boop''s Tavern (a jazz-jumpin'' place) for lunch. Back in the mine, Bimbo delves into weird realms.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y1hNOmBpkJlB1qMBRSsfZsBGTBh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:161889'),
  ('20463786198678088', 'I Heard the Bells', 2022, 'History, Fantasy, Drama', 'Steve Buckwalter, Jordan Velez, Joshua Enck', 'Joshua Enck', 'Stephen Atherholt, Jonathan Blair, Rachel Day Hughes, Zach Meeker', 'NR', 'Known as America’s Poet, Henry Wadsworth Longfellow leads an idyllic life – until the day his world is shattered by tragedy. With a nation divided by Civil War and his family torn apart, Henry puts down his pen, silenced by grief. But it’s the sound of Christmas morning that reignites the poet’s lost voice as he discovers the resounding hope of rekindled faith.', 'Known as America’s Poet, Henry Wadsworth Longfellow leads an idyllic life – until the day his world is shattered by tragedy. With a nation divided by Civil War and his family torn apart, Henry puts down his pen, silenced by grief. But it’s the sound of Christmas morning that reignites the poet’s lost voice as he discovers the resounding hope of rekindled faith.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rk2IyAZIYWx9WzznLkNj0rdEyhR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1039571'),
  ('1011657471174815355', 'I Hired a Contract Killer', 1990, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama, Romance', 'Timo Salminen, Aki Kaurismäki, Kari Laine', 'Aki Kaurismäki', 'Jean-Pierre Léaud, Margi Clarke, Kenneth Colley, T.R. Bowen, Imogen Claire, Angela Walsh, Cyril Epstein, Nicky Tesco', null, 'After losing his job and realizing that he is alone in the world, a businessman opts to voluntarily end his life. Lacking courage, he hires a contract killer to do the job. Then, while awaiting his demise, he meets a woman and promptly falls in love.', 'After losing his job and realizing that he is alone in the world, a businessman opts to voluntarily end his life. Lacking courage, he hires a contract killer to do the job. Then, while awaiting his demise, he meets a woman and promptly falls in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p343X7QppeByj9Sz6i003jNkens.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7975'),
  ('839114754453399867', 'I Hired Two Contract Cleaners', 1997, 'Comedy, TV Movie', 'Tapio Piirainen, Pauli Bessonoff', 'Tapio Piirainen', 'Kai Lehtinen, Pertti Koivula, Maarit Peltomaa, Saara Pakkasvirta, Mia Raski, Risto Aaltonen, Ossi Ahlapuro, Pekka Autiovuori', null, 'A ragtag team of cleaners tackles absurdly dangerous jobs - explosions, devastating water damage, and “impossible” stains - while dreaming of escaping poverty and enjoying holidays in the sun.', 'A ragtag team of cleaners tackles absurdly dangerous jobs - explosions, devastating water damage, and “impossible” stains - while dreaming of escaping poverty and enjoying holidays in the sun.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mI3t5QAx2KP4m3Mwh8KRoSnSqgc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148479'),
  ('536519702786230104', 'I Hope They Serve Beer in Hell', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Bob Gosse, Suki Medencevic', 'Tucker Max', 'Matt Czuchry, Jesse Bradford, Geoff Stults, Marika Domińczyk, Keri Lynn Pratt, Traci Lords, Meagen Fay, Susie Abromeit', 'R', 'A tireless and charismatic novelty seeker, Tucker tricks his buddy Dan into lying to his fiancée Kristy, so they can go to an legendary strip club three and a half hours away to celebrate Dan’s last days of bachelorhood in proper style.', 'A tireless and charismatic novelty seeker, Tucker tricks his buddy Dan into lying to his fiancée Kristy, so they can go to an legendary strip club three and a half hours away to celebrate Dan’s last days of bachelorhood in proper style.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oBBood3JcOu0LQstdL9FeqCxMwa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30128'),
  ('1122588092976057218', 'I Just Didn''t Do It', 2007, 'Drama', 'Masayuki Suō, Naoki Kayano, Shozo Katashima', 'Masayuki Suō', 'Ryo Kase, Asaka Seto, Koji Yakusho, Koji Yamamoto, Masako Motai, Tetsushi Tanaka, Ken Mitsuishi, Toshinori Omi', null, 'A young man is falsely accused of molesting a high-school girl on a train. He is arrested and charged, and goes through endless court sessions, all the while insisting that he is innocent.', 'A young man is falsely accused of molesting a high-school girl on a train. He is arrested and charged, and goes through endless court sessions, all the while insisting that he is innocent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8SWnHY5wBJioLuofYSBvnsYertg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22449'),
  ('646803296659494956', 'I Just Wanna Hug You', 2014, 'Drama, Romance', 'Akihiko Shiota, Tokushō Kikumura', 'Akihiko Shiota, Hiroshi Saito', 'Keiko Kitagawa, Ryo Nishikido, Yusuke Kamiji, Takumi Saitoh, Aya Hirayama, Eriko Sato, Megumi Sato, Masataka Kubota', null, 'Tsukasa got into a severe car accident when she was a high school student. She still suffers from the effects of that accident, with memory impairment and needing to use a wheelchair. Tsukasa falls in love with taxi driver Masaki. Even though they have difficulties, they try to make a happy family together, but they encounter another serious situation.', 'Tsukasa got into a severe car accident when she was a high school student. She still suffers from the effects of that accident, with memory impairment and needing to use a wheelchair. Tsukasa falls in love with taxi driver Masaki. Even though they have difficulties, they try to make a happy family together, but they encounter another serious situation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fuDqWakHe6qpbeztAF30KAVWUuh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:292264'),
  ('32502818451406913', 'I Just Wanted to Go Home', 2017, 'Drama, Crime, TV Movie', 'Yves Rénier, Stéphane Talagrand, Olive Chenieux', 'Jean-Luc Estèbe', 'Mathilde Seigner, Thomas Mustin, Jean-Claude Leguay, Yves Rénier, Steve Driesen, Jean-Michel Lahmi, Xavier Martel, Philippe Résimont', null, 'In September 1986, two children were brutally killed in the suburbs of Metz. This is the beginning of "The Patrick Dils Affair", one of the most emblematic judicial errors in the annals of French justice.', 'In September 1986, two children were brutally killed in the suburbs of Metz. This is the beginning of "The Patrick Dils Affair", one of the most emblematic judicial errors in the annals of French justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e9G2XTMhxEEMgzQ07mibt4Pi5YN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:499416'),
  ('491849564319441842', 'I Kill Giants', 2017, 'Fantasy, Drama', 'Anders Walter, Rasmus Heise, Phillip Berg', 'Joe Kelly', 'Madison Wolfe, Zoe Saldaña, Imogen Poots, Sydney Wade, Rory Jackson, Art Parkinson, Noel Clarke, Jennifer Ehle', 'PG-13', 'Sophia, a new high school student, tries to make friends with Barbara, who tells her that “she kills giants,” protecting this way her hometown and its inhabitants, who do not understand her strange behavior.', 'Sophia, a new high school student, tries to make friends with Barbara, who tells her that “she kills giants,” protecting this way her hometown and its inhabitants, who do not understand her strange behavior.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cvit6HDbXHE6W5kGPd47jd0wthQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:419831'),
  ('793158495495131130', 'I Killed Einstein, Gentlemen', 1970, 'Science Fiction, Comedy', 'Oldřich Lipský, Tomáš Svoboda, Ivan Šlapeta', 'Oldřich Lipský, Miloš Macourek, Josef Nesvadba', 'Jiří Sovák, Jana Brejchová, Lubomír Lipský, Iva Janžurová, Petr Čepek, Radoslav Brzobohatý, Svatopluk Beneš, Jan Libíček', null, 'This futuristic science fiction comedy features an atomic bomb blast that causes women to grow beards and lose the ability to have children. A summit meeting is held at the United Nations, with the proposed solution of building a time machine. The decision is made to travel back in time and murder Einstein, with the hopeful result being that without the noted mathematician''s research there will be no atomic bombs.', 'This futuristic science fiction comedy features an atomic bomb blast that causes women to grow beards and lose the ability to have children. A summit meeting is held at the United Nations, with the proposed solution of building a time machine. The decision is made to travel back in time and murder Einstein, with the hopeful result being that without the noted mathematician''s research there will be no atomic bombs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jfy4IIe3YSL4Lf7HAlf2RSyVydf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61127'),
  ('142179762164678387', 'I Killed My Lesbian Wife, Hung Her on a Meat Hook, and Now I Have a Three-Picture Deal at Disney', 1993, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Ben Affleck', 'Jay Lacopo, Kamala Lopez', 'Jay Lacopo, Karla Montana, Johanna McCloy, Robert Koch, Tommy Hinkley, Harry Victor, Marilyn Pitzer, Harvey Stephens', null, 'A first-time feature-film director (who''s also the writer and producer) is casting the lead actress. We meet him talking to his wife about the picture and the process. We meet the actress, Sandy, negotiating with her roommate and talking by phone to her mother. Then, we watch Sandy audition for the director at the call-back session; also attending are the casting director and the production company''s sycophants. The wrinkle is that the director is a homicidal misogynist, his wife is tied up and hanging from the ceiling, and Sandy has something in her purse that bodes a rocky future.', 'A first-time feature-film director (who''s also the writer and producer) is casting the lead actress. We meet him talking to his wife about the picture and the process. We meet the actress, Sandy, negotiating with her roommate and talking by phone to her mother. Then, we watch Sandy audition for the director at the call-back session; also attending are the casting director and the production company''s sycophants. The wrinkle is that the director is a homicidal misogynist, his wife is tied up and hanging from the ceiling, and Sandy has something in her purse that bodes a rocky future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iHbJz5HhdTYMnEkdmR68lomWzZt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33607'),
  ('1055225383485069922', 'I Killed My Mother', 2009, 'Drama', 'Xavier Dolan, Stéphanie Weber Biron, Nicolas Canniccioni', 'Xavier Dolan', 'Xavier Dolan, Anne Dorval, François Arnaud, Suzanne Clément, Patricia Tulasne, Niels Schneider, Monique Spaziani, Pierre Chagnon', 'NR', 'Hubert, a brash 17-year-old, is confused and torn by a love-hate relationship with his mother that consumes him more and more each day. After distressing ordeals and tragic episodes, Hubert will find his mother on the banks of Saint Lawrence river, where he grew up, and where a murder will be committed: the murder of childhood.', 'Hubert, a brash 17-year-old, is confused and torn by a love-hate relationship with his mother that consumes him more and more each day. After distressing ordeals and tragic episodes, Hubert will find his mother on the banks of Saint Lawrence river, where he grew up, and where a murder will be committed: the murder of childhood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nB6OuDdERS95aQtoxPExXxsW3Ov.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26280'),
  ('456683353582955242', 'I Killed Napoleon', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Giorgia Farina, Maurizio Calvesi, Francesca Borromeo', 'Giorgia Farina, Federica Pontremoli', 'Micaela Ramazzotti, Libero De Rienzo, Elena Sofia Ricci, Adriano Giannini, Iaia Forte, Thony, Monica Nappo, Bebo Storti', null, 'In the space of twenty-four hours the life of Anita, single and brilliant manager in career, is blown away by a hurricane of trouble.', 'In the space of twenty-four hours the life of Anita, single and brilliant manager in career, is blown away by a hurricane of trouble.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7SghGfSdKoIoEpOBuy9xKEttpvW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:332709'),
