  ('107479110610326976', 'I Kissed a Girl', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Noémie Saglio, Jérôme Alméras, Maxime Govare', 'Maxime Govare, Noémie Saglio', 'Pio Marmaï, Franck Gastambide, Lannick Gautry, Camille Cottin, Adriane Gradziel, Frédéric Pierrot, Isabelle Candelier, Sébastien Castro', null, 'Jérémie, 34, wakes up in an apartment he doesn''t know, next to a woman he doesn''t know. She is Adna, a stunning Swedish woman who is as funny as she is sweet. Is this the beginning of a fairy tale? Not quite, since Jérémie is about to get married—to Antoine.', 'Jérémie, 34, wakes up in an apartment he doesn''t know, next to a woman he doesn''t know. She is Adna, a stunning Swedish woman who is as funny as she is sweet. Is this the beginning of a fairy tale? Not quite, since Jérémie is about to get married—to Antoine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s0L9olKKjcUOiU4JOuq8fJuXTNH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:319340'),
  ('642658666521926324', 'I Knew Her Well', 1965, 'Drama', 'Antonio Pietrangeli, Marcello Ugolini, Giovanni Fabbri', 'Ruggero Maccari, Ettore Scola, Antonio Pietrangeli', 'Stefania Sandrelli, Mario Adorf, Jean-Claude Brialy, Joachim Fuchsberger, Nino Manfredi, Enrico Maria Salerno, Ugo Tognazzi, Karin Dor', null, 'A young woman from the Italian countryside experiences the dark side of the business after she moves to Rome to become a star.', 'A young woman from the Italian countryside experiences the dark side of the business after she moves to Rome to become a star.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eyQibuSHTg2lwSeWj3VRF4EJKoN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59336'),
  ('299487664698698360', 'I Knew It Was You: Rediscovering John Cazale', 2009, 'Documentary', 'Richard Shepard', 'Michael Facciolo, Kari Hollend, Matt Austin', 'Al Pacino, Meryl Streep, Robert De Niro, Olympia Dukakis, Gene Hackman, Carol Kane, Steve Buscemi, Richard Dreyfuss', null, 'John Cazale was in only five films – The Godfather, The Conversation, The Godfather: Part II, Dog Day Afternoon and The Deer Hunter – each was nominated for Best Picture. Yet today most people don''t even know his name. I KNEW IT WAS YOU is a fresh tour through movies that defined a generation.', 'John Cazale was in only five films – The Godfather, The Conversation, The Godfather: Part II, Dog Day Afternoon and The Deer Hunter – each was nominated for Best Picture. Yet today most people don''t even know his name. I KNEW IT WAS YOU is a fresh tour through movies that defined a generation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6a00p3eRZKjvDeYY2tHN057Jvx0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45485'),
  ('35073262534842792', 'I Know That Voice', 2014, 'Documentary', 'Lawrence Shapiro', null, 'Charlie Adler, Pamela Adlon, Carlos Alazraqui, Jack Angel, Ed Asner, Hank Azaria, Diedrich Bader, Eric Bauza', 'NR', 'Filmmaker Lawrence Shapiro discusses voice-over acting with the talented people behind the characters.', 'Filmmaker Lawrence Shapiro discusses voice-over acting with the talented people behind the characters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y5aSllFoF11fVu945IUZtR4h37l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:124623'),
