  ('609569327149058552', 'I Know What You Did Last Summer', 1997, 'Horror, Thriller, Mystery', 'Jim Gillespie, Denis Crossan, Louis D''Esposito', 'Kevin Williamson', 'Jennifer Love Hewitt, Freddie Prinze Jr., Sarah Michelle Gellar, Ryan Phillippe, Bridgette Wilson-Sampras, Johnny Galecki, Muse Watson, Anne Heche', 'R', 'After an accident on a winding road, four teens make the fatal mistake of dumping their victim''s body into the sea. Exactly one year later, the deadly secret resurfaces as they''re stalked by a hook-handed figure.', 'After an accident on a winding road, four teens make the fatal mistake of dumping their victim''s body into the sea. Exactly one year later, the deadly secret resurfaces as they''re stalked by a hook-handed figure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dQyaJx0SptDqvQcAewAr8FAtLB2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3597'),
  ('793044954343296508', 'I Know What You Did Last Summer', 2025, 'Horror, Thriller, Mystery', 'Jennifer Kaytin Robinson, Elisha Christian, Patrick James Howe', 'Jennifer Kaytin Robinson, Sam Lansky', 'Chase Sui Wonders, Madelyn Cline, Sarah Pidgeon, Jennifer Love Hewitt, Freddie Prinze Jr., Jonah Hauer-King, Tyriq Withers, Sarah Michelle Gellar', 'R', 'When five friends inadvertently cause a deadly car accident, they cover up their involvement and make a pact to keep it a secret rather than face the consequences. A year later, their past comes back to haunt them and they''re forced to confront a horrifying truth: someone knows what they did last summer…and is hell-bent on revenge.', 'When five friends inadvertently cause a deadly car accident, they cover up their involvement and make a pact to keep it a secret rather than face the consequences. A year later, their past comes back to haunt them and they''re forced to confront a horrifying truth: someone knows what they did last summer…and is hell-bent on revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8FP2ObEGIiQYQCf83gL4ZVzwZF8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1083433'),
  ('695208745606203550', 'I Know Where I''m Going!', 1945, 'Romance, Drama, Comedy', 'Michael Powell, Emeric Pressburger, Erwin Hillier', 'Emeric Pressburger, Michael Powell', 'Wendy Hiller, Roger Livesey, Pamela Brown, Finlay Currie, George Carney, Nancy Price, Catherine Lacey, Jean Cadell', 'NR', 'Plucky Englishwoman Joan Webster travels to the remote islands of the Scottish Hebrides in order to marry a wealthy industrialist. Trapped by inclement weather on the Isle of Mull and unable to continue to her destination, Joan finds herself charmed by the straightforward, no-nonsense islanders around her, and becomes increasingly attracted to naval officer Torquil MacNeil, who holds a secret that may change her life forever.', 'Plucky Englishwoman Joan Webster travels to the remote islands of the Scottish Hebrides in order to marry a wealthy industrialist. Trapped by inclement weather on the Isle of Mull and unable to continue to her destination, Joan finds herself charmed by the straightforward, no-nonsense islanders around her, and becomes increasingly attracted to naval officer Torquil MacNeil, who holds a secret that may change her life forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/woAOLgYVUmLBtWNxTJgAnqGwyuL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56137'),
  ('126627157093240057', 'I Know Who Killed Me', 2007, 'Thriller, Horror, Mystery', 'John R. Leonetti, Chris Sivertson, Frederic Roth', 'Jeff Hammond', 'Lindsay Lohan, Julia Ormond, Neal McDonough, Spencer Garrett, Gregory Itzin, Kenya Moore, Garcelle Beauvais, Michael Adler', 'R', 'An idyllic small town is rocked when Aubrey Fleming, a bright and promising young woman, is abducted and tortured by a sadistic serial killer. When she manages to escape, the traumatized girl who regains consciousness in the hospital insists that she is not who they think she is and that the real Aubrey Fleming is still in mortal danger.', 'An idyllic small town is rocked when Aubrey Fleming, a bright and promising young woman, is abducted and tortured by a sadistic serial killer. When she manages to escape, the traumatized girl who regains consciousness in the hospital insists that she is not who they think she is and that the real Aubrey Fleming is still in mortal danger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7hz8jYHGNsNsnF0FPngxQEEVyR6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5857'),
  ('639859074075353901', 'I Know Who You Are', 2000, null, 'Patricia Ferreira', 'Patrícia Ferreira Pará Yxapy, Daniela Féjerman, Manuel Gutiérrez Aragón', 'Ana Fernández, Miguel Ángel Solá, Ingrid Rubio, Luis Tosar, Roberto Enríquez, Mercedes Sampietro, Vicky Peña, Gonzalo Uriarte', null, 'Paloma is a young psychiatrist, who is hired to work as a director of a clinic in Galicia, and is attracted to Mario, her very first patient. He suffers from a rare form of amnesia, commonly known as Korsakov''s syndrome. As a result, both his short and long term memories are affected, and he has temporary lapses of perception. However, Paloma finds Mario to be a fascinating individual, not just a regular patient. Intrigued, she decides to explore Mario''s past and, through their dialogues, their relationship takes an unexpected turn.', 'Paloma is a young psychiatrist, who is hired to work as a director of a clinic in Galicia, and is attracted to Mario, her very first patient. He suffers from a rare form of amnesia, commonly known as Korsakov''s syndrome. As a result, both his short and long term memories are affected, and he has temporary lapses of perception. However, Paloma finds Mario to be a fascinating individual, not just a regular patient. Intrigued, she decides to explore Mario''s past and, through their dialogues, their relationship takes an unexpected turn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d0wlbBx8EFGNI5KojnJp78rRnu2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:187911'),
  ('325496918708157747', 'I Lampaclima e l''isola misteriosa', 2006, 'Animation', 'Francesco Sulpizi, Cristina Lo Giudice, Maurizio Forestieri', 'Roberto Piumini', 'Alex Polidori, Domitilla D''Amico, Antonella Giannini, Mirko Mazzanti, Marco Vivio, Francesca Gambacorta, Monica Ward, Perla Liberatori', null, 'Grandma Bine and her two grandchildren are searching for the Mysterious Island, which, according to legend, becomes visible only under certain weather conditions: when it rains, when it snows, and when the sun shines.', 'Grandma Bine and her two grandchildren are searching for the Mysterious Island, which, according to legend, becomes visible only under certain weather conditions: when it rains, when it snows, and when the sun shines.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/90NOclOE6fjG9zRzjbVoNDcOWc4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:609455'),
  ('877013269877002472', 'I Like Bats', 1986, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Krzysztof Pakulski, Grzegorz Warchoł', 'Grzegorz Warchoł, Krystyna Kofta', 'Katarzyna Walter, Marek Barbasiewicz, Małgorzata Lorentowicz, Jonasz Kofta, Edwin Petrykat, Jan Prochyra, Andrzej Grabarczyk, Wiktor Grotowicz', null, 'Izabella, a beautiful young woman, works at her aunt’s shop in a small town in Poland. She uses her hands to create unique small objects for the shop, but in the night she has the strange habit to feed bats.', 'Izabella, a beautiful young woman, works at her aunt’s shop in a small town in Poland. She uses her hands to create unique small objects for the shop, but in the night she has the strange habit to feed bats.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kvmfFLUUC9eNKbHG6n0nbbsVgFE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:386303'),
  ('218075055648984969', 'I Like Bikes, But...', 1978, null, 'Ernest Johnson, Oscar Rojas, Bob Deaton', 'Douglas Poulter, Arthur H. Wolf', null, null, 'An animated bike named Ike explains the safety hazards of bikes, chanting "I like bikes" as he moves through various settings, then following live-action bike riders. One falls over in the street and is nearly hit by Lisa''s parents. Ike then narrates Lisa''s interest in bikes through to her teenage years when she gets a car to see if she can be attentive now that she''s not using hers as much.', 'An animated bike named Ike explains the safety hazards of bikes, chanting "I like bikes" as he moves through various settings, then following live-action bike riders. One falls over in the street and is nearly hit by Lisa''s parents. Ike then narrates Lisa''s interest in bikes through to her teenage years when she gets a car to see if she can be attentive now that she''s not using hers as much.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vxVVPAJMCJJ4iz2XY5eLifUHtTo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:353085'),
  ('962389615877938241', 'I Like It Like That', 1994, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Darnell Martin, Alexander Gruszynski, H.H. Cooper', 'Darnell Martin', 'Luna Lauren Vélez, Jon Seda, Tomas Melly, Desiree Casado, Isaiah Garcia, Jesse Borrego, Lisa Vidal, Griffin Dunne', 'R', 'After her husband is arrested for looting, Lisette struggles for independence while dealing with her transgender sibling, her critical mother-in-law and assorted neighborhood eccentrics.', 'After her husband is arrested for looting, Lisette struggles for independence while dealing with her transgender sibling, her critical mother-in-law and assorted neighborhood eccentrics.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aCxh21UPLHi7Pxm9ykH1GNx39OW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48992'),
  ('682637182351493546', 'I Like Killing Flies', 2004, 'Documentary', 'Matt Mahurin', null, 'Kenny Shopsin, Eve Shopsin, Calvin Trillin, Michael Fishman, John A. Papa', 'R', 'In the cramped, cluttered confines of Shopsin’s, a legendary hole-in-the-wall diner in New York’s Greenwich Village, eccentric chef Kenny Shopsin holds court—serving up an absurdly massive menu alongside his razor-sharp wit and unfiltered philosophies on life, food, and human nature. As the family-run institution faces a forced relocation, this intimate documentary captures the controlled chaos of Kenny’s world, where every customer is a character and every meal is a performance. A love letter to stubborn individuality and the art of doing things your own way.', 'In the cramped, cluttered confines of Shopsin’s, a legendary hole-in-the-wall diner in New York’s Greenwich Village, eccentric chef Kenny Shopsin holds court—serving up an absurdly massive menu alongside his razor-sharp wit and unfiltered philosophies on life, food, and human nature. As the family-run institution faces a forced relocation, this intimate documentary captures the controlled chaos of Kenny’s world, where every customer is a character and every meal is a performance. A love letter to stubborn individuality and the art of doing things your own way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/elr5xGIbVqJtg2Y5KJ7mUmbWTi4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51069'),
  ('864510884847023020', 'I Like Life a Lot', 1977, 'Animation, Documentary', 'Mária Neményi, Kati Macskássy', null, null, null, 'The Komló settlement was a typical example of how Roma labour was exploited in the 1970s industrial mass production. This collaboration of Roma pupils and their teachers portrays the children’s everyday lives through their own drawings, often translating cruel facts into fairytales.', 'The Komló settlement was a typical example of how Roma labour was exploited in the 1970s industrial mass production. This collaboration of Roma pupils and their teachers portrays the children’s everyday lives through their own drawings, often translating cruel facts into fairytales.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mZctWtwMoijLiVy24d9GWkCQHyI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:570951'),
  ('409969921243689118', 'I Like Mountain Music', 1933, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Music', 'Rudolf Ising', null, 'Sara Berner, Pinto Colvig, Jack Mercer, The King''s Men', null, 'After hours, individuals on various magazine covers in a drugstore come to life and sing, speak, or perform. Caricature celebrity depictions include George Arliss, Eddie Cantor, Sonja Henie, Benito Mussolini, Ignacy Paderewski, Edward G. Robinson, Will Rogers, and Ed Wynn. A robbery sequence features bad guys breaking into the cash register and Sherlock Holmes and Dr. Watson on the case. King Kong also makes an appearance. A Merrie Melody cartoon.', 'After hours, individuals on various magazine covers in a drugstore come to life and sing, speak, or perform. Caricature celebrity depictions include George Arliss, Eddie Cantor, Sonja Henie, Benito Mussolini, Ignacy Paderewski, Edward G. Robinson, Will Rogers, and Ed Wynn. A robbery sequence features bad guys breaking into the cash register and Sherlock Holmes and Dr. Watson on the case. King Kong also makes an appearance. A Merrie Melody cartoon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pMFqGKPKfYuwGVF4UF1WnV7VEWb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:151913'),
  ('161517103731667903', 'I Like Movies', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Rico Moran, Chandler Levack, Caoimhe Clancy', 'Chandler Levack', 'Isaiah Lehtinen, Romina D''Ugo, Krista Bridges, Percy Hynes White, Alex Ateah, Andy McQueen, Eden Cupid, Anand Rajaram', 'NR', 'Socially inept 17-year-old cinephile Lawrence Kweller gets a job at a video store, where he forms a complicated friendship with his older female manager.', 'Socially inept 17-year-old cinephile Lawrence Kweller gets a job at a video store, where he forms a complicated friendship with his older female manager.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Gu30dMoeLhz7fulx1uohyIOlqT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:980996'),
  ('679864025105751308', 'I Like to Play Games', 1995, 'Drama', 'Kim Haun, Robert Kubilos, Sasha Rendulic', 'David Keith Miller', 'Lisa Boyle, Ken Steadman, James DiZazzo, Pamela Dickerson, Monique Noel, Toshiya Agata, Tom Druzbick, Jennifer Burton', 'R', 'Michael is looking for a woman who likes to play games, but when he finds Suzanne, she might just be more than he bargained for.', 'Michael is looking for a woman who likes to play games, but when he finds Suzanne, she might just be more than he bargained for.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/37wDv1a2nYYBH4MivZKELvIGIoP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68481'),
  ('63634295216968664', 'I Like to Play Games Too', 1999, 'Drama, Romance', 'Edward Holzman, Ben Kufrin, Brian O''Sullivan', 'David Keith Miller', 'Maria Ford, Bobby Johnston, Kim Dawson, Stephanee LaFleur, Doug Kruse, Scott Carson, Vince Vouyer, Nenna Quiroz', 'R', 'An advertising agent comes up against a client she is unable to manipulate through her seduction games.', 'An advertising agent comes up against a client she is unable to manipulate through her seduction games.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o6G7gtGmckzbEFEadLq9uQYhGMZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90761'),
  ('1141898538642017915', 'I Like to Work – Mobbing', 2004, 'Drama', 'Francesca Comencini, Luca Bigazzi', 'Francesca Comencini', 'Nicoletta Braschi, Camille Dugay Comencini, Marina Buoncristiani, Roberta Celea, Assunta Cestaro, Stefano Colace, Claudia Coli, Marcello Miglio', null, 'A woman comes across the difficulties of modern work: to force her to resign from her job, her firm tries all the humiliation techniques known as "mobbing". The film is based upon real cases reported by Italian unions.', 'A woman comes across the difficulties of modern work: to force her to resign from her job, her firm tries all the humiliation techniques known as "mobbing". The film is based upon real cases reported by Italian unions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f8sXcrrTAyIMv2VHq1R1Us7ArYi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60069'),
  ('288933945782643164', 'I Live Here Now', 2026, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'Julie Pacino, Aron Meinhardt', 'Julie Pacino', 'Lucy Fry, Sarah Rich, Madeline Brewer, Matt Rife, Sheryl Lee', 'Not Rated', 'A woman finds herself trapped in a remote hotel where the violent echoes of her past come alive, blurring the lines between her darkest nightmares and the waking world.', 'A woman finds herself trapped in a remote hotel where the violent echoes of her past come alive, blurring the lines between her darkest nightmares and the waking world.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FrzbbtzA50E66aUFNWcLMKFeUMTw.jpg', 'plex:movie:i-live-here-now-2026'),
  ('321664495098951961', 'I Live in Fear', 1955, 'Drama', 'Akira Kurosawa, Asakazu Nakai', 'Hideo Oguni, Shinobu Hashimoto', 'Toshirō Mifune, Takashi Shimura, Minoru Chiaki, Masao Shimizu, Eiko Miyoshi, Kyoko Aoyama, Haruko Tōgō, Noriko Sengoku', null, 'An aging foundry patriarch, gripped by terror of nuclear annihilation, tries to uproot his family to Brazil. When they petition to have him declared incompetent, a family-court counselor witnesses his obsession slide into ruin—and asks whether ignoring the atomic threat is any saner.', 'An aging foundry patriarch, gripped by terror of nuclear annihilation, tries to uproot his family to Brazil. When they petition to have him declared incompetent, a family-court counselor witnesses his obsession slide into ruin—and asks whether ignoring the atomic threat is any saner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lStaAPLPkPc5NkeHzZoi191efOy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21490'),
  ('422534923782512742', 'I Lost My Body', 2019, 'Animation, Drama, Fantasy', 'Jérémy Clapin, David Nasser', 'Jérémy Clapin, Guillaume Laurant', 'Hakim Faris, Victoire du Bois, Patrick d''Assumçao, Alfonso Arfi, Hichem Mesbah, Myriam Loucif, Bellamine Abdelmalek, Maud Le Guénédal', null, 'A story of Naoufel, a young man who is in love with Gabrielle. In another part of town, a severed hand escapes from a dissection lab, determined to find its body again.', 'A story of Naoufel, a young man who is in love with Gabrielle. In another part of town, a severed hand escapes from a dissection lab, determined to find its body again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z5dXCywyo8zEPNDkeQY7nbvkrz8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:586940'),
  ('310645009530920030', 'I Love a Man in Uniform', 1993, 'Drama, Thriller', 'David Franco, David Wellington, Stephen Reynolds', 'David Wellington', 'Tom McCamus, Brigitte Bako, Kevin Tighe, David Hemblen, Alex Karzis, Graham McPherson, Daniel MacIvor, Wendy Hopkins', 'R', 'Henry Adler, an outwardly normal banker, yearns to make it in show business and still answers to his overbearing father. When Henry is hired to act in a television police drama, he realizes his big break has arrived and decides to do whatever it takes to get into the role — even if that means donning his police costume in public during off hours. It isn''t long, however, before Henry begins to take the law into his own hands as his violent side chillingly emerges.', 'Henry Adler, an outwardly normal banker, yearns to make it in show business and still answers to his overbearing father. When Henry is hired to act in a television police drama, he realizes his big break has arrived and decides to do whatever it takes to get into the role — even if that means donning his police costume in public during off hours. It isn''t long, however, before Henry begins to take the law into his own hands as his violent side chillingly emerges.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zaOQyMcobE0UEqv30KHfSemUtpc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70302'),
  ('560278128991271380', 'I Love a Parade', 1932, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Rudolf Ising', null, null, null, 'A circus parade, to the title tune. Next, a series of sideshow acts: the wild boy, the rubber man, siamese twin pigs, a tattooed man, a hula-dancing hippo, an Indian snake (or goat) charmer. Into the ring, we have a hippo riding a horse (much to the horse''s dismay), a high-wire act (again, to the title song), and finally a lion tamer.', 'A circus parade, to the title tune. Next, a series of sideshow acts: the wild boy, the rubber man, siamese twin pigs, a tattooed man, a hula-dancing hippo, an Indian snake (or goat) charmer. Into the ring, we have a hippo riding a horse (much to the horse''s dismay), a high-wire act (again, to the title song), and finally a lion tamer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rrPcGYSUSakaj10cOeobWBmBlQM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:161575'),
