  ('295698807457335145', 'I Love NY', 2015, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Radhika Rao, Vinay Sapru, Nirav Patel', 'Radhika Rao, Vinay Sapru', 'Kangana Ranaut, Sunny Deol, Prem Chopra, Kubbra Sait, Reema Lagoo, Manoj Joshi, Russell Geoffrey Banks, Tannishtha Chatterjee', null, 'Two strangers meet in Manhattan on New Year''s Eve, and both of their lives are forever transformed in this romantic Bollywood drama. Even as they try to preserve their current relationships, neither can resist falling head over heels for the other.', 'Two strangers meet in Manhattan on New Year''s Eve, and both of their lives are forever transformed in this romantic Bollywood drama. Even as they try to preserve their current relationships, neither can resist falling head over heels for the other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tIqav4xlbDh55dmxNFPRx5rVQLX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:312056'),
  ('392827763407701428', 'I Love Peru', 2025, 'Comedy, Drama, Adventure', 'Raphaël Quenard, Hugo David, Hugo David', 'Hugo David, Raphaël Quenard', 'Raphaël Quenard, Hugo David, Anaïde Rozam, José Garcia, Jean-Pascal Zadi, Michel Hazanavicius, David Duponchel, Marina Foïs', null, 'In the relentless pursuit of success, a quirky actor leaves behind his closest allies. Alone facing himself, he is struck by a disturbing vision. Off to Peru for a spiritual journey.', 'In the relentless pursuit of success, a quirky actor leaves behind his closest allies. Alone facing himself, he is struck by a disturbing vision. Off to Peru for a spiritual journey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8KMfH8AqCrfg7nK1jcP7LoBOMZh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1477279'),
