  ('758053762122736278', 'I Love You', 1986, 'Drama, Fantasy, Romance', 'William Lubtchansky, Marco Ferreri', 'Marco Ferreri, Enrico Oldoini, Didier Kaminka', 'Christopher Lambert, Eddy Mitchell, Flora Barillaro, Agnès Soral, Anémone, Marc Berman, Patrice Bertrand, Paula Dehelly', null, 'In another indictment of the flaws of our so-called civilization, this satire from the late director Marco Ferreri features Christopher Lambert as Michel, a miserable man who has failed at love and finds solace in a mechanical key holder.', 'In another indictment of the flaws of our so-called civilization, this satire from the late director Marco Ferreri features Christopher Lambert as Michel, a miserable man who has failed at love and finds solace in a mechanical key holder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eIM80jNHOzp5JZxn5E9SSlq6C3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:198466'),
  ('180841654957065268', 'I Love You', 1999, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Marek Koterski, Bogdan Stachurski', 'Marek Koterski', 'Cezary Pazura, Katarzyna Figura, Zbigniew Buczkowski, Eugenia Herman, Jan Jurewicz, Michał Koterski, Maciej Kozłowski, Cezary Żak', null, 'A literary critic''s quest for love takes a hopeful turn when he runs into a woman from his past, but their turbulent quirks strain their new romance.', 'A literary critic''s quest for love takes a hopeful turn when he runs into a woman from his past, but their turbulent quirks strain their new romance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pekjzaIbzdPhMjdrbKzRkL6U1CU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74921'),
  ('969391979652146142', 'I Love You Again', 1940, 'Comedy, Romance', 'W.S. Van Dyke, Oliver T. Marsh', 'George Oppenheimer, Charles Lederer, Harry Kurnitz', 'William Powell, Myrna Loy, Frank McHugh, Edmund Lowe, Donald Douglas, Nella Walker, Carl Switzer, Pierre Watkin', 'NR', 'Boring businessman Larry Wilson recovers from amnesia and discovers he''s really a con man...and loves his soon-to-be-ex wife.', 'Boring businessman Larry Wilson recovers from amnesia and discovers he''s really a con man...and loves his soon-to-be-ex wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vOqMLBf3AcTqjM1PFcYDDAgye23.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20643'),
  ('1043391681894265350', 'I Love You All', 1980, 'Drama, Romance', 'Claude Berri, Étienne Becker', 'Claude Berri, Michel Grisolia', 'Catherine Deneuve, Jean-Louis Trintignant, Gérard Depardieu, Serge Gainsbourg, Alain Souchon, Christian Marquand, Ysabelle Lacamp, Igor Schlumberger', null, 'Alice invites her past two lovers and her current to Christmas dinner uniting them all in her house. In sentimental flashbacks she recalls the former times with each of them. While she reminisces, she also fixates on a new relationship that blooms and dies within the same calendar year leaving her to wonder if she''s meant to be with anyone for any extended time.', 'Alice invites her past two lovers and her current to Christmas dinner uniting them all in her house. In sentimental flashbacks she recalls the former times with each of them. While she reminisces, she also fixates on a new relationship that blooms and dies within the same calendar year leaving her to wonder if she''s meant to be with anyone for any extended time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jQVqFhyxsSmkhztbzgDi1lVJdsC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41814'),
  ('211494234876264251', 'I Love You Coiffure', 2020, 'Comedy, TV Movie', 'Kika Ungaro, Muriel Robin', 'Muriel Robin', 'Muriel Robin, Charlotte Rampling, Jean Reno, Carole Bouquet, Vanessa Paradis, Pierre Arditi, Élie Semoun, Régis Laspalès', null, 'Liliane and Maud are twin sisters. The first is a modest provincial hairdresser while the second leads the great life in Paris. They both fight over their mother''s custody.', 'Liliane and Maud are twin sisters. The first is a modest provincial hairdresser while the second leads the great life in Paris. They both fight over their mother''s custody.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2khQgCB3EVv93lzSKMYKdqYJJ19.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:739943'),
  ('905686412619812430', 'I Love You in All Languages of the World', 2005, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Leonardo Pieraccioni, Italo Petriccione, Federica Ciciarelli', 'Giovanni Veronesi, Leonardo Pieraccioni', 'Leonardo Pieraccioni, Giorgio Panariello, Marjo Berasategui, Rocco Papaleo, Massimo Ceccherini, Giulia Elettra Gorietti, Francesco Guccini, Barbara Enrichi', null, 'A divorced high school PE teacher falls in love with a single mom before learning that her daughter is the student who''s been hitting on him between classes.', 'A divorced high school PE teacher falls in love with a single mom before learning that her daughter is the student who''s been hitting on him between classes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sAD8wEFbGwVIJHrps9Zll9Ov2Rt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44894'),
  ('231191849590733912', 'I Love You Phillip Morris', 2010, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama, Romance', 'John Requa, Glenn Ficarra, Stephen E. Hagen', 'John Requa, Glenn Ficarra', 'Jim Carrey, Ewan McGregor, Leslie Mann, Rodrigo Santoro, Brennan Brown, Nicholas Alexander, Tony Bentley, Michael Beasley', 'R', 'Steven Russell leads a seemingly average life – an organ player in the local church, happily married to Debbie, and a member of the local police force. That is until he has a severe car accident that leads him to the ultimate epiphany: he’s gay and he’s going to live life to the fullest – even if he has to break the law to do it. Taking on an extravagant lifestyle, Steven turns to cons and fraud to make ends meet and is eventually sent to the State Penitentiary where he meets the love of his life, a sensitive, soft-spoken man named Phillip Morris. His devotion to freeing Phillip from jail and building the perfect life together prompts him to attempt (and often succeed at) one impossible con after another.', 'Steven Russell leads a seemingly average life – an organ player in the local church, happily married to Debbie, and a member of the local police force. That is until he has a severe car accident that leads him to the ultimate epiphany: he’s gay and he’s going to live life to the fullest – even if he has to break the law to do it. Taking on an extravagant lifestyle, Steven turns to cons and fraud to make ends meet and is eventually sent to the State Penitentiary where he meets the love of his life, a sensitive, soft-spoken man named Phillip Morris. His devotion to freeing Phillip from jail and building the perfect life together prompts him to attempt (and often succeed at) one impossible con after another.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qtAuWLGQ7N4PNQ6boZeqqoUY2l9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8952'),
  ('343688650040069965', 'I Love You Renato', 2013, 'Drama, Romance', 'Fabiano Cafure', 'Fabiano Cafure, Diana Hime', 'Ingrid Conte, Felippe Bondarovsky, Vinícius Moulin Allemand, Leandro Develly, Flavia Arruda, Leandro Develly, Irene Alonso', null, '"I love you Renato" is a film about freedom and love in the lost 90s. The story takes place within the state of Rio in the historic city of Valença. The year is 1996, the year that marks the end of the famous Coca-Cola generation, the death of the typewriter and handwritten letters. Beto, Adriana and André embark on a journey of discovery, music and desire, until their lives and an entire generation is changed forever!', '"I love you Renato" is a film about freedom and love in the lost 90s. The story takes place within the state of Rio in the historic city of Valença. The year is 1996, the year that marks the end of the famous Coca-Cola generation, the death of the typewriter and handwritten letters. Beto, Adriana and André embark on a journey of discovery, music and desire, until their lives and an entire generation is changed forever!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yYDXHPLSctpljItkIigGGMlz7qf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:198273'),
  ('665160059352821347', 'I Love You Rosa', 1972, 'Romance, Drama', 'Moshé Mizrahi', 'Moshé Mizrahi', 'Michal Bat-Adam, Gabi Otterman, Yosef Shiloach, Levana Finkelstein, Avner Hizkiyahu, Moshe Tal', null, 'This story centers on the Jewish practice that requires an unmarried brother to marry the childless widow of his dead brother. In this story the younger brother is only 12 years old when his brother dies. The requirement is avoided by a legal fiction, but as time passes in the story, the situation changes.', 'This story centers on the Jewish practice that requires an unmarried brother to marry the childless widow of his dead brother. In this story the younger brother is only 12 years old when his brother dies. The requirement is avoided by a legal fiction, but as time passes in the story, the situation changes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3GShGJJfJErOOQ06IfpjLuWwclF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:140423'),
  ('318784512245239017', 'I Love You to Death', 1990, 'Comedy, Crime, Romance', 'Lawrence Kasdan, Owen Roizman', 'John Kostmayer', 'Kevin Kline, Tracey Ullman, Joan Plowright, River Phoenix, William Hurt, Keanu Reeves, James Gammon, Jack Kehler', 'R', 'Joey Boca is the owner of a pizza parlour, and has been married to Rosalie for years. When Rosalie discovers that Joey is a womanizer and has been cheating on her for a long time, she goes to extreme lengths to punish him.', 'Joey Boca is the owner of a pizza parlour, and has been married to Rosalie for years. When Rosalie discovers that Joey is a womanizer and has been cheating on her for a long time, she goes to extreme lengths to punish him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8LdWJLUfEa5JeUJ7SljJQMIJikZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3101'),
  ('683264207060048625', 'I Love You Very Much', 2010, 'Comedy, Family', 'Philippe Locquet, Romain Winding', 'Philippe Locquet', 'Firmine Richard, Max Clavelly, Julien Crampon, Pierre Lefebvre, Léopoldine Serre, Axel Boute, Bruno Lochet, Philippe Duquesne', null, 'When the mother they have never known dies, three half brothers aged 8, 15 and 17 respectively, who were all brought up in different ways, meet for the very first time. They spend the long summer holidays with Nonna, their grandmother, and start sharing secrets and rabbits, polenta and mean tricks, adventures and first time experiences, together. At last their once solitary lives take a new direction.', 'When the mother they have never known dies, three half brothers aged 8, 15 and 17 respectively, who were all brought up in different ways, meet for the very first time. They spend the long summer holidays with Nonna, their grandmother, and start sharing secrets and rabbits, polenta and mean tricks, adventures and first time experiences, together. At last their once solitary lives take a new direction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ar5gQG8VMj3hLNka03oJRFJm9L0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52474'),
  ('42906871871683350', 'I Love You, Alice B. Toklas!', 1968, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Hy Averback, Philip H. Lathrop', 'Paul Mazursky, Larry Tucker', 'Peter Sellers, Jo Van Fleet, Leigh Taylor-Young, Joyce Van Patten, David Arkin, Herb Edelman, Salem Ludwig, Louis Gottlieb', 'R', 'Harold Fine is a self-described square - a 35-year-old Los Angeles lawyer who''s not looking forward to middle age nor his upcoming wedding. His life changes when he falls in love with Nancy, a free-spirited, innocent, and beautiful young hippie. After Harold and his family enjoy some of her "groovy" brownies, he decides to "drop out" with her and become a hippie too. But can he return to his old life when he discovers that the hippie lifestyle is just a little too independent and irresponsible for his tastes?', 'Harold Fine is a self-described square - a 35-year-old Los Angeles lawyer who''s not looking forward to middle age nor his upcoming wedding. His life changes when he falls in love with Nancy, a free-spirited, innocent, and beautiful young hippie. After Harold and his family enjoy some of her "groovy" brownies, he decides to "drop out" with her and become a hippie too. But can he return to his old life when he discovers that the hippie lifestyle is just a little too independent and irresponsible for his tastes?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zhlJINj5sVFUnghjbxfJJvWjA2W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42623'),
  ('609963661836728322', 'I Love You, Beth Cooper', 2009, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Chris Columbus, Phil Abraham, Bob Brown', 'Larry Doyle', 'Hayden Panettiere, Paul Rust, Jack Carpenter, Lauren London, Lauren Storm, Shawn Roberts, Jared Keeso, Brendan Penny', 'PG-13', 'A valedictorian''s declaration of love for a high-school cheerleader launches a night of revelry, reflection and romance for a group of graduating seniors.', 'A valedictorian''s declaration of love for a high-school cheerleader launches a night of revelry, reflection and romance for a group of graduating seniors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mUi6nEbo04DR1YwflbZX1RR7UwS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19840'),
  ('679285878329803072', 'I Love You, Daddy', 2017, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Louis C.K., Jeremy Mohler, Nick Vanderpool', 'Louis C.K.', 'Louis C.K., Chloë Grace Moretz, John Malkovich, Rose Byrne, Charlie Day, Helen Hunt, Edie Falco, Pamela Adlon', null, 'When a successful television writer''s daughter becomes the interest of an aging filmmaker with an appalling past, he becomes worried about how to handle the situation.', 'When a successful television writer''s daughter becomes the interest of an aging filmmaker with an appalling past, he becomes worried about how to handle the situation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oyacgMEIrYFKE8bMW2ydAotJTU3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:470932'),
  ('581243249382355139', 'I Love You, I Don''t', 1976, 'Drama', 'Willy Kurant, Serge Gainsbourg', 'Serge Gainsbourg', 'Joe Dallesandro, Jane Birkin, Hugues Quester, Gérard Depardieu, Reinhard Kolldehoff, Michel Blanc, Raoul Delfosse, Liliane Rovère', null, 'The petite waitress Johnny works and lives in a truck-stop, where she''s lonely and longs for love. She develops a crush on the garbage truck driver Krassky, although her sleazy boss Boris warns her that he''s gay.', 'The petite waitress Johnny works and lives in a truck-stop, where she''s lonely and longs for love. She develops a crush on the garbage truck driver Krassky, although her sleazy boss Boris warns her that he''s gay.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/45WJFrBw9fa5mN4YOWlnbylIu5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4580'),
  ('1027772524381260058', 'I Love You, I Kill You', 1971, 'Drama', 'Uwe Brandner', 'Uwe Brandner', 'Rolf Becker, Hannes Fuchs, Helmut Brasch, Marianne Blomquist, Nikolaus Dutsch, Monika Hansen, Wolfgang Ebert, Walter Ladengast', null, 'German movie set in the future where there is a village existing only to maintain a game preserve for the ruling class and whose inhabitants are kept happy by popping pills. Written and directed by Uwe Brandner, the movie operates on many levels of love-hate relationships, but it is primarily a political parable about fascism and freedom. A young teacher comes to a remote village , which rich gentlemen have chosen as their hunting ground. The residents are happy and nice to each other. Any dissatisfaction that arises is wiped away with freely available drugs or with the clubs of the village police. A gamekeeper who makes sure that the high lords'' hunting parties are not endangered becomes the new teacher in the village''s first friend. They fall in love, and the gamekeepers gift of love is a gun, which will eventually break their relationship as a confrontation ensues as the teacher starts poaching with his new gun.', 'German movie set in the future where there is a village existing only to maintain a game preserve for the ruling class and whose inhabitants are kept happy by popping pills. Written and directed by Uwe Brandner, the movie operates on many levels of love-hate relationships, but it is primarily a political parable about fascism and freedom. A young teacher comes to a remote village , which rich gentlemen have chosen as their hunting ground. The residents are happy and nice to each other. Any dissatisfaction that arises is wiped away with freely available drugs or with the clubs of the village police. A gamekeeper who makes sure that the high lords'' hunting parties are not endangered becomes the new teacher in the village''s first friend. They fall in love, and the gamekeepers gift of love is a gun, which will eventually break their relationship as a confrontation ensues as the teacher starts poaching with his new gun.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4QaXKfvS13aobbHZVnCjbWtDea9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:285065'),
  ('154195857461589978', 'I Love You, I Love You Not', 1996, 'Drama, Family, Romance', 'Billy Hopkins, Maryse Alberti', 'Wendy Kesselman', 'Claire Danes, Jude Law, Jeanne Moreau, James Van Der Beek, Kris Park, Lauren Fox, Emily Burkes-Nossiter, Carrie Szlasa', 'NR', 'A school student and her European-born grandmother share sad stories of their lives.', 'A school student and her European-born grandmother share sad stories of their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aesZ94JtQFiVdvNFNbO5CSeWms2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45565'),
  ('1018177169434267434', 'I Love You, Man', 2009, 'Comedy, Romance', 'John Hamburg, Lawrence Sher, Scott Robertson', 'John Hamburg, Larry Levin', 'Paul Rudd, Jason Segel, Rashida Jones, Andy Samberg, J.K. Simmons, Jane Curtin, Jon Favreau, Jaime Pressly', 'R', 'Peter Klaven is a successful real estate agent who, upon getting engaged to the woman of his dreams, Zooey, discovers, to his dismay and chagrin, that he has no male friend close enough to serve as his Best Man. Peter immediately sets out to rectify the situation, embarking on a series of bizarre and awkward "man-dates."', 'Peter Klaven is a successful real estate agent who, upon getting engaged to the woman of his dreams, Zooey, discovers, to his dismay and chagrin, that he has no male friend close enough to serve as his Best Man. Peter immediately sets out to rectify the situation, embarking on a series of bizarre and awkward "man-dates."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xr4zAYsvgTzvMMiWu6qCAP9WBer.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16538'),
  ('6543391393186066', 'I Love You, Stupid', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Sergi Gallardo, Laura Mañá', 'Abraham Sastre, Ivan Bouso', 'Quim Gutiérrez, Natalia Tena, Alfonso Bassave, Alba Ribas, Ernesto Alterio, Patricia Vico, Francesc Albiol, Núria Valls', null, 'Marcos'' life turns upside down after he loses the same day his girlfriend and his job. Marcos'' life turns wild after to meet Raquel.', 'Marcos'' life turns upside down after he loses the same day his girlfriend and his job. Marcos'' life turns wild after to meet Raquel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ceKh9Qd00EZg5uT2OnLOskL94kr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:613096'),
  ('947270170331522364', 'I Love Your Work', 2003, 'Drama', 'Adam Goldberg, Adam Rehmeier, Mark Putnam', 'Adrian Butchart, Adam Goldberg', 'Giovanni Ribisi, Christina Ricci, Marisa Coughlan, Judy Greer, Shalom Harlow, Jared Harris, Vince Vaughn, Joshua Jackson', null, 'A fictional movie star endures the disintegration of his marriage, a gradual mental breakdown, and an increasing obsession with a young film student who reminds him of his own life before becoming famous.', 'A fictional movie star endures the disintegration of his marriage, a gradual mental breakdown, and an increasing obsession with a young film student who reminds him of his own life before becoming famous.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eEHWma4acEcP0byL2a7h9MJxB57.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25428'),
  ('263045366460818677', 'I Love, You Love', 1988, 'Romance, Drama', 'Dušan Hanák, Alojz Hanúsek, Jozef Ort-Šnep', 'Dušan Hanák, Dušan Dušek', 'Roman Kłosowski, Iva Janžurová, Milan Jelić, Václav Babka, Milada Ježková, Juraj Nvota, Ľudovít Reiter, Věra Bílá', null, 'The drama called I Love, You Love was made in 1980 but because of the absurd ideological ban, the film entered cinemas nine years later. Pišta is an unmarried man who works at a freight wagon which carries letters and parcels. Alcohol helps him to overcome his handicap of being short and not good-looking. He wishes he had a woman, but the woman he really wants, ageing Viera who reloads the cargoes, has a soft spot for another man. So, Pišta has nobody and nothing, except for senile mother who sometimes fails to recognize him. The film received Silver Bear for Best Director at the International Film Festival in Berlin.', 'The drama called I Love, You Love was made in 1980 but because of the absurd ideological ban, the film entered cinemas nine years later. Pišta is an unmarried man who works at a freight wagon which carries letters and parcels. Alcohol helps him to overcome his handicap of being short and not good-looking. He wishes he had a woman, but the woman he really wants, ageing Viera who reloads the cargoes, has a soft spot for another man. So, Pišta has nobody and nothing, except for senile mother who sometimes fails to recognize him. The film received Silver Bear for Best Director at the International Film Festival in Berlin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/50isBItKAZatAX5qy770xZhhwWH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:245184'),
  ('196910778068906163', 'I Loved a Woman', 1933, 'Drama, Romance', 'Alfred E. Green, James Van Trees, Maxwell Arnow', 'Charles Kenyon, Sidney Sutherland', 'Edward G. Robinson, Kay Francis, Genevieve Tobin, Robert Barrat, Murray Kinnell, Robert McWade, J. Farrell MacDonald, Henry Kolker', null, 'The son of a ruthless meatpacking king goes through a number of changes in ideals and motivations as he reluctantly inherits the mantle and falls in love.', 'The son of a ruthless meatpacking king goes through a number of changes in ideals and motivations as he reluctantly inherits the mantle and falls in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xZczvd88iewrwiPVXsUwX4wQVyh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109549'),
  ('233826581564481009', 'I Loved an Armchair', 1971, 'Comedy', 'Dinos Dimopoulos, Pantelis Filippides, Stelios Antoniadis', 'Lakis Mihailidis', 'Kostas Voutsas, Eleni Erimou, Stavros Xenidis, Giorgos Moshidis, Katerina Yioulaki, Maria Foka, Nikitas Platis, Athinodoros Prousalis', null, 'Years ago, Grigoris was forced to sell four velvet armchairs to the junk dealer. After the death of his aunt, he was informed that her entire legacy, which was a box of jewelry, was hidden in one of those four armchairs. In the meantime, the armchairs had been sold to other people, and so a desperate quest for the right armchair begins, resulting in many and sometimes grotesque adventures.', 'Years ago, Grigoris was forced to sell four velvet armchairs to the junk dealer. After the death of his aunt, he was informed that her entire legacy, which was a box of jewelry, was hidden in one of those four armchairs. In the meantime, the armchairs had been sold to other people, and so a desperate quest for the right armchair begins, resulting in many and sometimes grotesque adventures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7yn1RJXnBlntUjKbptR1aOeS7Ye.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:392855'),
  ('662766092822131277', 'I Lunes e la sfera di Lasifer', 2002, 'Animation', 'Francisco Alvarez, Giorgio Valentini, Silvio Pautasso', null, 'Daniele Natali, Alessio Cigliano, Alberto Angrisano, Cristina Grado, Valentina Tomada, Luigi Ferraro, Flavio Aquilone, Paolo Marchese', null, 'The Lunes are the guardians of Lasifer''s magical sphere, which has always been suspended in the pyramid thanks to the energy of the moonlight. Woe betide if the moonlight were to fail: the sphere would fall, bringing terrible calamities upon the earth.', 'The Lunes are the guardians of Lasifer''s magical sphere, which has always been suspended in the pyramid thanks to the energy of the moonlight. Woe betide if the moonlight were to fail: the sphere would fall, bringing terrible calamities upon the earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f7RqZoPn0CGuvcAJWdKgLlE135w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:542643'),
  ('1152187393338737091', 'I magicanti e i tre elementi', 2003, 'Animation, Family', 'Silvio Pautasso, Giorgio Valentini', null, 'Paolo Marchese, Alessio Puccio, Valeria Vidali, Raffaella Castelli, Flavio Aquilone, Erica Necci, Paola Majano, Gerolamo Alchieri', null, 'Gemma and Benny, two children, end up meeting the White Wizards of Maga Feliza''s school and the Black Wizards of Master Badabè''s school.', 'Gemma and Benny, two children, end up meeting the White Wizards of Maga Feliza''s school and the Black Wizards of Master Badabè''s school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Dz0H3EsLuIxitYzERz0Pehi3Rd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:542685'),
  ('707132368186876253', 'I Magotti e la Pentola Magica', 2001, 'Animation', 'Silvio Pautasso, Giorgio Valentini, Anthony LaMolinara', 'Bianca Pitzorno', 'Oliviero Dinelli, Laura Latini, Fabrizio Vidale, Antonella Baldini, Antonella Rinaldi, Paolo Lombardi, Mauro Gravina, Fabrizio Mazzotta', null, 'The Wizard Cabalone and the rooster Coccante, in an attempt to create the perfect assistant, pour a potion down from the tower, which passes through herbs, bushes and rocks, collecting their colors, the same ones from which the Magotti are born.', 'The Wizard Cabalone and the rooster Coccante, in an attempt to create the perfect assistant, pour a potion down from the tower, which passes through herbs, bushes and rocks, collecting their colors, the same ones from which the Magotti are born.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2E3Tj28EvgiSSBjgyQe15trRTYF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:542587'),
  ('487800171848350596', 'I Married a Dumbass', 2016, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Juan Lovece, Fernando Alcalde, Sabrina García', 'Pablo Solarz', 'Adrián Suar, Valeria Bertuccelli, Gerardo Romano, Norman Briski, Alan Sabbagh, Marina Bellati, María Alché, Analía Couceyro', null, 'Florencia, a rising actress, ends up falling in love with her co-star, a famous film star. When they decide to marry, Florencia becomes aware that in reality she fell in love with the character and that her husband is indeed a real idiot.', 'Florencia, a rising actress, ends up falling in love with her co-star, a famous film star. When they decide to marry, Florencia becomes aware that in reality she fell in love with the character and that her husband is indeed a real idiot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rWo38m3XwcbOeArt2UOixPtkoB9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:389995'),
  ('411910544910525522', 'I Married a Monster from Outer Space', 1958, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Bud Brill, William Mull, Haskell B. Boggs', 'Louis Vittes', 'Tom Tryon, Gloria Talbott, Alan Dexter, Jean Carson, Ken Lynch, Maxie Rosenbloom, Peter Baldwin, Jack Orrison', 'NR', 'Aliens from Outer Space are slowly switching places with real humans -- one of the first being a young man about to get married. Slowly, his new wife realizes something is wrong, and her suspicions are confirmed when her husband''s odd behaviour begins to show up in other townspeople.', 'Aliens from Outer Space are slowly switching places with real humans -- one of the first being a young man about to get married. Slowly, his new wife realizes something is wrong, and her suspicions are confirmed when her husband''s odd behaviour begins to show up in other townspeople.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a38yzngqdcauRc0p9WEeZgvT2xU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43117'),
  ('951321376343257499', 'I Married a Shadow', 1983, 'Crime, Drama', 'Bernard Zitzermann, Robin Davis', 'Robin Davis', 'Nathalie Baye, Francis Huster, Richard Bohringer, Madeleine Robinson, Guy Tréjan, Victoria Abril, Véronique Genest, Maurice Jacquemont', null, 'After a train accident, a woman survives and is mistaken for an other woman she just met on a train before the accident.', 'After a train accident, a woman survives and is mistaken for an other woman she just met on a train before the accident.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e1fHOMHDUZEHHC54GjXzcj58oeM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4227'),
  ('882009215952519570', 'I Married a Strange Person!', 1998, 'Comedy, Animation, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Bill Plympton, John Donnelly', 'P.C. Vey, Bill Plympton', 'Tom Larson, Charis Michelsen, Richard Spore, Christopher Cooke, Ruth Ray, J.B. Adams, John Russo Jr., Jennifer Senko', 'R', 'On their wedding night, Grant begins experiencing strange, supernatural powers and his bride Keri can''t cope. Whenever Grant thinks of something, it becomes reality, yet he doesn''t know where this magic came from. Things become more complicated when a megalomaniac CEO sends the military to capture Grant in order to weaponize his abilities.', 'On their wedding night, Grant begins experiencing strange, supernatural powers and his bride Keri can''t cope. Whenever Grant thinks of something, it becomes reality, yet he doesn''t know where this magic came from. Things become more complicated when a megalomaniac CEO sends the military to capture Grant in order to weaponize his abilities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n2WjY1mESooUlLjreQpePocIXVw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51942'),
  ('1089537156701723525', 'I Married a Witch', 1942, 'Romance, Fantasy, Comedy', 'René Clair, Ted Tetzlaff, William Forsyth', 'Robert Pirosh, Marc Connelly', 'Fredric March, Veronica Lake, Robert Benchley, Susan Hayward, Cecil Kellaway, Elizabeth Patterson, Robert Warwick, Georgia Backus', 'NR', 'A 17th-century witch returns to wreak havoc in the life of a descendant of the Puritan witch hunter who burned her, but runs afoul of her father when she discovers that her mischief might have found her true love.', 'A 17th-century witch returns to wreak havoc in the life of a descendant of the Puritan witch hunter who burned her, but runs afoul of her father when she discovers that her mischief might have found her true love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pOtHcQfo0wCesRfeDPacrS2bD3W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25970'),
  ('194601588192343816', 'I Married an Anti-Fan', 2016, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Kim Je-young', 'Kim Je-young', 'Chanyeol, Yuan Shanshan, Seohyun, Jo Jiang, Zhao Zhiwei, Yuan Yuxuan, Shi Wenxiang, Wang Zheng', 'NR', 'An entertainment reporter hates a star after she is fired for trying to reveal secrets about him. After a series of events, she starts to fall in love with the entertainer.', 'An entertainment reporter hates a star after she is fired for trying to reveal secrets about him. After a series of events, she starts to fall in love with the entertainer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/geIRuYpxuAZ8JejotIJUwmCAIzo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:403582'),
  ('233829746466042192', 'I Melt with You', 2011, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Mark Pellington, Eric Schmidt, Rod Smith', 'Glenn Porter', 'Thomas Jane, Jeremy Piven, Rob Lowe, Christian McKay, Carla Gugino, Arielle Kebbel, Sasha Grey, Tom Bower', 'R', 'Former college friends meet up for a reunion that leads them to face the apparent disillusionment that defines their lives. After a week of excessive drug and alcohol abuse, events lead them to contemplate fulfilling a self destructive pact they made when they were young.', 'Former college friends meet up for a reunion that leads them to face the apparent disillusionment that defines their lives. After a week of excessive drug and alcohol abuse, events lead them to contemplate fulfilling a self destructive pact they made when they were young.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6Xq0cwrXOgmyKCTtH3KlOJFS8uu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75345'),
  ('522741887894472062', 'I Met a Girl', 2020, 'Romance, Drama, Comedy', 'Luke Eve, Patrick O''Sullivan', 'Glen Dolman', 'Brenton Thwaites, Lily Sullivan, Joel Jackson, Zahra Newman, Anita Hegh, Dan Paris, Anni Finsterer, Amy Mathews', null, 'An aspiring musician struggling with schizophrenia falls for a mysterious woman who may be all in his head. When she suddenly vanishes, he takes off on a cross-country journey across Australia to find her, forcing his long-suffering brother to chase after him.', 'An aspiring musician struggling with schizophrenia falls for a mysterious woman who may be all in his head. When she suddenly vanishes, he takes off on a cross-country journey across Australia to find her, forcing his long-suffering brother to chase after him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mkE8z7x5Ab94gN3CtormERYIz8B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:611114'),
  ('1102082027300886357', 'I Met the Walrus', 2007, 'Documentary, Animation', 'Josh Raskin', 'Josh Raskin', 'John Lennon, Jerry Levitan', null, 'The film is based on an interview of John Lennon by Jerry Levitan in 1969. Levitan, then 14 years old, tracked Lennon to his hotel room at Toronto''s King Edward Hotel after hearing a rumour that Lennon had been sighted at the Toronto Airport. Jerry made his way into John Lennon''s suite and persuaded John to agree to an interview. The animation is based on Levitan''s historic 30 minute recording of the interview, which was edited down to 5 minutes.', 'The film is based on an interview of John Lennon by Jerry Levitan in 1969. Levitan, then 14 years old, tracked Lennon to his hotel room at Toronto''s King Edward Hotel after hearing a rumour that Lennon had been sighted at the Toronto Airport. Jerry made his way into John Lennon''s suite and persuaded John to agree to an interview. The animation is based on Levitan''s historic 30 minute recording of the interview, which was edited down to 5 minutes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j0pawYsvCvIMNRo6801H61ZvAOL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:159145'),
  ('636802301441389766', 'I Miss Sonia Henie', 1971, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Frederick Wiseman, Karpo Aćimović Godina, Paul Morrissey', 'Dobrila Stojnić, Branko Milićević, Srđan Zelenović', 'Brooke Hayward, Sonja Henie, Buck Henry, Branko Milićević, Catherine Rouvel, Dobrila Stojnić, Srđan Zelenović', null, 'One camera in one setting, one attic and eight young directors – the result is a unique Dadaistic collage of seven short sketches. The original task for each filmmaker was to keep each short under three minutes, to set it in one hotel room, and to include the sentence “I miss Sonja Henie." This experimental film was shot over a single night at the international film festival FEST in Beograd in 1971.', 'One camera in one setting, one attic and eight young directors – the result is a unique Dadaistic collage of seven short sketches. The original task for each filmmaker was to keep each short under three minutes, to set it in one hotel room, and to include the sentence “I miss Sonja Henie." This experimental film was shot over a single night at the international film festival FEST in Beograd in 1971.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iUKcB1zh9Yezuq44VSt1cMP67I9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48860'),
  ('320821039161302166', 'I Miss You', 2019, 'Drama, Romance', 'Rodrigo Bellott, Noah Greenberg', 'Rodrigo Bellott', 'Oscar Martínez, Rossy de Palma, Fernando Barbosa, Luis Gamarra, Rick Cosnett, Ana Asensio, Dominic Colón, Modesto Lacen', 'NR', 'Following his son Gabriel’s death, Jorge travels from conservative Bolivia to New York City to confront Gabriel’s boyfriend Sebastian. While the two battle over Jorge’s inability to accept his son, Sebastian channels his grief into a bold new play in honor of his lost love, in which Gabriel’s inner turmoil is transformed into an eye-popping gay fantasia.', 'Following his son Gabriel’s death, Jorge travels from conservative Bolivia to New York City to confront Gabriel’s boyfriend Sebastian. While the two battle over Jorge’s inability to accept his son, Sebastian channels his grief into a bold new play in honor of his lost love, in which Gabriel’s inner turmoil is transformed into an eye-popping gay fantasia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eTqb0SharJxXebJxr6tAN0NLgbi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:612437'),
  ('188789831962725373', 'I Miss You, Hugs and Kisses', 1978, 'Mystery, Drama', 'Murray Markowitz, Donald Wilder, Ron Yowart', 'Murray Markowitz', 'Elke Sommer, Donald Pilon, Chuck Shamata, George Touliatos, Cindy Girling, George Chuvalo, Cec Linder, Richard M. Davidson', null, 'Successful businessman Charles Kruschen (Donald Pilon) is accused of bludgeoning to death his beautiful but manipulative model wife Magdalene (Elke Sommer). As the trial draws to a close, Charles reflects on the events leading up to the terrible incident...', 'Successful businessman Charles Kruschen (Donald Pilon) is accused of bludgeoning to death his beautiful but manipulative model wife Magdalene (Elke Sommer). As the trial draws to a close, Charles reflects on the events leading up to the terrible incident...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xceAskpxMl4KKMhCbYh60RDXmPS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40109'),
  ('430790025629649892', 'I motorizzati', 1962, 'Comedy', 'Camillo Mastrocinque, Nino Zanchin, Tonino Valerii', 'Pipolo, Castellano', 'Ugo Tognazzi, Nino Manfredi, Franca Valeri, José Luis López Vázquez, Walter Chiari, Mario Brega, Gianni Agus, Mercedes Alonso', null, 'A guy is about to become the millionth citizen to buy a car in Rome. Frightened, he decides to remain pedestrian, and recalls several stories, with new car owners as protagonists. Episodic comedy.', 'A guy is about to become the millionth citizen to buy a car in Rome. Frightened, he decides to remain pedestrian, and recalls several stories, with new car owners as protagonists. Episodic comedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cgb1uyWZfaQaXm0VqYEIs6G668y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99916'),
  ('913804908316619469', 'I Murder Seriously', 2002, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Antonio Urrutia', 'Javier Valdés, Carlos Puig', 'Jesús Ochoa, Santiago Segura, Ivonne Montero, Gabriela Roel, Daniel Giménez Cacho, Rafael Inclán, Diego Jáuregui, Eduardo España', null, 'A cop sets out to find a man who has been delivering too much of a good thing in this offbeat comedy. Police detective Martinez (Jesus Ochoa) has been handed a most unusual case -- a number of local prostitutes have been murdered, and it''s up to Martinez to bring in the killer. What makes the case truly unusual, though, is the manner of death; it seems the hookers all died as a result of having orgasms so powerful they were literally fatal. Teaming up with cultural anthropologist Onofre (Daniel Giménez Cacho), Martinez hits the streets looking for clues, and eventually gets some unexpected help from Father Gorkisolo (Santiago Segura), a priest with a unusually deep knowledge of sexual matters. Asesino en Serio was the first feature film from director Antonio Urrutia; noted Mexican filmmaker Guillermo del Toro served as executive producer.', 'A cop sets out to find a man who has been delivering too much of a good thing in this offbeat comedy. Police detective Martinez (Jesus Ochoa) has been handed a most unusual case -- a number of local prostitutes have been murdered, and it''s up to Martinez to bring in the killer. What makes the case truly unusual, though, is the manner of death; it seems the hookers all died as a result of having orgasms so powerful they were literally fatal. Teaming up with cultural anthropologist Onofre (Daniel Giménez Cacho), Martinez hits the streets looking for clues, and eventually gets some unexpected help from Father Gorkisolo (Santiago Segura), a priest with a unusually deep knowledge of sexual matters. Asesino en Serio was the first feature film from director Antonio Urrutia; noted Mexican filmmaker Guillermo del Toro served as executive producer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tDFtXrxnFCxo2A0QOtaCvb2KJmZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44149'),
  ('332287993967103071', 'I Need Money', 1951, 'Drama, Comedy, Crime, Romance', 'Miguel Zacarías, Jorge Stahl Jr., Valerio Olivo', 'Edmundo Báez, Miguel Zacarías', 'Pedro Infante, Sara Montiel, Irma Dorantes, Gustavo Rivero, Armando Sáenz, Elda Peralta, Guillermo Samperio, Gloria Morel', null, 'Manuel is a mechanic in love with the beautiful Maria Teresa. When the rich Jose Antonio courts his beloved Maria, Manuel realizes that he needs money and gets into trouble to get it.', 'Manuel is a mechanic in love with the beautiful Maria Teresa. When the rich Jose Antonio courts his beloved Maria, Manuel realizes that he needs money and gets into trouble to get it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jf9mOmELErCBD5PEGi1s1w1wsgy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:191663'),
  ('326295266640775748', 'I Neraida Kai to Palikari', 1969, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Dinos Dimopoulos, Angelos Sideratos, Giorgos Arvanitis', 'Lakis Mihailidis', 'Aliki Vougiouklaki, Dimitris Papamichael, Dionysis Papagiannopoulos, Spyros Kalogirou, Giannis Argyris, Nikos Tsoukas, Joly Garbi, Alekos Tzanetakos', null, 'Fourtounakis’ daughter, Katerinio, is forced to get engaged with a brutal Cretan, Skandalakis. But the return of Manousos Vrontakis from Athens and his flirtation with the girl leads to a great romance, without them knowing that they belong to families who are longstanding enemies.', 'Fourtounakis’ daughter, Katerinio, is forced to get engaged with a brutal Cretan, Skandalakis. But the return of Manousos Vrontakis from Athens and his flirtation with the girl leads to a great romance, without them knowing that they belong to families who are longstanding enemies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Mkc0RXMMTZxtWMvMMy8BayCW5m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:234961'),
  ('650194162791366846', 'I Never Cry', 2020, 'Drama', 'Carmen Kovacs, Marcin Kasiński, Kacper Habisiak', 'Piotr Domalewski', 'Zofia Stafiej, Kinga Preis, Arkadiusz Jakubik, Dawid Tulej, Nigel O''Neill, Shane Casey, David Pearse, Donncha Crowley', null, 'Ola sets off to Ireland to bring her father''s body back to Poland after he dies in a building site accident. But never mind her dad, Ola wants to know if he had saved money for the car he had promised her. Dealing with foreign bureaucracy in her own streetwise way, Ola will get to know her father.', 'Ola sets off to Ireland to bring her father''s body back to Poland after he dies in a building site accident. But never mind her dad, Ola wants to know if he had saved money for the car he had promised her. Dealing with foreign bureaucracy in her own streetwise way, Ola will get to know her father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/11B50N0J0BHBdvB8SYOa6krouNS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:736225'),
  ('354431386221920090', 'I Never Promised You a Rose Garden', 1977, 'Drama', 'Anthony Page, Bruce Logan', 'Gavin Lambert, Lewis John Carlino', 'Kathleen Quinlan, Bibi Andersson, Ben Piazza, Lorraine Gary, Martine Bartlett, Margo Ann Berdeshevsky, Darlene Craviotto, Reni Santoni', 'R', 'A disturbed and institutionalized 16-year-old girl struggles between fantasy and reality.', 'A disturbed and institutionalized 16-year-old girl struggles between fantasy and reality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AcumdxTlCtFBQXDjsIsiy1VyjpX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66092'),
  ('177220027441883173', 'I Never Sang for My Father', 1970, 'Drama', 'Gilbert Cates, George Stoetzel, Morris Hartzband', 'Robert Anderson', 'Gene Hackman, Melvyn Douglas, Dorothy Stickney, Estelle Parsons, Elizabeth Hubbard, Lovelady Powell, Daniel Keyes, Conrad Bain', 'PG', 'A man living in the towering shadow of his aging father finds it difficult to start a new chapter in his life by marrying his girlfriend and moving to California.', 'A man living in the towering shadow of his aging father finds it difficult to start a new chapter in his life by marrying his girlfriend and moving to California.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o494qtKJgd5IU21sMjdc5tTd7fQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92283'),
  ('398323821090238450', 'I Not Stupid', 2002, 'Comedy', 'Jack Neo', 'Jack Neo', 'Jack Neo, Xiang Yun, Richard Low, Selena Tan, Shawn Lee, Joshua Ang, Huang Po Ju, Cheryl Chan', null, 'Kok Pin, Boon Hock and Terry are classmates in "EM3" stream. In Singapore, that means that at the age of 12, the government has decided that they are not as academically inclined as their peers. Kok Pin is creative and a born artist but his parents would rather he focus on his Maths and Sciences. Boon Hock comes from a low-income family and needs to balance school and helping out at the food stall. Terry, a spoilt brat is just too lazy a student. While the three children suffer from the pressure of school, their parents have another set of problems - their jobs and careers.', 'Kok Pin, Boon Hock and Terry are classmates in "EM3" stream. In Singapore, that means that at the age of 12, the government has decided that they are not as academically inclined as their peers. Kok Pin is creative and a born artist but his parents would rather he focus on his Maths and Sciences. Boon Hock comes from a low-income family and needs to balance school and helping out at the food stall. Terry, a spoilt brat is just too lazy a student. While the three children suffer from the pressure of school, their parents have another set of problems - their jobs and careers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bXQ9kHkb5SXPrDM3qvMXWoDGTDi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56836'),
  ('796238624780242070', 'I Not Stupid Too', 2006, 'Drama', 'Jack Neo', 'Jack Neo', 'Shawn Lee, Ashley Leong, Joshua Ang, Huang Yiliang, Jack Neo, Xiang Yun, M.C. King, Selena Tan', null, 'A 2006 Singaporean film and the sequel to the 2002 film, I Not Stupid. A satirical comedy, I Not Stupid Too portrays the lives, struggles and adventures of three Singaporean youths - 15-year-old Tom, his 8-year-old brother Jerry and their 15-year-old friend Chengcai - who have a strained relationship with their parents. The film explores the issue of poor parent-child communication.', 'A 2006 Singaporean film and the sequel to the 2002 film, I Not Stupid. A satirical comedy, I Not Stupid Too portrays the lives, struggles and adventures of three Singaporean youths - 15-year-old Tom, his 8-year-old brother Jerry and their 15-year-old friend Chengcai - who have a strained relationship with their parents. The film explores the issue of poor parent-child communication.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2q8LJ7xD2NMIJPiPZGcIVFKd3dR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59275'),
  ('1137064563365994278', 'I Now Pronounce You Chuck & Larry', 2007, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Dennis Dugan, Dean Semler, Doug Coleman', 'Jim Taylor, Alexander Payne, Barry Fanaro', 'Adam Sandler, Kevin James, Jessica Biel, Dan Aykroyd, Ving Rhames, Steve Buscemi, Nicholas Turturro, Allen Covert', 'PG-13', 'Firefighters Chuck Ford and Larry Valentine are guy''s guys, loyal to the core—which is why when widower Larry asks Chuck to pose as his lover so that he can get domestic partner benefits for his kids, his buddy agrees. However, things get dicey when a bureaucrat comes calling, and the boys are forced to present a picture of domestic bliss.', 'Firefighters Chuck Ford and Larry Valentine are guy''s guys, loyal to the core—which is why when widower Larry asks Chuck to pose as his lover so that he can get domestic partner benefits for his kids, his buddy agrees. However, things get dicey when a bureaucrat comes calling, and the boys are forced to present a picture of domestic bliss.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vF0yEaGyXYsHWRTMmeJaJKp43bj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3563'),
  ('352271714986421799', 'I Often Think of Piroschka', 1955, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Richard Angst, Kurt Hoffmann', 'Per Schwenzen, Hugo Hartung, Joachim Wedekind', 'Liselotte Pulver, Gunnar Möller, Wera Frydtberg, Gustav Knuth, Rudolf Vogel, Adrienne Gessner, Annie Rosar, Margit Symo', null, 'Andreas, a young German student comes to Hungary on an exchange programme. In the Hungarian village he falls in love with the stationmaster''s daughter Piroschka and spends much of his time with her. They have an enchanting summer until Andreas gets an invitation to join another young woman at a nearby resort. Piroschka is jealous and follows him there, causing trouble. It takes a long time for Andreas and Piroschka to even talk to each other again. When Andreas has to leave Hungary at the end of his holiday, he is determined to return some day.', 'Andreas, a young German student comes to Hungary on an exchange programme. In the Hungarian village he falls in love with the stationmaster''s daughter Piroschka and spends much of his time with her. They have an enchanting summer until Andreas gets an invitation to join another young woman at a nearby resort. Piroschka is jealous and follows him there, causing trouble. It takes a long time for Andreas and Piroschka to even talk to each other again. When Andreas has to leave Hungary at the end of his holiday, he is determined to return some day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/obmyNjPpBNk8T3vwpAJxHW2EMFW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11095'),
  ('946419897308888209', 'I Only Want You to Love Me', 1976, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Rainer Werner Fassbinder, Michael Ballhaus, Ernst Schmid', 'Rainer Werner Fassbinder, Klaus Antes, Christiane Erhardt', 'Vitus Zeplichal, Elke Aberle, Alexander Allerson, Erni Mangold, Annemarie Wendl, Peer Raben, Johanna Hofer, Wolfgang Hess', null, 'Peter grew up during the economic miracle, bereft of parental care and love. Learning early on that interpersonal relationships are based on the principles of exchange or purchase, he abides by these rules and gives generous presents to his family and his wife, Erika. But when he is unable to keep up this lifestyle, his story takes a horrendous turn...', 'Peter grew up during the economic miracle, bereft of parental care and love. Learning early on that interpersonal relationships are based on the principles of exchange or purchase, he abides by these rules and gives generous presents to his family and his wife, Erika. But when he is unable to keep up this lifestyle, his story takes a horrendous turn...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iWRLLbOwaX1ZrWXCw2W9Ee9OiJ0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:93655'),
  ('369532290827706723', 'I Origins', 2014, 'Science Fiction, Drama', 'Markus Förderer, Mike Cahill, Willy Friedman', 'Mike Cahill', 'Michael Pitt, Brit Marling, Àstrid Bergès-Frisbey, Steven Yeun, Archie Panjabi, Cara Seymour, Venida Evans, William Mapother', 'R', 'A molecular biologist''s study of the human eye has far-reaching implications about humanity''s scientific and spiritual beliefs.', 'A molecular biologist''s study of the human eye has far-reaching implications about humanity''s scientific and spiritual beliefs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2P31jhd1dWUAPD8dmnSrwkQ8CNN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:244267'),
  ('326386255607586895', 'I Ought to Be in Pictures', 1982, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Herbert Ross, David M. Walsh', 'Neil Simon', 'Walter Matthau, Ann-Margret, Dinah Manoff, Lance Guest, Michael Dudikoff, Eugene Butler, David Faustino, Martin Ferrero', 'PG', 'Grandmother has nothing to say when Libby tells her that she is off to LA to look up Dad, a Hollywood screenwriter. Grandmother has been in a New York cemetery for six years and Dad has been out of Libby''s life for 16 of her 19 years. Libby arrives in LA on a Tuesday and phones Dad the one night that Stephanie, who does Jane Fonda''s hair, stays over. Stephanie is there the next morning when Libby decides she needs to tell her story face-to-face.', 'Grandmother has nothing to say when Libby tells her that she is off to LA to look up Dad, a Hollywood screenwriter. Grandmother has been in a New York cemetery for six years and Dad has been out of Libby''s life for 16 of her 19 years. Libby arrives in LA on a Tuesday and phones Dad the one night that Stephanie, who does Jane Fonda''s hair, stays over. Stephanie is there the next morning when Libby decides she needs to tell her story face-to-face.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/77w57DPFk8NhcVHbVl94gbjKUa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42128'),
  ('862528641221049470', 'I picari', 1987, 'Comedy', 'Mario Monicelli, Riccardo Milani, Tonino Nardi', 'Piero De Bernardi, Leonardo Benvenuti, Mario Monicelli', 'Giancarlo Giannini, Enrico Montesano, Vittorio Gassman, Nino Manfredi, Giuliana De Sio, Bernard Blier, Paolo Hendel, Vittorio Caprioli', null, 'The adventures of a couple of scoundrels in the Spain of the 16th century.', 'The adventures of a couple of scoundrels in the Spain of the 16th century.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cyopgUvtcSSF6pwSycph77dZyDV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103216'),
  ('657636729883564787', 'I piccoli maestri', 1998, 'Drama, War, History', 'Daniele Luchetti, Giuseppe Lanci, Serena Canevari', 'Domenico Starnone, Sandro Petraglia, Stefano Rulli', 'Stefano Accorsi, Stefania Montorsi, Giorgio Pasotti, Diego Gianesini, Filippo Sandon, Manuel Donato, Marco Piras, Marco Paolini', null, 'During the 20 months before Italy''s liberation from Fascism, a group of university students trade empty rhetoric for action by joining the Partisans into the mountains of Nazi-occupied northern Italy. There, group leader Gigi falls in love with his best friend''s girl. As the Resistance struggle continues, some of the "little teachers" are killed, and the brutal reality of war leaves its mark on their youthful idealism.', 'During the 20 months before Italy''s liberation from Fascism, a group of university students trade empty rhetoric for action by joining the Partisans into the mountains of Nazi-occupied northern Italy. There, group leader Gigi falls in love with his best friend''s girl. As the Resistance struggle continues, some of the "little teachers" are killed, and the brutal reality of war leaves its mark on their youthful idealism.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5jhyb4PCOvVpy8Gxqnnp6BQhK4P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:203794'),
  ('135917590407297869', 'I pionieri', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Luca Scivoletto, Stefano Falivene', 'Pierpaolo Pirone, Luca Scivoletto, Eleonora Cimpanelli', 'Mattia Bonaventura, Francesco Cilia, Danilo Di Vita, Matilde Sofia Fazio, Peppino Mazzotta, Lorenza Indovina, Eleonora Danco, Claudio Bigagli', null, 'Sicily, summer 1990. Two young boys, sons of ardent communists, run away from home to re-found the Pioneers, the glorious and now extinct scouts of the Party. But not everything goes according to their plans.', 'Sicily, summer 1990. Two young boys, sons of ardent communists, run away from home to re-found the Pioneers, the glorious and now extinct scouts of the Party. But not everything goes according to their plans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7fNc4x9jNysipBTql2gBZLjg0PM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1100488'),
