  ('610104673339921838', 'I Promise You Anarchy', 2015, 'Romance, Drama', 'María Secco, Julio Hernández Cordón', 'Julio Hernández Cordón', 'Diego Calva, Eduardo Eliseo Martínez, Shvasti Calderón, Sarah Minter, Gabriel Casanova, Martha Claudia Moreno, Milkman, Mario Alberto Sánchez', null, 'Miguel and Johnny know each other since childhood. They are dedicated to skate and have fun. To earn easy money and continue skating, they sell their own blood to a clandestine contact in a hospital. The activity becomes business until a large transaction is not as they imagined.', 'Miguel and Johnny know each other since childhood. They are dedicated to skate and have fun. To earn easy money and continue skating, they sell their own blood to a clandestine contact in a hospital. The activity becomes business until a large transaction is not as they imagined.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/38VsKKWIIynl5bDWGkm3DkT5scn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:317940'),
  ('961656918225783940', 'I ragazzi dello Zecchino d’Oro', 2019, 'Comedy, TV Movie', 'Ambrogio Lo Giudice', null, 'Matilda De Angelis, Maya Sansa, Valentina Cervi, Antonio Gerardi, Ruben Santiago Vecchi, Simone Gandolfo, Guido Roncalli, Olga Rui Marchiò', null, 'We are in the mid-60s, when a very young Mariele Ventre gave birth to the very first formation of the Piccolo Coro, originally composed of only eight children. In a few years the Piccolo Coro becomes a real school of choral singing. In its 56 years of history, there have been hundreds of small voices that have brought the music of Zecchino d’Oro and its repertoire around Italy and the world.', 'We are in the mid-60s, when a very young Mariele Ventre gave birth to the very first formation of the Piccolo Coro, originally composed of only eight children. In a few years the Piccolo Coro becomes a real school of choral singing. In its 56 years of history, there have been hundreds of small voices that have brought the music of Zecchino d’Oro and its repertoire around Italy and the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tk0I5s0elnD8SwpxHFXdiJET3iV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:644883'),
  ('1093790553439171086', 'I Really Hate My Job', 2007, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Oliver Parker, Tony Miller', 'Jennifer Higgie', 'Neve Campbell, Shirley Henderson, Alexandra Maria Lara, Anna Maxwell Martin, Oana Pellea, Danny Huston, Andrew Higgie, Nathaniel Parker', 'NR', 'While anticipating the arrival of a famous Hollywood star, five employees at a mediocre restaurant in London''s Soho must deal with rats, arguments and kitchen-based power struggles.', 'While anticipating the arrival of a famous Hollywood star, five employees at a mediocre restaurant in London''s Soho must deal with rats, arguments and kitchen-based power struggles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pIrO0UOWT4mrKvogAQQC6bQZjXs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18820'),
  ('1058631627048606455', 'I Really Play the Man', 1983, 'Comedy', 'Errikos Thalassinos', 'Errikos Thalassinos', 'Sotiris Moustakas, Katerina Yioulaki, Kostas Karagiorgis, Thaleia Papazoglou, Vagelis Protopapas, Teta Konstanta, Panagiotis Soupiadis', null, 'Zinon is a successful fashion designer but he has family problems. His wife, his children and his parents-in law are too abusive and uncaring. Everything changes when the police starts looking for a serial killer who is identical to Zinon.', 'Zinon is a successful fashion designer but he has family problems. His wife, his children and his parents-in law are too abusive and uncaring. Everything changes when the police starts looking for a serial killer who is identical to Zinon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tF67Xws680QXQ6icELRUCa8nAYg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:394092'),
  ('410194891981512480', 'I REC U', 2015, 'Comedy, Adventure, Fantasy, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Federico Sfascia, Barbara Fagotti', 'Federico Sfascia', 'Lorenzo Porzi, Dolphine Lundgren, Federica Bertolani, Massimiliano Torti, Terry Gilliam, Guglielmo Favilla', null, '19 years old Neve sees women out of focus - but he can see them properly when they are recorded on magnetic tape or film. This is why he wears a special pair of camera-glasses which, recording every single moment of his life, allow him to see everything correctly. His life actually becoming one of the movies he has been watching since he was a child. Until the day he meets the one and only woman he can see at naked eye.', '19 years old Neve sees women out of focus - but he can see them properly when they are recorded on magnetic tape or film. This is why he wears a special pair of camera-glasses which, recording every single moment of his life, allow him to see everything correctly. His life actually becoming one of the movies he has been watching since he was a child. Until the day he meets the one and only woman he can see at naked eye.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lu3LC07hOwgkjXUb9o4wzgm5iHI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:269602'),
  ('42768957677247581', 'I Remember', 2006, 'Drama', 'Edgard Navarro, Lula Oliveira, Macarra Vianna', 'Edgard Navarro', 'Lucas Valadares, Victor Porfírio, Dantlen Melo, Arly Arnaud, Fernando Neves, Valderez Freitas Teixeira, Analu Tavares, Wilson Mello', null, 'The memories of Guiga, from early childhood to young adulthood: his family, relatives, friends, fears, dreams and reality in a still provincial city of Salvador, Bahia, from the 50s to the 70s.', 'The memories of Guiga, from early childhood to young adulthood: his family, relatives, friends, fears, dreams and reality in a still provincial city of Salvador, Bahia, from the 50s to the 70s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8wYOA0e9pqWN0ftTfGoN7sOqJGG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108712'),
  ('132333786770521255', 'I Remember Mama', 1948, 'Family, Drama', 'George Stevens, Nicholas Musuraca, Hollingsworth Morse', 'DeWitt Bodeen', 'Irene Dunne, Barbara Bel Geddes, Oskar Homolka, Philip Dorn, Cedric Hardwicke, Edgar Bergen, Rudy Vallee, Barbara O''Neil', null, 'Norwegian immigrant Marta Hanson keeps a firm but loving hand on her household of four children, a devoted husband and a highly-educated lodger who reads great literature to the family every evening. Through financial crises, illnesses and the small triumphs of everyday life, Marta maintains her optimism and sense of humor, traits she passes on to her aspiring-author daughter, Katrin.', 'Norwegian immigrant Marta Hanson keeps a firm but loving hand on her household of four children, a devoted husband and a highly-educated lodger who reads great literature to the family every evening. Through financial crises, illnesses and the small triumphs of everyday life, Marta maintains her optimism and sense of humor, traits she passes on to her aspiring-author daughter, Katrin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oqiq3Zm6NeiVvd08gpUUu3WrihA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43442'),
  ('771765891701031210', 'I Remember the Crows', 2018, 'Documentary', 'Gustavo Vinagre, Cris Lyra', 'Gustavo Vinagre, Julia Katharine', 'Julia Katharine', null, 'Julia Katharine, a Japanese-Brazilian trans woman, opens her door to the filmmaker. Before day breaks, she evokes her relationship with her parents, a young love that never was, her sleepless nights and her passion for cinema.', 'Julia Katharine, a Japanese-Brazilian trans woman, opens her door to the filmmaker. Before day breaks, she evokes her relationship with her parents, a young love that never was, her sleepless nights and her passion for cinema.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1otKaVKRcFwVtr6w24GkEBV4OZF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:496049'),
  ('756195747597721633', 'I Remember You', 2017, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller, Drama', 'Óskar Thór Axelsson, Vigfús Þormar Gunnarsson, Hálfdán Theodórsson', 'Ottó Geir Borg, Óskar Thór Axelsson', 'Jóhannes Haukur Jóhannesson, Ágústa Eva Erlendsdóttir, Thorvaldur Kristjansson, Elma Stefanía Ágústsdóttir, Sara Dögg Ásgeirsdóttir, Jóhanna Vigdís Arnardóttir, Anna Gunndís Guðmundsdóttir, Þröstur Leó Gunnarsson', 'R', 'After an older lady hangs herself in a church, a new psychiatrist discovers she was obsessed with the disappearance of his eight-year-old son, who vanished three years earlier. Meanwhile, three city dwellers are restoring a house when they realize it is haunted.', 'After an older lady hangs herself in a church, a new psychiatrist discovers she was obsessed with the disappearance of his eight-year-old son, who vanished three years earlier. Meanwhile, three city dwellers are restoring a house when they realize it is haunted.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eJncIaKkn0in8QxZySGZuGU68RA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:423236'),
  ('703596818705882173', 'I Roteò e la magia dello specchio', 2004, 'Animation, Family, Music', 'Alessandro Belli', 'Giancarlo Di Giovine', 'Simone Crisari, Raffaella Castelli, Alessio De Filippis, Perla Liberatori, Paolo Vivio, Federica De Bortoli, Barbara Pitotti, Alessio De Filippis', null, 'The Roteò make people happy with their somersaults and acrobatics, until their abilities are taken away and they must find a way to get them back.', 'The Roteò make people happy with their somersaults and acrobatics, until their abilities are taken away and they must find a way to get them back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tFNMs7WDyF9HgQZBdARpfAsGwGj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:542652'),
  ('760964533560125496', 'I Saw Ben Barka Get Killed', 2005, 'History, Action, Thriller', 'Serge Le Péron, Saïd Smihi, Christophe Pollock', 'Serge Le Péron, Frédérique Moreau, Saïd Smihi', 'Charles Berling, Simon Abkarian, Jean-Pierre Léaud, Josiane Balasko, Eric Mitchell, Mathieu Amalric, Fabienne Babe, Azize Kabouche', null, 'January 1966. In a Paris apartment, police discovers the corpse of Georges Figon, the man who broke the scandal of the Ben Barka affair and undermined Gaullist power.', 'January 1966. In a Paris apartment, police discovers the corpse of Georges Figon, the man who broke the scandal of the Ben Barka affair and undermined Gaullist power.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o0xRtyhccoq2Vr8E9wq6CZRE8Av.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83238'),
  ('530716087419469585', 'I Saw Mommy Kissing Santa Claus', 2002, 'Comedy, Family, TV Movie', 'John Shepphird, Neal Brown', 'Randy Vampotic, Mike Sorrentino', 'Connie Sellecca, Corbin Bernsen, Cole Sprouse, Dylan Sprouse, Eric Jacobs, Sonny Carl Davis, Tony Larimer, David Millbern', 'NR', 'A boy witnesses his mother kissing what he believes to be is the real Santa Clause and retaliates with mischief.', 'A boy witnesses his mother kissing what he believes to be is the real Santa Clause and retaliates with mischief.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qYT1IElPInc5D4GhI6nqM7FgDTg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36427'),
  ('257530698405440549', 'I Saw the Devil', 2010, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Lee Mo-gae, Kim Jee-woon, Seok Min-u', 'Park Hoon-jung, Kim Jee-woon', 'Lee Byung-hun, Choi Min-sik, Jeon Kuk-hwan, Cheon Ho-jin, Oh San-ha, Kim Yoon-seo, Nam Bo-ra, Lee Jun-hyuk', 'R', 'Kyung-chul is a dangerous psychopath who kills for pleasure. Soo-hyeon, a top-secret agent, decides to track down the murderer himself. He promises himself that he will do everything in his power to take vengeance against the killer, even if it means that he must become a monster himself.', 'Kyung-chul is a dangerous psychopath who kills for pleasure. Soo-hyeon, a top-secret agent, decides to track down the murderer himself. He promises himself that he will do everything in his power to take vengeance against the killer, even if it means that he must become a monster himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zp5NrmYp80axIGiEiYPmm1CW6uH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49797'),
  ('990358207836375878', 'I Saw the Light', 2016, 'Music, Drama', 'Marc Abraham, Dante Spinotti', 'Marc Abraham', 'Tom Hiddleston, Elizabeth Olsen, Wayne Péré, David Krumholtz, Wrenn Schmidt, Bradley Whitford, Josh Pais, Cherry Jones', 'R', 'Singer and songwriter Hank Williams rises to fame in the 1940s, but alcohol abuse and infidelity take a toll on his career and marriage to fellow musician Audrey Mae Williams.', 'Singer and songwriter Hank Williams rises to fame in the 1940s, but alcohol abuse and infidelity take a toll on his career and marriage to fellow musician Audrey Mae Williams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A2AryRwBcPDhet25eyQCyupXl0D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:297806'),
  ('7881188082695472', 'I Saw the Sun', 2009, 'Drama', 'Mahsun Kırmızıgül, Soykut Turan', 'Mahsun Kırmızıgül', 'Mahsun Kırmızıgül, Demet Evgar, Murat Ünalmış, Altan Erkekli, Erol Demiröz, Cemal Toktas, Menderes Samancılar, Emre Kınay', null, 'In the southeast region of Turkey, the Kurdish family of Altun lives in a small mountainside village plagued by a 25-year war that makes their daily lives a hellish struggle. As the war intensifies, the family is forced to migrate west to the city of Istanbul.', 'In the southeast region of Turkey, the Kurdish family of Altun lives in a small mountainside village plagued by a 25-year war that makes their daily lives a hellish struggle. As the war intensifies, the family is forced to migrate west to the city of Istanbul.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/12f1B21UGEcXiwrY0Iiw2O9OlSk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27960'),
  ('894885570409188148', 'I Saw the TV Glow', 2024, 'Drama, Horror', 'Jane Schoenbrun, Eric K. Yue, Ella Thompson', 'Jane Schoenbrun', 'Justice Smith, Jack Haven, Ian Foreman, Helena Howard, Lindsey Jordan, Danielle Deadwyler, Fred Durst, Conner O''Malley', 'PG-13', 'Teenager Owen is just trying to make it through life in the suburbs when his classmate Maddy introduces him to a mysterious TV show — a vision of a supernatural world beneath their own. In the pale glow of the television, Owen’s view of reality begins to crack.', 'Teenager Owen is just trying to make it through life in the suburbs when his classmate Maddy introduces him to a mysterious TV show — a vision of a supernatural world beneath their own. In the pale glow of the television, Owen’s view of reality begins to crack.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hS4GYkYpN1rfl4GIxyc02sCyfAj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:858017'),
  ('1017981444947331337', 'I Saw What You Did', 1965, 'Thriller, Horror, Crime', 'William Castle, Joseph F. Biroc, Terry Morse Jr.', 'William P. McGivern', 'Andi Garrett, Sara Lane, Joan Crawford, John Ireland, Leif Erickson, Sharyl Locke, Patricia Breslin, John Archer', 'NR', 'Teenage friends Kit and Libby make prank phone calls for fun but then find themselves involved in a brutal double murder committed by one of their targets.', 'Teenage friends Kit and Libby make prank phone calls for fun but then find themselves involved in a brutal double murder committed by one of their targets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mliHs2Ii393vF0A3i73F6jAysdh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28295'),
  ('88802903053511722', 'I Saw What You Did', 1988, 'Thriller, TV Movie', 'Woody Omens, Fred Walton, Donald Hauer', null, 'Shawnee Smith, Tammy Lauren, Candace Cameron Bure, Robert Carradine, David Carradine, Rosanna Huffman, Jo Anderson, Bo Brundin', null, 'Two teens, Lisa and Kim, are playing games making prank calls on the phone. But when they call Adrian Lancer who has some mental problems, and say "I saw what you did", they ignite a human time bomb. Adrian has just killed someone and thinks they saw him do it. Now he is trying to find them.', 'Two teens, Lisa and Kim, are playing games making prank calls on the phone. But when they call Adrian Lancer who has some mental problems, and say "I saw what you did", they ignite a human time bomb. Adrian has just killed someone and thinks they saw him do it. Now he is trying to find them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3vujxScv7qKQ2Ka6DX2U3HFu5Wc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121518'),
  ('686507503079525484', 'I Screamed When I Knew What You Did in Friday the 13th of Last Summer Part 2 - I Saw the Hour of the Return of the Revenge in Halloween', 2011, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Felipe M. Guerra', 'Felipe M. Guerra', 'Eliseu Demari, Niandra Sartori, Rodrigo Guerra, Kiko Berwanger, Leandro Facchini, Oldina Cerutti do Monte, Kasha Lee, Fábio Prina Da Silva', null, 'Seven years after the massacre of the first film, the survivors Niandra and Eliseu still fear the return of Geison, the terrible psychopath who mutilated his friends on a Friday the 13th. New murders start happening in the small town of Carlos Barbosa, putting a new generation of victims as targets of the killer. But who is behind that "Scream" mask?', 'Seven years after the massacre of the first film, the survivors Niandra and Eliseu still fear the return of Geison, the terrible psychopath who mutilated his friends on a Friday the 13th. New murders start happening in the small town of Carlos Barbosa, putting a new generation of victims as targets of the killer. But who is behind that "Scream" mask?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vadsox7kS3dTzODeGdeWg3cbW9z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:471925'),
  ('199819513752950869', 'I See a Dark Stranger', 1946, 'Drama, Thriller, War', 'Frank Launder, Wilkie Cooper, Muir Mathieson', 'Sidney Gilliat, Wolfgang Wilhelm', 'Deborah Kerr, Trevor Howard, Raymond Huntley, Michael Howard, Liam Redmond, Brefni O''Rorke, James Harcourt, George Woodbridge', null, 'Proud Irishwoman Bridie Quilty journeys to Dublin while World War II rages across Europe. During her travels, she encounters J. Miller, who recruits her as a Nazi spy. She acquires the necessary information that leads to the breakout of a German spy who holds key information about the Allies'' newest offensive plans. However, the arrival of British officer David Baynes and his romancing of Bridie lead to unexpected consequences.', 'Proud Irishwoman Bridie Quilty journeys to Dublin while World War II rages across Europe. During her travels, she encounters J. Miller, who recruits her as a Nazi spy. She acquires the necessary information that leads to the breakout of a German spy who holds key information about the Allies'' newest offensive plans. However, the arrival of British officer David Baynes and his romancing of Bridie lead to unexpected consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2mgCNAsZyGXZ2CFrCylzfkfU6W4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28006'),
  ('356694967943489638', 'I See Naked', 1969, 'Comedy', 'Alessandro D''Eva, Erico Menczer, Dino Risi', 'Jaja Fiastri, Ruggero Maccari', 'Nino Manfredi, Sylva Koscina, Enrico Maria Salerno, Nerina Montagnani, Véronique Vendell, Guido Spadea, Daniela Giordano, Umberto D''Orsi', null, 'Seven sketches including the title sketch "I See Naked" in which a fashion editor begins to see naked women everywhere he goes.', 'Seven sketches including the title sketch "I See Naked" in which a fashion editor begins to see naked women everywhere he goes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rY7Wx2RDfurzZKSzsm8TQj8hvMr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68813'),
  ('932784145395863282', 'I See the Sun', 1965, 'Drama, Romance, War', 'Lana Goghoberidze', 'Nodar Dumbadze, Lana Goghoberidze', 'Gela Chichinadze, Leila Kipiani, Lia Eliava, Zurab Laperadze, Tengiz Archvadze, Gleb Strizhenov, Spartak Bagashvili, Ipolite Khvichia', null, 'In Georgia during WWII Zurikela, an orphan boy, meets Khatia, a blind girl, and vows to help her to see again.', 'In Georgia during WWII Zurikela, an orphan boy, meets Khatia, a blind girl, and vows to help her to see again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e2ArxZLePJnjBx2QeUbJB2KTu0f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:270373'),
  ('938903940522108408', 'I See You', 2006, 'Romance, Drama', 'Jay Oza, Vivek B Agrawal, Ashok Mehta', 'Suresh Nair', 'Arjun Rampal, Vipasha Agarwal, Boman Irani, Chunky Panday, Sonali Kulkarni, Sophiya Chaudhary, Kirron Kher, Michael Maloney', null, 'Dr Shivani Dutt living and working in a hospital in London, notices some of her colleagues delving in organ trafficking. Before she can expose them she is involved in an accident, leaving her on a life support machine.', 'Dr Shivani Dutt living and working in a hospital in London, notices some of her colleagues delving in organ trafficking. Before she can expose them she is involved in an accident, leaving her on a life support machine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z4ReGLUPzh4QiIsbX7K0A4PMOQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65956'),
  ('416935532000760749', 'I See You', 2019, 'Horror, Thriller, Mystery', 'Adam Randall, Lynn K. D''Angona, Philipp Blaubach', 'Devon Graye', 'Helen Hunt, Jon Tenney, Owen Teague, Judah Lewis, Libe Barer, Gregory Alan Williams, Erika Alexander, Sam Trammell', 'R', 'When a 12-year-old boy goes missing at a local park, a detective investigates the case to help the boy''s family find answers.', 'When a 12-year-old boy goes missing at a local park, a detective investigates the case to help the boy''s family find answers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2LwamrHAmxqEHsT9JViFJxT08Ek.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:524251'),
  ('441863920371736391', 'I Sell the Dead', 2008, 'Comedy, Drama, Horror', 'Devin Febbroriello, Richard Lopez, Beck Underwood', 'Glenn McQuaid', 'Dominic Monaghan, Larry Fessenden, Ron Perlman, Angus Scrimm, Brenda Cooney, Joel Marsh Garland, John Speredakos, Daniel Manche', 'NR', '18th century justice catches up with a pair of grave robbers. With only a few hours to go before his date with the guillotine, Arthur Blake tells his life story to Father Francis Duffy. Before long, Arthur spills the beans on how he got started in the grim corpse peddling business with seasoned ghoul Willie Grimes.', '18th century justice catches up with a pair of grave robbers. With only a few hours to go before his date with the guillotine, Arthur Blake tells his life story to Father Francis Duffy. Before long, Arthur spills the beans on how he got started in the grim corpse peddling business with seasoned ghoul Willie Grimes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1KjIGzUho6NCE7dDJP1QyRnMRRK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21910'),
  ('974858514512922307', 'I Served the King of England', 2007, 'Comedy', 'Jiří Menzel, Jaromír Šofr, Jiří Kačírek Jr.', 'Jiří Menzel', 'Ivan Barnev, Oldřich Kaiser, Julia Jentsch, Marián Labuda, Milan Lasica, Zuzana Fialová, Martin Huba, Josef Abrhám', 'R', 'Prague, Czechoslovakia, during the inter-war period. Jan Dítě, a young and clever waiter who wants to become a millionaire, comes to the conclusion that to achieve his ambitious goal he must be diligent, listen and observe as much as he can, be always discreet and use what he learns to his own advantage; but the turbulent tides of history will continually stand in his way.', 'Prague, Czechoslovakia, during the inter-war period. Jan Dítě, a young and clever waiter who wants to become a millionaire, comes to the conclusion that to achieve his ambitious goal he must be diligent, listen and observe as much as he can, be always discreet and use what he learns to his own advantage; but the turbulent tides of history will continually stand in his way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mwuabUjZMSg8ngHScjcKCmFO0jA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12555'),
  ('843116024001405475', 'I Shot Andy Warhol', 1996, 'Drama', 'Mary Harron, Ellen Kuras', 'Mary Harron, Daniel Minahan', 'Lili Taylor, Jared Harris, Martha Plimpton, Lothaire Bluteau, Anna Thomson, Peter Friedman, Tahnee Welch, Jamie Harrold', 'R', 'Based on the true story of Valerie Solanas who was a 1960s radical preaching hatred toward men in her "Scum" manifesto. She wrote a screenplay for a film that she wanted Andy Warhol to produce, but he continued to ignore her. So she shot him. This is Valerie''s story.', 'Based on the true story of Valerie Solanas who was a 1960s radical preaching hatred toward men in her "Scum" manifesto. She wrote a screenplay for a film that she wanted Andy Warhol to produce, but he continued to ignore her. So she shot him. This is Valerie''s story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eF4iTAjunicLQyc6AdF7JNwSBOC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26890'),
  ('833865174927632773', 'I Shot Jesse James', 1949, 'Western', 'Samuel Fuller, Ernest Miller, John Grubbs', 'Samuel Fuller, Homer Croy', 'Preston Foster, Barbara Britton, John Ireland, Reed Hadley, J. Edward Bromberg, Victor Kilian, Tom Tyler, Tommy Noonan', 'NR', 'Bob Ford murders his best friend Jesse James in order to obtain a pardon that will free him to marry his girlfriend Cynthy. The guilt-stricken Ford soon finds himself greeted with derision and open mockery throughout town. He travels to Colorado to try his hand at prospecting in hopes that marriage with Cynthy is still in the cards.', 'Bob Ford murders his best friend Jesse James in order to obtain a pardon that will free him to marry his girlfriend Cynthy. The guilt-stricken Ford soon finds himself greeted with derision and open mockery throughout town. He travels to Colorado to try his hand at prospecting in hopes that marriage with Cynthy is still in the cards.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8NiIpXBImEW1vacQS4LyinVGqa4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41058'),
  ('819666177961450138', 'I Smile Back', 2015, 'Drama', 'Adam Salky, Eric Lin', 'Amy Koppelman, Paige Dylan', 'Sarah Silverman, Josh Charles, Thomas Sadoski, Skylar Gaertner, Chris Sarandon, Terry Kinney, Mia Barron, Shayne Coleman', 'R', 'Laney is an attractive, intelligent suburban wife and devoted mother of two adorable children. She has the perfect husband who plays basketball with the kids in the driveway, a pristine house, and a shiny SUV for carting the children to their next activity. However, just beneath the façade lie depression and disillusionment that send her careening into a secret world of reckless compulsion. Only very real danger will force her to face the painful root of her destructiveness and its crumbling effect on those she loves.', 'Laney is an attractive, intelligent suburban wife and devoted mother of two adorable children. She has the perfect husband who plays basketball with the kids in the driveway, a pristine house, and a shiny SUV for carting the children to their next activity. However, just beneath the façade lie depression and disillusionment that send her careening into a secret world of reckless compulsion. Only very real danger will force her to face the painful root of her destructiveness and its crumbling effect on those she loves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8ufYyCJsID2ufc493ZkJocdkPCY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:307946'),
  ('473059220436667227', 'I Spit on Your Corpse, I Piss on Your Grave', 2001, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Eric Stanze', 'Eric Stanze', 'Emily Haack', null, 'Sandy has stumbled onto a lair of torture and humiliation. She was abducted and brought to this pit of pain as the next intended victim. But Sandy overthrows her captor and kills him. Does she release the other prisoners? Does she call the police? No. Her mind snaps and she assumes control over the prisoners, taking them as her own playtoys. Naked bodies writhe in ecstasy as blood runs down the walls in this chilling tale of madness and revenge', 'Sandy has stumbled onto a lair of torture and humiliation. She was abducted and brought to this pit of pain as the next intended victim. But Sandy overthrows her captor and kills him. Does she release the other prisoners? Does she call the police? No. Her mind snaps and she assumes control over the prisoners, taking them as her own playtoys. Naked bodies writhe in ecstasy as blood runs down the walls in this chilling tale of madness and revenge', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2cShwS6j2gJQF4TQ6NPPsf9VoM9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59936'),
  ('64935816739562864', 'I Spit on Your Grave', 1959, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Michel Gast, Marc Fossard', 'Boris Vian, Jacques Dopagne', 'Christian Marquand, Antonella Lualdi, Daniel Cauchy, Jean Sorel, Paul Guers, Fernand Ledoux, Renate Ewert, Jean Droze', null, 'Joe Grant, a light-skinned African American, heads to a small Southern town to investigate the lynching death of his brother. He draws the attention of a gorgeous heiress whom he learns may have been involved in the killing.', 'Joe Grant, a light-skinned African American, heads to a small Southern town to investigate the lynching death of his brother. He draws the attention of a gorgeous heiress whom he learns may have been involved in the killing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tVVLSBzRmwh8M4DHPdaKlDXGLMb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51862'),
  ('503644121056138602', 'I Spit on Your Grave', 2010, 'Thriller, Crime, Horror', 'Steven R. Monroe, Neil Lisk, Jeff Fuller', 'Meir Zarchi', 'Sarah Butler, Jeff Branson, Tracey Walter, Andrew Howard, Chad Lindberg, Rodney Eastman, Daniel Franzese, Mollie Milligan', 'R', 'A beautiful woman from the city, Jennifer Hills, rents an isolated cabin in the country to write her latest novel. Soon, a group of local lowlifes subject her to a nightmare of degradation, rape, and violence.', 'A beautiful woman from the city, Jennifer Hills, rents an isolated cabin in the country to write her latest novel. Soon, a group of local lowlifes subject her to a nightmare of degradation, rape, and violence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xDbNbIqsdA1D0W2gve2QRTp4z83.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43947'),
  ('251477394196013913', 'I Spit on Your Grave 2', 2013, 'Thriller, Horror, Crime', 'Steven R. Monroe, Damian Bromley, Galina Kyuchukova', 'Thomas Fenton, Neil Elman', 'Jemma Dallender, Joe Absolom, Aleksandar Aleksiev, Yavor Baharov, Mary Stockley, Michael Dixon, Valentine Pelka, Peter Silverleaf', 'R', 'Broke, and in desperate need to update her portfolio, New York City model Katie calls a number from a tear-off flyer offering free photos. But this innocent attempt quickly turns into an unthinkable kidnapping nightmare where she''s ripped away from everyone and everything she knows.', 'Broke, and in desperate need to update her portfolio, New York City model Katie calls a number from a tear-off flyer offering free photos. But this innocent attempt quickly turns into an unthinkable kidnapping nightmare where she''s ripped away from everyone and everything she knows.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wit1VRI9sAbCstuwm3KPgxfYYqo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:207768'),
  ('1084962292253654822', 'I Spit on Your Grave III: Vengeance Is Mine', 2015, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Richard J. Vialet, John J. Tierney, Buz Wallick', 'Daniel Gilboy', 'Sarah Butler, Jennifer Landon, Jeff Branson, Harley Jane Kozak, Karen Strassman, Alissa Juvan, Megan Raich, Doug McKeon', 'R', 'Jennifer Hills is still tormented by the brutal sexual assault she endured years ago. She’s changed identities and cities, reluctantly joining a support group where she begins to piece together a new life. But when her new friend’s murderer goes free and the tales of serial rapists haunt her, Jennifer will hunt down the men responsible and do what the system won’t – make them pay for their crimes in the most horrific ways imaginable. Only this time, no jury may be able to save her.', 'Jennifer Hills is still tormented by the brutal sexual assault she endured years ago. She’s changed identities and cities, reluctantly joining a support group where she begins to piece together a new life. But when her new friend’s murderer goes free and the tales of serial rapists haunt her, Jennifer will hunt down the men responsible and do what the system won’t – make them pay for their crimes in the most horrific ways imaginable. Only this time, no jury may be able to save her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qosIFCddpZjoMdsrkcQWB4UGm3o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:357096'),
  ('161680161672027343', 'I Spit on Your Grave: Déjà Vu', 2019, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Meir Zarchi, Pedja Radenkovic, Kenneth Brewster', 'Meir Zarchi', 'Camille Keaton, Jamie Bernadette, Maria Olsen, Jim Tavaré, Jonathan Peacy, Jeremy Ferdman, Holgie Forrester, Roy Allen III', 'NR', 'Following her rape, Jennifer Hills wrote a bestselling account of her ordeal and of the controversial trial in which she was accused of taking the law into her own hands and brutally killing her assailants. In the small town where the rape and revenge took place, the relatives of the rapists she killed are furious that the court declared her not guilty and resolve to take justice into their own hands.', 'Following her rape, Jennifer Hills wrote a bestselling account of her ordeal and of the controversial trial in which she was accused of taking the law into her own hands and brutally killing her assailants. In the small town where the rape and revenge took place, the relatives of the rapists she killed are furious that the court declared her not guilty and resolve to take justice into their own hands.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hrD8fU6tA1Pzh4ybxG4iN5TbVdU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:369196'),
  ('267765564722104880', 'I Spy', 2002, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Thriller', 'Betty Thomas, Oliver Wood, David Arnold', 'David Ronn, Marianne Wibberley, Cormac Wibberley', 'Eddie Murphy, Owen Wilson, Famke Janssen, Malcolm McDowell, Gary Cole, Phill Lewis, Viv Leacock, Keith Dallas', 'PG-13', 'When the Switchblade, the most sophisticated prototype stealth fighter created yet, is stolen from the U.S. government, one of the United States'' top spies, Alex Scott, is called to action. What he doesn''t expect is to get teamed up with a cocky civilian, World Class Boxing Champion Kelly Robinson, on a dangerous top secret espionage mission. Their assignment: using equal parts skill and humor, catch Arnold Gundars, one of the world''s most successful arms dealers.', 'When the Switchblade, the most sophisticated prototype stealth fighter created yet, is stolen from the U.S. government, one of the United States'' top spies, Alex Scott, is called to action. What he doesn''t expect is to get teamed up with a cocky civilian, World Class Boxing Champion Kelly Robinson, on a dangerous top secret espionage mission. Their assignment: using equal parts skill and humor, catch Arnold Gundars, one of the world''s most successful arms dealers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hmjCMtkeqxruMVocq7iwMx899xi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8427'),
  ('307105740092921847', 'I Stand Alone', 1999, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Gaspar Noé, Dominique Colin, Stephane Derderian', 'Gaspar Noé', 'Philippe Nahon, Blandine Lenoir, Frankie Pain, Martine Audrain, Zaven, Jean-François Rauger, Guillaume Nicloux, Olivier Doran', 'NR', 'After completing jail time for beating up a man who tried to seduce his mentally-handicapped teenage daughter, the Butcher wants to start life anew. He institutionalizes his daughter and moves to the Lille suburbs with his mistress, who promises him a new butcher shop. Learning that she lied, the Butcher returns to Paris to find his daughter.', 'After completing jail time for beating up a man who tried to seduce his mentally-handicapped teenage daughter, the Butcher wants to start life anew. He institutionalizes his daughter and moves to the Lille suburbs with his mistress, who promises him a new butcher shop. Learning that she lied, the Butcher returns to Paris to find his daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4kMB2AAcDQ5diRuh7NTxuS90bx7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1567'),
  ('782937100878614326', 'I Start Counting', 1970, 'Thriller, Drama', 'David Greene, Alex Thomson, Jack Causey', 'Richard Harris', 'Jenny Agutter, Bryan Marshall, Clare Sutcliffe, Simon Ward, Gregory Phillips, Lana Morris, Billy Russell, Madge Ryan', null, 'An English schoolgirl suspects the foster brother she worships is a serial killer.', 'An English schoolgirl suspects the foster brother she worships is a serial killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aMlhnvMc3wua4eZlAYjkP6TRFfm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96243'),
  ('230503047784083222', 'I Stay with You', 2014, 'Drama, Comedy, Horror', 'Renata Gutiérrez, Artemio Narro, Rosaura Bichir', 'Artemio Narro', 'Anajosé Aldrete, Beatriz Arjona, Ximena Rubio, Flor Eduarda Gurrola, Iván Arana, José María de Tavira, Diego Luna, Amaury Jair', 'PG-13', 'Natalia and her friends go out one night out and end up subjecting a man to their sexual will. An essay on violence that revolves around three themes: power structures, machismo and the media.', 'Natalia and her friends go out one night out and end up subjecting a man to their sexual will. An essay on violence that revolves around three themes: power structures, machismo and the media.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1vgYHBv9h003mubMyHbkAkbe4iy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:311078'),
  ('1147342113185214565', 'I Still Believe', 2020, 'Music, Drama, Romance', 'Andrew Erwin, Jon Erwin, Kristopher S. Kimlin', 'Jon Erwin, Jon Gunn, Jeremy Camp', 'KJ Apa, Britt Robertson, Nathan Parsons, Gary Sinise, Shania Twain, Reuben Dodd, Nicolas Bechtel, Melissa Roxburgh', 'PG', 'The true-life story of Christian music star Jeremy Camp and his journey of love and loss that looks to prove there is always hope.', 'The true-life story of Christian music star Jeremy Camp and his journey of love and loss that looks to prove there is always hope.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dqA2FCzz4OMmXLitKopzf476RVB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:585244'),
  ('724611327126965922', 'I Still Dream of Jeannie', 1991, 'Comedy', 'Joseph L. Scanlan', 'April Kelly, Sidney Sheldon', 'Barbara Eden, Bill Daily, Al Waxman, Peter Breck, Ken Kercheval, Garry Chalk, Christopher Bolton', 'G', 'Col. Nelson is on a long-term, top-secret space mission. Jeannie cannot bring him home (temporarily) to hear their son''s important academic presentation without knowing exactly where he is in the first place. The general in charge of the mission won''t reveal anything. Things are further complicated when Jeannie''s sister (Jeannie II) reminds Sham-Ir, the head of the genies, that a genie on Earth cannot go more than 3 months without an earthly master. (Col. Nelson is no longer Earthly, being in space.) Sham-Ir give Jeannie I a fortnight (14 days) to either find Col. Nelson or get a new master, a single male. (Col. Healy can''t help, since he''s now married.)', 'Col. Nelson is on a long-term, top-secret space mission. Jeannie cannot bring him home (temporarily) to hear their son''s important academic presentation without knowing exactly where he is in the first place. The general in charge of the mission won''t reveal anything. Things are further complicated when Jeannie''s sister (Jeannie II) reminds Sham-Ir, the head of the genies, that a genie on Earth cannot go more than 3 months without an earthly master. (Col. Nelson is no longer Earthly, being in space.) Sham-Ir give Jeannie I a fortnight (14 days) to either find Col. Nelson or get a new master, a single male. (Col. Healy can''t help, since he''s now married.)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2wbH4ce6Q9YD5k0NVKTUtDHD9Ex.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:191435'),
  ('221049671302222562', 'I Still Know What You Did Last Summer', 1998, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Vernon Layton, Danny Cannon, Enrique Echeverría', 'Trey Callaway', 'Freddie Prinze Jr., Jennifer Love Hewitt, Matthew Settle, Brandy Norwood, Mekhi Phifer, Muse Watson, Jennifer Esposito, Bill Cobbs', 'R', 'Ever since killing the Fisherman one year ago, Julie James is still haunted by images of him after her. When her best friend Karla wins free tickets to the Bahamas, Julie finds this a perfect opportunity to finally relax. But someone is waiting for her. Someone who she thought was dead. Someone who is out again for revenge.', 'Ever since killing the Fisherman one year ago, Julie James is still haunted by images of him after her. When her best friend Karla wins free tickets to the Bahamas, Julie finds this a perfect opportunity to finally relax. But someone is waiting for her. Someone who she thought was dead. Someone who is out again for revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eg3d6hvTaOmW3lNErFfutBmWmAR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3600'),
  ('343227429417950315', 'I Still See You', 2018, 'Thriller, Fantasy, Mystery', 'Reed Makayev, Scott Speer, Simon Dennis', 'Jason Fuchs', 'Bella Thorne, Richard Harmon, Dermot Mulroney, Amy Price-Francis, Shaun Benson, Louis Herthum, Thomas Elms, Sara Thompson', 'PG-13', 'Ten years after an apocalyptic event left the world haunted by ghosts, Roni receives a threatening message from beyond the grave. Joining forces with a mysterious classmate, Kirk, Roni descends into a shadow world that blurs the bounds of the living and the dead-and begins a desperate race against time to stop a cunning killer.', 'Ten years after an apocalyptic event left the world haunted by ghosts, Roni receives a threatening message from beyond the grave. Joining forces with a mysterious classmate, Kirk, Roni descends into a shadow world that blurs the bounds of the living and the dead-and begins a desperate race against time to stop a cunning killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9fqzZs922V8OmwgO11Eqclof2mQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:448095'),
  ('165488610622365845', 'I Swear', 2025, 'Drama', 'Samuel Theis, Julie Allione, Jonathan Ricquebourg', 'Samuel Theis', 'Julien Ernwein, Marie Pires-Masala, Marina Foïs, Louise Bourgoin, Souleymane Cissé, Sophie Guillemin, Hedi Zada, Micha Lescot', null, 'Thirtysomething Marco goes through life without a compass. Employed at a Forbach recycling center, he finds comfort in alcohol. And a little with Madeleine, a mature woman with whom he secretly has a relationship. One day, he is drawn by lot to be a juror of Assisi. Incapable of discernment for himself, Marco will have to decide the life of a young arsonist accused of manslaughter.', 'Thirtysomething Marco goes through life without a compass. Employed at a Forbach recycling center, he finds comfort in alcohol. And a little with Madeleine, a mature woman with whom he secretly has a relationship. One day, he is drawn by lot to be a juror of Assisi. Incapable of discernment for himself, Marco will have to decide the life of a young arsonist accused of manslaughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iTtk01mXyupLSzBnkIxbhIyc3nO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1044736'),
  ('1021532428529664706', 'I Take These Truths', 1995, null, 'Stan Brakhage', null, null, null, 'This film is entirely hand-painted and is composed of such an evolution of variably colored shapes that their inter-action with each other should constitute a purely visual "self-evident" (as prompted by the title). Each frame is printed twice, so that its effective speed (at 24fps) is 12 frames per second. A variety of organic and crystalline painted shapes (painted on clear leader, thus as if brilliantly back-lit in a blazing space of light) are interspersed with very dark (black leader) passages as if etched with scratches of light and stained radiances. There are also some straight, multi-colored, bars which move, diagonally from one side of the film frame to the other. All these "themes" finally give way to clear thick gelatinous effects which resolve themselves in a long passage of hieroglyphic white shapes in a black field, ending on a brief spate of variable coloration.', 'This film is entirely hand-painted and is composed of such an evolution of variably colored shapes that their inter-action with each other should constitute a purely visual "self-evident" (as prompted by the title). Each frame is printed twice, so that its effective speed (at 24fps) is 12 frames per second. A variety of organic and crystalline painted shapes (painted on clear leader, thus as if brilliantly back-lit in a blazing space of light) are interspersed with very dark (black leader) passages as if etched with scratches of light and stained radiances. There are also some straight, multi-colored, bars which move, diagonally from one side of the film frame to the other. All these "themes" finally give way to clear thick gelatinous effects which resolve themselves in a long passage of hieroglyphic white shapes in a black field, ending on a brief spate of variable coloration.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/40duCxitoApeMBupnhYAoZjewHO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:164606'),
  ('539030562515778841', 'I Think I Do', 1997, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Brian Sloan, Milton Kam', 'Brian Sloan', 'Alexis Arquette, Christian Maelen, Luna Lauren Vélez, Jamie Harrold, Guillermo Díaz, Maddie Corman, Marianne Hagan, Tuc Watkins', 'NR', 'The marriage of mutual friends reunites former college roommates Bob and Brendan, who tried to ignore the sexual tension that always flowed between them. Brendan finally comes out to Bob at the reception, but is it a case of too little, too late?', 'The marriage of mutual friends reunites former college roommates Bob and Brendan, who tried to ignore the sexual tension that always flowed between them. Brendan finally comes out to Bob at the reception, but is it a case of too little, too late?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/59LvJlLf2wIhi9mWOpCGhqVLopc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19797'),
  ('987640625762416071', 'I Think I Love My Wife', 2007, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Chris Rock, William Rexer', 'Éric Rohmer', 'Chris Rock, Gina Torres, Kerry Washington, Steve Buscemi, Edward Herrmann, Vanessa Lee Chester, Welker White, Darius McCrary', 'R', 'Richard Cooper is a married man and father of two who is just plain bored with married life. Not getting any sex from his wife, he resorts to ogling random women on the street to the point that he takes lunch late to look at them. When old crush Nikki Tru visits his office to get a reference letter, she becomes obsessed with Cooper and they begin a complicated relationship.', 'Richard Cooper is a married man and father of two who is just plain bored with married life. Not getting any sex from his wife, he resorts to ogling random women on the street to the point that he takes lunch late to look at them. When old crush Nikki Tru visits his office to get a reference letter, she becomes obsessed with Cooper and they begin a complicated relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qEPLktOmURG7dq9MFni6B5D9sik.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14434'),
  ('870489372831332363', 'I Think We''re Alone Now', 2008, 'Documentary', 'Sean Donnelly', 'Sean Donnelly', 'Jeff Turner, Kelly McCormick, Tiffany', 'R', 'Every celebrity deals with his or her share of obsessed fans. "I Think We''re Alone Now" is a documentary that focuses on two individuals, Jeff and Kelly, who claim to be in love with the 80''s pop singer Tiffany. Jeff Turner, a 50-year-old man from Santa Cruz, California has attended Tiffany concerts since 1988. Diagnosed with Asperger''s syndrome, he never had a girlfriend. Jeff spends his days hanging out on the streets of Santa Cruz, striking up conversations with anyone who has a moment to spare. Kelly McCormick is a 38-year-old intersex woman from Denver, Colorado, who claims to have been friends with Tiffany as a teenager. She credits Tiffany as the shining star who has motivated her to do everything in her life. Both Jeff and Kelly have been labeled stalkers by the media and other Tiffany fans. This film takes you inside the lonely lives these two characters, revealing the source of their clinging obsessions...', 'Every celebrity deals with his or her share of obsessed fans. "I Think We''re Alone Now" is a documentary that focuses on two individuals, Jeff and Kelly, who claim to be in love with the 80''s pop singer Tiffany. Jeff Turner, a 50-year-old man from Santa Cruz, California has attended Tiffany concerts since 1988. Diagnosed with Asperger''s syndrome, he never had a girlfriend. Jeff spends his days hanging out on the streets of Santa Cruz, striking up conversations with anyone who has a moment to spare. Kelly McCormick is a 38-year-old intersex woman from Denver, Colorado, who claims to have been friends with Tiffany as a teenager. She credits Tiffany as the shining star who has motivated her to do everything in her life. Both Jeff and Kelly have been labeled stalkers by the media and other Tiffany fans. This film takes you inside the lonely lives these two characters, revealing the source of their clinging obsessions...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8qBY7PzmUQfKa4KCYiDAVsKqheM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56967'),
  ('186278939805629205', 'I Think We''re Alone Now', 2018, 'Drama, Science Fiction, Mystery', 'Jake Brown, Matt McLootta, Reed Morano', 'Mike Makowsky', 'Peter Dinklage, Elle Fanning, Paul Giamatti, Charlotte Gainsbourg, Elaine Apruzzese', 'R', 'After a catastrophe destroys most of humanity, recluse Del lives in his small, empty town, content with the utopia he has methodically created for himself, until an interloper, young Grace, disrupts his solitude.', 'After a catastrophe destroys most of humanity, recluse Del lives in his small, empty town, content with the utopia he has methodically created for himself, until an interloper, young Grace, disrupts his solitude.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9sNsmC8FKgr4hTfnGCS49WY20k4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:451877'),
  ('954720867665508682', 'I Thought It Was a Party', 2013, 'Drama', 'Bruno Roberti, Victoria Galardi, Julián Ledesma', 'Victoria Galardi', 'Elena Anaya, Valeria Bertuccelli, Fernán Mirás, Esteban Lamothe, Esteban Bigliardi', null, 'Ana is a woman who has a love affair with her best friend''s ex-husband, in a film about love, friendship, loneliness, fear, guilt, and the world of women.', 'Ana is a woman who has a love affair with her best friend''s ex-husband, in a film about love, friendship, loneliness, fear, guilt, and the world of women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hCMNuE9W3WX8k9MAWWdjIEIkJyI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:209420'),
  ('297190653893780924', 'I Thought It Was Love', 1991, 'Comedy', 'Massimo Troisi, Miro Viglianesi, Camillo Bazzoni', 'Anna Pavignano, Massimo Troisi', 'Massimo Troisi, Francesca Neri, Marco Messeri, Angelo Orlando, Natalia Bizzi, Vittorio Viviani, Alessia Salustri, Antonio Sigillo', null, 'Tommaso goes incredible lengths to win back the love of his former girlfriend Cecilia, but sometimes things change in the most unexpected way.', 'Tommaso goes incredible lengths to win back the love of his former girlfriend Cecilia, but sometimes things change in the most unexpected way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/klLPGlWdJWqAeXJhfRyAJOYzeEd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56975'),
  ('42384304225964957', 'I Told You So', 2024, 'Drama', 'Ginevra Elkann, Vladan Radović', 'Chiara Barzini, Ilaria Bernardini, Ginevra Elkann', 'Valeria Bruni Tedeschi, Danny Huston, Valeria Golino, Riccardo Scamarcio, Alba Rohrwacher, Greta Scacchi, Sofia Panizzi, Gianmarco Saurino', null, 'In Rome, during a January weekend a sudden heatwave arrives. The sun is initially pleasant, but the heat quickly escalates to a frightening degree, resulting in people and animals losing self-control.', 'In Rome, during a January weekend a sudden heatwave arrives. The sun is initially pleasant, but the heat quickly escalates to a frightening degree, resulting in people and animals losing self-control.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eenQyFdrKc9xxX3yc9eSg1uPvsk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:976854'),
  ('739037787777113361', 'I Trapped the Devil', 2019, 'Horror, Mystery, Drama', 'Josh Lobo, Bryce Holden', 'Josh Lobo', 'Scott Poythress, AJ Bowen, Susan Burke, Jocelin Donahue, Chris Sullivan, Rowan Russell, John Marrott, Aaron Larsen', null, 'A man descends into paranoia after trapping what he believes to be the devil in his basement, but things take a dark turn when his family unexpectedly arrive for Christmas.', 'A man descends into paranoia after trapping what he believes to be the devil in his basement, but things take a dark turn when his family unexpectedly arrive for Christmas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/95ioOrJWlUTKskXpGLDlOpahu8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:537476'),
  ('456674928268263629', 'I Travel Because I Have to, I Come Back Because I Love You', 2010, 'Drama', 'Karim Aïnouz, Marcelo Gomes', 'Karim Aïnouz, Marcelo Gomes', 'Irandhir Santos', null, 'José Renato, a 35-year-old geologist, is sent out on a solitary expedition to the hinterlands of northeastern Brazil. The purpose of the trip is to assess possible routes for a canal that will connect the area with the only major river in the region. As the field trip progresses, it becomes clear that Renato shares with those places the same emptiness, sense of abandonment and isolation.', 'José Renato, a 35-year-old geologist, is sent out on a solitary expedition to the hinterlands of northeastern Brazil. The purpose of the trip is to assess possible routes for a canal that will connect the area with the only major river in the region. As the field trip progresses, it becomes clear that Renato shares with those places the same emptiness, sense of abandonment and isolation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kNw8FmmZ2scmlA1uY6SeudnFpLe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87199'),
  ('164635169797341924', 'I Used to Be Famous', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama, Music', 'Eddie Sternberg, Angus Hudson, Alexander Holt', 'Eddie Sternberg, Zak Klein', 'Ed Skrein, Eleanor Matsuura, Eoin Macken, Kurt Egyiawan, Neil Stuke, Racheal Ofori, Leo Long, Lorraine Ashbourne', 'R', 'A former boy band star unexpectedly gets a second shot at success when he forms a bond with a gifted young drummer.', 'A former boy band star unexpectedly gets a second shot at success when he forms a bond with a gifted young drummer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hJMnsf6vzgoNx0bv3uh3PTCjmks.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1013228'),
  ('177825335312631621', 'I Used to Be Funny', 2024, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Ally Pankiw, Nina Djacic, Emma Jean Sutherland', 'Ally Pankiw', 'Rachel Sennott, Olga Petsa, Jason Jones, Sabrina Jalees, Caleb Hearon, Ennis Esmer, Dani Kind, Hoodo Hersi', 'NR', 'Sam, an aspiring stand-up comedian and au pair struggling with PTSD, weighs whether to join the search for Brooke, a missing teenage girl she used to nanny. The story unfolds between the present—where Sam tries to recover from her trauma and return to the stage—and the past, where memories of Brooke make it increasingly difficult to ignore her sudden disappearance.', 'Sam, an aspiring stand-up comedian and au pair struggling with PTSD, weighs whether to join the search for Brooke, a missing teenage girl she used to nanny. The story unfolds between the present—where Sam tries to recover from her trauma and return to the stage—and the past, where memories of Brooke make it increasingly difficult to ignore her sudden disappearance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jcWC3RVZKplXiydBELoCOoF6NJ8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:918287'),
  ('226330628199768827', 'I Used to Go Here', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Kris Rey, Nate Hurtsellers, Morgan Jon Fox', 'Kris Rey', 'Gillian Jacobs, Josh Wiggins, Jemaine Clement, Hannah Marks, Forrest Goodluck, Jorma Taccone, Zoë Chao, Kate Micucci', null, 'Following the lackluster launch of her debut novel, 35-year-old writer Kate Conklin receives an invitation from her former professor and old crush to speak at her alma mater. With her book tour canceled and her ego deflated, Kate decides to take the trip, wondering if it might give her the morale boost she sorely needs. Instead, she falls into a comical regression—from misadventures with eccentric twenty-year-olds, to feelings of jealousy toward her former professor’s new favorite student. Striking the balance between bittersweet and hilarious, Kate takes a journey through her past to reevaluate her future.', 'Following the lackluster launch of her debut novel, 35-year-old writer Kate Conklin receives an invitation from her former professor and old crush to speak at her alma mater. With her book tour canceled and her ego deflated, Kate decides to take the trip, wondering if it might give her the morale boost she sorely needs. Instead, she falls into a comical regression—from misadventures with eccentric twenty-year-olds, to feelings of jealousy toward her former professor’s new favorite student. Striking the balance between bittersweet and hilarious, Kate takes a journey through her past to reevaluate her future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7cN1YBcuBKrxdtxUDig29cXKfKR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:664301'),
  ('138117026929653918', 'I viaggiatori della sera', 1979, 'Science Fiction, Drama', 'Ugo Tognazzi, Ennio Guarnieri, Ricky Tognazzi', 'Alessandro Parenzo, Ugo Tognazzi', 'Ugo Tognazzi, Ornella Vanoni, Roberta Paladini, Pietro Brambilla, José Luis López Vázquez, William Berger, Manuel de Blas, Deddi Savagnone', null, 'A famous radio announcer is being retired at the top of his career and in full professional maturity. But for him and his wife life is not over now, he has more plans.', 'A famous radio announcer is being retired at the top of his career and in full professional maturity. But for him and his wife life is not over now, he has more plans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9WdeBhoeq0iqdmVUuuYVZ9PqaHQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:230821'),
  ('488873604904335725', 'I Vicerè', 2007, 'Drama, History, Romance', 'Franco Nardella, Elvis Frasca, Giulio La Monica', 'Renato Minore, Tullia Giardina', 'Alessandro Preziosi, Lando Buzzanca, Cristiana Capotondi, Guido Caprino, Assumpta Serna, Sebastiano Lo Monaco, Giselda Volodi, Paolo Calabresi', null, 'In late 19th-century Sicily, the noble Uzeda family—whose lineage dates back to the ancient viceroys that ruled those lands—fights to preserve its waning power in the face of the newly unified Italian regime.', 'In late 19th-century Sicily, the noble Uzeda family—whose lineage dates back to the ancient viceroys that ruled those lands—fights to preserve its waning power in the face of the newly unified Italian regime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hsmgLhNyx395mWNvROcxhPzHF51.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16545'),
  ('558791213528822194', 'I Wake Up Screaming', 1941, 'Mystery, Crime', 'H. Bruce Humberstone, Edward Cronjager, Ad Schaumer', 'Dwight Taylor', 'Betty Grable, Victor Mature, Carole Landis, Laird Cregar, William Gargan, Alan Mowbray, Allyn Joslyn, Elisha Cook Jr.', null, 'A young promoter is accused of the murder of Vicky Lynn, a young actress he "discovered" as a waitress while out with ex-actor Robin Ray and gossip columnist Larry Evans.', 'A young promoter is accused of the murder of Vicky Lynn, a young actress he "discovered" as a waitress while out with ex-actor Robin Ray and gossip columnist Larry Evans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oeGJPrFxppG4LYEGRMBTkAEU2yP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21600'),
  ('716773441417184511', 'I Walk Alone', 1947, 'Drama, Crime', 'Leo Tover, Byron Haskin, Richard McWhorter', 'Charles Schnee', 'Burt Lancaster, Lizabeth Scott, Kirk Douglas, Wendell Corey, Kristine Miller, George Rigaud, Marc Lawrence, Mike Mazurki', 'NR', 'Bootleggers on the lam Frankie and Noll split up to evade capture by the police. Frankie is caught and jailed, but Noll manages to escape and open a posh New York City nightclub. 14 years later, Frankie is released from the clink and visits Noll with the intention of collecting his half of the nightclub''s profits. But Noll, who has no intention of being so equitable, uses his ex-girlfriend Kay to divert Frankie from his intended goal.', 'Bootleggers on the lam Frankie and Noll split up to evade capture by the police. Frankie is caught and jailed, but Noll manages to escape and open a posh New York City nightclub. 14 years later, Frankie is released from the clink and visits Noll with the intention of collecting his half of the nightclub''s profits. But Noll, who has no intention of being so equitable, uses his ex-girlfriend Kay to divert Frankie from his intended goal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ovAn6MX1Oxs5GUBa3byvKCCYlea.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27035'),
  ('1023449394092245354', 'I Walk the Line', 1970, 'Drama', 'John Frankenheimer, David M. Walsh, Philip L. Parslow', 'Alvin Sargent', 'Gregory Peck, Tuesday Weld, Estelle Parsons, Ralph Meeker, Charles Durning, Jeff Dalton, Freddie McCloud, Jane Rose', 'PG-13', 'Henry Tawes, a middle-aged sheriff in a rural Tennessee town, is usually the first man to criticize others for their bad behavior. Miserable in his marriage, Henry falls in love with teenage seductress Alma, who is the daughter of local criminal and moonshiner Carl McCain. Henry''s moral character comes further into question when he is tempted to conceal Carl''s crimes in order to prolong his relationship with Alma.', 'Henry Tawes, a middle-aged sheriff in a rural Tennessee town, is usually the first man to criticize others for their bad behavior. Miserable in his marriage, Henry falls in love with teenage seductress Alma, who is the daughter of local criminal and moonshiner Carl McCain. Henry''s moral character comes further into question when he is tempted to conceal Carl''s crimes in order to prolong his relationship with Alma.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/slwnnOlNcCpgUEQHZXx6FYDYkRJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72881'),
  ('19457847285199074', 'I Walked with a Zombie', 1943, 'Mystery, Horror, Drama', 'Jacques Tourneur, J. Roy Hunt, William Dorfman', 'Curt Siodmak, Ardel Wray', 'James Ellison, Frances Dee, Tom Conway, Edith Barrett, James Bell, Christine Gordon, Theresa Harris, Sir Lancelot', 'NR', 'A nurse in the Caribbean turns to voodoo in hopes of curing her patient, a mindless woman whose husband she''s fallen in love with.', 'A nurse in the Caribbean turns to voodoo in hopes of curing her patient, a mindless woman whose husband she''s fallen in love with.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uoyBR8XNxPQRojujtczfG1qJezY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27130'),
  ('951197486401720114', 'I Wanna Be a Sailor', 1937, 'Comedy, Family, Animation', 'Tex Avery', null, 'Elvia Allman, Mel Blanc, Billy Bletcher, Robert Winkler, Bernice Hansen', null, 'Momma parrot is teaching her young-uns to say "Polly want a cracker" but little Peter doesn''t want a cracker, he wants to be a sailor like dad. Mom tells him what a no-account his dad really was, setting sail for Hawaii ("no, Maw, it was Catalina") right after the kids were born. Peter is unswayed, and takes off. He turns a barrel into a boat, and crews it with an annoyingly talkative duckling, then sets sail on a lake. They get caught in a thunderstorm (the duck loves it). Peter calls for help and momma comes running, but the duck has already saved him. But he still wants to be a sailor.', 'Momma parrot is teaching her young-uns to say "Polly want a cracker" but little Peter doesn''t want a cracker, he wants to be a sailor like dad. Mom tells him what a no-account his dad really was, setting sail for Hawaii ("no, Maw, it was Catalina") right after the kids were born. Peter is unswayed, and takes off. He turns a barrel into a boat, and crews it with an annoyingly talkative duckling, then sets sail on a lake. They get caught in a thunderstorm (the duck loves it). Peter calls for help and momma comes running, but the duck has already saved him. But he still wants to be a sailor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w94NsplX8tPJaxT8BMkkMrO3QjO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:152235'),
  ('834679324463220597', 'I Wanna Hold Your Hand', 1978, 'Comedy, Music', 'Robert Zemeckis, Donald M. Morgan', 'Bob Gale, Robert Zemeckis', 'Nancy Allen, Bobby Di Cicco, Marc McClure, Susan Kendall Newman, Theresa Saldana, Wendie Jo Sperber, Eddie Deezen, Christian Juttner', 'PG', 'If they missed Beatles'' first appearance in the U.S.A. they would hate themselves for the rest of their lives! So four young girls from New Jersey set off even though they don''t have tickets for the show! The journey is full of surprises and misfortunes but the young ladies are determined to reach their idols.', 'If they missed Beatles'' first appearance in the U.S.A. they would hate themselves for the rest of their lives! So four young girls from New Jersey set off even though they don''t have tickets for the show! The journey is full of surprises and misfortunes but the young ladies are determined to reach their idols.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/42FrsGqERVyIUNtjGFTBji2L2Lp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55457'),
  ('1007043574488600916', 'I Wanna Play House', 1936, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Friz Freleng', null, 'Bernice Hansen', null, 'Two bear cubs, one black, one brown, frolic near their sleeping father.', 'Two bear cubs, one black, one brown, frolic near their sleeping father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zWYr0qhxuRDSTuPkheLIP6gMIRW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:202039'),
  ('669704446394370272', 'I Want a Dog for Christmas, Charlie Brown', 2003, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, TV Movie', 'Larry Leichliter, Bill Melendez, Andy Kim', 'Charles M. Schulz', 'Jimmy Bennett, Adam Taylor Gordon, Ashley Rose Orr, Corey Padnos, Hannah Leigh, Nick Price, Jake Miner, Kaitlyn Maggio', 'G', 'All Rerun wants from Santa is a dog, but his mother won''t let him have one. Spending time with Snoopy provides the perfect pick-me-up. But when Snoopy gets too busy to play with Rerun, they call in a substitute—Snoopy''s brother Spike.', 'All Rerun wants from Santa is a dog, but his mother won''t let him have one. Spending time with Snoopy provides the perfect pick-me-up. But when Snoopy gets too busy to play with Rerun, they call in a substitute—Snoopy''s brother Spike.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iwbvzY1jwcxbJOoP17bAgOTBr30.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24251'),
  ('808028017211367791', 'I Want Candy', 2007, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Stephen Surjik, Crighton Bone', 'Phil Hughes, Jamie Minoprio, Jonathan Stern', 'Tom Riley, Tom Burke, Carmen Electra, Eddie Marsan, Michelle Ryan, Mackenzie Crook, Felicity Montagu, Philip Jackson', 'R', 'Two hopeful lads from Leatherhead trying to break into the movies stumble upon the opportunity of a lifetime. Frustrated by their arty film teacher, wannabe producer Joe and his talented but neurotic director friend Baggy head to London to sell what they know is a script made of gold.', 'Two hopeful lads from Leatherhead trying to break into the movies stumble upon the opportunity of a lifetime. Frustrated by their arty film teacher, wannabe producer Joe and his talented but neurotic director friend Baggy head to London to sell what they know is a script made of gold.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vRdZtvhy6tAhQx8DASW5BNYBoFy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13687'),
