  ('232243291201655065', 'I Want Someone to Eat Cheese With', 2006, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Jeff Garlin, Peter Biagi', 'Jeff Garlin', 'Jeff Garlin, Sarah Silverman, Bonnie Hunt, Dan Castellaneta, David Pasquesi, Amy Sedaris, Paul Mazursky, Richard Kind', null, 'Life has its downs for James, living with his mom in Chicago at 39, an aging performer at Second City, eating and weighing too much. A woman he''s been dating drops him, as does his agent, her brother. James turns down roles in local TV, roles that make him sad. Someone''s remaking his favorite movie, "Marty," a role he''d love, but he doesn''t even get an audition.', 'Life has its downs for James, living with his mom in Chicago at 39, an aging performer at Second City, eating and weighing too much. A woman he''s been dating drops him, as does his agent, her brother. James turns down roles in local TV, roles that make him sad. Someone''s remaking his favorite movie, "Marty," a role he''d love, but he doesn''t even get an audition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kLlygFX66qkJs0rTL2M5G6b6HhJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13066'),
  ('629729811314898543', 'I Want to Be a Soldier', 2010, 'Drama', 'Juan Carlos Lausín, Christian Molina', 'Cuca Canals', 'Fergus Riordan, Cameron Antrobus, Andrew Tarbet, Josephine Barnes, Luke Denton, Ben Temple, Jo Kelly, Thomas Riordan', null, '“I Want To Be A Soldier” is the story of Alex, an average 8 year old child who develops a morbid fascination for images portraying violence. He starts to have communication problems with his parents and other children at school and becomes withdrawn, inventing two imaginary friends.', '“I Want To Be A Soldier” is the story of Alex, an average 8 year old child who develops a morbid fascination for images portraying violence. He starts to have communication problems with his parents and other children at school and becomes withdrawn, inventing two imaginary friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xaSQScSJLpDeEVKRpd3yZRjA9mH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72875'),
  ('190527659429212794', 'I Want to Be Like the Main Character in a Novel', 2020, 'Drama', 'Mountain Baekdu', null, 'Bo Ri, Baek Se-ri, Sin Yeong-woong', null, 'While writing, I don''t think so well, so I am in trouble while talking to myself. Then, the girlfriend Lisa came to the hero''s house to play. A girlfriend who asks her boyfriend who is welcoming to see if she is writing well these days. To a boyfriend who confesses that it is not being used well. A girl friend who knows how to do that and has been wearing weird clothes to inspire. Lisa throws off the clothes she was wearing for her boyfriend...', 'While writing, I don''t think so well, so I am in trouble while talking to myself. Then, the girlfriend Lisa came to the hero''s house to play. A girlfriend who asks her boyfriend who is welcoming to see if she is writing well these days. To a boyfriend who confesses that it is not being used well. A girl friend who knows how to do that and has been wearing weird clothes to inspire. Lisa throws off the clothes she was wearing for her boyfriend...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mNFodgIhrOeS79nlykxeXcLpjag.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:727207'),
  ('941250666766850624', 'I Want to Deliver Your Voice', 2017, 'Animation, Drama, Fantasy', 'Shuhei Yabuta, Shigenori Hirozumi, Yoji Shimizu', 'Manabu Ishikawa', 'Mina Katahira, Hitomi Suzuki, Momone Iwabuchi, Misako Iino, Mitsuho Kambe, Yuki Tanaka, Suzuko Mimori, Tatsuhisa Suzuki', null, 'The story focuses on high school girl Nagisa Yukiai who lives in a seaside town. She has believed her grandmother''s story that spirits dwell in words and they are called "kotodama" (word spirit). One day, she strays into a mini FM station that has not been used for years. As an impulse of the moment, she tries to talk like a DJ using the facility. But her voice accidentally broadcasted reaches someone she has never expected.', 'The story focuses on high school girl Nagisa Yukiai who lives in a seaside town. She has believed her grandmother''s story that spirits dwell in words and they are called "kotodama" (word spirit). One day, she strays into a mini FM station that has not been used for years. As an impulse of the moment, she tries to talk like a DJ using the facility. But her voice accidentally broadcasted reaches someone she has never expected.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/XWJHtLrIjlqUEfw9uM4nfnDihW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:461078'),
  ('1125174865709349286', 'I Want to Eat Your Pancreas', 2018, 'Animation, Drama, Romance', 'Keito Watanabe, Koremi Kishi, Won Chang-hee', 'Shinichiro Ushijima', 'Mahiro Takasugi, Lynn, Yukiyo Fujii, Yuma Uchida, Jun Fukushima, Atsuko Tanaka, Shin-ichiro Miki, Emi Wakui', null, 'After his classmate and crush is diagnosed with a pancreatic disease, an average high schooler sets out to make the most of her final days.', 'After his classmate and crush is diagnosed with a pancreatic disease, an average high schooler sets out to make the most of her final days.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qpV8kvRfAntV7D4aOOsLIz7OdPc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:504253'),
  ('1151203830262972902', 'I Want to Go Home', 1989, 'Comedy', 'Alain Resnais, Charles Van Damme', 'Jules Feiffer', 'Laura Benson, Adolph Green, Linda Lavin, Gérard Depardieu, Geraldine Chaplin, François-Eric Gendron, Georges Fricker, John Ashton', null, 'Joey Wellman, an American cartoonist from Cleveland now largely forgotten at home, visits France with his partner Lena to attend an exhibition in Paris about the comic strip (bande dessinée) which features his work. He also hopes to be reconciled with his daughter Elsie who has been a student in Paris for two years, in flight from the American culture of which she sees her father as a typical example. Elsie is naively infatuated with French literature, and is trying to secure an introduction to the brilliant university professor Christian Gauthier, an expert on Flaubert but also an enthusiast for comic books. The meeting of father and daughter goes badly, but Elsie is persuaded to join Joey and Lena for the weekend at the country house of Gauthier''s mother, Isabelle. During a comic-themed masquerade party, all of the characters are made to reconsider their present and past relationships.', 'Joey Wellman, an American cartoonist from Cleveland now largely forgotten at home, visits France with his partner Lena to attend an exhibition in Paris about the comic strip (bande dessinée) which features his work. He also hopes to be reconciled with his daughter Elsie who has been a student in Paris for two years, in flight from the American culture of which she sees her father as a typical example. Elsie is naively infatuated with French literature, and is trying to secure an introduction to the brilliant university professor Christian Gauthier, an expert on Flaubert but also an enthusiast for comic books. The meeting of father and daughter goes badly, but Elsie is persuaded to join Joey and Lena for the weekend at the country house of Gauthier''s mother, Isabelle. During a comic-themed masquerade party, all of the characters are made to reconsider their present and past relationships.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iQ4bRvvQfTTnI266GfsKeFW3kA7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48200'),
  ('497771870911462894', 'I Want To Go To Prison', 1998, 'Comedy', 'Grigoriy Belenkiy, Alla Surikova, Aleksandr Grebyonkin', 'Vladimir Eryomin', 'Vladimir Ilin, Natalya Gundareva, Alla Kliouka, Sergey Batalov, Boris Shcherbakov, Anatoliy Gorin, Mikhail Petrovsky, Anvar Libabov', null, 'After Semyon helps a man commit a crime, he learns the gravity of his actions and decides to go to jail. But he chooses to get imprisoned in the Netherlands to get some comfort.', 'After Semyon helps a man commit a crime, he learns the gravity of his actions and decides to go to jail. But he chooses to get imprisoned in the Netherlands to get some comfort.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ApFNZpP3nXlZJfz9rsiDrLep0DO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57774'),
  ('56534467950267377', 'I Want to Know Your Parents', 2022, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Lee Chang-jae, Yoon Jong-han, Park Si-hwan', 'Kim Gyeong-mi, Yu Young-ah', 'Sul Kyung-gu, Chun Woo-hee, Moon So-ri, Oh Dal-su, Ko Chang-seok, Kang Shin-il, Sung Yoo-bin, Nam Kee-ae', null, 'An eighth grade student kills himself but not before writing the names of the students who victimized him. Their parents are called into the school and a battle goes on regarding the will.', 'An eighth grade student kills himself but not before writing the names of the students who victimized him. Their parents are called into the school and a battle goes on regarding the will.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7DLzrazHoJpM0s8DysCTbC8eb8l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:629322'),
  ('176612898628907641', 'I Want to Live!', 1958, 'Drama, Crime', 'Robert Wise, Lionel Lindon', 'Ed Montgomery', 'Susan Hayward, Simon Oakland, Virginia Vincent, Theodore Bikel, Wesley Lau, Philip Coolidge, Lou Krugman, James Philbrook', 'NR', 'Brazen perpetual offender Barbara Graham tries to go straight but she finds herself implicated in a murder and sent to death row.', 'Brazen perpetual offender Barbara Graham tries to go straight but she finds herself implicated in a murder and sent to death row.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hufXkmILGy34VXEdQC69etY8Rt4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28577'),
  ('124663345698484779', 'I Want to Return Return Return', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Elsa Rosengren', 'Elsa Rosengren', 'Elpiniki Saranti, Maria Kalach, Ramses Komuro Boubaker, Robert Hamill, Stefan Keuneke, Katarzyna Pacura, Ellen Edmar, Angelika Mertens', null, 'A depiction of the Wrangelkiez neighbourhood in Berlin. The people portrayed tell their life stories. One woman came to the neighbourhood a decade ago to work in Berlin’s still unfinished Brandenburger Airport, one man reminisces his childhood on a Tobacco farm in Kentucky, another speaks of an exceptional day in an otherwise monotonous workplace. These portraits are interwoven with the story of Elpi, a Greek woman who is waiting for the long overdue visit of an old important friend. The outcome of this mixture is a film which captures the lives and perspectives of some of Wrangelkiez’s most commanding citizens, while at the same time evoking the loss that change and time passing means for places and for people.', 'A depiction of the Wrangelkiez neighbourhood in Berlin. The people portrayed tell their life stories. One woman came to the neighbourhood a decade ago to work in Berlin’s still unfinished Brandenburger Airport, one man reminisces his childhood on a Tobacco farm in Kentucky, another speaks of an exceptional day in an otherwise monotonous workplace. These portraits are interwoven with the story of Elpi, a Greek woman who is waiting for the long overdue visit of an old important friend. The outcome of this mixture is a film which captures the lives and perspectives of some of Wrangelkiez’s most commanding citizens, while at the same time evoking the loss that change and time passing means for places and for people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/goHjKTGvOR2MTgv9PAvltaXxsNY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:715892'),
  ('132650709564226468', 'I Want to Talk About Duras', 2022, 'Drama, Romance', 'Marie Willaume, Céline Bozon, Claire Simon', 'Claire Simon', 'Swann Arlaud, Emmanuelle Devos, Christophe Paou, Philippe Minyana', null, 'In 1982, Yann Andréa and Marguerite Duras have been living together for two years. She is almost 70 years old, while he is 38 years her junior. Andréa asks journalist and writer Michèle Manceaux to interview him about his life with Duras, an obsession that both impassions him and drives him mad. He believes by entrusting their story to Manceaux, he may gain more clarity of the relationship. What follows is an intense and compelling conversation delving into the deepest recesses of modern love.', 'In 1982, Yann Andréa and Marguerite Duras have been living together for two years. She is almost 70 years old, while he is 38 years her junior. Andréa asks journalist and writer Michèle Manceaux to interview him about his life with Duras, an obsession that both impassions him and drives him mad. He believes by entrusting their story to Manceaux, he may gain more clarity of the relationship. What follows is an intense and compelling conversation delving into the deepest recesses of modern love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hQldaApF9aWgxrnoHbb5AO1654n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:803701'),
  ('871282936741104671', 'I Want You', 1998, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama, Music, Romance', 'Michael Winterbottom, Sławomir Idziak, Michael Elliott', 'Eoin McNamee', 'Rachel Weisz, Alessandro Nivola, Luka Petrušić, Labina Mitevska, Carmen Ejogo, Ben Daniels, Graham Crowden, Geraldine O''Rawe', null, 'A young boy and his sister are drawn into one man''s obsessive pursuit of his former lover.', 'A young boy and his sister are drawn into one man''s obsessive pursuit of his former lover.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iMnAh6K4jLnwDrtxjaCshX9k425.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35113'),
  ('844482794744010794', 'I Want You', 2007, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Luis Prieto, Umberto Riccioni Carteni, Manfredo Archinto', 'Federico Moccia, Teresa Ciabatti', 'Riccardo Scamarcio, Laura Chiatti, Katy Louise Saunders, Maria Chiara Augenti, Ivan Bacchi, Giulia Elettra Gorietti, Susy Laude, Marco Aceti', null, 'A macho type man becomes entangled with an independent-minded girl.', 'A macho type man becomes entangled with an independent-minded girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cFGEqTIz82FjZbSY1U4M8O7WLhM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21943'),
  ('76798804901438363', 'I Want You', 2012, 'Drama, Romance', 'Fernando González Molina, Xavi Giménez', 'Ramón Salazar', 'María Valverde, Mario Casas, Clara Lago, Álvaro Cervantes, Diego Martín, Marina Salas, Cristina Plazas, Nerea Camacho', null, 'After two years away, Hache returns to Barcelona seeking a fresh start. Falling for Gin while facing unresolved feelings for Babi, he must confront love, loss, and who he''s becoming.', 'After two years away, Hache returns to Barcelona seeking a fresh start. Falling for Gin while facing unresolved feelings for Babi, he must confront love, loss, and who he''s becoming.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m7JUNQu5zRsmFeUWZrGoV0fTp0B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109689'),
  ('32454543704984697', 'I Want You Back', 2022, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Jason Suhrke, Megan Molloy, Vincent Lascoumes', 'Elizabeth Berger, Isaac Aptaker', 'Charlie Day, Jenny Slate, Scott Eastwood, Gina Rodriguez, Manny Jacinto, Clark Backo, Luke David Blumm, Mason Gooding', 'R', 'Peter and Emma thought they were on the precipice of life’s biggest moments – marriage, kids, and houses in the suburbs – until their respective partners dumped them. Horrified to learn that the loves of their lives have already moved on, Peter and Emma hatch a hilarious plan to win back their exes with unexpected results.', 'Peter and Emma thought they were on the precipice of life’s biggest moments – marriage, kids, and houses in the suburbs – until their respective partners dumped them. Horrified to learn that the loves of their lives have already moved on, Peter and Emma hatch a hilarious plan to win back their exes with unexpected results.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/an4HVcLT4Ce2aXgxuSEnJ1UDdfp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:680860'),
  ('965511589305339442', 'I Want Your Sex', 2026, 'Drama, Comedy, Thriller', 'Gregg Araki, Tucker Korte, Tim Neven', 'Karley Sciortino, Gregg Araki', 'Olivia Wilde, Cooper Hoffman, Mason Gooding, Chase Sui Wonders, Daveed Diggs, Charli xcx, Johnny Knoxville, Margaret Cho', 'R', 'When fresh-faced Elliot lands an exciting job for renowned artist, icon and provocateur Erika Tracy, his fantasies come true as Erika taps him to become her sexual muse. But Elliot soon finds himself out of his depth as Erika takes him on a journey more profound than he ever could have imagined, into a world of sex, obsession, power, betrayal and murder.', 'When fresh-faced Elliot lands an exciting job for renowned artist, icon and provocateur Erika Tracy, his fantasies come true as Erika taps him to become her sexual muse. But Elliot soon finds himself out of his depth as Erika takes him on a journey more profound than he ever could have imagined, into a world of sex, obsession, power, betrayal and murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8qLjMLuni7prIhO7GIwiYIJJcO5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1288059'),
  ('809600816373356069', 'I Wanted Pants', 1990, 'Crime, Drama, Romance', 'Maurizio Calvesi, Maurizio Ponzi', 'Leonardo Benvenuti, Bruno Garbuglia, Piero De Bernardi', 'Giulia Fossà, Ángela Molina, Natasha Hovey, Tony Palazzo, Pino Colizzi, Luciano Catenacci, Lucia Bosè, Ludovica Modugno', null, 'Annetta, of Sicilian origins, is annoyed by the different treatments and freedoms reserved for men and women. Because of her rebellious attitude, the girl is locked up in the house of her relatives where she suffers an attempt of violence by her uncle. After returning to her parents, she finally gets married to her beloved Nicola.', 'Annetta, of Sicilian origins, is annoyed by the different treatments and freedoms reserved for men and women. Because of her rebellious attitude, the girl is locked up in the house of her relatives where she suffers an attempt of violence by her uncle. After returning to her parents, she finally gets married to her beloved Nicola.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vhYEOt2jU7FDOyxDnTSTqEkct01.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:282898'),
  ('26913095580818674', 'I Wanted to Find You', 2018, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Javier Colinas', 'Tamara Argamasilla', 'Eréndira Ibarra, Erick Elías, Patricia Reyes Spíndola, Diana Bracho, Eugenia Cauduro, Luis Arrieta, Rafael Simón, Paulette Hernández', null, 'Diego, just a few weeks away from his wedding to Julia, the perfect bride, is forced by his father to remodel a hotel he destroyed during his wild bachelor party. There, he meets Lu, the hotel manager, a free-spirited, bold, and beautiful woman; the kind of woman who turns your life upside down. Lu will make Diego confront himself and take control of his life for the first time.', 'Diego, just a few weeks away from his wedding to Julia, the perfect bride, is forced by his father to remodel a hotel he destroyed during his wild bachelor party. There, he meets Lu, the hotel manager, a free-spirited, bold, and beautiful woman; the kind of woman who turns your life upside down. Lu will make Diego confront himself and take control of his life for the first time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/73atVJhv6FkGAdgicw1Jf0Hf9Tf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:514186'),
  ('1001270509525975724', 'I Was a Communist for the FBI', 1951, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Edwin B. DuPar, Gordon Douglas, Oren Haglund', 'Crane Wilbur', 'Frank Lovejoy, Dorothy Hart, Philip Carey, James Millican, Richard Webb, Konstantin Shayne, Paul Picerni, Roy Roberts', 'NR', 'A fact-based story about a man who posed as an American Communist for years as part of a secret plan to infiltrate their organization.', 'A fact-based story about a man who posed as an American Communist for years as part of a secret plan to infiltrate their organization.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fC8JWi0Sp13O5VDukp8wf5lcxa4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49508'),
  ('345547213981430812', 'I Was a Dreamer', 2016, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Michele Vannucci, Matteo Vieille, Sara Casani', 'Michele Vannucci, Anita Otto', 'Mirko Frezza, Alessandro Borghi, Vittorio Viviani, Milena Mancini, Ivana Lotito, Ginevra De Carolis', null, 'At 39 years of age Mirko has just left prison. In the outskirts of Rome, a new future waits for him. When he is elected president of the homeowners’ committee, he realises that he can dream of a different kind of existence. Not only for himself and his family, but for the whole suburb where he lives. This film deals with a “bandit” who, with the help of his best friend Boccione, wants to turn the indifference of the suburb into solidarity and the roads into luxuriant fields of tomatoes, becoming the bearer of a happiness he does not know how to reach. It is the story of a fragile and irrational dream: offering a future to those who do not even believe they deserve a present.', 'At 39 years of age Mirko has just left prison. In the outskirts of Rome, a new future waits for him. When he is elected president of the homeowners’ committee, he realises that he can dream of a different kind of existence. Not only for himself and his family, but for the whole suburb where he lives. This film deals with a “bandit” who, with the help of his best friend Boccione, wants to turn the indifference of the suburb into solidarity and the roads into luxuriant fields of tomatoes, becoming the bearer of a happiness he does not know how to reach. It is the story of a fragile and irrational dream: offering a future to those who do not even believe they deserve a present.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9JiwRYj4uGtVFfhhu1Fo2DAIbry.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:412492'),
  ('66624974964070932', 'I Was a Male War Bride', 1949, 'Comedy, Romance, War', 'Howard Hawks, Lionel Newman, John Bremer', 'Hagar Wilde, Charles Lederer, Leonard Spigelgass', 'Cary Grant, Ann Sheridan, Marion Marshall, Randy Stuart, Bill Neff, Russ Conway, Gene Garrick, William Self', null, 'After marrying an American lieutenant with whom he was assigned to work in post-war Germany, a French captain attempts to find a way to accompany her back to the States under the terms of the War Bride Act.', 'After marrying an American lieutenant with whom he was assigned to work in post-war Germany, a French captain attempts to find a way to accompany her back to the States under the terms of the War Bride Act.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gwliIJs9TWlZAcp6k0cx0I81W5e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23567'),
  ('217591123926409252', 'I Was a Soldier', 1971, 'Documentary', 'Krzysztof Kieślowski, Andrzej Titkow, Stanislaw Niedbalski', 'Ryszard Zgórecki', null, null, 'A group of veterans recount a horrifying experience when trapped in a minefield, resulting in each losing their sight.', 'A group of veterans recount a horrifying experience when trapped in a minefield, resulting in each losing their sight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1K1QXEZjARsfSfK5fLskrYDCh9s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48884'),
  ('565427299649108596', 'I Was a Stranger', 2025, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Merve Toz, Toufic Khreich, Michael Monar', 'Brandt Andersen', 'Yasmine Al Massri, Yahya Mahayni, Omar Sy, Ziad Bakri, Constantine Markoulakis, Jason Beghe, Ayman Samman, Massa Daoud', 'PG-13', 'A Syrian doctor and her daughter flee Aleppo, setting off a chain of events that binds five strangers together. A smuggler, a soldier, a poet, and a coast guard captain collide in a crisis that tests their courage, their choices, and their humanity.', 'A Syrian doctor and her daughter flee Aleppo, setting off a chain of events that binds five strangers together. A smuggler, a soldier, a poet, and a coast guard captain collide in a crisis that tests their courage, their choices, and their humanity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/RBIrEveMOIy5Kxg2WzgMnCIhaN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1193128'),
