  ('228022940023495914', 'I-See-You.com', 2006, 'Comedy', 'Eric Steven Stahl, Armando Salas', 'Sean McLain, Eric Steven Stahl', 'Beau Bridges, Rosanna Arquette, Mathew Botuchis, Shiri Appleby, Dan Castellaneta, Baelyn Neff, Victor Alfieri, Tracee Ellis Ross', 'NR', 'A 17-year-old boy buys mini-cameras and displays the footage online at I-see-you.com. The cash rolls in as the site becomes a major hit. Everyone seems to have fun until it all comes crashing down....', 'A 17-year-old boy buys mini-cameras and displays the footage online at I-see-you.com. The cash rolls in as the site becomes a major hit. Everyone seems to have fun until it all comes crashing down....', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fscHts499XahFEaHquyowRUzOC5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14569'),
  ('924949449638347022', 'I, ''The Heifer''', 1985, 'Crime, Drama', 'José Antonio de la Loma, José Antonio de la Loma Jr., Carles Gusi', 'José Antonio de la Loma', 'Raúl García Losada, Teresa Giménez, Carmen de Lirio, Juan José Moreno Cuenca, Frank Braña, Daniel Medrán, Mingo Ràfols, Nat Collado', null, 'Juan Jose Moreno Cuenca, alias the Heifer, is 23 years old and tells his story as a criminal offender from 1 Ocaña Toledo. Fatherless, the offender has his childhood and how everything changed when her mother went to prison.', 'Juan Jose Moreno Cuenca, alias the Heifer, is 23 years old and tells his story as a criminal offender from 1 Ocaña Toledo. Fatherless, the offender has his childhood and how everything changed when her mother went to prison.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/myDF0z8XxLe1n9pRBQJgCpg7pvJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:189312'),
  ('1029997092064686447', 'I, a Negro', 1959, 'Documentary', 'Jean Rouch', 'Jean Rouch', 'Oumarou Ganda, Petit Touré, Alassane Maiga, Amadou Demba, Gambi, Seydou Guede, Karidyo Faoudou, Edmond Bernus', null, 'Winner of the prestigious Prix Louis Delluc in 1958, "Moi, un noir" marked Jean Rouch''s break with traditional ethnography, and his embrace of the collaborative and improvisatory strategies he called "shared ethnography" and "ethnofiction". The film depicts an ordinary week in the lives of men and women from Niger who have migrated to Abidjan, Côte d''Ivoire for work.', 'Winner of the prestigious Prix Louis Delluc in 1958, "Moi, un noir" marked Jean Rouch''s break with traditional ethnography, and his embrace of the collaborative and improvisatory strategies he called "shared ethnography" and "ethnofiction". The film depicts an ordinary week in the lives of men and women from Niger who have migrated to Abidjan, Côte d''Ivoire for work.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6Zz3rVvm8vjXMy9UWkbPGN3cL9v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64299'),
  ('934198911222547614', 'I, an Actress', 1977, 'Documentary, Comedy, Drama', 'George Kuchar', null, 'George Kuchar, Barbara Lapsley', null, 'An actress and a director run through a melodramatic scene, speaking to a mannequin.', 'An actress and a director run through a melodramatic scene, speaking to a mannequin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/793K0efdX7WxqwqeP30gooJbyvq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110275'),
  ('434806673613182403', 'I, Cesar', 2003, 'Comedy', 'Richard Berry, Thomas Hardmeier', 'Eric Assous, Richard Berry', 'Jules Sitruk, Joséphine Berry, Mabô Kouyaté, Anna Karina, Stéphane Guillon, Jean-Philippe Écoffey, Annick Blancheteau, Cécile de France', null, 'Cesar is a young schoolboy living in Paris with his family. Their life is ordinary, but Cesar wants more excitement (which he creates, in one instance, by claiming to his teachers that his father has been arrested). During the school holidays, Cesar and his friend Sarah decide to help their mutual friend, Morgan, find his father who supposedly lives in London. Each one tells their parents that they''re staying with the other two, and together they sneak out to begin their search.', 'Cesar is a young schoolboy living in Paris with his family. Their life is ordinary, but Cesar wants more excitement (which he creates, in one instance, by claiming to his teachers that his father has been arrested). During the school holidays, Cesar and his friend Sarah decide to help their mutual friend, Morgan, find his father who supposedly lives in London. Each one tells their parents that they''re staying with the other two, and together they sneak out to begin their search.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mEMSJSet752wIVM75u5BewGsTy8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60025'),
  ('480758889127443932', 'I, Don Giovanni', 2009, 'Drama, Romance', 'Carlos Saura, Vittorio Storaro', 'Raffaello Uboldi, Alessandro Vallini, Carlos Saura', 'Lorenzo Balducci, Lino Guanciale, Emilia Verginelli, Tobias Moretti, Ennio Fantastichini, Ketevan Kemoklidze, Valentina Calandriello', null, 'A drama based on the life of 18th century Italian lyricist Lorenzo da Ponte, who collaborated with Mozart on his "Don Giovanni" opera.', 'A drama based on the life of 18th century Italian lyricist Lorenzo da Ponte, who collaborated with Mozart on his "Don Giovanni" opera.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mqwgiehzAV6EgvKYAjxVxF6qAdD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78207'),
  ('552522593419512222', 'I, Frankenstein', 2014, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Stuart Beattie, Ross Emery, Brian Edmonds', 'Stuart Beattie', 'Aaron Eckhart, Yvonne Strahovski, Bill Nighy, Jai Courtney, Miranda Otto, Caitlin Stasey, Penny Higgs, Aden Young', 'PG-13', '200 years after his shocking creation, Dr. Frankenstein''s creature, Adam, still walks the earth. But when he finds himself in the middle of a war over the fate of humanity, Adam discovers he holds the key that could destroy humankind.', '200 years after his shocking creation, Dr. Frankenstein''s creature, Adam, still walks the earth. But when he finds himself in the middle of a war over the fate of humanity, Adam discovers he holds the key that could destroy humankind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a53tIl4k20zCZCNyq73kiXkwWkl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100241'),
  ('882505920488293788', 'I, Leonardo', 2019, 'History, Drama', 'Jesus Garces Lambert', null, 'Luca Argentero, Angela Fontana, Massimo De Lorenzo, Francesco Pannofino', null, 'Discover Leonardo da Vinci, the man, the painter, the scientist and the inventor, through a unique, engaging and fascinating journey in the mind of Leonardo.', 'Discover Leonardo da Vinci, the man, the painter, the scientist and the inventor, through a unique, engaging and fascinating journey in the mind of Leonardo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6DfpPu4iGrBswsyLdJlCwiLCudw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:599616'),
  ('93365577076726658', 'I, Madman', 1989, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Tibor Takács, Bryan England, Roger La Page', 'David Chaskin', 'Jenny Wright, Clayton Rohner, Randall William Cook, Stephanie Hodge, Michelle Jordan, Vance Valencia, Mary Baldwin, Raf Nazario', 'R', 'A bookshop clerk starts seeing the disfigured killer from her favorite 1950s pulp novels come to life and start killing people around her.', 'A bookshop clerk starts seeing the disfigured killer from her favorite 1950s pulp novels come to life and start killing people around her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vmM7hNVmPMQM8ijiI9P235jjlLQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40353'),
  ('1007245490454766296', 'I, Me aur Main', 2013, 'Drama', 'Kapil Sharma', 'Devika Bhagat', 'John Abraham, Chitrangada Singh, Prachi Desai, Zarina Wahab, Raima Sen, Mukul Chadda', 'NR', 'As Ishaan, a music producer who takes advantage of the women in his life, feels a connection with Gauri, his new next-door neighbor, he begins to learn the importance of friendship - causing him to work to repair his relationships.', 'As Ishaan, a music producer who takes advantage of the women in his life, feels a connection with Gauri, his new next-door neighbor, he begins to learn the importance of friendship - causing him to work to repair his relationships.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c0L7Rke5Rm86CCiSkuR4sSOnCiX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:171767'),
  ('185117323456830580', 'I, Monster', 1971, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Stephen Weeks, Michael Stevenson, Al Burgess', 'Milton Subotsky', 'Christopher Lee, Peter Cushing, Mike Raven, Richard Hurndall, George Merritt, Kenneth J. Warren, Susan Jameson, Marjie Lawrence', 'PG', 'Christopher Lee stars in this Amicus production of “Dr. Jekyll & Mr. Hyde” where the names have been changed to Dr. Marlowe and Mr. Blake. Lee as Dr. Marlowe experiments with intravenous drugs that are suppose to release inner inhibitions. So comes forth Mr. Blake (also Lee) who gets more monstrous with each transformation. Peter Cushing plays his friend and colleague, Dr. Utterson.', 'Christopher Lee stars in this Amicus production of “Dr. Jekyll & Mr. Hyde” where the names have been changed to Dr. Marlowe and Mr. Blake. Lee as Dr. Marlowe experiments with intravenous drugs that are suppose to release inner inhibitions. So comes forth Mr. Blake (also Lee) who gets more monstrous with each transformation. Peter Cushing plays his friend and colleague, Dr. Utterson.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7MMjLTD68UiRbSM9bVy8HhYY3uB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52941'),
  ('620096930356004912', 'I, Olga Hepnarova', 2016, 'Drama, History', 'Petr Kazda, Adam Sikora, Tomáš Weinreb', 'Petr Kazda, Tomáš Weinreb', 'Michalina Olszańska, Martin Pechlát, Klára Melíšková, Marika Šoposká, Juraj Nvota, Martin Finger, Jan Novotný, Ondřej Malý', null, 'Olga is a complex young woman desperate to break free from her unfeeling family and social conventions. With her Louise Brooks-like tomboyish looks she drags herself, chain-smoking, from one job to another until she appears to find her niche as a truck driver. Although she has female lovers she does not form a bond with any of them; instead she clashes, time and again, venting herself in wordless emotional outbursts and other behavioural extremes.', 'Olga is a complex young woman desperate to break free from her unfeeling family and social conventions. With her Louise Brooks-like tomboyish looks she drags herself, chain-smoking, from one job to another until she appears to find her niche as a truck driver. Although she has female lovers she does not form a bond with any of them; instead she clashes, time and again, venting herself in wordless emotional outbursts and other behavioural extremes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tmtu6NAvyVYZzreAj8dqigBFHe7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:382143'),
  ('186173999156567441', 'I, Pierre Rivière, Having Slaughtered My Mother, My Sister and My Brother…', 1976, 'Crime, Drama', 'René Allio, Gérard Mordillat, Nicolas Philibert', 'Pascal Bonitzer, Jean Jourdheuil, Serge Toubiana', 'Claude Hébert, Jacqueline Milliere, Joseph Leportier, Annick Gehan, François Regnault', null, 'Based on documents compiled by leading French philosopher Michel Foucault, this unique and original film charts the gruesome events which took place in a Normandy village in 1835, when a young man, Pierre Rivière, murdered his mother, sister and brother before fleeing to the countryside. With a cast made up of real-life villagers from the area where the events took place, the detailed re-enactments and careful attention to the gestures of their ancestors serve to create an intense and sometimes disturbing atmosphere of hyper-realism. Details of the crime and of the trial that followed are told from varied perspectives, including the written confession of Pierre himself, and form a rich and complex narrative that interrogates the concepts of “truth” and “history”.', 'Based on documents compiled by leading French philosopher Michel Foucault, this unique and original film charts the gruesome events which took place in a Normandy village in 1835, when a young man, Pierre Rivière, murdered his mother, sister and brother before fleeing to the countryside. With a cast made up of real-life villagers from the area where the events took place, the detailed re-enactments and careful attention to the gestures of their ancestors serve to create an intense and sometimes disturbing atmosphere of hyper-realism. Details of the crime and of the trial that followed are told from varied perspectives, including the written confession of Pierre himself, and form a rich and complex narrative that interrogates the concepts of “truth” and “history”.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aSndBIPwaJQvSmWUrfq0IsDXvsm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63984'),
  ('868794411664783755', 'I, Potro', 2018, 'Comedy, TV Movie', 'Marcos Bucay, Francisco Iñigo', 'Marcos Bucay', 'Joaquín Ferreira, Marcela Alvarez, Benjamín Alfonso, Emilia Claudeville, Mauricio Llera, Sol Gaschetto, Martín Seefeld, Martín Rocco', null, 'Former Club de Cuervos player Potro returns home to Argentina to crash the wedding of his famous soccer-star brother and confront his estranged family.', 'Former Club de Cuervos player Potro returns home to Argentina to crash the wedding of his famous soccer-star brother and confront his estranged family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vmmWHT3oShNF9Pd2GUqOfa9DMlE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:554954'),
  ('835103494359910694', 'I, Putin: A Portrait', 2012, 'Documentary', 'Hubert Seipel', null, 'Vladimir Putin, Peter Bieringer', null, 'The multiple, award-winning television author Hubert Seipel, accompanied Vladimir Putin in Russia, over a period of many weeks. He not only conducted several interviews with him, but was also present when Putin shouldered judo opponents, or challenged his bodyguards during a game of ice hockey.', 'The multiple, award-winning television author Hubert Seipel, accompanied Vladimir Putin in Russia, over a period of many weeks. He not only conducted several interviews with him, but was also present when Putin shouldered judo opponents, or challenged his bodyguards during a game of ice hockey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kTfrB6nnsscOI9RwIjm31aKF8qp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:254623'),
  ('164818004534490249', 'I, Robot', 2004, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'Alex Proyas, Simon Duggan, Kendelle Elliott', 'Jeff Vintar, Akiva Goldsman', 'Will Smith, Bridget Moynahan, Alan Tudyk, James Cromwell, Bruce Greenwood, Adrian Ricard, Chi McBride, Jerry Wasserman', 'PG-13', 'In 2035, where robots are commonplace and abide by the three laws of robotics, a technophobic cop investigates an apparent suicide. Suspecting that a robot may be responsible for the death, his investigation leads him to believe that humanity may be in danger.', 'In 2035, where robots are commonplace and abide by the three laws of robotics, a technophobic cop investigates an apparent suicide. Suspecting that a robot may be responsible for the death, his investigation leads him to believe that humanity may be in danger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/efwv6F2lGaghjPpBRSINHtoEiZB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2048'),
  ('202696789705362681', 'I, the Executioner', 1968, 'Thriller, Horror, Drama, Crime', 'Tai Katō, Keiji Maruyama, Keiji Shiraki', 'Tai Katō, Haruhiko Mimura, Yoji Yamada', 'Makoto Satō, Chieko Baisho, Sanae Nakahara, Oh Ranfan, Kin Sugai, Junko Toda, Tatsuo Matsumura, Fujio Suga', null, 'Police detectives investigate the link between a serial killer''s machinations and a teenage boy who committed suicide.', 'Police detectives investigate the link between a serial killer''s machinations and a teenage boy who committed suicide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vcBKbgHpVm1cmTRyWP7vWfx36pL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125270'),
  ('574717540008409875', 'I, the Executioner', 2024, 'Action, Crime, Comedy', 'Ryoo Seung-wan, Choi Young-hwan, Chang Ki-ha', 'Ryoo Seung-wan, Lee Won-jae', 'Hwang Jung-min, Jung Hae-in, Oh Dal-su, Oh Dae-hwan, Jang Yoon-ju, Kim Si-hoo, Jin Kyung, Shin Seung-hwan', null, 'The veteran detective Seo Do-cheol and his team at Major Crimes, relentless in their pursuit of criminals, join forces with rookie cop Park Sun-woo to track down a serial killer who has plunged the nation into turmoil.', 'The veteran detective Seo Do-cheol and his team at Major Crimes, relentless in their pursuit of criminals, join forces with rookie cop Park Sun-woo to track down a serial killer who has plunged the nation into turmoil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gAtP0usArK5gVOBObnsENKLwML8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:995926'),
  ('226257877529565480', 'I, the Jury', 1953, 'Mystery, Crime', 'John Alton, Harry Essex', 'Harry Essex', 'Biff Elliot, Preston Foster, Peggie Castle, Margaret Sheridan, Alan Reed, Mary Anderson, Tom Powers, Frances Osborne', 'NR', 'After his best friend and war buddy is mysteriously gunned down, Mike Hammer will stop at nothing to settle the score for the man who sacrificed a limb to save his own life during combat. Along the way, Hammer rides a fine line between gumshoe and a one-man jury, staying two-steps ahead of the law—and trying not to get bumped off in the process.', 'After his best friend and war buddy is mysteriously gunned down, Mike Hammer will stop at nothing to settle the score for the man who sacrificed a limb to save his own life during combat. Along the way, Hammer rides a fine line between gumshoe and a one-man jury, staying two-steps ahead of the law—and trying not to get bumped off in the process.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4jFRYkgZ5TOJLnIKtpt5yYrz9GM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37184'),
  ('1019610269684104829', 'I, the Jury', 1982, 'Crime, Thriller, Mystery', 'Richard T. Heffron, Andrew Laszlo', 'Larry Cohen', 'Armand Assante, Barbara Carrera, Laurene Landon, Alan King, Geoffrey Lewis, Paul Sorvino, Judson Scott, Barry Snider', null, 'Jack Williams was the best friend of Vietnam veteran and detective Mike Hammer. When Jack is murdered, Mike makes it his business to solve the crime. He is helped by his secretary Velda, and partly helped, partly hindered by the Chief of Police, Pat Chambers. On the trail of the killer, Mike discovers government conspiracies, and plots used by the CIA and the Mafia.', 'Jack Williams was the best friend of Vietnam veteran and detective Mike Hammer. When Jack is murdered, Mike makes it his business to solve the crime. He is helped by his secretary Velda, and partly helped, partly hindered by the Chief of Police, Pat Chambers. On the trail of the killer, Mike discovers government conspiracies, and plots used by the CIA and the Mafia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/11UUzdaxwPjX8Mfw1ZIpMTY3y6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37191'),
  ('1047379428741521807', 'I, the Worst of All', 1990, 'Drama, Romance, History', 'María Luisa Bemberg, Félix "Chango" Monti, Marcelo Rembado', 'María Luisa Bemberg, Antonio Larreta', 'Assumpta Serna, Dominique Sanda, Héctor Alterio, Lautaro Murúa, Alberto Segado, Franklin Caicedo, Graciela Araujo, Hugo Soto', null, 'A 17th-century Mexican nun defies expectations by becoming a renowned intellectual and writer during the Spanish Inquisition.', 'A 17th-century Mexican nun defies expectations by becoming a renowned intellectual and writer during the Spanish Inquisition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/svqJY9yyrPl42UbFaSbANvcTY9C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:123763'),
  ('146585176076792005', 'I, Tonya', 2017, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Craig Gillespie, Nicolas Karakatsanis, Tim Fitzgerald', 'Steven Rogers', 'Margot Robbie, Sebastian Stan, Allison Janney, Julianne Nicholson, Paul Walter Hauser, Bobby Cannavale, Bojana Novaković, Caitlin Carver', 'R', 'Competitive ice skater Tonya Harding rises amongst the ranks at the U.S. Figure Skating Championships, but her future in the sport is thrown into doubt when her ex-husband intervenes.', 'Competitive ice skater Tonya Harding rises amongst the ranks at the U.S. Figure Skating Championships, but her future in the sport is thrown into doubt when her ex-husband intervenes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6gNXwSHxaksR1PjVZRqNapmkgj3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:389015'),
  ('1138328099422136644', 'I, Zombie: The Chronicles of Pain', 1999, 'Horror, Drama', 'Andrew Parkinson, Andrew Parkinson, Rob Miller', 'Andrew Parkinson', 'Ellen Softley, Dean Sipling, Claire Griffin, Kate Thorougood, Mia Fothergill, Giles Aspen, Peter Hacket, Nick Mallinowski', null, 'A young man, while out on a field trip, gets bitten by an ill looking person. When he comes back home he starts getting sick and a slow but steady degeneration begins in his body. He is turning into a zombie. He leaves his girlfriend and moves into his own place. In order to survive he needs to eat human flesh. Against his own consciense, he kills people and eats them in his living room. But things start getting worse as his degeneration progresses.', 'A young man, while out on a field trip, gets bitten by an ill looking person. When he comes back home he starts getting sick and a slow but steady degeneration begins in his body. He is turning into a zombie. He leaves his girlfriend and moves into his own place. In order to survive he needs to eat human flesh. Against his own consciense, he kills people and eats them in his living room. But things start getting worse as his degeneration progresses.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3VGQ1t6XwDPyMXzFjGwJsQ57YVy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68180'),
  ('557207335630592884', 'I... Dreaming', 1988, null, 'Stan Brakhage', null, 'Stan Brakhage, Bearthm Brakhage, Neowyn Brakhage, Rarc Brakhage', null, 'Phrases of Stephen Foster, set to music by Joel Heartling, are set to film in this autobiographical piece: a solitary female voice, occasionally joined by a chorus, sings phrases of sorrow as we watch a solitary man in shadows in an unadorned house: he stretches out, he picks his feet, he walks across a room, he rocks in a chair. Occasionally he watches two young children at play; the film sometimes speeds up. Handwritten words, like "dark void" and "waiting longing," cross the screen. Film and phrases often come in short bursts. Outdoor it looks gray and cold.', 'Phrases of Stephen Foster, set to music by Joel Heartling, are set to film in this autobiographical piece: a solitary female voice, occasionally joined by a chorus, sings phrases of sorrow as we watch a solitary man in shadows in an unadorned house: he stretches out, he picks his feet, he walks across a room, he rocks in a chair. Occasionally he watches two young children at play; the film sometimes speeds up. Handwritten words, like "dark void" and "waiting longing," cross the screen. Film and phrases often come in short bursts. Outdoor it looks gray and cold.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fwb5ryqcKxDW9kEkUvWS22jVFpP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126193'),
  ('542974328096892177', 'I... for Icarus', 1979, 'Thriller, Crime, Mystery', 'Henri Verneuil, Jean-Louis Picavet', 'Didier Decoin, Henri Verneuil', 'Yves Montand, Michel Etcheverry, Roger Planchon, Jacques Denis, Pierre Vernier, Jacques Sereys, Jean-François Garreaud, Michel Albertini', null, 'Following the assassination of President Marc Jarry, a member of the investigation committee refuses to sign off on the committee''s final findings.', 'Following the assassination of President Marc Jarry, a member of the investigation committee refuses to sign off on the committee''s final findings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q3t1r7zabpfUDTzpbN7ecsl0Rp2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25264'),
  ('397830016494754875', 'I.D.', 1995, 'Crime, Drama', 'Phil Davis, Thomas Mauch', 'Vincent O''Connell', 'Reece Dinsdale, Richard Graham, Perry Fenwick, Philip Glenister, Warren Clarke, Claire Skinner, Saskia Reeves, Sean Pertwee', null, 'Four policemen go undercover and infiltrate a gang of football hooligans hoping to route out their leaders. For one of the four, the line between ''job'' and ''yob'' becomes more unclear as time passes . . .', 'Four policemen go undercover and infiltrate a gang of football hooligans hoping to route out their leaders. For one of the four, the line between ''job'' and ''yob'' becomes more unclear as time passes . . .', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hcDZx4VTA9QzquHvWOdoOSeSB2t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15322'),
  ('79128774005032507', 'I.O.U.S.A.', 2008, 'Documentary', 'Patrick Creadon', 'Patrick Creadon, Christine O''Malley', 'Robert Bixby, Warren Buffett, Douglas Durst, Alan Greenspan, Judd Gregg', null, 'With the country''s debt growing out of control, Americans by and large are unaware of the looming financial crisis. This documentary examines several of the ways America can get its economy back on the right track. In addition to looking at the federal deficit and trade deficit, the film also closely explores the challenges of funding national entitlement programs such as Social Security, Medicare and Medicaid.', 'With the country''s debt growing out of control, Americans by and large are unaware of the looming financial crisis. This documentary examines several of the ways America can get its economy back on the right track. In addition to looking at the federal deficit and trade deficit, the film also closely explores the challenges of funding national entitlement programs such as Social Security, Medicare and Medicaid.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8M8TjVNxo9Y9cEizJjtIVI3YL3T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15320'),
  ('831339717030202353', 'I.Q.', 1994, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Fred Schepisi, Ian Baker', 'Michael J. Leeson, Andy Breckman', 'Tim Robbins, Meg Ryan, Walter Matthau, Lou Jacobi, Gene Saks, Joseph Maher, Stephen Fry, Tony Shalhoub', 'PG', 'Albert Einstein helps a young man who''s in love with Einstein''s niece to catch her attention by pretending temporarily to be a great physicist.', 'Albert Einstein helps a young man who''s in love with Einstein''s niece to catch her attention by pretending temporarily to be a great physicist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5we3ZV6yiw13b8zGk4LuacuV8n7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11777'),
  ('589405907036676946', 'I.S.S.', 2024, 'Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Sean Vawter, Nick Remy Matthews, Scott Hardwick', 'Nick Shafir', 'Ariana DeBose, Chris Messina, John Gallagher Jr., Masha Mashkova, Costa Ronin, Pilou Asbæk', 'R', 'Tensions flare in the near future aboard the International Space Station as a conflict breaks out on Earth. U.S. and Russian astronauts receive orders from the ground: take control of the station by any means necessary.', 'Tensions flare in the near future aboard the International Space Station as a conflict breaks out on Earth. U.S. and Russian astronauts receive orders from the ground: take control of the station by any means necessary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/blPAS2HZcOGLTREbUeNIWmz0B6f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:790462'),
  ('816675523548428006', 'I.T.', 2016, 'Thriller, Crime', 'John Moore, Ekkehart Pollack, Tamara Conboy', 'Daniel Kay, William Wisher', 'Pierce Brosnan, Stefanie Scott, James Frecheville, Michael Nyqvist, Anna Friel, Jay Benedict, Eric Kofi Abrefa, Bruce Lester-Johnson', 'NR', 'Mike Regan is a successful, self-made man who has it all: a gorgeous wife, a beautiful teenage daughter and a sleek, state-of-the-art “smart home”. But he soon finds himself in a deadly, high-stakes game of cat-and-mouse when his I.T. consultant, Ed, starts using his skills to stalk Mike’s daughter and endanger his family, his business, and his life. In a world where there is no privacy, and personal secrets can go viral by the click of a mouse, Mike needs to rely on his old connections to defeat a new kind of nemesis.', 'Mike Regan is a successful, self-made man who has it all: a gorgeous wife, a beautiful teenage daughter and a sleek, state-of-the-art “smart home”. But he soon finds himself in a deadly, high-stakes game of cat-and-mouse when his I.T. consultant, Ed, starts using his skills to stalk Mike’s daughter and endanger his family, his business, and his life. In a world where there is no privacy, and personal secrets can go viral by the click of a mouse, Mike needs to rely on his old connections to defeat a new kind of nemesis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A5VrX0pzM2pnPNXwKO3jKTt35ux.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:340677'),
  ('769861286028721077', 'I''d Receive the Worst News from Your Beautiful Lips', 2011, 'Drama', 'Beto Brant, Renato Ciasca, Lula Araújo', 'Marçal Aquino', 'Camila Pitanga, Gustavo Machado, Zécarlos Machado, Gero Camilo, Adriano Barroso, Magnólio de Oliveira, Simone Sou, Antônio Pitanga', null, 'In a remote part of the Amazon, a traveling photographer has an intense affair with a preacher''s wife, but secrets from her past threaten to ruin them both.', 'In a remote part of the Amazon, a traveling photographer has an intense affair with a preacher''s wife, but secrets from her past threaten to ruin them both.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jsF1xHkI1Zw384NoM0I4ZVbQqCG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125935'),
  ('928166212626389855', 'I''ll Always Know What You Did Last Summer', 2006, 'Horror', 'Stephen M. Katz, Sylvain White, Donald Hauer', 'Michael D. Weiss', 'Brooke Nevin, David Paetkau, Torrey DeVitto, Ben Easter, Seth Packard, K.C. Clyde, Clayton Taylor, Michael Flynn', 'R', 'Several teenagers in a small-town in Colorado concoct a July 4th prank based on a frightening legend that goes awry when their friend ends up accidentally killed; however, the teens agree to keep their involvement a secret from the authorities, who continue to search for the man who apparently killed their friend. A year later, with the July 4th celebration coming up again, the teenagers realize that they''re being stalked by someone who clearly intends on keeping the horrible legend alive by killing them off.', 'Several teenagers in a small-town in Colorado concoct a July 4th prank based on a frightening legend that goes awry when their friend ends up accidentally killed; however, the teens agree to keep their involvement a secret from the authorities, who continue to search for the man who apparently killed their friend. A year later, with the July 4th celebration coming up again, the teenagers realize that they''re being stalked by someone who clearly intends on keeping the horrible legend alive by killing them off.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4gDbZ60YJ6WDstT0XOBABq4bQtO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3602'),
