  ('964613636229501362', 'I''ll Make You Queen', 1964, 'Comedy', 'Alekos Sakellarios, Pavlos Filippou, Kostas Lyhnaras', 'Alekos Sakellarios, Christos Giannakopoulos', 'Thanasis Veggos, Labros Konstadaras, Niki Linardou, Yorgos Moutsios, Dimitris Nikolaidis, Souli Sabah, Mitsi Konstadara, Giannis Vogiatzis', null, 'Antonis Tsilivikis, a stingy construction contractor, neglects his home and wife Eleni and forces her to lie to her rich uncle in America, Peter, in order to continue to send a monthly financial aid. But when the uncle notices that he comes to Greece, and in order not to reveal the truth, Antonis disguises himself as a retired named Beizanis, who supposedly rents a room at their home...', 'Antonis Tsilivikis, a stingy construction contractor, neglects his home and wife Eleni and forces her to lie to her rich uncle in America, Peter, in order to continue to send a monthly financial aid. But when the uncle notices that he comes to Greece, and in order not to reveal the truth, Antonis disguises himself as a retired named Beizanis, who supposedly rents a room at their home...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5dyrhSE81lc94Ynsc7ZZiK7NyzJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:297330'),
  ('1122530199668341915', 'I''ll Never Die Alone', 2008, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Adrián García Bogliano', 'Adrián García Bogliano', 'Andrés Aramburu, Gimena Blesa, Leonardo Canga, Magdalena De Santo, Marisol Tur, Andrea Duarte, Camila Loyza Basualdo, Leonardo Cuchetti', null, 'A violent thriller set in the outback of remote La Plata region, I''LL NEVER DIE ALONE (aka NO MORIRE SOLA) is a tough and pounding story of revenge for rape, mercilessly carried out by a group of women intent on pursuing their attackers to the bitter end.', 'A violent thriller set in the outback of remote La Plata region, I''LL NEVER DIE ALONE (aka NO MORIRE SOLA) is a tough and pounding story of revenge for rape, mercilessly carried out by a group of women intent on pursuing their attackers to the bitter end.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qJvSlVBoYaTtzCRQQR32aCnQ9yH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30026'),
  ('738151940354147720', 'I''ll Never Forget What''s''isname', 1967, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Michael Winner, Otto Heller', 'Peter Draper', 'Oliver Reed, Orson Welles, Carol White, Harry Andrews, Michael Hordern, Wendy Craig, Marianne Faithfull, Norman Rodway', 'NR', 'Advertising golden boy Andrew Quint is fed up with his fabulously successful life. In very dramatic fashion, he quits his job to return to writing for a small literary magazine. He wants to leave his former life behind, going as far as saying good-bye to his wife and mistresses. He finds, however, that it''s not so easy to escape the past.', 'Advertising golden boy Andrew Quint is fed up with his fabulously successful life. In very dramatic fashion, he quits his job to return to writing for a small literary magazine. He wants to leave his former life behind, going as far as saying good-bye to his wife and mistresses. He finds, however, that it''s not so easy to escape the past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/isgjO5QfslKGJaWGp2o3MjgPgZl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:139058'),
  ('902155394590177574', 'I''ll Never Heil Again', 1941, 'Comedy', 'Jules White, L. William O''Connell', 'Felix Adler', 'Curly Howard, Larry Fine, Moe Howard, Mary Ainslee, Vernon Dent, Ned Glass, Bud Jamison, Don Brodie', 'NR', 'The Stooges have taken over the country of Moronica. Moe is Hailstone the Dictator, Curly is a Field Marshal and Larry is Minister of Propaganda. The Stooges are planning with their allies to conquer the world, which mainly consists of fighting over a globe. The former king''s daughter gets into their headquarters and plants a bomb which Curly detonates. All ends well as the king regains control of the country and the Stooges wind up as trophies on the wall.', 'The Stooges have taken over the country of Moronica. Moe is Hailstone the Dictator, Curly is a Field Marshal and Larry is Minister of Propaganda. The Stooges are planning with their allies to conquer the world, which mainly consists of fighting over a globe. The former king''s daughter gets into their headquarters and plants a bomb which Curly detonates. All ends well as the king regains control of the country and the Stooges wind up as trophies on the wall.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c1oKlNaz0MxthabUbRV4xDjNnU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115992'),
  ('615055731058349376', 'I''ll Remember April', 1999, 'Drama, Family, War', 'Bob Clark, Stephen M. Katz', 'Mark Sanderson', 'Haley Joel Osment, Pat Morita, Trevor Morgan, Pam Dawber, Mark Harmon, Yuji Okumoto, Richard Taylor Olson, Yuki Tokuhiro', 'PG', 'Four young boys find a shipwrecked Japanese sailor during World War II and struggle with the decision to save him.', 'Four young boys find a shipwrecked Japanese sailor during World War II and struggle with the decision to save him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f1fFqWmBnOo3W05utBVLe3XPcJS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119349'),
  ('373452653488904770', 'I''ll See You in My Dreams', 1951, 'Comedy, Drama, Music', 'Ray Heindorf, Michael Curtiz, Ted D. McCord', 'Melville Shavelson, Jack Rose', 'Doris Day, Danny Thomas, Frank Lovejoy, Patrice Wymore, James Gleason, Mary Wickes, Julie Oshins, Jim Backus', 'NR', 'Songwriter Gus Kahn fights to make his name, then has to fight again to survive the Depression.', 'Songwriter Gus Kahn fights to make his name, then has to fight again to survive the Depression.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l7qBmXPwXUZRa17RI2M3MLbTnTV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43375'),
  ('122388068408497595', 'I''ll See You in My Dreams', 2003, 'Horror', 'Miguel Ángel Vivas, Pedro J. Márquez', 'Filipe Melo, Ivan Vivas', 'Rui Unas, Sofia Aparício, Manuel João Vieira, São José Correia, Adelino Tavares, João Didelet, David Almeida, Filipe Melo', null, 'The film is set in a small rural town that is haunted by the undead. Only one man seems to be able to stop them, and that is Lúcio, a worker whose wife recently turned into a zombie, forcing him to keep her locked in the basement. In a local tavern he finds a second shot at true love, but this blooming romance is threatened by the situation plaguing the town.', 'The film is set in a small rural town that is haunted by the undead. Only one man seems to be able to stop them, and that is Lúcio, a worker whose wife recently turned into a zombie, forcing him to keep her locked in the basement. In a local tavern he finds a second shot at true love, but this blooming romance is threatened by the situation plaguing the town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xFCANIsWVtW165onRmhyTEh78dF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80821'),
  ('1003566342026301273', 'I''ll See You in My Dreams', 2015, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Chad Rosen, Stephanie Cluff, Mikhaela Rosen', 'Brett Haley, Marc Basch', 'Blythe Danner, Martin Starr, June Squibb, Rhea Perlman, Mary Kay Place, Sam Elliott, Malin Åkerman, Aarti Mann', 'PG-13', 'A sudden loss disrupts Carol’s orderly life, propelling her into the dating world for the first time in 20 years. Finally living in the present tense, she finds herself swept up in not one, but two unexpected relationships that challenge her assumptions about what it means to grow old.', 'A sudden loss disrupts Carol’s orderly life, propelling her into the dating world for the first time in 20 years. Finally living in the present tense, she finds herself swept up in not one, but two unexpected relationships that challenge her assumptions about what it means to grow old.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nlOSiuSxWFPiFOIWoXxfRzcJW7s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:310121'),
  ('280903374996058400', 'I''ll Sleep When I''m Dead', 2003, 'Drama, Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Michael Garfath, Mike Hodges', 'Trevor Preston', 'Clive Owen, Jonathan Rhys Meyers, Charlotte Rampling, Malcolm McDowell, Jamie Foreman, Ken Stott, John Surman, Alexander Morton', 'R', 'Will Graham is a former London crime boss who has left his former life to live as a recluse in the forest. Haunted by the blood of those he has murdered, Will wishes never to return. But when his brother commits suicide following a sexual assault at the hands of a volatile car dealer, Will returns to London to discover the cause of his brother''s death and administer justice to those responsible.', 'Will Graham is a former London crime boss who has left his former life to live as a recluse in the forest. Haunted by the blood of those he has murdered, Will wishes never to return. But when his brother commits suicide following a sexual assault at the hands of a volatile car dealer, Will returns to London to discover the cause of his brother''s death and administer justice to those responsible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/azbXPYe22TpcxNOkLZNjtN84olR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3515'),
  ('245968810160808563', 'I''ll Take Sweden', 1965, 'Comedy, Music, Romance', 'Frederick de Cordova, Daniel L. Fapp, Herbert S. Greene', 'Nat Perrin', 'Bob Hope, Tuesday Weld, Frankie Avalon, Dina Merrill, Jeremy Slate, Rosemarie Frankland, Walter Sande, John Qualen', 'NR', 'Bob Holcomb will do anything to stop his daughter JoJo from tying the knot with her lazy boyfriend, even move her all the way to Sweden! But once they''re "safely" out of the country, JoJo falls for a sly Swedish playboy.', 'Bob Holcomb will do anything to stop his daughter JoJo from tying the knot with her lazy boyfriend, even move her all the way to Sweden! But once they''re "safely" out of the country, JoJo falls for a sly Swedish playboy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fVYo5fMABqkXeWDQmDom7KsgJ50.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39220'),
