  ('655298211813935689', 'I''ll Wait for the Next One...', 2002, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Philippe Orreindy', 'Thomas Gaudin', 'Sophie Forte, Thomas Gaudin, Pascal Casanova', null, 'On a subway train, a man announces that he''s looking for someone who might be interested in him; the usual dating methods have not worked, though there''s nothing wrong with him. He explains that any interested woman can just get off at the next stop. One woman looks interested...', 'On a subway train, a man announces that he''s looking for someone who might be interested in him; the usual dating methods have not worked, though there''s nothing wrong with him. He explains that any interested woman can just get off at the next stop. One woman looks interested...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iTu72Gxt4f1iqNH2bw5Qh9O9G3e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:162657'),
  ('763919348097535339', 'I''m a Cyborg, But That''s OK', 2006, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Park Chan-wook, Chung Chung-hoon, Park Hyun-won', 'Chung Seo-kyung', 'Lim Soo-jung, Rain, Oh Dal-su, Lee Yeong-mi, Kim Chun-gi, Park Jun-myun, Cheon Seong-hoon, Choi Hee-jin', null, 'Young-goon, mentally deranged and frequently electro-charging herself with a transistor radio, has been admitted into a mental institution. Firmly believing herself to be a cyborg, she refuses to consume like a human being. Il-soon is another patient, who catches the eye of Young-goon and soon becomes a close friend. Il-soon is now confronted with the biggest task: to cure Young-goon''s mental problem and have her eat real food.', 'Young-goon, mentally deranged and frequently electro-charging herself with a transistor radio, has been admitted into a mental institution. Firmly believing herself to be a cyborg, she refuses to consume like a human being. Il-soon is another patient, who catches the eye of Young-goon and soon becomes a close friend. Il-soon is now confronted with the biggest task: to cure Young-goon''s mental problem and have her eat real food.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x48ecVD1HbfQh3KZeK6LwRgVrOl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5488'),
  ('293914870749925448', 'I''m a Girl, I''m a Princess', 2021, 'Drama', 'Federico Palazzo, Nicolás Purdía, Paulina Dana', 'Federico Palazzo, José Paquez', 'Eleonora Wexler, Juan Palomino, Isabella G.C., Valentino Vena, Valentina Bassi, Lidia Catalano, Mariano Bertolini, Paola Barrientos', null, 'The story focuses on the life of a couple and their twin sons, one of whom begins to show that he identifies as a girl. From this, Gabriela, the mother, will try to understand the situation of her son who soon becomes a trans girl, thus beginning a struggle for the rights and gender identity of Luana , who will also have to face the rejection of her father Guillermo.', 'The story focuses on the life of a couple and their twin sons, one of whom begins to show that he identifies as a girl. From this, Gabriela, the mother, will try to understand the situation of her son who soon becomes a trans girl, thus beginning a struggle for the rights and gender identity of Luana , who will also have to face the rejection of her father Guillermo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kuQkWhEDqRZvs3LTWKfzOHg1baM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:812491'),
  ('1021227308844304265', 'I''m a Killer', 2016, 'History, Crime, Thriller', 'Maciej Pieprzyca, Paweł Dyllus', 'Maciej Pieprzyca', 'Mirosław Haniszewski, Arkadiusz Jakubik, Agata Kulesza, Magdalena Popławska, Karolina Staniec, Piotr Adamczyk, Tomasz Włosok, Michał Żurawski', null, 'Inspired by true events from the 1970s, the story revolves around a young detective who becomes the head of a police unit focused on catching a rampant serial killer of women, nicknamed ''The Silesian Vampire''.', 'Inspired by true events from the 1970s, the story revolves around a young detective who becomes the head of a police unit focused on catching a rampant serial killer of women, nicknamed ''The Silesian Vampire''.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r4zPukclIS35vmM6WChKQwzhk8g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:424782'),
  ('916646052331330882', 'I''m a Porn Star: Gay 4 Pay', 2016, 'Documentary', 'Charlie David', 'Charlie David', 'Solomon Aspen, Alex Mecum, Will Braun, Adam Bryant, Brent Everett, Diego Sans, Eddie Stone, Roman Todd', null, 'Welcome to the curious, surprising and always outspoken world of straight men who go Gay4Pay. Curiously, there is a disproportionate percentage of men working in gay porn who identify as straight. Why would a straight man do gay porn? What motivates him to try this or make a career of it? Why is there such keen interest and debate into the sexuality and personal lives of these men? And what does it say about us, the viewer that so much of gay porn is dominated by images of straight men?', 'Welcome to the curious, surprising and always outspoken world of straight men who go Gay4Pay. Curiously, there is a disproportionate percentage of men working in gay porn who identify as straight. Why would a straight man do gay porn? What motivates him to try this or make a career of it? Why is there such keen interest and debate into the sexuality and personal lives of these men? And what does it say about us, the viewer that so much of gay porn is dominated by images of straight men?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xZPN6n8GD4J6HOpDF5RFxMrgd20.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:445077'),
  ('726129295700936845', 'I''m a Woman Already', 1975, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Manuel Summers', 'Manuel Summers', 'Cristina Ramón, Beatriz Galbó, Dacil Márquez, Currito Martín, Juan José Flores, Andrés Pelaez, María José de la Fuente, Milagros Yagüe', null, 'This film follows a group of kids, all in various stages of puberty. The primary focus is on a girl of about twelve years old. Watch as she grows interested in sex, develops romantic feelings for a priest who teaches at her school, has a friend''s father hit on her, sexually engages with a peer.', 'This film follows a group of kids, all in various stages of puberty. The primary focus is on a girl of about twelve years old. Watch as she grows interested in sex, develops romantic feelings for a priest who teaches at her school, has a friend''s father hit on her, sexually engages with a peer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2hEDX9mIBBwHpw0c2b3WbDNnOoA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:430762'),
  ('1049315125738258449', 'I''m a Zombie, You''re a Zombie, She''s a Zombie', 1979, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Nello Rossati, Paolo Vidali, Sandro Mancori', 'Nello Rossati, Roberto Gianviti, Paolo Vidali', 'Renzo Montagnani, Duilio Del Prete, Cochi Ponzoni, Nadia Cassini, Gianfranco D''Angelo, Tullio Solenghi, Ghigo Masino, Giancarlo Sisti', null, 'An under-taker (Renzo Montagnini) unintentionally raises three accident victims from the dead while reading out-loud from a zombie pulp novel. He dies of a heart attack, but the zombies then turn around raise HIM with the same book, and the the four of them shamble off looking for food. After unsuccessfully trying to prey on passing motorists, they end up at an inn owned by the aunt of one of the men. After accidentally giving her a heart attack, they take over the inn and try dine on the guests, but their plans go hilariously awry as the movie turns into a parody of "Night of the Living Dead", its sequel (and Italian co-production) "Dawn of the Dead", as well as such classics as "Dead of Night" and even "The Wizard of Oz"', 'An under-taker (Renzo Montagnini) unintentionally raises three accident victims from the dead while reading out-loud from a zombie pulp novel. He dies of a heart attack, but the zombies then turn around raise HIM with the same book, and the the four of them shamble off looking for food. After unsuccessfully trying to prey on passing motorists, they end up at an inn owned by the aunt of one of the men. After accidentally giving her a heart attack, they take over the inn and try dine on the guests, but their plans go hilariously awry as the movie turns into a parody of "Night of the Living Dead", its sequel (and Italian co-production) "Dawn of the Dead", as well as such classics as "Dead of Night" and even "The Wizard of Oz"', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ioWidlVM74OnTToAbYPfFMTQ6mR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121519'),
  ('170606405913937598', 'I''m All Right Jack', 1959, 'Comedy', 'John Boulting, Mutz Greenbaum, Philip Shipway', 'Frank Harvey, John Boulting', 'Peter Sellers, Ian Carmichael, Terry-Thomas, Richard Attenborough, Dennis Price, Margaret Rutherford, Irene Handl, Liz Fraser', 'NR', 'Naive Stanley Windrush looks for a career in a family business. Much to his dismay, he finds work at a munitions factory where he has to start from the bottom, while both the management and the labor union use him as a tool in their fight for power.', 'Naive Stanley Windrush looks for a career in a family business. Much to his dismay, he finds work at a munitions factory where he has to start from the bottom, while both the management and the labor union use him as a tool in their fight for power.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4HD25hdMIcFAd0MbGCFM8t7G0sO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34783'),
  ('95175461951980994', 'I''m All Yours', 2015, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Baya Kasmi, Guillaume Deffontaines', 'Baya Kasmi, Michel Leclerc', 'Vimala Pons, Mehdi Djaadi, Agnès Jaoui, Ramzy Bedia, Laurent Capelluto, Claudia Tagbo, Anémone, Zinedine Soualem', null, 'Charming thirty-year-old Hanna Belkacem has inherited the gene from her parents: she is unable to say no. And as she is the Director of Human resources of a big firm such infirmity is not without its problems, particularly when she has to fire someone. The only solution she has found to be forgiven is to... get l* with the men she lays off!', 'Charming thirty-year-old Hanna Belkacem has inherited the gene from her parents: she is unable to say no. And as she is the Director of Human resources of a big firm such infirmity is not without its problems, particularly when she has to fire someone. The only solution she has found to be forgiven is to... get l* with the men she lays off!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/59oYX97oh9MNBwINCWMDp30nUYR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:352188'),
  ('335392783149342834', 'I''m Back', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Chantal Toesca, Guido Michelotti, Giaime Grieco', 'Nicola Guaglianone, Luca Miniero', 'Massimo Popolizio, Frank Matano, Stefania Rocca, Gioele Dix, Eleonora Belcamino, Ariella Reggio, Massimo De Lorenzo, Giancarlo Ratti', null, 'Benito Mussolini resurfaces in Rome 72 years after his death, as if not a single day had passed. Finding a country still full of problems, both old and new, his firebrand rhetoric wins him once again the hearts and minds of millions of Italians — who see him as a wacky reenactor who speaks inconvenient truths to power.', 'Benito Mussolini resurfaces in Rome 72 years after his death, as if not a single day had passed. Finding a country still full of problems, both old and new, his firebrand rhetoric wins him once again the hearts and minds of millions of Italians — who see him as a wacky reenactor who speaks inconvenient truths to power.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2R4rcoQaQSRpN5vtFnc9z8FsPkJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:495766'),
