  ('805644804616495079', 'I''m Dangerous Tonight', 1990, 'Horror, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Levie Isaacks, Tobe Hooper, Tom Blank', null, 'Mädchen Amick, Corey Parker, Daisy Hall, R. Lee Ermey, Natalie Schafer, Jason Brooks, William Berger, Mary Frann', 'R', 'An ancient Aztec cloth with a curse accidentally finds its way into the possession of a young woman. She decides to make a dress from the cloth. Whoever wears this cloth/dress comes under its spell; all inhibitions and moral responsibilities are lost.', 'An ancient Aztec cloth with a curse accidentally finds its way into the possession of a young woman. She decides to make a dress from the cloth. Whoever wears this cloth/dress comes under its spell; all inhibitions and moral responsibilities are lost.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/64uYMJpHCzuNwCxQonvO6hF5fMQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:183327'),
  ('229707100572140064', 'I''m Dead But I Have Friends', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Stéphane Malandrin, Guillaume Malandrin', 'Guillaume Malandrin, Stéphane Malandrin', 'Bouli Lanners, Wim Willaert, Serge Riaboukine, Eddy Leduc, Jacky Lambert, Marie-Renée André', null, 'Four bearded, hairy rock musicians - and Belgians - bury the singer of their group. Out of friendship and to prove to itself that nothing can stop them, they decide to leave on tour to Los Angeles with its ashes. The day before the departure, a serviceman with a moustache appears as the lover of their friend. Their journey takes an at least unexpected tour ...', 'Four bearded, hairy rock musicians - and Belgians - bury the singer of their group. Out of friendship and to prove to itself that nothing can stop them, they decide to leave on tour to Los Angeles with its ashes. The day before the departure, a serviceman with a moustache appears as the lover of their friend. Their journey takes an at least unexpected tour ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o6WkXqWRPgyG2hjshmax0sbgDwV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:345594'),
  ('1096167808661396305', 'I''m Flash!', 2012, 'Action, Drama', 'Toshiaki Toyoda, ZAK, Toyotarô Shigemori', 'Toshiaki Toyoda', 'Tatsuya Fujiwara, Ryuhei Matsuda, Tasuku Emoto, Mayu Harada, Itsuji Itao, Yukiya Kitamura, Kiko Mizuhara, Kento Nagayama', null, 'Rui is the charismatic leader of a new religious group. Consequently, he starts to gain attention from the mass media. After becoming involved in a car accident, Rui goes to a remote island with ex-gangster now bodyguard. On the island, Rui reveals more about his religious group, while a set of ominous events are about to occur.', 'Rui is the charismatic leader of a new religious group. Consequently, he starts to gain attention from the mass media. After becoming involved in a car accident, Rui goes to a remote island with ex-gangster now bodyguard. On the island, Rui reveals more about his religious group, while a set of ominous events are about to occur.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qaNjQgTF8vwo3GHKp0q4qoPxDQ7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:159562'),
  ('261473184678170061', 'I''m for the Hippopotamus', 1979, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy', 'Italo Zingarelli, Aiace Parolin, Renzo Marignano', 'Italo Zingarelli, Barbara Alberti, Amedeo Pagani', 'Terence Hill, Bud Spencer, Joe Bugner, May Dlamini, Dawn Jürgens, Ben Masinga, Les Marcowitz, Sandy Nkomo', 'PG-13', 'In Africa, Slim and Tom don''t like it when a German tyrant starts selling all of the African wildlife to Canadian zoos. Slim and Tom must teach this guy a lesson by beating the hell out of him and his gang.', 'In Africa, Slim and Tom don''t like it when a German tyrant starts selling all of the African wildlife to Canadian zoos. Slim and Tom must teach this guy a lesson by beating the hell out of him and his gang.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/voImabKBh1yzuOj7jfpApHuTW1s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9031'),
  ('212273220997670222', 'I''m from Hollywood', 1989, 'Comedy, Documentary', 'Joe Orr, Lynne Margulies', 'Lynne Margulies, Joe Orr', 'Andy Kaufman, Tony Danza, James Ray Hart, Marilu Henner, David Letterman, Bob Zmuda, Jerry Lawler, Robin Williams', 'NR', 'I''m from Hollywood is about the adventures of late performance artist Andy Kaufman in the world of professional wrestling. This film includes interviews with Taxi co-stars Marilu Henner and Tony Danza and interviews with comedian Robin Williams, wrestler Jerry Lawler, wrestling commentator Lance Russell, and Kaufman''s best friend, Bob Zmuda. Other people seen in the film include TV host David Letterman and Jimmy Hart of Continental Wrestling Association. The film''s title refers to a phrase spoken by Kaufman to the Memphis wrestling audience.', 'I''m from Hollywood is about the adventures of late performance artist Andy Kaufman in the world of professional wrestling. This film includes interviews with Taxi co-stars Marilu Henner and Tony Danza and interviews with comedian Robin Williams, wrestler Jerry Lawler, wrestling commentator Lance Russell, and Kaufman''s best friend, Bob Zmuda. Other people seen in the film include TV host David Letterman and Jimmy Hart of Continental Wrestling Association. The film''s title refers to a phrase spoken by Kaufman to the Memphis wrestling audience.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1pxJM4dzieK5pdPEei30EtQ28VJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63622'),
  ('186895284752197485', 'I''m Getting a Yacht', 1980, 'Comedy', 'Sergio Corbucci, Luigi Kuveiller, Amanzio Todini', 'Bruno Corbucci, Ernesto Gastaldi, Mario Amendola', 'Laura Antonelli, Johnny Dorelli, Christian De Sica, Cariddi Nardulli, Itaco Nardulli, Daniela Poggi, West Buchanan, Franco Giacobini', null, 'A dentist buys a small yacht and takes his two children on a cruise of the Mediterranean. His ex-wife stows away to keep an eye on the children and the inevitable happens.', 'A dentist buys a small yacht and takes his two children on a cruise of the Mediterranean. His ex-wife stows away to keep an eye on the children and the inevitable happens.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q0qlcxldXwx7zo4vtWR7H6IGtrP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:161497'),
