  ('437951556595153644', 'I''m Gilda', 2016, 'Drama, Music', 'Lorena Muñoz, Daniel Ortega, Santiago Boskovich', 'Tamara Viñes, María Laura Gargarella, Lorena Muñoz', 'Natalia Oreiro, Ángela Torres, Javier Drolas, Lautaro Delgado Tymruk, Susana Pampín, Daniel Valenzuela, Jordán Otero, Edwin Manrique', null, 'The life and death of the tropical singer Gilda.', 'The life and death of the tropical singer Gilda.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/weRetbMsMr0NjTHYCuKWPcWgwCZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:416680'),
  ('538352209312914767', 'I''m Glad I Did', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Selçuk Metin, Uğur İçbak', 'Zeynep Miraç', 'Tilbe Saran, Metin Akpınar, Demet Akbağ, Perran Kutman, Ahmet Gülhan, Cihat Tamer, Selma Sonat, Suat Sungur', null, 'Metin Akpınar has not been on the theater stage since 1992. In addition to TV series and movies, new generations were able to meet him with Devekuşu Kabare''s six plays that could be recorded. As if it was written today, those who watched had a taste of his unique acting in current plays. It was an acting that accompanied his talent and his intellectual background. "I''m Glad I Did", when transferring through the years Metin Akpinar he brought his own narrative, on the other hand, offers a different approach to Turkey''s recent history, leaving an archive for the future by refreshing memory.', 'Metin Akpınar has not been on the theater stage since 1992. In addition to TV series and movies, new generations were able to meet him with Devekuşu Kabare''s six plays that could be recorded. As if it was written today, those who watched had a taste of his unique acting in current plays. It was an acting that accompanied his talent and his intellectual background. "I''m Glad I Did", when transferring through the years Metin Akpinar he brought his own narrative, on the other hand, offers a different approach to Turkey''s recent history, leaving an archive for the future by refreshing memory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vzWIW1cuDpsTcMMsWXyO2U51F5g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:752973'),
  ('316988421233657799', 'I''m Glad It''s Christmas', 2022, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Ernie Barbarash', 'Joel Canfield, Steve Gottfried, Lisa Canfield', 'Jessica Lowndes, Paul Greene, Gladys Knight, Peggy Prud''homme, Sierra Wooldridge, Josh Reich, Dieter Lische-Parkes, Tammy Isbell', 'G', 'An aspiring Broadway singer is convinced to participate in a small-scale production for her local Christmas celebration. Along the way, she finds hope and unexpected mentorship towards her dream career. But will her professional success come at the cost of her chance at love?', 'An aspiring Broadway singer is convinced to participate in a small-scale production for her local Christmas celebration. Along the way, she finds hope and unexpected mentorship towards her dream career. But will her professional success come at the cost of her chance at love?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f06n8vO4sevRsWwwzlkfTa3eRXt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1022685'),
  ('1064845729346488491', 'I’m Glad My Mother Is Alive', 2009, 'Drama', 'Claude Miller, Nathan Miller', 'Claude Miller, Nathan Miller', 'Sophie Cattani, Christine Citti, Yves Verhoeven, Maxime Renard, Olivier Gueritée, Ludo Harley, Gabin Lefebvre, Quentin Gonzalez', null, 'Now a taciturn adult, an adoptee finds his biological mother and strikes up a relationship fraught with tension and emotion.', 'Now a taciturn adult, an adoptee finds his biological mother and strikes up a relationship fraught with tension and emotion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8OuC775VcPxYmomZX8RfERbwmWe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40522'),
  ('397863292767550661', 'I’m Going Home', 2001, 'Drama', 'Manoel de Oliveira, Sabine Lancelin', 'Jacques Parsi', 'Michel Piccoli, Catherine Deneuve, John Malkovich, Antoine Chappey, Leonor Baldaque, Sylvie Testud, Leonor Silveira, Isabel Ruth', null, 'The comfortable daily routines of aging Parisian actor Gilbert Valence, 76, are suddenly shaken when he learns that his wife, daughter, and son-in-law have been killed in a car crash. Having to take care of his now-orphaned grandson, he struggles to go on with his lifelong acting career like he''s used to. But the roles he is offered -- a flashy TV show and a hectic last-minute replacement in an English-language film of Joyce''s Ulysses -- finally convince him that it''s time to retire.', 'The comfortable daily routines of aging Parisian actor Gilbert Valence, 76, are suddenly shaken when he learns that his wife, daughter, and son-in-law have been killed in a car crash. Having to take care of his now-orphaned grandson, he struggles to go on with his lifelong acting career like he''s used to. But the roles he is offered -- a flashy TV show and a hectic last-minute replacement in an English-language film of Joyce''s Ulysses -- finally convince him that it''s time to retire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sh0VEL1VyTsSMJpw8yFBbugQ9BF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49685'),
  ('881191051416305727', 'I''m Going to Get You... Elliott Boy', 1971, 'Drama, Crime', 'Ed Forsyth, Peter Reusch', 'Ed Forsyth, Jerry Thomas', 'Ross Stephenson, Maureen McGill, Jeremy Hart, Edward Blessington, Don MacQuarrie, Paul Kelman, Larry Shreve, Bob McCord', null, 'Elliott was a loser who robbed the bank only to land in jail. In prison, he encounters homosexuality as every inmate wants to turn Elliott into a mate!', 'Elliott was a loser who robbed the bank only to land in jail. In prison, he encounters homosexuality as every inmate wants to turn Elliott into a mate!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ueBLoBV3NbswTZta2yB2dc9Kcei.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:369189'),
  ('898323152494586461', 'I''m Going to Live by Myself', 1982, 'Comedy', 'Marco Risi, Giuseppe Maccari, Franco Amurri', 'Jerry Calà, Marco Risi, Enrico Vanzina', 'Jerry Calà, Elvire Audray, Francesco Salvi, Franz Di Cioccio, Lando Buzzanca, Elsa Vazzoler, Alessandra Panelli, Stefano Altieri', null, 'Giacomino, tired of living at home with his parents, goes to his own place, but his neighbour, mr. Giuseppe, convinces himself to teach Giacomino about sex...', 'Giacomino, tired of living at home with his parents, goes to his own place, but his neighbour, mr. Giuseppe, convinces himself to teach Giacomino about sex...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mwQBo8RNoZCYX61sibWeTRzsCFO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82830'),
  ('788628972527233966', 'I''m Going to Santiago', 1964, 'Documentary', 'Sara Gómez, Mario García Joya', 'Sara Gómez', 'Victoria Nápoles', null, 'This black-and-white film is a loving portrait of Santiago de Cuba and its people. It provides a view of Cuba as a picturesque country, the product of an earthy mix of black and criollo cultures. The film uses historical images which portray the end of the eighteenth century when Haitian slave owners fled with their slaves to Cuba after the Haitian Revolution.', 'This black-and-white film is a loving portrait of Santiago de Cuba and its people. It provides a view of Cuba as a picturesque country, the product of an earthy mix of black and criollo cultures. The film uses historical images which portray the end of the eighteenth century when Haitian slave owners fled with their slaves to Cuba after the Haitian Revolution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tPnKAZGCN2RYop4VwWSmQu40EfR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:262028'),
  ('728502595106163767', 'I''m Going to Tell You a Secret', 2005, 'Documentary, Music', 'Jonas Åkerlund, Dago Gonzales, Eric Broms', null, 'Madonna, Stuart Price, Guy Ritchie, Michael Moore, Donna DeLory, Siedah Garrett, Jamie King, Iggy Pop', 'NR', 'A documentary that follows Madonna on her 2004 Re-Invention World Tour.', 'A documentary that follows Madonna on her 2004 Re-Invention World Tour.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4fOvOXO9cKmnsXcwAIFgO92NCD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36802'),
  ('802652503539972476', 'I''m Gonna Explode', 2008, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Gerardo Naranjo, Tobias Datum, Katina Medina Mora', 'Gerardo Naranjo', 'Juan Pablo de Santiago, María Deschamps, Daniel Giménez Cacho, Martha Claudia Moreno, Rebecca Jones, Renato Ornelas, Gustavo González, Carlos Narro', null, 'Tale of a young couple who throw caution to the wind and set out in search of their true fate. Román is the son of a contemptible, right-leaning congressman. Recently enrolled in a new high school, the rebellious teen clumsily attempts to hang himself on-stage at the big talent show. Maru is the sole member of the audience to applaud, earning both students a day of detention. After bonding during the course of their punishment, Román and Maru grab daddy''s gun, steal a Volkswagen, and hit the road bound for nowhere.', 'Tale of a young couple who throw caution to the wind and set out in search of their true fate. Román is the son of a contemptible, right-leaning congressman. Recently enrolled in a new high school, the rebellious teen clumsily attempts to hang himself on-stage at the big talent show. Maru is the sole member of the audience to applaud, earning both students a day of detention. After bonding during the course of their punishment, Román and Maru grab daddy''s gun, steal a Volkswagen, and hit the road bound for nowhere.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/99ys1u1up74ceKDZWwlkWZ4i7UT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86440'),
  ('1062937745910734055', 'I''m Gonna Git You Sucka', 1988, 'Comedy, Action, Crime', 'Keenen Ivory Wayans, Cathy Gesualdo, Elliot Lewis Rosenblatt', 'Keenen Ivory Wayans', 'Keenen Ivory Wayans, Bernie Casey, Antonio Fargas, Steve James, Isaac Hayes, Jim Brown, Ja''net DuBois, Dawnn Lewis', 'R', 'Jack Spade returns from the army in his old ghetto neighbourhood when his brother, June Bug, dies. Jack declares war on Mr. Big, powerful local crimelord. His army is led by John Slade, his childhood idol who used to fight bad guys in the 70s.', 'Jack Spade returns from the army in his old ghetto neighbourhood when his brother, June Bug, dies. Jack declares war on Mr. Big, powerful local crimelord. His army is led by John Slade, his childhood idol who used to fight bad guys in the 70s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4PZ0CED293fkLjwhPOQ6BpbUgU2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17006'),
  ('710076738444664269', 'I''m Here', 2010, 'Romance, Science Fiction, Drama', 'Spike Jonze, Adam Kimmel', 'Spike Jonze', 'Andrew Garfield, Sienna Guillory, Lyle Kanouse, Nancy Munoz, Annie Hardy, Daniel London, Michael Berry Jr., Aska Matsumiya', 'PG-13', 'A library assistant plods through an ordinary life in LA until a chance meeting opens his eyes to the power of creativity and ultimately, love. When this new life and love begin to fall apart, he discovers he has a lot to give. This short film proves that ordinary is no place to be.', 'A library assistant plods through an ordinary life in LA until a chance meeting opens his eyes to the power of creativity and ultimately, love. When this new life and love begin to fall apart, he discovers he has a lot to give. This short film proves that ordinary is no place to be.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1jq9zUwPIFGid3BMrLLcm3YY2nY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37058'),
  ('618012223108845293', 'I''m in Love with a Church Girl', 2013, 'Drama, Romance', 'Steve Race, Keith J. Duggan, Gino Caputi', 'Galley Molina', 'Ja Rule, Adrienne Bailon-Houghton, Stephen Baldwin, T-Bone, Martin Kove, Michael Madsen, Vincent Pastore, Michael Rivera', 'PG', 'Miles Montego has it all - cars, boats, good looks, mansion, money, women, but more importantly, he has a past.', 'Miles Montego has it all - cars, boats, good looks, mansion, money, women, but more importantly, he has a past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jgXsK9s2Nmy7T2A7Y4l7D0IMkz3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:207883'),
  ('189412945233262010', 'I''m in Love With My Little Sister', 2005, 'Romance, Animation, Drama', 'Mayumi Nishimoto, Yukiyo Teramoto, Hiroyuki Hayase', 'Touko Machida', 'Showtaro Morikubo, Mai Nakahara, Tomoko Kawakami, Sakiko Tamagawa, Toru Furusawa, Kohsuke Toriumi', null, 'Yori and his twin sister Iku used to be very close as children but lately Yori has grown colder toward Iku and is always eager to stay away from her. Iku was confused by Yori''s attitude. Actually Yori is in love with Iku and that forbidden love is causing Yori sleepless nights since Yori and Iku are sharing the same room with bunk beds. Yori tried to ease his intense desire for Iku by bedding Iku''s best friend. He had even applied to attend a boarding school in another city to take him far away from Iku. Yori lost his resolve to stay quiet about his feelings when Iku started to talk about having a boyfriend and going on dates. Now Yori want to have his little sister and he confessed. Iku loves her big brother and wanted them to stay together, so Iku is willing to anything to keep them together. But Yori wanted to have Iku as a lover, not as a sister loyal to her twin.', 'Yori and his twin sister Iku used to be very close as children but lately Yori has grown colder toward Iku and is always eager to stay away from her. Iku was confused by Yori''s attitude. Actually Yori is in love with Iku and that forbidden love is causing Yori sleepless nights since Yori and Iku are sharing the same room with bunk beds. Yori tried to ease his intense desire for Iku by bedding Iku''s best friend. He had even applied to attend a boarding school in another city to take him far away from Iku. Yori lost his resolve to stay quiet about his feelings when Iku started to talk about having a boyfriend and going on dates. Now Yori want to have his little sister and he confessed. Iku loves her big brother and wanted them to stay together, so Iku is willing to anything to keep them together. But Yori wanted to have Iku as a lover, not as a sister loyal to her twin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fRdxgR85XX5BAWsPETWW7t3UfdV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:470639'),
  ('674138908084878677', 'I''m in the Army Now', 1936, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Dave Fleischer, Willard Bowsky, Dave Tendlar', null, 'Jack Mercer, Mae Questel, Gus Wicke', null, 'Olive tells Popeye and Bluto that she loves a man in a uniform, so they try to sign up at the recruiting station - that can only take one of them.', 'Olive tells Popeye and Bluto that she loves a man in a uniform, so they try to sign up at the recruiting station - that can only take one of them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7HuueYCG3PMT2lJ5nJ1j9R6MuUR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:202281'),
  ('466187407817188377', 'I''m Just F*cking with You', 2019, 'Comedy, Horror, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Adam Mason, Thomas E. Nicholson, Lyn Moncrief', 'Gregg Zehentner, Scott Barkan', 'Keir O''Donnell, Hayes MacArthur, Jessica McNamee, Charles Halford, John Marshall Jones', 'NR', 'Siblings headed to a family wedding endure a night of increasingly frightening practical jokes while staying at a secluded motel.', 'Siblings headed to a family wedding endure a night of increasingly frightening practical jokes while staying at a secluded motel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gmUHZgxf8Eol8dM6XlFYRraEL8P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:586044'),
  ('201033738378946413', 'I''m Just Wild About Jerry', 1965, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Chuck Jones, Maurice Noble', null, null, null, 'Tom chases Jerry through city streets, gets run over by a streetcar (twice), and follows Jerry into a department store. In the toy department, they have some fun with radio-controlled cars and a collection of mouse dolls. They move on to sporting goods, where Jerry manages to combine table tennis with croquet.', 'Tom chases Jerry through city streets, gets run over by a streetcar (twice), and follows Jerry into a department store. In the toy department, they have some fun with radio-controlled cars and a collection of mouse dolls. They move on to sporting goods, where Jerry manages to combine table tennis with croquet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qlBHVMBWBQgFjy4MgDRRV6m8vDF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:234398'),
  ('587109579508547', 'I''m Losing It', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Anastasia Bagirova, Geta Bagdasarova, Evgenia Tkachenko', 'Konstantin Mayer', 'Aleksandra Bortich, Evgeniy Kulik, Irina Gorbacheva, Sergey Shnurov, Aleksandr Ptashenchuk, Elena Valyushkina, Valeriya Dergileva, Andrey Trushin', null, 'There''s two great loves in Anya''s life, her athlete boyfriend Zhenya and food. Zhenya is not happy how Anya has been gaining weight due to her eating habits and decides to dump her. But Anya doesn''t want to give up and decides to get rid of excess weight with the help of Nikolai, an overweight man obsessed with the healthy living.', 'There''s two great loves in Anya''s life, her athlete boyfriend Zhenya and food. Zhenya is not happy how Anya has been gaining weight due to her eating habits and decides to dump her. But Anya doesn''t want to give up and decides to get rid of excess weight with the help of Nikolai, an overweight man obsessed with the healthy living.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xrfBWqcJyUWjoMZSnSzV5GdwSAx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:497713'),
  ('1101752785404004664', 'I''m Losing My Temper', 1974, 'Comedy', 'Claude Zidi, Henri Decaë', 'Michel Fabre, Pierre Richard, Claude Zidi', 'Pierre Richard, Jane Birkin, Claude Piéplu, Jean Martin, Danielle Minazzoli, Julien Guiomar, Vittorio Caprioli, Henri Guybet', null, 'Pierre is a clumsy, overly serious math teacher at an all-girls high school. His life is thrown into chaos after encountering a beautiful British actress and the paparazzi that follow her around.', 'Pierre is a clumsy, overly serious math teacher at an all-girls high school. His life is thrown into chaos after encountering a beautiful British actress and the paparazzi that follow her around.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cOaaMaNXuKp6NpEFdGs6529pUdC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51212'),
  ('110041943359765514', 'I''m Losing You', 1998, 'Drama', 'Bruce Wagner, Rob Sweeney', 'Bruce Wagner', 'Rosanna Arquette, Frank Langella, Andrew McCarthy, Elizabeth Perkins, Amanda Donohoe, Daniel von Bargen, Aria Noelle Curzon, Salome Jens', null, 'Based on Bruce Wagner''s best selling novel, "I''m Losing You" is the gripping tale of a wealthy Los Angeles family and their journey from profound loss to love, hope and redemption. On the verge of his 60th birthday, patriarch and TV producer Perry Krohn is diagnosed with inoperable cancer and is told he has only months left to live. He delays telling his thirtysomething children, has-been actor Bertie and adopted daughter Rachel.', 'Based on Bruce Wagner''s best selling novel, "I''m Losing You" is the gripping tale of a wealthy Los Angeles family and their journey from profound loss to love, hope and redemption. On the verge of his 60th birthday, patriarch and TV producer Perry Krohn is diagnosed with inoperable cancer and is told he has only months left to live. He delays telling his thirtysomething children, has-been actor Bertie and adopted daughter Rachel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5tPU4WRaMp03Wta6wH9ukCbTF1m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:185746'),
  ('814840208511259984', 'I''m Mad', 1994, 'Comedy, Animation, Music', 'Rich Arons, Dave Marshall, Audu Paden', 'Randy Rogel', 'Rob Paulsen, Jess Harnell, Tress MacNeille', null, 'The Warner Brothers, Yakko and Wakko, and their sister Dot star in their first theater short. Yakko and Dot are constantly bickering while Wakko is complaining during a car ride with their psychiatrist Dr. Otto Scratchansniff. A mostly musical cartoon.', 'The Warner Brothers, Yakko and Wakko, and their sister Dot star in their first theater short. Yakko and Dot are constantly bickering while Wakko is complaining during a car ride with their psychiatrist Dr. Otto Scratchansniff. A mostly musical cartoon.', null, 'tmdb:movie:385920'),
  ('998984560833131738', 'I''m No Angel', 1933, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Wesley Ruggles, Leo Tover', 'Mae West', 'Mae West, Cary Grant, Gregory Ratoff, Edward Arnold, Ralf Harolde, Kent Taylor, Gertrude Michael, Russell Hopton', 'NR', 'Bold performer Tira works as dancing beauty and lion tamer at a fair. Out of an urgent financial need, she agrees to a risky new number: she''ll put her head into the lion''s mouth! With this attraction, the circus makes it to New York and Tira can pursue her dearest occupation — flirting with rich men and accepting expensive presents.', 'Bold performer Tira works as dancing beauty and lion tamer at a fair. Out of an urgent financial need, she agrees to a risky new number: she''ll put her head into the lion''s mouth! With this attraction, the circus makes it to New York and Tira can pursue her dearest occupation — flirting with rich men and accepting expensive presents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ttACv1NRimYH9JiyVwy5Kwq2nL0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34456'),
  ('1085671017077573941', 'I''m Not a Killer', 2019, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Andrea Zaccariello, Fabio Zamarion, Alessandro Specchio', 'Andrea Zaccariello', 'Riccardo Scamarcio, Alessio Boni, Edoardo Pesce, Claudia Gerini, Barbara Ronchi, Sarah Felberbaum, Vincenzo De Michele, Caterina Shulha', null, 'One livid dawn, a cold and damp wind blows as a man walks alone through the darkness. Deputy Police Superintendent Francesco Prencipe is on his way to meet his best friend, Judge Giovanni Mastropaolo whom he hasn''t seen for almost two years. The men drive for two hours and exchange but a few words. Later that morning, the Judge is found dead, a single gunshot wound to his head. Francesco is the last person who saw him and his ﬁngerprints are the only ones found in the house. But is he the murderer?', 'One livid dawn, a cold and damp wind blows as a man walks alone through the darkness. Deputy Police Superintendent Francesco Prencipe is on his way to meet his best friend, Judge Giovanni Mastropaolo whom he hasn''t seen for almost two years. The men drive for two hours and exchange but a few words. Later that morning, the Judge is found dead, a single gunshot wound to his head. Francesco is the last person who saw him and his ﬁngerprints are the only ones found in the house. But is he the murderer?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vWDROEuq5xgIqZ8wVEEGEKtaqDw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:592877'),
  ('205401158614180394', 'I''m Not a Robot', 2025, 'Comedy, Drama, Science Fiction', 'Victoria Warmerdam, Martijn van Broekhuizen, Johan Ivens', 'Victoria Warmerdam', 'Ellen Parren, Henry van Loon, Thekla Reuten, Juliette van Ardenne, Asma El Mouden, Sophie Höppener, Joep Vermolen, Sieger Sloot', null, 'A music producer spirals into an existential crisis after repeatedly failing a CAPTCHA test-leading her to question whether she might actually be a robot.', 'A music producer spirals into an existential crisis after repeatedly failing a CAPTCHA test-leading her to question whether she might actually be a robot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/QDYALBI8geKHDaiW9l9lT1mSxh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1178556'),
  ('738295699858781201', 'I''m Not Ashamed', 2016, 'Drama, Crime', 'Brian Baugh', 'Robin Hanley, Kari Redmond, Philipa Booyens', 'Masey McLain, Mark Daugherty, Jennifer O''Neill, Ben VanderMey, Jaci Velasquez, Emma Elle Roberts, Cameron McKendry, Terri Minton', 'PG-13', 'Based on the journal entries of Rachel Joy Scott, the first student killed in the Columbine High School shooting in 1999.', 'Based on the journal entries of Rachel Joy Scott, the first student killed in the Columbine High School shooting in 1999.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/P4bxuNq5XT0Wc3MYpoLP52e0P6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:409502'),
  ('986824977475460716', 'I''m Not Crazy!', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Nicolás López, Fernando Alé, Antonio Quercia', 'Guillermo Amoedo, Nicolás López', 'Paz Bascuñan, Marcial Tagle, Antonia Zegers, Carolina Paulsen, Gabriela Hernández, Fernanda Urrejola, Luis Pablo Román, Alison Mandel', null, 'A woman enters a quirky mental health clinic after attempting suicide upon finding out her husband is having an affair with her best friend.', 'A woman enters a quirky mental health clinic after attempting suicide upon finding out her husband is having an affair with her best friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a1pmA35FCWUcXVTC5bKY8BrB8zN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:493224'),
  ('110630849515123705', 'I''m Not Here', 2017, 'Drama', 'Pete Villani, Michelle Schumacher', 'Michelle Schumacher, Tony Cummings', 'J.K. Simmons, Sebastian Stan, Maika Monroe, Mandy Moore, Max Greenfield, Iain Armitage, Harold Perrineau, Jeremy Maguire', null, 'A man struggles with the tragic memories of his past to make sense of his present, but soon realizes that time isn''t the enemy he thinks it is.', 'A man struggles with the tragic memories of his past to make sense of his present, but soon realizes that time isn''t the enemy he thinks it is.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zyJyNCoR4rVi5OEYniLEOxYCM4b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:411139'),
  ('699780344884344908', 'I''m Not Rappaport', 1996, 'Comedy', 'Herb Gardner', 'Herb Gardner', 'Walter Matthau, Ossie Davis, Amy Irving, Craig T. Nelson, Boyd Gaines, Martha Plimpton, Guillermo Díaz, Elina Löwensohn', 'PG-13', 'Old Nat Moyer is a talker, a philosopher, and a troublemaker with a fanciful imagination. His companion is Midge Carter, who is half-blind, but still the super of an apartment house. When he is threatened with retirement, Nat battles on his behalf. Nat also takes on his daughter, a drug dealer, and a mugger in this appealing version of a really ''odd couple''.', 'Old Nat Moyer is a talker, a philosopher, and a troublemaker with a fanciful imagination. His companion is Midge Carter, who is half-blind, but still the super of an apartment house. When he is threatened with retirement, Nat battles on his behalf. Nat also takes on his daughter, a drug dealer, and a mugger in this appealing version of a really ''odd couple''.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1gatAVNrBnDnbbwj4FNIwlMBpUd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61536'),
  ('1054259398140999835', 'I''m Not Ready for Christmas', 2015, 'Family, TV Movie, Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Sam Irvin, Theo Angell', 'Hanz Wasserburger', 'Alicia Witt, George Stults, Brigid Brannagh, Dan Lauria, Mia Bagley, Maxwell Caulfield, Eli Baldwin, Derrick Dean', null, 'Holly finds her world turned upside-down when she suddenly finds herself incapable of lying. (Don’t you hate when that happens?) It’s because of a wish her niece made to Santa Claus. And now, with Christmas coming up fast, she has to come to terms with her natural penchant to want to fib while trying to do the right thing. And that’s no lie.', 'Holly finds her world turned upside-down when she suddenly finds herself incapable of lying. (Don’t you hate when that happens?) It’s because of a wish her niece made to Santa Claus. And now, with Christmas coming up fast, she has to come to terms with her natural penchant to want to fib while trying to do the right thing. And that’s no lie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qjos0Ijhp2w2AhDtVhN4vrwCmMS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:363478'),
  ('753613150641853897', 'I''m Not Scared', 2003, 'Mystery, Drama, Thriller, Crime', 'Gabriele Salvatores, Italo Petriccione, Fabiola Banzi', 'Niccolò Ammaniti, Francesca Marciano', 'Giuseppe Cristiano, Dino Abbrescia, Aitana Sánchez-Gijón, Diego Abatantuono, Fabio Tetta, Riccardo Zinna, Giulia Matturro, Antonella Stefanucci', 'R', 'In a tiny community enclosed by wheat fields, the adults shelter indoors, while six children venture out on their bikes across the scorched, deserted countryside. Exploring a dilapidated and uninhabited farmhouse, nine-year-old Michele discovers a secret so momentous, so terrible, that he dares not tell anyone about it …', 'In a tiny community enclosed by wheat fields, the adults shelter indoors, while six children venture out on their bikes across the scorched, deserted countryside. Exploring a dilapidated and uninhabited farmhouse, nine-year-old Michele discovers a secret so momentous, so terrible, that he dares not tell anyone about it …', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vTf4qR0OSuV4qBT8As4QoWxSJSq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25300'),
  ('336874087658594115', 'I''m Not There', 2007, 'Drama, Music', 'Todd Haynes, Edward Lachman, Fabrice Barrilliet', 'Todd Haynes, Oren Moverman', 'Christian Bale, Cate Blanchett, Marcus Carl Franklin, Richard Gere, Heath Ledger, Ben Whishaw, Charlotte Gainsbourg, David Cross', 'R', 'Six actors portray six personas of music legend Bob Dylan in scenes depicting various stages of his life, chronicling his rise from unknown folksinger to international icon and revealing how Dylan constantly reinvented himself.', 'Six actors portray six personas of music legend Bob Dylan in scenes depicting various stages of his life, chronicling his rise from unknown folksinger to international icon and revealing how Dylan constantly reinvented himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bucgvB7gQqcl1m71efHkenfIMTj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3902'),
  ('108291085050374056', 'I''m Not Your Mom', 2019, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Marcos Carnevale, Horacio Maira', 'Nicolás Allegro, Florencia Colacito, Marcos Carnevale', 'Julieta Díaz, Pablo Echarri, Sebastián Wainraich, Celina Font, Sofía Vladimirsky, Daniela Pal, Christian Sancho, Valeria Lois', null, 'A journalist states in her weekly column the reasons why she does not want to have any children, defending her position on life and motherhood. But she will have to rethink her beliefs when she meets her new neighbor and his little daughter.', 'A journalist states in her weekly column the reasons why she does not want to have any children, defending her position on life and motherhood. But she will have to rethink her beliefs when she meets her new neighbor and his little daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5yRBIxOAnEaQOqy0eYHX1rJWGQh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:609175'),
  ('495931060271262797', 'I''m Off Then', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Julia von Heinz, Felix Poplawsky', 'Jane Ainscough, Chris Silber, Sandra Nettelbeck', 'Devid Striesow, Martina Gedeck, Karoline Schuch, Katharina Thalbach, Annette Frier, Herwig Andres, Noah Wiechers, Moritz Knapp', null, 'Based on the book "Ich bin dann mal weg" by Hape Kerkeling where the author describes his journey on the Way of St. James, a pilgrimage route, and the people he encounters there.', 'Based on the book "Ich bin dann mal weg" by Hape Kerkeling where the author describes his journey on the Way of St. James, a pilgrimage route, and the people he encounters there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mfALps3CfdqpK5gOtnFTzfQbrE3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:361403'),
  ('751632639445445193', 'I''m Photogenic', 1980, 'Comedy', 'Dino Risi, Claudio Risi, Tonino Delli Colli', 'Marco Risi, Dino Risi, Massimo Franciosa', 'Renato Pozzetto, Edwige Fenech, Aldo Maccione, Julien Guiomar, Gino Santercole, Massimo Boldi, Livia Ermolli, Paolo Baroni', null, 'Antonio Barozzi moves from Lago Maggiore to Rome to become an actor. He does not realize his agent and acting coach are only manipulating him to further their own careers.', 'Antonio Barozzi moves from Lago Maggiore to Rome to become an actor. He does not realize his agent and acting coach are only manipulating him to further their own careers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/UnM9qltCcjXD6tq0B6BMuNKTfJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75336'),
  ('219922637382589662', 'I''m Reed Fish', 2007, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Zackary Adler, Doug Chamberlain, Jay Gira', 'Reed Fish', 'Jay Baruchel, Alexis Bledel, Victor Rasuk, Schuyler Fisk, A. J. Cook, Katey Sagal, Shiri Appleby, Chris Parnell', 'PG-13', 'When an old high school crush returns to his small hometown, Reed Fish''s once simple, calculated life begins to unravel. A drunken incident prompts Reed''s fiancée and the entire town to turn against him.', 'When an old high school crush returns to his small hometown, Reed Fish''s once simple, calculated life begins to unravel. A drunken incident prompts Reed''s fiancée and the entire town to turn against him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nHbj6Zkg6WSUnUx3Z3WqST25DAR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41044'),
  ('959875409582013860', 'I''m Rich!', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Pedro Antônio, Julio Costantini, Carol Durão', 'Vitor Brandt, Fil Braz', 'Samantha Schmütz, Katiuscia Canoro, Marcelo Adnet, Anderson Di Rizzi, Marcelo Mello Jr., Fabiana Karla, Marcus Majella, Silvio Matos', null, 'Selminha is a lower-class woman who receives a family inheritance, but only if she meets the challenge of spending 30 million reais in 30 days, without accumulating anything. However, in this marathon, she will find out that there are things that money does not buy.', 'Selminha is a lower-class woman who receives a family inheritance, but only if she meets the challenge of spending 30 million reais in 30 days, without accumulating anything. However, in this marathon, she will find out that there are things that money does not buy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/NtGVJWXFuBuYIcpI4UUGEm2Uyh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:322994'),
  ('723917448288604164', 'I''m So Excited!', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Pedro Almodóvar, José Luis Alcaine, Mariangel Domián', 'Pedro Almodóvar', 'Antonio Banderas, Penélope Cruz, Coté Soler, Antonio de la Torre, Hugo Silva, Miguel Ángel Silvestre, Laya Martí, Javier Cámara', 'R', 'Something has gone wrong with the landing gear of a plane en route from Madrid to Mexico City. The group of eccentric travelers on the flight, defenseless in the face of danger, indulge in colourful confessionals, while the outlandish crew attempts to find ways to entertain them.', 'Something has gone wrong with the landing gear of a plane en route from Madrid to Mexico City. The group of eccentric travelers on the flight, defenseless in the face of danger, indulge in colourful confessionals, while the outlandish crew attempts to find ways to entertain them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sQSHPwWlqW9AJEac6sakeIhrMZx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144789'),
  ('81221400817283419', 'I''m Staying', 2003, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Diane Kurys, Robert Alazraki', 'Florence Quentin', 'Sophie Marceau, Vincent Perez, Charles Berling, Hardy Krüger Jr., Pascale Roberts, Caroline Chaniolleau, Eric Santos, Colette Maire', null, 'A self-centered engineer tries to win back his wife after she takes a new lover.', 'A self-centered engineer tries to win back his wife after she takes a new lover.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Pi9UwHAPgBurfAGE7i0eTekJy6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72363'),
  ('1014748667470824980', 'I''m Staying', 2007, 'Comedy, Drama, Science Fiction', 'Evgeny Privin, Karen Oganesyan, Andrei Bludushkin', 'Alyona Zvantsova, Dmitriy Konstantinov', 'Andrey Krasko, Fyodor Bondarchuk, Elena Yakovleva, Nelly Uvarova, Andrey Sokolov, Vladimir Yepifantsev, Alyona Bondarchuk, Irina Grineva', null, 'Many people assume that life does not end after death. Not Dr. Tyrsa, practical and skeptical man, who never believed in this nonsense. However, thanks to the bowling accident, he finds himself in a desert land with people like him not belonging to this world yet not accepted into the other. Now Dr. Tyrsa realizes that the life he used to live was not so bad, and he''s got something worth returning to.', 'Many people assume that life does not end after death. Not Dr. Tyrsa, practical and skeptical man, who never believed in this nonsense. However, thanks to the bowling accident, he finds himself in a desert land with people like him not belonging to this world yet not accepted into the other. Now Dr. Tyrsa realizes that the life he used to live was not so bad, and he''s got something worth returning to.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sPZIuXRAq8stFZEuO44iNeno42R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33714'),
  ('832569813825341248', 'I''m Still a Superstar', 2025, 'Documentary, Music', 'Marc Pujolar, Toni Vidal, Inés Sorlat', 'Marc Pujolar, María Zuil', 'Yurena, Margarita Seisdedos, Loly Alvarez, Leonardo Dantés, Paco Porras, Tony Genil, Miguel Diego Ñiguez "Arleuquin", Nacho Vigalondo', null, 'This documentary explores Yurena''s meteoric rise to fame as Tamara, the media frenzy she faced in the 2000s and the present-day lives of her TV rivals.', 'This documentary explores Yurena''s meteoric rise to fame as Tamara, the media frenzy she faced in the 2000s and the present-day lives of her TV rivals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sb7JQgksW88sTeywHMGIvCz8JF4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1508562'),
  ('706710905727377697', 'I''m Still Here', 2010, 'Music, Comedy, Drama', 'Casey Affleck, Casey Affleck, Magdalena Górka', 'Casey Affleck, Joaquin Phoenix', 'Joaquin Phoenix, Antony Langdon, Carey Perloff, Larry McHale, Casey Affleck, Jack Nicholson, Billy Crystal, Danny Glover', 'R', 'I''m Still Here is a portrayal of a tumultuous year in the life of actor Joaquin Phoenix. With remarkable access, the film follows the Oscar-nominee as he announces his retirement from a successful film career in the fall of 2008 and sets off to reinvent himself as a hip-hop musician. The film is a portrait of an artist at a crossroads and explores notions of courage and creative reinvention, as well as the ramifications of a life spent in the public eye.', 'I''m Still Here is a portrayal of a tumultuous year in the life of actor Joaquin Phoenix. With remarkable access, the film follows the Oscar-nominee as he announces his retirement from a successful film career in the fall of 2008 and sets off to reinvent himself as a hip-hop musician. The film is a portrait of an artist at a crossroads and explores notions of courage and creative reinvention, as well as the ramifications of a life spent in the public eye.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h8c53OPv2miF6vzpVXQZX8jw1pJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43939'),
  ('594918526610525461', 'I''m the King of the Castle', 1989, 'Drama, Thriller, Romance', 'Régis Wargnier', 'Régis Wargnier, Alain Le Henry', 'Jean Rochefort, Dominique Blanc, Régis Arpin, David Behar, Pascale Le Goff, Frederic Renno', null, 'Thomas, the son of a millionaire lives a fairly isolated existence, in a mansion in rural France. His father hires a widowed woman to take care of things while he is away. The maid''s son, Charles moves in as well, and the two parents hope that the two can become friends but they become enemies immediately after meeting each other. Once their parents fall in love, Thomas decides to make Charles, who he views as an "invader", as miserable as possible.', 'Thomas, the son of a millionaire lives a fairly isolated existence, in a mansion in rural France. His father hires a widowed woman to take care of things while he is away. The maid''s son, Charles moves in as well, and the two parents hope that the two can become friends but they become enemies immediately after meeting each other. Once their parents fall in love, Thomas decides to make Charles, who he views as an "invader", as miserable as possible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hXcDA0tkgqdt9xbRxCsrrMEOQud.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36503'),
  ('616190609199726979', 'I''m Thinking of Ending Things', 2020, 'Mystery, Thriller, Drama', 'Charlie Kaufman, Simón Wilches, Merissa Lombardo', 'Charlie Kaufman', 'Jesse Plemons, Jessie Buckley, Toni Collette, David Thewlis, Guy Boyd, Hadley Robinson, Gus Birney, Abby Quinn', 'R', 'Nothing is as it seems when a woman experiencing misgivings about her new boyfriend joins him on a road trip to meet his parents at their remote farm.', 'Nothing is as it seems when a woman experiencing misgivings about her new boyfriend joins him on a road trip to meet his parents at their remote farm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5ynWWapdl45hJXUh0KIevxSG9JQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:500840'),
  ('1090255468920107486', 'I''m Totally Fine', 2022, 'Comedy, Science Fiction, Drama', 'Wojciech Kielar, Brandon Dermer', 'Alisha Ketry', 'Jillian Bell, Natalie Morales, Kyle Newacheck, Harvey Guillén, Karen Maruyama, Blake Anderson, Cyrina Fiallo', null, 'Vanessa embarks on a solo trip after the death of her best friend, Jennifer. However, her self-care plans change when she finds Jennifer standing in her kitchen, claiming to be an extraterrestrial.', 'Vanessa embarks on a solo trip after the death of her best friend, Jennifer. However, her self-care plans change when she finds Jennifer standing in her kitchen, claiming to be an extraterrestrial.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4eCfOPqoE5ezwQCgVGQszwlxdJh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:800282'),
  ('853536860630926481', 'I''m with Lucy', 2002, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Jon Sherman, Tom Richmond', 'Eric Pomerance', 'Monica Potter, Julianne Nicholson, Flora Martínez, Harold Ramis, Julie Christie, Craig Bierko, John Hannah, David Boreanaz', 'R', 'It''s an hour before Lucy''s wedding and her best friend wants to hear all about what led up to that moment. So, Lucy tells about the five men she had blind dates with over the past year (Doug, Gabriel, Bobby, Barry, and Luke) and her experiences with each one. But which one of the five men is Lucy about to walk down the aisle with?', 'It''s an hour before Lucy''s wedding and her best friend wants to hear all about what led up to that moment. So, Lucy tells about the five men she had blind dates with over the past year (Doug, Gabriel, Bobby, Barry, and Luke) and her experiences with each one. But which one of the five men is Lucy about to walk down the aisle with?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iz4zN7fGHxvJS5BuXWSFIWWv9kT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20718'),
  ('997291553652017517', 'I''m Your Man', 2021, 'Science Fiction, Comedy, Romance', 'Benedict Neuenfels, Maria Schrader', 'Maria Schrader, Jan Schomburg', 'Maren Eggert, Dan Stevens, Sandra Hüller, Hans Löw, Wolfgang Hübsch, Annika Meier, Falilou Seck, Jürgen Tarrach', 'R', 'Alma is a scientist coerced into participating in an extraordinary study in order to obtain research funds for her work. For three weeks, she has to live with a humanoid robot tailored to her character and needs, whose artificial intelligence is designed to be the perfect life partner for her. Enter Tom, a machine in human form in a class of its own, created solely to make her happy.', 'Alma is a scientist coerced into participating in an extraordinary study in order to obtain research funds for her work. For three weeks, she has to live with a humanoid robot tailored to her character and needs, whose artificial intelligence is designed to be the perfect life partner for her. Enter Tom, a machine in human form in a class of its own, created solely to make her happy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v13p6KlgD7Y1Tas6X8GLJzv5zRe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:795813'),
  ('74360153181144545', 'I''m Your Woman', 2020, 'Crime, Drama', 'Bryce Fortner, Julia Hart', 'Jordan Horowitz, Julia Hart', 'Rachel Brosnahan, Marsha Stephanie Blake, Arinzé Kene, Bill Heck, Frankie Faison, Marceline Hugot, James McMenamin, Jameson Charles', 'R', 'A woman is forced to go on the run after her husband betrays his partners, sending her and her baby on a dangerous journey.', 'A woman is forced to go on the run after her husband betrays his partners, sending her and her baby on a dangerous journey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uTcJAxIV8BzNXuvcViBSibQSBid.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:643612'),
  ('660045970460965570', 'I''m Yours', 2012, 'Romance, Drama', 'Leonard Farlinger, Jonathon Cliff', 'Leonard Farlinger', 'Rossif Sutherland, Karine Vanasse, Don McKellar, Nicholas Campbell, Marie-Hélène Fontaine, Gregory ''Dominic'' Odjig, Ella Jonas Farlinger, Gregory Ambrose Calderone', null, 'A road movie romance that conjures a heady concoction of free love and end of the world conspiracy.', 'A road movie romance that conjures a heady concoction of free love and end of the world conspiracy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wBC3X3VN2OwSSfq9rhSEsEqzOHE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:132955'),
  ('512230987806052645', 'I''ve Always Liked You', 2016, 'Animation, Drama, Romance', 'Hideki Okamoto, Kazuya Aiura, Tetsuya Yanagisawa', 'Yoshimi Narita', 'Aki Toyosaki, Haruka Tomatsu, Kana Asumi, Yuki Kaji, Kenichi Suzumura, Hiroshi Kamiya, Hikaru Midorikawa, Tsubasa Yonaga', null, 'Love is blooming at Sakuragaoka High School. Natsuki Enomoto has finally mustered the courage to confess to her childhood friend, Yuu Setoguchi. However, in the final moments of her confession, an embarrassed Natsuki passes it off as a "practice confession." Oblivious to her true feelings and struggling with his own, Yuu promises to support Natsuki in her quest for love. While Natsuki deals with her failed confession, fellow classmate Koyuki Ayase struggles with his own feelings for Natsuki. Despite his timidness, he is determined to win over her heart. This movie follows Natsuki as she dreams of one day ending her practices and genuinely confessing to Yuu. Meanwhile, close friends also find themselves entangled in their own webs of unrequited love and unspoken affections.', 'Love is blooming at Sakuragaoka High School. Natsuki Enomoto has finally mustered the courage to confess to her childhood friend, Yuu Setoguchi. However, in the final moments of her confession, an embarrassed Natsuki passes it off as a "practice confession." Oblivious to her true feelings and struggling with his own, Yuu promises to support Natsuki in her quest for love. While Natsuki deals with her failed confession, fellow classmate Koyuki Ayase struggles with his own feelings for Natsuki. Despite his timidness, he is determined to win over her heart. This movie follows Natsuki as she dreams of one day ending her practices and genuinely confessing to Yuu. Meanwhile, close friends also find themselves entangled in their own webs of unrequited love and unspoken affections.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rQDnIuWMYdZ2BXwaqy4Ird4w8Kw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:374853'),
  ('362658219156196972', 'I''ve Been Waiting for You', 1998, 'Thriller, Horror, TV Movie', 'Jon Joffin, Christopher Leitch', null, 'Sarah Chalke, Soleil Moon Frye, Ben Foster, Christian Campbell, Maggie Lawson, Chad Cox, Markie Post, Tom Dugan', 'PG-13', 'When a New England high schooler is mysteriously murdered, the town blames Sarah, the new girl who recently moved into a purportedly haunted house and who they believe to be the reincarnation of a witch who was burned at the stake 300 years ago.', 'When a New England high schooler is mysteriously murdered, the town blames Sarah, the new girl who recently moved into a purportedly haunted house and who they believe to be the reincarnation of a witch who was burned at the stake 300 years ago.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vtb5CtWqRZWmRG8g07dhMW9MeUT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117904'),
  ('339334600805440000', 'I''ve Been Waiting So Long', 2004, 'Drama, Romance', 'Thierry Klifa, Pierre Aïm', 'Thierry Klifa, Christopher Thompson', 'Nathalie Baye, Patrick Bruel, Géraldine Pailhas, Anouk Grinberg, Danielle Darrieux, François Berléand, Michaël Cohen, Stéphane Guillon', null, 'A married Frenchwoman living in Brazil returns to her native country to visit her ailing elderly mother. There, she ends up rekindling a love affair with a man whom she hadn''t seen in twelve years.', 'A married Frenchwoman living in Brazil returns to her native country to visit her ailing elderly mother. There, she ends up rekindling a love affair with a man whom she hadn''t seen in twelve years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nawQTnQ1BfFswTldkVqBu8yamNB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78692'),
