  ('276653602522976026', 'Iberia', 2005, 'Documentary', 'Carlos Saura', null, 'Sara Baras, Antonio Canales, Marta Carrasco', null, 'Adaptation of the suite "Iberia" by Isaac Albeniz. Documentary about the world of flamenco. The story arises from the music itself and those who interpret it: the musicians and dancers. The film recreates and reinvents musical pieces and merges classical ballet, contemporary and Spanish dance and flamenco', 'Adaptation of the suite "Iberia" by Isaac Albeniz. Documentary about the world of flamenco. The story arises from the music itself and those who interpret it: the musicians and dancers. The film recreates and reinvents musical pieces and merges classical ballet, contemporary and Spanish dance and flamenco', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rW4rdN2J0pTt9A5KitMP7u65XWW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102368'),
  ('316685305456279200', 'Ibitsu', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Toshiyuki Morioka', 'Toshiyuki Morioka', 'Hitomi Komatani, Sasa Handa, Masahiro Ishida, Yorie Yamashita, Shuichi Yamauchi, Dandî Sakano, Azusa Sato', null, 'High school girl Madoka may look pretty and cute, but there is another side to her. She can exact revenge, land a good punch or a kick and not care about limits. She opts to inflict pain, coerce and blackmail a virgin when she is sensually touched on the train. She begins making his life hell.', 'High school girl Madoka may look pretty and cute, but there is another side to her. She can exact revenge, land a good punch or a kick and not care about limits. She opts to inflict pain, coerce and blackmail a virgin when she is sensually touched on the train. She begins making his life hell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tIubB80AKoWkTnnZLNzINNUTYDz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:438505'),
