  ('725897870827991464', 'Ibiza', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Denis Rouden, Arnaud Lemort', 'Mathieu Oullion, Arnaud Lemort', 'Christian Clavier, Mathilde Seigner, Léopold Buchsbaum, JoeyStarr, Olivier Marchal, Frédérique Bel, Louis-Do de Lencquesaing, Alexis Corso', null, 'A mature podiatrist, his girlfriend and her teenage children travel Ibiza to live a crazy holidays.', 'A mature podiatrist, his girlfriend and her teenage children travel Ibiza to live a crazy holidays.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ml0RD4YEycTKAGiHuFyaMd96FYn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:531735'),
  ('26082970177432100', 'Iblard Time', 2007, 'Animation, Fantasy, Adventure, Mystery', 'Naohisa Inoue, Kenichi Konishi', 'Naohisa Inoue', null, null, 'A quiet stroll through the imaginary world of Iblard, originally depicted in the paintings by Naohisa Inoue, influenced by Impressionism and Surrealism.', 'A quiet stroll through the imaginary world of Iblard, originally depicted in the paintings by Naohisa Inoue, influenced by Impressionism and Surrealism.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uhb2Buog6cFCSVMR4TTMxb9X1bO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21534'),
  ('815588053394876656', 'İbo and Güllüşah', 1977, 'Comedy', 'Atıf Yılmaz, Turgut Ceviker, Sami Güçlü', 'İhsan Bilsev, Türker İnanoğlu, Deniz Türkali', 'Kemal Sunal, Gülşah Alkoçlar, Ayşen Gruda, Deniz Türkali, Bilge Zobu, Celile Toyon, Ali Şen, Halit Gungor', null, 'A poor villager who cannot marry the girl he loves because he cannot afford a bride-price, follows her to Istanbul. But he is unable to raise the money and appear in front of his father. Meanwhile, his friendship with a little girl he meets by chance complicates everything. Seeking attention from her family, the girl tells the young man to kidnap her for ransom. In this way, both she will test whether she is loved or not, and the poor boy will get the girl he loves and wants to marry thanks to the ransom. But things turn into a tangle in an instant.', 'A poor villager who cannot marry the girl he loves because he cannot afford a bride-price, follows her to Istanbul. But he is unable to raise the money and appear in front of his father. Meanwhile, his friendship with a little girl he meets by chance complicates everything. Seeking attention from her family, the girl tells the young man to kidnap her for ransom. In this way, both she will test whether she is loved or not, and the poor boy will get the girl he loves and wants to marry thanks to the ransom. But things turn into a tangle in an instant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mJeVnn0GvpFEDKxKcVA4FzZCE3C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:111803'),
  ('955526638041934737', 'iBoy', 2017, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'Adam Randall, Eben Bolter', 'Mark Denton, Jonny Stockwood', 'Bill Milner, Maisie Williams, Rory Kinnear, Miranda Richardson, Jordan Bolger, Charley Palmer Rothwell, Helen Daniels, Aymen Hamdouchi', null, 'After an accident, Tom wakes from a coma to discover that fragments of his smart phone have been embedded in his head, and worse, that returning to normal teenage life is impossible because he has developed a strange set of super powers.', 'After an accident, Tom wakes from a coma to discover that fragments of his smart phone have been embedded in his head, and worse, that returning to normal teenage life is impossible because he has developed a strange set of super powers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f5dMAWXLjp8duA44Lp40WZFGZB0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:414190'),
  ('840607360462365789', 'Ibrahim', 2021, 'Drama', 'Samir Guesmi', null, 'Samir Guesmi, Abdelrani Bendaher, Luàna Bajrami, Rabah Nait Oufella, Philippe Rebbot, Florence Loiret Caille', null, 'When teenage Ibrahim lands his father with an unexpected debt, he resolves to do whatever it takes to make amends and gain his father’s respect.', 'When teenage Ibrahim lands his father with an unexpected debt, he resolves to do whatever it takes to make amends and gain his father’s respect.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gGRvFA02Kb1WcwIBBEQWcrTOtrv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:712158'),
  ('354488225971198375', 'Ibrahim El-Abyad', 2009, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Hossam Ali, Marwan Hamed, Sameh Selim', 'Abbas Abu Elhassan', 'Ahmed Al Saqqa, Hend Sabry, Mahmoud Abdel Aziz, Amr Waked, Khaled Kamal, Mohamed Mamdouh, Sayed Ragab, Nedal Al Shafeay', null, 'After witnessing the murder of his father as a child, Ibrahim is drawn into the criminal underworld of Egypt. While making a name for himself with his best friend Ashri, he finds his high school sweetheart Houria and manages to rekindle their love, but paths intertwine with Abdel Malik Zarzor, the city''s crime lord, who is connected somehow to Houria.', 'After witnessing the murder of his father as a child, Ibrahim is drawn into the criminal underworld of Egypt. While making a name for himself with his best friend Ashri, he finds his high school sweetheart Houria and manages to rekindle their love, but paths intertwine with Abdel Malik Zarzor, the city''s crime lord, who is connected somehow to Houria.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o6OJxg7gdjvmtTP7kl6a7CAyvhP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103364'),
  ('949471528657179647', 'iCarly: iGo to Japan', 2008, 'Comedy, Family, TV Movie, Adventure', 'Mike Spodnik, Steve Hoefer', null, 'Miranda Cosgrove, Jennette McCurdy, Nathan Kress, Jerry Trainor, Mary Scheer, Elaine Mani Lee, Ally Maki, Harry Shum Jr.', 'G', 'Carly, Sam and Freddie kick off their adventure in Japan on a tin can of a plane packed with caged possums and piloted by Spencer''s odd acquaintance.', 'Carly, Sam and Freddie kick off their adventure in Japan on a tin can of a plane packed with caged possums and piloted by Spencer''s odd acquaintance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i0TxUi4osHGcgORmpjHmzcff2AF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62459'),
  ('815427843471341048', 'Icarus', 2010, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Dolph Lundgren, Marc Windon', 'Raul Sanchez Inglis', 'Dolph Lundgren, Samantha Ferris, David James Lewis, Bo Svenson, Katelyn Mager, Lindsay Maxwell, Monique Ganderton, Marian Koprada', 'R', 'Trained KGB assassin, Edward Genn (code name ICARUS), worked years ago as a sleeper agent in America. But when the Soviet Union collapsed, he quickly found himself in a foreign country with no one to trust. Determined to escape his muddled existence, Edward tries to start over. He assumes a new identity, starts a family and tries to start his own legitimate business that could potentially pull him out of his world of being a hitman.', 'Trained KGB assassin, Edward Genn (code name ICARUS), worked years ago as a sleeper agent in America. But when the Soviet Union collapsed, he quickly found himself in a foreign country with no one to trust. Determined to escape his muddled existence, Edward tries to start over. He assumes a new identity, starts a family and tries to start his own legitimate business that could potentially pull him out of his world of being a hitman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cmDDkOXzEICJ3v6pIxOsmulwPi9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35402'),
  ('591907908997739221', 'Icarus', 2017, 'Documentary', 'Bryan Fogel, Jake Swantko, Timothy Rode', 'Bryan Fogel, Mark Monroe, Jon Bertain', 'Bryan Fogel, Dave Zabriskie, Don Catlin, Grigory Rodchenkov, Scott Brandt, Ben Stone, Richard Pound, Richard McLaren', null, 'While investigating the furtive world of illegal doping in sports, director Bryan Fogel connects with renegade Russian scientist Dr. Grigory Rodchenkov—a pillar of his country’s “anti-doping” program. Over dozens of Skype calls, urine samples, and badly administered hormone injections, Fogel and Rodchenkov grow closer despite shocking allegations that place Rodchenkov at the center of Russia’s state-sponsored Olympic doping program.', 'While investigating the furtive world of illegal doping in sports, director Bryan Fogel connects with renegade Russian scientist Dr. Grigory Rodchenkov—a pillar of his country’s “anti-doping” program. Over dozens of Skype calls, urine samples, and badly administered hormone injections, Fogel and Rodchenkov grow closer despite shocking allegations that place Rodchenkov at the center of Russia’s state-sponsored Olympic doping program.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x5azMi1KvZWbBbfjmGqpHNGqjH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:432976'),
  ('577183187251994264', 'Icarus', 2022, 'Animation, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Carlo Vogele', 'Isabelle Andrivet, Carlo Vogele', 'Féodor Atkine, Camille Cottin, Niels Schneider, Wolf Van Cappellen, Mark Irons, Igor van Dessel, Maia Baran, Alexis Flamant', null, 'On the island of Crete, a day-dreamy boy named Icarus befriends a mysterious creature with the body of a man and the head of a bull named Asterion (aka the Minotaur). When the King asks Icarus’ father, a famous inventor, to work on a secret project, Icarus realizes his new friend is in danger.', 'On the island of Crete, a day-dreamy boy named Icarus befriends a mysterious creature with the body of a man and the head of a bull named Asterion (aka the Minotaur). When the King asks Icarus’ father, a famous inventor, to work on a secret project, Icarus realizes his new friend is in danger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aCEGjd8Mjn8G98vTyiPKIZWbGXU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:921253'),
  ('793681975282509152', 'Ice', 1970, 'Drama, Science Fiction', 'Robert Kramer, Robert Machover', 'Robert Kramer', 'Leo Braudy, Robert Kramer, Paul McIsaac', 'NR', 'An underground revolutionary group struggles against internal strife to stage urban guerilla attacks against a fictionalized fascist regime in the United States. Interspersed throughout the narrative are rhetorical sequences that explain the philosophy of radical action and restrain the melodrama inherent in the thriller genre.', 'An underground revolutionary group struggles against internal strife to stage urban guerilla attacks against a fictionalized fascist regime in the United States. Interspersed throughout the narrative are rhetorical sequences that explain the philosophy of radical action and restrain the melodrama inherent in the thriller genre.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/onn0tZPFkQSrTcaYA3RcCsWi5IZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:161915'),
  ('506695589514344885', 'Ice', 1994, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Brook Yeaton, Scott Hohnbaum, Garett Griffin', 'Sean Dash', 'Traci Lords, Zach Galligan, Jorge Rivero, Jaime Alba, Floyd Levine, Phillip Troy Linger, Michael Bailey Smith, Jean St. James', null, 'A married couple of cat burglars scheme to rob a set of stolen diamonds from the local mafia only to be hampered by persistent police detectives, another scam artist, and a rival mob group.', 'A married couple of cat burglars scheme to rob a set of stolen diamonds from the local mafia only to be hampered by persistent police detectives, another scam artist, and a rival mob group.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5lr0uiXKtpqjGzPtXzT9ItA8ReU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94028'),
  ('504577750991338089', 'Ice', 1998, 'Action, Adventure, TV Movie', 'Jean de Segonzac, Mike Fash', 'Bruce A. Taylor, Roderick Taylor', 'Eva LaRue, Grant Show, Karen Waddell, Audie England, Kristin Booth, Udo Kier, Katherine Trowell, Sandra Feldman', 'PG-13', 'After the whole North of the Equator freezes below zero, a group of people in Los Angeles risk their lives while trying to "escape" from the city''s hostile conditions, in order to take a ship to a hotter place on Earth.', 'After the whole North of the Equator freezes below zero, a group of people in Los Angeles risk their lives while trying to "escape" from the city''s hostile conditions, in order to take a ship to a hotter place on Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tilZyozOjIZVEPZvz7nCXLTjv09.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36979'),
  ('1014355930434385694', 'Ice', 2011, 'Thriller, Action, Science Fiction', 'Nick Copus, Lawrence Woodward, Simon Ambridge', 'Ray Harding', 'Richard Roxburgh, Frances O''Connor, Claire Forlani, Ben Cross, Stephen Moyer, Sam Neill, Simon Callow, Patrick Bergin', null, 'It is 2020. Findings by environmental scientist Professor Thom Archer suggest that Halo, the corporate energy company drilling on the Greenland Glacier are causing it to melt. Archer''s warnings are ignored, so he heads to the Arctic to find indisputable evidence. Upon arrival, he realizes humankind is under immediate threat, and races home to save his family. The glacier collapses, with devastating consequences. Astonishing weather patterns emerge and plunge the world''s temperatures into steep decline.', 'It is 2020. Findings by environmental scientist Professor Thom Archer suggest that Halo, the corporate energy company drilling on the Greenland Glacier are causing it to melt. Archer''s warnings are ignored, so he heads to the Arctic to find indisputable evidence. Upon arrival, he realizes humankind is under immediate threat, and races home to save his family. The glacier collapses, with devastating consequences. Astonishing weather patterns emerge and plunge the world''s temperatures into steep decline.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4sgpgF4Li9Bfrl0x5GpOLjIN4u9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121442'),
  ('153585955424745406', 'Ice', 2018, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Oleg Trofim, Yuliya Marina, Andrey Belchikov', 'Andrey Zolotarev, Oleg Malovichko', 'Aglaya Tarasova, Mariya Aronova, Alexander Petrov, Miloš Biković, Kseniya Rappoport, Yan Tsapnik, Kseniya Lavrova-Glinka, Pavel Maykov', null, 'Contemporary Russia. Nadya gives up her dream of becoming a champion figure skater when she is hospitalized with an injury. But then she meets Sasha, a hockey player, who decides to teach her to believe in herself and her dream again.', 'Contemporary Russia. Nadya gives up her dream of becoming a champion figure skater when she is hospitalized with an injury. But then she meets Sasha, a hockey player, who decides to teach her to believe in herself and her dream again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sySCOn2MBNcOy5w4iYYpYgWTcA6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:440630'),
  ('921593504043146765', 'Ice 2', 2020, 'Drama, Romance', 'Marina Tarasova, Grigoriy Yablochnikov, Stanislav Krechkov', 'Andrey Zolotarev, Zhora Kryzhovnikov', 'Alexander Petrov, Mariya Aronova, Aglaya Tarasova, Vitaliya Kornienko, Nadezhda Mikhalkova, Yuliya Khlynina, Sergey Lavygin, Olga Tumaykina', null, 'What happens in fairy tales after the wedding of the prince and princess? Figure skater Nadia and hockey player Sasha got married and more than anything else they dream of a child. True, the price they will have to pay for this dream will be unimaginably high. After such upheavals, it seems impossible to count on a happy ending. But if you think so, you do not know anything about real tales...', 'What happens in fairy tales after the wedding of the prince and princess? Figure skater Nadia and hockey player Sasha got married and more than anything else they dream of a child. True, the price they will have to pay for this dream will be unimaginably high. After such upheavals, it seems impossible to count on a happy ending. But if you think so, you do not know anything about real tales...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1ynScSMSMMGx3Um9fKhD4K63sk2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:576917'),
  ('487862747977292858', 'Ice Age', 2002, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Adventure', 'Chris Wedge, Carlos Saldanha, Christopher M. Burrows', 'Michael Berg, Michael J. Wilson, Peter Ackerman', 'Ray Romano, John Leguizamo, Denis Leary, Goran Višnjić, Jack Black, Cedric the Entertainer, Stephen Root, Diedrich Bader', 'PG', 'Manny the mammoth, Sid the loquacious sloth, and Diego the sabre-toothed tiger go on a comical quest to return a human baby back to his father, across a world on the brink of an ice age.', 'Manny the mammoth, Sid the loquacious sloth, and Diego the sabre-toothed tiger go on a comical quest to return a human baby back to his father, across a world on the brink of an ice age.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gLhHHZUzeseRXShoDyC4VqLgsNv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:425'),
  ('481547938149137523', 'Ice Age: A Mammoth Christmas', 2011, 'Animation, Family, TV Movie', 'Karen Disher', 'Sam Harper, Mike Reiss', 'Ray Romano, John Leguizamo, Queen Latifah, Denis Leary, Seann William Scott, Josh Peck, Billy Gardell, Ciara Bravo', 'PG', 'When Sid accidentally destroys Manny''s heirloom Christmas rock and ends up on Santa''s naughty list, he leads a hilarious quest to the North Pole to make things right and ends up making things much worse. Now it''s up to Manny and his prehistoric posse to band together and save Christmas for the entire world!', 'When Sid accidentally destroys Manny''s heirloom Christmas rock and ends up on Santa''s naughty list, he leads a hilarious quest to the North Pole to make things right and ends up making things much worse. Now it''s up to Manny and his prehistoric posse to band together and save Christmas for the entire world!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ue5417HaDcvgMDusryenwwwZARq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79218'),
  ('262491816614917826', 'Ice Age: Boiling Point', 2027, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Adventure', 'Émile Beaucage', null, 'Ray Romano, John Leguizamo, Denis Leary, Queen Latifah, Simon Pegg, Keke Palmer, Jennifer Lopez, Jessie J', null, 'A dinosaur-and-lava-filled madcap adventure that takes Manny, Sid, Diego, Ellie, Scrat and the rest of the herd to visit never-before-seen corners of the treacherous Lost World.', 'A dinosaur-and-lava-filled madcap adventure that takes Manny, Sid, Diego, Ellie, Scrat and the rest of the herd to visit never-before-seen corners of the treacherous Lost World.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yga4pd5kMH7Zpto8biCjEKVkLAh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1384758'),
  ('62713535930184589', 'Ice Age: Collision Course', 2016, 'Adventure, Animation, Family, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Renato Falcão, Galen T. Chu, Mike Thurmeier', 'Michael J. Wilson, Michael Berg, Yoni Brenner', 'Ray Romano, John Leguizamo, Denis Leary, Queen Latifah, Seann William Scott, Josh Peck, Simon Pegg, Keke Palmer', 'PG', 'Set after the events of Continental Drift, Scrat''s epic pursuit of his elusive acorn catapults him outside of Earth, where he accidentally sets off a series of cosmic events that transform and threaten the planet. To save themselves from peril, Manny, Sid, Diego, and the rest of the herd leave their home and embark on a quest full of thrills and spills, highs and lows, laughter and adventure while traveling to exotic new lands and locations.', 'Set after the events of Continental Drift, Scrat''s epic pursuit of his elusive acorn catapults him outside of Earth, where he accidentally sets off a series of cosmic events that transform and threaten the planet. To save themselves from peril, Manny, Sid, Diego, and the rest of the herd leave their home and embark on a quest full of thrills and spills, highs and lows, laughter and adventure while traveling to exotic new lands and locations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/okF78W1AcXAenlYFE3vna9Uuqjp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:278154'),
  ('92544434812987751', 'Ice Age: Continental Drift', 2012, 'Animation, Comedy, Adventure, Family', 'Mike Thurmeier, Steve Martino, Renato Falcão', 'Michael Berg, Jason Fuchs', 'Ray Romano, John Leguizamo, Denis Leary, Seann William Scott, Josh Peck, Queen Latifah, Jennifer Lopez, Peter Dinklage', 'PG', 'Manny, Diego, and Sid embark upon another adventure after their continent is set adrift. Using an iceberg as a ship, they encounter sea creatures and battle pirates as they explore a new world.', 'Manny, Diego, and Sid embark upon another adventure after their continent is set adrift. Using an iceberg as a ship, they encounter sea creatures and battle pirates as they explore a new world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dfp1BZF7FxbBUyzHvMOI9t8NWDD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57800'),
  ('16340970484274763', 'Ice Age: Dawn of the Dinosaurs', 2009, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Adventure', 'Carlos Saldanha, Keith Stichweh, Lisa Kalmanson', 'Michael Berg, Peter Ackerman, Yoni Brenner', 'Ray Romano, John Leguizamo, Denis Leary, Queen Latifah, Simon Pegg, Seann William Scott, Josh Peck, Chris Wedge', 'PG', 'Times are changing for Manny the moody mammoth, Sid the motor mouthed sloth and Diego the crafty saber-toothed tiger. Life heats up for our heroes when they meet some new and none-too-friendly neighbors – the mighty dinosaurs.', 'Times are changing for Manny the moody mammoth, Sid the motor mouthed sloth and Diego the crafty saber-toothed tiger. Life heats up for our heroes when they meet some new and none-too-friendly neighbors – the mighty dinosaurs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cXOLaxcNjNAYmEx1trZxOTKhK3Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8355'),
  ('29108056848336209', 'Ice Age: The Great Egg-Scapade', 2016, 'Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Family, TV Movie', 'Ricardo Curtis', 'Jim Hecht', 'Ray Romano, John Leguizamo, Denis Leary, Taraji P. Henson, Queen Latifah, Gabriel Iglesias, Wendy Williams, Lili Estefan', 'PG', 'A harried prehistoric bird mother entrusts her precious, soon-to-hatch egg to Sid. When she recommends him to her neighbours, business booms at his new egg-sitting service. However, dastardly pirate bunny, Squint, who is seeking revenge on the herd, steals, camouflages and hides all the eggs. Once again, with Squint’s twin brother assisting, Manny, Diego and the rest of the gang come to the rescue and take off on a daring mission that turns into the world’s first Easter egg hunt.', 'A harried prehistoric bird mother entrusts her precious, soon-to-hatch egg to Sid. When she recommends him to her neighbours, business booms at his new egg-sitting service. However, dastardly pirate bunny, Squint, who is seeking revenge on the herd, steals, camouflages and hides all the eggs. Once again, with Squint’s twin brother assisting, Manny, Diego and the rest of the gang come to the rescue and take off on a daring mission that turns into the world’s first Easter egg hunt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ysQqYp9G37Q114Nc6uvCHbDmaj6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:387893'),
  ('613093523727899995', 'Ice Age: The Meltdown', 2006, 'Animation, Family, Comedy, Adventure', 'Carlos Saldanha, Craig Grasso, Jason Davies', 'Jim Hecht, Gerry Swallow, Peter Gaulke', 'Ray Romano, John Leguizamo, Denis Leary, Queen Latifah, Seann William Scott, Josh Peck, Jay Leno, Will Arnett', 'PG', 'Diego, Manny and Sid return in this sequel to the hit animated movie Ice Age. This time around, the deep freeze is over, and the ice-covered earth is starting to melt, which will destroy the trio''s cherished valley. The impending disaster prompts them to reunite and warn all the other beasts about the desperate situation.', 'Diego, Manny and Sid return in this sequel to the hit animated movie Ice Age. This time around, the deep freeze is over, and the ice-covered earth is starting to melt, which will destroy the trio''s cherished valley. The impending disaster prompts them to reunite and warn all the other beasts about the desperate situation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e23bfKyjOiKJ5uOufFgfO7JO5ug.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:950'),
  ('712987439324194442', 'Ice Blues: A Donald Strachey Mystery', 2008, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'C. Kim Miles, Ron Oliver', 'Ron McGee', 'Chad Allen, Sebastian Spence, Nelson Wong, Brittney Wilson, Sebastien Roberts, Daryl Shuttleworth, Sherry Miller, Myron Natwick', null, 'America''s favorite gay private investigator, Donald Strachey, takes on the most complicated case of his career. After his long-time partner, Tim, asks him to uncover the source of an anonymous and generous donation to the Albany youth center, he gets caught in a whirlwind of deceit and danger.', 'America''s favorite gay private investigator, Donald Strachey, takes on the most complicated case of his career. After his long-time partner, Tim, asks him to uncover the source of an anonymous and generous donation to the Albany youth center, he gets caught in a whirlwind of deceit and danger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4A8OXqjO1EFy5A6Tyq0qNRcpiot.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73252'),
  ('656264004242916619', 'Ice Castles', 1978, 'Drama, Romance', 'Donald Wrye, Bill Butler', 'Donald Wrye, Gary L. Baim', 'Robby Benson, Lynn-Holly Johnson, Colleen Dewhurst, Tom Skerritt, Jennifer Warren, David Huffman, Diane Reilly, Craig T. McCullen', 'PG', 'Alexis is on top of the world until a tragic accident dashes her hopes and dreams of becoming a world-class figure skater. Only with the help of those who love her can she prove to the world — and herself — that she still has the potential to realize her dreams.', 'Alexis is on top of the world until a tragic accident dashes her hopes and dreams of becoming a world-class figure skater. Only with the help of those who love her can she prove to the world — and herself — that she still has the potential to realize her dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5iS3EJD286IYkJ83L5pEVoNF3xn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50541'),
  ('772414896095235712', 'Ice Castles', 2010, 'Drama', 'Donald Wrye, Eric Cayla', null, 'Taylor Firth, Rob Mayes, Henry Czerny, Morgan Kelly, Tattiawna Jones, Eve Crawford, Molly Oberstar, Michelle Kwan', 'PG', 'Young, beautiful, talented Alexis Winston comes from nowhere to become a figure skating superstar. But her rise to stardom isn’t easy. She has to push herself, reinvent herself, and most painfully of all, leave her hometown boyfriend behind. When a tragic fall leaves her blind, she needs someone to believe in her, to love her; someone to convince her she has the strength to skate and dream again.', 'Young, beautiful, talented Alexis Winston comes from nowhere to become a figure skating superstar. But her rise to stardom isn’t easy. She has to push herself, reinvent herself, and most painfully of all, leave her hometown boyfriend behind. When a tragic fall leaves her blind, she needs someone to believe in her, to love her; someone to convince her she has the strength to skate and dream again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nyOdft1lgrcCQANnfYMMCwZ7RIB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33570'),
  ('993704157109655840', 'Ice Cold in Alex', 1958, 'War, Adventure, Drama', 'J. Lee Thompson, Gilbert Taylor, Gus Agosti', 'T. J. Morrison, Christopher Landon', 'John Mills, Sylvia Syms, Anthony Quayle, Harry Andrews, Diane Clare, Richard Leech, Liam Redmond, Allan Cuthbertson', 'PG', 'A group of army personnel and nurses attempt a dangerous and arduous trek across the deserts of North Africa during the second world war. The leader of the team dreams of his ice cold beer when he reaches Alexandria.', 'A group of army personnel and nurses attempt a dangerous and arduous trek across the deserts of North Africa during the second world war. The leader of the team dreams of his ice cold beer when he reaches Alexandria.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lkqTxSL9JwyyXDu5yeOoj5mzsVc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16284'),
  ('963003745856715144', 'Ice Cold: Murder, Coffee and Jessica Wongso', 2023, 'Documentary, Crime', 'Rob Sixsmith', null, 'Jessica Wongso, Mirna Salihin, Otto Hasibuan, Edi Darmawan Salihin, Marcella Zalianty, Sandy Salihin, Devi Siagian, Rangga Saputro', 'PG-13', 'This documentary delves into the unanswered questions surrounding the trial of Jessica Wongso — years after the death of her best friend, Mirna Salihin.', 'This documentary delves into the unanswered questions surrounding the trial of Jessica Wongso — years after the death of her best friend, Mirna Salihin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/duv6wtHMuN74HF7UuLjvUUrn8dB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1172499'),
  ('777143261636012069', 'Ice Cream in Glim', 1992, 'Drama, Music', 'Tarek El Tilmisany, Khairy Beshara', 'Mohamed Al Mansy Qandil, Medhat El Adl', 'Amr Diab, Ashraf Abdel Baky, Simone, Ezzat Abu Ouf, Hussein al-Imam, Gehan Fadel, Alaa Wali El Din, Ali Hassanein', null, 'Seif works in a video rental store, and lives with a group of young men aspiring for a better life. Seif tries to prove himself worthy by showcasing his singing talent, to the disappointment of the store''s owner who fires him. Seif ends up in jail, where he meets a leftist student and poet, who introduces him to an infamous old composer, and they form a trio and take their art to the streets.', 'Seif works in a video rental store, and lives with a group of young men aspiring for a better life. Seif tries to prove himself worthy by showcasing his singing talent, to the disappointment of the store''s owner who fires him. Seif ends up in jail, where he meets a leftist student and poet, who introduces him to an infamous old composer, and they form a trio and take their art to the streets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iUPCoAFy6SzaFRk3jls5xPqlRTa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:328013'),
  ('948546913446102967', 'Ice Cream Man', 1995, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Norman Apstein, Lynn K. D''Angona, Beth Spanier', 'Sven Davison, David Dobkin', 'Clint Howard, Justin Isfeld, Anndi McAfee, JoJo Adams, Mikey LeBeau, Sandahl Bergman, Andrea Evans, Steve Garvey', 'R', 'Young Gregory Tudor sees his local ice cream man murdered and later grows up to inherit his business, opting to inject gruesome ingredients—including human body parts—into his frozen confections. When one of the neighborhood boys goes missing, the local kids suspect Gregory and band together to get to the bottom of things.', 'Young Gregory Tudor sees his local ice cream man murdered and later grows up to inherit his business, opting to inject gruesome ingredients—including human body parts—into his frozen confections. When one of the neighborhood boys goes missing, the local kids suspect Gregory and band together to get to the bottom of things.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c6ZouvwSkBPnmKVjeBDwdA44Tx8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44470'),
  ('214165583952979873', 'Ice Cream, I Scream', 2006, 'Comedy', 'Yüksel Aksu', 'Yüksel Aksu', 'Turan Özdemir, Gülnihal Demir, İsmet Can Suda, Ulaş Sarıbaş, Alaaddin Sakar, Recep Yener, Sabriye Günüç, Onur Yaprakçı', null, 'Ali, who is ice cream salesman in Mugla, tries to survive in the face of fierce competition from the big ice cream brands. While trying to promote his ice cream, he tours the village with his brand new yellow ice cream motorbike. However the naugthy boys of the town who are chasing him to have free ice cream, steal the motorbike while he is away. Still repaying the debts for the loan on his motorbike, Ali becomes furious and accuses the big ice cream brands of stealing the car in order to destroy him. He starts investigating the theft of his motorbike asking one by one to the sellers of the big brands, while all along the naugthy boys are enjoying their free ice cream', 'Ali, who is ice cream salesman in Mugla, tries to survive in the face of fierce competition from the big ice cream brands. While trying to promote his ice cream, he tours the village with his brand new yellow ice cream motorbike. However the naugthy boys of the town who are chasing him to have free ice cream, steal the motorbike while he is away. Still repaying the debts for the loan on his motorbike, Ali becomes furious and accuses the big ice cream brands of stealing the car in order to destroy him. He starts investigating the theft of his motorbike asking one by one to the sellers of the big brands, while all along the naugthy boys are enjoying their free ice cream', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nM3rXq2EpfpcwQ80TEeSOIpqv5f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81550'),
  ('176896216936476461', 'Ice Kacang Puppy Love', 2010, 'Drama, Romance', 'Ah Niu, Keoh Chee Ang, Yong Choon Lin', 'Ah Niu', 'Ah Niu, Angelica Lee Sin-Jie, Gary Chaw, Victor Wong, Fish Leong, Eric Moo Kai-Yin, Yi Jet Qi, Angela Chan', null, 'Botak, the son of a coffee shop owner, is secretly in love with tomboy Fighting Fish, who has grown up with him since she and her mother came to live with them a decade or so ago. Angry at her mother for deserting her no-good father when she was still young, Fighting Fish sets out one day to find him, with Botak in tow.', 'Botak, the son of a coffee shop owner, is secretly in love with tomboy Fighting Fish, who has grown up with him since she and her mother came to live with them a decade or so ago. Angry at her mother for deserting her no-good father when she was still young, Fighting Fish sets out one day to find him, with Botak in tow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Vqk5LKahSGYXEIdD2IP94O3Ah0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57958'),
  ('909487504939686551', 'Ice Merchants', 2023, 'Animation, Drama', 'João Gonzalez, João Gonzalez', 'João Gonzalez', null, null, 'Every day, a father and his son jump with a parachute from their vertiginous cold house, attached to a cliff, to go to the village on the ground, far away where they sell the ice they produce daily.', 'Every day, a father and his son jump with a parachute from their vertiginous cold house, attached to a cliff, to go to the village on the ground, far away where they sell the ice they produce daily.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uDoiGF4KqyNglxaIJlRWdFQ4WJT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:965171'),
  ('630052066966217685', 'Ice Palace', 1987, 'Mystery, Drama', 'Per Blom, Halvor Næss', 'Per Blom', 'Hilde Nyeggen Martinsen, Line Storesund, Sigrid Huun, Urda Brattrud Larsen, Merete Moen, Vidar Sandem, Knut Ørvig, Charlotte Lundestad', null, 'One evening, in a remote Norwegian mountain-town, two 12 year old girls meet. For the first time in their lives they are thrown into a strong emotional confrontation. The next day, Unn is unable to meet Siss again. Instead, she ventures alone into the cold, lonely winter landscape.', 'One evening, in a remote Norwegian mountain-town, two 12 year old girls meet. For the first time in their lives they are thrown into a strong emotional confrontation. The next day, Unn is unable to meet Siss again. Instead, she ventures alone into the cold, lonely winter landscape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y7cBlV3SePU4KzyokOAFbhFoiRL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60477'),
  ('449581752550893578', 'Ice Princess', 2005, 'Family, Drama, Comedy', 'Tim Fywell, David Hennings', 'Meg Cabot', 'Michelle Trachtenberg, Joan Cusack, Amy Stewart, Steve Ross, Hayden Panettiere, Kim Cattrall, Trevor Blumas, Kirsten Olson', 'G', 'With the help of her coach, her mom, and the boy who drives the Zamboni, nothing can stop Casey Carlyle from realizing her dream to be a champion figure skater.', 'With the help of her coach, her mom, and the boy who drives the Zamboni, nothing can stop Casey Carlyle from realizing her dream to be a champion figure skater.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oLWeyvu0ZJrpxDsRrzsMeaGzyZp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13374'),
  ('921829424876015781', 'Ice Princess Lily', 2018, 'Family, Animation', 'Sven Unterwaldt Jr.', 'Hortense Ullrich, Marco Petry, Gerrit Hermans', 'Wincent Weiss, Yvonne Catterfeld, Rick Kavanian, Michael Herbig, Heinz Hoenig, Rufus Beck, Katharina Thalbach, Sven Unterwaldt Jr.', 'PG', 'A young dragon looking for his own fire must fight against an evil wizard with help of the beautiful ice princess, Lilli.', 'A young dragon looking for his own fire must fight against an evil wizard with help of the beautiful ice princess, Lilli.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wDjG3ihlUlCqzasAxo4InceFj46.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:421920'),
  ('690097467779537075', 'Ice Quake', 2010, 'Science Fiction, Action, Thriller, TV Movie, Adventure', 'Paul Ziller, Anthony C. Metchie', 'David Ray', 'Brendan Fehr, Holly Dignard, Jodelle Ferland, Ryan Grantham, Rob LaBelle, Nicholas Carella, Victor Garber, Marsha Regis', 'PG', 'As the permafrost melts in Alaska, underground rivers of volatile liquid methane form which sets off a series of devastating earthquakes. Forced apart by this violent occurrence, one family must find each other during the holidays and work to stop the deadly rivers that could cause a worldwide catastrophy.', 'As the permafrost melts in Alaska, underground rivers of volatile liquid methane form which sets off a series of devastating earthquakes. Forced apart by this violent occurrence, one family must find each other during the holidays and work to stop the deadly rivers that could cause a worldwide catastrophy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lT5k8PPJ0VbyRmX3WViBQXBbLCP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62989'),
  ('263382688236797858', 'Ice Road: Vengeance', 2025, 'Action, Thriller, Drama', 'Jonathan Hensleigh, Tom Stern', 'Jonathan Hensleigh', 'Liam Neeson, Fan Bingbing, Marcus Thomas, Grace O''Sullivan, Saksham Sharma, Bernard Curry, Geoff Morrell, Mahesh Jadu', 'R', 'Big rig ice road driver Mike McCann travels to Nepal to scatter his late brother’s ashes on Mt. Everest. While on a packed tour bus traversing the deadly 12,000 ft. terrain of the infamous Road to the Sky, McCann and his mountain guide encounter a group of mercenaries and must fight to save themselves, the busload of innocent travelers, and the local villagers’ homeland.', 'Big rig ice road driver Mike McCann travels to Nepal to scatter his late brother’s ashes on Mt. Everest. While on a packed tour bus traversing the deadly 12,000 ft. terrain of the infamous Road to the Sky, McCann and his mountain guide encounter a group of mercenaries and must fight to save themselves, the busload of innocent travelers, and the local villagers’ homeland.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cQN9rZj06rXMVkk76UF1DfBAico.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1119878'),
  ('830761376187377022', 'Ice Sculpture Christmas', 2015, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'Anthony C. Metchie, Ryan Kosmynka, Darren Robson', 'Tracy Andreen', 'Rachel Boston, David Alpay, Brenda Strong, Paul McGillion, Aliyah O''Brien, Mark Brandon, Leanne Lapp, Sachin Sahel', 'NR', 'After starting her first job at a country club restaurant, Callie’s passions for cooking and ice sculpting are met with romance and Christmas spirit when a childhood friend enters her into the club’s annual Christmas ice sculpting competition without her knowledge.', 'After starting her first job at a country club restaurant, Callie’s passions for cooking and ice sculpting are met with romance and Christmas spirit when a childhood friend enters her into the club’s annual Christmas ice sculpting competition without her knowledge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tbLXuXt9ZBVGcrLE8AfLCzGfoHw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:360604'),
  ('875787060550902399', 'Ice Sharks', 2016, 'TV Movie, Adventure, Action, Science Fiction, Horror', 'Emile Edwin Smith, Darrin Webb, David Michael Harwell', 'Emile Edwin Smith', 'Edward DeRuiter, Jenna Parker, Kaiwi Lyman, Clarissa Thibeaux, Travis Lincoln Cox, Mia Danelle, Leddie Garcia, Shamar Philippe', null, 'A new breed of aggressive, ravenous sharks cracks the frozen ocean floor of an Arctic research station, devouring all who fall through. As the station sinks into frigid waters, those alive must fashion makeshift weapons or suffer the same fate.', 'A new breed of aggressive, ravenous sharks cracks the frozen ocean floor of an Arctic research station, devouring all who fall through. As the station sinks into frigid waters, those alive must fashion makeshift weapons or suffer the same fate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xab3G2RWCrjXNhlQg3NYsuGt9Q6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:407627'),
  ('540634087415561879', 'Ice Skater', 2026, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Taavi Vartia, Nikos Karanikolas, Laura Laintila', 'Taavi Vartia', 'Thea Sofie Loch Næss, Nikos Koukas, Mimi Roivainen, Jasmin Simonen', null, 'A survival drama about an ice skater stranded on an ice floe at the Arctic Sea. When the ice floe starts to float towards south and melt, the ice skater must use all means necessary to survive.', 'A survival drama about an ice skater stranded on an ice floe at the Arctic Sea. When the ice floe starts to float towards south and melt, the ice skater must use all means necessary to survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m93BKabB7Je8WQACed58BXeHNNR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1424965'),
  ('579283343488725176', 'Ice Soldiers', 2013, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'Sturla Gunnarsson, Kristen Henderson, Avrel Fisher', 'Jonathan Tydor', 'Dominic Purcell, Adam Beach, Michael Ironside, Gabriel Hogan, Matthew G. Taylor', 'R', 'A scientist discovers the bodies of three frozen genetically modified Russians buried in the Canadian North. Upon thawing them out he realizes he has unleashed a deadly threat to Western society and must stop them at all costs.', 'A scientist discovers the bodies of three frozen genetically modified Russians buried in the Canadian North. Upon thawing them out he realizes he has unleashed a deadly threat to Western society and must stop them at all costs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5wsNxymjvBo65z0g5XqqOodSye2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:255692'),
  ('1079609303679316224', 'Ice Spiders', 2007, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Action, Adventure, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Barry Gravelle, Tibor Takács', 'Eric Miller', 'Patrick Muldoon, Charles Halford, Thomas Calabro, Stephen J. Cannell, Vanessa Williams, David Millbern, Connie Young, Jill Adler', 'R', 'When a young ski team training for the Olympics arrives at the remote and isolated Lost Mountain Ski Resort to focus on training, they''re thrilled to find a retired Olympic skier is there to help them train. But their plans are halted when a scientist working at a nearby government lab arrives with the horrifying news that a top secret Government project has produced giant spiders and they have escaped, killing and eating everything in sight.', 'When a young ski team training for the Olympics arrives at the remote and isolated Lost Mountain Ski Resort to focus on training, they''re thrilled to find a retired Olympic skier is there to help them train. But their plans are halted when a scientist working at a nearby government lab arrives with the horrifying news that a top secret Government project has produced giant spiders and they have escaped, killing and eating everything in sight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Asp7hjh1CfZoOxSJ3cr2RiVx3yt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17306'),
  ('948994732033217552', 'Ice Station Zebra', 1968, 'Action, Adventure, Thriller', 'John Sturges, Art Levinson, Daniel L. Fapp', 'Douglas Heyes, W.R. Burnett', 'Rock Hudson, Ernest Borgnine, Patrick McGoohan, Jim Brown, Tony Bill, Alf Kjellin, Gerald S. O''Loughlin, Ted Hartley', 'G', 'A top-secret Soviet spy satellite -- using stolen Western technology -- malfunctions and then goes into a descent that lands it near an isolated Arctic research encampment called Ice Station Zebra, belonging to the British, which starts sending out distress signals before falling silent. The atomic submarine Tigerfish, commanded by Cmdr. James Ferraday (Rock Hudson), is dispatched to save them.', 'A top-secret Soviet spy satellite -- using stolen Western technology -- malfunctions and then goes into a descent that lands it near an isolated Arctic research encampment called Ice Station Zebra, belonging to the British, which starts sending out distress signals before falling silent. The atomic submarine Tigerfish, commanded by Cmdr. James Ferraday (Rock Hudson), is dispatched to save them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/euPqp2J79zAomdgCcdpCmqjRHMy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17657'),
  ('542579828034637227', 'Ice Storm', 2023, 'Science Fiction, Action, Horror, TV Movie', 'Jared Cohn, Marcus Friedlander', 'Marc Gottlieb, Bryan Coyne', 'McKenzie Westmore, Grant Bowler, Tyler Christopher, William Baldwin, Tori Griffith, Jessie B. Evans, Adam H. Marchand, Tola Lawal', null, 'When a devastating winter storm freezes over the whole of North Carolina, climatologists and disaster relief experts are called in before the entire East Coast is destroyed.', 'When a devastating winter storm freezes over the whole of North Carolina, climatologists and disaster relief experts are called in before the entire East Coast is destroyed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lWwaW9Nt3u4zs61AnKiktgrD2jU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1071976'),
  ('564563080101723757', 'Ice Twisters', 2009, 'Action, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Steven R. Monroe, Anthony C. Metchie, Kevin Leslie', 'Andrew C. Erin', 'Mark Moses, Camille Sullivan, Kaj-Erik Eriksen, Alex Zahara, Luisa d''Oliveira, Ryan Kennedy, Chelan Simmons, Robert Moloney', 'PG-13', 'Charlie Price, a former scientist turned science fiction author, starts living one of his novels when the Federal Science Foundation''s weather experiments escape control and turn disastrous.', 'Charlie Price, a former scientist turned science fiction author, starts living one of his novels when the Federal Science Foundation''s weather experiments escape control and turn disastrous.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yaKcjBXIOnzOki4438QIsjxt3oD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34559'),
  ('504785438762559912', 'Iceberg', 2005, 'Comedy', 'Bruno Romy, Dominique Abel, Fiona Gordon', null, 'Lucy Tulugarjuk, Fiona Gordon, Dominique Abel, Philippe Martz, Thérèse Fichet, Georges Jore, Louis Lecouvreur, Bruno Romy', null, 'Fiona is the manager of a fast-food restaurant. She lives comfortably with her family in the suburbs. In other words, Fiona is happy... until one day she accidentally gets locked into a walk-in fridge. She escapes the next morning, half frozen and barely alive, only to realize that her husband and two children didn''t even notice she was missing. But when Fiona develops an obsession for everything cold and icy: snow, polar bears, fridges, icebergs--she drops everything, climbs into a frozen goods delivery truck and leaves home. For a real iceberg.', 'Fiona is the manager of a fast-food restaurant. She lives comfortably with her family in the suburbs. In other words, Fiona is happy... until one day she accidentally gets locked into a walk-in fridge. She escapes the next morning, half frozen and barely alive, only to realize that her husband and two children didn''t even notice she was missing. But when Fiona develops an obsession for everything cold and icy: snow, polar bears, fridges, icebergs--she drops everything, climbs into a frozen goods delivery truck and leaves home. For a real iceberg.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x9obKoXFDgDWQUhPaLmJVvPyk3b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74055'),
