  ('500944248311616585', 'Iced', 1989, 'Horror', 'Jeff Kwitny, Eugene D. Shlugleit', 'Joseph Alan Johnson', 'Debra De Liso, Doug Stevenson, Ron Kologie, Elizabeth Gorcey, John C. Cooke, Joseph Alan Johnson, Dan Smith, Michael Picardi', null, 'A group of childhood friends are invited to the opening of a posh ski resort, unaware that an old nemesis has murderous plans in mind for them.', 'A group of childhood friends are invited to the opening of a posh ski resort, unaware that an old nemesis has murderous plans in mind for them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x9Kv6EpgAc0xLjXQNBs5rSFhxmd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83283'),
  ('1011542011533901732', 'Icefall', 2025, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Stefan Ruzowitzky, Benedict Neuenfels', 'George Mahaffey', 'Joel Kinnaman, Cara Jade Myers, Danny Huston, Graham Greene, Martin Sensmeier, Oliver Trevena, DeVaughn Nixon, Frida Gustavsson', null, 'A young Indigenous game warden arrests an infamous poacher only to discover that the poacher knows the location of a plane carrying millions of dollars that has crashed in a frozen lake. When a group of criminals and dirty cops are alerted to the poacher’s whereabouts, the warden and the poacher team up to fight back and escape across the treacherous lake before the ice melts.', 'A young Indigenous game warden arrests an infamous poacher only to discover that the poacher knows the location of a plane carrying millions of dollars that has crashed in a frozen lake. When a group of criminals and dirty cops are alerted to the poacher’s whereabouts, the warden and the poacher team up to fight back and escape across the treacherous lake before the ice melts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Byv6nznAb2Izd0gHpODOXnuSbo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1242501'),
  ('522169865293517024', 'Iceman', 1984, 'Science Fiction', 'Fred Schepisi, Ian Baker, Jim Van Wyck', 'Chip Proser, John Drimmer', 'Timothy Hutton, Lindsay Crouse, John Lone, Josef Sommer, David Strathairn, James Tolkan, Danny Glover, Richard Monette', 'PG', 'A team of Arctic researchers find a 40,000 year-old man frozen in ice and bring him back to life. Anthropologist Dr. Stanley Shephard wants to befriend the Iceman and learn about the man''s past while Dr. Diane Brady and her surgical team want to discover the secret that will allow man to live in a frozen state.', 'A team of Arctic researchers find a 40,000 year-old man frozen in ice and bring him back to life. Anthropologist Dr. Stanley Shephard wants to befriend the Iceman and learn about the man''s past while Dr. Diane Brady and her surgical team want to discover the secret that will allow man to live in a frozen state.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4HllE4JWVl3YbaWKmHXsBVkH4Sr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24749'),
  ('33545576320564403', 'Iceman', 2014, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Law Wing-Cheong, Edmond Fung Yuen-Man, Kenny Tse Chung-To', 'Lam Fung, Mark Woo Yiu-Fai', 'Donnie Yen, Eva Huang Shengyi, Wang Baoqiang, Simon Yam, Yu Kang, Wang Wenqi, Mark Woo Yiu-Fai, Lam Suet', 'R', 'An imperial guard and his three traitorous childhood friends ordered to hunt him down get accidentally buried and kept frozen in time. 400 years later, they are defrosted continuing the battle they left behind.', 'An imperial guard and his three traitorous childhood friends ordered to hunt him down get accidentally buried and kept frozen in time. 400 years later, they are defrosted continuing the battle they left behind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/juAYTbpP05NR8co9GhDTPwEKqde.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105001'),
