  ('495436251337471783', 'Ich gehöre ihm', 2017, 'TV Movie, Drama', 'Thomas Durchschlag', null, 'Anna Bachmann, Maria Simon, Bernd Michael Lade, Oktay Özdemir, Rolf Berg, Samy Abdel Fattah, Jamie Bick, Luna Fellmann', null, '15-year-old Caro is one of the inconspicuous students in her school. One day she get noted by a handsome, wealthy Turkish guy who is 5 years older than her. Since they start seeing each other she turns into a totally different person', '15-year-old Caro is one of the inconspicuous students in her school. One day she get noted by a handsome, wealthy Turkish guy who is 5 years older than her. Since they start seeing each other she turns into a totally different person', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4kzSU4xffjHbPbkmPGAqwaGIRgv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:434690'),
  ('212985315308813808', 'ICHI', 2008, 'Action, Adventure, Drama, History', 'Fumihiko Sori', 'Taeko Asano', 'Haruka Ayase, Yosuke Kubozuka, Takao Osawa, Shido Nakamura, Tetta Sugimoto, Megumi Yokoyama, Riki Takeuchi, Mayumi Sada', null, 'Ichi is a blind entertainer that travels the countryside with her traditional Japanese guitar and walking stick. She’s in search for the kind man that brought her up as a child, but because of her beauty she encounters problems every step of the way. Fortunately for Ichi, she is also a gifted swordswoman and carries a lethal blade within her walking stick.', 'Ichi is a blind entertainer that travels the countryside with her traditional Japanese guitar and walking stick. She’s in search for the kind man that brought her up as a child, but because of her beauty she encounters problems every step of the way. Fortunately for Ichi, she is also a gifted swordswoman and carries a lethal blade within her walking stick.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oLiCuvbIci52akNwPhxI0uIOz1v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19506'),
  ('863529621939644593', 'Ichi the Killer', 2001, 'Action, Crime, Horror', 'Takashi Miike, Hideo Yamamoto', 'Sakichi Sato', 'Tadanobu Asano, Nao Omori, Shinya Tsukamoto, SABU, Paulyn Sun, Susumu Terajima, Shun Sugata, Toru Tezuka', null, 'As sadomasochistic yakuza enforcer Kakihara searches for his missing boss he comes across Ichi, a repressed and psychotic killer who may be able to inflict levels of pain that Kakihara has only dreamed of.', 'As sadomasochistic yakuza enforcer Kakihara searches for his missing boss he comes across Ichi, a repressed and psychotic killer who may be able to inflict levels of pain that Kakihara has only dreamed of.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k8j4YLZlda98dqp9ErymKzjYowG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9696'),
  ('247394017219615366', 'Ichi the Killer: Episode Zero', 2002, 'Animation, Drama, Horror, Thriller, Crime', 'Matsuri Oohana, Shinji Ishihira, Toshiki Kameyama', 'Sakichi Sato', 'Chihiro Suzuki, Shinpachi Tsuji, Takashi Miike, Sayaka Ohara, Atsushi Imaruoka, Daisuke Sakaguchi, Ema Kogure, Eri Saito', null, 'A masochistic mobster meets his match in the dark streets of Tokyo. His nemesis, Ichi, is a psychopathic killer with an unrelenting thirst for bloodshed. A horrifying secret burns in his mind, and his hands deal death without mercy. At last, the shrouds of mystery are parted to reveal the origin of the monster. The city will know its greatest fear at the unveiling of Ichi the Killer.', 'A masochistic mobster meets his match in the dark streets of Tokyo. His nemesis, Ichi, is a psychopathic killer with an unrelenting thirst for bloodshed. A horrifying secret burns in his mind, and his hands deal death without mercy. At last, the shrouds of mystery are parted to reveal the origin of the monster. The city will know its greatest fear at the unveiling of Ichi the Killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c2Q2PXTXoAD1dGDZLLD9qZFSYvI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87069'),
  ('222875273636209184', 'Ichiko', 2023, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Akihiro Toda, Kosuke Haruki, Wataru Hiranami', 'Naho Kamimura, Akihiro Toda', 'Hana Sugisaki, Ryuya Wakaba, Yuki Morinaga, Daichi Watanabe, Shohei Uno, Yuri Nakamura, Seina Nakata, Ruka Ishikawa', null, 'On August 12, 2015, Hasegawa proposed to Ichiko. Ichiko is moved by Hasegawa''s proposal and sheds tears, but the next day, she suddenly leaves home, seemingly shocked after seeing the TV news. Where did Ichiko go? Hasegawa reports the disappearance to the police, and the detective in charge of the investigation tells an unexpected story.', 'On August 12, 2015, Hasegawa proposed to Ichiko. Ichiko is moved by Hasegawa''s proposal and sheds tears, but the next day, she suddenly leaves home, seemingly shocked after seeing the TV news. Where did Ichiko go? Hasegawa reports the disappearance to the police, and the detective in charge of the investigation tells an unexpected story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gi91xQQ9OYHuib3XPajRmLqdOyJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1171548'),
