  ('642577061256658919', 'Identification of a Woman', 1982, 'Drama, Romance', 'Michelangelo Antonioni, Carlo Di Palma', 'Tonino Guerra', 'Tomas Milian, Daniela Silverio, Christine Boisson, Lara Wendel, Veronica Lazăr, Enrica Antonioni, Sandra Monteleoni, Marcel Bozzuffi', 'NR', 'Movie director Niccolò has just been left by his wife. Subsequently he embarks on an obsessive relationship with a young woman who eventually leaves him and disappears while searching for her, he meets a variety of other willing girls. This gives him the idea of making a movie about women''s relationships. He starts to search for a woman who can play the leading part in the movie.', 'Movie director Niccolò has just been left by his wife. Subsequently he embarks on an obsessive relationship with a young woman who eventually leaves him and disappears while searching for her, he meets a variety of other willing girls. This gives him the idea of making a movie about women''s relationships. He starts to search for a woman who can play the leading part in the movie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5SOYgzI3CeWgCKlPYkv43C11ZfZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53234'),
  ('1063119461367699757', 'Identifying Features', 2020, 'Drama', 'Ana Moreno Hernández, Fernanda Valadez, Claudia Becerril Bulos', 'Astrid Rondero, Fernanda Valadez', 'Mercedes Hernández, David Illescas, Juan Jesús Varela, Ana Lauda Rodríguez, Armando García, Laura Elena Ibarra, Juan Pablo Acevedo, Xicoténcatl Ulloa', 'NR', 'Magdalena makes a journey to find her son, who has disappeared on his way to the Mexican border with the United States. Her odyssey takes her to meet Miguel, a man recently deported from the US. They start to travel together, Magdalena looking for her son, and Miguel hoping to see his mother again.', 'Magdalena makes a journey to find her son, who has disappeared on his way to the Mexican border with the United States. Her odyssey takes her to meet Miguel, a man recently deported from the US. They start to travel together, Magdalena looking for her son, and Miguel hoping to see his mother again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/muB0BuXV3UIABCiVC6sm0oJOza0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:653658'),
