  ('1102112032390154078', 'Idiocracy', 2006, 'Comedy, Science Fiction, Adventure', 'Mike Judge, Tim Suhrstedt, Rip Murray', 'Etan Cohen, Mike Judge', 'Luke Wilson, Maya Rudolph, Dax Shepard, Terry Crews, Anthony ''Citric'' Campos, David Herman, Sonny Castillo, Kevin McAfee', 'R', 'To test its top-secret Human Hibernation Project, the Pentagon picks the most average Americans it can find - an Army private and a prostitute - and sends them to the year 2505 after a series of freak events. But when they arrive, they find a civilization so dumbed-down that they''re the smartest people around.', 'To test its top-secret Human Hibernation Project, the Pentagon picks the most average Americans it can find - an Army private and a prostitute - and sends them to the year 2505 after a series of freak events. But when they arrive, they find a civilization so dumbed-down that they''re the smartest people around.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k75tEyoPbPlfHSKakJBOR5dx1Dp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7512'),
  ('1141165414129384308', 'Idiot in Paris', 1967, 'Comedy', 'Jean-Claude Sussfeld, Bernard Guillou, Roger Dallier', 'Michel Audiard, Jean Vermorel, Serge Korber', 'Jean Lefebvre, Dany Carrel, Bernard Blier, Robert Dalban, Bernadette Lafont, Paul Préboist, Yves Robert, André Pousse', null, 'Goubi, the simpleton of his village in the French Department Allier, has but one wish: to see Paris. One day, the truckers Grafouillère deposit a drunk Goubi in the biggest market of Paris (the "Halles"). The poor man is completely lost, but the meat merchant Dessertine takes him under his wings when he hears that Goubi was likewise ''raised by the State''...', 'Goubi, the simpleton of his village in the French Department Allier, has but one wish: to see Paris. One day, the truckers Grafouillère deposit a drunk Goubi in the biggest market of Paris (the "Halles"). The poor man is completely lost, but the meat merchant Dessertine takes him under his wings when he hears that Goubi was likewise ''raised by the State''...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jggzyqiMb2Iag529IFw0bGiISGj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78377'),
