  ('15155424178126298', 'Idle Hands', 1999, 'Comedy, Horror, Fantasy, Romance', 'Christopher Baffa, Rodman Flender', 'Ron Milbauer, Terri Hughes', 'Devon Sawa, Seth Green, Elden Henson, Jessica Alba, Vivica A. Fox, Jack Noseworthy, Christopher Hart, Katie Wright', 'R', 'Anton is a cheerful but exceedingly non-ambitious 17-year-old stoner who lives to stay buzzed, watch TV, and moon over Molly, the beautiful girl who lives next door. However, it turns out that the old cliché about idle hands being the devil''s playground has a kernel of truth after all.', 'Anton is a cheerful but exceedingly non-ambitious 17-year-old stoner who lives to stay buzzed, watch TV, and moon over Molly, the beautiful girl who lives next door. However, it turns out that the old cliché about idle hands being the devil''s playground has a kernel of truth after all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mCO4gU1lkViGXTkoRBEYrvjDIJu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6552'),
