  ('400582146014265567', 'Ieoh Island', 1977, 'Mystery, Drama, Horror', 'Kim Ki-young, Jung Il-sung, Seo Byeong-su', 'Ha Yu-Sang', 'Lee Hwa-si, Kim Jung-chul, Choi Yun-seok, Kwon Mi-hye, Park Jeong-ja, Park Am, Yoo Soon-chul, Yeo Po', null, 'A company hopes to open a spa hotel named after Ieodo, a mythical island inhabited by the souls of drowned sailors. During a study trip to the proposed location of the hotel, a journalist disappears under mysterious circumstances. One of the contractors goes to Ieodo''s neighboring island, populated by widows of the dead sailors, to unravel the mystery.', 'A company hopes to open a spa hotel named after Ieodo, a mythical island inhabited by the souls of drowned sailors. During a study trip to the proposed location of the hotel, a journalist disappears under mysterious circumstances. One of the contractors goes to Ieodo''s neighboring island, populated by widows of the dead sailors, to unravel the mystery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3nH2OjveT29YYUjuMekFR42cxFT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104310'),
