  ('859634875879135766', 'If a Man Answers', 1962, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Henry Levin, Phil Bowles, Russell Metty', 'Richard Morris', 'Sandra Dee, Bobby Darin, Micheline Presle, John Lund, Cesar Romero, Stefanie Powers, Christopher Knight, Charlene Holt', 'NR', 'Rich socialite Chantal marries photographer Eugene and everything seems blissful until her envious friend attempts to break them up. In desperation, she turns to her mother, but the advice she receives may do more harm than good.', 'Rich socialite Chantal marries photographer Eugene and everything seems blissful until her envious friend attempts to break them up. In desperation, she turns to her mother, but the advice she receives may do more harm than good.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7wupF3mY2RWFHGO0zT0ctCFo2GL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46081'),
