  ('196052404160095125', 'If I Had Four Dromedaries', 1966, 'Documentary', 'Chris Marker, Chris Marker', 'Chris Marker', 'Pierre Vaneck, Nicolas Youmatoff, Catherine Le Couey, Tatyana Lavrova, Tatyana Samoylova, Samuel Feijóo, Samuel Beckett', null, 'Composed entirely of still photographs taken by Chris Marker across 26 countries, If I Had Four Dromedaries presents a dialogue between three voices reflecting on the meaning of images and travel. Through this photo-essay form, Marker explores the relationship between still and moving images and the act of seeing itself.', 'Composed entirely of still photographs taken by Chris Marker across 26 countries, If I Had Four Dromedaries presents a dialogue between three voices reflecting on the meaning of images and travel. Through this photo-essay form, Marker explores the relationship between still and moving images and the act of seeing itself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5RbsdsffZWulqCyDvSmVKTuTJDC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:256375'),
