  ('602699995970406172', 'If I Never See You Again', 1997, 'Comedy', 'Juan Pablo Villaseñor, Pierre Tatarka, Rigoberto Castañeda', 'Juan Pablo Villaseñor', 'Ignacio Retes, Max Kerlow, Rodolfo Vélez, Leticia Huijara, Zaide Silvia Gutiérrez, Angelina Peláez, Ana Bertha Espín, José Carlos Rodríguez', null, 'Five elderly men form a music group and run away from the nursing home where they are interns with the hope of playing for an audience. They confront th city, the nursing home authorities, the police and all those who wish to destroy their dream which finally comes true when they are contracted to serve as musical background for strippers of a second class cabaret. In case i never see you again, is a movie about life, death, melancholy and the quest for happiness.', 'Five elderly men form a music group and run away from the nursing home where they are interns with the hope of playing for an audience. They confront th city, the nursing home authorities, the police and all those who wish to destroy their dream which finally comes true when they are contracted to serve as musical background for strippers of a second class cabaret. In case i never see you again, is a movie about life, death, melancholy and the quest for happiness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tebBLGWaRSOS7K6C8UHzE2W4UCt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:304346'),
