  ('298092909378927915', 'If I Were for Real', 1981, 'Drama', 'Wang Tung, Lin Hung-chung', 'Chang Yung-hsiang', 'Alan Tam, Nancy Hu Guan-Chen', null, 'Taiwanese film about the dark days of the Cultural Revolution and the young people who were destroyed by it, centered on a group of students who perform Nikolai Gogol’s play The Inspector General.', 'Taiwanese film about the dark days of the Cultural Revolution and the young people who were destroyed by it, centered on a group of students who perform Nikolai Gogol’s play The Inspector General.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3KmAHlDNxpvr1Oqa0ee7HUzCv7h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:341230'),
  ('387594564753693229', 'If I Were King', 1938, 'Adventure, History', 'Frank Lloyd, Theodor Sparkuhl, William Tummel', 'Preston Sturges', 'Ronald Colman, Basil Rathbone, Frances Dee, Ellen Drew, C. V. France, Henry Wilcoxon, Heather Thatcher, Stanley Ridges', 'NR', 'King Louis XI masquerades as a commoner in Paris, seeking out the treachery he is sure lurks in his kingdom. At a local tavern, he overhears the brash poet François Villon extolling why he would be a better king. Annoyed yet intrigued, the King bestows on Villon the title of Grand Constable. Soon Villon begins work and falls for a lovely lady-in-waiting, but then must flee execution when the King turns on him.', 'King Louis XI masquerades as a commoner in Paris, seeking out the treachery he is sure lurks in his kingdom. At a local tavern, he overhears the brash poet François Villon extolling why he would be a better king. Annoyed yet intrigued, the King bestows on Villon the title of Grand Constable. Soon Villon begins work and falls for a lovely lady-in-waiting, but then must flee execution when the King turns on him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zqyhx8mpoRDqf6sdf2HlssNcP8G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126777'),
