  ('445699595642846762', 'If I Were You', 2006, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Daniel Filho, José Roberto Eliezer', 'Adriana Falcão, Carlos Gregório, Rene Belmonte', 'Tony Ramos, Glória Pires, Thiago Lacerda, Glória Menezes, Danielle Winits, Lavínia Vlasak, Maria Gladys, Ary Fontoura', null, 'The publicist Claudio and the housewife and choral teacher Helena have been married for many years, but they do not understand and respect the feelings and view point of the partner. Claudio sees Helena as a shopper and "little teacher of a choral" and Helena sees Claudio as an insensitive and rough man. On the night before the fiftieth anniversary of Claudio, they changed places with each other.', 'The publicist Claudio and the housewife and choral teacher Helena have been married for many years, but they do not understand and respect the feelings and view point of the partner. Claudio sees Helena as a shopper and "little teacher of a choral" and Helena sees Claudio as an insensitive and rough man. On the night before the fiftieth anniversary of Claudio, they changed places with each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6ZQCy9TSZr1lhJqLtt6hSEDaxH6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34588'),
  ('406432593173527159', 'If I Were You', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Alejandro Lubezki', 'Beto Cohen, Amaranta Argüelles, Miguel Necoechea', 'Juan Manuel Bernal, Sophie Alexander-Katz, Sebastián Zurita, Anabel Ferreira, Isela Vega, Macarena Oz, Rosa María Bianchi', null, 'Claudia and Antonio have been married for 15 years. After so many years of marriage they have lost track of each other. One night, after a strong argument, the unusual alignment of the planets Venus, Earth and Mars causes a magical transformation: Antonio''s soul is trapped in the body of Claudia and Claudia''s in Antonio''s body.', 'Claudia and Antonio have been married for 15 years. After so many years of marriage they have lost track of each other. One night, after a strong argument, the unusual alignment of the planets Venus, Earth and Mars causes a magical transformation: Antonio''s soul is trapped in the body of Claudia and Claudia''s in Antonio''s body.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b4vCOdWyC3lSEN3B5SKczsFBSCo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:555120'),
  ('531465467485224055', 'If I Were You 2', 2009, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Daniel Filho, Cris D''amato, Cininha de Paula', 'Daniel Filho', 'Glória Pires, Tony Ramos, Isabelle Drummond, Cássio Gabus Mendes, Maria Luísa Mendonça, Chico Anysio, Maria Gladys, Marcos Paulo', null, 'Claudio and Helena are on the verge of breaking up, until the couple experiences another strange phenomenon that looks to help them understand one another more.', 'Claudio and Helena are on the verge of breaking up, until the couple experiences another strange phenomenon that looks to help them understand one another more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jruDMExMKeUz7PHgkk4ROlWwCFO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21752'),
  ('139753499891939600', 'If in Winter', 2026, 'Drama', 'Ravi Neill, Ravi Neill, Justin Trujillo', 'Ravi Neill', 'Henri Moss, Ravi Neill, Alex Sherman', null, 'On the streets of New York City’s Diamond District in the near future; Two best friends depend on each other to survive the winter, knowing that alone they wouldn’t last, and together might not be enough.', 'On the streets of New York City’s Diamond District in the near future; Two best friends depend on each other to survive the winter, knowing that alone they wouldn’t last, and together might not be enough.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eAh1aQZwBHTkl0CkyjY30xqjGnD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1660731'),
  ('137924597232637715', 'If It Don''t Fit, Use a Bigger Hammer', 2002, 'Comedy', 'Peter Thorwarth, Eckhard Jansen', 'Matthias Dinter, Martin Ritzenhoff', 'Dietmar Bär, Ralf Richter, Hilmi Sözer, Willi Thomczyk, Peter Thorwarth, Alexandra Maria Lara, Michael Brandner, Tana Schanzara', null, 'Frustrated with their lazy new intern, a trio of offbeat builders decide to teach him a lesson with a series of escalating pranks.', 'Frustrated with their lazy new intern, a trio of offbeat builders decide to teach him a lesson with a series of escalating pranks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mbDegEdhElyCxlBZyVGgv684Qbg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9254'),
  ('91411966225036963', 'If It''s Tuesday, This Must Be Belgium', 1969, 'Romance, Comedy, Adventure', 'Mel Stuart, Vilis Lapenieks', 'David Shaw', 'Ian McShane, Suzanne Pleshette, Vittorio De Sica, Murray Hamilton, Sandy Baron, Mario Carotenuto, Paul Esser, Suzy Falk', null, 'A group of travelers from the United States race through seven European countries in 18 days.', 'A group of travelers from the United States race through seven European countries in 18 days.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ekeVazUMtejiDhuBiykEgbXUBsd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11643'),
  ('298988242145470626', 'If Life Gives You Lemons', 2018, 'Drama', 'Salvatore Landi, Ciro D''Emilio', 'Cosimo Calamini, Ciro D''Emilio', 'Anna Foglietta, Fabio De Caro, Biagio Forestieri, Giampiero De Concilio, Massimo De Matteo, Peppe Cioffi, Peppe Miale, Fulvio Sacco', null, 'Antonio is seventeen years old and has a dream: to be a footballer in a great team. He lives in a small village in the province of Campania, a place where getting away is not always that easy. What makes the situation even more complex is the wonderful Miriam, a kind and gentle, but highly problematical mother, who Antonio loves more than any other person in the world. On top of this there is Carlo, Antonio''s father who abandoned them when he was very young, and Miriam is obsessed with the idea of rebuilding her family. All of a sudden life seems to present Antonio and Miriam with a real opportunity: a talent scout looking for promising youngsters to take to the Parma team’s Primavera. But there is a high price to pay for every dream.', 'Antonio is seventeen years old and has a dream: to be a footballer in a great team. He lives in a small village in the province of Campania, a place where getting away is not always that easy. What makes the situation even more complex is the wonderful Miriam, a kind and gentle, but highly problematical mother, who Antonio loves more than any other person in the world. On top of this there is Carlo, Antonio''s father who abandoned them when he was very young, and Miriam is obsessed with the idea of rebuilding her family. All of a sudden life seems to present Antonio and Miriam with a real opportunity: a talent scout looking for promising youngsters to take to the Parma team’s Primavera. But there is a high price to pay for every dream.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eDfHGv9fG5kUgNUjRoclqsR6Cz9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:538368'),
  ('555449918870890506', 'If Looks Could Kill', 1991, 'Action, Comedy', 'William Dear, Douglas Milsome, Glenn Randall Jr.', 'Darren Star', 'Richard Grieco, Gabrielle Anwar, Roger Rees, Linda Hunt, Robin Bartlett, Carole Davis, Geraldine James, Michael Siberry', 'PG-13', 'Michael Corben, along with the rest of his high-school French class, sets out for a trip to France when he is mistaken for an agent of the same name. He is beseiged by both the good guys and the bad guys. British Intelligence outfits him with a series of James-Bond-like gizmos, and Steranko sends more would-be assassins after him. Can Michael stop the evil Steranko''s plans for European domination?', 'Michael Corben, along with the rest of his high-school French class, sets out for a trip to France when he is mistaken for an agent of the same name. He is beseiged by both the good guys and the bad guys. British Intelligence outfits him with a series of James-Bond-like gizmos, and Steranko sends more would-be assassins after him. Can Michael stop the evil Steranko''s plans for European domination?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rTjcoGpHONeacV4zewHi1oSttW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22434'),
  ('436830204458572046', 'If Lucy Fell', 1996, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Ron Fortunato, Eric Schaeffer', 'Eric Schaeffer', 'Sarah Jessica Parker, Eric Schaeffer, Ben Stiller, Elle Macpherson, James Rebhorn, Robert John Burke, Scarlett Johansson, Dominic Chianese', 'R', 'Joe and Lucy are roommates and best friends. Lucy, whose love life is embarrassingly dull, convinces Joe, who is infatuated with a neighbor he''s never met, that if they don''t have stable romances within a month, they must jump off the Brooklyn Bridge.', 'Joe and Lucy are roommates and best friends. Lucy, whose love life is embarrassingly dull, convinces Joe, who is infatuated with a neighbor he''s never met, that if they don''t have stable romances within a month, they must jump off the Brooklyn Bridge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l3Bwmjdon6JBDzJUA3ZSdMZZ7lI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10324'),
  ('970722854794003176', 'If Not This, Then That', 1958, 'Comedy, Music, Romance', 'Huseyn Seyidzadeh, Ramiz Eliyev, A. Filimonova', 'Sabit Rakhman', 'Äliagha Aghayev, Arif Mirzaquliyev, Tamara Gozalova, Agasadig Gararbayli, Barat Shekinskaya, Ismail Efendiyev, Mustafa Mardanov, Ismail Osmanli', null, 'Popularly known by the name of the main character, "Mashadi Ibad" was based on a musical comedy by composer Uzeyir Hajibeyov and written in the early 1900s. The story is based on the age old-theme of a beautiful young woman Gulnaz who falls in love with a young man Sarvar but is obliged to marry someone else.', 'Popularly known by the name of the main character, "Mashadi Ibad" was based on a musical comedy by composer Uzeyir Hajibeyov and written in the early 1900s. The story is based on the age old-theme of a beautiful young woman Gulnaz who falls in love with a young man Sarvar but is obliged to marry someone else.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9FONCrEX21Osmlu0N3mGj7Mk11a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:458671'),
  ('437782403121872057', 'If Not Us, Who?', 2011, 'Drama', 'Andres Veiel, Judith Kaufmann', 'Andres Veiel', 'August Diehl, Lena Lauzemis, Alexander Fehling, Thomas Thieme, Imogen Kogge, Michael Wittenborn, Susanne Lothar, Sebastian Blomberg', null, 'In the early 60s, Bernward Vesper and fellow university student Gudrun Ensslin begin a passionate love in the stifling atmosphere of provincial West Germany. Dedicated to the power of the written word, Bernward and Gudrun found a publishing house whose first publication is, paradoxically to many, a controversial past work of Bernward''s ostracized father, an infamous Nazi author. Bernward defends his father''s writing ability, even if he is haunted by his father''s suspicious past.', 'In the early 60s, Bernward Vesper and fellow university student Gudrun Ensslin begin a passionate love in the stifling atmosphere of provincial West Germany. Dedicated to the power of the written word, Bernward and Gudrun found a publishing house whose first publication is, paradoxically to many, a controversial past work of Bernward''s ostracized father, an infamous Nazi author. Bernward defends his father''s writing ability, even if he is haunted by his father''s suspicious past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3cyGoFnsUfrccxDdodzTw1fcEM0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73132'),
  ('917378297645673911', 'If Only', 2004, 'Drama, Romance, Fantasy', 'Gil Junger, Giles Nuttgens, Victoria Burrows', 'Christina Welsh', 'Jennifer Love Hewitt, Paul Nicholls, Tom Wilkinson, Diana Hardcastle, Lucy Davenport, Roy Sampson, Kevin Moore, Neville Phillips', 'PG-13', 'After his impetuous musician girlfriend, Samantha, dies in an accident shortly after they had a fight (and nearly broke up), Ian Wyndham, a grief-stricken British businessman living in London gets a chance to relive the day all over again, in the hope of changing the events that led up to her getting killed.', 'After his impetuous musician girlfriend, Samantha, dies in an accident shortly after they had a fight (and nearly broke up), Ian Wyndham, a grief-stricken British businessman living in London gets a chance to relive the day all over again, in the hope of changing the events that led up to her getting killed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m55qCh44VzrDhWSINr1MdB7RtAb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15775'),
  ('820786900000941907', 'If Only', 2020, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Ginevra Elkann, Vladan Radović', 'Ginevra Elkann, Chiara Barzini', 'Riccardo Scamarcio, Alba Rohrwacher, Ettore Giustiniani, Oro De Commarque, Milo Roussel, Céline Sallette, Brett Gelman, Florinda Bolkan', null, 'Alma, Jean and Sebastiano, the children of divorced parents, arrive in Rome from Paris on a visit to their father. During a holiday, the family’s tensions come to the surface.', 'Alma, Jean and Sebastiano, the children of divorced parents, arrive in Rome from Paris on a visit to their father. During a holiday, the family’s tensions come to the surface.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vy0lr38qUOBMMSOXzERgGkJHHJg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:614971'),
  ('281878426832506637', 'If Paris Were Told to Us', 1956, 'Comedy, Drama, History', 'Sacha Guitry, Philippe Agostini', null, 'Sacha Guitry, Louis de Funès, Jean Marais, Robert Lamoureux, Andrex, Renée Saint-Cyr, Françoise Arnoul, Danielle Darrieux', null, 'Historical film directed and written by Sacha Guitry follows the the history of Paris from its founding through the significant events in the city''s history.', 'Historical film directed and written by Sacha Guitry follows the the history of Paris from its founding through the significant events in the city''s history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d4nyq3tUfLNAMBRVSP3gu7c0gUW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80051'),
  ('630145650573075535', 'If the Enemy Doesn''t Surrender...', 1983, 'War, Drama, Action', 'Timofei Levchuk, Eduard Pluchik, G. Tarnopolskiy', 'Yevgeni Onopriyenko', 'Yakov Tripolsky, Mikhail Ulyanov, Vladimir Menshov, Valentin Kulik, Volodymyr Talashko, Anatoli Vasilyev, Valentin Gaft, Algimantas Masiulis', null, 'A story about one of the big battles of WWII.', 'A story about one of the big battles of WWII.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/okFGDXfbcpLjsBW7luYp4OffsCP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:431858'),
  ('742887733603516076', 'If the Father and the Son', 1955, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Kurt Schulz, Hans Quest', 'Gustav Kampendonk, Eckart Hachfeld', 'Heinz Rühmann, Oliver Grimm, Waltraut Haas, Robert Freitag, Pero Alexander, Fita Benkhoff, Carl-Heinz Schroth, Rudolf Schündler', null, 'After Clown Teddy lost his son, he lost his gift for laughter. He opened a joke shop and lives above the shop. His landlady has had a foster son since birth, and Teddy decides to raise the child, who always believed that Teddy was his father. When the mother suddenly appears five years later and wants her son, Teddy decides to run away with the child and goes back onstage with his son. Will the family catch up with them, or will the mother never get her son back?', 'After Clown Teddy lost his son, he lost his gift for laughter. He opened a joke shop and lives above the shop. His landlady has had a foster son since birth, and Teddy decides to raise the child, who always believed that Teddy was his father. When the mother suddenly appears five years later and wants her son, Teddy decides to run away with the child and goes back onstage with his son. Will the family catch up with them, or will the mother never get her son back?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A9VYcos5R5kfm2qLoJUlHfZB6gi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11715'),
  ('217125324802148475', 'If the Shoe Fits', 1990, 'Comedy, Romance, TV Movie', 'Tom Clegg, Françoise Menidrey, Pascal Deux', 'Madeline Di Maggio, Pamela Wallace', 'Rob Lowe, Jennifer Grey, Élisabeth Vitali, Andréa Ferréol, Rebecca Potok, Sacha Briquet, Florence Pelly, Alison Hornus', 'PG', 'A modern Cinderella in Paris: While the plain Kelly Carter works as a dresser for the famous fashion designer Francesco, she dreams of designing shoes for him. However she can''t win his attention... until she helps a good fairy on the street who, unbeknownst to Kelly, enchants a pair of Kelly''s shoes so that she turns into a supermodel whenever she wears them. She attends Francesco''s Ball and immediately wins his heart. Now, how can she make him love her real self?', 'A modern Cinderella in Paris: While the plain Kelly Carter works as a dresser for the famous fashion designer Francesco, she dreams of designing shoes for him. However she can''t win his attention... until she helps a good fairy on the street who, unbeknownst to Kelly, enchants a pair of Kelly''s shoes so that she turns into a supermodel whenever she wears them. She attends Francesco''s Ball and immediately wins his heart. Now, how can she make him love her real self?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dp8AwqwR12MZoHk2GQJMeO9cSkE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61535'),
  ('329140904572789016', 'If There Be Thorns', 2015, 'TV Movie, Thriller, Drama', 'James Liston, Nancy Savoca, Richard Flower', null, 'Heather Graham, Rachael Carpani, Jason Lewis, Mason Cook, Jedidiah Goodacre, Emily Tennant, Mackenzie Gray, Glynis Davies', null, 'Christopher and Cathy Dollanganger live together as man and wife with Cathy''s two sons who are unaware of the incestuous nature of their parents'' relationship. But when a mysterious woman moves in next door and befriends the younger boy, Bart, he begins a strange transformation and displays accusatory behavior towards Cathy and Christopher. When Christopher discovers their mysterious neighbor is, in fact, his mother Corrine Dollanganger, all of the family''s long-hidden secrets are revealed in a tragic climax.', 'Christopher and Cathy Dollanganger live together as man and wife with Cathy''s two sons who are unaware of the incestuous nature of their parents'' relationship. But when a mysterious woman moves in next door and befriends the younger boy, Bart, he begins a strange transformation and displays accusatory behavior towards Cathy and Christopher. When Christopher discovers their mysterious neighbor is, in fact, his mother Corrine Dollanganger, all of the family''s long-hidden secrets are revealed in a tragic climax.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9hL5RbsqidxK7bkXxKIxWdIVvPA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:333653'),
  ('659319975339513482', 'If These Walls Could Sing', 2022, 'Documentary, Music', 'Mary McCartney, Ben Magahy, Tim Cragg', null, 'Mary McCartney, Paul McCartney, Ringo Starr, Noel Gallagher, Liam Gallagher, Elton John, Giles Martin, John Williams', 'PG-13', 'The untold story of the Abbey Road studio, all-star interviews and intimate access to the premises.', 'The untold story of the Abbey Road studio, all-star interviews and intimate access to the premises.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pvyDU4uekUMtWlNXB5yugBtVjNH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:926392'),
  ('941344781600185967', 'If These Walls Could Talk', 1996, 'TV Movie, Drama', 'Cher, Nancy Savoca, Bobby Bukowski', 'Susan Nanus, Nancy Savoca, I. Marlene King', 'Demi Moore, Sissy Spacek, Cher, Shirley Knight, Catherine Keener, Jason London, CCH Pounder, Kevin Cooney', 'R', 'A powerful, intimate portrait of three women living in the same house during different eras who all face unplanned pregnancies. The vignettes follow a recently widowed nurse struggling to take control of her life in the early 50s, a mother of four balancing raising a family and maintaining a career in the 70s, and a student making a difficult decision with the help of one woman that will change the course of both their lives in the 90s.', 'A powerful, intimate portrait of three women living in the same house during different eras who all face unplanned pregnancies. The vignettes follow a recently widowed nurse struggling to take control of her life in the early 50s, a mother of four balancing raising a family and maintaining a career in the 70s, and a student making a difficult decision with the help of one woman that will change the course of both their lives in the 90s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5foda9jN8pAM9zvKP5iFdITepWj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35203'),
  ('477754568319190208', 'If These Walls Could Talk 2', 2000, 'Romance, Drama', 'Jane Anderson, Martha Coolidge, Phil Robinson', 'Anne Heche, Jane Anderson, Sylvia Sichel', 'Vanessa Redgrave, Michelle Williams, Ellen DeGeneres, Chloë Sevigny, Marian Seldes, Paul Giamatti, Elizabeth Perkins, Nia Long', 'R', 'The stories of three lesbian couples -- who live in the same house at different periods of time -- who are at a crossroads in their lives. In 1961, Edith loses her lover, Abby, to a stroke. Linda and Amy struggle with feminist issues in 1972. And, in 2000, Kal and Fran try to have a baby with the help of sperm donor.', 'The stories of three lesbian couples -- who live in the same house at different periods of time -- who are at a crossroads in their lives. In 1961, Edith loses her lover, Abby, to a stroke. Linda and Amy struggle with feminist issues in 1972. And, in 2000, Kal and Fran try to have a baby with the help of sperm donor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1bwmJfLJVoxmj96qKVuE9oSmEUS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28031'),
  ('186853934992804057', 'If They Tell You I Fell', 1989, 'Drama, Thriller, Mystery, Romance', 'Vicente Aranda, Juan Amorós, Pere Joan Ventura', 'Vicente Aranda', 'Jorge Sanz, Victoria Abril, Antonio Banderas, Javier Gurruchaga, Lluís Homar, Ferran Rañé, Carlos Tristancho, Joan Miralles', null, 'In the post Spanish civil war years, Catalan kids would sit in circles among the ruins and tell stories, known as "aventis" (the film''s original title in Catalan, its original language). These tales mix war stories, local gossip, comic book characters, fantasy and real events. The "aventis" told in this film are told in flashback. In the mid 80s, 45 or so years after the age of the "aventis," a doctor and a nurse-nun (who grew up together, and now are co-workers in a hospital) identify the corpse of one of the main characters of the "aventis" of their childhood and adolescence. Besides the interesting flashbacks - a chronical of the Civil War in a "typical" Barcelona microcosm itself, the discovery of this body (belonging to someone long presumed dead) leads to other surprises and unresolved doubts, several decades later', 'In the post Spanish civil war years, Catalan kids would sit in circles among the ruins and tell stories, known as "aventis" (the film''s original title in Catalan, its original language). These tales mix war stories, local gossip, comic book characters, fantasy and real events. The "aventis" told in this film are told in flashback. In the mid 80s, 45 or so years after the age of the "aventis," a doctor and a nurse-nun (who grew up together, and now are co-workers in a hospital) identify the corpse of one of the main characters of the "aventis" of their childhood and adolescence. Besides the interesting flashbacks - a chronical of the Civil War in a "typical" Barcelona microcosm itself, the discovery of this body (belonging to someone long presumed dead) leads to other surprises and unresolved doubts, several decades later', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lI5KtEPz9AYkjKCqq3o83688JVO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59877'),
  ('232237363628981922', 'If They''re Roses...', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Marco Limberti, Paolo De Lucia, Barbara Giordani', 'Filippo Bologna, Leonardo Pieraccioni', 'Leonardo Pieraccioni, Elena Cucci, Caterina Murino, Claudia Pandolfi, Gabriella Pession, Michela Andreozzi, Antonia Truppo, Mariasole Pollio', null, 'Leonardo is still single and immature as ever at 50. Tired to see him like that, his daughter texts all his exes "I''m a changed man: let''s try again", setting in motion an unexpected trip down memory lane.', 'Leonardo is still single and immature as ever at 50. Tired to see him like that, his daughter texts all his exes "I''m a changed man: let''s try again", setting in motion an unexpected trip down memory lane.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8YsINmTMh7lCSJjMgyp6hKs0ZO4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:558022'),
  ('718508019876776830', 'If You Are the One', 2008, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Feng Xiaogang, Lü Yue', 'Feng Xiaogang', 'Ge You, Shu Qi, Fan Wei, Alex Fong Chung-Sun, Vivian Hsu, Hu Ke, Luo Haiqiong, Che Xiao', null, 'Qin Fen, a funny, honest, single inventor, met a girl called Smiley, who was in agony of her boyfriend''s betrayal. They traveled to Hokkaido, tried to help Smiley cure her pain in heart, and both of them gradually found their true love and life redemption during the journey.', 'Qin Fen, a funny, honest, single inventor, met a girl called Smiley, who was in agony of her boyfriend''s betrayal. They traveled to Hokkaido, tried to help Smiley cure her pain in heart, and both of them gradually found their true love and life redemption during the journey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5EJ3WXtAV0itREDaFM4GRhFSTh8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18232'),
  ('575443599108771167', 'If You Are the One 2', 2010, 'Comedy, Romance, Fantasy', 'Feng Xiaogang, Lü Yue', 'Wang Shuo', 'Ge You, Shu Qi, Sun Honglei, Yao Chen, Zhang Hanyu, Liao Fan, Ady An, Shao Bing', null, 'The odd-couple courtship saga continues of wealthy, middle-aged retiree Qin Fen and serious-minded young air hostess Xiaoxiao. After an amusing prelude in which Qin presides over a lavish divorce ceremony for an amicably splitting married couple, he and Xiaoxiao decide to address their own relationship barriers — her youth and beauty, his cynical, childish sense of humor — by entering into a trial marriage while on a trip to the country''s tropical southeast.', 'The odd-couple courtship saga continues of wealthy, middle-aged retiree Qin Fen and serious-minded young air hostess Xiaoxiao. After an amusing prelude in which Qin presides over a lavish divorce ceremony for an amicably splitting married couple, he and Xiaoxiao decide to address their own relationship barriers — her youth and beauty, his cynical, childish sense of humor — by entering into a trial marriage while on a trip to the country''s tropical southeast.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3FjlLKcay0hV6BcizAIMVlhCoWe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56540'),
  ('8971427166980725', 'If You Are the One 3', 2023, 'Comedy, Romance, Science Fiction', 'Feng Xiaogang, Rui Zhong', 'Feng Xiaogang', 'Ge You, Shu Qi, Fan Wei, Li Chengru, Guan Xiaotong, Yu Shuxin, Yue Yunpeng, Chang Yuan', null, 'In 2031, Qin retires alone on a small island, as his wife Xiaoxiao is away all year long. Fan, Qin''s friend, designs an android identical to Xiaoxiao to keep Qin company.', 'In 2031, Qin retires alone on a small island, as his wife Xiaoxiao is away all year long. Fan, Qin''s friend, designs an android identical to Xiaoxiao to keep Qin company.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eMsP44KNK4jspZxvZj1E9GE6nk9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1211979'),
  ('798951840954830465', 'If You Could Only Cook', 1935, 'Comedy, Romance, Crime', 'William A. Seiter, John Stumar', 'Howard J. Green, Gertrude Purcell', 'Herbert Marshall, Jean Arthur, Leo Carrillo, Lionel Stander, Alan Edwards, Frieda Inescort, Gene Morgan, Ralf Harolde', 'NR', 'An auto engineer and a professor''s daughter pose as married servants in a mobster''s mansion.', 'An auto engineer and a professor''s daughter pose as married servants in a mobster''s mansion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u8fy1AI1FCx1eUY3MdwnrHsCsMB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126083'),
  ('126979872274432570', 'If You Die, I''ll Kill You', 2011, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Hiner Saleem, Manuel Teran', 'Hiner Saleem', 'Jonathan Zaccaï, Golshifteh Farahani, Billey Demirtaş, Özz Nüjen, Menderes Samancılar, Nazmi Kırık, Mylène Demongeot, Jane Birkin', null, 'In Paris'' cosmopolitan and colorful 10th arrondissement, Philippe, who''s fresh out of prison, crosses paths with Avdal, a Kurd who is trying to track down an Iraqi war criminal. Avdal, who dreams of staying in France, plans to bring his fiancee Siba to Paris. She''s due to arrive in the next few days. The two men strike up a friendship and when Avdal dies suddenly and unexpectedly, Philippe finds himself left to organize the funeral arrangements. What should he do with the body? Siba arrives in Paris, and soon learns that Avdal has died. She is taken in by a group of Kurdish men and before long she also meets Philippe - all of whom are quite smitten by her beauty. Meanwhile, Avdal''s father Cheto, a devout Muslim, comes to Paris to grieve for his son. He intends to force Siba to return to her homeland, but the young woman has now had a taste of freedom.', 'In Paris'' cosmopolitan and colorful 10th arrondissement, Philippe, who''s fresh out of prison, crosses paths with Avdal, a Kurd who is trying to track down an Iraqi war criminal. Avdal, who dreams of staying in France, plans to bring his fiancee Siba to Paris. She''s due to arrive in the next few days. The two men strike up a friendship and when Avdal dies suddenly and unexpectedly, Philippe finds himself left to organize the funeral arrangements. What should he do with the body? Siba arrives in Paris, and soon learns that Avdal has died. She is taken in by a group of Kurdish men and before long she also meets Philippe - all of whom are quite smitten by her beauty. Meanwhile, Avdal''s father Cheto, a devout Muslim, comes to Paris to grieve for his son. He intends to force Siba to return to her homeland, but the young woman has now had a taste of freedom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7g9dHTsWLhZMJJ1nJAbLmW9nKxy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:145361'),
  ('389495659850533007', 'If You Don''t Like It, Look Away', 2025, 'Documentary, Comedy', 'Margaux Fournier, Théo Vincent-Suzzoni', 'Margaux Fournier', 'Joëlle, Joëlle, Régine, Carmen, Serge, Nicolas', null, 'Every day, Joëlle meets her retired friends on Bain des Dames’s beachin Marseille. Like in an open-air theater, they laugh, talk about love, sex, aging bodies, and remake the world with the freedom of those who have nothing left to prove.', 'Every day, Joëlle meets her retired friends on Bain des Dames’s beachin Marseille. Like in an open-air theater, they laugh, talk about love, sex, aging bodies, and remake the world with the freedom of those who have nothing left to prove.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5oLz8Es3W7IhRCDBCvmnp2QHhTD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1483921'),
  ('442578172924066316', 'If You Don''t Stop It...You''ll Go Blind!!!', 1975, 'Comedy', 'John Dirlam, Keefe Brasselle, I. Robert Levy', 'Mike Callie', 'George Spencer, Jane Kellem, Uschi Digard, Patrick Wright, Garth Pillsbury, Herb Graham, Alan Sinclair, Pat McCormick', 'R', 'A series of vignettes, usually of a crude sexual nature, from various not so well known comedians combining to make a hilarious spoof.', 'A series of vignettes, usually of a crude sexual nature, from various not so well known comedians combining to make a hilarious spoof.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e5gsq7k7DQLgg9jXTH9mb0n7uVl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:204090'),
  ('402676644939834097', 'If You Don''t, I Will', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Sophie Fillières, Emmanuelle Collinot', 'Sophie Fillières', 'Emmanuelle Devos, Mathieu Amalric, Anne Brochet, Joséphine de la Baume, Nelson Delapalme, Laurent Poitrenaux, Julia Roy, David Clark', null, 'A couple goes on a hike in the woods, and the woman refuses to return.', 'A couple goes on a hike in the woods, and the woman refuses to return.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8qJYB1sMXcJKaxQ9kRhoDDhHxxe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:253944'),
  ('1105893932523241886', 'If You Knew How Beautiful It Is Here', 2015, 'TV Movie, Crime, Drama', 'Andreas Prochaska, Thomas W. Kiennast', 'Stefan Hafner, Thomas Weingartner', 'Gerhard Liebmann, Simon Hatzl, Ines Honsel, Manuel Sefciuc, Fritz Egger, Susanne Kubelka, Arthur Klemt, Robert Putzinger', null, 'The 16-year-old daughter of the highest dignitary in Hüttenberg is found murdered in the disused mine. For the first time, Muck has to deal with a case of this magnitude.', 'The 16-year-old daughter of the highest dignitary in Hüttenberg is found murdered in the disused mine. For the first time, Muck has to deal with a case of this magnitude.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ginvk50ekpl2zdcTrlBTODpRSdN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:373332'),
  ('1055688140507575998', 'If You Love Me', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Marcello Montarsi, Fausto Brizzi', 'Fausto Brizzi, Herbert Simone Paragnani, Mauro Uzzeo', 'Claudio Bisio, Sergio Rubini, Dino Abbrescia, Lorena Cacciatore, Valeria Fabrizi, Flavio Insinna, Susy Laude, Maria Amelia Monti', null, 'After a suicide attempt, depressed lawyer Diego decides to take up the mantle of good Samaritan by helping his loved ones fix the problems in their life, but ends up bringing only utter havoc.', 'After a suicide attempt, depressed lawyer Diego decides to take up the mantle of good Samaritan by helping his loved ones fix the problems in their life, but ends up bringing only utter havoc.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y6bPYaxQ6RLvYYIZqhnlzymYNV7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:593400'),
  ('689470925836017342', 'If You Meet Sartana Pray for Your Death', 1968, 'Western', 'Gianfranco Parolini, Sandro Mancori, Ignazio Dolce', 'Gianfranco Parolini, Renato Izzo, Theo Maria Werner', 'Gianni Garko, Fernando Sancho, William Berger, Sydney Chaplin, Gianni Rizzo, Franco Pesce, Heidi Fischer, Maria Pia Conte', null, 'After a stagecoach is robbed and the passengers murdered, a long and tangled series of surprise attacks and murderous double-crosses, leaves the coach''s strongbox in the hands of the killer Lasky. It is up to the legendary hero Sartana to track down the missing money and determine just who is ultimately behind the grisly robberies and killings.', 'After a stagecoach is robbed and the passengers murdered, a long and tangled series of surprise attacks and murderous double-crosses, leaves the coach''s strongbox in the hands of the killer Lasky. It is up to the legendary hero Sartana to track down the missing money and determine just who is ultimately behind the grisly robberies and killings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bCNoJDWXZP2WzX7WJYo8CTXXkoM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83122'),
  ('403146355063458524', 'If You Saw His Heart', 2017, 'Drama', 'Joan Chemla', 'Joan Chemla, Santiago Amigorena', 'Gael García Bernal, Marine Vacth, Nahuel Pérez Biscayart, Karim Leklou, Wojciech Pszoniak, Alba Galocha, Mariano Santiago, Antonia Malinova', null, 'Cast out of his insular community, a damaged and down on his luck man teeters between a life of crime and the path to redemption.', 'Cast out of his insular community, a damaged and down on his luck man teeters between a life of crime and the path to redemption.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1RwUxHZA4yCRPRpWj0eyIGkT5To.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:470818'),
  ('453520357770469415', 'If You Were Me', 2003, 'Drama', 'Park Chan-wook, Jeong Jae-eun, Yeo Kyun-dong', 'Jeong Jae-eun, Park Chan-wook, Park Jin-pyo', 'Jo Sun-kyung, Lee Seol-Hee, Kil Hae-yeon, Ju Jin-mo, Jeon Ha-eun, Baek Jong-hak, Byeon Jung-su, Kim Moon-joo', null, 'Anthology film of six shorts by leading Korean directors. Park Chan-Wook, tackles racial prejudice and the economic exploitation of immigrant workers through the real-life story of a Nepalese woman in Korea. Jeong Jae-Eun, tackles the plight of a paedophile released into the community. Yeo Gyun-Dong, invites disabled actor Kim Moon-Joo to re-enact his most famous protest. Im Soon-Rye, goes for the engrained sexism of Korean men with superb wit and, Park Jin-Pyo, confronts the horror of children forced into oral surgery to improve their English-speaking ability.', 'Anthology film of six shorts by leading Korean directors. Park Chan-Wook, tackles racial prejudice and the economic exploitation of immigrant workers through the real-life story of a Nepalese woman in Korea. Jeong Jae-Eun, tackles the plight of a paedophile released into the community. Yeo Gyun-Dong, invites disabled actor Kim Moon-Joo to re-enact his most famous protest. Im Soon-Rye, goes for the engrained sexism of Korean men with superb wit and, Park Jin-Pyo, confronts the horror of children forced into oral surgery to improve their English-speaking ability.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5dzNLRKnzx2DzxsGul7rTYdylUb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65318'),
  ('795862208233509061', 'If You Were the Last', 2024, 'Science Fiction, Romance, Comedy', 'Alex Disenhof, Kristian Mercado Figueroa, Alisa Fredericks', 'Angela Bourassa', 'Anthony Mackie, Zoë Chao, Natalie Morales, Geoff Stults, Missi Pyle, Sarah Voigt, Kaleka, Jason Bayle', 'R', 'Adrift in their broken-down space shuttle with little hope of rescue, two astronauts argue over whether they''re better off spending their remaining days as friends or something more.', 'Adrift in their broken-down space shuttle with little hope of rescue, two astronauts argue over whether they''re better off spending their remaining days as friends or something more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bEyfMRY7frsy1v5yesdQEWjf1qz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:777847'),
  ('1055002127918627007', 'if....', 1968, 'Drama', 'Lindsay Anderson, Miroslav Ondříček', 'John Howlett', 'Malcolm McDowell, David Wood, Richard Warwick, Christine Noonan, Rupert Webster, Robert Swann, Hugh Thomas, Michael Cadman', 'R', 'In an English boys'' boarding school, social hierarchy reigns supreme and power remains in the hands of distanced and ineffectual teachers and callously vicious prefects in the Upper Sixth. Three Lower Sixth students, Wallace, Johnny and leader Mick Travis decide on a shocking course of action to redress the balance of privilege once and for all.', 'In an English boys'' boarding school, social hierarchy reigns supreme and power remains in the hands of distanced and ineffectual teachers and callously vicious prefects in the Upper Sixth. Three Lower Sixth students, Wallace, Johnny and leader Mick Travis decide on a shocking course of action to redress the balance of privilege once and for all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oqlpAGq4aXhc6ODtxBcGM1SEoIp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14794'),
  ('118784026439363864', 'İffet', 1982, 'Drama', 'Kartal Tibet, Ertunç Şenkay', 'Yavuz Turgul', 'Müjde Ar, Faruk Peker, Savaş Başar, Ergün Uçucu, Suna Selen, Ayten Erman, Damla Coşkunoğlu, Buket Sayhan', null, 'Iffet lives in a low income neighbourhood of Istanbul with her sister and father under the strict rules of her father. She can not even go visit her aunt since she is not allowed to leave home without permission. She nevethless falls in love with Cemil…', 'Iffet lives in a low income neighbourhood of Istanbul with her sister and father under the strict rules of her father. She can not even go visit her aunt since she is not allowed to leave home without permission. She nevethless falls in love with Cemil…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mtfu2M67dTfeesb4VX2XIRvM2Oy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:428228'),
  ('440602189459628224', 'Iftar Soda', 2016, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Yüksel Aksu, Mirsad Herović, Mehmet Kurtuluş', 'Yüksel Aksu', 'Cem Yılmaz, Berat Efe Parlar, Ümmü Putgül, Okan Avcı, Yilmaz Bayraktar, Macit Koper, Gün Koper, Greta Fusco', null, 'In early 1970s, Adem is a boy living in an Aegean village with his family. He just finished the primary school and he wants to work while he''s on summer holiday. He gets permission from his family to work for a soda pop seller named Ciber Kemal. But the Ramadan has just came and Adem wants to do his fast while he''s working. But he starts seeing hallucinations because of the hot summer day. It seems it''s going to be the longest day of Adem.', 'In early 1970s, Adem is a boy living in an Aegean village with his family. He just finished the primary school and he wants to work while he''s on summer holiday. He gets permission from his family to work for a soda pop seller named Ciber Kemal. But the Ramadan has just came and Adem wants to do his fast while he''s working. But he starts seeing hallucinations because of the hot summer day. It seems it''s going to be the longest day of Adem.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9SWxIHHQLNmILDBiksHus2Ej0tC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:380464'),
  ('244835008322647607', 'Igby Goes Down', 2002, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Burr Steers, Wedigo von Schultzendorff', 'Burr Steers', 'Kieran Culkin, Susan Sarandon, Jeff Goldblum, Claire Danes, Jared Harris, Amanda Peet, Ryan Phillippe, Bill Pullman', 'R', 'Igby Slocumb, a rebellious and sarcastic 17-year-old boy, is at war with the stifling world of old money privilege he was born into. With a schizophrenic father, a self-absorbed, distant mother, and a shark-like young Republican big brother, Igby figures there must be a better life out there -- and sets about finding it.', 'Igby Slocumb, a rebellious and sarcastic 17-year-old boy, is at war with the stifling world of old money privilege he was born into. With a schizophrenic father, a self-absorbed, distant mother, and a shark-like young Republican big brother, Igby figures there must be a better life out there -- and sets about finding it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f53JBgzYESamcYT3LkUeeoSXPgi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9685'),
  ('901657701274997675', 'Ignace', 1937, 'Comedy', 'Pierre Colombier', 'Jean Manse', 'Fernandel, Saturnin Fabre, Fernand Charpin, Alice Tissot, Raymond Cordy, Andrex, Nita Raya, Charles Redgie', null, 'Ignace Boitaclou, although sympathetic, is not very intelligent. Upon his arrival at the barracks to perform his military service, he was appointed colonel and had to take care of the latter''s terrible wife.', 'Ignace Boitaclou, although sympathetic, is not very intelligent. Upon his arrival at the barracks to perform his military service, he was appointed colonel and had to take care of the latter''s terrible wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h3m0MSqdrXtcDj2vJbcWY5RYZod.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74819'),
  ('567515329204576519', 'Ignorance Is Bliss', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Riccardo Antonaroli, Laura Greco, Alessandro Pesci', 'Herbert Simone Paragnani, Massimiliano Bruno, Gianni Corsi', 'Marco Giallini, Alessandro Gassmann, Valeria Bilello, Carolina Crescentini, Teresa Romagnoli, Michela Andreozzi, Alessandro Di Carlo, Pietro De Silva', null, 'Ernesto and Filippo, two high school teachers, couldn’t be more different: Filippo is a cheerful liberal who is constantly online. Handsome and youthful, he is a serial seducer on the social networks. Ernesto, instead is a stern conservative, rigorously computerless. He is probably the last person around who still has a first-generation cell phone and his teaching methods are very traditional. They used to be best friends but an unresolved fight kept them far apart, until the day fate intervened and they found themselves teaching at the same school. Their opposite viewpoints will soon and inevitably lead to a new clash. The internet will force them to deal with their past, which resurfaces in the shape of Nina, a young woman who conducts an experiment on them: Filippo must try to leave the world of Internet and Ernesto must try to enter it.', 'Ernesto and Filippo, two high school teachers, couldn’t be more different: Filippo is a cheerful liberal who is constantly online. Handsome and youthful, he is a serial seducer on the social networks. Ernesto, instead is a stern conservative, rigorously computerless. He is probably the last person around who still has a first-generation cell phone and his teaching methods are very traditional. They used to be best friends but an unresolved fight kept them far apart, until the day fate intervened and they found themselves teaching at the same school. Their opposite viewpoints will soon and inevitably lead to a new clash. The internet will force them to deal with their past, which resurfaces in the shape of Nina, a young woman who conducts an experiment on them: Filippo must try to leave the world of Internet and Ernesto must try to enter it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zI0jYXFdiG9jram9yWSadttUyxB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:419522'),
  ('1104450224333525880', 'Igor', 2008, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Fantasy, Horror', 'Tony Leondis', 'Tony Leondis, Dimitri Toscas, John Hoffman', 'John Cusack, Myleene Klass, Robin Walsh, Matt McKenna, John Cleese, Steve Buscemi, Sean Hayes, Eddie Izzard', 'PG', 'A cliché hunchbacked evil scientist''s assistant aspires to become a scientist himself, much to the displeasure of the rest of the evil science community.', 'A cliché hunchbacked evil scientist''s assistant aspires to become a scientist himself, much to the displeasure of the rest of the evil science community.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mI4SPs0bZQm7bGVZKToC8KUsTd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14248'),
  ('198016962002319225', 'Igor and the Lunatics', 1985, 'Horror', 'W.J. Parolini', 'Jocelyn Beard, W.J. Parolini', 'Joseph Eero, Mary Ann Schacht, Joe Niola, T.J. Glenn, Joan Ellen Delaney, Peter Dain, Kathleen Dennehy, Constance Rodgers', 'R', 'After 16 years in prison, Igor and his gang are out and bent on taking revenge on the town that sent them up.', 'After 16 years in prison, Igor and his gang are out and bent on taking revenge on the town that sent them up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/47NdOemyAI4Zy0V1UjeZWCctL43.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85567'),
  ('476330257598493288', 'Iguana', 1988, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Monte Hellman, Josep M. Civit', 'Steven Gaydos, Monte Hellman, David M. Zehr', 'Everett McGill, Fabio Testi, Michael Madsen, Jack Taylor, Michael J. Bradford, Roger Kendall, Robert Case, Maru Valdivielso', 'NR', 'A grotesquely disfigured harpooner called Iguana is severely mistreated by his fellow sailors on a whaling ship in the 19th century. One night he escapes and takes up residence on a remote island. He makes himself ruler of the island and declares war on mankind. Anyone unfortunate enough to wind up on the island with Iguana is subjected to his cruel tyranny.', 'A grotesquely disfigured harpooner called Iguana is severely mistreated by his fellow sailors on a whaling ship in the 19th century. One night he escapes and takes up residence on a remote island. He makes himself ruler of the island and declares war on mankind. Anyone unfortunate enough to wind up on the island with Iguana is subjected to his cruel tyranny.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yN6FIIICpMp9DyRXk9trUm3t3zt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:191229'),
  ('847982729432507826', 'iHostage', 2025, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Bobby Boermans', 'Simon de Waal', 'Soufiane Moussouli, Admir Šehović, Emmanuel Ohene Boafo, Fockeline Ouwerkerk, Roosmarijn van der Hoek, Robin Boissevain, Louis Talpe, Marcel Hensema', 'R', 'When a gunman enters an Apple Store in the heart of Amsterdam, the police face a delicate challenge to resolve the standoff.', 'When a gunman enters an Apple Store in the heart of Amsterdam, the police face a delicate challenge to resolve the standoff.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tn3Ckxyc7OWXnhMPkiIBvqLdFC6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1371202'),
  ('828883755658352419', 'III', 2015, 'Thriller, Drama, Horror', 'Pavel Khvaleev', 'Aleksandra Khvaleeva', 'Polina Davydova, Lyubov Ignatushko, Evgeniy Gagarin, Andrey Abramichev, Galina Kritsuk, Maxim Kuplyanin, Anton Gamaev, Julia Sarkisova', null, 'A small European town, where sisters Ayia and Mirra live, gets struck down by an unknown disease which takes many lives. Following their mother''s death, the younger sister falls ill. Having realized that conventional medicine is useless in the face of the sister''s disease, Ayia seeks help from Father Herman, a parish priest and a close family friend. In his house she finds books that are very far from the conventional religion. She gets to know that only penetration into Mirra''s sick subconscious mind and discovery of the true cause of her disease will give her a chance to save her sister. Ayia is ready to go through this terrifying ritual, dive into the depths of the subconscious mind, and face the demons residing there. But will she cope with her own fear when she discovers the mysteries of her sister''s past? Since the closer to the bottom of the ocean, the darker it gets.', 'A small European town, where sisters Ayia and Mirra live, gets struck down by an unknown disease which takes many lives. Following their mother''s death, the younger sister falls ill. Having realized that conventional medicine is useless in the face of the sister''s disease, Ayia seeks help from Father Herman, a parish priest and a close family friend. In his house she finds books that are very far from the conventional religion. She gets to know that only penetration into Mirra''s sick subconscious mind and discovery of the true cause of her disease will give her a chance to save her sister. Ayia is ready to go through this terrifying ritual, dive into the depths of the subconscious mind, and face the demons residing there. But will she cope with her own fear when she discovers the mysteries of her sister''s past? Since the closer to the bottom of the ocean, the darker it gets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dad6DDNXKihLtoSaGpDlU9VLRCA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:329013'),
  ('987364730903689453', 'Ijaazat', 1987, 'Romance, Drama', 'Gulzar, Ashfaque Ahmed, Monesh Prem', 'Arun Kaul', 'Rekha, Naseeruddin Shah, Anuradha Patel, Rammohan Sharma, Sulabha Deshpande, Dina Pathak, Rita Rani Kaul, Ashok Mehta', null, 'An estranged couple accidentally meet in a railway station''s waiting room and revisit their past.', 'An estranged couple accidentally meet in a railway station''s waiting room and revisit their past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6b8bMbbVYDcw78m2ts0d6PMC2HO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118133'),
  ('219622677924172073', 'Ik ben Joep Meloen', 1981, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Mat van Hensbergen, Frans Bromet, Guus Verstraete jr.', null, 'André van Duin, Corrie van Gorp, Frans van Dusschoten, Doris Van Caneghem, Peter Tuinman, André van den Heuvel, Will Van Selst, Inger van Heyst', null, 'Joep is a piano tuner, and not the best in his profession. His fiancee ends their relationship and Joep wants to end his life. Then he meets Dorien. They fall in love, but they must deal with some issues from the past--like an ex-lover and a hitman.', 'Joep is a piano tuner, and not the best in his profession. His fiancee ends their relationship and Joep wants to end his life. Then he meets Dorien. They fall in love, but they must deal with some issues from the past--like an ex-lover and a hitman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kmNKw7xSJaJfQfaJx6zSbvi1ndM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80690'),
  ('709843907701837447', 'Ikar and Sages', 1976, 'Animation', 'Fyodor Khitruk, Mikhail Druyan, Tatyana Lytko', 'Fyodor Khitruk', null, null, 'It is a parable about world wisdom and "madness of brave men" who are ready to risk their life for the sake of new opening.', 'It is a parable about world wisdom and "madness of brave men" who are ready to risk their life for the sake of new opening.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tAu3FAsGsI6ay4yZvlr6gQJ8XBk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90058'),
  ('1018175422980200750', 'Ikarie XB 1', 1963, 'Science Fiction', 'Hynek Bočan, Jindřich Polák, Jan Kališ', 'Pavel Juráček, Jindřich Polák', 'Zdeněk Štěpánek, František Smolík, Dana Medřická, Irena Kačírková, Radovan Lukavský, Otto Lackovič, Miroslav Macháček, Jiří Vršťala', null, 'The year is 2163. Starship Ikaria XB 1 embarks on a mission deep into space in search of alien life. During their perilous journey the crew confront the effects of a malignant dark star, the destructive legacy of the 20th century and, ultimately, the limits of their own sanity.', 'The year is 2163. Starship Ikaria XB 1 embarks on a mission deep into space in search of alien life. During their perilous journey the crew confront the effects of a malignant dark star, the destructive legacy of the 20th century and, ultimately, the limits of their own sanity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/svpzTXId4kH1pwn71e3ZOFUxd7L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19757'),
  ('353246216935614457', 'Ike: Countdown to D-Day', 2004, 'Drama, War, History, TV Movie', 'Robert Harmon', 'Lionel Chetwynd', 'Tom Selleck, James Remar, Timothy Bottoms, Gerald McRaney, Ian Mune, Bruce Phillips, John Bach, Nick Blake', 'PG', 'The story of the senior-level preparations for the D-Day invasion on June 6, 1944 from the time of Dwight D. Eisenhower''s appointment as the Supreme Allied Commander in Europe, to the establishment of the beachhead in Normandy.', 'The story of the senior-level preparations for the D-Day invasion on June 6, 1944 from the time of Dwight D. Eisenhower''s appointment as the Supreme Allied Commander in Europe, to the establishment of the beachhead in Normandy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a094KlACWR9GMYTdSfCt1HUQHoX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31065'),
  ('761908462192085438', 'Ikebana', 1957, 'Documentary', 'Hiroshi Teshigahara', null, 'Tomoko Naraoka, Sofu Teshigahara', null, 'The history and art of ikebana, a centuries old Japanese art of flower arrangement and a look inside the Sogetsu School of Ikebana, where the director''s father Sofu Teshigahara worked as the grand master of the school.', 'The history and art of ikebana, a centuries old Japanese art of flower arrangement and a look inside the Sogetsu School of Ikebana, where the director''s father Sofu Teshigahara worked as the grand master of the school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/50LF4c0i69qW3qYv3sEqwdjQA6G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105580'),
  ('271444990135964404', 'Ikigami: The Ultimate Limit', 2008, 'Drama', 'Tomoyuki Takimoto, Hajime Gonno', 'Motorô Mase', 'Shota Matsuda, Takashi Tsukamoto, Riko Narumi, Takayuki Yamada, Akira Emoto, Yuta Kanai, Kazuma Sano, Takashi Sasano', null, 'In an attempt to spur citizens into taking more productive roles in society, the Japanese government issues death messages, or "ikigami", informing them that they have only 24 hours left to live. The film follows a young man tasked with delivering these messages, as well as the victims.', 'In an attempt to spur citizens into taking more productive roles in society, the Japanese government issues death messages, or "ikigami", informing them that they have only 24 hours left to live. The film follows a young man tasked with delivering these messages, as well as the victims.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o9aTO5AV4ii4KctEZ4kFHJsEesb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19063'),
  ('666475460859287962', 'Ikiru', 1952, 'Drama', 'Akira Kurosawa, Asakazu Nakai', 'Shinobu Hashimoto, Akira Kurosawa, Hideo Oguni', 'Takashi Shimura, Haruo Tanaka, Nobuo Kaneko, Bokuzen Hidari, Miki Odagiri, Shinichi Himori, Minoru Chiaki, Minosuke Yamada', 'NR', 'Kanji Watanabe is a middle-aged man who has worked in the same monotonous bureaucratic position for decades. Learning he has cancer, he starts to look for the meaning of his life.', 'Kanji Watanabe is a middle-aged man who has worked in the same monotonous bureaucratic position for decades. Learning he has cancer, he starts to look for the meaning of his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dgNTS4EQDDVfkzJI5msKuHu2Ei3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3782'),
  ('628968265281993882', 'Ikki Tousen in Kyoto', 2011, 'Action, Animation', 'Rion Kujo', 'Takawo Yoshioka', 'Masumi Asano, Satoshi Hino, Susumu Akagi, Yuu Asakawa, Minori Chihara, Hajime Iijima, Mai Kadowaki, Yuhko Kaida', null, 'Immediately following the events of "Ikki tousen: Xtreme Xecutor", the kids from Nanyo Academy head to Kyoto for a school trip. Before long, they run into rival classmates from other Kanto schools and find themselves confronted by Kyoto''s best fighters. It''s a battle of epic proportions. Hopefully the city of Kyoto will be left standing!', 'Immediately following the events of "Ikki tousen: Xtreme Xecutor", the kids from Nanyo Academy head to Kyoto for a school trip. Before long, they run into rival classmates from other Kanto schools and find themselves confronted by Kyoto''s best fighters. It''s a battle of epic proportions. Hopefully the city of Kyoto will be left standing!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x2qMCtqe34peZ7sl6sbTgiIb4r2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:227268'),
  ('325465790732369489', 'Ikkis', 2026, 'History, War, Drama', 'Sriram Raghavan, Anil Mehta', 'Sriram Raghavan, Pooja Ladha Surti, Arijit Biswas', 'Dharmendra, Jaideep Ahlawat, Agastya Nanda, Simar Bhatia, Shree Bishnoi, Suhasini Mulay, Rahul Dev, Sikandar Kher', 'PG-13', 'Second Lieutenant and India''s youngest Param Vir Chakra recipient, Arun Khetarpal, gave his life fighting for his battalion and the country during the 1971 Battle of Basantar. Ikkis also takes a reflective look at the futility of war through the eyes of Khetarpal''s father, who visits his ancestral home in Sargodha and Alma Mater for reunion, which now happens to be in post-partition Pakistan, 30 years later.', 'Second Lieutenant and India''s youngest Param Vir Chakra recipient, Arun Khetarpal, gave his life fighting for his battalion and the country during the 1971 Battle of Basantar. Ikkis also takes a reflective look at the futility of war through the eyes of Khetarpal''s father, who visits his ancestral home in Sargodha and Alma Mater for reunion, which now happens to be in post-partition Pakistan, 30 years later.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8PWu0V10nMqG5SrA13wLRXTD2fH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1196946'),
  ('731311227832872056', 'Il bambino e il poliziotto', 1989, 'Comedy, Family', 'Danilo Desideri, Roberto Giandalia, Simona De Laurentiis', 'Leonardo Benvenuti, Carlo Verdone, Piero De Bernardi', 'Carlo Verdone, Federico Rizzo, Adriana Franceschi, Barbara Cupisti, Isabella De Bernardi, Gianluca Favilla, Francesco Gabriele, Anna Maria Dossena', null, 'Carlo, a police officer, after intercepting a call conducts a drug bust at a private party at the upper class apartment of Rosanna Clerici and she is arrested. Just as the police and party guests are leaving, Giulio, Rosanna''s six-year-old son, comes out of his room and asks Carlo where his mother is. Seeing that Carlo is the person responsible for his mother''s arrest, Giulio tags along with him until his mother is freed. Carlo does everything possible to have Social Services or somebody look after the kid but is told by the Courts that he is the best candidate for his custody until a better one is found. Even though Giulio manages to turn Carlo''s life inside out he ends up getting to like the kid and falling for the kid''s mother, Rosanna, while she is in prison. It ends with Rosanna being released from prison and the three of them going out for dinner.', 'Carlo, a police officer, after intercepting a call conducts a drug bust at a private party at the upper class apartment of Rosanna Clerici and she is arrested. Just as the police and party guests are leaving, Giulio, Rosanna''s six-year-old son, comes out of his room and asks Carlo where his mother is. Seeing that Carlo is the person responsible for his mother''s arrest, Giulio tags along with him until his mother is freed. Carlo does everything possible to have Social Services or somebody look after the kid but is told by the Courts that he is the best candidate for his custody until a better one is found. Even though Giulio manages to turn Carlo''s life inside out he ends up getting to like the kid and falling for the kid''s mother, Rosanna, while she is in prison. It ends with Rosanna being released from prison and the three of them going out for dinner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y0jHaxb7u7NGw21cAxU3HT0GWOY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60014'),
  ('616335056105076644', 'Il barbiere di Rio', 1996, 'Comedy', 'Fabrizio Sergenti Castellani, Maurizio Calvesi, Marco Limberti', 'Ugo Chiti, Giovanni Veronesi', 'Diego Abatantuono, Zuleica Dos Santos, Rocco Papaleo, Irene Grandi, Giuseppe Oristanio, Margaret Mazzantini, Renata Fronzi, Mauro Di Francesco', null, 'Matteo is a Roman barber whose business is full of debts. He decides to escape from this depressing reality by accepting his sister''s invitation to Brazil.', 'Matteo is a Roman barber whose business is full of debts. He decides to escape from this depressing reality by accepting his sister''s invitation to Brazil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jmg6aUK0hNojCEl9eqAAhLqMprf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77137'),
  ('169459691681016384', 'Il bell''Antonio', 1960, 'Drama', 'Mauro Bolognini, Nicolò Ferrari, Luigi Bazzoni', 'Gino Visentini, Pier Paolo Pasolini', 'Marcello Mastroianni, Claudia Cardinale, Pierre Brasseur, Rina Morelli, Tomas Milian, Fulvia Mammi, Patrizia Bini, Anna Arena', null, 'Problems arise for Antonio Magnano when he is unable to consummate his marriage to the beautiful Barbara Puglisi and his virility is called into question. Despite the fact that he loves his beautiful wife and they have otherwise been happily married for a year, his problem becomes a source of contention for all concerned.', 'Problems arise for Antonio Magnano when he is unable to consummate his marriage to the beautiful Barbara Puglisi and his virility is called into question. Despite the fact that he loves his beautiful wife and they have otherwise been happily married for a year, his problem becomes a source of contention for all concerned.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j3inmLWDgtFqXSG8sdAZ75dzpZj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76157'),
  ('874807153628147726', 'Il bene mio', 2018, 'Drama', 'Pippo Mezzapesa, Giorgio Giannoccaro', 'Massimo De Angelis, Antonella Gaeta, Pippo Mezzapesa', 'Sonya Mellah, Sergio Rubini, Teresa Saponangelo, Dino Abbrescia, Francesco De Vito, Michele Sinisi', null, 'In the shadow of earthquakes which have devastated several parts of Italy, this poignant tale is centered around the last remaining inhabitant of a town destroyed by this natural disaster. Elia (Sergio Rubini) has no intention of leaving his ghost town of Providence which was struck by an earthquake years earlier. While he spends his days in the company of the memories of his wife and his idyllic past life, the rest of the population has moved downstream into the new community housing. Every so often, someone comes to visit him: the local teacher, his friend Gesualdo, and the mayor. But it is a different and wholly unexpected presence which begins to turn Elia’s solitary life upside-down.', 'In the shadow of earthquakes which have devastated several parts of Italy, this poignant tale is centered around the last remaining inhabitant of a town destroyed by this natural disaster. Elia (Sergio Rubini) has no intention of leaving his ghost town of Providence which was struck by an earthquake years earlier. While he spends his days in the company of the memories of his wife and his idyllic past life, the rest of the population has moved downstream into the new community housing. Every so often, someone comes to visit him: the local teacher, his friend Gesualdo, and the mayor. But it is a different and wholly unexpected presence which begins to turn Elia’s solitary life upside-down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8r10t1EFhQT12qwPySHPB7ZI0FY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:540002'),
  ('530998283661429891', 'Il Bi e il Ba', 1986, 'Comedy', 'Maurizio Nichetti, Cristiano Pogany, Beatrice Banfi', 'Maurizio Nichetti, Nino Frassica, Daniela Conti', 'Nino Frassica, Leo Gullotta, Marco Messeri, Daniela Conti, Maria Giovanna Elmi, Roberto Della Casa, Nino Terzo, Luca Sportelli', null, 'Despite being penniless, Antonino Scannapieco possesses a convincing eloquence. Having obtained money from friends to travel to Rome to consult a luminary about his dandruff problem, he sets off for the capital, where various misadventures await him.', 'Despite being penniless, Antonino Scannapieco possesses a convincing eloquence. Having obtained money from friends to travel to Rome to consult a luminary about his dandruff problem, he sets off for the capital, where various misadventures await him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pF3g9ttaeIqO7bvVCt7SfB3Mi2w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:150151'),
  ('981127125339095097', 'Il brigadiere Pasquale Zagaria ama la mamma e la polizia', 1973, 'Comedy', 'Mario Forges Davanzati, Stelvio Massi, Stefania Bussolari', 'Guido Castaldo, Raffaele Sposito', 'Lino Banfi, Francesca Romana Coluzzi, Aldo Giuffrè, Rosario Borelli, Sal Borgese, Gabriella Andreini, Luca Sportelli, Renzo Marignano', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tnyONHK3ntvs74DI4zLyZYkUwTD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121343'),
  ('920330809381547234', 'Il Buco', 2021, 'Drama', 'Giovanni Maria Melis, Vincenzo Russo, Angelo Urbano', 'Michelangelo Frammartino, Giovanna Giuliani', 'Nicola Lanza, Antonio Lanza, Leonardo Larocca, Claudia Candusso, Mila Costi, Carlos José Crespo, Jacopo Elia, Federico Gregoretti', null, 'In August 1961, speleologists from Italy’s booming North arrive on a Calabrian plateau where time stands still. The intruders discover one of the world’s deepest caves, the Bifurto Abyss, under the gaze of an old shepherd, the only witness of the pristine territory.', 'In August 1961, speleologists from Italy’s booming North arrive on a Calabrian plateau where time stands still. The intruders discover one of the world’s deepest caves, the Bifurto Abyss, under the gaze of an old shepherd, the only witness of the pristine territory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7KCL9qcY4gqtb1uzCqdsdvmVLBK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:660708'),
  ('37415260149923686', 'Il camionista', 2016, 'Drama', 'Francesco Di Giacomo, Lucio Gaudino', 'Giovanna Guidoni, Lucio Gaudino', 'Giorgio Tirabassi, Simona Borioni, Elena Cotta, Pippo Delbono, Nicola Di Pinto, Nicola Nocella, Emily Rinaldi', null, 'Riccardo is a truck driver in his late fifties who illegally transports immigrants on his long journeys for a criminal organization. The organization entrusts him with Maisha, an African girl, for a few days, and she immediately establishes a good relationship with Riccardo''s family, who has a ten-year-old daughter. When the organization demands that he return Maisha, he faces a difficult decision.', 'Riccardo is a truck driver in his late fifties who illegally transports immigrants on his long journeys for a criminal organization. The organization entrusts him with Maisha, an African girl, for a few days, and she immediately establishes a good relationship with Riccardo''s family, who has a ten-year-old daughter. When the organization demands that he return Maisha, he faces a difficult decision.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ye9iBtlgYZFhgdbWH69kpMc7XZQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:432020'),
  ('333340719002121065', 'Il Capitano: A Swedish Requiem', 1991, 'Drama, Crime', 'Jan Troell, Jan Troell', 'Jan Troell, Per Olov Enquist, Göran Setterberg', 'Antti Reini, Maria Heiskanen, Berto Marklund, Harri Mallenius, Marjut Dahlström, Antti Vierikko, Eva Stellby, Matti Dahlberg', null, 'The film is based on a true occurrence in Sweden in 1988. A Finnish couple murdered a young boy and his parents when they prevented the theft of the son''s bicycle. The film tries to describe the relationship between the dominant Jari, who calls himself "Il Capitano", and his more mature "soldier" Minna, that develops into mutual dependence.', 'The film is based on a true occurrence in Sweden in 1988. A Finnish couple murdered a young boy and his parents when they prevented the theft of the son''s bicycle. The film tries to describe the relationship between the dominant Jari, who calls himself "Il Capitano", and his more mature "soldier" Minna, that develops into mutual dependence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nnZIaHG6OxkR6kBo6JezfseaMDP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71721'),
  ('1089729804580284549', 'Il caso Pantani - L''omicidio di un campione', 2020, 'Drama', 'Domenico Ciolfi', 'Domenico Ciolfi, Davide Sala', 'Marco Palvetti, Brenno Placido, Fabrizio Rongione, Francesco Pannofino, Monica Camporesi, Paola Baldini, Libero De Rienzo, Emanuela Rossi', null, 'The Pantani case, a film directed by Domenico Ciolfi, tells the story of the last five years in the life of the cyclist from Romagna, in particular from 5 June 1999, when he was suspended from racing, to 14 February 2004, the day of his death. His untimely death in unclear circumstances, which have opened several judicial inquiries, was a shock to the world of cycling, which lost its Pirate on Valentine''s Day. The film is a tribute to this Italian sporting hero, remembering him as a young man who, riding his bike, reached several milestones but was defeated in a fatal match.', 'The Pantani case, a film directed by Domenico Ciolfi, tells the story of the last five years in the life of the cyclist from Romagna, in particular from 5 June 1999, when he was suspended from racing, to 14 February 2004, the day of his death. His untimely death in unclear circumstances, which have opened several judicial inquiries, was a shock to the world of cycling, which lost its Pirate on Valentine''s Day. The film is a tribute to this Italian sporting hero, remembering him as a young man who, riding his bike, reached several milestones but was defeated in a fatal match.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kSdXgHudzD1dqAQX2wHTPwPZhBB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:673760'),
  ('109326112856306604', 'Il cav. Costante Nicosia demoniaco, ovvero Dracula in Brianza', 1975, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Sergio Salvati, Victor Tourjansky, Lucio Fulci', 'Mario Amendola, Pupi Avati, Bruno Corbucci', 'Lando Buzzanca, Rossano Brazzi, Sylva Koscina, Moira Orfei, Christa Linder, John Steiner, Francesca Romana Coluzzi, Valentina Cortese', null, 'A boorish, snobish toothpaste factory owner, Constantino Nicosia, gives his wife and everyone a hard time having let success and wealth go to his head. But after the superticous Nicosia has an encounter with an elderly gypsy aunt, and a business trip to Romania results in another encounter with a suave vampire, named Count Dragalescu, Nicosia returns with blood-sucking like qualities which makes him re-examine his life and existence.', 'A boorish, snobish toothpaste factory owner, Constantino Nicosia, gives his wife and everyone a hard time having let success and wealth go to his head. But after the superticous Nicosia has an encounter with an elderly gypsy aunt, and a business trip to Romania results in another encounter with a suave vampire, named Count Dragalescu, Nicosia returns with blood-sucking like qualities which makes him re-examine his life and existence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/50oh6keRuHt5OUGiiVnHSpyEZz7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107122'),
  ('333802237703545321', 'Il cielo in una stanza', 1999, 'Comedy', 'Carlo Vanzina', 'Carlo Vanzina, Enrico Vanzina', 'Elio Germano, Gabriele Mainetti, Alessandro Cianflone, Francesco Venditti, Tosca D''Aquino, Elisabetta Pellini, Sascha Zacharias, Alessandro Bucci', null, 'Clashing with his father Paolo after coming home late, 17-year-old Marco accuses him of being old and stifling. They time travel to the 1960s, where Paolo will be able to prove his son he too used to be hip.', 'Clashing with his father Paolo after coming home late, 17-year-old Marco accuses him of being old and stifling. They time travel to the 1960s, where Paolo will be able to prove his son he too used to be hip.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/csFW8Fo4xTujBUPP7ck4LCHEnBv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:150941'),
  ('298622475828274020', 'Il commissario Lo Gatto', 1986, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Dino Risi, Massimo Carocci, Alessandro D''Eva', 'Enrico Vanzina, Dino Risi', 'Lino Banfi, Maurizio Ferrini, Maurizio Micheli, Isabel Russinova, Galeazzo Benti, Renata Attivissimo, Nicoletta Boris, Albano Bufalini', null, 'Police commissioner Lo Gatto is in charge of the local Italian police station within Vatican State. During an investigation, following the murder of a Vatican priest, he decides to question the Pope! For this reason Lo Gatto is sent to a Sicilian remote island Favignana. There is very little for the commissioner to do on the quiet island, so Lo Gatto decides to investigate the vanishing of a tourist which quickly becomes a very complicated affair.', 'Police commissioner Lo Gatto is in charge of the local Italian police station within Vatican State. During an investigation, following the murder of a Vatican priest, he decides to question the Pope! For this reason Lo Gatto is sent to a Sicilian remote island Favignana. There is very little for the commissioner to do on the quiet island, so Lo Gatto decides to investigate the vanishing of a tourist which quickly becomes a very complicated affair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nvSuS1gSMp2KjLnE8u2hQntsxSF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59139'),
  ('196478713922123291', 'Il conte Max', 1957, 'Comedy', 'Giorgio Bianchi, Silvana Mangini Colizzi, Mario Montuori', 'Ruggero Maccari, Alberto Sordi, Giorgio Bianchi', 'Alberto Sordi, Vittorio De Sica, Anne Vernon, Susana Canales, Tina Pica, Juan Calvo, Jacinto San Emeterio, Diletta D''Andrea', null, 'Alberto, a newspaper man, tries a one-time shot of living the good life with the help of his penniless mentor.', 'Alberto, a newspaper man, tries a one-time shot of living the good life with the help of his penniless mentor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lTAkTEZvaCbIfUSPsXu5QYglS2n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60195'),
  ('915035719321622211', 'Il Conte Max', 1991, 'Comedy', 'Sergio Salvati, François Goizet, Florence Strauss', 'Christian De Sica, Filippo Ascione, Agenore Incrocci', 'Christian De Sica, Ornella Muti, Galeazzo Benti, Anita Ekberg, Antonello Fassari, María Mercader, Maurizio Fabbri, Bruno Corazzari', null, 'Alfredo is a crude Roman motorcycle repairman who is a friend of Count Max, a gentleman and ex-pleasure lover. The latter invites Alfredo to his residence in Campo dei Fiori and teaches him etiquette, French and how to play poker. The laughter will begin when Alfredo meets and chases the beautiful model Isabell Bellissima in Paris.', 'Alfredo is a crude Roman motorcycle repairman who is a friend of Count Max, a gentleman and ex-pleasure lover. The latter invites Alfredo to his residence in Campo dei Fiori and teaches him etiquette, French and how to play poker. The laughter will begin when Alfredo meets and chases the beautiful model Isabell Bellissima in Paris.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vr23bRk28BcVvcbBGA4jCBZbNLr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105750'),
  ('686152809778587632', 'Il coraggio', 1955, 'Comedy', 'Domenico Paolella, Mariano Laurenti, Mario Fioretti', 'Riccardo Mantoni, Totò, Edoardo Anton', 'Totò, Gino Cervi, Irène Galter, Gianna Maria Canale, Gabriele Tinti, Paola Barbara, Bruna Vecchio, Ernesto Almirante', null, 'A wealthy trader saves the life of a poor suicidal man who then decides that his savior has the responsibility of taking care of him and his family.', 'A wealthy trader saves the life of a poor suicidal man who then decides that his savior has the responsibility of taking care of him and his family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bb1yPvx6AlDtC5U6Ut92xfHwhXq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68880'),
  ('678019647732456256', 'Il delitto Mattarella', 2020, 'History, Drama, Crime, Documentary', 'Aurelio Grimaldi, Alfio D''Agata', 'Aurelio Grimaldi', 'Antonio Alveario, Claudio Castrogiovanni, Nicasio Catanese, Domenico Ciaramitaro, David Coco, Vincenzo Crivello, Francesco Di Leva, Donatella Finocchiaro', null, 'January 6, 1980. President of the Sicily Piersanti Mattarella is going to Mass with his family when a young man approaches his car and shoots him in cold blood, killing him. The young Deputy Prosecutor on duty that day is Pietro Grasso, future General Anti-Mafia Prosecutor and President of the Italian Senate. His investigations are continued by Giovanni Falcone, who uncovers dangerous connections between the Mafia, the ruling Christian Democratic Party, neo-fascist terrorists, and secret services.', 'January 6, 1980. President of the Sicily Piersanti Mattarella is going to Mass with his family when a young man approaches his car and shoots him in cold blood, killing him. The young Deputy Prosecutor on duty that day is Pietro Grasso, future General Anti-Mafia Prosecutor and President of the Italian Senate. His investigations are continued by Giovanni Falcone, who uncovers dangerous connections between the Mafia, the ruling Christian Democratic Party, neo-fascist terrorists, and secret services.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d41JbAILBUawk7oCsqtqhXzhe2P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:671940'),
  ('152844749512984082', 'Il était une fois à Monaco', 2020, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'Frédéric Forestier', 'Gilles Paquet-Brenner', 'Rayane Bensetti, Anne Serra, Antoine Duléry, Chantal Ladesou, Gladys Cohen, Valérie Dashwood, Colin Bates, Marc Brun Adryan''', null, 'Mehdi lives with his mother in the suburbs of Paris. He plays poker online. After a lucky strike he decides it is time to risk it all in Montecarlo.', 'Mehdi lives with his mother in the suburbs of Paris. He plays poker online. After a lucky strike he decides it is time to risk it all in Montecarlo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5AiHVOAwXqcevzjCqLNPYsF0XgL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:752928'),
  ('297581717136146788', 'Il figlio della luna', 2007, 'Drama', 'Gianfranco Albano, Saverio Guarna', 'Lucia Frisone, Paola Pascolini, Mauro Caporiccio', 'Lunetta Savino, Antonio Milo, Alessandro Morace, Paolo Briguglia, Sabrina Sirchia, Evelyn Famà, Alessandra Costanzo', null, 'Based on the real story of Fulvio Frisone, born with spastic quadriplegia dystonia severe enough to prevent him from even speaking. Thanks largely to the enormous efforts of the mother Lucia, Fulvio, apparently condemned to a life without opportunities, manage to study with great profit, and today is an accomplished scientist in the field of Physics.', 'Based on the real story of Fulvio Frisone, born with spastic quadriplegia dystonia severe enough to prevent him from even speaking. Thanks largely to the enormous efforts of the mother Lucia, Fulvio, apparently condemned to a life without opportunities, manage to study with great profit, and today is an accomplished scientist in the field of Physics.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nO2VlGKcFW3ZpSfen5sl9OXOEXB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:435164'),
  ('970147395372967877', 'Il figlio più piccolo', 2010, 'Drama', 'Pupi Avati, Pasquale Rachini', 'Pupi Avati', 'Christian De Sica, Laura Morante, Luca Zingaretti, Nicola Nocella, Sydne Rome, Massimo Bonetti, Manuela Morabito, Alessandra Acciai', null, 'Ruthless businessman Luciano reconnects with his estranged family from a previous marriage, only to use their youngest son, awkward and starry-eyed Baldo, as the fall guy for his failing endeavor.', 'Ruthless businessman Luciano reconnects with his estranged family from a previous marriage, only to use their youngest son, awkward and starry-eyed Baldo, as the fall guy for his failing endeavor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j01I7b4MlHa8zINF4Ja4VqQeBjz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42579'),
