  ('100102942066765488', 'Il grande salto', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Alessandro Scuderi, Annalisa Morello, Alessandro De Rosa', 'Daniele Costantini, Giorgio Tirabassi, Mattia Torre', 'Ricky Memphis, Giorgio Tirabassi, Roberta Mattei, Paola Tiziana Cruciani, Gianfelice Imparato, Salvatore Striano, Cristiano Di Pietra, Federica Carruba Toscano', null, 'Nello and Rufetto are two second-rate robbers, both in their forties and living in a suburban neighborhood of Rome. After serving four years in prison for a botched robbery, resuming their business, and more importantly, successfully completing it, is no easy feat.', 'Nello and Rufetto are two second-rate robbers, both in their forties and living in a suburban neighborhood of Rome. After serving four years in prison for a botched robbery, resuming their business, and more importantly, successfully completing it, is no easy feat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bpbbDDCtIRFAaoMohlIRFqgXcAG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:602468'),
