  ('1039707375629194679', 'Il Grido', 1957, 'Drama', 'Michelangelo Antonioni, Gianni Di Venanzo, Sergio Zavoli', 'Michelangelo Antonioni, Elio Bartolini, Ennio De Concini', 'Steve Cochran, Alida Valli, Dorian Gray, Jacqueline Jones, Gabriella Pallotta, Pina Boldrini, Guerrino Campanilli, Mirna Girardi', 'NR', 'A sugar-refinery worker flees his Northern Italy town after a woman refuses his marriage proposal.', 'A sugar-refinery worker flees his Northern Italy town after a woman refuses his marriage proposal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/anUoCgC45XL1nmLJoXD1kVKnwka.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41054'),
  ('768796484953578715', 'Il lupo e l''agnello', 1980, 'Comedy', 'Francesco Massaro, Armando Nannuzzi', 'Michel Audiard', 'Michel Serrault, Tomas Milian, Ombretta Colli, Laura Adani, Giuliana Calandra, Enrico Luzi, Gloria Bozzola, Cariddi Nardulli', null, 'Leon de Paris is a modest dog-barber in Paris. In search of more satisfaction. Thanks to the economic helps of Fanny (his terrible mother in law), he succeeds to set up in Roma a very stylish "Coiffeur pour homme". But due to this, his life with Fanny isn''t funny, and more, Leon has to dissimulate homosexuality for job reasons. He decides to stop this nightmare engaging "Er Cuculo" (the cuckoo) a B-gangster to simulate a robbery. In fact the plan is to take all Fanny''s money, share it among them and escape in Montecarlo. Will the strange couple succeed?', 'Leon de Paris is a modest dog-barber in Paris. In search of more satisfaction. Thanks to the economic helps of Fanny (his terrible mother in law), he succeeds to set up in Roma a very stylish "Coiffeur pour homme". But due to this, his life with Fanny isn''t funny, and more, Leon has to dissimulate homosexuality for job reasons. He decides to stop this nightmare engaging "Er Cuculo" (the cuckoo) a B-gangster to simulate a robbery. In fact the plan is to take all Fanny''s money, share it among them and escape in Montecarlo. Will the strange couple succeed?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xT2CsN6EYRgtCM272jNp6ujqlOu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82365'),
