  ('934999425315128884', 'Il Mistero di Bellavista', 1985, 'Comedy', 'Luciano De Crescenzo, Sebastiano Celeste, Filiberto Fiaschi', 'Riccardo Pazzaglia, Luciano De Crescenzo', 'Luciano De Crescenzo, Sergio Solli, Benedetto Casillo, Marina Confalone, Andy Luotto, Marisa Laurito, Renato Scarpa, Riccardo Pazzaglia', null, 'A doorman and a street cleaner, intrigued by the passage of Halley''s Comet, ask Professor Bellavista if they can observe the sky through his telescope. The two, instead of observing the comet, end up framing a window of the apartment opposite and believe they have discovered a crime. So they set out in search of the body.', 'A doorman and a street cleaner, intrigued by the passage of Halley''s Comet, ask Professor Bellavista if they can observe the sky through his telescope. The two, instead of observing the comet, end up framing a window of the apartment opposite and believe they have discovered a crime. So they set out in search of the body.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vwRcDFzZXB6W5mgjTmOeu4ZUFqo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57923'),
