  ('334031921988474273', 'Il padre delle spose', 2006, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Lodovico Gasparini, Gino Sgrava', 'Giancarlo Russo, Paola Pascolini, Fabio Leoni', 'Lino Banfi, Rosanna Banfi, Lucia Sardo, Mapi Galán, Gianni Ciardo, Michaela Molinari, Carles Arquimbau, Lucia Poli', null, 'Riccardo, a southern man of solid principles and good feelings, decides to go and visit his daughter Aurora, who has been living in Barcelona for some time. There, however, a surprise awaits him: Aurora has married a woman. Indignant, Riccardo hastily returns to Italy, determined never to see her again. But perhaps destiny has decided otherwise.', 'Riccardo, a southern man of solid principles and good feelings, decides to go and visit his daughter Aurora, who has been living in Barcelona for some time. There, however, a surprise awaits him: Aurora has married a woman. Indignant, Riccardo hastily returns to Italy, determined never to see her again. But perhaps destiny has decided otherwise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lBOKdQYUhQusiaggrXZQEKdy4xf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:391604'),
  ('249765301289160680', 'Il pataffio', 2022, 'Comedy, History', 'Diego Romero, Francesco Lagi, Francesca Borromeo', 'Francesco Lagi', 'Lino Musella, Viviana Cangiano, Valerio Mastandrea, Alessandro Gassmann, Giorgio Tirabassi, Giovanni Ludeno, Vincenzo Nemolato, Daria Deflorian', null, 'An unlikely group of soldiers and courtiers led by Marcount Berlocchio and his new bride Bernarda take possession of a distant fief. But their castle is a decrepit dump and their villagers aren''t willing to be ruled.', 'An unlikely group of soldiers and courtiers led by Marcount Berlocchio and his new bride Bernarda take possession of a distant fief. But their castle is a decrepit dump and their villagers aren''t willing to be ruled.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/85HyfPKf7Rzay6sM3tK0ztrX5kT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:890576'),
  ('626185315709915085', 'Il piccolo lord', 1995, 'TV Movie, Family', 'Gianfranco Albano', 'Sergio Donati', 'Mario Adorf, Marianne Sägebrecht, Antonella Ponziani, Francesco De Pasquale, Giovanni Mauriello, Edoardo Velo, Giancarlo Puglisi, Armando De Ceccon', null, '11-year-old Christian lives with his Italian mother Gioia in poverty on the island of Ischia. His German father died in a rescue mission before Christian was born. The kind boy had an unremarkable and calm life until, one day, his grandfather Carl Schneibel finds him. Schneibel is a wealthy businessman who had never seen Christian before. Since the old lonely man has no heir, he decides to take Christian in and offer him a good education. Schneibel has never been on good terms with his son and never liked his son’s choice of wife, so he decides that Gioia must not come along. Despite, Gioia does not wish to obstruct her son’s future and allows him to go. Thanks to his good nature and his kind ways, Christian wins the heart of his grandfather and changes his life for the better.', '11-year-old Christian lives with his Italian mother Gioia in poverty on the island of Ischia. His German father died in a rescue mission before Christian was born. The kind boy had an unremarkable and calm life until, one day, his grandfather Carl Schneibel finds him. Schneibel is a wealthy businessman who had never seen Christian before. Since the old lonely man has no heir, he decides to take Christian in and offer him a good education. Schneibel has never been on good terms with his son and never liked his son’s choice of wife, so he decides that Gioia must not come along. Despite, Gioia does not wish to obstruct her son’s future and allows him to go. Thanks to his good nature and his kind ways, Christian wins the heart of his grandfather and changes his life for the better.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rapjb1HHpwnfLwrneVsyDaA6JU0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:377104'),
  ('931498217442761345', 'Il Posto', 1961, 'Drama', 'Ermanno Olmi, Lamberto Caimi', 'Ermanno Olmi, Ettore Lombardo', 'Loredana Detto, Sandro Panseri, Corrado Aprile, Guido Chiti, Tullio Kezich, Bice Melegari, Mara Revel, Guido Spadea', 'NR', 'With his family mired in financial troubles, Domenico moves to Milan, Italy, from his small town to get a job in lieu of furthering his education. A lack of options forces him to take a position as a messenger at a big company, where he hopes to receive a promotion soon. There, Domenico meets Antonietta, a young woman in a similar situation as himself. The two form a tentative relationship, but the soulless nature of their jobs threatens to keep them apart.', 'With his family mired in financial troubles, Domenico moves to Milan, Italy, from his small town to get a job in lieu of furthering his education. A lack of options forces him to take a position as a messenger at a big company, where he hopes to receive a promotion soon. There, Domenico meets Antonietta, a young woman in a similar situation as himself. The two form a tentative relationship, but the soulless nature of their jobs threatens to keep them apart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nQlJDXunyhHfCLqNLZGlCyORMVQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31742'),
  ('935334037743958766', 'Il posto dell''anima', 2003, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Riccardo Milani, Arnaldo Catinari, Simona Berenice Vignoli', 'Riccardo Milani, Domenico Starnone, Nerina Fiumanò', 'Silvio Orlando, Michele Placido, Paola Cortellesi, Claudio Santamaria, Flavio Pistilli, Federico Di Flauro, Maria Laura Rondanini, Ennio Tozzi', null, 'Three workers of a tire factory, in southern Italy, lead the struggle against the American company owner of the factory who wants to close the Italian branch in which they work.', 'Three workers of a tire factory, in southern Italy, lead the struggle against the American company owner of the factory who wants to close the Italian branch in which they work.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h6FJEJlGsYkdReDvnFLtKFOKCj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57570'),
  ('1115927717770595291', 'Il pranzo della domenica', 2003, 'Comedy', 'Massimo Carocci, Giorgio Melidoni, Claudio Zamarion', 'Enrico Vanzina, Carlo Vanzina', 'Massimo Ghini, Barbara De Rossi, Rocco Papaleo, Maurizio Mattioli, Elena Sofia Ricci, Galatea Ranzi, Virginie Marsan, Marco Messeri', null, 'The life of Franca Malorni, exponent of the good bourgeoisie of the capital, suddenly changes when her husband dies suddenly. The woman begins to pour her attention on the three daughters, obliging them to have a Sunday lunch with their families.', 'The life of Franca Malorni, exponent of the good bourgeoisie of the capital, suddenly changes when her husband dies suddenly. The woman begins to pour her attention on the three daughters, obliging them to have a Sunday lunch with their families.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8dC61aVJFh7mhowo6QBOE1wKWWb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56716'),
  ('636928428219518140', 'Il premio', 2017, 'Drama', 'Tommaso Pagliai, Massimiliano Battistella, Alessandro Gassmann', 'Walter Lupo, Alessandro Gassmann, Massimiliano Bruno', 'Gigi Proietti, Alessandro Gassmann, Rocco Papaleo, Anna Foglietta, Matilda De Angelis, Elda Alvigini, Marco Zitelli, Andrea Johansson', null, 'After winning the Nobel Prize, Giovanni Passamonte decides to drive to Stockholm with his sons and assistant rather than fly.', 'After winning the Nobel Prize, Giovanni Passamonte decides to drive to Stockholm with his sons and assistant rather than fly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zjmQlBXj3XMNeFhVzZx1mySFWY1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:468206'),
  ('388916723954925152', 'Il presidente del Borgorosso Football Club', 1970, 'Comedy', 'Luigi Filippo D''Amico, Sante Achilli, Giovanni Fabbri', 'Adriano Zecca, Sergio Amidei, Alberto Sordi', 'Alberto Sordi, Margarita Lozano, Daniele Vargas, Carlo Taranto, Tina Lattanzi, Omar Sívori, Giuliano Todeschini, Teodoro Corrà', null, 'Benito Fornaciari, a pale, devoutly Catholic, Upper Middleclass Italian inherits a minor-league football club from a long-lost uncle. He decides to visit the club to sell it, but the local population has other ideas: through an almost-armed uprising they "force" him not to sell the club but lead it to other glories on the football field.', 'Benito Fornaciari, a pale, devoutly Catholic, Upper Middleclass Italian inherits a minor-league football club from a long-lost uncle. He decides to visit the club to sell it, but the local population has other ideas: through an almost-armed uprising they "force" him not to sell the club but lead it to other glories on the football field.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ycGyjDITyGeTnwx0UNJgDmINcNd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73753'),
  ('840453688272410455', 'Il profeta del gol', 1976, 'Documentary', 'Sandro Ciotti', null, 'Johan Cruijff, Ruud Krol, Wim Suurbier', null, 'The documentary narrates the successes of the Dutch champion Johan Cruyff (three times winner of the Ballon d''Or), which in the seventies was a symbol of the great Dutch national soccer team, and representative of the so-called total soccer, expressed during the two World Finals in Monaco 1974 and Argentina 1978', 'The documentary narrates the successes of the Dutch champion Johan Cruyff (three times winner of the Ballon d''Or), which in the seventies was a symbol of the great Dutch national soccer team, and representative of the so-called total soccer, expressed during the two World Finals in Monaco 1974 and Argentina 1978', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mzwEWFvqGzCe5oeEdZbHjjesv2w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117177'),
  ('968364443846660546', 'Il ragazzo del Pony Express', 1986, 'Comedy', 'Giuseppe Bernardini, Angelo Vicari, Franco Amurri', 'Cesare Frugoni, Stefano Sudriè, Jerry Calà', 'Jerry Calà, Alessandro Benvenuti, Isabella Ferrari, Emanuela Taschini, Sergio Di Pinto, Tiberio Murgia, Gabriella Saitta, Fiammetta Baralla', null, 'A youth who has recently graduated can''t find a job. One day he unintentionally snatches a bag from a girl and buys a motorbike with the "proceeds" of the theft. Then he begins to work as a mail express courier. At first the girl denounces him then falls in love with him.', 'A youth who has recently graduated can''t find a job. One day he unintentionally snatches a bag from a girl and buys a motorbike with the "proceeds" of the theft. Then he begins to work as a mail express courier. At first the girl denounces him then falls in love with him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a1bcxfB0YX2JUmj2CKzaiFcxlI4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:193066'),
