  ('284872995792563058', 'Il regno', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Giulia Lapenna, Beatrice Bergonzini, Paolo Geremei', 'Francesco Fanuele, Stefano Di Santi', 'Stefano Fresi, Max Tortora, Silvia D''Amico, Fotinì Peluso, Francesca Nunzi, Paolo Buglioni, Agnese Nano, Enzo Salomone', null, 'The king of a secret modern-time Medieval kingdom leaves his throne in inheritance to his son, who struggles to lead the kingdom in fight for its independence from the Italian state.', 'The king of a secret modern-time Medieval kingdom leaves his throne in inheritance to his son, who struggles to lead the kingdom in fight for its independence from the Italian state.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/316U2EwqfWY25wWHY703TTd0WqY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:696826'),
  ('250391862403156820', 'Il ritorno del Monnezza', 2005, 'Comedy', 'Carlo Vanzina, Giorgio Melidoni, Gianluca Ottone', 'Enrico Vanzina, Carlo Vanzina, Claudio Amendola', 'Claudio Amendola, Enzo Salvi, Elisabetta Rocchetti, Kaspar Capparoni, Gabriella Labate, Paolo Triestino, Alessandro Di Carlo, Luis Molteni', null, 'Rocky Giraldi, son of police officer Nico, followed in his father''s footsteps and is now an agent in the police force''s operational departments. He is currently working on a seemingly straightforward case: the murder of a burglar. In reality, behind the crime lies a dangerous network of drug dealers involved in money laundering, which also includes an important law enforcement official whom the man knows well.', 'Rocky Giraldi, son of police officer Nico, followed in his father''s footsteps and is now an agent in the police force''s operational departments. He is currently working on a seemingly straightforward case: the murder of a burglar. In reality, behind the crime lies a dangerous network of drug dealers involved in money laundering, which also includes an important law enforcement official whom the man knows well.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rurep4jrtk3BKz8HfRSu36GHXRO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62466'),
