  ('709001400249738669', 'Ilsa, the Tigress of Siberia', 1977, 'Horror, Thriller, War', 'Jean LaFleur, Richard Ciupka, Daniel Hausmann', 'Marven McGara, John C.W. Saxton', 'Dyanne Thorne, Michel-René Labelle, Jean-Guy Latour, Gilbert Beaumont, Ray Landry, Terry Haig, Jacques Morin, Henry Gamer', null, 'Siberia 1953: Ilsa is now working in a Gulag prison camp. Her mission is to "retrain the minds" of those who don''t agree with the communists.', 'Siberia 1953: Ilsa is now working in a Gulag prison camp. Her mission is to "retrain the minds" of those who don''t agree with the communists.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r8zD8k2TKzEeLBtmgnEZk0XGxPs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28746'),
