  ('186655053321190583', 'Ilsa: She Wolf of the SS', 1975, 'Thriller, Horror, War, Drama', 'Don Edmonds, Glenn Roland', 'Jonah Royston, John C.W. Saxton', 'Dyanne Thorne, Gregory Knoph, Tony Mumolo, Maria Marx, Nicolle Riddell, Jo Jo Deville, Sandy Richman, George Buck Flower', 'NR', 'Ilsa, a warden at a Nazi death camp that conducts experiments on prisoners, strives to prove that women can withstand more pain and suffering than men, and therefore should be allowed to fight on the frontlines.', 'Ilsa, a warden at a Nazi death camp that conducts experiments on prisoners, strives to prove that women can withstand more pain and suffering than men, and therefore should be allowed to fight on the frontlines.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/toiyTNxp1DiCMK5wS63Q9eZcS2N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20850'),
  ('1146752756666760945', 'Ilusión Nacional', 2014, 'Documentary', 'Olallo Rubio', 'Olallo Rubio', 'Olallo Rubio, Hugo Sánchez, Diego Maradona, Antonio Carbajal, Enrique Borja, Julio Gómez, Eduardo Galeano, Javier Aguirre', null, 'A sport like football is primarily a passionate celebration, but one that is so massive (economically, politically and socially) that it, of course, also brings many problems. Olallo Rubio''s third documentary (and fourth film in total), Ilusión Nacional, is a take on how the world''s most popular sport relates to Mexican society and politics.', 'A sport like football is primarily a passionate celebration, but one that is so massive (economically, politically and socially) that it, of course, also brings many problems. Olallo Rubio''s third documentary (and fourth film in total), Ilusión Nacional, is a take on how the world''s most popular sport relates to Mexican society and politics.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8VGf7Fc09Jm893ivGWPRj65FSdK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:263148'),
  ('137883364928193911', 'Ilya Muromets and Sparrow the Robber', 2007, 'Comedy, Animation, Adventure, Family', 'Vladimir Toropchin, Vladimir Golounin', 'Maksim Sveshnikov, Aleksandr Boyarsky', 'Valeri Solovyev, Sergey Makovetskiy, Oleg Tabakov, Yekaterina Gorokhovskaya, Andrei Tolubeyev, Yuri Tarasov, Anatoliy Petrov, Natalya Danilova', null, 'Ilya Muromets has to rescue his trusty horse Burushka and Kiev treasury from the greedy hands of the famous bandit, Sparrow the Robber.', 'Ilya Muromets has to rescue his trusty horse Burushka and Kiev treasury from the greedy hands of the famous bandit, Sparrow the Robber.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eFdACQL1wauPYZLCCxlKrIv76ed.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:451172'),
