  ('389055617606320548', 'Impression of a War', 2015, 'Documentary', 'Camilo Restrepo, Camilo Restrepo', null, null, null, 'For over 70 years Colombia has been subject to an internal armed conflict whose demarcation lines seem to have become blurred over time. An insidious creeping violence has gradually pervaded the whole of society. Impossible as it is to tell this story in one unified narrative, the history behind this violence seems to take form through a multitude of traces.', 'For over 70 years Colombia has been subject to an internal armed conflict whose demarcation lines seem to have become blurred over time. An insidious creeping violence has gradually pervaded the whole of society. Impossible as it is to tell this story in one unified narrative, the history behind this violence seems to take form through a multitude of traces.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rb2QBN0qMbuux22FiBji7tvesRs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:385576'),
