  ('29756997894524815', 'Improvised and Purposeful: Cinema Novo', 1967, 'Documentary', 'Joaquim Pedro de Andrade', 'Maurício Gomes Leite', 'Glauber Rocha, Arnaldo Jabor, Nelson Pereira dos Santos, Hugo Carvana, Anecy Rocha, Zózimo Bulbul, Arduíno Colassanti, Carlos Diegues', null, 'Originally produced for German TV, Improvised and Purposeful is a firsthand look at the "Cinema Novo" movement (otherwise known as the ''Brazilian New Wave''). Director Joaquim Pedro de Andrade focuses on six Cinema Novo filmmakers working in Rio in 1967.', 'Originally produced for German TV, Improvised and Purposeful is a firsthand look at the "Cinema Novo" movement (otherwise known as the ''Brazilian New Wave''). Director Joaquim Pedro de Andrade focuses on six Cinema Novo filmmakers working in Rio in 1967.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eDxiyihAG7yv5sSzXCNe18HaNBN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:321143'),
