  ('664100330657145283', 'Impy''s Island', 2006, 'Animation, Family, Fantasy', 'Holger Tappe, Reinhard Klooss', 'Oliver Huzly, Sven Severin, Reinhard Klooss', 'Domenic Redl, Anke Engelke, Wigald Boning, Christoph Maria Herbst, Oliver Pocher, Wolfgang Völz, Stefan Krause, Frank Schaff', 'G', 'On a magical tropical island, a fun-loving group of misfit animals and people discover a baby dinosaur frozen since prehistoric times. When a king from a faraway country vows to capture the loveable baby dino for his private collection, all the inhabitants must join together to save their new friend.', 'On a magical tropical island, a fun-loving group of misfit animals and people discover a baby dinosaur frozen since prehistoric times. When a king from a faraway country vows to capture the loveable baby dino for his private collection, all the inhabitants must join together to save their new friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/83jgTDWYS0Whokjm3CB2Q6kYQCV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26497'),
  ('879517352673968477', 'Impy''s Wonderland', 2008, 'Animation, Adventure, Family, Fantasy, Comedy', 'Holger Tappe, Reinhard Klooss', 'Oliver Huzly, Reinhard Klooss, Sven Severin', 'Hannes Maurer, Anke Engelke, Oliver Kalkofe, Wigald Boning, Christoph Maria Herbst, Oliver Pocher, Julia Ziffer, Wolfgang Völz', 'G', 'A winged baby dinosaur inhabits an island in the middle of the ocean with a group of loveable animal friends. Everything changes when a dimwitted dinosaur hunter turns up and lures the creature back to captivity with rather sinister plans for his discovery.', 'A winged baby dinosaur inhabits an island in the middle of the ocean with a group of loveable animal friends. Everything changes when a dimwitted dinosaur hunter turns up and lures the creature back to captivity with rather sinister plans for his discovery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gpXEW16zK1jQDT6IyZXw0QROBBR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78124'),
