  ('100336196697786660', 'In China They Eat Dogs', 1999, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Lasse Spang Olsen, Morten Søborg, Ian Kroch', 'Anders Thomas Jensen', 'Kim Bodnia, Dejan Čukić, Nikolaj Lie Kaas, Tomas Villum Jensen, Peter Gantzler, Trine Dyrholm, Line Kruse, Brian Patterson', null, 'Arvid is an ordinary bank clerk who lives a rather unassuming life with his dear girlfriend. But his life is turned completely upside down when he bravely manages to avert a robbery against the bank where he works.', 'Arvid is an ordinary bank clerk who lives a rather unassuming life with his dear girlfriend. But his life is turned completely upside down when he bravely manages to avert a robbery against the bank where he works.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v78NxEyzsElWnwSvGWpvf2DCzP9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:250'),
  ('834616015122372240', 'In Cold Blood', 1967, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller, History', 'Richard Brooks, Conrad Hall, Tom Shaw', 'Richard Brooks', 'Robert Blake, Scott Wilson, John Forsythe, Paul Stewart, Gerald S. O''Loughlin, Jeff Corey, John Gallaudet, James Flavin', 'R', 'After a botched robbery results in the brutal murder of a rural family, two drifters elude police, in the end coming to terms with their own mortality and the repercussions of their vile atrocity.', 'After a botched robbery results in the brutal murder of a rural family, two drifters elude police, in the end coming to terms with their own mortality and the repercussions of their vile atrocity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sPEvsif5Y70mfVvtU39iOyrVJdF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18900'),
  ('866624975607172854', 'In Cold Light', 2026, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Maxime Giroux, Sara Mishara', 'Patrick Whistler', 'Maika Monroe, Troy Kotsur, Allan Hawco, Helen Hunt, Jesse Irving, Noah Parker, Patrick Sabongui, David Haysom', 'R', 'Fresh out of prison, Ava''s attempt to reclaim her drug operation collapses when she witnesses a brutal crime, forcing her to flee into a nightmarish underworld where allies are scarce and enemies multiply by the minute.', 'Fresh out of prison, Ava''s attempt to reclaim her drug operation collapses when she witnesses a brutal crime, forcing her to flee into a nightmarish underworld where allies are scarce and enemies multiply by the minute.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rnrrZfFiUIpL00wUh15OBKStnDD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1128377'),
  ('666651543324754042', 'In Country', 1989, 'Drama', 'Norman Jewison, Russell Boyd', 'Frank Pierson, Cynthia Cidre', 'Bruce Willis, Emily Lloyd, Joan Allen, Kevin Anderson, John Terry, Peggy Rea, Judith Ivey, Richard Hamilton', 'R', 'Samantha Hughes, a teenaged Kentucky girl, never knew her father, who died in Vietnam before her birth. Samantha lives with her uncle Emmett, who also served in Vietnam. Emmett hangs around with Tom, Earl, and Pete, three other Vietnam vets who, like Emmett, all have problems of one kind or another that relate to their war experiences. Samantha becomes obsessed with finding out about her father.', 'Samantha Hughes, a teenaged Kentucky girl, never knew her father, who died in Vietnam before her birth. Samantha lives with her uncle Emmett, who also served in Vietnam. Emmett hangs around with Tom, Earl, and Pete, three other Vietnam vets who, like Emmett, all have problems of one kind or another that relate to their war experiences. Samantha becomes obsessed with finding out about her father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rLyxWz5O2QfOBbqLDlloUHQyuru.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32855'),
  ('314688292155162226', 'In Darkness', 2009, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Çağan Irmak, Gökhan Tiryaki', 'Çağan Irmak', 'Erdem Akakçe, Meral Çetinkaya, Derya Alabora, Rıza Akın, Merih Atalay, Durul Bazan, Savaş Akova, Pınar Töre', null, 'A drama-thriller centered on an advertising agency employee for whom work is an outlet from his life under his overbearing mother''s roof.', 'A drama-thriller centered on an advertising agency employee for whom work is an outlet from his life under his overbearing mother''s roof.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gfbVOejn8cf7mBc9RG4xDIWvBO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52162'),
  ('245471292289497278', 'In Darkness', 2011, 'Drama, War', 'Agnieszka Holland, Daniel J. Murphy, David Forsyth', 'David F. Shamoon', 'Robert Więckiewicz, Benno Fürmann, Agnieszka Grochowska, Maria Schrader, Herbert Knaup, Marcin Bosak, Julia Kijowska, Jerzy Walczak', 'R', 'A dramatization of one man''s rescue of Jewish refugees in the Nazi-occupied city of Lviv. In Darkness tells the true story of Leopold Soha who risks his own life to save a dozen people from certain death. Initially only interested in his own good, the thief and burglar hides Jewish refugees for 14 months in the sewers of the Nazi-occupied town of Lviv (formerly Poland).', 'A dramatization of one man''s rescue of Jewish refugees in the Nazi-occupied city of Lviv. In Darkness tells the true story of Leopold Soha who risks his own life to save a dozen people from certain death. Initially only interested in his own good, the thief and burglar hides Jewish refugees for 14 months in the sewers of the Nazi-occupied town of Lviv (formerly Poland).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cRm30D0tBvMLXjtoKuaUteBZ4nv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73686'),
  ('340898443274115514', 'In Darkness', 2018, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Anthony Byrne, Si Bell, Ashe Morrison', 'Anthony Byrne, Natalie Dormer', 'Natalie Dormer, Emily Ratajkowski, Ed Skrein, Joely Richardson, James Cosmo, Neil Maskell, Jan Bijvoet, Michael Bott', null, 'A blind musician hears a murder committed in the apartment upstairs from hers that sends her down a dark path into London''s gritty criminal underworld.', 'A blind musician hears a murder committed in the apartment upstairs from hers that sends her down a dark path into London''s gritty criminal underworld.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A4gJEE1zpImXE8MYkeq4sB69mfZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:417643'),
  ('6837061058789889', 'In Darkness We Fall', 2014, 'Horror, Adventure', 'Alfredo Montero, Alfredo Montero', 'Alfredo Montero, Javier Gullón', 'Marta Castellote, Xoel Fernández, Eva García-Vacas, Marcos Ortiz, Jorge López Páez', null, 'Three boys and two girls go backpacking from the city to a paradisiacal island. There they rent motorcycles, travel around the prettiest and most remote spots, camp out in the woods, on a coastal cliff, get drunk and swim in the sea. The following day they enter a deep, maze-like cave to explore it and get lost inside.', 'Three boys and two girls go backpacking from the city to a paradisiacal island. There they rent motorcycles, travel around the prettiest and most remote spots, camp out in the woods, on a coastal cliff, get drunk and swim in the sea. The following day they enter a deep, maze-like cave to explore it and get lost inside.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vQgUNCouT5frFxeXx5mXRskOhWJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:253376'),
  ('820317367310991357', 'In Defense of a Married Man', 1990, 'TV Movie, Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Joel Oliansky, François Protat', null, 'Judith Light, Michael Ontkean, Jerry Orbach, Johnny Galecki, Cynthia Sikes, Gema Zamprogna, Patricia Hamilton, Pat Corley', null, 'When a defense lawyer''s adulterous husband becomes the prime suspect in the murder of the woman he was cheating with, his wife chooses to defend him. Can she overcome his betrayal while searching for the truth?', 'When a defense lawyer''s adulterous husband becomes the prime suspect in the murder of the woman he was cheating with, his wife chooses to defend him. Can she overcome his betrayal while searching for the truth?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g6fKtWN03BwLutfrIu1tEA4hxpa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:169821'),
  ('525764747402211219', 'In Desert and Wilderness', 1973, 'Adventure, Family, History', 'Władysław Ślesicki, Bogusław Lambach, Khairy Beshara', 'Władysław Ślesicki', 'Tomasz Mędrzak, Monika Rosca, Emos Bango, Malija Mekki, Stanisław Jasiukiewicz, Edmund Fetting, Zygmunt Maciejewski, Zygmunt Hobot', null, 'Fourteen year old Polish boy Stas Tarkowski and eight year old Nel Rawlison from England are kidnapped as the hostages by Arabic fanatics and taken to their religion leader. Then they manage to escape and try to return to their fathers. Children have a lot of dangerous adventures, meet two Black kids; Kali and Mea, who also help them, make a friendship with an elephant and help one Black''s tribe.', 'Fourteen year old Polish boy Stas Tarkowski and eight year old Nel Rawlison from England are kidnapped as the hostages by Arabic fanatics and taken to their religion leader. Then they manage to escape and try to return to their fathers. Children have a lot of dangerous adventures, meet two Black kids; Kali and Mea, who also help them, make a friendship with an elephant and help one Black''s tribe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iNB23VDjWCfF9uazdLt6J2bGwmo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:154297'),
  ('116353726754583299', 'In Dog''s Words', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Marcos Jorge', 'Lusa Silvestre, Marcos Jorge', 'Babu Santana, Adriana Esteves, Lázaro Ramos, Thainá Duarte, Vini Carvalho, Milhem Cortaz, Paulinho Serra, Tony Ravan', null, 'São Paulo, 2007. Santana works as a dogcatcher, picking up stray animals. He is a friendly guy, averse to trouble, who has always kept violence away from the doorsteps of his home. One day, he catches a very big dog in a school. Some days later, comes the animal''s owner: Babyface, a sociopath ex-cop. The man is furious, considering his dog to be "kidnapped", and demands immediate restitution of his pet. But the dog is not coming back: according to the law, the animal was put to sleep. In a misunderstanding, Babyface argue with Santana, blaming him for his pet''s death. From this moment on, Santana''s life will be completely changed.', 'São Paulo, 2007. Santana works as a dogcatcher, picking up stray animals. He is a friendly guy, averse to trouble, who has always kept violence away from the doorsteps of his home. One day, he catches a very big dog in a school. Some days later, comes the animal''s owner: Babyface, a sociopath ex-cop. The man is furious, considering his dog to be "kidnapped", and demands immediate restitution of his pet. But the dog is not coming back: according to the law, the animal was put to sleep. In a misunderstanding, Babyface argue with Santana, blaming him for his pet''s death. From this moment on, Santana''s life will be completely changed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8CK7eSAk4Fw9N5FdrqMOpaderuP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:360142'),
  ('316537907427511729', 'In Dreams', 1999, 'Mystery, Thriller, Horror', 'Neil Jordan, Patrick Clayton, Christo Morse', 'Bruce Robinson, Neil Jordan', 'Annette Bening, Aidan Quinn, Stephen Rea, Robert Downey Jr., Paul Guilfoyle, Dennis Boutsikaris, Krystal Benn, Lonnie Farmer', 'R', 'A suburban housewife learns that she has psychic connections to a serial killer, and can predict this person''s motives through her dreams.', 'A suburban housewife learns that she has psychic connections to a serial killer, and can predict this person''s motives through her dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q3Q00fCgeZGjAYaiwbfTMuIrUb0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28902'),
  ('323209361198651072', 'In Dubious Battle', 2016, 'Drama', 'James Franco, Bruce Thierry Cheung', 'Matt Rager', 'James Franco, Nat Wolff, Selena Gomez, Vincent D''Onofrio, Robert Duvall, Ed Harris, Sam Shepard, Bryan Cranston', 'R', 'In the California apple country, 900 migratory workers rise ''in dubious battle'' against the landowners. The group takes on a life of its own—stronger than its individual members, and more frightening. Led by the doomed Jim Nolan, the strike is founded on his tragic idealism—''courage, never submit, or yield''.', 'In the California apple country, 900 migratory workers rise ''in dubious battle'' against the landowners. The group takes on a life of its own—stronger than its individual members, and more frightening. Led by the doomed Jim Nolan, the strike is founded on his tragic idealism—''courage, never submit, or yield''.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bC7N0pUc6RzuDqSNHsV0VXk06Cq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:337844'),
  ('112194656435906859', 'In Dutch', 1946, 'Family, Animation', 'Charles August Nichols', null, 'Pinto Colvig', 'NR', 'In Holland, Pluto acts as a milkman (dog?) leaving canisters of milk on the town''s doorsteps. While going about his job, he falls head over heels in love with Dinah the dachshund. In his enthusiasm, he accidentally rings the dike bell causing the town to think the dike is leaking. When the fraud is exposed, Pluto and Dinah are kicked out of the town. Upon leaving, they both notice the dike actually has sprung a leak. While Dinah plugs the leak, Pluto must return to the town and find a way to get the residents to follow him to the dike leak.', 'In Holland, Pluto acts as a milkman (dog?) leaving canisters of milk on the town''s doorsteps. While going about his job, he falls head over heels in love with Dinah the dachshund. In his enthusiasm, he accidentally rings the dike bell causing the town to think the dike is leaking. When the fraud is exposed, Pluto and Dinah are kicked out of the town. Upon leaving, they both notice the dike actually has sprung a leak. While Dinah plugs the leak, Pluto must return to the town and find a way to get the residents to follow him to the dike leak.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x6OZh68AO5UL5jk9IjvX2i2zxl5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68496'),
  ('1014530057474367657', 'In Enemy Hands', 2004, 'War', 'Tony Giglio, Gerry Lively, Mike Smith', 'Johnny Hartmann, John E. Deaver', 'William H. Macy, Til Schweiger, Scott Caan, Thomas Kretschmann, Lauren Holly, Xander Berkeley, Chris Ellis, Carmine Giovinazzo', 'R', 'At the height of Hitler''s infamous U-boat war, the crew of the U.S.S. Swordfish were heading home after months at sea. They never made it. Now prisoners of war aboard U-boat 429, a small group of American survivors will find their loyalties put to the ultimate test when they''re forced to join their German captors to fight for their very lives.', 'At the height of Hitler''s infamous U-boat war, the crew of the U.S.S. Swordfish were heading home after months at sea. They never made it. Now prisoners of war aboard U-boat 429, a small group of American survivors will find their loyalties put to the ultimate test when they''re forced to join their German captors to fight for their very lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4CQR4giYM3NNzBTpA75Fq8I5rqM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23592'),
  ('590145758218610468', 'In Fabric', 2018, 'Horror, Fantasy, Comedy, Mystery', 'Peter Strickland, Ari Wegner, Nick Gillespie', 'Peter Strickland', 'Marianne Jean-Baptiste, Sidse Babett Knudsen, Julian Barratt, Richard Bremmer, Fatma Mohamed, Gwendoline Christie, Hayley Squires, Caroline Catz', 'R', 'A haunting ghost story set against the backdrop of a busy winter sales period in a department store, following the life of a cursed dress as it passes from person to person, with devastating consequences.', 'A haunting ghost story set against the backdrop of a busy winter sales period in a department store, following the life of a cursed dress as it passes from person to person, with devastating consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ndeOYvcEgRGV0c484ocmfhtma6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:475220'),
  ('632996441155823181', 'In Family I Trust', 2019, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Patricia Font, David Valldepérez', 'Darío Madrona, Carlos Montero', 'Clara Lago, Carmen Maura, Alexandra Jiménez, Paula Malia, Álex García, Carlos Cuevas, Eduardo Ferrés, Fernando Guallar', null, 'Bea is a successful architect who lives in Barcelona (Catalonia, northeast to Spain) with her boyfriend and boss, Víctor, a CEO of an important company. During a night celebration of an important contract signed to make a skyscraper designed by Bea, in the bar appears the famous TV reporter and anchorwoman Rebecca Ramos, Victor''s personal erotic fantasy. Not measuring the consequences of her actions due to the alcohol she drank, Bea makes a meeting between Víctor and Rebecca. When to the next day she wakes up, Víctor proposes to wed Bea and she accepts, but after she arrives to the job, Bea learns about a videotape where Víctor and Rebecca make the love in a car that it''s in all TV channels. In front of all CEOs during a full meeting, Bea slaps Víctor and destroys her design, being fired from the job. Looking for a break, she travels her natal coastal town, Santa Clara, just to discover that her rest isn''t so easy as it seems: her eccentric, free-spirited and eternal smiling mother ...', 'Bea is a successful architect who lives in Barcelona (Catalonia, northeast to Spain) with her boyfriend and boss, Víctor, a CEO of an important company. During a night celebration of an important contract signed to make a skyscraper designed by Bea, in the bar appears the famous TV reporter and anchorwoman Rebecca Ramos, Victor''s personal erotic fantasy. Not measuring the consequences of her actions due to the alcohol she drank, Bea makes a meeting between Víctor and Rebecca. When to the next day she wakes up, Víctor proposes to wed Bea and she accepts, but after she arrives to the job, Bea learns about a videotape where Víctor and Rebecca make the love in a car that it''s in all TV channels. In front of all CEOs during a full meeting, Bea slaps Víctor and destroys her design, being fired from the job. Looking for a break, she travels her natal coastal town, Santa Clara, just to discover that her rest isn''t so easy as it seems: her eccentric, free-spirited and eternal smiling mother ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nHaZbu9rtmDheImnkKz1kLHM86I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:512019'),
  ('712482771719609144', 'In Fear', 2013, 'Thriller', 'Timur Karamolla, Simon Hedges, Paddy Blake', 'Jeremy Lovering', 'Alice Englert, Iain De Caestecker, Allen Leech', 'R', 'Driving to a music festival in Ireland, a young couple gets trapped in a country maze on their way to a remote hotel, where an unidentifiable sinister force torments them.', 'Driving to a music festival in Ireland, a young couple gets trapped in a country maze on their way to a remote hotel, where an unidentifiable sinister force torments them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9GpmoAAp1LTMx8byVLlpjumOzgj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:159095'),
  ('549989693162591505', 'In for a Murder', 2021, 'Crime, Comedy', 'Piotr Mularuk, Barbara Burska, Adam Bajerski', 'Katarzyna Gacek, Piotr Mularuk', 'Anna Smołowik, Paweł Domagała, Szymon Bobrowski, Piotr Adamczyk, Dorota Segda, Rafał Królikowski, Przemysław Stippa, Jacek Feliks Knap', null, 'A stay-at-home mom and avid reader of crime stories discovers the deepest secrets of a small town''s residents while investigating a woman''s murder.', 'A stay-at-home mom and avid reader of crime stories discovers the deepest secrets of a small town''s residents while investigating a woman''s murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i4CLIpT1lEOtVvOsF3dajDTXxuc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:846167'),
  ('796194322684341641', 'In fraganti', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Juan Camilo Pinzón, Alejandro “Nano” Moreno', 'Darío Armando García, César Betancur', 'Natalia Paris, César Mora, Aída Morales, Martín Karpan, Ana María Sánchez, Carla Giraldo, Ramsés Ramos, Bernardo García', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3yNuDdD7GOTl0kHKIXjuBQoUJXl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:142829'),
  ('479299834441472112', 'In fremden Händen', 2026, 'Thriller', 'Christian Bach', 'Christian Bach', 'Désirée Nosbusch, Robert Hunger-Bühler, Picco von Groote, Bettina Burchard, Peter Ketnath', null, 'Als die attraktive Karola in das Leben des wohlhabenden Wolfgang tritt, freuen sich seine beiden Töchter, dass sich jemand um den Vater kümmert. Doch führt Karola etwas im Schilde? Wolfgang hatte Karola in einem Hotel kennengerlernt und sich prompt in sie verliebt. Ein schwerer Sturz während einer gemeinsamen Wanderung fesselt Wolfgang nun an Krücken, er ist auf Hilfe angewiesen. Als Karola bei Wolfgang einzieht und scheinbar selbstlos dessen komplettes Leben umkrempelt, fragen sich die Töchter Verena und Jana, ob sich die neue Freundin des Vaters womöglich doch nur bereichern will. Das wachsende Misstrauen führt zu Auseinandersetzungen in der Familie. Beleidigt torpediert Karola Verenas und Janas Versuche der Versöhnung, was zum endgültigen Bruch mit dem Vater führt. Zunehmend schirmt sie den kränkelnden Wolfgang nun auch von seinem restlichen Umfeld ab und nimmt seine ärztliche Versorgung selbst in die Hand. Wolfgangs Gesundheit verschlechtert sich dramatisch. Doch es ist zu spät: als Wolfgang endlich erkennt, dass er es mit einer gerissenen und skrupellosen Frau zu tun hat, ist er längst vollkommen isoliert und von Karola abhängig. Mit Medikamentencocktails fesselt sie ihn ans Bett und verhindert jeden Kontakt mit der Familie. Durch eigene Nachforschungen gelingt es den Schwestern, Karolas mörderischer Masche auf die Schliche zu kommen. Das Treffen mit einer weiteren Opferfamilie bringt schließlich Gewissheit: Karola war bereits mehrfach mit betagten Witwern liiert, die plötzlich verstorben sind, nachdem sie sich durch eine Vorsorgevollmacht deren gesamtes Vermögen erschlichen hatte. Verzweifelt versuchen die beiden Schwestern, ihren Vater zu retten. Doch um das zu erreichen, müssen sie Karola mit illegalen Mitteln von ihrem perfiden Tun abhalten.', 'Als die attraktive Karola in das Leben des wohlhabenden Wolfgang tritt, freuen sich seine beiden Töchter, dass sich jemand um den Vater kümmert. Doch führt Karola etwas im Schilde? Wolfgang hatte Karola in einem Hotel kennengerlernt und sich prompt in sie verliebt. Ein schwerer Sturz während einer gemeinsamen Wanderung fesselt Wolfgang nun an Krücken, er ist auf Hilfe angewiesen. Als Karola bei Wolfgang einzieht und scheinbar selbstlos dessen komplettes Leben umkrempelt, fragen sich die Töchter Verena und Jana, ob sich die neue Freundin des Vaters womöglich doch nur bereichern will. Das wachsende Misstrauen führt zu Auseinandersetzungen in der Familie. Beleidigt torpediert Karola Verenas und Janas Versuche der Versöhnung, was zum endgültigen Bruch mit dem Vater führt. Zunehmend schirmt sie den kränkelnden Wolfgang nun auch von seinem restlichen Umfeld ab und nimmt seine ärztliche Versorgung selbst in die Hand. Wolfgangs Gesundheit verschlechtert sich dramatisch. Doch es ist zu spät: als Wolfgang endlich erkennt, dass er es mit einer gerissenen und skrupellosen Frau zu tun hat, ist er längst vollkommen isoliert und von Karola abhängig. Mit Medikamentencocktails fesselt sie ihn ans Bett und verhindert jeden Kontakt mit der Familie. Durch eigene Nachforschungen gelingt es den Schwestern, Karolas mörderischer Masche auf die Schliche zu kommen. Das Treffen mit einer weiteren Opferfamilie bringt schließlich Gewissheit: Karola war bereits mehrfach mit betagten Witwern liiert, die plötzlich verstorben sind, nachdem sie sich durch eine Vorsorgevollmacht deren gesamtes Vermögen erschlichen hatte. Verzweifelt versuchen die beiden Schwestern, ihren Vater zu retten. Doch um das zu erreichen, müssen sie Karola mit illegalen Mitteln von ihrem perfiden Tun abhalten.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FaNS4fubNI6NgLfnTqYnP72knKSD.jpg', 'plex:movie:in-fremden-handen-2026'),
  ('713371033075447682', 'In from the Side', 2022, 'Drama, Romance', 'Matt Carter, Aidan Kirwan, Bozhidar Peychev', 'Matt Carter, Adam Silver', 'Alexander Lincoln, Alexander King, Peter McPherson, Christopher Sherwood, Ivan Comisso, Pearse Egan, Carl Loughlin, Kane Surry', 'NR', 'Mark, a new and inexperienced rugby club member, finds himself drawn to Warren, a seasoned first team player. When a series of happenstances at an away fixture lead to a drunken encounter, Mark and Warren unwittingly embark on a romantic affair they struggle to hide from their partners and teammates.', 'Mark, a new and inexperienced rugby club member, finds himself drawn to Warren, a seasoned first team player. When a series of happenstances at an away fixture lead to a drunken encounter, Mark and Warren unwittingly embark on a romantic affair they struggle to hide from their partners and teammates.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3ZJzL6L0RFVBg6qa2CDAXxXxJjC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:622082'),
  ('282418372650266473', 'In Front of Your Face', 2021, 'Drama', 'Hong Sang-soo, Hong Sang-soo', 'Hong Sang-soo', 'Lee Hye-young, Cho Yun-hee, Kwon Hae-hyo, Shin Seok-ho, Kim Sae-byuk, Ha Seong-guk, Seo Young-hwa, Lee Eun-mi', null, 'She has never lived in a high-rise apartment, and she wonders how her sister can live at this height every day. A few days ago she kind of burst in to stay with her sister, and she is now becoming re-accustomed to life in Korea. While seeming to keep a grave secret to herself, she manages life one day at a time with a sense of mindfulness. Meanwhile a certain director, some years younger than her, has asked her to join his project, and after a polite refusal, they have agreed to meet for the first time today. Downtown Seoul is filled with narrow alleys that harbor tiny old bars, and that''s where they meet. As they are getting drunk, there is sudden rainfall and thunder.', 'She has never lived in a high-rise apartment, and she wonders how her sister can live at this height every day. A few days ago she kind of burst in to stay with her sister, and she is now becoming re-accustomed to life in Korea. While seeming to keep a grave secret to herself, she manages life one day at a time with a sense of mindfulness. Meanwhile a certain director, some years younger than her, has asked her to join his project, and after a polite refusal, they have agreed to meet for the first time today. Downtown Seoul is filled with narrow alleys that harbor tiny old bars, and that''s where they meet. As they are getting drunk, there is sudden rainfall and thunder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vAoV0wQB3015O0mdAsXPnV06yk5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:820517'),
  ('121779537769673650', 'In fuga con Babbo Natale', 2023, 'Family, Comedy', 'Marcello Montarsi, Volfango De Biasi, Cristina Corna', 'Fabrice Carazo, Rachel Palmieri, Laurent Zeitoun', 'Giampaolo Morelli, Enea Indraccolo, Ilaria Spada, Mario de la Rosa, Elisa Di Eusanio, Michela Andreozzi, Renato Marchetti, Marco Conidi', null, 'On Christmas Eve, a curious child embarks on a hilarious adventure with a man he believes to be Santa Claus — but is actually an undercover thief.', 'On Christmas Eve, a curious child embarks on a hilarious adventure with a man he believes to be Santa Claus — but is actually an undercover thief.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/19qFDsjJFSXRIxH2XPlKM1Y1zzC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1189213'),
  ('123586211044554701', 'In Full Bloom', 2019, 'Action, Drama', 'Reza Ghassemi, Adam VillaSeñor', null, 'Tyler JW Wood, Yusuke Ogasawara, Hiroyuki Watanabe, Timothy V. Murphy, S. Scott McCracken, Stefanie Estes, Hidetoshi Imura, Shu Sakimoto', null, 'Set shortly after the end of World War II, a philosophical boxing drama of two fighters from opposite worlds (USA and Japan) who are pulled together for a questionable fight arranged by their unscrupulous managers and the Yakuza.', 'Set shortly after the end of World War II, a philosophical boxing drama of two fighters from opposite worlds (USA and Japan) who are pulled together for a questionable fight arranged by their unscrupulous managers and the Yakuza.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yAEEX18LgxzhTbo5NZKpqUL5HVP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:608813'),
