  ('651768433597841532', 'In Love and War', 1996, 'Drama, Romance', 'Richard Attenborough, Michael Stevenson, Roger Pratt', 'Allan Scott, Anna Hamilton Phelan, Clancy Sigal', 'Sandra Bullock, Chris O''Donnell, Mackenzie Astin, Margot Steinberg, Alan Bennett, Ingrid Lacey, George Rossi, Carlo Croccolo', 'PG-13', 'After teenage ambulance driver Ernest Hemingway takes shrapnel in the leg during World War I, he falls in love with Agnes von Kurowsky, a beautiful older nurse at the hospital where he''s sent to recover. Their affair slowly blossoms, until Hemingway boldly asks Agnes to be his wife and journey to America with him.', 'After teenage ambulance driver Ernest Hemingway takes shrapnel in the leg during World War I, he falls in love with Agnes von Kurowsky, a beautiful older nurse at the hospital where he''s sent to recover. Their affair slowly blossoms, until Hemingway boldly asks Agnes to be his wife and journey to America with him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sX6MAU5LnYgh4w4Pg0AV18NypQD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26949'),
  ('967151165415626128', 'In Love We Trust', 2008, 'Drama', 'Wang Xiaoshuai', 'Wang Xiaoshuai', 'Liu Weiwei, Cheng Taishen, Zhang Jiayi, Tian Yuan, Yu Nan, Gao Yuanyuan, Cao Kefan, Zhang Chuqian', null, 'A divorced couple learns that the only way to possibly save their daughter, who is suffering from blood cancer, is to have another child. The problem is they''ve both already remarried.', 'A divorced couple learns that the only way to possibly save their daughter, who is suffering from blood cancer, is to have another child. The problem is they''ve both already remarried.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eXJqeUOsiFOmBpdnVrk4W6yFBsE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31205'),
