  ('924255811821512633', 'In The Mix', 2005, 'Comedy, Drama, Crime, Romance, Music', 'Ron Underwood', 'Jacqueline Zambrano', 'Usher, Chazz Palminteri, Emmanuelle Chriqui, Kevin Hart, Robert Costanzo, Robert Davi, Matt Gerald, Anthony Fazio', 'PG-13', 'A successful DJ named Darrel, managed to rescue a powerful mobster one night. In order to repay Darrell, the mobster, Frank Pacelli, gives him the task of protecting his daughter, Dolly.', 'A successful DJ named Darrel, managed to rescue a powerful mobster one night. In order to repay Darrell, the mobster, Frank Pacelli, gives him the task of protecting his daughter, Dolly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iMpA1GqP4DcJrXUOp3uk1rHjtKs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17952'),
  ('135032741643797680', 'In the Mood', 1987, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Phil Alden Robinson', 'Phil Alden Robinson', 'Patrick Dempsey, Beverly D''Angelo, Talia Balsam, Michael Constantine, Kathleen Freeman, Brian McNamara, Peter Hobbs, Terry Camilleri', 'PG-13', 'When 15-year-old Sonny Wisecarver has an affair with his older neighbor Francine and then runs off to marry her, a stern judge has the union annulled. Then, when Sonny finds himself before the same judge after getting involved with another woman in her 20s, the publicity from this case makes him the object of affection for millions of young women', 'When 15-year-old Sonny Wisecarver has an affair with his older neighbor Francine and then runs off to marry her, a stern judge has the union annulled. Then, when Sonny finds himself before the same judge after getting involved with another woman in her 20s, the publicity from this case makes him the object of affection for millions of young women', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9PnJgbeDVdveR2VP5KFyJAVRRzr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88448'),
  ('1060461247903723720', 'In the Mood for Love', 2000, 'Drama, Romance', 'Wong Kar-Wai, Christopher Doyle, Mark Lee Ping-Bing', 'Wong Kar-Wai', 'Maggie Cheung, Tony Leung Chiu-wai, Siu Ping-Lam, Rebecca Pan, Kelly Lai Chen, Joe Cheung Tung-Cho, Chan Man-Lei, Koo Kam-Wah', 'PG', 'Two neighbors form a strong bond after both suspect extramarital activities of their spouses. However, they agree to keep their bond platonic so as not to commit similar wrongs.', 'Two neighbors form a strong bond after both suspect extramarital activities of their spouses. However, they agree to keep their bond platonic so as not to commit similar wrongs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iYypPT4bhqXfq1b6EnmxvRt6b2Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:843'),
  ('422922297239594598', 'In the Mouth of Madness', 1995, 'Horror, Mystery', 'John Carpenter, Gary B. Kibbe, Stuart Williams', 'Michael De Luca', 'Sam Neill, Julie Carmen, Jürgen Prochnow, David Warner, John Glover, Bernie Casey, Peter Jason, Charlton Heston', 'R', 'An insurance investigator visits a small town while looking into the strange disappearance of a popular horror novelist. He soon finds that the impact of the author’s books is far more than inspirational.', 'An insurance investigator visits a small town while looking into the strange disappearance of a popular horror novelist. He soon finds that the impact of the author’s books is far more than inspirational.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/msh4tEUzbnEqlHcFOUH4O0Zti8r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2654'),
  ('31675113646719145', 'In the Name of a Prank', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Tatyana Mokhova, Анна Голицина, Alexey Sinitsyn', 'Vladimir Kott', 'Viktor Horinyak, Taisiya Vilkova, Aglaya Tarasova, Tatyana Orlova, Yuriy Kuznetsov, Maksim Lagashkin, Anton Eskin, Sergei Selin', null, 'YouTube star Dima causes outrage among Christians. To hide from the police and activists, he goes undercover as a pope in a small church. One month without communication, surrounded by monks, will change his life.', 'YouTube star Dima causes outrage among Christians. To hide from the police and activists, he goes undercover as a pope in a small church. One month without communication, surrounded by monks, will change his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vJ85yHazgkr4lK4xPdxjqjyWG1s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:778970'),
  ('323086704901306383', 'In the Name of Blood', 2025, 'Thriller', 'Akaki Popkhadze, Justin Vaudaux, Vianney Etossé', 'Florent Hill, Akaki Popkhadze', 'Denis Lavant, Jean-Philippe Ricci, Nicolas Duvauchelle, Finnegan Oldfield, Florent Hill, Merab Ninidze, Ia Shugliashvili, Camille Pistone', null, 'In the working-class neighborhoods of Nice, a pillar of the local Georgian community is murdered. His son Tristan, who aspires to become an orthodox priest, finds himself finds himself alone with his grieving mother. Gabriel, his older brother with a troubled past, reappears from a long exile to make amends by redeeming his family honor.', 'In the working-class neighborhoods of Nice, a pillar of the local Georgian community is murdered. His son Tristan, who aspires to become an orthodox priest, finds himself finds himself alone with his grieving mother. Gabriel, his older brother with a troubled past, reappears from a long exile to make amends by redeeming his family honor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4lG3ZiGYNWo4lnOvnbS5afVzNA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:861211'),
  ('269168681211854396', 'In the Name of God', 1992, 'Documentary', 'Anand Patwardhan', null, null, null, 'The film explores the campaign waged by the Hindu right-wing organisation Vishva Hindu Parishad to build a Ram temple at the site of the Babri Masjid in Ayodhya, as well as the communal violence that it triggered. A couple of months after Ram ke Naam was released, VHP activists demolished the Babri Masjid in 1992, provoking further violence.', 'The film explores the campaign waged by the Hindu right-wing organisation Vishva Hindu Parishad to build a Ram temple at the site of the Babri Masjid in Ayodhya, as well as the communal violence that it triggered. A couple of months after Ram ke Naam was released, VHP activists demolished the Babri Masjid in 1992, provoking further violence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sgq0VUIjQfrTYRUMKlSWmd0kfb0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:260669'),
  ('367392097196544876', 'In the Name of My Daughter', 2014, 'Drama, Mystery', 'André Téchiné, Julien Hirsch', 'André Téchiné, Jean-Charles Le Roux, Cédric Anger', 'Catherine Deneuve, Guillaume Canet, Adèle Haenel, Judith Chemla, Mauro Conte, Jean Corso, Hugo Sablic, Jean-Pierre Getti', null, 'In 1976 in Nice, Agnes, the daughter of the owner of the Palais de la Méditerranée, falls in love with an older lawyer.', 'In 1976 in Nice, Agnes, the daughter of the owner of the Palais de la Méditerranée, falls in love with an older lawyer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yKSOj7pyAgEVsPbU3oV9duVLfLC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:270899'),
  ('539147415092820067', 'In the Name of the Daughter', 2011, 'Drama', 'Armando Salazar, Tania Hermida', 'Tania Hermida', 'Eva Mayu Mecham Benavides, Markus Mecham Benavides, Martina León, Sebastián Hormachea, Francisco Jaramillo, Francisco Aguirre, Juana Estrella', null, 'En el Nombre de la Hija tells the story of a nine-year old girl whose name is in dispute. Manuela has been named alter her socialist-atheist father, but her catholic-conservative grandmother insists she should carry the name the first daughters of the family have carried for generations: Dolores. The story takes place in a Valley in the Ecuadorian Andes, during the summer of 1976. Manuela and her little brother, Camilo, are spending vacations with their cousins and grandparents at the family''s farmhouse. Eager to defend her father''s ideas, Manuela confronts her cousins and grandparents, but an unexpected encounter leads her to confront herself instead. Hidden in the family''s abandoned library, schizophrenic uncle Felipe is devoted to setting words free from the constraints of dogmas. His wisdom sets Manuela free from her own dogmas and forever changes her relationship with words, including her own name.', 'En el Nombre de la Hija tells the story of a nine-year old girl whose name is in dispute. Manuela has been named alter her socialist-atheist father, but her catholic-conservative grandmother insists she should carry the name the first daughters of the family have carried for generations: Dolores. The story takes place in a Valley in the Ecuadorian Andes, during the summer of 1976. Manuela and her little brother, Camilo, are spending vacations with their cousins and grandparents at the family''s farmhouse. Eager to defend her father''s ideas, Manuela confronts her cousins and grandparents, but an unexpected encounter leads her to confront herself instead. Hidden in the family''s abandoned library, schizophrenic uncle Felipe is devoted to setting words free from the constraints of dogmas. His wisdom sets Manuela free from her own dogmas and forever changes her relationship with words, including her own name.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eDgOhO6TTKiPkpnZtgHe2Bj4w5r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:389422'),
  ('306011924036439316', 'In the Name of the Father', 1971, 'History, Drama, Mystery, Comedy', 'Franco Di Giacomo, Marco Bellocchio, Simone Carella', 'Marco Bellocchio', 'Yves Beneyton, Renato Scarpa, Piero Vida, Aldo Sassi, Lou Castel, Laura Betti, Simone Carella, Marco Romizi', 'NR', 'In 1958 Angelo, a rich and spoiled boy, enters a religious school, where students are tired of its vice-rector, and the strict rules and old-fashioned teaching methods of priests. Soon, Angelo exerts strong leadership among his peers and incites turmoil among them, helped by intellectual Franco and shy Camma. They expel the prefect from the school, organize a Grand Guignol show, and disappear the corpse of an old professor.', 'In 1958 Angelo, a rich and spoiled boy, enters a religious school, where students are tired of its vice-rector, and the strict rules and old-fashioned teaching methods of priests. Soon, Angelo exerts strong leadership among his peers and incites turmoil among them, helped by intellectual Franco and shy Camma. They expel the prefect from the school, organize a Grand Guignol show, and disappear the corpse of an old professor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7QjtRyvLjQlnx4siDyKC3nFprDA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47840'),
  ('286421828143134622', 'In the Name of the Father', 2002, 'Drama', 'Júlio Maria Pessoa', 'Júlio Maria Pessoa', 'Leonardo Miggiorin, Elias Andreato, Denise Weinberg', null, 'The short film depicts the life of a boy who is constantly sexually abused by his father. Leonardo Miggiorin brilliantly plays the role of this boy, who belongs to a poor and unstructured family.', 'The short film depicts the life of a boy who is constantly sexually abused by his father. Leonardo Miggiorin brilliantly plays the role of this boy, who belongs to a poor and unstructured family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rNqUVdZ64HuFxUe9TwUYwCNfQob.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:471156'),
  ('765407953214031282', 'In the Name of the Italian People', 1971, 'Comedy, Drama, Crime', 'Dino Risi, Alessandro D''Eva, Renato Rizzuto', 'Furio Scarpelli, Agenore Incrocci', 'Ugo Tognazzi, Vittorio Gassman, Ely Galleani, Yvonne Furneaux, Michele Cimarosa, Renato Baldini, Pietro Tordi, Maria Teresa Albani', null, 'An obscure Italian magistrate suspects that a well-known industrialist commited murder, and decides to investigate him, and bring him to court, whatever it takes. But - will the magistrate have it in him to go against impossible odds, in the name of the Italian people he represents?', 'An obscure Italian magistrate suspects that a well-known industrialist commited murder, and decides to investigate him, and bring him to court, whatever it takes. But - will the magistrate have it in him to go against impossible odds, in the name of the Italian people he represents?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e5reonxsH0Dxti5TZ1qi7qGt11G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65573'),
  ('94951258594506263', 'In the Name of the King 2: Two Worlds', 2011, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Drama, Action', 'Uwe Boll, Mathias Neumann', 'Michael Nachoff', 'Dolph Lundgren, Lochlyn Munro, Natassia Malthe, Aleks Paunovic, Natalie Burn, Christina Jastrzembska, Elisabeth Rosen, Michael Adamthwaite', 'R', 'Granger, an ex-Special Forces soldier gets thrown back to medieval times to fulfill an ancient prophecy. Venturing through the now war torn Kingdom of Ehb, he teams up with an unlikely band of allies with the goal of slaying the leader of the "Dark Ones". Fighting against all odds, they must free the land from the grasp of the evil tyrant Raven and save the world.', 'Granger, an ex-Special Forces soldier gets thrown back to medieval times to fulfill an ancient prophecy. Venturing through the now war torn Kingdom of Ehb, he teams up with an unlikely band of allies with the goal of slaying the leader of the "Dark Ones". Fighting against all odds, they must free the land from the grasp of the evil tyrant Raven and save the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kM9hjeGLtPZi9ExuBVwIFYrQbx0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80410'),
  ('539152946030241018', 'In the Name of the King III', 2014, 'Action, Adventure, Drama, Fantasy', 'Mathias Neumann, Uwe Boll', 'Joel Ross', 'Dominic Purcell, Ralitsa Paskaleva, Daria Simeonova, Petra Gocheva, Marina Dakova, Bashar Rahal, Nikolai Sotirov, Marian Valev', 'R', 'Hazen Kaine, an American contract killer living in Sofia, Bulgaria, gets more than he bargains for when he enters into a contract with the mob. One last job before he gets out and starts a new life for himself. The targets: the three children of royal billionaire Andon Dupont. Seems simple enough, or so he thought. Hazen apprehends the children, and before he can blink an eye, a simple necklace worn by one of the children sends his life spiraling back to medieval times. Now completely out of his element, Hazen fights for his life as he tries to escape a medieval army and a fierce fire-breathing dragon.', 'Hazen Kaine, an American contract killer living in Sofia, Bulgaria, gets more than he bargains for when he enters into a contract with the mob. One last job before he gets out and starts a new life for himself. The targets: the three children of royal billionaire Andon Dupont. Seems simple enough, or so he thought. Hazen apprehends the children, and before he can blink an eye, a simple necklace worn by one of the children sends his life spiraling back to medieval times. Now completely out of his element, Hazen fights for his life as he tries to escape a medieval army and a fierce fire-breathing dragon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yetbsCuB6fmzI4lpJMvqwJcehti.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:252360'),
  ('358346280479495796', 'In the Name of the King: A Dungeon Siege Tale', 2007, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Action, Drama', 'Uwe Boll, Mathias Neumann', 'Doug Taylor', 'Jason Statham, Ray Liotta, Leelee Sobieski, John Rhys-Davies, Burt Reynolds, Matthew Lillard, Brian J. White, Claire Forlani', 'PG-13', 'A man named Farmer sets out to rescue his kidnapped wife and avenge the death of his son – two acts committed by the Krugs, a race of animal-warriors who are controlled by the evil Gallian.', 'A man named Farmer sets out to rescue his kidnapped wife and avenge the death of his son – two acts committed by the Krugs, a race of animal-warriors who are controlled by the evil Gallian.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bbN1lmDk1PT0GsTFCy179sk5nIF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2312'),
  ('897501830889820367', 'In the Name of the Land', 2019, 'Drama', 'Édouard Bergeon, Éric Dumont, Barbara Dupont', 'Édouard Bergeon, Bruno Ulmer, Emmanuel Courcol', 'Guillaume Canet, Veerle Baetens, Anthony Bajon, Rufus, Samir Guesmi, Yona Kervern, Solal Forte, Marie-Christine Orry', null, 'Pierre is 25 when he returns from Wyoming to his fiancée and take over the family farm. Twenty years later, the farm expanded and so did the family. It''s the time of happy days, at least at the beginning. The debts accumulate and Pierre is exhausted at work. Despite the love of his wife and children, he is slowly falling...', 'Pierre is 25 when he returns from Wyoming to his fiancée and take over the family farm. Twenty years later, the farm expanded and so did the family. It''s the time of happy days, at least at the beginning. The debts accumulate and Pierre is exhausted at work. Despite the love of his wife and children, he is slowly falling...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4n4Mrn3StPtzWu8IOBII4k1T127.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:612368'),
  ('1104918905282608022', 'In the Name of the Law', 1949, 'Drama, Crime', 'Pietro Germi, Argi Rovelli, Salvatore Rosso', 'Tullio Pinelli, Federico Fellini, Mario Monicelli', 'Massimo Girotti, Jone Salinas, Camillo Mastrocinque, Charles Vanel, Saro Urzì, Turi Pandolfini, Peppino Spadaro, Saro Arcidiacono', null, 'A young, by-the-book judge is appointed to a Sicilian village controlled by corrupt leaders and the mafia.', 'A young, by-the-book judge is appointed to a Sicilian village controlled by corrupt leaders and the mafia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zJivgprws3TOLTZSDh2qXfnIeZt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:195382'),
  ('1108906893504609828', 'In the Name of the Law', 1952, 'Crime, Drama, Romance', 'Lütfi Akad', 'Lütfi Akad, Osman F. Seden', 'Ayhan Işık, Gülistan Güzey, Muzaffer Tema, Pola Morelli, Talat Artemel, Settar Körmükçü, Neşe Yulaç', null, 'Car mechanic Nazım Usta marries the woman he loves, Ayten. Ayten''s sister Nezahat also has feelings for Nazım. Nezahat''s plans mark the beginning of a crime story that will lead all three of them to ruin.', 'Car mechanic Nazım Usta marries the woman he loves, Ayten. Ayten''s sister Nezahat also has feelings for Nazım. Nezahat''s plans mark the beginning of a crime story that will lead all three of them to ruin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ckHOMnzWHgNOgpbfI4HI89Y4MLT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:261531'),
  ('843040633349103061', 'In the Name of the Law', 1986, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Kjell Sundvall', 'Leif G.W. Persson, Hans Iveberg', 'Sven Wollter, Anita Wall, Ernst Günther, Stefan Sauk, Pia Green, Johan Ulveson, Sven Strömersten-Holm, Marvin Yxner', null, 'A group of four policemen is known for cruising the streets of Stockholm in their van, looking for drunks or criminals they can beat up with their batons. Lately witnesses saw them pick up a drunk who later was found dead. The four policemen deny any knowledge. Police inspector Jarnebring gets the case and finds out that these four policemen have been reported for 22 cases of police brutality. Shortly after, another criminal dies in their van...', 'A group of four policemen is known for cruising the streets of Stockholm in their van, looking for drunks or criminals they can beat up with their batons. Lately witnesses saw them pick up a drunk who later was found dead. The four policemen deny any knowledge. Police inspector Jarnebring gets the case and finds out that these four policemen have been reported for 22 cases of police brutality. Shortly after, another criminal dies in their van...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ns5Www5MXuxsiTfrxPVGJ3qKhQs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76132'),
  ('1075738274612849961', 'In the Name of the Pope King', 1977, 'History, Drama', 'Luigi Magni, Danilo Desideri', 'Luigi Magni', 'Nino Manfredi, Danilo Mattei, Carmen Scarpitta, Salvo Randone, Ettore Manni, Giovannella Grifeo, Carlo Bagno, Gabriella Giacobbe', null, 'In 1867, with Garibaldi''s forces close to bringing Rome into the Italian kingdom, Monsignor Colombo da Priverno, a world-weary judge on the papal court, wants to resign, disgusted by the violence to which the papacy resorts to hold secular power.', 'In 1867, with Garibaldi''s forces close to bringing Rome into the Italian kingdom, Monsignor Colombo da Priverno, a world-weary judge on the papal court, wants to resign, disgusted by the violence to which the papacy resorts to hold secular power.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lTobEFDo921mqYG4VZ81oPbteNJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42220'),
  ('9183423650739118', 'In the Name of the Son', 2012, 'Drama', 'Vincent Lannoo', 'Vincent Lannoo, Philippe Falardeau', 'Astrid Whettnall, Philippe Nahon, Achille Ridolfi, Zacharie Chasseriaud, Albert Chassagne, Serge Swysen, Lionel Bourguet, Jacky Nercessian', null, 'When Elisabeth, a woman of faith, host of a radio show on a Catholic radio station, devoted to her family and the suffering of the world, is confronted with the pedophilia of priests and the suicide of her son, belief gives way to rage and to violence.', 'When Elisabeth, a woman of faith, host of a radio show on a Catholic radio station, devoted to her family and the suffering of the world, is confronted with the pedophilia of priests and the suicide of her son, belief gives way to rage and to violence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/akzojndpxqYICSUP8z3QEsPC13F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:187252'),
  ('750624192814419201', 'In the Name of...', 2013, 'Drama', 'Małgorzata Szumowska, Michał Englert, Kacper Habisiak', 'Małgorzata Szumowska, Michał Englert', 'Andrzej Chyra, Mateusz Kościukiewicz, Maja Ostaszewska, Maria Maj, Łukasz Simlat, Tomasz Schuchardt, Kamil Adamowicz, Mateusz Gajko', 'NR', 'The contemporary story of a priest who launches a centre for troubled youth in a small parish. He is a good priest and is well-liked by his congregation, which remains unaware of his complicated past.', 'The contemporary story of a priest who launches a centre for troubled youth in a small parish. He is a good priest and is well-liked by his congregation, which remains unaware of his complicated past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2tk89gkhWlntQMnBt125uRXwSSD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:160165'),
  ('969851436848408835', 'In the Navy', 1941, 'Comedy, Music, War', 'Arthur Lubin, Joseph A. Valentine, Harold H. MacArthur', 'Arthur T. Horman, John Grant', 'Bud Abbott, Lou Costello, Dick Powell, Claire Dodd, Laverne Andrews, Maxene Andrews, Patty Andrews, Dick Foran', 'NR', 'Popular crooner Russ Raymond abandons his career at its peak and joins the Navy using an alias, Tommy Halstead. However, Dorothy Roberts, a reporter, discovers his identity and follows him in the hopes of photographing him and revealing his identity to the world. Aboard the Alabama, Tommy meets up with Smoky and Pomeroy, who help hide him from Dorothy, who hatches numerous schemes in an attempt to photograph Tommy/Russ being a sailor.', 'Popular crooner Russ Raymond abandons his career at its peak and joins the Navy using an alias, Tommy Halstead. However, Dorothy Roberts, a reporter, discovers his identity and follows him in the hopes of photographing him and revealing his identity to the world. Aboard the Alabama, Tommy meets up with Smoky and Pomeroy, who help hide him from Dorothy, who hatches numerous schemes in an attempt to photograph Tommy/Russ being a sailor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5sdXSwjR3Ed6eE6rXdudbpWUH1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33523'),
  ('414051329628457555', 'In the Nguyen Kitchen', 2025, 'Comedy, Music', 'Stéphane Ly-Cuong, Anthony Moreau, Lucie Llopis', 'Stéphane Ly-Cuong', 'Clotilde Chevalier, Camille Japy, Leanna Chea, Linh-Dan Pham, Anh Tran-Nghia, Marie-Thérèse Priou, Gaël Kamilindi, Thomas Jolly', null, 'French-Vietnamese actress Yvonne Nguyen dreams of a successful career in musicals, to the great displeasure of her mother, who would like her to pursue a more serious path. When Yvonne has no choice but to move back home, both women are strangers to each other. But, in the intimacy of the Vietnamese family restaurant''s kitchen, they grow closer. Meanwhile, Yvonne is still after her dreams and finally gets the chance to audition for a big show.', 'French-Vietnamese actress Yvonne Nguyen dreams of a successful career in musicals, to the great displeasure of her mother, who would like her to pursue a more serious path. When Yvonne has no choice but to move back home, both women are strangers to each other. But, in the intimacy of the Vietnamese family restaurant''s kitchen, they grow closer. Meanwhile, Yvonne is still after her dreams and finally gets the chance to audition for a big show.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gfYmFNR29VJmAqkr8VBNZ13Y86r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1001248'),
  ('757113215120913865', 'In the Night', 1930, 'Drama', 'Charles Vanel, Georges Asselin', 'Charles Vanel', 'Charles Vanel, Sandra Milovanoff, Christiane Tourneur', null, 'A quarry worker gets married and lives his marital bliss, until an explosion at his workplace, a mine, disfigures him...', 'A quarry worker gets married and lives his marital bliss, until an explosion at his workplace, a mine, disfigures him...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bPl6r2IwfgcYhBh6L50pCUPkiQs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:190354'),
  ('318166901616937906', 'In the Open', 2011, 'Drama', 'Hernán Belón', 'Hernán Bélon, Valeria Radivo', 'Dolores Fonzi, Leonardo Sbaraglia, Pochi Ducasse, Matilda Manzano, Juan Villegas', null, 'Elisa, a thirty-eight-year old woman, leaves for a week with her husband and young daughter on a vacation to a house in the country. Everything is going for her: she has a successful professional career, loves her family, has enough money for a comfortable life, and has plans for the future. After arriving to the country, a strange feeling takes hold of her. She starts feeling the presence of something that moves the treetops at night, makes the dogs howl, and wanders like the breath of a ghost across the infinite countryside. A stinging feeling that kills all her certainties. In the middle of the night Elisa wakes up. The moonlight shines on her face.', 'Elisa, a thirty-eight-year old woman, leaves for a week with her husband and young daughter on a vacation to a house in the country. Everything is going for her: she has a successful professional career, loves her family, has enough money for a comfortable life, and has plans for the future. After arriving to the country, a strange feeling takes hold of her. She starts feeling the presence of something that moves the treetops at night, makes the dogs howl, and wanders like the breath of a ghost across the infinite countryside. A stinging feeling that kills all her certainties. In the middle of the night Elisa wakes up. The moonlight shines on her face.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oip1iTvBeJqgXserIljiGqZGPkU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:154552'),
  ('737481335564339114', 'In the Palm of Your Hand', 1951, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime', 'Roberto Gavaldón, Ignacio Villareal, Alex Phillips', 'Roberto Gavaldón, José Revueltas', 'Arturo de Córdova, Leticia Palma, Ramón Gay, Consuelo Guerrero de Luna, Carmen Montejo, Enriqueta Reza, Manuel Arvide, Bertha Lehar', null, 'A con artist seduces the widow of a millionaire, only to learn she''d plotted with her lover to murder the late husband. A tense game of cat-and-mouse ensues—but who''s the cat?', 'A con artist seduces the widow of a millionaire, only to learn she''d plotted with her lover to murder the late husband. A tense game of cat-and-mouse ensues—but who''s the cat?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uIZUXhUV2agSAzN7ch1cmVVw4x7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:240585'),
  ('1064139568022815076', 'In the Pit', 2006, 'Documentary', 'Juan Carlos Rulfo', 'Juan Carlos Rulfo', 'Salvador Enriquez Castillo, Sofia García López, José Guadalupe Calzada, Isabel Dolores Hernández', null, 'A portrait of the construction workers involved in building the second deck of Mexico City''s Periferico freeway.', 'A portrait of the construction workers involved in building the second deck of Mexico City''s Periferico freeway.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sS9NeqLYCY7wjMHrWrHNiOxlp8G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57702'),
  ('1126837942643438898', 'In the Pope''s Eye', 1980, 'Comedy', 'Fabrizio Corallo, Renzo Arbore, Luciano Tovoli', 'Renzo Arbore, Luciano De Crescenzo', 'Roberto Benigni, Luciano De Crescenzo, Andy Luotto, Isabella Rossellini, Diego Abatantuono, Renzo Arbore, Manfred Freyberger, Mario Marenco', null, 'The Pope is disturbed by the fact that today''s youth are not as spiritually inclined as they should be, and so he decides to set up a Vatican television station and entice them back into the religion of their ancestors. In order to particularly grab the wandering flock, a priest invites the comedians from "The Other Sunday," an actual comedy program on Italian television, to perform on this new channel.', 'The Pope is disturbed by the fact that today''s youth are not as spiritually inclined as they should be, and so he decides to set up a Vatican television station and entice them back into the religion of their ancestors. In order to particularly grab the wandering flock, a priest invites the comedians from "The Other Sunday," an actual comedy program on Italian television, to perform on this new channel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zO2gHN8334H0NG1M8Nxb5hsT7dx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42290'),
  ('1022478376765237773', 'In the Presence of a Clown', 1998, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Ingmar Bergman, Irene Wiklund, Antonia Pyk', 'Ingmar Bergman', 'Börje Ahlstedt, Marie Richardson, Erland Josephson, Pernilla August, Anita Björk, Agneta Ekmanner, Lena Endre, Gunnel Fred', null, 'In 1925, eccentric inventor and Franz Schubert devotee Carl Åkerblom is confined to a psychiatric ward in Uppsala after attempting to murder his fiancée. Obsessed with death, music, and the future of cinema, he joins forces with a fellow patient to create a “living talkie,” an experimental film performance with live-spoken dialogue. As the project unfolds, art, madness, and mortality collide in a tragicomic reflection on creativity and human frailty.', 'In 1925, eccentric inventor and Franz Schubert devotee Carl Åkerblom is confined to a psychiatric ward in Uppsala after attempting to murder his fiancée. Obsessed with death, music, and the future of cinema, he joins forces with a fellow patient to create a “living talkie,” an experimental film performance with live-spoken dialogue. As the project unfolds, art, madness, and mortality collide in a tragicomic reflection on creativity and human frailty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bMSjFvrr03h7DNyKs6rsYK9ihcs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47723'),
  ('317419309280099059', 'In the Quarry', 2019, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Rafael Antonaccio, Bernardo Antonaccio', 'Rafael Antonaccio, Bernardo Antonaccio', 'Paula Silva, Natalia Tarmezzano, Rafael Beltrán, Augusto Gordillo, Luis Pazos', null, 'Four youngsters meet on a bayou after years and sordid things start to emerge.', 'Four youngsters meet on a bayou after years and sordid things start to emerge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wsEi7VknB8T4Sj39Z294JnxWi9w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:584123'),
  ('590196333141699726', 'In the Realm of the Senses', 1976, 'Drama, Romance', 'Nagisa Ōshima, Masayuki Motomochi, Shizuo Satô', 'Nagisa Ōshima', 'Eiko Matsuda, Tatsuya Fuji, Aoi Nakajima, Yasuko Matsui, Meika Seri, Kanae Kobayashi, Taiji Tonoyama, Kyōji Kokonoe', 'NR', 'A passionate telling of the story of Sada Abe, a woman whose affair with her master led to an obsessive and ultimately destructive sexual relationship.', 'A passionate telling of the story of Sada Abe, a woman whose affair with her master led to an obsessive and ultimately destructive sexual relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AiFQbgjgSXWPfbi9iIYT39iXWMW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5879'),
  ('1152728754925194089', 'In the Realms of the Unreal', 2004, 'Documentary', 'Jessica Yu', 'Jessica Yu', 'Henry Darger, Larry Pine, Dakota Fanning, Frier McCollister, Wally Wingert, Mary O''Donnell, Kiyoko Lerner', null, 'In the Realms of the Unreal is a documentary about the reclusive Chicago-based artist Henry Darger. Henry Darger was so reclusive that when he died his neighbors were surprised to find a 15,145-page manuscript along with hundreds of paintings depicting The Story of the Vivian Girls, in What is Known as the Realms of the Unreal, of the Glodeco-Angelinnian War Storm, Cased by the Child Slave Rebellion.', 'In the Realms of the Unreal is a documentary about the reclusive Chicago-based artist Henry Darger. Henry Darger was so reclusive that when he died his neighbors were surprised to find a 15,145-page manuscript along with hundreds of paintings depicting The Story of the Vivian Girls, in What is Known as the Realms of the Unreal, of the Glodeco-Angelinnian War Storm, Cased by the Child Slave Rebellion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lKxzlejHu8ApBZohNHMfbmIGzZd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1853'),
  ('72154493961191558', 'In the Room', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Eric Khoo, Brian Gothong Tan', 'Andrew Hook, Jonathon Lim', 'Boon Pin Koh, Daniel Jenkins, Josie Ho, Jean Maguire, Gillian Tan, Rain Chan, Ian Tan, Nadia Ar', null, 'This sensitive and sensual film draws together several narratives spanning several decades, all of them transpiring in the same room of the same Singaporean hotel — and all of them involving sex.', 'This sensitive and sensual film draws together several narratives spanning several decades, all of them transpiring in the same room of the same Singaporean hotel — and all of them involving sex.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mrkrtLNROhzfpboxgDiH6BZiyOR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:355998'),
  ('259465884242468495', 'In the Same Breath', 2021, 'Documentary', 'Nanfu Wang', null, null, 'NR', 'This documentary recounts the experiences of people on the ground in the earliest days of the novel coronavirus and the way two countries dealt with its initial spread, from the first days of the outbreak in Wuhan to its rampage across the United States.', 'This documentary recounts the experiences of people on the ground in the earliest days of the novel coronavirus and the way two countries dealt with its initial spread, from the first days of the outbreak in Wuhan to its rampage across the United States.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/36iasJftRB0t0LA38d3HEiZSG4m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:776518'),
  ('259369723188963724', 'In the Shadow of Death', 1972, 'Drama, Adventure, Thriller', 'Gunārs Piesis, Leonīds Brušteins, Sergejs Berdičevskis', 'Jānis Kalniņš, Gunārs Piesis', 'Pēteris Šogolovs, Gunārs Cilinskis, Eduards Pavuls, Alfreds Videnieks, Girts Jakovlevs, Karlis Sebris, Juris Plavins, Lūcija Baumane', null, 'A group of men go under-ice fishing, but find themselves trapped on a piece of ice, that has broken off. As they are drifting through the sea, the tension between them rises.', 'A group of men go under-ice fishing, but find themselves trapped on a piece of ice, that has broken off. As they are drifting through the sea, the tension between them rises.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1hyPN7uwk7evJScFjVxjDw4dn7Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:191536'),
  ('92372197719220534', 'In the Shadow of Iris', 2016, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Pierre-Yves Bastard, Jalil Lespert', 'Andrew Bovell', 'Romain Duris, Charlotte Le Bon, Jalil Lespert, Camille Cottin, Adel Bencherif, Hélène Barbry, Sophie Verbeeck, Jalis Laleg', null, 'The sudden disappearance of a wealthy banker''s wife cracks open a dizzying world of secret fetishes, desperate acts and elaborate deceptions.', 'The sudden disappearance of a wealthy banker''s wife cracks open a dizzying world of secret fetishes, desperate acts and elaborate deceptions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tzVLPSoLfs0U3JHeGW5RKvsRAO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:395763'),
  ('648221755239521253', 'In the Shadow of Kilimanjaro', 1986, 'Horror', 'Raju Patel, Chuy Elizondo', 'T. Michael Harry, Jeffrey M. Sneller', 'John Rhys-Davies, Timothy Bottoms, Irene Miracle, Michele Carey, Leonard Trolley, Patty Foley, Calvin Jung, Don Blakely', null, 'There''s a big drought in Africa. Food and water are scarce. 90,000 wild baboons suddenly start attacking humans and eating them in order to survive. Some people find themselves being hunted by the starving monkeys and must do whatever they can to stay alive.', 'There''s a big drought in Africa. Food and water are scarce. 90,000 wild baboons suddenly start attacking humans and eating them in order to survive. Some people find themselves being hunted by the starving monkeys and must do whatever they can to stay alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oftZi13q2mOvL3dt6NFdj131W1u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29947'),
  ('908638345330554586', 'In the Shadow of the Cypress', 2023, 'Animation, Drama', 'Hossein Molayemi, Shirin Sohani', 'Hossein Molayemi, Shirin Sohani', 'Zahra Moosavi', null, 'Living in a house by the sea with his daughter, a former captain who has post-traumatic stress disorder leads a tough and secluded life.', 'Living in a house by the sea with his daughter, a former captain who has post-traumatic stress disorder leads a tough and secluded life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eaQeIDHGa8m4H2B4vrrthOTibeH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1156619'),
  ('810651621564591583', 'In the Shadow of the Moon', 2007, 'Documentary, History', 'David Sington', null, 'Buzz Aldrin, Michael Collins, Alan Bean, Eugene Cernan, Charlie Duke, Jim Lovell, Edgar D. Mitchell, Harrison Schmitt', 'PG', 'Archival material from the original NASA film footage – much of it seen for the first time – plus interviews with the surviving astronauts, including Jim Lovell, Dave Scott, John Young, Gene Cernan, Mike Collins, Buzz Aldrin, Alan Bean, Edgar Mitchell, Charlie Duke and Harrison Schmitt.', 'Archival material from the original NASA film footage – much of it seen for the first time – plus interviews with the surviving astronauts, including Jim Lovell, Dave Scott, John Young, Gene Cernan, Mike Collins, Buzz Aldrin, Alan Bean, Edgar Mitchell, Charlie Duke and Harrison Schmitt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xvthKnu7EjK0QvEBPY9ZnO3SiHe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14284'),
  ('875406645592242962', 'In the Shadow of the Moon', 2019, 'Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Jonnie Katz, Jim Mickle, David Lanzenberg', 'Gregory Weidman, Geoff Tock', 'Boyd Holbrook, Cleopatra Coleman, Michael C. Hall, Bokeem Woodbine, Sarah Dugdale, Rudi Dharmalingam, Rachel Keller, Quincy Kirkwood', 'R', 'In 1988, Philadelphia police officer Thomas "Locke" Lockhart, hungry to become a detective, begins tracking a serial killer whose crimes defy scientific explanation. When the killer mysteriously resurfaces nine years later, Locke''s obsession with finding the truth threatens to destroy his career, his family, and possibly his sanity.', 'In 1988, Philadelphia police officer Thomas "Locke" Lockhart, hungry to become a detective, begins tracking a serial killer whose crimes defy scientific explanation. When the killer mysteriously resurfaces nine years later, Locke''s obsession with finding the truth threatens to destroy his career, his family, and possibly his sanity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5DSVYlKwEzGBxTkS95L73c3oxLs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:530382'),
  ('360101690056571978', 'In the Shadow of the Raven', 1988, 'Drama, Action', 'Hrafn Gunnlaugsson, Esa Vuorinen', 'Hrafn Gunnlaugsson', 'Reine Brynolfsson, Tinna Gunnlaugsdóttir, Egill Ólafsson, Sune Mangs, Kristbjörg Kjeld, Helgi Skúlason, Johann Neumann, Sigurður Sigurjónsson', null, 'Trausti returns to Iceland just in time to be entangled in a family feud over a stranded whale-cadaver. His mother (the family head) is mortally wounded and Grim kills Erikur; the other clan leader. Isold, daughter of Erikur now takes his place. Isold and Trausti are attracted to each other, but Isold was promised to Hjoerleifur - the son of the Bishop (of Iceland) and his powerful wife. However, Isold has a plan...', 'Trausti returns to Iceland just in time to be entangled in a family feud over a stranded whale-cadaver. His mother (the family head) is mortally wounded and Grim kills Erikur; the other clan leader. Isold, daughter of Erikur now takes his place. Isold and Trausti are attracted to each other, but Isold was promised to Hjoerleifur - the son of the Bishop (of Iceland) and his powerful wife. However, Isold has a plan...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/69sXlzK9TQK9W3YTriCMj2rLXj2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16853'),
  ('978193895514763809', 'In the Shadow of the Vultures', 1998, 'Drama', 'Leonel Vieira, Acácio de Almeida', 'Leonel Vieira', 'Vítor Norte, Diogo Infante, José Eduardo, José Wallenstein, Fátima Belo, Raquel Maria, Ivo Serra, Orlando Costa', null, 'Two simple, unassuming, apolitical men have their lives changed forever when they find themselves hunted by agents of the ruling dictatorship.', 'Two simple, unassuming, apolitical men have their lives changed forever when they find themselves hunted by agents of the ruling dictatorship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tLQleQKpuop4Bk4cCLpnnR5cSMI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:216422'),
  ('61855939751544172', 'In the Shadow of Women', 2015, 'Drama, Romance', 'Philippe Garrel, Guillaume Bonnier, Renato Berta', 'Caroline Deruas, Jean-Claude Carrière, Philippe Garrel', 'Clotilde Courau, Stanislas Merhar, Léna Paugam, Vimala Pons, Mounir Margoum, Jean Pommier, Thérèse Quentin, Antoinette Moya', null, 'Pierre and Manon are poor. They make documentaries with nothing and they live by doing odd jobs. Pierre meets a young intern, Elisabeth, and she becomes his mistress. But Pierre will not leave Manon for Elisabeth; he wants to keep both.', 'Pierre and Manon are poor. They make documentaries with nothing and they live by doing odd jobs. Pierre meets a young intern, Elisabeth, and she becomes his mistress. But Pierre will not leave Manon for Elisabeth; he wants to keep both.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v6rwTr6OyjNR3Ny3pseM5ecGEIv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:315865'),
  ('240005441562630780', 'In the Shadows', 2010, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime', 'Thomas Arslan, Reinhold Vorschneider, Serpil Turhan', 'Thomas Arslan', 'Mišel Matičević, Rainer Bock, Uwe Bohm, Karoline Eichhorn, Timo Jacobs, Peter Kurth, Jörg Malchow, David Scheller', null, '"In the Shadows" slithers through underworld Berlin in grand style. En route to a twisty finale, German writer-director Thomas Arslan keeps his audience glued to the increasingly desperate actions of Trojan, a thirtysomething career criminal whose latest job slowly catches up with him.', '"In the Shadows" slithers through underworld Berlin in grand style. En route to a twisty finale, German writer-director Thomas Arslan keeps his audience glued to the increasingly desperate actions of Trojan, a thirtysomething career criminal whose latest job slowly catches up with him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oDPGyy4mcJYf8sxbt1fbo9EJTAg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64611'),
