  ('545563580957212770', 'In the Spider''s Web', 2007, 'Action, Horror, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Terry Winsor, Choochat Nantitanyatada', 'Gary Dauberman', 'Lance Henriksen, Emma Catherwood, Cian Barry, Sohrab Ardeshir, Mike Rogers, Michael Smiley, Jane Perry, Lisa Livingstone', null, 'When a team of backpackers sets out to explore the Indian jungles, one of them is bitten by a poisonous spider and killed.', 'When a team of backpackers sets out to explore the Indian jungles, one of them is bitten by a poisonous spider and killed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2pLLgbkZQCThY4iMZpls2kO2O4n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42901'),
