  ('927242545529419761', 'In the Sub for Love', 2024, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Tatiana Vialle, Lucas Bernard, Franck Morand', 'Lucas Bernard', 'Pio Marmaï, Eye Haïdara, José Garcia, Victor Pontecorvo, Frédéric Maranber, Paul Zinga, Calixte Broisin-Doutaz, Nicolas Lancelin', null, 'She is a tactical submarine officer. He is a steward. Before diving for 90 days she chooses to make it her "four-hour". But here he is clinging. Who follows her. Who sticks it. Where do we go if the flight crew of a 747 prides itself on romance? As if we had time to be in love on board a military ship. Still, the Pacific Ocean is not big enough. Neither does the Arctic Ocean. The world is so small when you love each other so much.', 'She is a tactical submarine officer. He is a steward. Before diving for 90 days she chooses to make it her "four-hour". But here he is clinging. Who follows her. Who sticks it. Where do we go if the flight crew of a 747 prides itself on romance? As if we had time to be in love on board a military ship. Still, the Pacific Ocean is not big enough. Neither does the Arctic Ocean. The world is so small when you love each other so much.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8AgHsphAafmNANTKdBQfKmgGbhi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1096638'),
