  ('948581835413326977', 'In the Wake', 2021, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Atsuhiro Nabeshima, Takahisa Zeze, Tsuyoshi Kage', 'Tamio Hayashi, Takahisa Zeze', 'Takeru Satoh, Hiroshi Abe, Kaya Kiyohara, Mitsuko Baisho, Hidetaka Yoshioka, Kento Hayashi, Eita Nagayama, Naoto Ogata', null, 'Baffling serial killings unfold in which the victims are tied up and left to starve. Tone was just released from prison after finishing his sentence for another crime, and he surfaces as a suspect but detective Tomashiro can''t nail down conclusive proof.', 'Baffling serial killings unfold in which the victims are tied up and left to starve. Tone was just released from prison after finishing his sentence for another crime, and he surfaces as a suspect but detective Tomashiro can''t nail down conclusive proof.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9BwuiPzeHcYJSteYm8pUCMUyOsY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:794719'),
