  ('148402740117375968', 'In the Year 2889', 1969, 'Horror, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Larry Buchanan, Robert C. Jessup', 'Harold Hoffman', 'Paul Petersen, Quinn O''Hara, Charla Doherty, Neil Fletcher, Hugh Feagin, Bill Thurman, Max W. Anderson, Byron Lord', null, 'The last seven survivors of a nuclear war barricade themselves against the outside world. Beyond a dense mist, other survivors, radiated and mutant, grow hungry.', 'The last seven survivors of a nuclear war barricade themselves against the outside world. Beyond a dense mist, other survivors, radiated and mutant, grow hungry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mWmdKGlZNaaG7GTS1s9c7NUKxxw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74837'),
  ('309412654120710355', 'In the Year of the Pig', 1969, 'Documentary, War', 'Emile de Antonio', null, 'David Halberstam, Daniel Berrigan, Harry S. Ashmore', null, 'Both sober and sobering, producer-director Emile de Antonio’s In the Year of the Pig is a powerful and, no doubt for many, controversial documentary about the Vietnam War.', 'Both sober and sobering, producer-director Emile de Antonio’s In the Year of the Pig is a powerful and, no doubt for many, controversial documentary about the Vietnam War.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iXAeDRmDguZAl2QxaHv1YQ7G1u6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63951'),
  ('425346875968813174', 'In Their Skin', 2012, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Jeremy Power Regimbal, Norm Li', 'Joshua Close', 'Selma Blair, Joshua Close, James D''Arcy, Rachel Miner, Quinn Lord, Alex Ferris, Matt Bellefleur, Terence Kelly', 'NR', 'A couple and their young son retreat to their woodland vacation home, only to face sinister neighbors who intend to kill them and steal their identities.', 'A couple and their young son retreat to their woodland vacation home, only to face sinister neighbors who intend to kill them and steal their identities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e9Hi3zFRr5RibddE1L7TLJQgbGK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117978'),
  ('678711165851950381', 'In Their Sleep', 2010, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Éric du Potet, Caroline du Potet, Pierre Cottereau', 'Caroline du Potet, Éric du Potet', 'Anne Parillaud, Arthur Dupont, Thierry Frémont, Jean-Hugues Anglade, Léo Moser', null, 'Sarah''s life is in pieces after the brutal death of her 18 year-old son. One night, her car accidentally hits Arthur, a young man the same age as her boy who is running from a burglar. Sarah sympathizes with him and takes him in, only to be tracked down by the burglar whose murderous rage towards Arthur forces her to take action.', 'Sarah''s life is in pieces after the brutal death of her 18 year-old son. One night, her car accidentally hits Arthur, a young man the same age as her boy who is running from a burglar. Sarah sympathizes with him and takes him in, only to be tracked down by the burglar whose murderous rage towards Arthur forces her to take action.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1T0DR42ljPCt4ryXxjWiuH0VZw3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53354'),
  ('505917314417008176', 'In Therapy', 2009, 'Romance, Drama, Comedy', 'José Alvarenga Jr., Dayse Amaral Dias, Luiz Henrique Campos', 'Marcelo Saback', 'Lília Cabral, José Mayer, Reynaldo Gianecchini, Cauã Reymond, Alexandra Richter, Eduardo Lago, Paulo Gustavo, Elias Gleizer', 'PG-13', 'In Rio de Janeiro, the forty and something years old Mercedes (Lília Cabral) goes to the psychoanalyst and tells the story of her life since she was a girl and lost her mother. Along the three years of analysis, her life changes and she divorces from her husband Gustavo (José Mayer) and has love affairs with the younger Theo (Reynaldo Gianecchini)', 'In Rio de Janeiro, the forty and something years old Mercedes (Lília Cabral) goes to the psychoanalyst and tells the story of her life since she was a girl and lost her mother. Along the three years of analysis, her life changes and she divorces from her husband Gustavo (José Mayer) and has love affairs with the younger Theo (Reynaldo Gianecchini)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hJmnyuysGHXGLBnGWSF7Yq0ccOB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29314'),
  ('994681236089322403', 'In This Our Life', 1942, 'Drama, Romance', 'John Huston, Ernest Haller, Jack Sullivan', 'Howard Koch', 'Bette Davis, Olivia de Havilland, George Brent, Dennis Morgan, Charles Coburn, Frank Craven, Billie Burke, Hattie McDaniel', 'NR', 'An unhappy, self-centered woman runs off with her sister''s husband, wreaking havoc and ruining the lives of those around her.', 'An unhappy, self-centered woman runs off with her sister''s husband, wreaking havoc and ruining the lives of those around her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bnQulLMPOlBfUqAxKPA3FvqxTrD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43525'),
  ('33336314326597503', 'In This Tricky Life', 2001, 'Drama', 'Beatriz Flores Silva, Francisco Gózon, Sergio de León', 'János Kovácsi, Beatriz Flores Silva', 'Mariana Santángelo, Silvestre, Josep Linuesa, Andrea Fantoni, Rodrigo Speranza, Agustín Abreu, Carlos Calero, Fermí Herrero', null, 'Montevideo, Uruguay. In this comedic drama, Elisa, 27, dreams of opening her own hairdressing salon in one of the rich districts of the Uruguayan capital. A bit of a rebel, one day Elisa moves out of her mother''s house with her two children and breaks up with Garcia, her boss and lover who has infuriated her by not wanting to get married. So, in the space of twenty-four hours, Elisa finds herself without a roof over her head, without a man, without a job and without money. Her best friend Loulou finds her a job - in the brothel run by Dona Jacqueline. And without really being aware of it, Elisa slides into prostitution, which leads her to Barcelona. She falls in love, she is exploited, she gets involved in transvestite gang wars, and meanwhile just dreams of earning enough money for her little beauty salon back home.', 'Montevideo, Uruguay. In this comedic drama, Elisa, 27, dreams of opening her own hairdressing salon in one of the rich districts of the Uruguayan capital. A bit of a rebel, one day Elisa moves out of her mother''s house with her two children and breaks up with Garcia, her boss and lover who has infuriated her by not wanting to get married. So, in the space of twenty-four hours, Elisa finds herself without a roof over her head, without a man, without a job and without money. Her best friend Loulou finds her a job - in the brothel run by Dona Jacqueline. And without really being aware of it, Elisa slides into prostitution, which leads her to Barcelona. She falls in love, she is exploited, she gets involved in transvestite gang wars, and meanwhile just dreams of earning enough money for her little beauty salon back home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mbLGA9OKgzsMkvXYGlJX8jwiUtm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61072'),
  ('990015529591557719', 'In This Very Moment', 2003, 'Drama', 'Ali Olcay Gözkaya, Christoph Hochhäusler', 'Benjamin Heisenberg, Christoph Hochhäusler', 'Sophie Charlotte Conrad, Leo Bruckmann, Judith Engel, Horst-Günter Marx, Mirosław Baka, Gerd Beyer, Harald Richter, Monika Pietsch', null, 'This is the story of Sylvia, who loses her stepchildren on a shopping trip in Poland. For fear of losing her husband''s love too, she is unable to tell him what has happened and returns home, pretending everything is fine. When he realizes that his children are missing, the father begins a desperate search. He is ready to give up anything in order to find them. Sylvia supports him in any way; she tries to comfort him and takes care of his hope''s vulnerable flame. For the first time he really needs her. While the children are trying their best to get home, the police fail in detecting their whereabouts. When a very vague trace leads to Poland, the parents hit the road to find the children on their own.', 'This is the story of Sylvia, who loses her stepchildren on a shopping trip in Poland. For fear of losing her husband''s love too, she is unable to tell him what has happened and returns home, pretending everything is fine. When he realizes that his children are missing, the father begins a desperate search. He is ready to give up anything in order to find them. Sylvia supports him in any way; she tries to comfort him and takes care of his hope''s vulnerable flame. For the first time he really needs her. While the children are trying their best to get home, the police fail in detecting their whereabouts. When a very vague trace leads to Poland, the parents hit the road to find the children on their own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mcCCnTA1dmjrrYJh16qZrmt4ziS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12765'),
  ('930351084073518348', 'In This World', 2003, 'Drama', 'Michael Winterbottom, Marcel Zyskind', 'Tony Grisoni', 'Jamal Udin Torabi, Enayatullah, Imran Paracha, Hiddayatullah, Jamau, Wakeel Khan, Lal Zarin, Ahsan Raza', null, 'Torn straight from the headlines, Michael Winterbottom''s compelling and prescient ''In This World'' follows young Afghan Jamal and his older cousin Enayat as they embark on a hazardous overland trip from their refugee camp at Peshawar, north-west Pakistan. Entering Turkey on foot through a snowy, Kurdish-controlled pass, the pair again take their lives into their hands and face suffocation when they are locked in a freight container on a ship bound for Italy. From there they plan to travel on to Paris, the Sangatte refuge centre and ultimately asylum in London.', 'Torn straight from the headlines, Michael Winterbottom''s compelling and prescient ''In This World'' follows young Afghan Jamal and his older cousin Enayat as they embark on a hazardous overland trip from their refugee camp at Peshawar, north-west Pakistan. Entering Turkey on foot through a snowy, Kurdish-controlled pass, the pair again take their lives into their hands and face suffocation when they are locked in a freight container on a ship bound for Italy. From there they plan to travel on to Paris, the Sangatte refuge centre and ultimately asylum in London.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/denzE2tZc3TZ95vQNK3rKo0iDHn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36791'),
  ('984376117588916640', 'In This World of Thieves', 2004, 'Comedy', 'Carlo Vanzina, Claudio Zamarion, Federica Ciciarelli', 'Carlo Vanzina, Claudio Pallottini, Piero De Bernardi', 'Carlo Buccirosso, Valeria Marini, Ricky Tognazzi, Biagio Izzo, Leo Gullotta, Enzo Iacchetti, Max Pisu, Mariella Valentini', null, 'A group of middle-aged time-share investors get ripped off and their desire for revenge is well-timed for them to be recruited by a bank clerk who feels the same about his employers.', 'A group of middle-aged time-share investors get ripped off and their desire for revenge is well-timed for them to be recruited by a bank clerk who feels the same about his employers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ilzoePzvkYOXCBMWTuPmPwKuSl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102341'),
  ('625590393780156786', 'In Those Days', 1947, 'Drama', 'Helmut Käutner, Igor Oberberg', 'Helmut Käutner, Ernst Schnabel', 'Erich Schellow, Gert Schaefer, Winnie Markus, Werner Hinz, Karl John, Carl Raddatz, Alice Treff, Franz Schafheitlin', null, 'A car tells its story and the story of its seven owners during the years of the Third Reich.', 'A car tells its story and the story of its seven owners during the years of the Third Reich.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zCK9zSx4eho90Ry0kWsC88fhhot.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:157515'),
  ('412243081052682622', 'In Time', 2011, 'Action, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Andrew Niccol, Roger Deakins, Lars P. Winther', 'Andrew Niccol', 'Amanda Seyfried, Justin Timberlake, Cillian Murphy, Vincent Kartheiser, Olivia Wilde, Matt Bomer, Johnny Galecki, Collins Pennie', 'PG-13', 'In the not-too-distant future, the aging gene has been switched off. To avoid overpopulation, time has become the currency and the way people pay for luxuries and necessities. The rich can live forever, while the rest struggle to negotiate for their immortality. A poor young man who suddenly comes into a fortune of time finds himself on the run from a corrupt police force known as the "time keepers".', 'In the not-too-distant future, the aging gene has been switched off. To avoid overpopulation, time has become the currency and the way people pay for luxuries and necessities. The rich can live forever, while the rest struggle to negotiate for their immortality. A poor young man who suddenly comes into a fortune of time finds himself on the run from a corrupt police force known as the "time keepers".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Mwj2sIONQckOZP3YwsUXF7U5I4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49530'),
  ('1035653764400655012', 'In Times of Fading Light', 2017, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Matti Geschonneck', 'Wolfgang Kohlhaase', 'Bruno Ganz, Alexander Fehling, Sylvester Groth, Stephan Grossmann, Angela Winkler, Evgenia Dodina, Pit Bukowski, Gabriela Maria Schmeide', null, 'Just before the fall of the Berlin Wall, the birthday celebrations of an East German family turn into a tragicomical moment of political and personal breakdown.', 'Just before the fall of the Berlin Wall, the birthday celebrations of an East German family turn into a tragicomical moment of political and personal breakdown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Cp4G6Je6IF1LHaTglvsplMslMw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:432892'),
  ('1064413522597072495', 'In Too Deep', 1999, 'Drama, Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Michael Rymer, Ellery Ryan, Jonnie Katz', 'Michael Henry Brown, Paul Aaron', 'Omar Epps, LL Cool J, Nia Long, Stanley Tucci, Hill Harper, Jake Weber, Pam Grier, Richard Brooks', 'R', 'Drug lord Dwayne Gittens rules Cincinnati with an iron fist. No wonder he''s known as "God" on the streets. Determined to break Gittens'' stranglehold on the city is undercover cop Jeffrey Cole. But as Cole takes on an assumed identity to penetrate Gittens'' criminal empire, he makes a disturbing discovery -- he kind of likes being a gangster.', 'Drug lord Dwayne Gittens rules Cincinnati with an iron fist. No wonder he''s known as "God" on the streets. Determined to break Gittens'' stranglehold on the city is undercover cop Jeffrey Cole. But as Cole takes on an assumed identity to penetrate Gittens'' criminal empire, he makes a disturbing discovery -- he kind of likes being a gangster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mYteXffai9mmShyGCa4nPhfGCLQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22314'),
  ('821278207940503368', 'In Top Form? No, Thank You!', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Alessandro Tamburini, Roberto Cimatti', 'Ciro Zecca, Alessandro Tamburini', 'Alessandro Tamburini, Anna Ferraioli Ravel, Claudio Bigagli, Giampaolo Fabrizio, Niccolò Senni, Francesca Valtorta, Enrico Borello', null, 'Alessandro and Anna meet by chance. Same night, different tables, both on a date where the other person does not show up. Initially Alessandro cannot stand Anna, but things change when he gets to know her.', 'Alessandro and Anna meet by chance. Same night, different tables, both on a date where the other person does not show up. Initially Alessandro cannot stand Anna, but things change when he gets to know her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v6N1ijtKDHH3xHc2JKCSq0ZPzD4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:522614'),
  ('1127970711226193322', 'In Tranzit', 2008, 'Drama, Romance, War', 'Tom Roberts, Sergey Astakhov', 'Simon van der Borgh', 'Vera Farmiga, Thomas Kretschmann, John Malkovich, Daniel Brühl, Natalie Press, Patrick Kennedy, John Lynch, Phillip Azarov', 'R', 'Nazi POWs suspected of heinous acts are locked up in a Soviet women''s prison run by vengeful female guards. To weed out the guilty, the innocent must pay. Can supposed enemies turn into great loves? Based on a true post-World War II story, this drama stars Thomas Kretschmann, John Malkovich and Vera Farmiga in a bitter game of cat and mouse and a battle between hate and humanity, mercy and revenge.', 'Nazi POWs suspected of heinous acts are locked up in a Soviet women''s prison run by vengeful female guards. To weed out the guilty, the innocent must pay. Can supposed enemies turn into great loves? Based on a true post-World War II story, this drama stars Thomas Kretschmann, John Malkovich and Vera Farmiga in a bitter game of cat and mouse and a battle between hate and humanity, mercy and revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dgdO3WvlTD9PfTQzoXIH9xYqBbD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24786'),
  ('402407825933841777', 'In Vanda''s Room', 2001, 'Drama', 'Pedro Costa, Pedro Costa', 'Pedro Costa', 'Vanda Duarte, Lena Duarte, Zita Duarte, Manuel Gomes Miranda, Diogo Pires Miranda, Evangelina Nelas, Miquelina Barros, Paulo Jorge Gonçalves', null, 'An unflinching, fragmentary look at a handful of self-destructive, marginalized people, but taking as main focus the heroin-addicted Vanda Duarte.', 'An unflinching, fragmentary look at a handful of self-destructive, marginalized people, but taking as main focus the heroin-addicted Vanda Duarte.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wi70RuDNiYqIyruZtXPeBOHTtj2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87063'),
  ('906441202582883809', 'In viaggio con Adele', 2018, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Alessandro Capitani, Massimiliano Kuveiller', 'Nicola Guaglianone', 'Sara Serraiocco, Alessandro Haber, Isabella Ferrari, Patrice Leconte, Anna Ferruzzo', null, 'Adele, a twenty-five year old girl who suffers from mental disorder, has never met her father and has always lived under the protective wing of her mother Margherita. Everything changes when her very existence is overturned by the latter’s sudden and unexpected death.', 'Adele, a twenty-five year old girl who suffers from mental disorder, has never met her father and has always lived under the protective wing of her mother Margherita. Everything changes when her very existence is overturned by the latter’s sudden and unexpected death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fswfNlFVpkwgGwR2kDOXZaPmGIL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:551702'),
  ('1133253566109376640', 'In Viaggio: The Travels of Pope Francis', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Gianfranco Rosi', null, 'Pope Francis', null, 'A chronicle of the first nine years of Pope Francis'' pontificate, including trips to 53 countries, focusing on his most important issues - poverty, migration, environment, solidarity, and war - while also giving rare access to the public life of the pontifical.', 'A chronicle of the first nine years of Pope Francis'' pontificate, including trips to 53 countries, focusing on his most important issues - poverty, migration, environment, solidarity, and war - while also giving rare access to the public life of the pontifical.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/72qxzNTJv5v1ifwwqI2soWCsKPf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1004682'),
  ('1098457763075934570', 'In Vitro', 2025, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Will Howarth, Tom McKeith, Shelley Farthing-Dawe', 'Tom McKeith, Will Howarth, Talia Zucker', 'Talia Zucker, Ashley Zukerman, Daniel Ciurte, Will Howarth, Stephanie Arezzi, Hayley McCarthy, Luke Anthony, Kate Ure', 'R', 'On an isolated cattle farm, a couple experimenting with biotechnology have their lives upended when they discover a disturbing presence on their property.', 'On an isolated cattle farm, a couple experimenting with biotechnology have their lives upended when they discover a disturbing presence on their property.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oADha0l3dCm68rQfFL2AvZPs8pl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1103731'),
  ('696035045801167950', 'In Water', 2023, 'Drama', 'Hong Sang-soo, Hong Sang-soo', 'Hong Sang-soo', 'Shin Seok-ho, Ha Seong-guk, Kim Seung-yun, Kim Min-hee, Kim So-ryeong', 'NR', 'A director, a cinematographer, and an actress spend the days leading up to a movie shoot together on-location, waiting for the director to come up with an idea for what the film will be about.', 'A director, a cinematographer, and an actress spend the days leading up to a movie shoot together on-location, waiting for the director to come up with an idea for what the film will be about.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tPbhATtyYbvCOWD3L5u1I4vmZOG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1077647'),
  ('386231391205439939', 'In Which We Serve', 1942, 'Drama, War', 'Noël Coward, David Lean, Ronald Neame', 'Noël Coward', 'Noël Coward, John Mills, Bernard Miles, Celia Johnson, Kay Walsh, Joyce Carey, Derek Elphinstone, Michael Wilding', 'NR', 'The story of the HMS Torrin, from its construction to its sinking in the Mediterranean during action in World War II. The ship’s first and only commanding officer is Captain E.V. Kinross, who trains his men not only to be loyal to him and the country, but—most importantly—to themselves.', 'The story of the HMS Torrin, from its construction to its sinking in the Mediterranean during action in World War II. The ship’s first and only commanding officer is Captain E.V. Kinross, who trains his men not only to be loyal to him and the country, but—most importantly—to themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i4SkM1rzBROLt9d33u0KGr2SVVm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28093'),
  ('928182464881602287', 'In Your Absence', 2008, 'Drama', 'Iván Noel', 'Iván Noel', 'Gonzalo Sánchez Salas, Francisco Alfonsin, Pedro Salido Saborido, Anabel Azuar, Ana Tutor, Antonio J. Atienza Sánchez, Acensio Salas Suárez, Juanjo Galiardo', null, '13-year-old Pablo is a quiet, lonely boy with a troubled past. His only friend is Julia, a shameless 15-year-old girl who is more than willing to help Pablo with his transition from childhood to adolescence, and give him some advice on sex, love, and life in general. On a quiet country road just outside of the village, Pablo meets Paco, an oddly calm, well-dressed stranger whose car just broke down. Nevertheless, he seems more interested in the boy than fixing his problem.', '13-year-old Pablo is a quiet, lonely boy with a troubled past. His only friend is Julia, a shameless 15-year-old girl who is more than willing to help Pablo with his transition from childhood to adolescence, and give him some advice on sex, love, and life in general. On a quiet country road just outside of the village, Pablo meets Paco, an oddly calm, well-dressed stranger whose car just broke down. Nevertheless, he seems more interested in the boy than fixing his problem.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cRCb1NAJZNks3xU8RNuR9mMMcJb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49232'),
  ('27838484943155093', 'In Your Dreams', 2005, 'Comedy', 'Denis Thybaud, Myriam Vinocour', 'Oxmo Puccino', 'Disiz, Vincent Elbaz, Sara Martins, Édouard Montoute, Béatrice Dalle, Léa Drucker, Simon Abkarian, Jean-Pierre Cassel', null, 'Ninth is a promising young rapper whose reputation does not exceed even the few streets of his neighborhood. With his band and supported by Keuj, hairdresser apprentice producer, he tries to attend concerts and trying to break into the music, to the chagrin of his mother, who would see him in a more conventional career at the post office...', 'Ninth is a promising young rapper whose reputation does not exceed even the few streets of his neighborhood. With his band and supported by Keuj, hairdresser apprentice producer, he tries to attend concerts and trying to break into the music, to the chagrin of his mother, who would see him in a more conventional career at the post office...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n4s5bm1mvKI9ZjjhyUMx2CYkXsK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61658'),
  ('784376234930301800', 'In Your Dreams', 2023, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Cemal Alpan, Reyhan Yildirim, Muratcan Gökçe', 'Umut Açıkalın, Ferhat Ergün, Serhat Solmaz', 'Murat Boz, Burcu Özberk, Ekin Mert Daymaz, Devrim Yakut, Şerif Erol, Feridun Düzağaç, Kubilay Karslıoğlu, Hivda Zizan Alp', null, 'You know the feeling. It feels like time slows down as your eyes meet a stranger’s. Then you walk pass each other, neither of you looking back. That’s what happened with Pelin and Engin. Lo and behold, they open their eyes in the same bed. And you may want to brace yourself for this one, as a two-year married couple! It must be a dream. No, a nightmare. But now, to wake up they must fall in love.', 'You know the feeling. It feels like time slows down as your eyes meet a stranger’s. Then you walk pass each other, neither of you looking back. That’s what happened with Pelin and Engin. Lo and behold, they open their eyes in the same bed. And you may want to brace yourself for this one, as a two-year married couple! It must be a dream. No, a nightmare. But now, to wake up they must fall in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rZe2lT3G9C7JrwB7Avu22mVhqFw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1073125'),
  ('730892118908120194', 'In Your Dreams', 2025, 'Animation, Family, Comedy, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Alex Woo, Erik Benson', 'Erik Benson, Alex Woo', 'Jolie Hoang-Rappaport, Elias Janssen, Simu Liu, Craig Robinson, Cristin Milioti, Gia Carides, Omid Djalili, SungWon Cho', 'PG', 'Stevie and her little brother Elliot journey into the wildly absurd landscape of their own dreams to ask the Sandman to grant them the perfect family.', 'Stevie and her little brother Elliot journey into the wildly absurd landscape of their own dreams to ask the Sandman to grant them the perfect family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ug0TqgmByPCEYzR9lQWQmyAa7sw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1117857'),
  ('361350485908631080', 'In Your Eyes', 2014, 'Drama, Romance, Science Fiction', 'Brin Hill, Elisha Christian', 'Joss Whedon', 'Zoe Kazan, Michael Stahl-David, Nikki Reed, Jennifer Grey, Mark Feuerstein, Steve Howey, David Gallagher, Steve Harris', 'NR', 'Two seemingly unconnected souls from different corners of the United States make a telepathic bond that allows them to see, hear and feel the other''s experiences, creating a bond that apparently can''t be broken.', 'Two seemingly unconnected souls from different corners of the United States make a telepathic bond that allows them to see, hear and feel the other''s experiences, creating a bond that apparently can''t be broken.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4XAaMo2nBZR3eH8HU6AbPkBKEXI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:226448'),
  ('891482402041930821', 'In Your Hands', 2011, 'Drama', 'Lola Doillon, Mathieu Vadepied, Ophélie Gelber', 'Lola Doillon', 'Kristin Scott Thomas, Pio Marmaï, Marie-Sohna Condé, Marie-Christine Orry, Vinciane Millereau, Sophie Fougère, Jean-Louis Tribes, Laurent Cyr', null, 'Stockholm Syndrome. Feelings arise between a young kidnapper and his victim, a woman surgeon. He seeks revenge for a medical accident that prevents him from living peacefully and decides to kidnapp the woman he holds responsible. When the latter manage to escape, she can''t stop to meet her kidnapper again, for reasons of love and of vengeance.', 'Stockholm Syndrome. Feelings arise between a young kidnapper and his victim, a woman surgeon. He seeks revenge for a medical accident that prevents him from living peacefully and decides to kidnapp the woman he holds responsible. When the latter manage to escape, she can''t stop to meet her kidnapper again, for reasons of love and of vengeance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tNZ4dzi8iPzYeE1Oogn3rhsomP1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57387'),
  ('365322579920406815', 'In Your Image', 2004, 'Drama, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Aruna Villiers, Gérard Sterin', 'Franck Philippon, Aruna Villiers, Guillaume Laurant', 'Nastassja Kinski, Christopher Lambert, Audrey DeWilder, Francine Bergé, Rufus, Andrzej Seweryn, Lyes Salem, Christian Hecq', null, 'Ridden by guilt for not being able to have a child, wife decides to conceive by cloning. The daughter she gives birth to is therefor almost identical to her. The child starts to grow rapidly and slowly replaces mom in the household.', 'Ridden by guilt for not being able to have a child, wife decides to conceive by cloning. The daughter she gives birth to is therefor almost identical to her. The child starts to grow rapidly and slowly replaces mom in the household.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/flg7FAdNic816Hxx4stIf3v07XM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47109'),
