  ('305340259617042482', 'In Youth We Trust', 2024, 'Action, Drama, Crime', 'Puttipong Nakthong, Kritsadapol Samanukul, Nitoch Kangsanan', 'Puttipong Nakthong, Ruttanaphon Pakphrieo', 'Nat Kitcharit, Arak Amornsupasiri, Itkron Pungkiatrussamee, Benjamin Joseph Varney, Todsapol Maisuk, Bhumibhat Thavornsiri, Sahatchai Chumrum, Arachaporn Pokinpakorn', null, 'Puek, a boy from the slums, had no choice but to endure his circumstances, feeling that he could never have the same worth as others. He remained silent, accepting the bullying of others just to survive in society.', 'Puek, a boy from the slums, had no choice but to endure his circumstances, feeling that he could never have the same worth as others. He remained silent, accepting the bullying of others just to survive in society.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vQsWKmt2np2BRtW1niifmJVQCJX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1283120'),
  ('426364282786568677', 'In Youth, Beside the Lonely Sea', 1925, 'Drama', 'Winston Miller', null, 'Winston Miller', null, 'An early widescreen film that was told by cutting the two sides of the image off and replacing them with a different image.', 'An early widescreen film that was told by cutting the two sides of the image off and replacing them with a different image.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fgHsXAYbNO3OEt5QMEQ8xRRT6vU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:184395'),
  ('193363616612647356', 'In-Lawfully Yours', 2016, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Caryn Nowland, Rebecca Bingham, Dwenda Mosley', 'Sean Gaffney, Robert Kirbyson', 'Chelsey Crisp, Joe Williamson, Marilu Henner, Philip Boyd, Michael Brown, Corbin Bernsen, Erin Muroski, Shayna Rosenfarb', null, 'Following both the death of her father-in-law and a divorce, Jesse, a New Yorker, returns to a small town to live with her now widowed mother-in-law. Jesse struggles to fit in with the local townsfolk who don’t welcome her with open arms to say the least. Jesse becomes acquainted with the local pastor, her widowed brother-in-law, falling in love with him, much to the dismay of the community. Things get even more complicated when her ex-husband comes calling, suspiciously trying to win her back. Between her love life and entangled in-laws, Jesse is tested as she seeks the answer to where she truly belongs.', 'Following both the death of her father-in-law and a divorce, Jesse, a New Yorker, returns to a small town to live with her now widowed mother-in-law. Jesse struggles to fit in with the local townsfolk who don’t welcome her with open arms to say the least. Jesse becomes acquainted with the local pastor, her widowed brother-in-law, falling in love with him, much to the dismay of the community. Things get even more complicated when her ex-husband comes calling, suspiciously trying to win her back. Between her love life and entangled in-laws, Jesse is tested as she seeks the answer to where she truly belongs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lPw7jUWNHsvunlVlEAStHnfdGZg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:412518'),
  ('105460932462176143', 'Inadequate People', 2010, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Roman Karimov, Ilya Ovsenev, Ivan Geranchev', 'Roman Karimov', 'Ilya Lyubimov, Ingrid Olerinskaya, Evgeny Tsyganov, Yuliya Takshina, Artem Dushkin, Polina Iosilevitch, Marina Zaytseva, Anastasiya Fedorkova', null, 'A 30-year-old man, Vitaly, moves to Moscow in search of inner peace after struggling with personal and psychological issues. As he settles into a seemingly ordinary life, he forms an unexpected bond with his younger neighbor, forcing him to confront his past and emotional instability.', 'A 30-year-old man, Vitaly, moves to Moscow in search of inner peace after struggling with personal and psychological issues. As he settles into a seemingly ordinary life, he forms an unexpected bond with his younger neighbor, forcing him to confront his past and emotional instability.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2TWwwSF5SUxUMRwkyrhpnQgBFao.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57209'),
  ('49485872174477778', 'Inadequate People 2', 2020, 'Drama', 'Evgeny Goryainov, Tatyana Rudnitskaya, Roman Karimov', 'Roman Karimov, Yana Lebedeva', 'Ilya Lyubimov, Ingrid Olerinskaya, Evgeny Tsyganov, Aleksandra Bulychyova, Nikita Sanaev, Mariya Goryacheva, Tatyana Zhevnova, Sergei Annenkov', null, 'Kristina lives with Vitaly in a quiet family life, but her sarcastic world view does not coincide with Vitaly’s ideals. While she is engaged in household chores, he spends more and more time at work, and Kristina begins to suspect that this is somehow connected with the appearance of his young assistant Sonya in the office.', 'Kristina lives with Vitaly in a quiet family life, but her sarcastic world view does not coincide with Vitaly’s ideals. While she is engaged in household chores, he spends more and more time at work, and Kristina begins to suspect that this is somehow connected with the appearance of his young assistant Sonya in the office.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vqa8W6z8kfcHke82j3ZZDFD3FkG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:575356'),
