  ('226981678816716694', 'Incendies', 2010, 'Drama, War, Mystery', 'Denis Villeneuve, André Turpin, Éric Parenteau', 'Valérie Beaugrand-Champagne, Denis Villeneuve', 'Lubna Azabal, Mélissa Désormeaux-Poulin, Maxim Gaudette, Rémy Girard, Allen Altman, Abdelghafour Elaaziz, Dominique Briand, Frédéric Paquet', 'R', 'A mother''s last wishes send twins Jeanne and Simon on a journey to Middle East in search of their tangled roots. Adapted from Wajdi Mouawad''s acclaimed play, Incendies tells the powerful and moving tale of two young adults'' voyage to the core of deep-rooted hatred, never-ending wars and enduring love.', 'A mother''s last wishes send twins Jeanne and Simon on a journey to Middle East in search of their tangled roots. Adapted from Wajdi Mouawad''s acclaimed play, Incendies tells the powerful and moving tale of two young adults'' voyage to the core of deep-rooted hatred, never-ending wars and enduring love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yH6DAQVgbyj72S66gN4WWVoTjuf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46738'),
  ('319140343042407086', 'Inception', 2010, 'Action, Science Fiction, Adventure', 'Wally Pfister, Kevin Frilet, Matt Sims', 'Christopher Nolan', 'Leonardo DiCaprio, Joseph Gordon-Levitt, Ken Watanabe, Tom Hardy, Elliot Page, Dileep Rao, Cillian Murphy, Tom Berenger', 'PG-13', 'Cobb, a skilled thief who commits corporate espionage by infiltrating the subconscious of his targets is offered a chance to regain his old life as payment for a task considered to be impossible: "inception", the implantation of another person''s idea into a target''s subconscious.', 'Cobb, a skilled thief who commits corporate espionage by infiltrating the subconscious of his targets is offered a chance to regain his old life as payment for a task considered to be impossible: "inception", the implantation of another person''s idea into a target''s subconscious.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xlaY2zyzMfkhk0HSC5VUwzoZPU1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27205'),
