  ('453085444229115752', 'Inch''Allah', 2012, 'Drama', 'Anaïs Barbeau-Lavalette, Philippe Lavalette', 'Anaïs Barbeau-Lavalette', 'Evelyne Brochu, Sabrina Ouazani, Sivan Levy, Yousef Sweid, Hammoudeh Alkarmi, Zorah Benali, Carlo Brandt, Marie-Thérèse Fortin', null, 'A Canadian doctor finds her sympathies sorely tested while working in the conflict ravaged Palestinian territories.', 'A Canadian doctor finds her sympathies sorely tested while working in the conflict ravaged Palestinian territories.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vkmnQyx4JgifqOpiVHEZj4QYmm0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128104'),
