  ('483375181628465120', 'Indecent Behavior', 1993, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Lawrence Lanoff, Anthony G. Nakonechnyj, Michael Delahoussaye', 'Rosalind Robinson', 'Shannon Tweed, Gary Hudson, Jan-Michael Vincent, Michelle Moffett, Lawrence Hilton-Jacobs, Brandy Ledford, George Shannon, Penny Peyser', null, 'Rebecca Mathis is a sex therapist. One of her patients is found dead. At first it is presumed he died of a heart attack...', 'Rebecca Mathis is a sex therapist. One of her patients is found dead. At first it is presumed he died of a heart attack...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fkHtWnuUXrZwc1O1NHAzvtggMTp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57766'),
  ('945868586846998174', 'Indecent Behavior II', 1994, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Carlo Gustaff, Christopher Taylor, William L. Nagle', 'Phoebe Caulfield, Cindy Cirile, Mike Snyder', 'Shannon Tweed, James Brolin, Chad McQueen, Cynthia Steele, Rochelle Swanson, Craig Stepp, Elizabeth Sandifer, Laura Rogers', null, 'Reporter Shoshona Reed is about to expose a number of people who have a lot to lose. Unfortunately, her cunning ways of getting stories by blackmailing people gets her killed...', 'Reporter Shoshona Reed is about to expose a number of people who have a lot to lose. Unfortunately, her cunning ways of getting stories by blackmailing people gets her killed...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fn4161kMTq7hxiDVDCbci8DtPAQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57769'),
