  ('380012395667785659', 'Indecent Desires', 1968, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Doris Wishman, C. Davis Smith', 'Doris Wishman', 'Sharon Kent, Trom Little, Michael Alaimo, Jackie Richards, Buck Starr', 'NR', 'Zeb finds a doll and a ring in a garbage can. Then, he sees Ann going to work with her friend Babs. He thinks she looks like the doll. When he gets home, he caresses the doll... Ann feels it! When Zeb finds out about Ann''s fiance Tom, he really gets mad, burns the doll, and beats it up, which makes Ann think she''s losing her mind.', 'Zeb finds a doll and a ring in a garbage can. Then, he sees Ann going to work with her friend Babs. He thinks she looks like the doll. When he gets home, he caresses the doll... Ann feels it! When Zeb finds out about Ann''s fiance Tom, he really gets mad, burns the doll, and beats it up, which makes Ann think she''s losing her mind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ci8Gvz0LtTDK5VafFTN7YJpjS2N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50970'),
  ('97857071604242234', 'Indecent Proposal', 1993, 'Romance, Drama', 'Howard Atherton, Adrian Lyne, Ruth A. Redfern', 'Amy Holden Jones', 'Robert Redford, Demi Moore, Woody Harrelson, Seymour Cassel, Oliver Platt, Billy Bob Thornton, Billy Connolly, Rip Taylor', 'R', 'John Gage offers a down-on-his-luck yuppie husband $1 million for the opportunity to spend the night with the man''s wife.', 'John Gage offers a down-on-his-luck yuppie husband $1 million for the opportunity to spend the night with the man''s wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a39WoiTJEG5kNLIrr3kOMwg3LFg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4478'),
  ('519810098876855340', 'Indemnity', 2022, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Travis Taute', 'Travis Taute', 'Jarrid Geduld, Gail Mabalane, André Jacobs, Nicole Fortuin, Louw Venter, Abduragman Adams, Hlomla Dandala', null, 'An ex-fireman with PTSD goes on the run when accused of a crime he doesn''t even remember committing, leading him down a rabbit hole of conspiracy to the highest degree.', 'An ex-fireman with PTSD goes on the run when accused of a crime he doesn''t even remember committing, leading him down a rabbit hole of conspiracy to the highest degree.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8y1rfKHot8DF0cQhGvKXtYsMjNx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:854467'),
  ('1148640264753287248', 'Independence Day', 1996, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Roland Emmerich, Karl Walter Lindenlaub, Lauren E. Polizzi', 'Dean Devlin, Roland Emmerich', 'Will Smith, Bill Pullman, Jeff Goldblum, Mary McDonnell, Judd Hirsch, Robert Loggia, Randy Quaid, Margaret Colin', 'PG-13', 'Strange phenomena surface around the globe. The skies ignite. Terror races through the world''s major cities. As these extraordinary events unfold, it becomes increasingly clear that a force of incredible magnitude has arrived. Its mission: total annihilation over the Fourth of July weekend. The last hope to stop the destruction is an unlikely group of people united by fate and unimaginable circumstances.', 'Strange phenomena surface around the globe. The skies ignite. Terror races through the world''s major cities. As these extraordinary events unfold, it becomes increasingly clear that a force of incredible magnitude has arrived. Its mission: total annihilation over the Fourth of July weekend. The last hope to stop the destruction is an unlikely group of people united by fate and unimaginable circumstances.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p0BPQGSPoSa8Ml0DAf2mB2kCU0R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:602'),
  ('108170938816606119', 'Independence Day: Resurgence', 2016, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Roland Emmerich, Jai James, Patrick M. Sullivan Jr.', 'Gabriel Sherman', 'Liam Hemsworth, Jeff Goldblum, Jessie T. Usher, Bill Pullman, Maika Monroe, Travis Tope, AngelaBaby, Charlotte Gainsbourg', 'PG-13', 'We always knew they were coming back. Using recovered alien technology, the nations of Earth have collaborated on an immense defense program to protect the planet. But nothing can prepare us for the aliens’ advanced and unprecedented force. Only the ingenuity of a few brave men and women can bring our world back from the brink of extinction.', 'We always knew they were coming back. Using recovered alien technology, the nations of Earth have collaborated on an immense defense program to protect the planet. But nothing can prepare us for the aliens’ advanced and unprecedented force. Only the ingenuity of a few brave men and women can bring our world back from the brink of extinction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9S50foUIYGwiNPWOxi1WJF6IPwI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47933'),
  ('350801169073552343', 'Independence Day: The ID4 Invasion', 1996, 'Science Fiction, Action', 'Thomas C. Grane', null, 'Bill Pullman, Will Smith, Jeff Goldblum, Margaret Colin, Robert Loggia, Vivica A. Fox, Mary McDonnell, Harry Connick Jr.', null, 'A "mockumentary" of the alien invasion during Independence Day. Barry Nolan hosts the programme, the first 9 minutes of which are a spoof news report of the events of the film. The middle bit is a discussion of the film by cast and crew, and at the end various scientists and politicians discuss what would happen if real aliens arrive on Earth.', 'A "mockumentary" of the alien invasion during Independence Day. Barry Nolan hosts the programme, the first 9 minutes of which are a spoof news report of the events of the film. The middle bit is a discussion of the film by cast and crew, and at the end various scientists and politicians discuss what would happen if real aliens arrive on Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gw01HpYoNXZbhG6GBQq8yGYPxnL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:579480'),
  ('346380194446535755', 'Independence Daysaster', 2013, 'Science Fiction, Action', 'W.D. Hogan, Robert S. Weber, Tim Sereda', 'Sydney Roper, Rudy Thauberger', 'Casey Dubois, Iain Belcher, Andrea Brooks, Emily Holmes, Ryan Merriman, Keenan Tracey, Garwin Sanford, Michael Kopsa', null, 'When Earth is attacked by a hostile alien force, a small town firefighter and a rogue SETI scientist team up to activate the only technology capable of defeating the invaders.', 'When Earth is attacked by a hostile alien force, a small town firefighter and a rogue SETI scientist team up to activate the only technology capable of defeating the invaders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6jor0EqECPgHqu89GrQIy9Wetkf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:205126'),
  ('969767698500466001', 'Indestructible Man', 1956, 'Crime, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Jack Pollexfen, John L. Russell', 'Sue Dwiggins, Vy Russell', 'Lon Chaney Jr., Max Showalter, Marian Carr, Ross Elliott, Stuart Randall, Ken Terrell, Robert Foulk, Peggy Maley', null, 'A scientific experiment involving subjecting a corpse to an extreme charge of electricity accidentally revives an executed criminal and makes him impervious to harm, allowing him to seek revenge on his former partners, and deal similarly with anyone else who gets in his way.', 'A scientific experiment involving subjecting a corpse to an extreme charge of electricity accidentally revives an executed criminal and makes him impervious to harm, allowing him to seek revenge on his former partners, and deal similarly with anyone else who gets in his way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kcD0kG86GK2mUHjNf6QoDfwtnxd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48385'),
  ('1068788146157623725', 'India', 1993, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Paul Harather, Hans Selikovsky', 'Josef Hader, Alfred Dorfer', 'Josef Hader, Alfred Dorfer, Maria Hofstätter, Roger Murbach, Ursula Rojek, Karl Markovics, Linde Prelog, Karl Künstler', null, 'Heinzi Boesel and Kurt Fellner are two Austrian health inspectors forced to work together, traveling through Austria. Over time a beautiful friendship evolves between the odd couple who couldn''t stand each other initially; a friendship that even overcomes the boundaries of great tragedy.', 'Heinzi Boesel and Kurt Fellner are two Austrian health inspectors forced to work together, traveling through Austria. Over time a beautiful friendship evolves between the odd couple who couldn''t stand each other initially; a friendship that even overcomes the boundaries of great tragedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AslgHRni2MxFfCfrokqYGqfowfu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11122'),
  ('566940521897942684', 'India Lockdown', 2022, 'Drama, Adventure', 'Keiko Nakahara, Palash Das, Madhur Bhandarkar', null, 'Shweta Basu Prasad, Prateik Smita Patil, Sai Tamhankar, Aahana Kumra, Prakash Belawadi, Zarin Shihab', null, 'The Indian government announces a country-wide lockdown for 21 days due to the pandemic. India Lockdown encapsulates the story of four out of lakhs of individuals whose lives came to a standstill.', 'The Indian government announces a country-wide lockdown for 21 days due to the pandemic. India Lockdown encapsulates the story of four out of lakhs of individuals whose lives came to a standstill.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rR8lTcL81n5oHtxmGHMWxag0XOc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:788348'),
