  ('160578676101764237', 'India Sweets and Spices', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Geeta Malik, Shane F. Kelly', 'Geeta Malik', 'Sophia Ali, Manisha Koirala, Adil Hussain, Deepti Gupta, Rish Shah, Ved Sapru, Krishna Sistla Ward', 'PG-13', 'A college freshman confronts her parents’ values in order to understand her own evolving identity.', 'A college freshman confronts her parents’ values in order to understand her own evolving identity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2cUczTzLq1F99Pgiw6BWFsKnD7J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:821493'),
