  ('533291033392531587', 'India''s Most Wanted', 2019, 'Action, Thriller', 'Raj Kumar Gupta, Anugrah Bantawa, Hanish Kalia', 'Raj Kumar Gupta', 'Arjun Kapoor, Rajesh Sharma, Gaurav Mishra, Prasanth Alexander, Sudev Nair, Aasif Khan, Jeetendra Shastri, Shantilal Mukherjee', null, 'Officer Prabhat and his team arrive in Nepal to verify a terror suspect and arrest him within a deadline of four days. A race against time ensues when Pakistani agencies start chasing them.', 'Officer Prabhat and his team arrive in Nepal to verify a terror suspect and arrest him within a deadline of four days. A race against time ensues when Pakistani agencies start chasing them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p8vy15IqBvGx13kfM0ZqQC4xBDI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:599598'),
  ('302055455956566339', 'Indian', 1996, 'Drama, Action, Thriller', 'Shankar, Jeeva, S. P. Hosimin', 'Sujatha Rangarajan', 'Kamal Haasan, Manisha Koirala, Urmila Matondkar, Sukanya, Nedumudi Venu, Manorama, Goundamani, Senthil', null, 'Senapathy, an ex-freedom fighter, is angry. He is angry against the rampant corruption at every level of the bureaucracy. He will clean it up at any cost.', 'Senapathy, an ex-freedom fighter, is angry. He is angry against the rampant corruption at every level of the bureaucracy. He will clean it up at any cost.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zhGayNbH2ZHWaJkhSv3qEhs5fy6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31521'),
  ('592662714972910387', 'Indian', 2001, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'N. Maharajan, Manish Baba, Manoj Tiwari', 'N. Maharajan', 'Sunny Deol, Shilpa Shetty Kundra, Mukesh Rishi, Raj Babbar, Om Puri, Rana Jung Bahadur, Deepak Shirke, Danny Denzongpa', null, 'DCP Raksekhar Azad (Raj) is an invincible cop with a great aim. He arrests a terrorist by the name of Khan. But Khan lands in a prison cell that looks cushier than the Buckingham Palace. However, this gets Raj promoted, and he is congratulated by none other than his father-in-law, who is also a very high ranking policeman. Then all of a sudden, Raj finds out that many policemen would like to see Khan go free. He discusses this issue with his father-in-law, and to his surprise, does not find any support from him. Disagreements and arguments ensue, and as a result, his father-in-law gets killed. The Police suspect Raj of killing him, they begin the process of arresting him, he runs away, while Khan is all set to get freed to do whatever he likes.', 'DCP Raksekhar Azad (Raj) is an invincible cop with a great aim. He arrests a terrorist by the name of Khan. But Khan lands in a prison cell that looks cushier than the Buckingham Palace. However, this gets Raj promoted, and he is congratulated by none other than his father-in-law, who is also a very high ranking policeman. Then all of a sudden, Raj finds out that many policemen would like to see Khan go free. He discusses this issue with his father-in-law, and to his surprise, does not find any support from him. Disagreements and arguments ensue, and as a result, his father-in-law gets killed. The Police suspect Raj of killing him, they begin the process of arresting him, he runs away, while Khan is all set to get freed to do whatever he likes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kMoS0caFjAsEJFX5HrbMGd4g51T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82575'),
  ('965611541642438966', 'Indian 2: Zero Tolerance', 2024, 'Drama, Action, Thriller', 'Ramazan Bulut, Anbumani, Arivumani', 'Shankar', 'Kamal Haasan, Siddharth, Priya Bhavani Shankar, Jagan, Rishikanth, Bobby Simha, Vivek, Nedumudi Venu', null, 'As corruption becomes rampant in the country, a group of idealistic youngsters attract attention of freedom fighter-turned-vigilante Senapathy through social media, who returns to his homeland to finish what he started.', 'As corruption becomes rampant in the country, a group of idealistic youngsters attract attention of freedom fighter-turned-vigilante Senapathy through social media, who returns to his homeland to finish what he started.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fPoiIfqmVfNYZRVUtfTSyuAj8Tw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:552398'),
  ('318139792492424622', 'Indian Horse', 2018, 'Drama', 'Yves Bélanger, Stephen S. Campanelli', 'Dennis Foon', 'Sladen Peltier, Forrest Goodluck, Ajuawak Kapashesit, Edna Manitowabi, Michael Murphy, Michiel Huisman, Martin Donovan, Johnny Issaluk', null, 'Follows the life of Native Canadian Saul Indian Horse as he survives residential school and life amongst the racism of the 1970s. A talented hockey player, Saul must find his own path as he battles stereotypes and alcoholism.', 'Follows the life of Native Canadian Saul Indian Horse as he survives residential school and life amongst the racism of the 1970s. A talented hockey player, Saul must find his own path as he battles stereotypes and alcoholism.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6PRmK9svHolvZ2CLNoBkmViYlrB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:471616'),
  ('1130361271003771222', 'Indian Summer', 1972, 'Drama, Romance', 'Valerio Zurlini, Paolo Pietrangeli, Dario Di Palma', 'Enrico Medioli, Valerio Zurlini', 'Alain Delon, Sonia Petrovna, Giancarlo Giannini, Renato Salvatori, Alida Valli, Adalberto Maria Merli, Salvo Randone, Lea Massari', null, 'In Italy, the gambler and professor of poetry Daniele Dominici arrives in the seaside town of Rimini and is hired to teach for four months in the local high school replacing another teacher. His relationship with his partner Monica is in crisis and he spends most of the time with his new acquaintances and gamblers Giorgio, Marcello and Gerardo. In classroom, he meets the gorgeous nineteen years old student Vanina Abati, who is Gerardo''s girlfriend.', 'In Italy, the gambler and professor of poetry Daniele Dominici arrives in the seaside town of Rimini and is hired to teach for four months in the local high school replacing another teacher. His relationship with his partner Monica is in crisis and he spends most of the time with his new acquaintances and gamblers Giorgio, Marcello and Gerardo. In classroom, he meets the gorgeous nineteen years old student Vanina Abati, who is Gerardo''s girlfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3TsBrOGlDLd7S1hq348fOLJ4RNP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47251'),
  ('55074983189746393', 'Indian Summer', 1993, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Mike Binder, Newton Thomas Sigel, Eric Heffron', 'Mike Binder', 'Alan Arkin, Bill Paxton, Diane Lane, Matt Craven, Julie Warner, Elizabeth Perkins, Kevin Pollak, Sam Raimi', 'PG-13', 'A group of childhood friends, now in their thirties, reunite at Camp Tamakwa. Only a few of the original campers show up, but they still have a good time reminiscing. The people share experiences and grow while at the camp. They are dismayed to discover that the camp''s owner, Unca Lou, is going to close the camp down.', 'A group of childhood friends, now in their thirties, reunite at Camp Tamakwa. Only a few of the original campers show up, but they still have a good time reminiscing. The people share experiences and grow while at the camp. They are dismayed to discover that the camp''s owner, Unca Lou, is going to close the camp down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A1gUvZbQ25wsnj7HD8bDwTxOSWy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33506'),
  ('344500022820165127', 'Indiana Jones and the Dial of Destiny', 2023, 'Adventure, Action', 'Phedon Papamichael, Martin Foley, David Webb', 'Jez Butterworth, John-Henry Butterworth, David Koepp', 'Harrison Ford, Phoebe Waller-Bridge, Mads Mikkelsen, Boyd Holbrook, Olivier Richters, Ethann Isidore, Toby Jones, Antonio Banderas', 'PG-13', 'Finding himself in a new era, and approaching retirement, Indy wrestles with fitting into a world that seems to have outgrown him. But as the tentacles of an all-too-familiar evil return in the form of an old rival, Indy must don his hat and pick up his whip once more to make sure an ancient and powerful artifact doesn''t fall into the wrong hands.', 'Finding himself in a new era, and approaching retirement, Indy wrestles with fitting into a world that seems to have outgrown him. But as the tentacles of an all-too-familiar evil return in the form of an old rival, Indy must don his hat and pick up his whip once more to make sure an ancient and powerful artifact doesn''t fall into the wrong hands.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Af4bXE63pVsb2FtbW8uYIyPBadD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:335977'),
  ('36422895587295359', 'Indiana Jones and the Kingdom of the Crystal Skull', 2008, 'Adventure, Action', 'Steven Spielberg, Janusz Kamiński, Mark W. Mansbridge', 'David Koepp', 'Harrison Ford, Cate Blanchett, Karen Allen, Shia LaBeouf, Ray Winstone, John Hurt, Jim Broadbent, Igor Jijikine', 'PG-13', 'Set during the Cold War, the Soviets—led by sword-wielding Irina Spalko—are in search of a crystal skull which has supernatural powers related to a mystical Lost City of Gold. Indy is coerced to head to Peru at the behest of a young man whose friend—and Indy''s colleague—Professor Oxley has been captured for his knowledge of the skull''s whereabouts.', 'Set during the Cold War, the Soviets—led by sword-wielding Irina Spalko—are in search of a crystal skull which has supernatural powers related to a mystical Lost City of Gold. Indy is coerced to head to Peru at the behest of a young man whose friend—and Indy''s colleague—Professor Oxley has been captured for his knowledge of the skull''s whereabouts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/56As6XEM1flWvprX4LgkPl8ii4K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:217'),
  ('46625068358813963', 'Indiana Jones and the Last Crusade', 1989, 'Adventure, Action', 'Steven Spielberg, Douglas Slocombe, Frank Marshall', 'Jeffrey Boam', 'Harrison Ford, Sean Connery, Denholm Elliott, Alison Doody, John Rhys-Davies, Julian Glover, River Phoenix, Michael Byrne', 'PG-13', 'In 1938, an art collector appeals to eminent archaeologist Dr. Indiana Jones to embark on a search for the Holy Grail. Indy learns that a medieval historian has vanished while searching for it, and the missing man is his own father, Dr. Henry Jones Sr.. He sets out to rescue his father by following clues in the old man''s notebook, which his father had mailed to him before he went missing. Indy arrives in Venice, where he enlists the help of a beautiful academic, Dr. Elsa Schneider, along with Marcus Brody and Sallah. Together they must stop the Nazis from recovering the power of eternal life and taking over the world!', 'In 1938, an art collector appeals to eminent archaeologist Dr. Indiana Jones to embark on a search for the Holy Grail. Indy learns that a medieval historian has vanished while searching for it, and the missing man is his own father, Dr. Henry Jones Sr.. He sets out to rescue his father by following clues in the old man''s notebook, which his father had mailed to him before he went missing. Indy arrives in Venice, where he enlists the help of a beautiful academic, Dr. Elsa Schneider, along with Marcus Brody and Sallah. Together they must stop the Nazis from recovering the power of eternal life and taking over the world!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sizg1AU8f8JDZX4QIgE4pjUMBvx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89'),
  ('1123048461914680496', 'Indiana Jones and the Temple of Doom', 1984, 'Adventure, Action', 'Steven Spielberg, Douglas Slocombe, Frank Marshall', 'Gloria Katz, Willard Huyck', 'Harrison Ford, Kate Capshaw, Ke Huy Quan, Amrish Puri, Roshan Seth, Philip Stone, Roy Chiao, David Yip', 'PG', 'After arriving in India, Indiana Jones is asked by a desperate village to find a mystical stone. He agrees – and stumbles upon a secret cult plotting a terrible plan in the catacombs of an ancient palace.', 'After arriving in India, Indiana Jones is asked by a desperate village to find a mystical stone. He agrees – and stumbles upon a secret cult plotting a terrible plan in the catacombs of an ancient palace.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gpdVNUaa4LhRMLfJOPj1AZdhAZ3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87'),
  ('1124713733009128886', 'Indiana Jones: The Search for the Lost Golden Age', 2021, 'Documentary, TV Movie', 'Clélia Cohen, Antoine Coursat', null, 'Nathalie Labarthe, Harrison Ford, Steven Spielberg, George Lucas, Omar Sharif, Stella Stevens, Nana Mouskouri, Gene Shalit', null, 'Hawaii, May 1977. After the success of Star Wars, George Lucas and Steven Spielberg meet to find a new project to work on together, the former as producer, the latter as director. The story of how the charismatic archaeologist Indiana Jones was born and how his first adventure, released in 1981, triumphed at box offices around the world.', 'Hawaii, May 1977. After the success of Star Wars, George Lucas and Steven Spielberg meet to find a new project to work on together, the former as producer, the latter as director. The story of how the charismatic archaeologist Indiana Jones was born and how his first adventure, released in 1981, triumphed at box offices around the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r3iQkvEU50t87oiKq6seLJFZMgF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:827007'),
  ('1034709019342127824', 'Indianara', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Aude Chevalier-Beaumel, Marcelo Barbosa, Marcelo Barbosa', 'Michele Frantz, Marcelo Barbosa, Aude Chevalier-Beaumel', 'Indianara Siqueira, Mauricio Susano, Wescla Vasconcellos, Biancka Fernandes, Luciana Vasconcellos, Marielle Franco', null, 'Bigger-than-life revolutionary, Indianara and her group lead a fight for the survival of transgender people in Brazil. She gathers her forces for one last battle against the attacks from her political party and the totalitarian threat to come.', 'Bigger-than-life revolutionary, Indianara and her group lead a fight for the survival of transgender people in Brazil. She gathers her forces for one last battle against the attacks from her political party and the totalitarian threat to come.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zED6UCrldkbBkV6zWD9LuZPJwkT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:597686'),
  ('230677699544127814', 'Indice 50', 2016, 'Family, Animation, Comedy', 'Sylvain Amblard, Alexandre Belmudes, Damien Clef', 'Sylvain Amblard', 'Claire D''Intorni', null, 'A family, composed of a strapping father, a mother with an authoritarian temper and an excited young boy, land on a crowded beach for their summer holidays. After struggling for several minutes to find a spot, the family, really organized, begin to settle themselves. However during that topping ritual, a fast and cunning mosquito is going to break the family chain. Owing to the little insect, their wonderful day will be transformed into a true hell.', 'A family, composed of a strapping father, a mother with an authoritarian temper and an excited young boy, land on a crowded beach for their summer holidays. After struggling for several minutes to find a spot, the family, really organized, begin to settle themselves. However during that topping ritual, a fast and cunning mosquito is going to break the family chain. Owing to the little insect, their wonderful day will be transformed into a true hell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mTdr1D6AFXTPvnlQOwcKVKTmcCC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:443069'),
  ('1067208042633905927', 'Indictment: The McMartin Trial', 1995, 'TV Movie, Drama', 'Mick Jackson', 'Abby Mann, Myra Mann', 'James Woods, Mercedes Ruehl, Lolita Davidovich, Sada Thompson, Henry Thomas, Shirley Knight, Mark Blum, Alison Elliott', 'R', 'The McMartin family''s lives are turned upside down when they are accused of serious child molestation. The family run a school for infants. An unqualified child cruelty "expert" videotapes the children describing outrageous stories of abuse. One of the most expensive and long running trials in US legal history, exposes the lack of evidence and unprofessional attitudes of the finger pointers which kept one of the accused in jail for over 5 years without bail.', 'The McMartin family''s lives are turned upside down when they are accused of serious child molestation. The family run a school for infants. An unqualified child cruelty "expert" videotapes the children describing outrageous stories of abuse. One of the most expensive and long running trials in US legal history, exposes the lack of evidence and unprofessional attitudes of the finger pointers which kept one of the accused in jail for over 5 years without bail.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m9yQXiRZhn2iS5rvUgXoXIwLtqo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46725'),
  ('585879099280212650', 'Indie Game: The Movie', 2012, 'Documentary', 'James Swirsky, Lisanne Pajot, Lisanne Pajot', null, 'Edmund McMillen, Tommy Refenes, Phil Fish, Jonathan Blow, Anthony Carboni', 'NR', 'Follows the dramatic journeys of video game developers as they create and release their games to the world. It''s about making video games, but at its core, it''s about the creative process, and exposing yourself through your work.', 'Follows the dramatic journeys of video game developers as they create and release their games to the world. It''s about making video games, but at its core, it''s about the creative process, and exposing yourself through your work.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2B1IqPg97ZhpEov4Fg3si4hI1Kw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80215'),
  ('616252340176388719', 'Indigenous', 2014, 'Horror', 'Alastair Orr, Brendan Barnes', 'Max Roberts', 'Zachary Soetenga, Lindsey McKeon, Sofia Pernas, Pierson Fodé, Juanxo Villaverde, Laura Peñuela, Michael Mealor, Jamie Anderson', 'R', 'A group of five American friends on the cusp of adulthood travel to Panama to relax and reconnect. They befriend a local woman in their hotel bar—and despite some ominous whispers—she goes against the specific instructions of her brother and brings the Americans on a daytrip into the pristine falls at the nearby jungle. What begins as an innocent outing to a picturesque waterfall quickly turns terrifying after she suddenly goes missing. As night closes in, the friends realize too late the truth behind the rumors—the legendary, blood-sucking Chupacabra is now stalking them.', 'A group of five American friends on the cusp of adulthood travel to Panama to relax and reconnect. They befriend a local woman in their hotel bar—and despite some ominous whispers—she goes against the specific instructions of her brother and brings the Americans on a daytrip into the pristine falls at the nearby jungle. What begins as an innocent outing to a picturesque waterfall quickly turns terrifying after she suddenly goes missing. As night closes in, the friends realize too late the truth behind the rumors—the legendary, blood-sucking Chupacabra is now stalking them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m4ZzYr8gmjJl56b7v4LxA3tVcc8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:265018'),
  ('675256017696331316', 'Indignation', 2016, 'Drama, Romance', 'James Schamus, Christopher Blauvelt', 'James Schamus', 'Logan Lerman, Sarah Gadon, Tracy Letts, Linda Emond, Joanne Baron, Ben Rosenfield, Philip Ettinger, Pico Alexander', 'R', 'In 1951, Marcus Messner, a working-class Jewish student from New Jersey, attends a small Ohio college, where he struggles with anti-Semitism, sexual repression, and the ongoing Korean War.', 'In 1951, Marcus Messner, a working-class Jewish student from New Jersey, attends a small Ohio college, where he struggles with anti-Semitism, sexual repression, and the ongoing Korean War.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2xNGhpg7BoQZIh6ufGNaRRPv706.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:340611'),
  ('337917540821271803', 'Indiscreet', 1931, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Leo McCarey, Ray June', 'Lew Brown, Ray Henderson, Buddy G. DeSylva', 'Gloria Swanson, Ben Lyon, Monroe Owsley, Barbara Kent, Arthur Lake, Maude Eburne, Henry Kolker, Nella Walker', 'NR', 'A young woman jeopardizes the relationship with the man she loves when a no-account from her past shows up.', 'A young woman jeopardizes the relationship with the man she loves when a no-account from her past shows up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nlRlzLXItc270RwJb5h7re0cDvg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53797'),
  ('296452820295918352', 'Indiscreet', 1958, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Stanley Donen, Freddie Young', 'Norman Krasna', 'Cary Grant, Ingrid Bergman, Cecil Parker, Phyllis Calvert, David Kossoff, Megs Jenkins, Michael Anthony, David Coote', 'PG', 'Anna Kalman is an accomplished actress who has given up hope of finding the man of her dreams. While talking about this subject with her sister, in walks Philip Adams and she realizes that this is the charming, smart, and handsome man she has been waiting for.', 'Anna Kalman is an accomplished actress who has given up hope of finding the man of her dreams. While talking about this subject with her sister, in walks Philip Adams and she realizes that this is the charming, smart, and handsome man she has been waiting for.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sv4ao2ceHx2Ii1I2SsAmCqr7k6K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22874'),
  ('295294269497404569', 'Indiscretion of an American Wife', 1953, 'Drama, Romance', 'Vittorio De Sica, Oswald Morris, James Wong Howe', 'Ben Hecht', 'Jennifer Jones, Montgomery Clift, Gino Cervi, Richard Beymer, Paolo Stoppa, Nando Bruno, Enrico Glori, Liliana Gerace', null, 'While on vacation in Rome, married American Mary Forbes becomes entangled in an affair with an Italian man, Giovanni Doria. As she prepares to leave Italy, Giovanni confesses his love for her; he doesn''t want her to go. Together they wander the railroad station where Mary is to take the train to Paris, then ultimately reunite with her husband and daughter in Philadelphia. Will she throw away her old life for this passionate new romance?', 'While on vacation in Rome, married American Mary Forbes becomes entangled in an affair with an Italian man, Giovanni Doria. As she prepares to leave Italy, Giovanni confesses his love for her; he doesn''t want her to go. Together they wander the railroad station where Mary is to take the train to Paris, then ultimately reunite with her husband and daughter in Philadelphia. Will she throw away her old life for this passionate new romance?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wvv892G09s9o0N1Mg5QkKZKBRNR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74585'),
  ('461923080293566475', 'Indivisible', 2016, 'Drama', 'Edoardo De Angelis, Ferran Paredes', 'Nicola Guaglianone, Barbara Petronio, Edoardo De Angelis', 'Angela Fontana, Marianna Fontana, Antonia Truppo, Massimiliano Rossi, Toni Laudadio, Marco Mario De Notaris, Gaetano Bruno, Gianfranco Gallo', null, 'Daisy and Viola are siamese twin sisters on the verge of turning 18 living in the suburbs of Naples. They are blessed with beautiful voices and thanks to their performances at weddings, communions and baptisms, they get the livelihood for the whole family. Kept isolated from the rest of the world by their own father who just exploits them in order to make money, their life turns upside-down when one of them falls in love for the first time and they discover that they can be separated.', 'Daisy and Viola are siamese twin sisters on the verge of turning 18 living in the suburbs of Naples. They are blessed with beautiful voices and thanks to their performances at weddings, communions and baptisms, they get the livelihood for the whole family. Kept isolated from the rest of the world by their own father who just exploits them in order to make money, their life turns upside-down when one of them falls in love for the first time and they discover that they can be separated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iseAcq2JgmGSmhFRIAjTSqozMzr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:408438'),
  ('890893804442698243', 'Indivisible', 2018, 'Drama, War', 'David G. Evans', 'David G. Evans, Cheryl McKay, Peter White', 'Justin Bruening, Sarah Drew, Jason George, Tia Mowry, Skye P. Marshall, Tanner Stine, Madeline Carroll, Michael O''Neill', 'PG-13', 'Upon returning from serving in the U.S. Army, Chaplain Darren Turner faces a crisis that shatters his Family and Faith in God but through the help of his fellow soldiers, he returns to his faith and family', 'Upon returning from serving in the U.S. Army, Chaplain Darren Turner faces a crisis that shatters his Family and Faith in God but through the help of his fellow soldiers, he returns to his faith and family', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nHoV8LbrDPGBZp0QSl9S0Jiw4tg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:514407'),
  ('677255204204643531', 'Indochina: Children Gathering Coins Scattered by Western Women', 1899, 'Documentary', 'Gabriel Veyre', null, null, null, 'Vietnamese children collect coins that are thrown them by two aristocratic ladies.', 'Vietnamese children collect coins that are thrown them by two aristocratic ladies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v1gaBapT8pKjnVOLVFuMWhTZpwf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:193619'),
  ('539205897981740901', 'Indochine', 1992, 'Drama, Romance', 'François Catonné, Régis Wargnier, Lal Harindranath', 'Régis Wargnier, Erik Orsenna, Louis Gardel', 'Catherine Deneuve, Vincent Perez, Linh-Dan Pham, Jean Yanne, Dominique Blanc, Alain Fromager, Eric Nguyen, Jean-Baptiste Huynh', 'PG-13', 'In colonial Vietnam, dashing French naval captain Jean-Baptiste, wealthy plantation owner Éliane Devries, and her adopted Vietnamese daughter Camillevare the three points of a cross-cultural romantic triangle. As the struggle against European imperialism sweeps Indochina, Jean-Baptiste and Camille have to choose sides and Éliane faces the emotionally difficult challenge of raising the child of her daughter and ex-lover.', 'In colonial Vietnam, dashing French naval captain Jean-Baptiste, wealthy plantation owner Éliane Devries, and her adopted Vietnamese daughter Camillevare the three points of a cross-cultural romantic triangle. As the struggle against European imperialism sweeps Indochina, Jean-Baptiste and Camille have to choose sides and Éliane faces the emotionally difficult challenge of raising the child of her daughter and ex-lover.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sAemRfr6mOSwtQ76e4yUQVImo8B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2731'),
  ('459978020974848130', 'Indoo Ki Jawani', 2020, 'Comedy', 'A. Vasanth, Abir Sengupta, Mika Singh', 'Abir Sengupta', 'Kiara Advani, Aditya Seal, Mallika Dua, Rakesh Bedi, Rajendra Sethi, Chittaranjan Tripathy, Rajesh Jais, Alka Kaushal', null, 'A feisty girl from Ghaziabad makes her profile on an online dating app and her left and right swipes on the app lead to hilarious consequences.', 'A feisty girl from Ghaziabad makes her profile on an online dating app and her left and right swipes on the app lead to hilarious consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sqFi1T7MMUSZ0nTGL1UphBykz3a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:693838'),
  ('6483911883095990', 'Indovina chi viene a Natale?', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Fausto Brizzi', 'Fausto Brizzi, Marco Martani', 'Diego Abatantuono, Claudio Bisio, Raoul Bova, Carlo Buccirosso, Gigi Proietti, Cristiana Capotondi, Angela Finocchiaro, Claudia Gerini', null, 'A very extended family gathers for the Christmas holidays, after the death of the breadwinner Leonardo Sereni, famous singer. The eldest son Julius, with his wife Marina, has a panettone factory.', 'A very extended family gathers for the Christmas holidays, after the death of the breadwinner Leonardo Sereni, famous singer. The eldest son Julius, with his wife Marina, has a panettone factory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rjQtWijw5jqJLf49cAjsZpalf4W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:244516'),
  ('827540603495211146', 'Industrial Symphony No. 1: The Dream of the Brokenhearted', 1990, 'Music', 'David Lynch, Angelo Badalamenti, John Schwartzman', null, 'Julee Cruise, Laura Dern, Nicolas Cage, Lisa Giobbi, Félix Blaska, Michael J. Anderson, Andre Badalamenti, John Bell', null, 'After her boyfriend ends their relationship, the dreamself of a heartbroken woman floats through the air over an industrial wasteland singing ballads of love.', 'After her boyfriend ends their relationship, the dreamself of a heartbroken woman floats through the air over an industrial wasteland singing ballads of love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1GM68xmNVkamPSoAqFCfihnO5MT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44257'),
  ('236246468239758508', 'İnek Şaban', 1979, 'Comedy', 'Osman F. Seden, Zafer Par, Aziz Yazman', 'Osman F. Seden', 'Kemal Sunal, Defne Yalnız, Saadet Gürses, Ali Şen, Dinçer Çekmez, Yavuz Karakaş, Süheyl Eğriboz, Baykal Kent', null, 'A poor grocery owner becomes a popular goalkeeper.', 'A poor grocery owner becomes a popular goalkeeper.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mTj5YwUMDA0hrGPdfSI1GTXlCjJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148706'),
  ('846124419418194186', 'Inequality for All', 2013, 'Documentary', 'Jacob Kornbluth', null, 'Robert Reich, Dolly Parton, Tyne Daly, Lily Tomlin, Mary Tyler Moore, Candice Bergen, Jon Stewart, Sharon Gless', 'PG', 'Based on Reich''s 2010 book Aftershock: The Next Economy and America''s Future, the film examines widening income inequality in the United States. U.S. Labor Secretary Robert Reich tries to raise awareness of the country''s widening economic gap. He publicly argued about the issue for decades, and producing a film of his viewpoints was a "final frontier" for him. In addition to being a social issue documentary, Inequality for All is also partially a biopic regarding Reich''s early life and his time as Secretary of Labor under Bill Clinton''s presidency. Warren Buffett and Nick Hanauer, two entrepreneurs and investors in the top 1%, are interviewed in the film, supporting Reich''s belief in an economy that benefits all citizens, including those of the middle and lower classes.', 'Based on Reich''s 2010 book Aftershock: The Next Economy and America''s Future, the film examines widening income inequality in the United States. U.S. Labor Secretary Robert Reich tries to raise awareness of the country''s widening economic gap. He publicly argued about the issue for decades, and producing a film of his viewpoints was a "final frontier" for him. In addition to being a social issue documentary, Inequality for All is also partially a biopic regarding Reich''s early life and his time as Secretary of Labor under Bill Clinton''s presidency. Warren Buffett and Nick Hanauer, two entrepreneurs and investors in the top 1%, are interviewed in the film, supporting Reich''s belief in an economy that benefits all citizens, including those of the middle and lower classes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yGWDqQlRzIcvna4YoEYw1cZ7rmn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:159008'),
  ('921555627981134639', 'Inescapable', 2012, 'Thriller, Romance', 'Ruba Nadda, Luc Montpellier', 'Ruba Nadda', 'Alexander Siddig, Joshua Jackson, Marisa Tomei, Oded Fehr, Saad Siddiqui, Fadia Nadda, Bonnie Lee Bouman', 'R', 'Twenty-five years ago Adib, a promising young officer in the Syrian military police, suddenly left Damascus under suspicious circumstances. Abandoning the love of his life Fatima, he made his way to Canada and wiped the slate clean. When his daughter Muna suddenly disappears in Damascus, his past threatens to violently catch up to him. Teaming up with a Canadian emissary, Adib must now confront the turmoil he thought he left behind in order to find Muna.', 'Twenty-five years ago Adib, a promising young officer in the Syrian military police, suddenly left Damascus under suspicious circumstances. Abandoning the love of his life Fatima, he made his way to Canada and wiped the slate clean. When his daughter Muna suddenly disappears in Damascus, his past threatens to violently catch up to him. Teaming up with a Canadian emissary, Adib must now confront the turmoil he thought he left behind in order to find Muna.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gCeZGBFcxjyGdvFncJqCGffBCpw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121676'),
