  ('98503653083159570', 'Infini', 2015, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Tom Gleeson, Shane Abbess, Carl Robertson', 'Brian Cachia, Shane Abbess', 'Daniel MacPherson, Grace Huang, Luke Hemsworth, Bren Foster, Luke Ford, Dwaine Stevenson, Louisa Mignone, Tess Haubrich', 'R', 'A search and rescue team are transported through deep space to a distant mining colony to save the sole survivor of a biological outbreak. During their mission, they find a lethal weapon which is set to arrive on Earth within the hour.', 'A search and rescue team are transported through deep space to a distant mining colony to save the sole survivor of a biological outbreak. During their mission, they find a lethal weapon which is set to arrive on Earth within the hour.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3RpZabrzEKiwoG5Y74HkX4rMQHM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:301728'),
  ('392826320738722767', 'Infinite', 2021, 'Science Fiction, Action, Adventure', 'Mauro Fiore, Max Keene, William Smith', 'Ian Shorr', 'Mark Wahlberg, Chiwetel Ejiofor, Sophie Cookson, Jason Mantzoukas, Rupert Friend, Toby Jones, Dylan O''Brien, Jóhannes Haukur Jóhannesson', 'PG-13', 'Evan McCauley has skills he never learned and memories of places he has never visited. Self-medicated and on the brink of a mental breakdown, a secret group that call themselves “Infinites” come to his rescue, revealing that his memories are real.', 'Evan McCauley has skills he never learned and memories of places he has never visited. Self-medicated and on the brink of a mental breakdown, a secret group that call themselves “Infinites” come to his rescue, revealing that his memories are real.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/niw2AKHz6XmwiRMLWaoyAOAti0G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:581726'),
  ('144074909136256537', 'Infinite Icon: A Visual Memoir', 2026, 'Documentary, Biography, Music, Musical', 'J.J. Duncan, Bruce Robertson, J J Duncan', 'J.J. Duncan, Bruce Robertson, J J Duncan', 'Sia, Rina Sawayama, Meghan Trainor, Megan Thee Stallion, María Becerra', 'PG-13', 'Paris Hilton''s musical journey unfolds through rare footage and intimate moments, from her debut album to her latest work. A raw look at her evolution as an artist and icon, blending performances with personal revelations.', 'Paris Hilton''s musical journey unfolds through rare footage and intimate moments, from her debut album to her latest work. A raw look at her evolution as an artist and icon, blending performances with personal revelations.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2Fd%2Fgracenote%2Fd77bf449bf7f8019236fbda748476c3e.jpg', 'plex:movie:infinite-icon-a-visual-memoir'),
  ('251378872365256837', 'Infinite Storm', 2022, 'Adventure, Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Małgorzata Szumowska, Michał Englert, Michał Englert', 'Joshua Rollins', 'Naomi Watts, Billy Howle, Denis O''Hare, Parker Sawyers, Joshua Rollins, Eliot Sumner, Lina Kolenko, Karin Putrih', 'R', 'One woman''s journey for self-discovery and turns into a harrowing tale of survival.', 'One woman''s journey for self-discovery and turns into a harrowing tale of survival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4B34NKfHCFVHriYfKhbsunHYl4x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:811631'),
  ('5997073744354650', 'Infinitely Polar Bear', 2014, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Maya Forbes, Bobby Bukowski, Ramses del Hierro', 'Maya Forbes', 'Mark Ruffalo, Zoe Saldaña, Imogene Wolodarsky, Ashley Aufderheide, Wallace Wolodarsky, Keir Dullea, Beth Dixon, Georgia Lyman', 'R', 'A manic-depressive mess of a father tries to win back his wife by attempting to take full responsibility of their two young, spirited daughters, who don''t make the overwhelming task any easier.', 'A manic-depressive mess of a father tries to win back his wife by attempting to take full responsibility of their two young, spirited daughters, who don''t make the overwhelming task any easier.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/knQuQkoqNLXKvdwcjgGpY1gzmJa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:244539'),
  ('863394929673441862', 'Infinitum: Subject Unknown', 2021, 'Science Fiction, Thriller, Mystery', 'Paolo Donati, Matthew Butler-Hart, Matthew Butler-Hart', 'Matthew Butler-Hart, Tori Butler-Hart', 'Tori Butler-Hart, Ian McKellen, Conleth Hill, Wendy Muir Hart, Christopher Hart, Matthew Butler-Hart, Holly Dale Spencer, Ben Lee', 'PG-13', 'Jane is the subject of a twisted science experiment where she is placed in a parallel world and is forced to find a way to either alter her reality or be stuck in a time-loop, destined to repeat the same test over and over again, with no memory of her doing it before. But with each ''reset'' she starts to retain fragments of memory. With clues pointing to the mysterious Wytness Quantum Research Centre, she tries to find a way out. (The film was shot entirely on an iPhone during the UK’s first lockdown.)', 'Jane is the subject of a twisted science experiment where she is placed in a parallel world and is forced to find a way to either alter her reality or be stuck in a time-loop, destined to repeat the same test over and over again, with no memory of her doing it before. But with each ''reset'' she starts to retain fragments of memory. With clues pointing to the mysterious Wytness Quantum Research Centre, she tries to find a way out. (The film was shot entirely on an iPhone during the UK’s first lockdown.)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qrcqNcct1Y2bAUoVDQalMQZg29o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:797861'),
  ('927916290140870093', 'Infinity', 1993, 'Drama', 'Marlen Khutsiyev, Gennady Karyuk, Aleksandr Karyuk', 'Marlen Khutsiyev', 'Vladislav Pilnikov, Aleksei Zeljonov, Marina Khazova, Anna Chernakova, Natalya Goncharova, Sergey Murzin, Oleg Uryumtsev, Galina Petrova', null, 'Fifty-year-old Vladimir Ivanovich Prokhorov, relieved of his worldly possessions, takes a journey back in time. Accompanied by a traveling companion barely half his age, he revisits the people and places of his youth and witnesses the dark forces that shaped the 20th century.', 'Fifty-year-old Vladimir Ivanovich Prokhorov, relieved of his worldly possessions, takes a journey back in time. Accompanied by a traveling companion barely half his age, he revisits the people and places of his youth and witnesses the dark forces that shaped the 20th century.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jM9nKKgGVGAgk544uAdlc8dXzrA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56735'),
  ('10337935067083208', 'Infinity', 1996, 'Drama, Romance', 'Matthew Broderick, Toyomichi Kurita', 'Patricia Broderick', 'Matthew Broderick, Patricia Arquette, Peter Riegert, Jeffrey Force, David Drew Gallagher, Raffi Di Blasio, Josh Keaton, James Hong', 'PG', 'Story of the early life of genius and Nobel Prize-winning physicist Richard Feynman.', 'Story of the early life of genius and Nobel Prize-winning physicist Richard Feynman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/45cU6BNyRGKhDQZKzVSll4eTgwh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2033'),
  ('456856264613903838', 'Infinity Chamber', 2016, 'Science Fiction, Mystery, Thriller', 'Travis Milloy, Marty Mullin, Jason Nolte', 'Travis Milloy', 'Christopher Soren Kelly, Cassandra Clark, Cajardo Lindsey, Jesse D. Arrow, Chuck Klein, Brandon Loomis, Garrett Behnke, Paul Milloy', null, 'A man trapped in an automated prison must outsmart a computer in order to escape and try and find his way back to the outside world that may already be wiped out.', 'A man trapped in an automated prison must outsmart a computer in order to escape and try and find his way back to the outside world that may already be wiped out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zaYlG8wZ4DN3Kevnov39u3PjOfh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:428948'),
  ('68608617437098212', 'Infinity Pool', 2023, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Rob Cotterill, Karim Hussain, Miklos Selmeczy', 'Brandon Cronenberg', 'Alexander Skarsgård, Mia Goth, Cleopatra Coleman, Jalil Lespert, Adam Boncz, Amanda Brugel, John Ralston, Jeff Ricketts', 'R', 'While staying at an isolated island resort, James and Em are enjoying a perfect vacation of pristine beaches, exceptional staff, and soaking up the sun. But guided by the seductive and mysterious Gabi, they venture outside the resort grounds and find themselves in a culture filled with violence, hedonism, and untold horror. A tragic accident leaves them facing a zero tolerance policy for crime: either you''ll be executed, or, if you’re rich enough to afford it, you can watch yourself die instead.', 'While staying at an isolated island resort, James and Em are enjoying a perfect vacation of pristine beaches, exceptional staff, and soaking up the sun. But guided by the seductive and mysterious Gabi, they venture outside the resort grounds and find themselves in a culture filled with violence, hedonism, and untold horror. A tragic accident leaves them facing a zero tolerance policy for crime: either you''ll be executed, or, if you’re rich enough to afford it, you can watch yourself die instead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cQKyNm0Nz6KWiDBQF9w4aZAmOfC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:667216'),
  ('833318113319012627', 'Inflame', 2017, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Ceylan Özgün Özçelik, Bilen Sevda Könen, Merve Toz', 'Ceylan Özgün Özçelik', 'Algı Eke, Özgür Çevik, Kadir Çermik, Boncuk Yilmaz, Selen Uçer, Asiye Dinçsoy, İpek Türktan, Kerem Kupacı', null, 'Hasret has been seeing the same nightmare for some time, but she keeps living unaware that what she sees is actually remembering. A 30-year-old woman who works in a News Channel, living alone in the flat left by her musician parents who died in a car crash twenty years ago. Is it? The question creeps into her mind, and then (or maybe even before) her life through recurring nightmares: Is it possible that her parents did not die in a car crash?', 'Hasret has been seeing the same nightmare for some time, but she keeps living unaware that what she sees is actually remembering. A 30-year-old woman who works in a News Channel, living alone in the flat left by her musician parents who died in a car crash twenty years ago. Is it? The question creeps into her mind, and then (or maybe even before) her life through recurring nightmares: Is it possible that her parents did not die in a car crash?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aNAj7LAqeVwvTySjW7zMuhuKE5U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:438532'),
  ('634993070777491092', 'Inflatable Sex Doll of the Wastelands', 1967, 'Crime, Drama', 'Hisato Aikura, Atsushi Yamatoya, Hajime Kai', 'Atsushi Yamatoya', 'Yūichi Minato, Shōhei Yamamoto, Miki Watari, Noriko Tatsumi, Mari Nagisa, Akaji Maro, Taka Okubo, Hatsuo Yamaya', null, 'A wealthy real estate investor is forced to watch the rape of his girlfriend and then is sent a film showing the fact. He hires a hitman, Sho, and shows him the film, so that the detective can get rid of the criminals. But the boss of the criminal band is Ko, Sho''s archnemesis, who raped and murdered his girlfriend.', 'A wealthy real estate investor is forced to watch the rape of his girlfriend and then is sent a film showing the fact. He hires a hitman, Sho, and shows him the film, so that the detective can get rid of the criminals. But the boss of the criminal band is Ko, Sho''s archnemesis, who raped and murdered his girlfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6Bw3mg9FaD8DkYI4fjI2XGmrABy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:143409'),
  ('171245769824503424', 'Inflation', 1928, 'Documentary', 'Hans Richter', 'Hans Richter', null, null, 'Inflation (1928) is an experimental silent film at eight minutes which is sometimes categorized as a documentary. By now Richter is well beyond playing with light & shadow. Inflation explores the subject of money through photographs & with with stop motion animation techniques, adding faces of people impoverished & enriched by the unpredictability of finance. It functions almost as a political cartoon in motion, building to a chaotic & catastrophic climax.', 'Inflation (1928) is an experimental silent film at eight minutes which is sometimes categorized as a documentary. By now Richter is well beyond playing with light & shadow. Inflation explores the subject of money through photographs & with with stop motion animation techniques, adding faces of people impoverished & enriched by the unpredictability of finance. It functions almost as a political cartoon in motion, building to a chaotic & catastrophic climax.', null, 'tmdb:movie:189945'),
  ('344634905621253338', 'Influence Peddling', 1999, 'Comedy', 'Dominique Farrugia, Pascal Gennesseaux', 'Dominique Mézerette, Dominique Farrugia', 'Thierry Lhermitte, Gérard Jugnot, Aure Atika, Jean-Pierre Cassel, Franck Dubosc, Zinedine Soualem, Lionel Abelanski, Marie-Christine Adam', null, 'Maxime and Gerard are a couple of white-collar criminals condemned to 5 years in prison. Sandrine Athan, an honest and principled young police officer, is assigned the banal task of escorting them to the nearest prison in Melun. Things get complicated when killers try to knock them off. Meanwhile, they must contend with strikes which have paralyzed the country and make travelling a nightmare. Added to this mess are the prisoners'' many botch escape attempts. All these complications turn a simple transfer into a hellish adventure.', 'Maxime and Gerard are a couple of white-collar criminals condemned to 5 years in prison. Sandrine Athan, an honest and principled young police officer, is assigned the banal task of escorting them to the nearest prison in Melun. Things get complicated when killers try to knock them off. Meanwhile, they must contend with strikes which have paralyzed the country and make travelling a nightmare. Added to this mess are the prisoners'' many botch escape attempts. All these complications turn a simple transfer into a hellish adventure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dNLxkK2Njb5WODOtAR39rYDASgu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49547'),
  ('990215082650005523', 'Influencer', 2023, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Kurtis David Harder, Robert Pistillo', 'Tesh Guttikonda, Kurtis David Harder', 'Cassandra Naud, Emily Tennant, Rory J. Saper, Sara Canning, Paul Spurrier, Justin Sams', null, 'While struggling on a solo backpacking trip in Thailand, social media influencer Madison meets CW, who travels with ease and shows her a more uninhibited way of living. But CW''s interest in her takes a darker turn.', 'While struggling on a solo backpacking trip in Thailand, social media influencer Madison meets CW, who travels with ease and shows her a more uninhibited way of living. But CW''s interest in her takes a darker turn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mtXV301BF7pqwvRjsWhQo6sD10F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1020910'),
  ('829449964583363806', 'Influencers', 2025, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Kurtis David Harder, David Schuurman', 'Kurtis David Harder', 'Cassandra Naud, Emily Tennant, Georgina Campbell, Lisa Delamar, Jonathan Whitesell, Veronica Long, Dylan Playfair, Osric Chau', null, 'In the picturesque landscapes of Southern France, a young woman''s chilling fascination with murder and identity theft sends her life into a whirlwind of chaos.', 'In the picturesque landscapes of Southern France, a young woman''s chilling fascination with murder and identity theft sends her life into a whirlwind of chaos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nRdjGDxBW60OhzjAtikLgQBwt3B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1476740'),
  ('269303886709485018', 'Influenza', 2004, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Bong Joon Ho, Kim Byeong-jeong', 'Bong Joon Ho', 'Yoon Je-moon, Koh Soo-hee, Lee Da-il', null, 'The film starts with a man named Cho Hyuk-rae who has perched dangerously on top of the Han River Bridge. It is a sad picture of a man who has been caught unwittingly on a security camera. The camera continues to reveal the downward spiral of Cho and those of us who surround him. The ''real'' images shown through the camera keep on becoming more ''corrupted'' as the time goes by.', 'The film starts with a man named Cho Hyuk-rae who has perched dangerously on top of the Han River Bridge. It is a sad picture of a man who has been caught unwittingly on a security camera. The camera continues to reveal the downward spiral of Cho and those of us who surround him. The ''real'' images shown through the camera keep on becoming more ''corrupted'' as the time goes by.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eJIUhG3FrsQGkOo4KWnwb0xLKQf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118179'),
  ('724353886336661726', 'Infrasexum', 1969, 'Drama, Thriller, Horror', 'Carlos Tobalina', 'Claus Muras, Carlos Tobalina', 'Eroff Lynn, Carlos Tobalina, Marsha Jordan, María Pía, Sharon Matt, William Kirschner, Anita de Moulin, Kathy Ferrick', 'NR', 'A middle-aged man is having problems trying to regain his sexual drive. He leaves behind his old life and tries to discover a simpler happiness through painting and meeting new friends. Wanting to save him from a sexless fate, his friend (director Carlos Tobalina in a supporting role) attempts to solve the mystery of his sexual shortcomings, through any means possible. Filled with incredible footage of Las Vegas, the Sierra Nevada and elsewhere, as well as subplots involving kidnapping, and even a bit of unexpected gore, filmmaker Carlos Tobalina’s debut feature is a totally unique sexploitation experiment that showcases many of the stylistic touches that would become his trademarks, along with a cast of beautiful starlets, including Sharon Matt and Marsha Jordan.', 'A middle-aged man is having problems trying to regain his sexual drive. He leaves behind his old life and tries to discover a simpler happiness through painting and meeting new friends. Wanting to save him from a sexless fate, his friend (director Carlos Tobalina in a supporting role) attempts to solve the mystery of his sexual shortcomings, through any means possible. Filled with incredible footage of Las Vegas, the Sierra Nevada and elsewhere, as well as subplots involving kidnapping, and even a bit of unexpected gore, filmmaker Carlos Tobalina’s debut feature is a totally unique sexploitation experiment that showcases many of the stylistic touches that would become his trademarks, along with a cast of beautiful starlets, including Sharon Matt and Marsha Jordan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zFaxR2waLHGEOwSBcYU0U1Zfy1b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:383491'),
  ('891799612676993983', 'Inga', 1968, 'Drama', 'Bruce G. Sparks, Joseph W. Sarno', 'Joseph W. Sarno', 'Marie Liljedahl, Monica Strömmerstedt, Thomas Ungewitter, Anne-Lise Myhrvold, Casten Lassen, Else-Marie Brandt, Sissi Kaiser', null, 'Inga, a 17 year-old, is sent to live with a scheming aunt who wants her to become mistress of her rich neighbour. She falls for a common young man instead.', 'Inga, a 17 year-old, is sent to live with a scheming aunt who wants her to become mistress of her rich neighbour. She falls for a common young man instead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cqnqZzT9nVD1hmp7E1KxTgwWf3s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:130562'),
  ('611109610516787723', 'Ingeborg Bachmann – Journey into the Desert', 2023, 'Drama, History', 'Margarethe von Trotta, Martin Gschlacht', 'Margarethe von Trotta', 'Vicky Krieps, Ronald Zehrfeld, Tobias Resch, Basil Eidenbenz, Luna Wedler, Marc Limpach, Ricardo Angelini, Bernhard Marsch', null, 'When Ingeborg Bachmann and Max Frisch meet for the first time in Paris in the summer of 1958, they are already international celebrities of the literary world. In the four years that follow, they dabble in great love and an open relationship between his hometown of Zurich and her adopted Rome.', 'When Ingeborg Bachmann and Max Frisch meet for the first time in Paris in the summer of 1958, they are already international celebrities of the literary world. In the four years that follow, they dabble in great love and an open relationship between his hometown of Zurich and her adopted Rome.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ju7p6Ak0moeIkwac4OI7yahw1yz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:978580'),
  ('1116045596228735506', 'Ingenious', 2009, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Jeff Balsmeyer, Geoffrey Hall', 'Mike Cram', 'Dallas Roberts, Jeremy Renner, Ayelet Zurer, Marguerite Moreau, Amanda Anka, Richard Kind, Eddie Jemison, Shannon Whirry', 'R', 'A rags-to-riches story of two friends, a small-time inventor and a sharky salesman, who hit rock bottom before coming up with a gizmo that becomes a worldwide phenomenon.', 'A rags-to-riches story of two friends, a small-time inventor and a sharky salesman, who hit rock bottom before coming up with a gizmo that becomes a worldwide phenomenon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/arRoYOiE15BAvt4xBvs08onceaP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:113655'),
  ('513377186632727178', 'Ingenivm Nobis Ipsa Pvella Fecit: Part I', 1974, null, 'Hollis Frampton', null, null, null, 'An experimental short by Hollis Frampton who films the female form during various activities.', 'An experimental short by Hollis Frampton who films the female form during various activities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g3PGSfIpk6pHIyhBH0o1QRgUa0H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:166711'),
  ('772689112650541122', 'Inglourious Basterds', 2009, 'Drama, Thriller, War', 'Robert Richardson, Carlos Fidel, Sebastian T. Krawinkel', 'Quentin Tarantino', 'Brad Pitt, Mélanie Laurent, Christoph Waltz, Eli Roth, Michael Fassbender, Diane Kruger, Daniel Brühl, Til Schweiger', 'R', 'In Nazi-occupied France during World War II, a group of Jewish-American soldiers known as "The Basterds" are chosen specifically to spread fear throughout the Third Reich by scalping and brutally killing Nazis. The Basterds, lead by Lt. Aldo Raine soon cross paths with a French-Jewish teenage girl who runs a movie theater in Paris which is targeted by the soldiers.', 'In Nazi-occupied France during World War II, a group of Jewish-American soldiers known as "The Basterds" are chosen specifically to spread fear throughout the Third Reich by scalping and brutally killing Nazis. The Basterds, lead by Lt. Aldo Raine soon cross paths with a French-Jewish teenage girl who runs a movie theater in Paris which is targeted by the soldiers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7sfbEnaARXDDhKm0CZ7D7uc2sbo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16869'),
  ('667435135545502270', 'Ingmar Bergman Makes a Movie', 1963, 'Documentary', 'Vilgot Sjöman', null, 'Ingmar Bergman, Vilgot Sjöman, Sven Nykvist, Gunnar Björnstrand, Ingrid Thulin, Katinka Faragó, Mago, P.A. Lundgren', null, 'The year is 1961 and Ingmar Bergman is making a movie. While planted on the scene as apprentice to Bergman, Vilgot Sjöman (director, I Am Curious–Yellow, 1967), suggests to Swedish Television that they take the opportunity to record with the acclaimed director. In August, Sjöman and the television crew begin to capture what would become a comprehensive five-part documentary on the making of Winter Light, offering views of script development, set construction and lighting, rehearsals and editing, as well as intimate conversations with Bergman and members of his cast and crew. Footage from the film’s Swedish premiere delivers immediate audience reactions and the critics’ reviews the following day.', 'The year is 1961 and Ingmar Bergman is making a movie. While planted on the scene as apprentice to Bergman, Vilgot Sjöman (director, I Am Curious–Yellow, 1967), suggests to Swedish Television that they take the opportunity to record with the acclaimed director. In August, Sjöman and the television crew begin to capture what would become a comprehensive five-part documentary on the making of Winter Light, offering views of script development, set construction and lighting, rehearsals and editing, as well as intimate conversations with Bergman and members of his cast and crew. Footage from the film’s Swedish premiere delivers immediate audience reactions and the critics’ reviews the following day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ddpqJy4kG0cn5cvnyZOqL4MWkMD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50950'),
  ('1131641562039485207', 'Ingrid Bergman: In Her Own Words', 2015, 'Documentary, History', 'Stig Björkman, Malin Korkeasalo', 'Dominika Daubenbüchel, Stina Gardell, Stig Björkman', 'Alicia Vikander, Pia Lindström, Isotta Rossellini, Isabella Rossellini, Fiorella Mariani, Liv Ullmann, Sigourney Weaver, Jeanine Basinger', 'NR', 'A personal and captivating account of the extraordinary life and work of Ingrid Bergman (1915-82), a young Swedish woman who became one of the most celebrated actresses in world cinema.', 'A personal and captivating account of the extraordinary life and work of Ingrid Bergman (1915-82), a young Swedish woman who became one of the most celebrated actresses in world cinema.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xQRyGiCQijS9m2nObo9He9mzSZx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:341106'),
  ('756097223723279374', 'Ingrid Goes West', 2017, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Sai Sharma, Matt Spicer, Bryce Fortner', 'David Branson Smith, Matt Spicer', 'Aubrey Plaza, Elizabeth Olsen, O''Shea Jackson Jr., Wyatt Russell, Billy Magnussen, Pom Klementieff, Hannah Pearl Utt, Joseph Breen', 'R', 'Ingrid becomes obsessed with a social network star named Taylor Sloane who seemingly has a perfect life. But when Ingrid decides to drop everything and move west to be Taylor''s friend, her behaviour turns unsettling and dangerous.', 'Ingrid becomes obsessed with a social network star named Taylor Sloane who seemingly has a perfect life. But when Ingrid decides to drop everything and move west to be Taylor''s friend, her behaviour turns unsettling and dangerous.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3LEyW11onDltXHo0L1X23j9Nnvg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:411741'),
  ('132124289209304050', 'Inhabitants', 1970, 'Documentary', 'Artavazd Peleshian', null, null, null, 'Inhabitants depicts animals in panic: the film is mostly filled with shots of mass migrations and stampedes (some, surprisingly, filmed from a helicopter). The title equalizes the species of the earth. Artavazd Peleshian merely alludes to the presence of human beings—a few silhouettes that seem to be the cause of these vast, anxious movements of animal fear. In many ways, this film is an ode to the animal world that moves toward formal abstraction, with clouds of silver birds pulverizing light. Peleshian said, “It’s hard to give a verbal synopsis of these films. Such films exist only on the screen, you have to see them.”', 'Inhabitants depicts animals in panic: the film is mostly filled with shots of mass migrations and stampedes (some, surprisingly, filmed from a helicopter). The title equalizes the species of the earth. Artavazd Peleshian merely alludes to the presence of human beings—a few silhouettes that seem to be the cause of these vast, anxious movements of animal fear. In many ways, this film is an ode to the animal world that moves toward formal abstraction, with clouds of silver birds pulverizing light. Peleshian said, “It’s hard to give a verbal synopsis of these films. Such films exist only on the screen, you have to see them.”', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zRxL4sImJ8fKXxWcG3aE5ZeZ7gb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:183728'),
  ('751145574478309985', 'Inhabited', 2003, 'Drama, Fantasy, Horror, Mystery', 'Kelly Sandefur, Charlie Gruet, John Lind', 'Rick Drew', 'Megan Gallagher, Eric Lutes, Sofia Vassilieva, Greg Cipes, Malcolm McDowell, James Otis, Peter Looney, Patty McCormack', 'PG-13', 'A family dismisses their daughter''s claims of "fairies" living in the playhouse in their new home''s backyard, until they discover another girl described the same beings in their home, decades before.', 'A family dismisses their daughter''s claims of "fairies" living in the playhouse in their new home''s backyard, until they discover another girl described the same beings in their home, decades before.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zeLXocx6Its6hIRHdGHZh68KtDe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96917'),
  ('1035270794289694739', 'Inhale', 2010, 'Drama, Action, Thriller', 'Baltasar Kormákur, Óttar Guðnason', 'Walter A. Doty III, John Claflin', 'Dermot Mulroney, Diane Kruger, Sam Shepard, Rosanna Arquette, Mia Stallard, Jordi Mollà, Vincent Perez, Walter Perez', 'R', 'A couple goes to dangerous lengths to find a lung donor for their daughter.', 'A couple goes to dangerous lengths to find a lung donor for their daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x1JpxURGHRkaGM819kVipNdtgR0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12645'),
  ('292852808282186616', 'Inherent Vice', 2014, 'Drama, Mystery, Comedy', 'Adam Somner, Eric Richard Lasko, Trevor Tavares', 'Paul Thomas Anderson', 'Joaquin Phoenix, Josh Brolin, Owen Wilson, Katherine Waterston, Reese Witherspoon, Benicio del Toro, Jena Malone, Joanna Newsom', 'R', 'In Los Angeles at the turn of the 1970s, drug-fueled detective Larry "Doc" Sportello investigates the disappearance of an ex-girlfriend.', 'In Los Angeles at the turn of the 1970s, drug-fueled detective Larry "Doc" Sportello investigates the disappearance of an ex-girlfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pfVua7TzzttOh3RTOuBqT7xN0oY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:171274'),
  ('1117116275751549445', 'Inherit the Viper', 2019, 'Crime, Thriller, Drama', 'Maggie Kimball, Douglas Boatwright, Maggie Wilkinson', 'Andrew Crabtree', 'Josh Hartnett, Margarita Levieva, Owen Teague, Valorie Curry, Bruce Dern, Chandler Riggs, Brad William Henke, Dash Mihok', 'R', 'Since the death of their father, the Riley siblings have kept their heads above water by illegally dealing in painkillers. Josie is managing the business with an iron fist, when her brother, War veteran Kip, is concerned that the risky business is increasingly turning them into outsiders in their small community. While Kip wants to keep his younger brother out of their illegal endeavors, his younger brother is already making plans of his own.', 'Since the death of their father, the Riley siblings have kept their heads above water by illegally dealing in painkillers. Josie is managing the business with an iron fist, when her brother, War veteran Kip, is concerned that the risky business is increasingly turning them into outsiders in their small community. While Kip wants to keep his younger brother out of their illegal endeavors, his younger brother is already making plans of his own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aaLEThX7CxKJuAQDnrZcecpzu0I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:634904'),
  ('560703626169633242', 'Inherit the Wind', 1999, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Daniel Petrie, James Bartle, Tony Schwartz', 'Nedrick Young, Harold Jacob Smith', 'Jack Lemmon, George C. Scott, Lane Smith, Tom Everett Scott, Kathryn Morris, John Cullum, Brad Greenquist, David Wells', 'PG', 'Two great lawyers argue the case for and against a science teacher accused of the crime of teaching evolution.', 'Two great lawyers argue the case for and against a science teacher accused of the crime of teaching evolution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rgH4hyR25OE2AvuW55URkp8bmA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103648'),
  ('771191611675148165', 'Inheritance', 2002, 'Drama', 'Paula Hernández, Fernando Alcalde, Natalia Smirnoff', 'Paula Hernández', 'Rita Cortese, Adrián Witzke, Martín Adjemián, Héctor Anglada, Julieta Díaz, Martín Ricci, Eduardo Cutuli, Carlos Portaluppi', null, 'Peter, a young German, enters a suburban Buenos Aires restaurant; seeking only directions, he instead accidentally ends up with a plate smashing into his head, thrown by the irritable Olinda, the 60 year-old Italian immigrant owner of the restaurant. The two develop a friendship once they discover that the reasons for their having moved to Argentina are strikingly similar.', 'Peter, a young German, enters a suburban Buenos Aires restaurant; seeking only directions, he instead accidentally ends up with a plate smashing into his head, thrown by the irritable Olinda, the 60 year-old Italian immigrant owner of the restaurant. The two develop a friendship once they discover that the reasons for their having moved to Argentina are strikingly similar.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uyRVmybSUYBlcRPD9b3DATr5Hvd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97070'),
