  ('485537261090241078', 'Initial D', 2005, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Alan Mak Siu-Fai, Andrew Lau Wai-Keung, Andrew Lau Wai-Keung', 'Felix Chong Man-Keung', 'Jay Chou, Anne Suzuki, Jordan Chan Siu-Chun, Shawn Yue Man-Lok, Anthony Wong Chau-Sang, Kenny Bee, Chapman To Man-Chat, Edison Chen', null, 'After winning his first competition, Takumi focuses his attention on drift racing, a sport he has unknowingly perfected while delivering tofu in his father''s Toyota AE86.', 'After winning his first competition, Takumi focuses his attention on drift racing, a sport he has unknowingly perfected while delivering tofu in his father''s Toyota AE86.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xMSbtGNX9pftwfHwfTVeoEaVTSw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16411'),
