  ('596971079439836524', 'Initiation: Silent Night, Deadly Night 4', 1990, 'Horror', 'Steve Coatney, Tony Markes, Thomas C. Rainone', 'Woody Keith', 'Maud Adams, Tommy Hinkley, Allyce Beasley, Clint Howard, Neith Hunter, Marjean Holden, Jeanne Bates, Laurel Lockhart', 'R', 'A reporter investigating the bizarre death of a woman who leaped from a building in flames finds herself mixed up in a cult of witches who are making her part of their sacrificial ceremony during the Christmas season.', 'A reporter investigating the bizarre death of a woman who leaped from a building in flames finds herself mixed up in a cult of witches who are making her part of their sacrificial ceremony during the Christmas season.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Oc6wObXYHThbBGsozL7WuilqOS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59762'),
