  ('928812674469033731', 'Ink', 2009, 'Action, Fantasy', 'Jamin Winans, Jeff Pointer', 'Jamin Winans', 'Christopher Soren Kelly, Jessica Duffy, Quinn Hunchar, Jeremy Make, Jennifer Batter, Eme Ikwuakor, Shelby Malone, Steve Sealy', 'NR', 'Invisible forces exert power over us in our sleep. A mercenary named Ink, on a literal nightmare mission, captures the spirit of 8-year-old Emma in the dream world. To save her, the dream-givers marshal all their resources, focusing on saving the soul of Emma''s tragically broken father.', 'Invisible forces exert power over us in our sleep. A mercenary named Ink, on a literal nightmare mission, captures the spirit of 8-year-old Emma in the dream world. To save her, the dream-givers marshal all their resources, focusing on saving the soul of Emma''s tragically broken father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9vYyX7c8gZtxuqd6SiRukRb4gRd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24869'),
  ('69111520026906086', 'Inkaar', 2013, null, 'Sudhir Mishra', null, 'Arjun Rampal, Chitrangada Singh, Deepti Naval, Vipin Sharma, Kanwaljit Singh, Rehana Sultan', null, 'At a leading ad agency, the battle for the top job between Rahul Verma, the advertising CEO, and Maya Luthra, his ambitious protégée, takes an ugly turn when Maya files a sexual harassment complaint against Rahul.', 'At a leading ad agency, the battle for the top job between Rahul Verma, the advertising CEO, and Maya Luthra, his ambitious protégée, takes an ugly turn when Maya files a sexual harassment complaint against Rahul.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qjrTqFoVJAcG4426KCssLzkogs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:161468'),
