  ('277557586162193738', 'Innocence Unprotected', 1968, 'Drama, Documentary', 'Dušan Makavejev, Branko Perak, Stevan Mišković', 'Dušan Makavejev, Branko Vučićević', 'Dragoljub Aleksić, Bratoljub Gligorijević, Vera Jovanović-Šegović, Ana Milosavljević, Pera Milosavljević, Ivan Živković', null, 'A documentary about the famous athlete and movie enthusiast who made Serbia''s first sound film, Innocence Unprotected. The Nazi occupation of Belgrade prevented the film from gaining wider acclaim. Director Makavejev intersperses clips of the original film with interviews of surviving cast and crew members, as well as newsreel and archival footage.', 'A documentary about the famous athlete and movie enthusiast who made Serbia''s first sound film, Innocence Unprotected. The Nazi occupation of Belgrade prevented the film from gaining wider acclaim. Director Makavejev intersperses clips of the original film with interviews of surviving cast and crew members, as well as newsreel and archival footage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9CBLbgOzkexoM5swzSvv9eExo8h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62842'),
