  ('696586350049360543', 'Inseparable Bros', 2019, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Yook Sang-hyo, Sung Seung-taek', 'Yook Sang-hyo', 'Shin Ha-kyun, Lee Kwang-soo, Esom, Park Cheol-min, Kwon Hae-hyo, Kil Hae-yeon, Kim Kyung-nam, Ahn Ji-ho', null, 'Se-ha who is physically handicapped and Dong-gu who is mentally handicapped are not their own brothers. But while living 20 years together, the two became indispensable to each other. One day, the mother of Dong-gu suddenly visits him and acts as his guardian.', 'Se-ha who is physically handicapped and Dong-gu who is mentally handicapped are not their own brothers. But while living 20 years together, the two became indispensable to each other. One day, the mother of Dong-gu suddenly visits him and acts as his guardian.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eMRTIn9MYl1VmQhwoeYvbZN4rPr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:571787'),
