  ('65136569581403627', 'Inside Furioza', 2025, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Cyprian T. Olencki, Jeremi Prokopowicz', 'Cyprian T. Olencki, Dawid Kornaga', 'Mateusz Damięcki, Szymon Bobrowski, Pola Gonciarz, Weronika Książkiewicz-Nathaniel, Łukasz Simlat, Mateusz Banasiuk, Cezary Łukaszewicz, Wojciech Zieliński', 'R', 'In the wake of murder, new Furioza leader Golden claims the reins of his violent and formidable hooligan gang and takes on a new focus across borders.', 'In the wake of murder, new Furioza leader Golden claims the reins of his violent and formidable hooligan gang and takes on a new focus across borders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dbe1zKVKNBIczdmRcm7jxEphYLz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1072699'),
  ('148677917798925987', 'Inside I''m Dancing', 2004, 'Drama', 'Damien O''Donnell, Peter Robertson', 'Jeffrey Caine', 'James McAvoy, Romola Garai, Steven Robertson, Alan King, Brenda Fricker, Ruth McCabe, Anna Healy, Tom Hickey', null, 'Michael is a 24-year-old who has cerebral palsy and long-term resident of the Carrigmore Residential Home for the Disabled, run by the formidable Eileen. His life is transformed when the maverick Rory O''Shea moves in.', 'Michael is a 24-year-old who has cerebral palsy and long-term resident of the Carrigmore Residential Home for the Disabled, run by the formidable Eileen. His life is transformed when the maverick Rory O''Shea moves in.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2umd8KCnjamgEk9RpSUDQ9TltbW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31165'),
  ('449482581653300990', 'Inside Job', 2010, 'Documentary, Crime', 'Kaylanee Mam, Charles Ferguson, Svetlana Cvetko', 'Adam Bolt, Chad Beck, Charles Ferguson', 'Matt Damon, Bill Ackman, Jonathan Alpert, Christine Lagarde, Daniel Alpert, Sigridur Benediktsdottir, Gylfi Zoega, Andri Snær Magnason', 'PG-13', 'A film that exposes the shocking truth behind the economic crisis of 2008. The global financial meltdown, at a cost of over $20 trillion, resulted in millions of people losing their homes and jobs. Through extensive research and interviews with major financial insiders, politicians and journalists, Inside Job traces the rise of a rogue industry and unveils the corrosive relationships which have corrupted politics, regulation and academia.', 'A film that exposes the shocking truth behind the economic crisis of 2008. The global financial meltdown, at a cost of over $20 trillion, resulted in millions of people losing their homes and jobs. Through extensive research and interviews with major financial insiders, politicians and journalists, Inside Job traces the rise of a rogue industry and unveils the corrosive relationships which have corrupted politics, regulation and academia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7yXXIWec24htucjsZS1sDuPLqw8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44639'),
  ('73934279941049945', 'Inside Llewyn Davis', 2013, 'Drama, Music', 'Ethan Coen, Joel Coen, Bruno Delbonnel', 'Joel Coen, Ethan Coen', 'Oscar Isaac, Carey Mulligan, Justin Timberlake, Ethan Phillips, Robin Bartlett, Max Casella, Jerry Grayson, Jeanine Serralles', 'R', 'In Greenwich Village in the early 1960s, gifted but volatile folk musician Llewyn Davis struggles with money, relationships, and his uncertain future.', 'In Greenwich Village in the early 1960s, gifted but volatile folk musician Llewyn Davis struggles with money, relationships, and his uncertain future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nNxK3pC3DMpPpWKMvo2p3liREVT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86829'),
  ('1094944133097820783', 'Inside Love', 2013, 'Drama', 'Santiago Tabernero, Angie Paul Risque', null, 'Eduardo Noriega, Marta Etura, Alfonso Bassave, Jack Taylor, Irene Escolar, La Terremoto de Alcorcón, Jorge Roldán', null, 'Julia and Félix are a young married couple under pressure to have a baby for the first time. After an argument at a beach resort, Julia suffers an accident.', 'Julia and Félix are a young married couple under pressure to have a baby for the first time. After an argument at a beach resort, Julia suffers an accident.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cSro8bEZHFFpT4cPHq0xSonIbac.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:238714'),
  ('732315576685714493', 'Inside Man', 2006, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Spike Lee, Matthew Libatique, James C. Feng', 'Russell Gewirtz', 'Denzel Washington, Clive Owen, Jodie Foster, Christopher Plummer, Willem Dafoe, Chiwetel Ejiofor, Carlos Andrés Gómez, Kim Director', 'R', 'When an armed, masked gang enter a Manhattan bank, lock the doors and take hostages, the detective assigned to effect their release enters negotiations preoccupied with corruption charges he is facing.', 'When an armed, masked gang enter a Manhattan bank, lock the doors and take hostages, the detective assigned to effect their release enters negotiations preoccupied with corruption charges he is facing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ffMUgkDZICNiyaws1Jkv8qG8uFW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:388'),
  ('696506755517731021', 'Inside Man', 2023, 'Crime, Thriller, Drama', 'Danny A. Abeckaser, Bryan Koss', 'Kosta Kondilopoulos', 'Emile Hirsch, Jake Cannavale, Lucy Hale, Ashley Greene, Danny A. Abeckaser, Vincent Laresca, Kyle Stefanski, James Russo', 'R', 'Based on true events. A disgraced police detective seeking redemption goes undercover to expose a violent crime syndicate. But as he sinks deeper into the mob, the price for absolution may be higher than he can afford.', 'Based on true events. A disgraced police detective seeking redemption goes undercover to expose a violent crime syndicate. But as he sinks deeper into the mob, the price for absolution may be higher than he can afford.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hIJ5QNIjQ2oILCNLBtbnS0Cmw9z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1020662'),
