  ('481509879044591308', 'Inside Men', 2015, 'Crime, Drama', 'Woo Min-ho, Go Rak-sun, Lee Seung-bin', 'Woo Min-ho', 'Lee Byung-hun, Cho Seung-woo, Baek Yoon-sik, Lee Kyung-young, Kim Hong-pa, Lee El, Jeong Man-sik, Bae Sung-woo', null, 'A disgruntled henchman teams up with an ambitious prosecutor to bring down a leading presidential candidate and the news editor behind him who is truly pulling the strings.', 'A disgruntled henchman teams up with an ambitious prosecutor to bring down a leading presidential candidate and the news editor behind him who is truly pulling the strings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7brLGeVVlGjsv7HZ0GdSElne0Ts.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:293413'),
  ('650815737392913664', 'Inside Monkey Zetterland', 1992, 'Comedy', 'Jefery Levy, Christopher Taylor, Trey Batchelor', 'Steve Antin', 'Steve Antin, Patricia Arquette, Sandra Bernhard, Sofia Coppola, Tate Donovan, Rupert Everett, Katherine Helmond, Bo Hopkins', 'R', 'An off beat comedy about an out of work screen writing/artist that complains about being too cool, too talented and way too gay.', 'An off beat comedy about an out of work screen writing/artist that complains about being too cool, too talented and way too gay.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t2UmWYnAkOJGsTVerKC1oRvSIim.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:172378'),
  ('972504558590983677', 'Inside Moves', 1980, 'Drama', 'Richard Donner, Michael Grillo, Paul Moen', 'Barry Levinson, Valerie Curtin', 'John Savage, David Morse, Diana Scarwid, Amy Wright, Tony Burton, Bill Henderson, Steve Kahan, Jack O''Leary', 'PG', 'After a failed suicide attempt leaves him partially crippled, Rory begins spending a lot of time at a neighborhood bar full of interesting misfits. When Jerry the bartender suddenly finds himself playing basketball for the Golden State Warriors, Rory and the rest of the bar regulars hope his success will provide a lift to their sagging spirits. Will Jerry forget his friends? What about his junkie hooker girlfriend and her pimp?', 'After a failed suicide attempt leaves him partially crippled, Rory begins spending a lot of time at a neighborhood bar full of interesting misfits. When Jerry the bartender suddenly finds himself playing basketball for the Golden State Warriors, Rory and the rest of the bar regulars hope his success will provide a lift to their sagging spirits. Will Jerry forget his friends? What about his junkie hooker girlfriend and her pimp?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A65YXgdnVgRjkaeA0hSMzfoAlZz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39503'),
  ('1013182459241192076', 'Inside Nazi Germany', 1938, 'Documentary', 'Jack Glenn', 'James L. Shute', 'Jackson Beck, William E. Dodd, Adolf Hitler, Benito Mussolini', null, 'Short documentary film in the newsreel series ''The March of Time''.', 'Short documentary film in the newsreel series ''The March of Time''.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cr1cuP6vibCYRZJz0dM5WqFg9wF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:132560'),
  ('569635159569191676', 'Inside Out', 1975, 'Comedy, Crime, Thriller', 'Peter Duffell', 'Stephen Schneck, Judd Bernard', 'Telly Savalas, Aldo Ray, Robert Culp, James Mason, Günter Meisner, Adrian Hoven, Wolfgang Lukschy, Charles Korvin', 'PG', 'An American ex-WW II POW returns to Germany 30 years after the war. He teams up with the former commander of his prison camp. Together they spring a Nazi war criminal from jail. He''s the only one left who knows where a secret wartime cache of gold is hidden.', 'An American ex-WW II POW returns to Germany 30 years after the war. He teams up with the former commander of his prison camp. Together they spring a Nazi war criminal from jail. He''s the only one left who knows where a secret wartime cache of gold is hidden.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kN2FLzI9pEltSh5qSMFGXWFLplh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96797'),
  ('831005842590132819', 'Inside Out', 1997, 'Comedy', 'Jason Gould, Michael Grady, Shawn Griffith', 'Jason Gould', 'Jason Gould, Elliott Gould, Alexis Arquette, Jon Polito, Christina Crawford, Jordan Ladd, Robert Amico, Kate Asner', null, 'A film that shows how "hard" it is to be son of celebrities.', 'A film that shows how "hard" it is to be son of celebrities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qrIqTCrsgJhkzjSkH4uqkvCiPwO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49175'),
  ('593463310774448682', 'Inside Out', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Edgar Pêra, Miguel Sales Lopes', 'Roberto Pereira, Henrique Cardoso Dias, Frederico Pombares', 'Diogo Morgado, Jorge Corrula, Philippe Leroux, Rui Melo, Melânia Gomes, Marina Albuquerque, Nuno Melo, Diana Monteiro', null, 'João is a writer who one day wakes up suffering from a bout of selective amnesia: he can''t remember that he''s gay. So he decides to reject his partner of five years and he plunges into a new, unexpectedly hetero life. But, as the saying goes, it never rains but it pours: João also has a creative block, and is incapable of finishing his latest novel. Isabel, his rival in the literary world, is suffering from a similar case of writer''s block. After a night spent together, Isabel steals João''s novel and tries to publish it as her own.', 'João is a writer who one day wakes up suffering from a bout of selective amnesia: he can''t remember that he''s gay. So he decides to reject his partner of five years and he plunges into a new, unexpectedly hetero life. But, as the saying goes, it never rains but it pours: João also has a creative block, and is incapable of finishing his latest novel. Isabel, his rival in the literary world, is suffering from a similar case of writer''s block. After a night spent together, Isabel steals João''s novel and tries to publish it as her own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/upzmFHQw79GcaQiA9Ezy17Aub7Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:286568'),
  ('264718689729911961', 'Inside Out', 2015, 'Animation, Family, Adventure, Drama, Comedy', 'Pete Docter, Patrick Lin, Andrew Page', 'Meg LeFauve, Josh Cooley, Pete Docter', 'Amy Poehler, Phyllis Smith, Richard Kind, Bill Hader, Lewis Black, Mindy Kaling, Kaitlyn Dias, Diane Lane', 'PG', 'When 11-year-old Riley moves to a new city, her Emotions team up to help her through the transition. Joy, Fear, Anger, Disgust and Sadness work together, but when Joy and Sadness get lost, they must journey through unfamiliar places to get back home.', 'When 11-year-old Riley moves to a new city, her Emotions team up to help her through the transition. Joy, Fear, Anger, Disgust and Sadness work together, but when Joy and Sadness get lost, they must journey through unfamiliar places to get back home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2H1TmgdfNtsKlU9jKdeNyYL5y8T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:150540'),
  ('704168393786501898', 'Inside Out 2', 2024, 'Animation, Adventure, Comedy, Family', 'Kelsey Mann, Jonathan Pytko, Adam Habib', 'Dave Holstein, Meg LeFauve', 'Amy Poehler, Maya Hawke, Kensington Tallman, Liza Lapira, Tony Hale, Lewis Black, Phyllis Smith, Ayo Edebiri', 'PG', 'Teenager Riley''s mind headquarters is undergoing a sudden demolition to make room for something entirely unexpected: new Emotions! Joy, Sadness, Anger, Fear and Disgust, who’ve long been running a successful operation by all accounts, aren’t sure how to feel when Anxiety shows up. And it looks like she’s not alone.', 'Teenager Riley''s mind headquarters is undergoing a sudden demolition to make room for something entirely unexpected: new Emotions! Joy, Sadness, Anger, Fear and Disgust, who’ve long been running a successful operation by all accounts, aren’t sure how to feel when Anxiety shows up. And it looks like she’s not alone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vpnVM9B6NMmQpWeZvzLvDESb2QY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1022789'),
  ('680568162819595170', 'Inside Rooms: 26 Bathrooms, London & Oxfordshire', 1985, 'Documentary', 'Peter Greenaway', null, 'Geoffrey Palmer, Cosey Fanni Tutti', null, 'Greenaway''s short documentary shows 26 bathrooms, each representing a letter of the alphabet.', 'Greenaway''s short documentary shows 26 bathrooms, each representing a letter of the alphabet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k8Dl2FiRn3rHej2mtSwgrE4FIQV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70157'),
  ('873562444727498586', 'Inside the Labyrinth', 1986, 'Documentary', 'Desmond Saunders', 'Jim Henson', 'Jim Henson, David Bowie, Charles Augins, Brian Henson, Brian Froud, Terry Jones, Michael McCormick, Ross Hill', 'NR', 'A behind-the-scenes look at Jim Henson''s 1986 fantasy film, ''Labyrinth'', featuring David Bowie and Jennifer Connelly.', 'A behind-the-scenes look at Jim Henson''s 1986 fantasy film, ''Labyrinth'', featuring David Bowie and Jennifer Connelly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kgv1ptuMi17wEguHVYqPD3eXvtI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:239059'),
  ('239173972606214550', 'Inside the Mind of a Cat', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Andy Mitchell', null, 'Neil Wilson, Dr. Bruce Kornriech, Maryna Savitska, Svitlana Savytska, Wailani Sung, Yuki Hattori, Eva Maria Giegl, Kristyn Vitale', null, 'Cat experts dive into the mind of the feline to reveal the true capabilities of the pouncing pet in this captivating and cuddly documentary.', 'Cat experts dive into the mind of the feline to reveal the true capabilities of the pouncing pet in this captivating and cuddly documentary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lqngTIvF2UdcK9uTZ8nLX3AfbHp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1003180'),
  ('304238431385684182', 'Inside the Mind of a Dog', 2024, 'Documentary', 'Andy Mitchell, Andy Mitchell, Claudia Raschke', null, 'Rob Lowe', null, 'Embark on a delightful journey into the world of dogs in this documentary that reveals scientific and emotional insights about our lovable BFFs.', 'Embark on a delightful journey into the world of dogs in this documentary that reveals scientific and emotional insights about our lovable BFFs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rajrUCW4fkvdK4EDickfpK9wLbO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1266321'),
  ('63001033226235080', 'Inside the Mossad', 2017, 'Documentary', null, 'Yossi Melman', 'Ram Ben Barak, Gad Shimron, Yossi Alpher', null, 'Shrouded in secrecy, Israel’s intelligence agency, the Mossad, has been closed to the media since its founding in 1950. This must-see documentary steps behind the curtain to unveil stories from former agents who provide first-hand testimony of the personal and operational challenges they overcame working for one of the most enigmatic institutions in the world. Inside the Mossad is an intriguing and unsettling examination of Israel’s history through the eyes of those who shaped its past and continue to influence its future.', 'Shrouded in secrecy, Israel’s intelligence agency, the Mossad, has been closed to the media since its founding in 1950. This must-see documentary steps behind the curtain to unveil stories from former agents who provide first-hand testimony of the personal and operational challenges they overcame working for one of the most enigmatic institutions in the world. Inside the Mossad is an intriguing and unsettling examination of Israel’s history through the eyes of those who shaped its past and continue to influence its future.', null, 'tmdb:movie:1049403'),
  ('357885257300282085', 'Inside the Rage Machine', 2026, 'Documentary', 'Rob Farquhar', null, 'Marianna Spring, Emilie Harley', null, 'New whistleblowers and insiders from social media companies speak out to reveal how algorithms designed to connect people have been helping to tear them apart. With new testimony and documents, they expose a machine thriving on outrage and division as part of a business model, with radicalisation, real-world violence and fractured societies some of the consequences of a system built to shape how users think, feel and see the world.', 'New whistleblowers and insiders from social media companies speak out to reveal how algorithms designed to connect people have been helping to tear them apart. With new testimony and documents, they expose a machine thriving on outrage and division as part of a business model, with radicalisation, real-world violence and fractured societies some of the consequences of a system built to shape how users think, feel and see the world.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FmJ5xvom8SXDrPazO7VzUVuQkrD1.jpg', 'plex:movie:inside-the-rage-machine'),
  ('603758006857881777', 'Inside The X-Files', 1998, 'Documentary, TV Movie', 'Glen Kasper', 'Frank Spotnitz, John Shiban', 'Chris Carter, David Duchovny, Gillian Anderson, William B. Davis, Sheila Larken, Mitch Pileggi, Bruce Harwood, Dean Haglund', null, 'Inside the X-Files for a behind-the-scenes look at the show. Also included are interviews with the cast and creator Chris Carter, never before seen segments from the show, outtakes and a sneak preview of the upcoming feature film.', 'Inside the X-Files for a behind-the-scenes look at the show. Also included are interviews with the cast and creator Chris Carter, never before seen segments from the show, outtakes and a sneak preview of the upcoming feature film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qUusijIwAsEAu25u1uHPBxuYzoP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:241170'),
  ('501925382448666641', 'Inside the Yellow Cocoon Shell', 2023, 'Drama', 'Phạm Thiên Ân, Dinh Duy Hung, Nguyễn Mai Ka', 'Phạm Thiên Ân', 'Le Phong Vu, Nguyen Thinh, Nguyen Thi Truc Quynh, Vu Ngoc Manh, Dylan Besseau, Phi Điểu, Nguyen Van Lu''u, Mạnh Cường', null, 'After a Vietnamese woman dies in a car crash in Saigon, her brother-in-law and her young son transport her body back to the former’s hometown in rural Vietnam, where they plan to give her a funeral.', 'After a Vietnamese woman dies in a car crash in Saigon, her brother-in-law and her young son transport her body back to the former’s hometown in rural Vietnam, where they plan to give her a funeral.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7k1QaP44m4jpavnmn1G1Fs2mGFD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1114816'),
  ('1046117496623214712', 'Inside-Out', 1999, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Charles Guard, Thomas Guard', 'Dylan Ritson', 'Lena Headey, Simon McBurney', null, 'Girl cleaning windows of an Oxford St store catches the eye of a guy in the street who larks about much to her amusement.', 'Girl cleaning windows of an Oxford St store catches the eye of a guy in the street who larks about much to her amusement.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hmeL9wiGNSLKORfibkMOemmntkQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44227'),
  ('1071868718583704411', 'Insidious', 2011, 'Horror, Thriller', 'James Wan, John R. Leonetti, David M. Brewer', 'Leigh Whannell', 'Patrick Wilson, Rose Byrne, Lin Shaye, Ty Simpkins, Barbara Hershey, Leigh Whannell, Angus Sampson, Andrew Astor', 'PG-13', 'A family discovers that dark spirits have invaded their home after their son inexplicably falls into an endless sleep. When they reach out to a professional for help, they learn things are a lot more personal than they thought.', 'A family discovers that dark spirits have invaded their home after their son inexplicably falls into an endless sleep. When they reach out to a professional for help, they learn things are a lot more personal than they thought.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1egpmVXuXed58TH2UOnX1nATTrf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49018'),
  ('493933838422115296', 'Insidious: Chapter 2', 2013, 'Horror, Thriller', 'James Wan, John R. Leonetti, Albert Cho', 'Leigh Whannell', 'Patrick Wilson, Rose Byrne, Lin Shaye, Ty Simpkins, Barbara Hershey, Steve Coulter, Leigh Whannell, Angus Sampson', 'PG-13', 'The haunted Lambert family seeks to uncover the mysterious childhood secret that has left them dangerously connected to the spirit world.', 'The haunted Lambert family seeks to uncover the mysterious childhood secret that has left them dangerously connected to the spirit world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w5JjiB3O1CLDXbTJe1QpU5RHmlU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91586'),
  ('380804759987380582', 'Insidious: Chapter 3', 2015, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Marc Newland, Leigh Whannell, Brian Pearson', 'Leigh Whannell', 'Stefanie Scott, Lin Shaye, Dermot Mulroney, Leigh Whannell, Angus Sampson, Steve Coulter, Hayley Kiyoko, Tom Gallop', 'PG-13', 'A twisted new tale of terror begins for a teenage girl and her family, and revealing more mysteries of the otherworldly realm, ''The Further''.', 'A twisted new tale of terror begins for a teenage girl and her family, and revealing more mysteries of the otherworldly realm, ''The Further''.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iDdGfdNvY1EX0uDdA4Ru77fwMfc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:280092'),
  ('620318413587754894', 'Insidious: The Last Key', 2018, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Adam Robitel, Toby Oliver', 'Leigh Whannell', 'Lin Shaye, Leigh Whannell, Angus Sampson, Kirk Acevedo, Caitlin Gerard, Spencer Locke, Josh Stewart, Tessa Ferrer', 'PG-13', 'Parapsychologist Elise Rainier and her team travel to Five Keys, NM, to investigate a man’s claim of a haunting. Terror soon strikes when Rainier realizes that the house he lives in was her family’s old home.', 'Parapsychologist Elise Rainier and her team travel to Five Keys, NM, to investigate a man’s claim of a haunting. Terror soon strikes when Rainier realizes that the house he lives in was her family’s old home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nb9fc9INMg8kQ8L7sE7XTNsZnUX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:406563'),
  ('324820199638288739', 'Insidious: The Red Door', 2023, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Riley Flanagan, Stephen Harrison, Patrick Wilson', 'Scott Teems', 'Rose Byrne, Ty Simpkins, Patrick Wilson, Lin Shaye, Sinclair Daniel, Hiam Abbass, Andrew Astor, Juliana Davies', 'PG-13', 'To put their demons to rest once and for all, Josh Lambert and a college-aged Dalton Lambert must go deeper into The Further than ever before, facing their family''s dark past and a host of new and more horrifying terrors that lurk behind the red door.', 'To put their demons to rest once and for all, Josh Lambert and a college-aged Dalton Lambert must go deeper into The Further than ever before, facing their family''s dark past and a host of new and more horrifying terrors that lurk behind the red door.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d07phJqCx6z5wILDYqkyraorDPi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:614479'),
  ('285136352465930492', 'Insight', 2021, 'Action, Science Fiction, Drama', 'Livi Zheng, Ken Zheng, Richard J. Vialet', 'Ken Zheng', 'Ken Zheng, Tony Todd, Keith David, Madeline Zima, John Savage, Adam Huss, Sunny May Allison, Kenny Apel', null, 'Jian is a counter terrorism agent who blends his skills as a martial artist and clairvoyant to bring the world''s most nefarious individuals to justice. This lone wolf is is forced to make an unexpected detour to Los Angeles upon receipt of the devastating news of a cover up surrounding his brother''s alleged suicide. With the reluctant help of LAPD detectives, Abby, Carl, and Captain Duke, the unlikely group become involved in the investigation. Jian and Abby fight against a high-tech criminal looking to exploit the brothers'' gifts in his own quest to power.', 'Jian is a counter terrorism agent who blends his skills as a martial artist and clairvoyant to bring the world''s most nefarious individuals to justice. This lone wolf is is forced to make an unexpected detour to Los Angeles upon receipt of the devastating news of a cover up surrounding his brother''s alleged suicide. With the reluctant help of LAPD detectives, Abby, Carl, and Captain Duke, the unlikely group become involved in the investigation. Jian and Abby fight against a high-tech criminal looking to exploit the brothers'' gifts in his own quest to power.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oyD5Fqesaw1h1B6OQEkaAONedj9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:796339'),
  ('706952449379281988', 'Insignificance', 1985, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Nicolas Roeg, Peter Hannan', 'Terry Johnson', 'Michael Emil, Theresa Russell, Tony Curtis, Gary Busey, Will Sampson, Patrick Kilpatrick, Ian O''Connell, George Holmes', 'R', 'Four 1950s icons meet in the same hotel room, and two of them discover more in common between them than they ever anticipated.', 'Four 1950s icons meet in the same hotel room, and two of them discover more in common between them than they ever anticipated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/priidLcX1Qxp0m0vaTa9vSwZ8ZZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42035'),
  ('1140114766967652152', 'Insignificant Things', 2008, 'Drama, Family', 'Andrea Martínez, Josep M. Civit', 'Andrea Martínez', 'Paulina Gaitán, Bárbara Mori, Fernando Luján, Blanca Guerra, Dolores Heredia, Carmelo Gómez, Lucía Jiménez, Arturo Ríos', null, 'Esmeralda is a teenager with an unusual obsession: she collects lost, forgotten or discarded objects from people she doesn''t know and keeps them in a box beneath her bed. This is the tale of three objects in the box and the people behind them, all in some way incapable of relating to the person they love most. It is also a tale of the box itself, and of how Esmeralda learns to open it, to feel and to hoard the most valuable thing of all: human relations.', 'Esmeralda is a teenager with an unusual obsession: she collects lost, forgotten or discarded objects from people she doesn''t know and keeps them in a box beneath her bed. This is the tale of three objects in the box and the people behind them, all in some way incapable of relating to the person they love most. It is also a tale of the box itself, and of how Esmeralda learns to open it, to feel and to hoard the most valuable thing of all: human relations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uM27P8FtwSTEXmyJ6dTrQ7jNZVD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23529'),
  ('221910699417067474', 'Insomnia', 1997, 'Thriller, Crime, Mystery', 'Erik Skjoldbjærg, Erling Thurmann-Andersen, Marianne O. Ulrichsen', 'Nikolaj Frobenius, Erik Skjoldbjærg', 'Stellan Skarsgård, Sverre Anker Ousdal, Bjørn Floberg, Maria Mathiesen, Gisken Armand, Kristian Figenschow, Thor Michael Aamodt, Frode Rasmussen', 'NR', 'Detectives Jonas and Erik are called to the midnight sun country of northern Norway to investigate a recent homicide, but their plan to arrest the killer goes awry, and Jonas mistakenly shoots Erik. The suspect escapes, and a frightened Jonas pins Erik''s death on the fugitive. Jonas continues to pursue the killer as he seeks to protect himself; however, his mounting guilt and the omnipresent sun plague him with an insomnia that affects his sanity.', 'Detectives Jonas and Erik are called to the midnight sun country of northern Norway to investigate a recent homicide, but their plan to arrest the killer goes awry, and Jonas mistakenly shoots Erik. The suspect escapes, and a frightened Jonas pins Erik''s death on the fugitive. Jonas continues to pursue the killer as he seeks to protect himself; however, his mounting guilt and the omnipresent sun plague him with an insomnia that affects his sanity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k0inzQmt7kATmAGns0wdfjiFxSu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26610'),
  ('239451810577213614', 'Insomnia', 2002, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Wally Pfister, Christopher Nolan, Vincent Lascoumes', 'Nikolaj Frobenius, Erik Skjoldbjærg', 'Al Pacino, Robin Williams, Hilary Swank, Martin Donovan, Nicky Katt, Maura Tierney, Paul Dooley, Jonathan Jackson', 'R', 'Two Los Angeles homicide detectives are dispatched to a northern town where the sun doesn''t set to investigate the methodical murder of a local teen.', 'Two Los Angeles homicide detectives are dispatched to a northern town where the sun doesn''t set to investigate the methodical murder of a local teen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/riVXh3EimGO0y5dgQxEWPRy5Itg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:320'),
  ('751308387453160321', 'Inspector Blunder', 1980, 'Comedy', 'Claude Zidi, Henri Decaë', 'Jean Bouchaud, Claude Zidi', 'Coluche, Gérard Depardieu, Dominique Lavanant, Julien Guiomar, Alain Mottet, François Perrot, Jean Bouchaud, Clément Harari', null, 'A detective, fresh out of the academy (lowest mark in class), gets the assignment to bodyguard a spoiled rich girl reporter. She''s been interviewed on TV and has questioned the virility of a mobster who kidnaps her later.', 'A detective, fresh out of the academy (lowest mark in class), gets the assignment to bodyguard a spoiled rich girl reporter. She''s been interviewed on TV and has questioned the virility of a mobster who kidnaps her later.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bASEmSrZXQ9y9rMIDmMKgMC27LP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24260'),
  ('1078447448157895309', 'Inspector Calzonzin', 1974, 'Comedy', 'Alfonso Arau', 'Juan de la Cabada, Eduardo del Río, Héctor Ortega', 'Alfonso Arau, Pancho Córdova, Virma Gonzalez, Héctor Ortega, Carolina Barret, Carmen Salinas, Arturo Alegro, Mario García ''Harapos''', null, 'A rumor reaches a small town, San Garabato, that a government infiltrator will arrive to check the conditions of the community. Quickly, the municipal president, Don Perpetuo del Rosal, orders the imprisonment of those who might give a bad image. An indigenous man named Calzonzin arrives in town, pursued by two men. He is quickly taken as the infiltrated inspector, and protected by all the local authorities.', 'A rumor reaches a small town, San Garabato, that a government infiltrator will arrive to check the conditions of the community. Quickly, the municipal president, Don Perpetuo del Rosal, orders the imprisonment of those who might give a bad image. An indigenous man named Calzonzin arrives in town, pursued by two men. He is quickly taken as the infiltrated inspector, and protected by all the local authorities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/95RxMB2zitOWuTnEFi6vvo3xBw0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:341321'),
  ('367984408129770179', 'Inspector Clouseau', 1968, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Arthur Ibbetson, Bud Yorkin, Kip Gowans', 'Frank Waldman, Tom Waldman', 'Alan Arkin, Frank Finlay, Delia Boccardo, Patrick Cargill, Beryl Reid, Clive Francis, Richard Pearson, Michael Ripper', 'G', 'Detective Inspector Jacques Clouseau is borrowed from the Surete on special assignment for Scotland Yard in hopes that a fresh outlook will help the government recover the loot from the Great Train Robbery, which is being used to underwrite a new crime wave. What they don''t count on, however, is having more than one Clouseau on the job.', 'Detective Inspector Jacques Clouseau is borrowed from the Surete on special assignment for Scotland Yard in hopes that a fresh outlook will help the government recover the loot from the Great Train Robbery, which is being used to underwrite a new crime wave. What they don''t count on, however, is having more than one Clouseau on the job.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A7yauQMOYV4bFO7DvdzkdnKzSLn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11573'),
  ('782699950979134547', 'Inspector Dupin: Brittany Calling', 2014, 'Crime, TV Movie', 'Matthias Tiefenbacher', 'Gernot Gricksch, Martin Ess', 'Pasquale Aleardi, Annika Blendl, Ludwig Blochberger, Sibylle Canonica, Michael Prelle, Gudrun Ritter, Walter Kreye, Ulrike C. Tscharre', null, 'A real and a fake Gauguin take Dupin back to the 19th century.', 'A real and a fake Gauguin take Dupin back to the 19th century.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5uSItO6GxsCyzlK2uPsdI9lCCpJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:334224'),
