  ('1102303154584926009', 'Inspector Dupin: Brittany''s Tide', 2017, 'Crime, TV Movie', 'Thomas Roth', 'Clemens Murath, Thomas Roth', 'Pasquale Aleardi, Ludger Pistor, Christian Redl, Annika Blendl, Ludwig Blochberger, Udo Samel, Arnd Klawitter, Jan Georg Schütte', null, 'Myths of the sunken city of Ys leads to the murder of a young couple.', 'Myths of the sunken city of Ys leads to the murder of a young couple.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fOF5Dyn6ogEVLWCcfoauUjfiHs7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:432656'),
  ('84201318692402864', 'Inspector Faustão and the Vagabond', 1991, 'Comedy, Crime, Thriller, Family', 'Mário Márcio Bandarra, Antonio Penido', 'Nelson Nadotti', 'Sérgio Mallandro, Faustão, Luiza Tomé, Chiquinho Brandão, Cláudia Alencar, Caíque Benigno, Cláudio Mamberti, Paulo César Peréio', null, 'Faustão, a fruit seller, is selected by God himself to become Inspector Faustão, defender of the animals. He''s joined by Sérgio Mallandro in a mission to save a group of quails from an illegal smuggler, while also having to deal with a bratty kid and a jealous girlfriend.', 'Faustão, a fruit seller, is selected by God himself to become Inspector Faustão, defender of the animals. He''s joined by Sérgio Mallandro in a mission to save a group of quails from an illegal smuggler, while also having to deal with a bratty kid and a jealous girlfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vzCyfApn3d3AGIBO4wXfvGqKedz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84743'),
  ('1022258910543155311', 'Inspector Gadget', 1999, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Family', 'David Kellogg, Sergio Mimica-Gezzan, Sean Hobin', 'Zak Penn, Kerry Ehrin', 'Matthew Broderick, Rupert Everett, Joely Fisher, Michelle Trachtenberg, Andy Dick, Cheri Oteri, Mike Hagerty, Dabney Coleman', 'PG', 'John Brown is a bumbling but well-intentioned security guard who is badly injured in an explosion planned by an evil mastermind. He is taken to a laboratory, where Brenda, a leading robotics surgeon, replaces his damaged limbs with state-of-the-art gadgets and tools. Named "Inspector Gadget" by the press, John -- along with his niece, Penny, and her trusty dog, Brain -- uses his new powers to discover who was behind the explosion.', 'John Brown is a bumbling but well-intentioned security guard who is badly injured in an explosion planned by an evil mastermind. He is taken to a laboratory, where Brenda, a leading robotics surgeon, replaces his damaged limbs with state-of-the-art gadgets and tools. Named "Inspector Gadget" by the press, John -- along with his niece, Penny, and her trusty dog, Brain -- uses his new powers to discover who was behind the explosion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dDcsv1Lql5aM6H4JYfDHjBAXKgT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:332'),
  ('57193501633133938', 'Inspector Gadget 2', 2003, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Family', 'Alex Zamm, Geoffrey Wharton, Steve Newman', 'William Robertson, Alex Zamm, Ron Anderson', 'French Stewart, Elaine Hendrix, Tony Martin, Caitlin Wachs, Mark Mitchell, Sigrid Thornton, Bruce Spence, Alethea McGrath', 'G', 'After capturing Claw, all the criminals have gone into hiding. Until Claw escapes! Gadget thinks he will get the case, but everyone else has other plans. A new version of the Gadget project is unveiled in the form of G2. Strict orders are given for Gadget to stay away from G2 and every crime scene, but Gadget feels he is needed more than anyone.', 'After capturing Claw, all the criminals have gone into hiding. Until Claw escapes! Gadget thinks he will get the case, but everyone else has other plans. A new version of the Gadget project is unveiled in the form of G2. Strict orders are given for Gadget to stay away from G2 and every crime scene, but Gadget feels he is needed more than anyone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6g5L4lpsQ1jYDJpMn1XGYOGzlar.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19766'),
  ('474935023753401329', 'Inspector Gadget Saves Christmas', 1992, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Chuck Patton', 'Eleanor Burian-Mohr, Jack Hanrahan', 'Don Adams, Frank Welker, Maurice LaMarche, Erica Horn', 'NR', 'That bionic bonehead is off to the North Pole to stop Dr. Claw from taking over Santa''s elves and workshop. Accompanied as usual by Penny and Brain who foil Claw''s operations once again.', 'That bionic bonehead is off to the North Pole to stop Dr. Claw from taking over Santa''s elves and workshop. Accompanied as usual by Penny and Brain who foil Claw''s operations once again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sPvBWFJJekQ1BuTR6c1XjLNZtlf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:431230'),
  ('1138076730590796147', 'Inspector Hornleigh Goes to It', 1941, 'Crime', 'Walter Forde, Arthur Crabtree, Jack E. Cox', 'J.O.C. Orton, Frank Launder, Val Guest', 'Gordon Harker, Alastair Sim, Phyllis Calvert, Edward Chapman, Charles Oliver, Raymond Huntley, Percy Walsh, David Horne', null, 'Third and final film in the ''Inspector Hornleigh’ series of comedy-thrillers. Inspector Hornleigh (Gordon Harker), disappointed at not being handed an important spy case, is assigned by Scotland Yard to an army barracks to investigate the mundane thefts of supplies from the stores. This accidentally leads Hornleigh and Sergeant Bingham (Alastair Sim) to a nest of fifth columnists when his dim-witted assistant carelessly talks to a girl in the cafeteria – and that night, news of Hornleigh and Bingham’s arrival is embarrassingly transmitted back to Germany.', 'Third and final film in the ''Inspector Hornleigh’ series of comedy-thrillers. Inspector Hornleigh (Gordon Harker), disappointed at not being handed an important spy case, is assigned by Scotland Yard to an army barracks to investigate the mundane thefts of supplies from the stores. This accidentally leads Hornleigh and Sergeant Bingham (Alastair Sim) to a nest of fifth columnists when his dim-witted assistant carelessly talks to a girl in the cafeteria – and that night, news of Hornleigh and Bingham’s arrival is embarrassingly transmitted back to Germany.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sLUykql42cUFgZByZK7KpOGmXgZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:253759'),
  ('78554901119201260', 'Inspector Lavardin', 1986, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Jean Rabier, Claude Chabrol, Michel Dupuy', 'Dominique Roulet, Claude Chabrol', 'Jean Poiret, Jean-Claude Brialy, Bernadette Lafont, Jean-Luc Bideau, Jacques Dacqmine, Hermine Clair, Pierre-François Dumeniaud, Florent Gibassier', null, 'Inspector Lavardin is called to a provincial village to investigate a murder – only to find that one of his ex-lovers is the victim’s widow.', 'Inspector Lavardin is called to a provincial village to investigate a murder – only to find that one of his ex-lovers is the victim’s widow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b2Z5vTpOEcrYcv5xAxGDV15rDLU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63322'),
  ('303658071835165745', 'Inspector Palmu''s Error', 1960, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Matti Kassila, Olavi Tuomi', 'Matti Kassila', 'Joel Rinne, Elina Pohjanpää, Matti Ranin, Leo Riuttu, Leo Jokela, Elina Salo, Matti Oravisto, Pentti Siimes', null, 'A closed room mystery begins when an infamous tycoon is found dead in his bath tub. The famous police lieutenant Palmu is summoned to investigate.', 'A closed room mystery begins when an infamous tycoon is found dead in his bath tub. The famous police lieutenant Palmu is summoned to investigate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j2EsFx9o4WfjCyiBKB8iRjXGjmD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55398'),
  ('360860996283818351', 'Inspector Sun and the Curse of the Black Widow', 2022, 'Animation, Family, Comedy, Mystery', 'Julio Soto Gurpide', 'Rocco Pucillo', 'Fernando Cabrera, Andrea Villaverde, Catherina Martínez, Ana Jiménez, Txema Moscoso, Vicente Gil, Jesús Barreda, Pedro Tena Ramos', 'PG', 'After being put on indefinite leave by his chief of police uncle, the highly intelligent and arrogant huntsman spider Inspector Sun boards a San Francisco bound seaplane. Joined by an intrepid young fan, Sun is pulled into a murder case where the turnout could affect both the insect and human worlds.', 'After being put on indefinite leave by his chief of police uncle, the highly intelligent and arrogant huntsman spider Inspector Sun boards a San Francisco bound seaplane. Joined by an intrepid young fan, Sun is pulled into a murder case where the turnout could affect both the insect and human worlds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zUYleUhOpEew8wdcusS0eGytZ6T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:987750'),
