  ('862270744440120992', 'Intervention', 1987, 'Adventure, Comedy, Documentary', 'Gennadi Poloka, Vladimir Burykin, Yevgeni Mezentsev', 'Lev Slavin', 'Vladimir Vysotsky, Valeriy Zolotukhin, Olga Aroseva, Gelena Ivlieva, Efim Kopelyan, Yuliya Burygina, Sergei Yursky, Rufina Nifontova', null, 'The movie is set during the last days of a foreign intervention against Soviet Russia. Police are searching everywhere for a Bolshevik named Brodsky but cannot find him. Meanwhile, a man named Michel Voronov serves as a teacher to a rich woman''s son, Zhen''ka.', 'The movie is set during the last days of a foreign intervention against Soviet Russia. Police are searching everywhere for a Bolshevik named Brodsky but cannot find him. Meanwhile, a man named Michel Voronov serves as a teacher to a rich woman''s son, Zhen''ka.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t5ZsDq8DXN4SD5AEuEctuGyUsxT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67029'),
  ('483360986673724990', 'Interview', 2003, 'Drama', 'Theo van Gogh, Thomas Kist', 'Hans Teeuwen, Theodor Holman', 'Katja Schuurman, Pierre Bokma, Theo Maassen, Ellen ten Damme, Michiel de Jong, Tinoes Fenanlamrer, Monique Meijer, Theo van Gogh', null, 'A middle-aged journalist interviews the real-life Dutch star Katja Schuurman, in her own loft. Pierre, the journalist is annoyed at being given such a fluffy assignment, as he is normally a political correspondent. Initially he has no questions for Katja, but soon they are coaxing their darkest secrets out of each other.', 'A middle-aged journalist interviews the real-life Dutch star Katja Schuurman, in her own loft. Pierre, the journalist is annoyed at being given such a fluffy assignment, as he is normally a political correspondent. Initially he has no questions for Katja, but soon they are coaxing their darkest secrets out of each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6wQHYXC9o1NXWCAFFRIIGm6jTE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36350'),
  ('370475663319767909', 'Interview', 2007, 'Drama', 'Steve Buscemi, Thomas Kist', 'Theodor Holman', 'Sienna Miller, Steve Buscemi, James Franco, Michael Buscemi, Tara Elders, Molly Griffith, Yan Xi, Katja Schuurman', 'R', 'After falling out with his editor, a fading political journalist is forced to interview America''s most popular soap actress.', 'After falling out with his editor, a fading political journalist is forced to interview America''s most popular soap actress.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jObPGoyEcBFB8x5j3Htabavgcxx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8414'),
  ('265659537180189027', 'Interview with a Hitman', 2012, 'Action, Thriller', 'Perry Bhandal, Neil Wallace, Craig Willis', 'Perry Bhandal', 'Luke Goss, Caroline Tillette, Stephen Marcus, Danny Midwinter, Elliot Greene, Philip Whitchurch, Patrick Lyster, Ray Panthaki', 'NR', 'An elite hitman returns to erase his past only to find that somebody has messed with his future.', 'An elite hitman returns to erase his past only to find that somebody has messed with his future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5RitmzYivc4WTncMIlOsrgjKzcd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118737'),
  ('266648685985466324', 'Interview with the Assassin', 2002, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Neil Burger, Richard Rutkowski', 'Neil Burger', 'Dylan Haggerty, Renee Faia, Raymond J. Barry, Kelsey Kemper, Jared McVay, Dennis Lau', null, 'Out of work TV cameraman Ron Kobelski is approached by his formerly reclusive neighbor Walter Ohlinger. Ohlinger claims that he was the mysterious "second gunman" that shot and killed President Kennedy. Ohlinger has kept quiet all these years, but has decided to tell his story now that he has been diagnosed with terminal cancer. Kobelski is skeptical of his neighbor''s story, after his investigations provide ambiguous answers. His attitude changes, however, after he receives threatening messages on his answering machine, and spots shadowy figures in his backyard. Is Ohlinger telling the truth? Or is there a bigger conspiracy at work?', 'Out of work TV cameraman Ron Kobelski is approached by his formerly reclusive neighbor Walter Ohlinger. Ohlinger claims that he was the mysterious "second gunman" that shot and killed President Kennedy. Ohlinger has kept quiet all these years, but has decided to tell his story now that he has been diagnosed with terminal cancer. Kobelski is skeptical of his neighbor''s story, after his investigations provide ambiguous answers. His attitude changes, however, after he receives threatening messages on his answering machine, and spots shadowy figures in his backyard. Is Ohlinger telling the truth? Or is there a bigger conspiracy at work?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yCEP43DIYqx8NM9ttcmgSnxScRI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36584'),
  ('739700833534952541', 'Interview with the Vampire', 1994, 'Horror, Drama, Fantasy', 'Philippe Rousselot, Neil Jordan, Patrick Clayton', 'Anne Rice', 'Tom Cruise, Brad Pitt, Antonio Banderas, Christian Slater, Stephen Rea, Kirsten Dunst, Domiziana Giordano, Thandiwe Newton', 'R', 'A vampire relates his epic life story of love, betrayal, loneliness, and dark hunger to an over-curious reporter.', 'A vampire relates his epic life story of love, betrayal, loneliness, and dark hunger to an over-curious reporter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2162lAT2MP36MyJd2sttmj5du5T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:628'),
  ('129686616402886780', 'Interviews with My Lai Veterans', 1971, 'Documentary, War', 'Joseph Strick, Richard Pearce, Haskell Wexler', 'Joseph Strick', 'Richard Hammer', null, 'Interviews with five former American soldiers who were present at the March 16, 1968 attack on the village of My Lai during the Vietnam War; they discuss the orders that were issued leading up to the attack, their expectations of what they would find there, and the subsequent massacre of the inhabitants and destruction of the village, as well as possible motivations for the killings and rapes which took place. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in 2002.', 'Interviews with five former American soldiers who were present at the March 16, 1968 attack on the village of My Lai during the Vietnam War; they discuss the orders that were issued leading up to the attack, their expectations of what they would find there, and the subsequent massacre of the inhabitants and destruction of the village, as well as possible motivations for the killings and rapes which took place. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in 2002.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l01LiB1pHerjOOi8py38Axva9iR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:183859'),
