  ('348544552527476558', 'Intimacies of a Prostitute', 1974, 'Drama', 'Armando Bó', 'Armando Bó, Dalmiro Sáenz', 'Isabel Sarli, Jorge Barreiro, Sabina Olmos, Guillermo Battaglia, Fidel Pintos, Ricardo Passano, Raúl del Valle, Virginia Romay', null, 'A woman from the country moves into to the big city of Buenos Aires to start a new life. Things are not going very easy and she soon finds herself working as a prostitute.', 'A woman from the country moves into to the big city of Buenos Aires to start a new life. Things are not going very easy and she soon finds herself working as a prostitute.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kkOeaoP20pGdoi1833yRxmTR05w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:460884'),
