  ('526574527649721705', 'Intimates', 1997, 'Romance, Drama', 'Jacob Cheung Chi-Leung, Jin Demao, Bowie Tsang', 'Siu Tong', 'Carina Lau, Charlie Yeung Choi-Nei, Winston Chao, Theresa Lee Yee-Hung, Gua Ah-leh, Stephen Tung Wai, Chin Ka-Lok, Jin Demao', null, 'Foon escapes an arranged marriage by walking the road of a Ji Sor. After an affair with Shing, she becomes pregnant. An attempted abortion nearly costs Foon her life. Wan, the young owner of a silk factory, rescues her. Wan and Foon share their romances, reflecting the experience of women during the 40''s.', 'Foon escapes an arranged marriage by walking the road of a Ji Sor. After an affair with Shing, she becomes pregnant. An attempted abortion nearly costs Foon her life. Wan, the young owner of a silk factory, rescues her. Wan and Foon share their romances, reflecting the experience of women during the 40''s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eh0Sn4fytCJDrS9ALyBX4t415Da.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:255863'),
  ('4586248708120128', 'Intimidation', 1960, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Koreyoshi Kurahara, Takashi Nomura, Yoshihiro Yamazaki', 'Osamu Kawase', 'Jun Hamamura, Kō Nishimura, Nobuo Kaneko, Yōko Kozono, Kōjirō Kusanagi, Mari Shiraki, Zenji Yamada, Tomio Aoki', null, 'Koreyoshi Kurahara''s ingeniously plotted, pocket-size noir concerns the intertwined fates of a desperate bank manager, blackmailed for book-cooking, and his resentful but timid underling, passed over for a promotion. The marvelously moody Intimidation is an elegantly stripped-down and carefully paced crime drama.', 'Koreyoshi Kurahara''s ingeniously plotted, pocket-size noir concerns the intertwined fates of a desperate bank manager, blackmailed for book-cooking, and his resentful but timid underling, passed over for a promotion. The marvelously moody Intimidation is an elegantly stripped-down and carefully paced crime drama.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qFKOns7QiHnHloC87nIjLjMdYOV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86823'),
  ('231721571335453131', 'Into a Dream', 2005, 'Drama', 'Sion Sono', 'Sion Sono', 'Tetsushi Tanaka, Yūna Natsuo, Joe Odagiri, Jun Murakami, Miwako Ichikawa, Ryo Iwamatsu, Akaji Maro, Rena Komine', null, 'Low-profile theatre troupe actor Mutsugoro Suzuki begins an oneiric journey home, marked by his quest to find the one responsible of infecting him with a STD.', 'Low-profile theatre troupe actor Mutsugoro Suzuki begins an oneiric journey home, marked by his quest to find the one responsible of infecting him with a STD.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uDKXC8m8QwVMpFQWqwRKnh1lKZL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66062'),
  ('681668620445574786', 'Into Eternity: A Film for the Future', 2010, 'Documentary', 'Michael Madsen, Heikki Färm', 'Jesper Bergman, Michael Madsen', 'Carl Reinhold Bråkenhjelm, Michael Madsen, Wendla Paile, Esko Roukola, Mikael Jensen, Berit Lundqvist', null, 'Every day, the world over, large amounts of high-level radioactive waste created by nuclear power plants is placed in interim storage, which is vulnerable to natural disasters, man-made disasters, and to societal changes. In Finland the world’s first permanent repository is being hewn out of solid rock – a huge system of underground tunnels - that must last 100,000 years as this is how long the waste remains hazardous.', 'Every day, the world over, large amounts of high-level radioactive waste created by nuclear power plants is placed in interim storage, which is vulnerable to natural disasters, man-made disasters, and to societal changes. In Finland the world’s first permanent repository is being hewn out of solid rock – a huge system of underground tunnels - that must last 100,000 years as this is how long the waste remains hazardous.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hzINyIeovFPMwtwMteSuXdByCby.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54527'),
  ('656818154108977487', 'Into Great Silence', 2005, 'Documentary', 'Philip Gröning, Philip Gröning', 'Philip Gröning', null, null, 'An intimate portrayal of the everyday lives of Carthusian monks of the Grande Chartreuse, high in the French Alps (Chartreuse Mountains). The idea for the film was proposed to the monks in 1984, but the Carthusians said they wanted time to think about it. The Carthusians finally contacted Gröning 16 years later to say they were now willing to permit Gröning to shoot the movie, if he was still interested.', 'An intimate portrayal of the everyday lives of Carthusian monks of the Grande Chartreuse, high in the French Alps (Chartreuse Mountains). The idea for the film was proposed to the monks in 1984, but the Carthusians said they wanted time to think about it. The Carthusians finally contacted Gröning 16 years later to say they were now willing to permit Gröning to shoot the movie, if he was still interested.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ctqLEwsIRYIPBGAJaDm4UxnTqpO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11225'),
  ('302566573586190483', 'Into My Heart', 1998, 'Drama', 'Sean Smith, Anthony Stark, Michael F. Barrow', 'Anthony Stark, Sean Smith', 'Rob Morrow, Claire Forlani, Jake Weber, Jayne Brook, Sebastian Roché, Nora Ariffin, Nelson Martinez, John Doumanian', null, 'At Columbia University, during the week of John Belushi''s death, lifelong friends Ben and Adam meet Nina at a student bar. After Nina and Adam marry, she goes to grad school in New York, while he begins a career as a writer. Ben marries Stanford law student Kat, and they both find work in New York. Lives are altered after Ben and Nina enter into an affair.', 'At Columbia University, during the week of John Belushi''s death, lifelong friends Ben and Adam meet Nina at a student bar. After Nina and Adam marry, she goes to grad school in New York, while he begins a career as a writer. Ben marries Stanford law student Kat, and they both find work in New York. Lives are altered after Ben and Nina enter into an affair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eCVaV1EdcTFf0SwPmNcVhxPGGU7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:163742'),
  ('1147763026561607285', 'Into Pitch Black', 2000, 'Action, Science Fiction, Crime, TV Movie', 'M. David Melvin', null, 'Vin Diesel, Lisa Saum, Brian Gant, William Roberts, Kevin Burnett, Andrew Bernard, Danny Stark, Heather Waters', 'R', 'After the events of Pitch Black, a contractor is hired to locate Riddick, dead or alive. He reviews available information on him and the events of Pitch Black. Terrified, he hires a female cyberpunk merc to do the job for him.', 'After the events of Pitch Black, a contractor is hired to locate Riddick, dead or alive. He reviews available information on him and the events of Pitch Black. Terrified, he hires a female cyberpunk merc to do the job for him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/daB2WDVkOXzaWohtuxvOArpRF4X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:244839'),
  ('404100541239417435', 'Into the Abyss', 2011, 'Documentary, Crime', 'Werner Herzog, Peter Zeitlinger', 'Werner Herzog', 'Werner Herzog, Jason Burkett, Richard Lopez, Damon Hall, Lisa Stolter-Balloun, Charles Richardson, Jared Talbert, Amanda West', 'PG-13', 'We do not know when and how we will die. Death Row inmates do. Werner Herzog embarks on a dialogue with Death Row inmates, asks questions about life and death and looks deep into these individuals, their stories, their crimes.', 'We do not know when and how we will die. Death Row inmates do. Werner Herzog embarks on a dialogue with Death Row inmates, asks questions about life and death and looks deep into these individuals, their stories, their crimes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/omYLK5w7N5YeWi4gFcNTylgvL8j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77365'),
  ('635571408602122199', 'Into the Abyss', 2023, 'Horror, Drama, Science Fiction', 'Matías Rispau, Matías Rispau, Juan Facundo López', 'Matías Rispau, Boris C.Q.', 'Martín Rispau, Germán Baudino, Chucho Fernández, Jorge Javier Alagastino, Demián Salomón, Paula Brasca, Tania Covelli', null, 'Trying to escape danger in a post-apocalyptic world, Bannon realizes that his very existence will be put to the test.', 'Trying to escape danger in a post-apocalyptic world, Bannon realizes that his very existence will be put to the test.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9D36ZMTHA7jqPpN2J1ja0LENw89.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:917281'),
  ('103851809970282121', 'Into the Arms of Danger', 2020, 'TV Movie, Thriller', 'Ferguson Sauvé-Rogan, Jeff Hare', 'Daniel West', 'Cathy Moriarty, AlexAnn Hopkins, Laurie Fortier, Sam Meader, Joey Luthman, Mason Trueblood, Tom Kiesche, Dru Mouser', null, 'Two paramedics arrive at the site of a car accident to transport an injured teenage girl to the hospital. However, instead of taking her to the hospital, the strangers bring her to a home of a woman whose daughter just died.', 'Two paramedics arrive at the site of a car accident to transport an injured teenage girl to the hospital. However, instead of taking her to the hospital, the strangers bring her to a home of a woman whose daughter just died.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/U1yqjQnFO3Lk8n5dUrzCAonDBs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:685051'),
  ('960805144980764724', 'Into the Arms of Strangers: Stories of the Kindertransport', 2000, 'Documentary, History, War', 'Mark Jonathan Harris, Don Lenzer', 'Mark Jonathan Harris', 'Judi Dench', 'PG', 'In the nine months prior to World War II, 10.000 innocent children left behind their families, their homes, their childhood, and took the journey... to Britain to escape the Nazi Holocaust.', 'In the nine months prior to World War II, 10.000 innocent children left behind their families, their homes, their childhood, and took the journey... to Britain to escape the Nazi Holocaust.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9vNRpMYT5H9L9UYf6Yq17isnQem.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58062'),
  ('822051074705330522', 'Into the Ashes', 2019, 'Crime, Thriller, Drama, Mystery', 'John W. Rutland, Elliott Barker, Bri Hervey', 'Aaron Harvey', 'Luke Grimes, Robert Taylor, Frank Grillo, James Badge Dale, Marguerite Moreau, Brady Smith, Andrea Frankle, Rob Mello', 'NR', 'With an honest job and a loving wife, Nick Brenner believed he had safely escaped his violent, criminal history. But his old crew hasn''t forgotten about him or the money he stole, and when they take what Nick now values the most - his wife - he has nothing left to lose. Confronted by the town sheriff, who is also his father-in-law, Nick must decide if he will stay on his new path or indulge in his need for revenge and force his enemies to pay for what they have done.', 'With an honest job and a loving wife, Nick Brenner believed he had safely escaped his violent, criminal history. But his old crew hasn''t forgotten about him or the money he stole, and when they take what Nick now values the most - his wife - he has nothing left to lose. Confronted by the town sheriff, who is also his father-in-law, Nick must decide if he will stay on his new path or indulge in his need for revenge and force his enemies to pay for what they have done.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xSTsGP8EUVk26L1khj6uOv2n3f9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:609189'),
  ('619185762183607081', 'Into the Badlands', 1991, 'Western, TV Movie, Horror', 'Sam Pillsbury, Johnny E. Jensen', null, 'Bruce Dern, Mariel Hemingway, Helen Hunt, Dylan McDermott, Lisa Pelikan, Andrew Robinson, Adan Sanchez, Jerry Gardner', null, 'A bounty hunter searches the west for a wanted outlaw named Red Roundtree.', 'A bounty hunter searches the west for a wanted outlaw named Red Roundtree.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/45tmCRnTCNFrUw9gdsph22EZNVL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:206157'),
  ('465303437699973154', 'Into the Beat', 2020, 'Drama, Romance', 'Stefan Westerwelle, Martin Schlecht', 'Stefan Westerwelle, Hannah Schweier', 'Alexandra Pfeifer, Yalany Marschner, Trystan Pütter, Katrin Pollitt, Helen Schneider, Geraldine Guy, Anton Wichers, Julius Nitschkoff', 'NR', 'Katya is a young, outstanding and upcoming ballet dancer. In just a few weeks she is due to have a major audition for the New York Ballet Academy and Katya has good chances of getting a scholarship. But when she meets a group of street-dancers the girl dives into a completely new world.', 'Katya is a young, outstanding and upcoming ballet dancer. In just a few weeks she is due to have a major audition for the New York Ballet Academy and Katya has good chances of getting a scholarship. But when she meets a group of street-dancers the girl dives into a completely new world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wHBGXcbZuEh6L4M0CjrmXsGBots.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:715978'),
  ('1109181722486750381', 'Into the Blue', 2005, 'Action, Thriller, Adventure, Crime', 'John Stockwell, Peter Zuccarini, Shane Hurlbut', 'Matt Johnson', 'Paul Walker, Jessica Alba, Scott Caan, Ashley Scott, Josh Brolin, James Frain, Dwayne Adway, Chris Taloa', 'PG-13', 'When they take some friends on an extreme sport adventure, the last thing Jared and Sam expect to see below the shark-infested waters is a legendary pirate ship rumored to contain millions of dollars in gold. But their good fortune is short-lived, as a ruthless gang of criminals gets word of what they have uncovered.', 'When they take some friends on an extreme sport adventure, the last thing Jared and Sam expect to see below the shark-infested waters is a legendary pirate ship rumored to contain millions of dollars in gold. But their good fortune is short-lived, as a ruthless gang of criminals gets word of what they have uncovered.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h5oXcjRu0EOiAxSxYuGq58897tu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11968'),
  ('966227111083314184', 'Into the Blue', 2012, 'Drama', 'Rudolf Thome, Bernadette Paaßen', 'Rudolf Thome', 'Vadim Glowna, Alice Dwyer, Esther Zimmering, Janina Rudenska, Henning Vogt, Stefan Rudolf, Elisabeth-Marie Leistikow, Bernd-Christian Althoff', null, 'A story of a filmmaking crew traveling in Italy.', 'A story of a filmmaking crew traveling in Italy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t3EpCqqiw9L0Nqw8hZGRG8AWSSz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:338334'),
  ('731683652612394692', 'Into the Blue 2: The Reef', 2009, 'Action, Adventure, Thriller', 'Stephen Herek, Thomas Yatsko, Louis Paul Tocchet', 'Mitchell Kapner', 'Chris Carmack, Laura Vandervoort, David Anders, Marsha Thomason, Mircea Monroe, Michael Graziadei, Mark Kubr, Audrina Patridge', 'NR', 'When they''re hired to recover the lost treasure of Columbus, married scuba divers Sebastian and Dani think they''ve hit the jackpot. But as they get closer to the fortune, the couple begins to suspect their employers have their own agenda. Hitting upon the real plan, the two come to the chilling realization that they may be expendable and that there''s much more than riches at stake.', 'When they''re hired to recover the lost treasure of Columbus, married scuba divers Sebastian and Dani think they''ve hit the jackpot. But as they get closer to the fortune, the couple begins to suspect their employers have their own agenda. Hitting upon the real plan, the two come to the chilling realization that they may be expendable and that there''s much more than riches at stake.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qLWOHSfrwWYrm7yic0ACFKGRLAq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16931'),
  ('168610581566839496', 'Into the Darkness', 2020, 'Drama, War, History', 'Anders Refn, Heine Kaarsberg', 'Flemming Quist Møller, Anders Refn', 'Jesper Christensen, Bodil Jørgensen, Mads Reuther, Gustav Dyekjær Giese, Sara Viktoria, Lue Støvelbæk, Sylvester Byder, Pernille Højmark', null, 'Karlskov is a self made, successful owner of a large electronics factory, has a wife and five children. They live the good, privileged upper-class life on Strandvejen north of Copenhagen when the Nazis occupy Denmark in April 1940. Karl struggles to continue production at the factory, but to protect his family and employees he reluctantly begins to produce for the German market. It brings him into a controversial collaboration with the occupying power and causes painful breaks in the family.', 'Karlskov is a self made, successful owner of a large electronics factory, has a wife and five children. They live the good, privileged upper-class life on Strandvejen north of Copenhagen when the Nazis occupy Denmark in April 1940. Karl struggles to continue production at the factory, but to protect his family and employees he reluctantly begins to produce for the German market. It brings him into a controversial collaboration with the occupying power and causes painful breaks in the family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1szNN4QorfoL9s9GKr4unE0av3X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:639514'),
  ('577225065574113487', 'Into the Deep', 2022, 'Thriller', 'Kate Cox, Ian Forbes', 'David Beton', 'Ella-Rae Smith, Jessica Alexander, Matthew Daddario, Nikkita Chadha, Jack Morris, Andrew Steele, Michael Workéyè', 'R', 'Follows a woman desperate to escape her town, she meets a stranger who promises a romantic escape, but it results in deceit, mistrust, and violence.', 'Follows a woman desperate to escape her town, she meets a stranger who promises a romantic escape, but it results in deceit, mistrust, and violence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bPyBqGBYjGzyLVHJEIsCwlZejk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:948333'),
  ('225515465646193592', 'Into the Deep', 2025, 'Horror, Action, Thriller', 'Christian Sesma, Niccolo De La Fere, Nicholas Ryan', 'Chad Law, Josh Ridgway', 'Scout Taylor-Compton, Richard Dreyfuss, Stuart Townsend, Jon Seda, AnnaMaria Demara, Tom O''Connell, Callum McGowan, Lorena Sarria', 'R', 'Divers searching for sunken treasure witness the murder of drug dealers by modern-day pirates, but a killer great white is determined not to let any of them escape its waters.', 'Divers searching for sunken treasure witness the murder of drug dealers by modern-day pirates, but a killer great white is determined not to let any of them escape its waters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qPvw21Y5pxojLQYDrK4ft5IYLlY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1388808'),
  ('763422569721211265', 'Into the Deep: The Submarine Murder Case', 2020, 'Documentary, Crime', 'Emma Sullivan, Lars Skree', null, 'Kim Wall, Peter Madsen', null, 'In 2016, a young Austrialian filmmaker began documenting amateur inventor Peter Madsen. One year in, Madsen brutally murdered Kim Wall aboard his homemade submarine. An unprecedented revelation of a killer and the journey his young helpers take as they reckon with their own complicity and prepare to testify.', 'In 2016, a young Austrialian filmmaker began documenting amateur inventor Peter Madsen. One year in, Madsen brutally murdered Kim Wall aboard his homemade submarine. An unprecedented revelation of a killer and the journey his young helpers take as they reckon with their own complicity and prepare to testify.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jdeKTPotIrwt4qSAr6rC7VAsPqs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:653588'),
  ('179855967270861825', 'Into the Faraway Sky', 2007, 'Drama, Adventure', 'Isao Yukisada, Hirofumi Kawaguchi, Jun Fukumoto', 'Isao Yukisada, Chihiro Ito', 'Ryunosuke Kamiki, Suzuka Ohgo, Yuma Sasano, Fumiyo Kohinata, Sawa Suzuki, Ayumi Ito, Keishi Nagatsuka, Tetsushi Tanaka', null, 'A vast wheat field, a straight road that has no end, a sky without a single building in sight – this is a town in the country where time comfortably passes by. But this former paradise is now being stirred up by a fight amongst its people over constructing an airport. This is a tale of three young people exploring youth and friendship as they reach out into the sky.', 'A vast wheat field, a straight road that has no end, a sky without a single building in sight – this is a town in the country where time comfortably passes by. But this former paradise is now being stirred up by a fight amongst its people over constructing an airport. This is a tale of three young people exploring youth and friendship as they reach out into the sky.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lENKFkJgxBtHII8OH7Pn0TUlSYO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19630'),
  ('159841120398459124', 'Into the Forest', 2016, 'Thriller', 'Gilles Marchand, Jeanne Lapoirie', 'Dominik Moll, Gilles Marchand', 'Jérémie Elkaïm, Timothé Vom Dorp, Théo Van de Voorde, Sophie Quinton, Mireille Perrier, Mika Zimmerman, Anna Åström, Frederik Carlsson', null, 'Tom (8) and Benjamin (11) travel to Stockholm to spend the summer with their father, whom they have barely seen since he divorced their mother. Tom, in particular, knows next to nothing about this strange, solitary man who seems never to sleep. When he suggests they spend a few days at his cabin in the country, the boys are delighted. But the cabin is totally isolated in the middle of a huge forest, a place both beautiful and troubling.', 'Tom (8) and Benjamin (11) travel to Stockholm to spend the summer with their father, whom they have barely seen since he divorced their mother. Tom, in particular, knows next to nothing about this strange, solitary man who seems never to sleep. When he suggests they spend a few days at his cabin in the country, the boys are delighted. But the cabin is totally isolated in the middle of a huge forest, a place both beautiful and troubling.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6HqrR0d79CeZVgwL9P6DtVcv253.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:406298'),
  ('1092692906632579526', 'Into the Grizzly Maze', 2015, 'Action, Horror, Thriller', 'David Hackl, John Lind, James Liston', 'Guy Moshe, J.R. Reher', 'James Marsden, Thomas Jane, Piper Perabo, Scott Glenn, Michaela McManus, Billy Bob Thornton, Adam Beach, Kelly Curran', 'R', 'Two estranged brothers reunite at their childhood home in the Alaskan wild. They set out on a two-day hike and are stalked by an unrelenting grizzly bear.', 'Two estranged brothers reunite at their childhood home in the Alaskan wild. They set out on a two-day hike and are stalked by an unrelenting grizzly bear.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i5GbFCeZ0fG5xb2ta6B3yNgzIM7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:244316'),
  ('516401773995432416', 'Into the Inferno', 2016, 'Documentary', 'Werner Herzog, Peter Zeitlinger', 'Werner Herzog', 'Werner Herzog, Clive Oppenheimer, Mael Moses, Sri Sumarti, Tim D. White, Kampiro Kayrento, Yonatan Sahle, Isaac Wan', null, 'With stunning views of eruptions and lava flows, Werner Herzog captures the raw power of volcanoes and their ties to indigenous spiritual practices.', 'With stunning views of eruptions and lava flows, Werner Herzog captures the raw power of volcanoes and their ties to indigenous spiritual practices.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tQaRaolI7rYrDvlWCSqXxm1YTJP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:360029'),
  ('60040452131928040', 'Into the Labyrinth', 2019, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Federico Masiero, Luigi Spoletini, Alessandra Fortuna', 'Donato Carrisi', 'Toni Servillo, Dustin Hoffman, Valentina Bellè, Vinicio Marchioni, Riccardo Cicogna, Caterina Shulha, Orlando Cinque, Filippo Dini', null, 'When a kidnapping victim turns up alive after fifteen years, a profiler and a private investigator try to piece together the mystery.', 'When a kidnapping victim turns up alive after fifteen years, a profiler and a private investigator try to piece together the mystery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tWcN7ZjeOBzuwNtx7viKb1w2UOj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:602545'),
  ('35708346492465980', 'Into the Mirror', 2003, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Kim Sung-ho, Yeom Hyo-sang', 'Kim Sung-ho', 'Yoo Ji-tae, Kim Myung-min, Kim Hye-na, Kim Myoeng-su, Ki Joo-bong, Rie Young-zin, Jung Eun-pyo, Oh Jung-se', null, 'Woo Yeong-min retired from the police force after trying to save his partner and causing his death. After a series of mysterious deaths in the shopping mall in which his uncle has allowed him to work as a security guard prior to its reopening, he must face both his own fear of mirrors and the mystery surrounding the fire that closed down the mall.', 'Woo Yeong-min retired from the police force after trying to save his partner and causing his death. After a series of mysterious deaths in the shopping mall in which his uncle has allowed him to work as a security guard prior to its reopening, he must face both his own fear of mirrors and the mystery surrounding the fire that closed down the mall.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9UhqqdaAkbMuRq9oFUFPszOT2io.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27316'),
  ('873204288703840307', 'Into The Mortal World', 2024, 'Animation, Fantasy', 'Zhong Ding, Xie Cilin, Kaiyuan Wang', 'Zhong Ding', 'Li Xin, Liu Xiaoyu, Xing Chao, Liu Cong, Sun Lulu, Shuai Guan, Tom Fu', null, 'The classic legend is adapted, and the descendants of the Cowherd and the Weaving Maiden continue to write a new adventure! The twenty-eight star constellations contain the power of the stars, which can destroy the sky and the earth. However, the Weaving Maiden, who is in charge of the Starry Nights, is greedy for the mortal world, causing the Starry Nights to flee and causing trouble. Years later, the Weaving Maiden''s son, Jin Feng, went down to the world for his mother, and teamed up with a young girl, Xiaofan, to subdue the Starry Nights. People and gods together, all the way to the thrills and dangers, the mystery of Xiaofan''s life, the truth of the Weaving Maiden''s crime also gradually surfaced .....', 'The classic legend is adapted, and the descendants of the Cowherd and the Weaving Maiden continue to write a new adventure! The twenty-eight star constellations contain the power of the stars, which can destroy the sky and the earth. However, the Weaving Maiden, who is in charge of the Starry Nights, is greedy for the mortal world, causing the Starry Nights to flee and causing trouble. Years later, the Weaving Maiden''s son, Jin Feng, went down to the world for his mother, and teamed up with a young girl, Xiaofan, to subdue the Starry Nights. People and gods together, all the way to the thrills and dangers, the mystery of Xiaofan''s life, the truth of the Weaving Maiden''s crime also gradually surfaced .....', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tPNTd2AAUcuQk4LdoXxM9nKoVAJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1303336'),
  ('212321529026216192', 'Into the Mud', 2016, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Pablo S. Pastor, Pelayo Sánchez, Alejo Malia', 'Pablo S. Pastor, Almudena Sarría', 'María Forqué, Ramón G. del Pomar', null, 'A young woman wakes up naked in the middle of the woods. After the initial confusion and after verifying that she''s hurt, she discovers a fisherman and hunter who will not easily let his new prey escape. Let the hunt begin.', 'A young woman wakes up naked in the middle of the woods. After the initial confusion and after verifying that she''s hurt, she discovers a fisherman and hunter who will not easily let his new prey escape. Let the hunt begin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bMDPIGasSYkfaGck2iCrPVFmvZ1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:484079'),
  ('544939971191483464', 'Into the Night', 1985, 'Thriller, Comedy, Action, Crime, Drama, Romance', 'John Landis, Robert Paynter, Henry Larrecq', 'Ron Koslow', 'Jeff Goldblum, Michelle Pfeiffer, Dan Aykroyd, Carmen Argenziano, Stacey Pickren, Paul Mazursky, Kathryn Harrold, Bruce McGill', 'R', 'Ed Okin used to have a boring life. He used to have trouble getting to sleep. Then one night, he met Diana. Now, Ed''s having trouble staying alive.', 'Ed Okin used to have a boring life. He used to have trouble getting to sleep. Then one night, he met Diana. Now, Ed''s having trouble staying alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/voqfHibbZVtl9o6D2MRcdQmN42i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11338'),
  ('396453450148840422', 'Into the Storm', 2009, 'Drama, History, TV Movie', 'Thaddeus O''Sullivan, Michael Elliott, Michel Amathieu', 'Hugh Whitemore', 'Brendan Gleeson, Adrian Scarborough, Iain Glen, James D''Arcy, Janet McTeer, Robert Pugh, Len Cariou, Patrick Malahide', 'PG', 'This powerful follow-up to “The Gathering Storm” follows Churchill from 1940 to 1945 as he guided his beleaguered nation through the crucible of the war years--even as his marriage was encountering its own struggles.', 'This powerful follow-up to “The Gathering Storm” follows Churchill from 1940 to 1945 as he guided his beleaguered nation through the crucible of the war years--even as his marriage was encountering its own struggles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/icIs3OmlazNg6LpfJmGGlw5VTiy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36465'),
  ('83885835120117987', 'Into the Storm', 2014, 'Action, Thriller', 'Steven Quale, Brian Pearson, Vanessa Cheung', 'John Swetnam', 'Richard Armitage, Sarah Wayne Callies, Matt Walsh, Max Deacon, Alycia Debnam-Carey, Nathan Kress, Arlen Escarpeta, Jeremy Sumpter', 'PG-13', 'As a new day begins in the town of Silverton, its residents have little reason to believe it will be anything other than ordinary. Mother Nature, however has other plans. In the span of just a few hours, an unprecedented onslaught of powerful tornadoes ravages Silverton. Storm trackers predict that the worst is still to come, as terrified residents seek shelter, and professional storm-chasers run toward the danger, hoping to study the phenomenon close up and get a once-in-a-lifetime shot.', 'As a new day begins in the town of Silverton, its residents have little reason to believe it will be anything other than ordinary. Mother Nature, however has other plans. In the span of just a few hours, an unprecedented onslaught of powerful tornadoes ravages Silverton. Storm trackers predict that the worst is still to come, as terrified residents seek shelter, and professional storm-chasers run toward the danger, hoping to study the phenomenon close up and get a once-in-a-lifetime shot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kBgrhrES9kMKSPxawUYV61KjlnB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:216282'),
  ('128329820239579158', 'Into the Sun', 1992, 'War, Action', 'Fritz Kiersch, Steve Grass', 'Michael Ferris, John Brancato', 'Michael Paré, Anthony Michael Hall, Deborah Moore, Terry Kiser, Brian Haley, Michael St. Gerard, Linden Ashby, Melissa Moore', null, 'Paul Watkins is an American pilot stationed in the Middle East, who is taken away from his normal duties of protecting the skies to show an actor everything he needs to know about being a pilot in the Air Force. The actor, Tom Slade, is about to start filming an Air Force movie and wants to "get the feeling" for the part. When Watkins takes Slade for a ride in an F-16 fighter, some other American jets are attacked and the pair comes to the rescue. However, it does not go according to the plan.', 'Paul Watkins is an American pilot stationed in the Middle East, who is taken away from his normal duties of protecting the skies to show an actor everything he needs to know about being a pilot in the Air Force. The actor, Tom Slade, is about to start filming an Air Force movie and wants to "get the feeling" for the part. When Watkins takes Slade for a ride in an F-16 fighter, some other American jets are attacked and the pair comes to the rescue. However, it does not go according to the plan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1cm2yTDrT4fEgZPcn2gZtCpVa2k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:209369'),
  ('1097111250451341751', 'Into the Sun', 2005, 'Action, Adventure, Thriller', 'mink, Don E. FauntLeRoy', 'Joe Halpin, Trevor Miller, Steven Seagal', 'Steven Seagal, Matthew Davis, Takao Osawa, Namihiko Ohmura, Daisuke Honda, Ken Lo Wai-Kwong, Kanako Yamaguchi, William Atherton', 'R', 'After the assassination of Tokyo''s Governor by Yakuza members, the CIA bureau chief for Tokyo puts out a call to an agent that had been raised in Japan and trained by ex-Yakuza. Using his former ties, he quickly determines that a war is brewing between old-guard Yakuza members and a young, crazed leader with ties to the Chinese Tong.', 'After the assassination of Tokyo''s Governor by Yakuza members, the CIA bureau chief for Tokyo puts out a call to an agent that had been raised in Japan and trained by ex-Yakuza. Using his former ties, he quickly determines that a war is brewing between old-guard Yakuza members and a young, crazed leader with ties to the Chinese Tong.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rrfGzNwsIycS8uQZ9eb0iJhPbgs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24546'),
  ('993388998391046166', 'Into the West', 1992, 'Adventure, Drama, Family, Fantasy, Western', 'Mike Newell, Newton Thomas Sigel', 'Jim Sheridan', 'Gabriel Byrne, Ellen Barkin, Ciarán Fitzgerald, Rúaidhrí Conroy, David Kelly, Johnny Murphy, Colm Meaney, John Kavanagh', null, 'Accused of a crime they didn''t commit, two city kids and a magical horse are about to become the coolest outlaws ever to ride Into The West.', 'Accused of a crime they didn''t commit, two city kids and a magical horse are about to become the coolest outlaws ever to ride Into The West.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k9e63dUNxu5MtXCCB3trUXtXX58.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33221'),
  ('48166040846774145', 'Into the White', 2012, 'War, Action, Drama', 'Petter Næss, Daniel Voldheim', 'Ole Meldgaard, Petter Næss, Dave Mango', 'Stig Henrik Hoff, Lachlan Nieboer, Rupert Grint, Florian Lukas, David Kross, Kim Haugen, Knut Joner, Morten Faldaas', 'R', 'During World War II, enemy fighter pilots find themselves face to face after shooting down one another''s planes over a desolate landscape. In order to survive, they must set aside the rules of war.', 'During World War II, enemy fighter pilots find themselves face to face after shooting down one another''s planes over a desolate landscape. In order to survive, they must set aside the rules of war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bk9RD0kH51GoDURk7xgWDoTcRl7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78215'),
  ('425447597084476656', 'Into the White Night', 2011, 'Drama, Crime', 'Yoshihiro Fukagawa', null, 'Maki Horikita, Kengo Kora, Tetsushi Tanaka, Keiko Toda, Yurie Midori, Nobuo Kyô, Urara Awata, Yuki Imai', null, 'A pawn shop owner in Osaka is murdered, but due to a lack of conclusive evidence the police lists the man''s death as a suicide. Detective Sasagaki, who investigated the case, can''t forget the dark eyes of the main suspect''s daughter Yukiho and the pawn shop owner''s son Ryouji. As time goes by, more mysterious deaths surround Yukiho & Ryouji. Detective Sasagaki still unable to let go of the pawn shop owner case discovers startling details about Yukiho and Ryouji ...', 'A pawn shop owner in Osaka is murdered, but due to a lack of conclusive evidence the police lists the man''s death as a suicide. Detective Sasagaki, who investigated the case, can''t forget the dark eyes of the main suspect''s daughter Yukiho and the pawn shop owner''s son Ryouji. As time goes by, more mysterious deaths surround Yukiho & Ryouji. Detective Sasagaki still unable to let go of the pawn shop owner case discovers startling details about Yukiho and Ryouji ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y7U3wCHChO7LIJ3PG7P7O0mWYpY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:138185'),
  ('585375712201792436', 'Into the Wild', 2007, 'Adventure, Drama', 'Sean Penn, Éric Gautier, John R. Saunders', 'Sean Penn', 'Emile Hirsch, Marcia Gay Harden, William Hurt, Jena Malone, Brian H. Dierker, Catherine Keener, Vince Vaughn, Kristen Stewart', 'R', 'After graduating from Emory University in 1992, top student and athlete Christopher McCandless abandons his possessions, gives his entire $24,000 savings account to charity, and hitchhikes to Alaska to live in the wilderness.', 'After graduating from Emory University in 1992, top student and athlete Christopher McCandless abandons his possessions, gives his entire $24,000 savings account to charity, and hitchhikes to Alaska to live in the wilderness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jnLnLYP5pGDfri04gxtAqAvkHMw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5915'),
  ('317757828789919777', 'Into the Wind', 2022, 'Drama, Romance', 'Michał Pukowiec, Tamara Allina, Jonas Lindfors', 'Julian Kijowski', 'Sonia Mietielica, Jakub Sasak, Waleria Gorobets, Sebastian Dela, Agnieszka Żulewska, Marcin Perchuć, Sonia Bohosiewicz, Grzegorz Małecki', null, 'She graduated from a prestigious high school in Warsaw and entered medicine in London. He works as a kitesurfing instructor at the seaside, thanks to which he combines earning money and passion. They will meet in Hel. The unusual charm of the boy makes the girl exceed her limits and enter a completely unknown world of kitesurfing, music and fun. The feeling that arises between them does not please her family or his friends. Is Ania and Michal''s relationship strong enough to overcome adversities and become more than just a holiday love?', 'She graduated from a prestigious high school in Warsaw and entered medicine in London. He works as a kitesurfing instructor at the seaside, thanks to which he combines earning money and passion. They will meet in Hel. The unusual charm of the boy makes the girl exceed her limits and enter a completely unknown world of kitesurfing, music and fun. The feeling that arises between them does not please her family or his friends. Is Ania and Michal''s relationship strong enough to overcome adversities and become more than just a holiday love?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/867QI9NTJIhe0kQJ0bcnutXjpK5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:933547'),
  ('407932521936640195', 'Into the Wonderwoods', 2024, 'Animation, Adventure, Family', 'Vincent Paronnaud, Alexis Ducord', 'Vincent Paronnaud, Alexis Ducord, Sébastien Dupouey', 'Yolande Moreau, Philippe Katerine, José Garcia, Dario Hardouin Spurio, Prune Bozo, Raphaël Lamarque, Marie Nonnenmacher, Benjamin Carlier', null, 'Angelo is a ten-year-old who dreams of becoming an explorer and a zoologist. When he goes to visit his granny, his parents leave him behind at a rest stop, and he decides to cut through the forest in search of them.', 'Angelo is a ten-year-old who dreams of becoming an explorer and a zoologist. When he goes to visit his granny, his parents leave him behind at a rest stop, and he decides to cut through the forest in search of them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rT5cAazPUmB22cR1LjYRO5Bdrjn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:999160'),
  ('535268832293946275', 'Into the Woods', 1991, 'Drama, Music, Fantasy, TV Movie', 'Paul Gemignani, James Lapine, James Lapine', 'James Lapine, Stephen Sondheim', 'Bernadette Peters, Chip Zien, Joanna Gleason, Tom Aldredge, Robert Westenberg, Kim Crosby, Danielle Ferland, Ben Wright', 'NR', 'In a woods filled with magic and fairy tale characters, a baker and his wife set out to end the curse put on them by their neighbor, a spiteful witch.', 'In a woods filled with magic and fairy tale characters, a baker and his wife set out to end the curse put on them by their neighbor, a spiteful witch.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8KI9Blf9VDBdWSqkEVhvZ0RPehq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23378'),
  ('333260495111420140', 'Into the Woods', 2014, 'Fantasy, Comedy', 'Rob Marshall, Dion Beebe, Chris Lowe', 'James Lapine', 'Anna Kendrick, Meryl Streep, Lilla Crawford, James Corden, Emily Blunt, Johnny Depp, Daniel Huttlestone, Chris Pine', 'PG', 'In a woods filled with magic and fairy tale characters, a baker and his wife set out to end the curse put on them by their neighbor, a spiteful witch.', 'In a woods filled with magic and fairy tale characters, a baker and his wife set out to end the curse put on them by their neighbor, a spiteful witch.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6bZC6KGfCwTMmwXmrLJQhxuRjlT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:224141'),
  ('638709462614001690', 'Into the World', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Marion Laine, Brice Pancot', 'Marion Laine', 'Sandrine Bonnaire, Aure Atika, Brigitte Roüan, Kenza Fortas, Sarah Stern, Alice Botté, Lucie Fagedet, Nadège Beausson-Diagne', null, 'Jeanne works as an auxiliary in a maternity in Marseilles. Day and night, Jeanne and her colleagues fight to help mothers and their babies against the lack of staff and constant management pressure. Jeanne lives with her 18 year-old daughter, Zoé. When a tragedy occurs at the maternity and Zoé leaves to study in Paris, Jeanne’s secret past suddenly resurfaces and forces her to assert her life choices.', 'Jeanne works as an auxiliary in a maternity in Marseilles. Day and night, Jeanne and her colleagues fight to help mothers and their babies against the lack of staff and constant management pressure. Jeanne lives with her 18 year-old daughter, Zoé. When a tragedy occurs at the maternity and Zoé leaves to study in Paris, Jeanne’s secret past suddenly resurfaces and forces her to assert her life choices.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9QAgWmP2KcJGt3B46GQbt7MwEbI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:653775'),
  ('692730928486246880', 'Into Thin Air: Death on Everest', 1997, 'Adventure, Action, Drama', 'Robert Markowitz, Neil Roach, Carl Lawrence Ludwig', 'Robert J. Avrech', 'Peter Horton, Nathaniel Parker, Richard Jenkins, Christopher McDonald, Tim Dutton, Pamela Gien, Peter J. Lucas, Long Nguyen', null, 'An adaptation of Jon Krakauer''s best selling book, "Into Thin Air: A Personal Account of the Mt. Everest Disaster". This movie attempts to re-create the disastrous events that took place during the Mount Everest climb on May 10, 1996. It also follows Jon Krakauer throughout the movie, and portrays what he was going through while climbing this mountain.', 'An adaptation of Jon Krakauer''s best selling book, "Into Thin Air: A Personal Account of the Mt. Everest Disaster". This movie attempts to re-create the disastrous events that took place during the Mount Everest climb on May 10, 1996. It also follows Jon Krakauer throughout the movie, and portrays what he was going through while climbing this mountain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1lfzyHi7dnBRPYX9Hv7LzYFrlK3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32648'),
  ('445870015669282015', 'Into Your Dance', 1935, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Friz Freleng', null, 'Joe Dougherty', null, 'The showboat comes to town, piloted by Captain Benny. A quartet sings "Go Into Your Dance" in honor of its originator, Al Jolson. They introduce the conductor, who is a pig caricature of orchestra leader Paul Whiteman. One of the musicians plugs the pig''s tail into a light socket so he conducts at super speed. Then Captain Benny announces the start of the amateur hour, with an operatic cow and a tough guy reciting poetry with sound effects.', 'The showboat comes to town, piloted by Captain Benny. A quartet sings "Go Into Your Dance" in honor of its originator, Al Jolson. They introduce the conductor, who is a pig caricature of orchestra leader Paul Whiteman. One of the musicians plugs the pig''s tail into a light socket so he conducts at super speed. Then Captain Benny announces the start of the amateur hour, with an operatic cow and a tough guy reciting poetry with sound effects.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jYuujh2mL5c2edYY5CMBwxDa09E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:184551'),
  ('5271175301899175', 'Intolerable Cruelty', 2003, 'Comedy, Romance, Crime', 'Joel Coen, Roger Deakins', 'Robert Ramsey, Matthew Stone, Joel Coen', 'George Clooney, Catherine Zeta-Jones, Geoffrey Rush, Cedric the Entertainer, Edward Herrmann, Paul Adelstein, Richard Jenkins, Billy Bob Thornton', 'PG-13', 'A revenge-seeking gold digger marries a womanizing Beverly Hills lawyer with the intention of making a killing in the divorce.', 'A revenge-seeking gold digger marries a womanizing Beverly Hills lawyer with the intention of making a killing in the divorce.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7K8hDwOWsZv0MluyrB8nWlhJOgB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11775'),
  ('494901018976773691', 'Intolerance', 2021, 'Drama', 'Keisuke Yoshida, Takayuki Shida, Daika Matsukura', 'Keisuke Yoshida', 'Arata Furuta, Tori Matsuzaka, Tomoko Tabata, Kisetsu Fujiwara, Shuri, Aoi Ito, Reiko Kataoka, Shinobu Terajima', null, 'A teenage girl''s accidental death incites a media frenzy and causes her harsh father to turn his rage against those he believes are responsible.', 'A teenage girl''s accidental death incites a media frenzy and causes her harsh father to turn his rage against those he believes are responsible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/IUeriwxPpr6NPKbVpX5siEYe9R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:826702'),
  ('330044606620540530', 'Intolerance: Love''s Struggle Throughout the Ages', 1916, 'Drama, History', 'Billy Bitzer, D.W. Griffith, Jack Conway', 'Anita Loos, D.W. Griffith, Frank E. Woods', 'Lillian Gish, Mae Marsh, Robert Harron, F.A. Turner, Sam De Grasse, Vera Lewis, Lillian Langdon, Olga Grey', 'NR', 'The story of a poor young woman, separated by prejudice from her husband and baby, is interwoven with tales of intolerance from throughout history.', 'The story of a poor young woman, separated by prejudice from her husband and baby, is interwoven with tales of intolerance from throughout history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lJCabs4TMOsKfnl0BmA5Hf16Ezb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3059'),
  ('683269707599565695', 'Intoxication', 2002, 'Documentary, Drama', 'Gaspar Noé, Gaspar Noé', 'Gaspar Noé', 'Stéphane Drouot', null, 'Short documentary by Gaspar Noé filmed around the the same time as Irréversible (in 16mm Scope), in which his friend Stéphane Drouot, the director of the cult film "La Banlieue des Étoiles / Star Suburb", discusses his life with AIDS and struggles to make films.', 'Short documentary by Gaspar Noé filmed around the the same time as Irréversible (in 16mm Scope), in which his friend Stéphane Drouot, the director of the cult film "La Banlieue des Étoiles / Star Suburb", discusses his life with AIDS and struggles to make films.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/plfvGqiUg09KiCgLKYyb2W78y3c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:185815'),
  ('494333022563174119', 'Întregalde', 2021, 'Drama, Comedy, Thriller', 'Radu Muntean, Tudor Vladimir Panduru', 'Alexandru Baciu, Radu Muntean, Răzvan Rădulescu', 'Maria Popistașu, Ilona Brezoianu, Alexandru Bogdan, Luca Sabin, Toma Cuzin, Radu Muntean', null, 'The suspense story follows three humanitarians whose mission in a remote village called Întregalde, in the Apuseni Mountains, in a remote area of Transylvania to offer the inhabitants various goods. Apart from a few quarrels and conflicts between the group members, everything seems to be going well for Maria and Dan. But soon after they stumble upon a disoriented local and try to help him, things go wrong.', 'The suspense story follows three humanitarians whose mission in a remote village called Întregalde, in the Apuseni Mountains, in a remote area of Transylvania to offer the inhabitants various goods. Apart from a few quarrels and conflicts between the group members, everything seems to be going well for Maria and Dan. But soon after they stumble upon a disoriented local and try to help him, things go wrong.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eCzi76IWzvoxpieTT8QSuHfzJid.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:838150'),
  ('1092354689983227177', 'Intrepido: A Lonely Hero', 2013, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Gianni Amelio, Luca Bigazzi', 'Gianni Amelio, Davide Lantieri', 'Antonio Albanese, Livia Rossi, Gabriele Rendina, Alfonso Santagata, Sandra Ceccarelli, Xu Wei-you, Giuseppe Antignati, Nicola Specchio', null, 'A meek middle-aged man takes on every conceivable temporary job in order to feel useful and keep his dignity—until something shakes his inexhaustible optimism.', 'A meek middle-aged man takes on every conceivable temporary job in order to feel useful and keep his dignity—until something shakes his inexhaustible optimism.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e9kVv9gSTtgtzxWkVBoVI8Y1z5r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:209413'),
  ('474676579840403307', 'Intrépidos Punks', 1988, 'Crime, Action', 'Francisco Guerrero, Alfredo Uribe', 'Roberto Marroquín', 'Juan Valentín, Juan Gallardo, Ana Luisa Peluffo, Princesa Lea, Martha Elena Cervantes, Alfredo Gutiérrez ''El Turco'', Guillermo Lagunes, Olga Ríos', null, 'After Fiera and her punk cohorts break their leader Tarzan out of prison, no one is safe! The newly reunited gang are quick to resume their favorite pastimes: robbing banks, brokering drug deals, and securing weapons, all while leaving a trail of mutilated corpses in their wake. As the entire countryside becomes caught up in the punk’s lifestyle of debauchery and violence, it''s up to federal agents Javier and Marco to track them down before bloodthirsty anarchy becomes the new way of life.', 'After Fiera and her punk cohorts break their leader Tarzan out of prison, no one is safe! The newly reunited gang are quick to resume their favorite pastimes: robbing banks, brokering drug deals, and securing weapons, all while leaving a trail of mutilated corpses in their wake. As the entire countryside becomes caught up in the punk’s lifestyle of debauchery and violence, it''s up to federal agents Javier and Marco to track them down before bloodthirsty anarchy becomes the new way of life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tAbBGg8gvkbGoOsbLwfPgOEk28r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103604'),
  ('1127013274188202329', 'Intrigo: Death of an Author', 2018, 'Mystery, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Paweł Edelman, Daniel Alfredson', 'Daniel Alfredson, Birgitta Bongenhielm', 'Benno Fürmann, Ben Kingsley, Tuva Novotny, Veronica Ferres, Michael Byrne, Daniela Lavender, Erik Johansson, Elizabeth Counsell', null, 'A young author comes into possession of a manuscript sent by critically acclaimed writer, Germund Rein, shortly before he commits suicide.', 'A young author comes into possession of a manuscript sent by critically acclaimed writer, Germund Rein, shortly before he commits suicide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/thrTXCqSkWx94wQsjj7v7mWKz3Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:482564'),
  ('873871323952503970', 'Introducing Chucky: The Making of Child''s Play', 1988, 'Documentary', 'Greg Grosz', 'Gary J. Prebula', 'Tom Holland, David Kirschner, Chris Sarandon, Kevin Yagher, Alex Vincent, Catherine Hicks, Brad Dourif, Ray Oliver', null, 'A vintage featurette about the making of Child''s Play (1988).', 'A vintage featurette about the making of Child''s Play (1988).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mRTnim0xPxYiH0LWi2O59Lqk2Gd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:706545'),
  ('705964014857088508', 'Introducing Dorothy Dandridge', 1999, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Martha Coolidge, Robbie Greenberg, Phil Robinson', null, 'Halle Berry, Brent Spiner, Klaus Maria Brandauer, Obba Babatundé, Loretta Devine, Cynda Williams, LaTanya Richardson Jackson, Tamara Taylor', 'PG-13', 'An acclaimed stage performer, Dorothy still struggled with the challenge of her color, in a time that wouldn''t let some stars in by the front door. Yet against the odds she beat out many more famous rivals for the role of "Carmen Jones", becoming the first black woman ever nominated for a Best Actress Academy Award. Marriages and affairs would break her heart, but her heart was strong. Seductive and easily seduced, she was born to be a star - with all the glory and all the pain of being loved, abused, cheated, glorified, undermined and undefeated. Here was a woman who wouldn''t wait in the wings. Halle Berry stars as Dorothy Dandrige.', 'An acclaimed stage performer, Dorothy still struggled with the challenge of her color, in a time that wouldn''t let some stars in by the front door. Yet against the odds she beat out many more famous rivals for the role of "Carmen Jones", becoming the first black woman ever nominated for a Best Actress Academy Award. Marriages and affairs would break her heart, but her heart was strong. Seductive and easily seduced, she was born to be a star - with all the glory and all the pain of being loved, abused, cheated, glorified, undermined and undefeated. Here was a woman who wouldn''t wait in the wings. Halle Berry stars as Dorothy Dandrige.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4y5HWByhvOrxzPZpxvwahpeAGZA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54982'),
  ('148359129209296636', 'Introduction', 2021, 'Drama', 'Hong Sang-soo, Hong Sang-soo', 'Hong Sang-soo', 'Shin Seok-ho, Park Mi-so, Kim Young-ho, Ye Ji-won, Ki Joo-bong, Seo Young-hwa, Kim Min-hee, Cho Yun-hee', null, 'Youngho is summoned by his father, who is a doctor. Finding him busy with his patients, one of whom is a famous actor, Youngho has to wait. When his girlfriend Juwon moves to Berlin for her studies, Youngho shows up in the city to surprise her. Through her mother, Juwon has found accommodation at the home of an artist whose beauty intimidates her. Some time later, Youngho goes to lunch with his mother who wants to introduce him to a colleague – it is the same man Youngho met at his father’s clinic. Youngho asks his friend Jeongsoo to accompany him, and after lunch they go to the beach. Youngho falls asleep, and dreams of Juwon. When he wakes up, he braves the considerable cold and goes swimming, while Jeongsoo watches.', 'Youngho is summoned by his father, who is a doctor. Finding him busy with his patients, one of whom is a famous actor, Youngho has to wait. When his girlfriend Juwon moves to Berlin for her studies, Youngho shows up in the city to surprise her. Through her mother, Juwon has found accommodation at the home of an artist whose beauty intimidates her. Some time later, Youngho goes to lunch with his mother who wants to introduce him to a colleague – it is the same man Youngho met at his father’s clinic. Youngho asks his friend Jeongsoo to accompany him, and after lunch they go to the beach. Youngho falls asleep, and dreams of Juwon. When he wakes up, he braves the considerable cold and goes swimming, while Jeongsoo watches.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a9aTkREV7ZbwMzgHaknjqWZUtUG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:795797'),
  ('553518595083144176', 'Intruder', 1989, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Scott Spiegel, Fernando Argüelles, Anthony Hall', 'Lawrence Bender', 'Elizabeth Cox, Renée Estevez, Dan Hicks, David Byrnes, Sam Raimi, Eugene Robert Glazer, Billy Marti, Burr Steers', 'R', 'The overnight stock crew of a local supermarket find themselves being stalked and slashed by a mysterious maniac.', 'The overnight stock crew of a local supermarket find themselves being stalked and slashed by a mysterious maniac.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pib25gFtNCShcyRpFvp1jrcJ1Xk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31150'),
  ('1046009168804850372', 'Intruder', 1997, 'Horror, Crime', 'Tsang Kan-Cheong, Cheng Siu-Keung, Albert Mak Kai-Kwong', 'Tsang Kan-Cheong', 'Jacklyn Wu Chien-Lien, Wayne Lai Yiu-Cheung, Moses Chan Ho, Bonnie Wong Man-Wai, Yuen Bun, Yuki Lai Yuen-Tung, Lam Suet, Hung Wai-Leung', null, 'A mainland Chinese girl is, with her husband, a wanted criminal and they have to get to Hong Kong in order to stay alive and be free.', 'A mainland Chinese girl is, with her husband, a wanted criminal and they have to get to Hong Kong in order to stay alive and be free.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vRmUIxAsd1AJIqUBYWThurPZEGT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:220655'),
  ('504659429515485061', 'Intruder', 2020, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Sohn Won-pyung, Baek Yoon-seuk, Lee Jun-il', 'Sohn Won-pyung', 'Kim Moo-yul, Song Ji-hyo, Ye Su-jeong, Heo Joon-seok, Lee Hae-woon, Han Hye-ji, Kim Seung-bee, Yang Mal-bok', null, 'Seo-jin is a widower still grieving his wife''s death. Then he receives the news that his long-lost younger sister, Yoo-jin, who went missing 25 years ago, has turned up. Unlike the rest of his family, who welcome her into their arms, Seo-jin feels that Yoo-jin is a stranger.', 'Seo-jin is a widower still grieving his wife''s death. Then he receives the news that his long-lost younger sister, Yoo-jin, who went missing 25 years ago, has turned up. Unlike the rest of his family, who welcome her into their arms, Seo-jin feels that Yoo-jin is a stranger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6RafKT94L6pFatwbWBTkV0zEaWm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:602291'),
  ('161907663106080935', 'Intruder in the Dust', 1949, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', 'Clarence Brown, Robert Surtees, Carl Roup', 'Ben Maddow', 'David Brian, Claude Jarman Jr., Juano Hernández, Porter Hall, Elizabeth Patterson, Charles Kemper, Will Geer, David Clarke', 'NR', 'Rural Mississippi in the 1940s: Lucas Beauchamp, a local black man with a reputation of not kowtowing to whites, is found standing over the body of a dead white man, holding a pistol that has recently been fired. Quickly arrested for murder and jailed, Beauchamp insists he''s innocent and asks the town''s most prominent lawyer, Gavin Stevens, to defend him, but Stevens refuses. When a local boy whom Beauchamp has helped in the past and who believes him to be innocent hears talk of a mob taking Beauchamp out of jail and lynching him, he pleads with Stevens to defend Beauchamp at trial and prove his innocence.', 'Rural Mississippi in the 1940s: Lucas Beauchamp, a local black man with a reputation of not kowtowing to whites, is found standing over the body of a dead white man, holding a pistol that has recently been fired. Quickly arrested for murder and jailed, Beauchamp insists he''s innocent and asks the town''s most prominent lawyer, Gavin Stevens, to defend him, but Stevens refuses. When a local boy whom Beauchamp has helped in the past and who believes him to be innocent hears talk of a mob taking Beauchamp out of jail and lynching him, he pleads with Stevens to defend Beauchamp at trial and prove his innocence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/upQaoMXJhglvPhsYXEDatTLiBXy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80572'),
  ('178737811911472961', 'Intruders', 2011, 'Thriller, Horror, Fantasy', 'Juan Carlos Fresnadillo, Enrique Chediak', 'Jaime Marques, Nicolás Casariego Córdoba', 'Clive Owen, Carice van Houten, Ella Purnell, Adrian Rawlins, Daniel Brühl, Ella Hunt, Kerry Fox, Pilar López de Ayala', 'R', 'Though no one can see him, Hollow Face lurks in the corners, desperately desiring love but only knowing how to spread fear and hate. He creeps into the life of John Farrow after Farrow’s beloved 13-year-old daughter Mia is assaulted in their home. The line between the real and the imaginary blurs as fissures start to open within the family unit. It seems that no security measure can keep Hollow Face out.', 'Though no one can see him, Hollow Face lurks in the corners, desperately desiring love but only knowing how to spread fear and hate. He creeps into the life of John Farrow after Farrow’s beloved 13-year-old daughter Mia is assaulted in their home. The line between the real and the imaginary blurs as fissures start to open within the family unit. It seems that no security measure can keep Hollow Face out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/erGjRCwzKOGHxJ32fR5ObGYtBBK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63207'),
  ('310939672519464455', 'Intruders', 2013, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Noh Young-seok', 'Noh Young-seok', 'Jun Suk-ho, Oh Tae-kyung, Choi Moo-seong, Han Eun-seon', null, 'In the dead of winter, a screenwriter travels to his friend''s closed cabin resort in the mountain with the intention of working on his script. Instead of being alone, he finds himself in the company of annoying strangers, from intrusive townsfolk who welcome themselves in to vacationing skiers who won''t take no for an answer. On top of that, mysterious sounds at night hint of something sinister in the woods. He realizes that he may have opened the door to a killer when dead bodies begin to turn up. Five years after his acclaimed debut Daytime Drinking, indie director Noh Young Seok returns with his second indie feature Intruders, applying dark comedy and satire to an unsettling cabin-in-the-woods suspense thriller.', 'In the dead of winter, a screenwriter travels to his friend''s closed cabin resort in the mountain with the intention of working on his script. Instead of being alone, he finds himself in the company of annoying strangers, from intrusive townsfolk who welcome themselves in to vacationing skiers who won''t take no for an answer. On top of that, mysterious sounds at night hint of something sinister in the woods. He realizes that he may have opened the door to a killer when dead bodies begin to turn up. Five years after his acclaimed debut Daytime Drinking, indie director Noh Young Seok returns with his second indie feature Intruders, applying dark comedy and satire to an unsettling cabin-in-the-woods suspense thriller.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zwrdWMORjb0Ntv5Dy2V0hNQetbC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:215040'),
  ('871306537825968745', 'Intruders', 2015, 'Drama, Thriller, Horror', 'Adam Schindler, Eric Leach', 'T.J. Cimfel, David White', 'Beth Riesgraf, Martin Starr, Jack Kesy, Rory Culkin, Leticia Jimenez, Joshua Mikel, Timothy McKinney', 'R', 'Anna suffers from agoraphobia so crippling that when a trio of criminals break into her house, she cannot bring herself to flee. But what the intruders don''t realize is that agoraphobia is not her only psychosis.', 'Anna suffers from agoraphobia so crippling that when a trio of criminals break into her house, she cannot bring herself to flee. But what the intruders don''t realize is that agoraphobia is not her only psychosis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5zRiFh5d1hWmYDqcYKz6uSUXKnl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:333674'),
  ('48052503612665741', 'Intrusion', 2021, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Eric Lin, Adam Salky', 'Chris Sparling', 'Freida Pinto, Logan Marshall-Green, Robert John Burke, Megan Elisabeth Kelly, Sarah Minnich, Hayes Hargrove, Mark Sivertsen, Brandon Fierro', null, 'When a husband and wife move to a small town, a home invasion leaves the wife traumatized and suspicious that those around her might not be who they seem.', 'When a husband and wife move to a small town, a home invasion leaves the wife traumatized and suspicious that those around her might not be who they seem.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o6ozTBflWXlBje0uxJv4m6s4HTq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:785752'),
  ('809313211297713177', 'Intrusive Thoughts', 2026, 'Drama', 'Saumene Mehrdady, Justin Moore', 'Saumene Mehrdady', 'Sarah Chang Tadayon, Alexander Morales, Angela Barber, Jeff Deglow, Shahrad Fredotti', 'Not Rated', 'In the aftermath of a breakup, a struggling filmmaker becomes seduced by his therapist while his ex-girlfriend grapples with her identity and where to go next.', 'In the aftermath of a breakup, a struggling filmmaker becomes seduced by his therapist while his ex-girlfriend grapples with her identity and where to go next.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2Fe%2Fgracenote%2Fe6a581ffb3ad0bb5e0adb34c4e97e831.jpg', 'plex:movie:intrusive-thoughts-2026'),
  ('437629315993145308', 'Intuition', 2020, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Alejandro Montiel', 'Florencia Etcheves, Mili Roque Pitt, Alejandro Montiel', 'Luisana Lopilato, Joaquín Furriel, Rafael Ferro, Maite Lanata, Juan Manuel Guilera, Abel Ayala, Sebastián Mogordoy, Delfina Chaves', null, 'Police officer Pipa works on her first big case while simultaneously investigating her boss, who is suspected of murder. The prequel to "Perdida".', 'Police officer Pipa works on her first big case while simultaneously investigating her boss, who is suspected of murder. The prequel to "Perdida".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m2rJGjlesDKxugl7ypW8n3Mipjl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:620883'),
  ('1123519350616217899', 'Inu-Oh', 2022, 'Animation, Drama, Music, Fantasy, History', 'Fuga Yamashiro, Eriko Kimura, Atsuko Fukushima', 'Akiko Nogi', 'Avu-chan, Mirai Moriyama, Tasuku Emoto, Kenjiro Tsuda, Yutaka Matsushige, Kuroemon Katayama, Kengo Tanimoto, Takanobu Sakaguchi', 'PG-13', 'A cursed dancer and a blind musician — both ostracized by society — become business partners and inseparable friends as their larger-than-life concerts propel them to stardom in 14th century Japan.', 'A cursed dancer and a blind musician — both ostracized by society — become business partners and inseparable friends as their larger-than-life concerts propel them to stardom in 14th century Japan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/67WmijqW7fjmLcc0eKZtW59Hf4d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:642538'),
  ('1051018448928450678', 'Inugami', 2001, 'Horror, Romance, Thriller', 'Masato Harada, Kenji Tominaga, Junichi Fujisawa', 'Masato Harada', 'Yuki Amami, Atsuro Watabe, Eugene Harada, Shiho Fujimura, Kazuhiro Yamaji, Kanako Fukaura, Shion Machida, Kenichi Yajima', null, 'Akira, a teacher from Tokyo, has just arrived in a small rural town to begin his new job. Soon after arriving, he meets, and begins to fall for, Miki, a papermaker and part of a large and unusual family. When he learns of an ancient legend that the family carries the curse of the Inugami, or Dog God, he brushes it off as silly superstition. After a series of mysterious deaths, however, the townspeople begin to grow restless, and Akira must confront the truth about Miki and her family.', 'Akira, a teacher from Tokyo, has just arrived in a small rural town to begin his new job. Soon after arriving, he meets, and begins to fall for, Miki, a papermaker and part of a large and unusual family. When he learns of an ancient legend that the family carries the curse of the Inugami, or Dog God, he brushes it off as silly superstition. After a series of mysterious deaths, however, the townspeople begin to grow restless, and Akira must confront the truth about Miki and her family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bcEsO3o6sg1S5OTXdtXg7FW3dS8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68494'),
  ('15490306437714555', 'iNumber Number: Jozi Gold', 2023, 'Crime, Action, Thriller', 'Donovan Marsh', 'Donovan Marsh', 'S''Dumo Mtshali, Presley Chweneyagae, Brenda Ngxoli, Deon Lotz', null, 'When an undercover cop is tasked with investigating a historic gold heist in Johannesburg, he’s forced to choose between his conscience and the law.', 'When an undercover cop is tasked with investigating a historic gold heist in Johannesburg, he’s forced to choose between his conscience and the law.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8OkmwdxCZOVxvZq9OyDrIIKEoDK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1129956'),
  ('178244323806625877', 'Inuyasha the Movie 2: The Castle Beyond the Looking Glass', 2002, 'Action, Animation, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Toshiya Shinohara, Hirofumi Ogura, Hideyuki Motohashi', 'Katsuyuki Sumisawa', 'Kappei Yamaguchi, Satsuki Yukino, Koji Tsujitani, Houko Kuwashima, Kumiko Watanabe, Noriko Hidaka, Kenichi Ogata, Toshiyuki Morikawa', 'PG-13', 'With their most formidable foe vanquished, Inuyasha and his comrades begin returning to their everyday lives. But their peace is fleeting as another adversary emerges: Kaguya, the self-proclaimed princess from the Moon of Legend, hatches a plot to plunge the world into an eternal night of the full moon. Inuyasha, Kagome, Miroku, Sango and Shippou must reunite to confront the new menace.', 'With their most formidable foe vanquished, Inuyasha and his comrades begin returning to their everyday lives. But their peace is fleeting as another adversary emerges: Kaguya, the self-proclaimed princess from the Moon of Legend, hatches a plot to plunge the world into an eternal night of the full moon. Inuyasha, Kagome, Miroku, Sango and Shippou must reunite to confront the new menace.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ceJsKxIcy4KOFp3MEqCcRkR7Daz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22537'),
  ('461057338054674373', 'Inuyasha the Movie 3: Swords of an Honorable Ruler', 2003, 'Animation, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Yuriko Nagaya, Toshiya Shinohara, Hirofumi Ogura', 'Katsuyuki Sumisawa', 'Kappei Yamaguchi, Satsuki Yukino, Koji Tsujitani, Houko Kuwashima, Kumiko Watanabe, Ken Narita, Akio Otsuka, Kikuko Inoue', 'R', 'Inuyasha and his brother, Sesshomaru, each inherited a sword from their father after his death. However, their father had a third sword, named Sounga, that he sealed away. Seven hundreds years after his death, Sounga awakens and threatens mankind''s very existence. How will the children of the Great Dog Demon stop this unimaginable power?', 'Inuyasha and his brother, Sesshomaru, each inherited a sword from their father after his death. However, their father had a third sword, named Sounga, that he sealed away. Seven hundreds years after his death, Sounga awakens and threatens mankind''s very existence. How will the children of the Great Dog Demon stop this unimaginable power?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5MbXmcxOJ8wrXZ4kmikiI72Ipbe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34295'),
  ('517039603935280855', 'Inuyasha the Movie 4: Fire on the Mystic Island', 2004, 'Fantasy, Animation, Adventure', 'Toshiya Shinohara, Hirofumi Ogura, Hirofumi Ogura', 'Katsuyuki Sumisawa', 'Kappei Yamaguchi, Satsuki Yukino, Koji Tsujitani, Houko Kuwashima, Kumiko Watanabe, Noriko Hidaka, Ken Narita, Cho', 'PG-13', 'The mysterious island of Houraijima has reappeared after 50 years, and with its reappearance has brought the attack of four gods, the Shitoushin, who have their eyes set on the powers that protect and sustain the island. Now it''s up to Inuyasha and his friends, along with Sesshoumaru, to find a way to defeat the powerful Shitoushin.', 'The mysterious island of Houraijima has reappeared after 50 years, and with its reappearance has brought the attack of four gods, the Shitoushin, who have their eyes set on the powers that protect and sustain the island. Now it''s up to Inuyasha and his friends, along with Sesshoumaru, to find a way to defeat the powerful Shitoushin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Am3rBqYfNmeLqv3JULfUjxXQgNS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34297'),
  ('469548968694481013', 'Inuyasha the Movie: Affections Touching Across Time', 2001, 'Action, Animation, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Toshiya Shinohara, Hirofumi Ogura, Masaya Fujimori', 'Katsuyuki Sumisawa', 'Kappei Yamaguchi, Satsuki Yukino, Koji Tsujitani, Houko Kuwashima, Kumiko Watanabe, Kenichi Ogata, Noriko Hidaka, Hisako Kyoda', 'PG-13', 'InuYasha is a half-demon who was trapped in the Legendary Tree and was set free by Kagome, a girl who traveled 500 years through time. This time, both of them will have to face Menomaru, a Chinese demon whose father, known as Hyoga, came 300 years ago to invade Japan, but was stopped by InuYasha''s Father. InuYasha and Kagome, along with Sango, Miroku, Shippou, Kaede and Myoga, will try to stop Menomaru in his becoming the most powerful demon ever.', 'InuYasha is a half-demon who was trapped in the Legendary Tree and was set free by Kagome, a girl who traveled 500 years through time. This time, both of them will have to face Menomaru, a Chinese demon whose father, known as Hyoga, came 300 years ago to invade Japan, but was stopped by InuYasha''s Father. InuYasha and Kagome, along with Sango, Miroku, Shippou, Kaede and Myoga, will try to stop Menomaru in his becoming the most powerful demon ever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gl8TvgVL6B2PR71cnrG7PbAUPls.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42360'),
