  ('145594370268859479', 'Invasion of Alien Bikini', 2011, 'Science Fiction, Comedy, Romance', 'Oh Young-Doo', null, 'Hong Seo-back, Ha Eun-Jung, Seo Byeong-cheol, Choi Yeong-jo, Jo Hoon-yeong, Kim Hyeon-tae', null, 'Young-Gun is a virgin who always tries to do the right thing. He wanders around the city every night as protector of the people. Nobody asked Young-Gun to do this and he doesn''t get paid, but he risks his life for the common good and also picks up trash along the way. One evening, he hears a woman screaming. After fighting with mysterious men, Young-Gun saves her and takes her back to his house. Young-Gun has a crush on her, but she is an alien who has been sent to Earth to increase her species. Before dawn, she has to find the best sperm and become fertilized with the sperm. Young-Gun has taken a vow of chastity until marriage, so he can''t give the alien what she wants. Throughout the long night the beautiful alien tries to get his sperm... Can the thirty something virgin Young-Gun overcome tempation from the alien? Can Young-Gun save Planet Earth?', 'Young-Gun is a virgin who always tries to do the right thing. He wanders around the city every night as protector of the people. Nobody asked Young-Gun to do this and he doesn''t get paid, but he risks his life for the common good and also picks up trash along the way. One evening, he hears a woman screaming. After fighting with mysterious men, Young-Gun saves her and takes her back to his house. Young-Gun has a crush on her, but she is an alien who has been sent to Earth to increase her species. Before dawn, she has to find the best sperm and become fertilized with the sperm. Young-Gun has taken a vow of chastity until marriage, so he can''t give the alien what she wants. Throughout the long night the beautiful alien tries to get his sperm... Can the thirty something virgin Young-Gun overcome tempation from the alien? Can Young-Gun save Planet Earth?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zW9IHfyH0pusA4l1iqMCJfVs6hq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95916'),
  ('925718238135426242', 'Invasion of Astro-Monster', 1965, 'Science Fiction, Action', 'Ishirō Honda, Hajime Koizumi, Koji Hashimoto', 'Shinichi Sekizawa', 'Nick Adams, Akira Takarada, Keiko Sawai, Kumi Mizuno, Jun Tazaki, Akira Kubo, Yoshio Tsuchiya, Takamaru Sasaki', 'G', 'Astronauts Glenn and Fuji investigate Planet X and encounter mysterious aliens known as the Xiliens, who ask Earth''s people to help save their world from "Monster Zero". In exchange for borrowing Godzilla and Rodan, the Xiliens offer a cure for cancer. As Glenn investigates, he develops a romance with Miss Namikawa and uncovers the Xilien''s true intentions.', 'Astronauts Glenn and Fuji investigate Planet X and encounter mysterious aliens known as the Xiliens, who ask Earth''s people to help save their world from "Monster Zero". In exchange for borrowing Godzilla and Rodan, the Xiliens offer a cure for cancer. As Glenn investigates, he develops a romance with Miss Namikawa and uncovers the Xilien''s true intentions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/70gwaushxXcpGRvadHtLD0YLHC1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19545'),
  ('635665243194725218', 'Invasion of the Bee Girls', 1973, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Denis Sanders, Gary Graver', 'Nicholas Meyer', 'William Smith, Anitra Ford, Victoria Vetri, Cliff Osmond, Wright King, Ben Hammer, Anna Aries, Andre Philippe', 'R', 'A powerful cosmic force is turning Earth women into queen bees who kill men by wearing them out sexually.', 'A powerful cosmic force is turning Earth women into queen bees who kill men by wearing them out sexually.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wIE6Fsq9KHTwBUOWwy1q9HwOXz3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27084'),
  ('845624966823387837', 'Invasion of the Blood Farmers', 1972, 'Horror', 'Ed Adlum, Roberta Findlay', 'Ed Adlum, Ed Kelleher', 'Norman Kelley, Tanna Hunter, Bruce Detrick, Paul Craig Jennings, Jack Neubeck, Richard Erickson, Cynthia Fleming, Lucy Grant', 'PG', 'Somewhere in upstate New York, a young woman is terrorized by a group of rural farmers primarily interested in a harvest of blood.', 'Somewhere in upstate New York, a young woman is terrorized by a group of rural farmers primarily interested in a harvest of blood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aq4DjUqumZ9CnCllQzzK33WgcB9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91066'),
  ('406477617479326250', 'Invasion of the Body Snatchers', 1956, 'Science Fiction, Horror, Thriller', 'Don Siegel, Ellsworth Fredericks, Richard Maybery', 'Daniel Mainwaring, Richard Collins', 'Kevin McCarthy, Dana Wynter, King Donovan, Carolyn Jones, Larry Gates, Kenneth Patterson, Virginia Christine, Jean Willes', null, 'A small-town doctor learns that the population of his community is being replaced by emotionless alien duplicates.', 'A small-town doctor learns that the population of his community is being replaced by emotionless alien duplicates.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8BrMQmgwGzIHSyBjCDOLOdi79fJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11549'),
  ('397022050232945205', 'Invasion of the Body Snatchers', 1978, 'Science Fiction, Horror', 'Philip Kaufman, Michael Chapman', 'W.D. Richter', 'Donald Sutherland, Brooke Adams, Leonard Nimoy, Jeff Goldblum, Veronica Cartwright, Art Hindle, Lelia Goldoni, Kevin McCarthy', 'PG', 'The residents of San Francisco are becoming drone-like shadows of their former selves, and as the phenomenon spreads, two Department of Health workers uncover the horrifying truth.', 'The residents of San Francisco are becoming drone-like shadows of their former selves, and as the phenomenon spreads, two Department of Health workers uncover the horrifying truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/skS02wdeH2C0nrbCQP3qKwJdZtZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11850'),
  ('1053594728550053873', 'Invasion of the Neptune Men', 1961, 'Science Fiction, Action, Adventure', 'Shizuka Fujii, Junya Satō, Koji Ota', 'Shin Morita', 'Sonny Chiba, Shinjirō Ehara, Ryuko Mizukami, Mitsue Komiya, Seiichirō Kameishi, Shiro Okamoto, Rinichi Yamamoto, Kappei Matsumoto', null, 'Astronomer Shinichi Tachibana has a secret identity as the superhero "Iron Sharp" and is well beloved by children. When they are attacked by a group of metallic aliens, Iron Sharp drives the aliens away. The resourceful Tachibana helps develop an electric barrier to block the aliens from coming to the Earth. After several losses by the aliens, they announce that they will invade the Earth, throwing the world into a state of panic.', 'Astronomer Shinichi Tachibana has a secret identity as the superhero "Iron Sharp" and is well beloved by children. When they are attacked by a group of metallic aliens, Iron Sharp drives the aliens away. The resourceful Tachibana helps develop an electric barrier to block the aliens from coming to the Earth. After several losses by the aliens, they announce that they will invade the Earth, throwing the world into a state of panic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qXFiYA9cDwCeMzEKrc0QOr6zLaB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31254'),
  ('1057858746469501992', 'Invasion of the Pod People', 2007, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Justin Jones, Leigh Scott, Bianca Bahena', 'Leigh Scott', 'Sarah Lieving, Erica Kessler, Jessica Bork, Danae Nason, Shaley Scott, Lorraine Smith, Michael Tower, Amanda Ward', null, 'After a meteor shower in California, Melissa feels that her co-workers and her boss Samantha that work in the agency owned by Vickland are acting differently after receiving a weird plant. She shares her fears with her colleague Billie and with Detective Alexander that are the only persons that she can trust', 'After a meteor shower in California, Melissa feels that her co-workers and her boss Samantha that work in the agency owned by Vickland are acting differently after receiving a weird plant. She shares her fears with her colleague Billie and with Detective Alexander that are the only persons that she can trust', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2GWV55tEERvHtVaLTyl429XELlD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76666'),
  ('629556934697375535', 'Invasion of the Saucer-Men', 1957, 'Science Fiction, Comedy, Horror', 'Edward L. Cahn, Frederick E. West', 'Robert J. Gurney Jr., Al Martin', 'Steven Terrell, Gloria Castillo, Frank Gorshin, Raymond Hatton, Lyn Osborn, Russ Bender, Douglas Henderson, Sam Buffington', null, 'Aliens equipped with venomous claws invade a small town, but the town''s teenage population is mobilized to fight the menace.', 'Aliens equipped with venomous claws invade a small town, but the town''s teenage population is mobilized to fight the menace.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8gEO48Pzl0IOzuW9gwbAYQGEmW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52199'),
  ('110294002363496479', 'Invasion of the Star Creatures', 1962, 'Science Fiction, Comedy', 'Bruno VeSota', 'Jonathan Haze', 'Robert Ball, Frank Ray Perilli, Gloria Victor, Dolores Reed, Trustin Howard, Mark Ferris, Richard Adams', null, 'Beautiful alien Amazonian women plan to conquer the world using an army of vegetable monsters. Dim-witted privates Philbrick and Penn bumble into a cave in search of atomic activity but collide instead with fierce carrot-topped tree mutants and their leaders, the 7-foot space sirens Prof. Tanga and Dr. Puna. This lavishly low-budget sci-fi romp has the bodacious aliens planning to overrun Earth with their vege-men army, but first they want the G.I.s to explain the meaning of love.', 'Beautiful alien Amazonian women plan to conquer the world using an army of vegetable monsters. Dim-witted privates Philbrick and Penn bumble into a cave in search of atomic activity but collide instead with fierce carrot-topped tree mutants and their leaders, the 7-foot space sirens Prof. Tanga and Dr. Puna. This lavishly low-budget sci-fi romp has the bodacious aliens planning to overrun Earth with their vege-men army, but first they want the G.I.s to explain the meaning of love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mTTcerdgTZGuLNrCAfbNga6uom4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46076'),
  ('1002839668620598344', 'Invasion U.S.A.', 1985, 'Action, Thriller', 'Joseph Zito, João Fernandes', 'James Bruner, Chuck Norris', 'Chuck Norris, Richard Lynch, Melissa Prophet, Alexander Zale, Alex Colon, Eddie Jones, Jon DeVries, James O''Sullivan', 'R', 'A one-man army comes to the rescue of the United States when a spy attempts an invasion.', 'A one-man army comes to the rescue of the United States when a spy attempts an invasion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vSBH5PndNMeNAMLIu6y6KFTwvWO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15983'),
  ('10448491579946075', 'Invasion, U.S.A.', 1952, 'Drama, Science Fiction', 'Alfred E. Green, John L. Russell, Ralph E. Black', 'Robert Smith', 'Gerald Mohr, Peggie Castle, Dan O''Herlihy, Robert Bice, Tom Kennedy, Wade Crosby, Phyllis Coates, Noel Neill', 'NR', 'A group of American witness the deadly invasion of the United States by the Soviet Union.', 'A group of American witness the deadly invasion of the United States by the Soviet Union.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Y7ovODwkyGH149SXPEpiSY9sQk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46145'),
  ('834279501947698803', 'Invasion: Planet Earth', 2019, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Simon Cox, Gordon Hickie', 'Simon Bovey, Simon Cox', 'Simon Haycock, Lucy Drive, Julie Hoult, Danny Steele, Sophie Anderson, Jon Campling, Toyah Willcox, Michael Bott', 'PG-13', 'On the same day that Tom Dunn finds out that he is to become a father again, the people of Earth become plagued with terrifying visions of the end of the world. When a gigantic, all-consuming alien mothership launches a ruthless attack, chaos and destruction follow. The ultimate war for Planet Earth is about to begin...', 'On the same day that Tom Dunn finds out that he is to become a father again, the people of Earth become plagued with terrifying visions of the end of the world. When a gigantic, all-consuming alien mothership launches a ruthless attack, chaos and destruction follow. The ultimate war for Planet Earth is about to begin...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/29sq0JjJslhPKhWjfMJVJ9fSmVw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:641370'),
  ('430503646743572309', 'Invasion: UFO', 1980, 'Science Fiction', 'Gerry Anderson, Cyril Frankel, David Tomblin', 'David Tomblin', 'Ed Bishop, George Sewell, Michael Billington, Wanda Ventham, Vladek Sheybal, Derren Nesbitt, David Warbeck, Shane Rimmer', null, 'The Earth is threatened by an alien race who kidnap and kill humans and even animals and use them for their body parts. In the year 1980 S.H.A.D.O. (Supreme Headquarters Alien Defence Organization), a highly secret military organization, is set up in the hope of defending the Earth from this alien threat. This organization operates from a secret location beneath the Harlington-Straker film studio in London. S.H.A.D.O. also has a base on the moon with Interceptors as well as an early warning satellite that detects inbound UFOs (called S.I.D.), and operate a fleet of submarines. General James Henderson and commander Ed Straker have a team of highly trained and well equipped females and males to battle the regularly incoming hostile UFOs.', 'The Earth is threatened by an alien race who kidnap and kill humans and even animals and use them for their body parts. In the year 1980 S.H.A.D.O. (Supreme Headquarters Alien Defence Organization), a highly secret military organization, is set up in the hope of defending the Earth from this alien threat. This organization operates from a secret location beneath the Harlington-Straker film studio in London. S.H.A.D.O. also has a base on the moon with Interceptors as well as an early warning satellite that detects inbound UFOs (called S.I.D.), and operate a fleet of submarines. General James Henderson and commander Ed Straker have a team of highly trained and well equipped females and males to battle the regularly incoming hostile UFOs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3gPXvyMKBRDKXnh8qiSluFa4ZgV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:210198'),
  ('443267655279702412', 'Inventing the Abbotts', 1997, 'Drama, Romance', 'Pat O''Connor, Kenneth MacMillan, Jonathan Watson', 'Ken Hixon', 'Joaquin Phoenix, Liv Tyler, Jennifer Connelly, Billy Crudup, Joanna Going, Kathy Baker, Will Patton, Michael Sutton', 'R', 'In the 1950s, brothers Jacey and Doug Holt, who come from the poorer side of their sleepy Midwestern town, vie for the affections of the wealthy, lovely Abbott sisters. Lady-killer Jacey alternates between Eleanor and Alice, wanting simply to break the hearts of rich young women. But sensitive Doug has a real romance with Pamela, which Jacey and the Abbott patriarch, Lloyd, both frown upon.', 'In the 1950s, brothers Jacey and Doug Holt, who come from the poorer side of their sleepy Midwestern town, vie for the affections of the wealthy, lovely Abbott sisters. Lady-killer Jacey alternates between Eleanor and Alice, wanting simply to break the hearts of rich young women. But sensitive Doug has a real romance with Pamela, which Jacey and the Abbott patriarch, Lloyd, both frown upon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ysfD96fF56BEzpktyDWChC8Epgs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12723'),
  ('849680577750546796', 'Investigation Held by Kolobki', 1986, 'Animation, TV Movie', 'Igor Kovalyov, Aleksandr Tatarskiy', 'Eduard Uspensky', 'Leonid Bronevoy, Aleksey Ptitsyn, Stanislav Fedosov, Mikhail Evdokimov', null, 'Two crazy brothers-detectives from a weird provincial town are searching for a rare striped elephant stolen by a suspicious foreigner.', 'Two crazy brothers-detectives from a weird provincial town are searching for a rare striped elephant stolen by a suspicious foreigner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/capVKIin7nWwRMWVM2TUOUcTKXo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:213321'),
  ('460810272014348234', 'Invictus', 2009, 'Drama, History', 'Clint Eastwood, Tom Stern, Tom Hannam', 'Anthony Peckham', 'Morgan Freeman, Matt Damon, Tony Kgoroge, Patrick Mofokeng, Matt Stern, Julian Lewis Jones, Adjoa Andoh, Marguerite Wheatley', 'PG-13', 'Newly elected President Nelson Mandela knows his nation remains racially and economically divided in the wake of apartheid. Believing he can bring his people together through the universal language of sport, Mandela rallies South Africa''s rugby union team as they make their historic run to the 1995 Rugby World Cup Championship match.', 'Newly elected President Nelson Mandela knows his nation remains racially and economically divided in the wake of apartheid. Believing he can bring his people together through the universal language of sport, Mandela rallies South Africa''s rugby union team as they make their historic run to the 1995 Rugby World Cup Championship match.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/runuhBAAX7PmdjGhqRKCyl4bh7z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22954'),
  ('520226223508821780', 'Invincible', 2001, 'Fantasy, Action, Thriller, Adventure', 'Jefery Levy, John Stokes, Liz Tan', 'Derek Haas, Michael Brandt', 'Billy Zane, Byron Mann, Stacy Oversier, Tory Kittles, Dominic Purcell, David Field, Michelle Comerford, Bren Foster', null, 'The Shadow Men are immortal beings of darkness and destruction. One such Shadow Man, Os (Zane), is confronted by the White Warrior, a being of light, and given the chance to change his ways or die. After the White Warrior bests Os in combat, she opens his heart to the power of love, and charges him to find the warriors who are the representation of the five elements and will save the world.', 'The Shadow Men are immortal beings of darkness and destruction. One such Shadow Man, Os (Zane), is confronted by the White Warrior, a being of light, and given the chance to change his ways or die. After the White Warrior bests Os in combat, she opens his heart to the power of love, and charges him to find the warriors who are the representation of the five elements and will save the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tVyc2qLdLBM67BLVah2VPm2tHsS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35216'),
  ('989384048320579925', 'Invincible', 2006, 'Drama, History', 'Ericson Core, Ericson Core', 'Brad Gann', 'Mark Wahlberg, Greg Kinnear, Elizabeth Banks, Kevin Conway, Michael Rispoli, Morgan Turner, Dov Davidoff, Kirk Acevedo', 'PG', 'Inspired by the true story of Vince Papale, a man with nothing to lose who ignored the staggering odds and made his dream come true. When the coach of Papale''s beloved hometown football team hosted an unprecedented open tryout, the public consensus was that it was a waste of time – no one good enough to play professional football was going to be found this way.', 'Inspired by the true story of Vince Papale, a man with nothing to lose who ignored the staggering odds and made his dream come true. When the coach of Papale''s beloved hometown football team hosted an unprecedented open tryout, the public consensus was that it was a waste of time – no one good enough to play professional football was going to be found this way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oEaUMn5POAiMLnU6hKOBKoZbDpo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11652'),
  ('1074527904084367858', 'Invincible', 2024, 'Drama', 'Alexandre Nour, Vincent René-Lortie, Romane Lepage', 'Vincent René-Lortie', 'Léokim Beaumier-Lépine, Élia St-Pierre, Isabelle Blais, Pierre-Luc Brillant, Ralph Prosper, Naoufel Chkirate, Miguel Tionjock, Raphaël Navarro-Gendron', null, 'Inspired by a true story, Invincible recounts the last 48 hours in the life of Marc-Antoine Bernier, a 14-year-old boy on a desperate quest for freedom.', 'Inspired by a true story, Invincible recounts the last 48 hours in the life of Marc-Antoine Bernier, a 14-year-old boy on a desperate quest for freedom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6FLCoMN4Ah5j2D6niuYQ85NAi27.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1084765'),
  ('1097832422901419455', 'Invincible Shaolin', 1978, 'Action, Drama', 'Chang Cheh, Cho Wai-Kei, Chiang Sheng', 'Chang Cheh, Ni Kuang', 'Sun Chien, Chiang Sheng, Lu Feng, Johnny Wang Lung-Wei, Suen Shu-Pei, Lo Meng, Phillip Kwok Chui, Wai Pak', null, 'Three North Shaolin teachers are called on by the Manchus to teach their soldiers and are urged to challenge the current South Shaolin teachers. They defeat the South Shaolin teachers and, that night, the head general kills the South Shaolin teachers and blames their death on the North Shaolin teachers. The South Shaolin master sends more of his pupils, who are killed accidentally by the North Shaolin teachers. He finally sends two more of his students to train with old masters and trains one student himself with the goal of finally defeating the North Shaolin experts.', 'Three North Shaolin teachers are called on by the Manchus to teach their soldiers and are urged to challenge the current South Shaolin teachers. They defeat the South Shaolin teachers and, that night, the head general kills the South Shaolin teachers and blames their death on the North Shaolin teachers. The South Shaolin master sends more of his pupils, who are killed accidentally by the North Shaolin teachers. He finally sends two more of his students to train with old masters and trains one student himself with the goal of finally defeating the North Shaolin experts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gZ9KLwe4dKDWI0S83n0uk3nAG4D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48297'),
  ('291551672367617016', 'Invincible Swordsman', 2025, 'Drama, Action', 'Luo Yiwei, Ding Yi', 'Wong Jing', 'Zhang Yuqi, Tim Huang, Terence Yin Chi-Wai, Sammo Hung Kam-Bo, Xuan Lu, Yun Qianqian, Zhang Lu, Cai Xiangyu', null, 'Linghu Chong, a swordsman longing to leave the martial arts world, is drawn back into the clash between good and evil. On his journey, he unexpectedly crosses paths with Dongfang Bubai, the enigmatic leader of the Demonic Sect, leading to an unpredictable and tumultuous adventure through the martial arts realm.', 'Linghu Chong, a swordsman longing to leave the martial arts world, is drawn back into the clash between good and evil. On his journey, he unexpectedly crosses paths with Dongfang Bubai, the enigmatic leader of the Demonic Sect, leading to an unpredictable and tumultuous adventure through the martial arts realm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7CJ38uqEGEC0IkqVUE5FSzWywAj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1416651'),
  ('663351308179991595', 'Invisible', 2005, 'Drama', 'Thierry Jousse, Josée Deshaies, Emile Louis', 'Emmanuèle Bernheim', 'Laurent Lucas, Lio, Michael Lonsdale, Margot Abascal, Noël Akchoté, Jean-Pierre Léonardini, Éva Ionesco, Violetta Sanchez', null, 'A budding electronica artist gives up his shot at stardom to pursue a woman from a telephone dating network.', 'A budding electronica artist gives up his shot at stardom to pursue a woman from a telephone dating network.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wibhDJk0AtSfFW7g9t4K9sUDRZh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66188'),
  ('487129457121325195', 'Invisible', 2017, 'Drama', 'Pablo Giorgelli, Verónica Biasin, Mariano Biasin', 'Pablo Giorgelli, María Laura Gargarella', 'Mora Arenillas, Mara Bestelli, Diego Cremonesi, Jorge Waldhorn, Agustina Fernández, Paula Fernández Mbarak, Leonel Arancibia, Fabiana Uría', null, 'Ely is 17 years old. After school, she works few hours at a pet shop. When Ely learns that she is pregnant, her inner world explodes even though she tries to go on with her daily routine as if nothing was different. She is afraid and upset, and she knows that, whatever she decides to do, there is no turning back.', 'Ely is 17 years old. After school, she works few hours at a pet shop. When Ely learns that she is pregnant, her inner world explodes even though she tries to go on with her daily routine as if nothing was different. She is afraid and upset, and she knows that, whatever she decides to do, there is no turning back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zBMBBcKgtrnDLBuk2uPYN7Dx20G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:473637'),
  ('9830992921461408', 'Invisible Adversaries', 1977, 'Drama, Science Fiction', 'Valie Export', 'Valie Export, Peter Weibel', 'Susanne Widl, Peter Weibel, Josef Plavec, Monika Helfer-Friedrich, Helke Sander, Dominick Dusek, Herbert Schmid, Edward Neversal', null, 'Anna, an artist, is obsessed with the invasion of alien doubles bent on total destruction. Her schizophrenia is reflected in the juxtapositions of long movie camera takes with violently edited montages: private with public spaces; black & white with colour, still photographs with video, earsplitting sounds with disruptive camera angles. Anna uses her body like a map; after a devastating quarrel with her lover, she paints red stitches on herself. Watching their scenes together, we realize how seldom, if ever before, the details of sexual intimacy have been shown in film from the point of view from a woman. Export privileges rupture over unity and never settles for one-dimensional solutions', 'Anna, an artist, is obsessed with the invasion of alien doubles bent on total destruction. Her schizophrenia is reflected in the juxtapositions of long movie camera takes with violently edited montages: private with public spaces; black & white with colour, still photographs with video, earsplitting sounds with disruptive camera angles. Anna uses her body like a map; after a devastating quarrel with her lover, she paints red stitches on herself. Watching their scenes together, we realize how seldom, if ever before, the details of sexual intimacy have been shown in film from the point of view from a woman. Export privileges rupture over unity and never settles for one-dimensional solutions', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ayLm9j5UuIuu1Hb8DRsywHcXPaE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:122469'),
  ('23053681674982071', 'Invisible Agent', 1942, 'Horror, Science Fiction, War', 'Edwin L. Marin, Lester White, Vernon Keays', 'Curt Siodmak', 'Ilona Massey, Jon Hall, Peter Lorre, Cedric Hardwicke, J. Edward Bromberg, Albert Bassermann, John Litel, Holmes Herbert', null, 'The Invisible Man''s grandson uses his secret formula to spy on Nazi Germany.', 'The Invisible Man''s grandson uses his secret formula to spy on Nazi Germany.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2yybvJ8qeTv3efX8LP0q1KGleDJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28426'),
  ('104463189671792070', 'Invisible Demons', 2021, 'Documentary', 'Rahul Jain, Rodrigo Trejo Villanueva, Saumyananda Sahi', 'Rahul Jain, Iikka Vehkalahti', null, null, 'A prismatic meditation on pollution in the capital of the World’s biggest free-market democracy and the most polluted and populated city, Delhi – a film about the pollution inside of the human mind.', 'A prismatic meditation on pollution in the capital of the World’s biggest free-market democracy and the most polluted and populated city, Delhi – a film about the pollution inside of the human mind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gD7ezX54kCQKhoII0oprQrYpkPN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:842361'),
