  ('800503330398611511', 'Io sono Rosa Ricci', 2025, 'Crime, Drama', 'Lyda Patitucci, Valerio Azzali, Vincenzo Rosa', 'Maurizio Careddu, Luca Infascelli', 'Maria Esposito, Andrea Arcangeli, Raiz, Gennaro Di Colandrea, Jorge Perugorría, Gerardo de Pablos, Juan Daniel Straube, Simon Rizzoni', null, 'In 2000s Naples, 15-year-old Rosa Ricci is kidnapped by enemies of her father, one of the city’s most feared Camorra bosses. Held captive on a remote island, she transforms from victim to survivor, ready to fight for her freedom before her father’s war for revenge consumes them both.', 'In 2000s Naples, 15-year-old Rosa Ricci is kidnapped by enemies of her father, one of the city’s most feared Camorra bosses. Held captive on a remote island, she transforms from victim to survivor, ready to fight for her freedom before her father’s war for revenge consumes them both.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tBk3rmW8JdvkrH0ud529kjt7rJc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1142122'),
  ('657710725678200247', 'Io sono Tempesta', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Chiara Polizzi, Gianluca Mizzi, Daniele Luchetti', 'Giulia Calenda, Daniele Luchetti, Sandro Petraglia', 'Marco Giallini, Elio Germano, Eleonora Danco, Jo Sung, Francesco Gheghi, Carlo Bigini, Marcello Fonte, Franco Boccuccia', null, 'To avoid jail, a tax-dodging businessman is sentenced to a year of community service in a homeless shelter.', 'To avoid jail, a tax-dodging businessman is sentenced to a year of community service in a homeless shelter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qlYY3pk7JJ3iDkXzyCU4OvgFhCV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:514266'),
  ('574543689616981760', 'Io tigro, tu tigri, egli tigra', 1978, 'Comedy', 'Giorgio Capitani, Renato Pozzetto, Lamberto Caimi', 'Giovanni Manganelli', 'Renato Pozzetto, Cochi Ponzoni, Angela Luce, Felice Andreasi, Paola Arduini, Massimo Boldi, Giorgio Porcaro, Ernst Thole', null, 'Three short stories full of absurd Italian humor. Episode 1: Oddjobs man Elia is hired to be a waiter and soon finds himself caught up in a plot to knock off his mistress (in more ways than one). Episode 2: Della is convinced that aliens are on their way to consume the world and before long ends up a guinea pig on a spaceship from the planet Phobos. Episode 3: Roberto becomes a Bersaglieri in the Italian army and nearly causes a war between Italy and Switzerland over a packet of cigarettes.', 'Three short stories full of absurd Italian humor. Episode 1: Oddjobs man Elia is hired to be a waiter and soon finds himself caught up in a plot to knock off his mistress (in more ways than one). Episode 2: Della is convinced that aliens are on their way to consume the world and before long ends up a guinea pig on a spaceship from the planet Phobos. Episode 3: Roberto becomes a Bersaglieri in the Italian army and nearly causes a war between Italy and Switzerland over a packet of cigarettes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vq8jg3Ghdz6LgvOIePqPt2m4pbc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43474'),
