  ('517250579511844984', 'Io, noi e Gaber', 2023, 'Documentary', 'Riccardo Milani, Saverio Guarna', 'Riccardo Milani, Francesco Renda', 'Giorgio Gaber, Claudio Bisio, Ombretta Colli, Ivano Fossati, Dalia Gaberscik, Ricky Gianco, Luigi Vignali, Michele Mozzati', null, 'Shot between Milan and Viareggio, in the places tied to Giorgio Gaber’s life, the undisputed protagonist of one of the most precious chapters in Italian entertainment, spanning from light music to teatro canzone. An intimate and exclusive journey.', 'Shot between Milan and Viareggio, in the places tied to Giorgio Gaber’s life, the undisputed protagonist of one of the most precious chapters in Italian entertainment, spanning from light music to teatro canzone. An intimate and exclusive journey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Z1pDDrcv8qWsNe3tylWqWe4UHg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1183354'),
  ('563960463371547076', 'Ion: The Lust for the Land, the Lust for Love', 1980, 'Drama, History', 'Mircea Mureșan', 'Titus Popovici', 'Şerban Ionescu, Ioana Crăciunescu, Leopoldina Bălănuță, Ion Besoiu, Tamara Buciuceanu-Botez, Petre Gheorghiu, Valentin Teodosiu, Octavian Cotescu', null, 'Jon, a young peasant love more "the land" than his engaged girlhood, Florica.Just when Ion thinks he has become master of his own land, he realizes that he has betrayed his heart, and that he is still in love with Florica, not with his wife. It is the curse of love that will be Ion''s undoing. Badly mistreated, Ana, his wife, is driven to despair and she hangs herself. Ion, now free and wealthy, believes that the time has come for him to have Florica. Florica''s husband, George waylays Ion and savagely murders him with a hoe.', 'Jon, a young peasant love more "the land" than his engaged girlhood, Florica.Just when Ion thinks he has become master of his own land, he realizes that he has betrayed his heart, and that he is still in love with Florica, not with his wife. It is the curse of love that will be Ion''s undoing. Badly mistreated, Ana, his wife, is driven to despair and she hangs herself. Ion, now free and wealthy, believes that the time has come for him to have Florica. Florica''s husband, George waylays Ion and savagely murders him with a hoe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8AyiNygn8DsRbrU1BYsGcNDtEsU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51805'),
  ('763613166938405091', 'Ip Man 2', 2010, 'Action, History, Drama', 'Wilson Yip, Poon Hang-Sang', 'Choi Hiu-Yan, Chan Tai-Lee', 'Donnie Yen, Sammo Hung Kam-Bo, Huang Xiaoming, Lynn Hung Doi-Lam, Kent Cheng Jak-Si, Ngo Ka-Nin, Simon Yam, Calvin Cheng', 'R', 'Having defeated the best fighters of the Imperial Japanese army in occupied Shanghai, Ip Man and his family settle in post-war Hong Kong. Struggling to make a living, Master Ip opens a kung fu school to bring his celebrated art of Wing Chun to the troubled youth of Hong Kong. His growing reputation soon brings challenges from powerful enemies, including pre-eminent Hung Gar master, Hung Quan.', 'Having defeated the best fighters of the Imperial Japanese army in occupied Shanghai, Ip Man and his family settle in post-war Hong Kong. Struggling to make a living, Master Ip opens a kung fu school to bring his celebrated art of Wing Chun to the troubled youth of Hong Kong. His growing reputation soon brings challenges from powerful enemies, including pre-eminent Hung Gar master, Hung Quan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wMcyFfKcJneVgcHxWYiQNUNHUsq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37472'),
  ('718606391576801426', 'Ip Man 3', 2015, 'Action, Drama, History', 'Wilson Yip, Kenny Tse Chung-To, Sin Tsz-Man', 'Jill Leung, Edmond Wong Chi-Mun, Chan Tai-Lee', 'Donnie Yen, Max Zhang, Lynn Hung Doi-Lam, Patrick Tam Yiu-Man, Mike Tyson, Karena Ng Chin-Yu, Kent Cheng Jak-Si, Bryan Leung Kar-Yan', 'PG-13', 'When a band of brutal gangsters led by a crooked property developer make a play to take over the city, Master Ip is forced to take a stand.', 'When a band of brutal gangsters led by a crooked property developer make a play to take over the city, Master Ip is forced to take a stand.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8PvinaGEqzf1rrfFAxiXujJnCtI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:365222'),
  ('866101803223066439', 'Ip Man 4: The Finale', 2019, 'Action, History, Drama', 'Wilson Yip, Yuen Woo-Ping, Cheng Siu-Keung', 'Hiroshi Fukazawa, Jill Leung, Edmond Wong Chi-Mun', 'Donnie Yen, Wu Yue, Vanness Wu, Scott Adkins, Kent Cheng Jak-Si, Danny Chan Kwok-Kwan, Ngo Ka-Nin, Chris Collins', 'NR', 'Following the death of his wife, Ip Man travels to San Francisco to ease tensions between the local kung fu masters and his star student, Bruce Lee, while searching for a better future for his son.', 'Following the death of his wife, Ip Man travels to San Francisco to ease tensions between the local kung fu masters and his star student, Bruce Lee, while searching for a better future for his son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b5cz6BoyHrgBnhfDHOW5hXRWbln.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:449924'),
  ('519885806567048513', 'Ip Man and Four Kings', 2019, 'Action, Drama', 'Fu Liwei', 'Jia Wanying, Cui Zouzhao', 'Michael Tong Man-Lung, Lin Fengye, Billy Lau Nam-Kwong, Zhao Lin, Chen Yuyong, Li Huo-Huo, Zheng Liuzhi, Li Peize', null, 'In 1950, a large number of martial artists entered Hong Kong to open a boxing gym. Among them, Ye Wen (Tang Wenlong) did not lose a reputation, causing the attention of Zheng Delong (Lin Fengyi), the owner of the Kowloon Walled Village. Zheng Delong’s fear of threatening himself I will plant the case of Fang Fang’s death on Ye Wen, and I want to remove Ye Wen by the hand of the police. The mysterious man emerged and rescued Ye Wen. Ye Wen is a self-certified innocence with a disciple, Amin Aqiang, who broke into the boundary of the Kowloon Walled City. Who thought that the city had already ambushed countless masters in the city, and he asked whether he could successfully bring Zheng Delong to justice, and he was still innocent!', 'In 1950, a large number of martial artists entered Hong Kong to open a boxing gym. Among them, Ye Wen (Tang Wenlong) did not lose a reputation, causing the attention of Zheng Delong (Lin Fengyi), the owner of the Kowloon Walled Village. Zheng Delong’s fear of threatening himself I will plant the case of Fang Fang’s death on Ye Wen, and I want to remove Ye Wen by the hand of the police. The mysterious man emerged and rescued Ye Wen. Ye Wen is a self-certified innocence with a disciple, Amin Aqiang, who broke into the boundary of the Kowloon Walled City. Who thought that the city had already ambushed countless masters in the city, and he asked whether he could successfully bring Zheng Delong to justice, and he was still innocent!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/axMEIwItVi4pGYpjatiil6olEXA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:643413'),
  ('54413349744267097', 'Ip Man: Kung Fu Master', 2019, 'Action, Drama', 'Li Liming, Lei Guo', 'Qingshui Shi, Li Liming', 'Dennis To Yu-Hang, Yuanli Ruoxin, Tong Xiaohu, Yue Dongfeng, Ren Yu, Chang Qinyuan, Zhao Xiaoguang, Li Rizhu', 'NR', 'Ip Man’s promising career as a Policeman is ruined after he is framed for murder and targeted by a mob boss’s daughter.', 'Ip Man’s promising career as a Policeman is ruined after he is framed for murder and targeted by a mob boss’s daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kHZN7zZGsWik9Sg3APaHGeTK5Jm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:658009'),
  ('99511937541342171', 'Ip Man: The Awakening', 2021, 'Action, Adventure, History, Drama', 'Li Xijie, Zhang Zhulin', 'Fang Lan, Liu Bayin', 'Xie Miao, Chen Guanying, Sergio De Ieso, Hou Tongjiang, Gu Lei, Hao Yanfei', null, 'When a young Master Ip stops a kidnapping, he ignites a turf war with a ruthless human-trafficking ring. In retaliation, the gang kidnaps one of Ip Man''s close friends, forcing him to face the group''s brutal boxing champion head-on.', 'When a young Master Ip stops a kidnapping, he ignites a turf war with a ruthless human-trafficking ring. In retaliation, the gang kidnaps one of Ip Man''s close friends, forcing him to face the group''s brutal boxing champion head-on.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A7vhdyGrpPMKXsuFBZzxmave94F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:875104'),
