  ('819696355653662352', 'Iphigenia', 1977, 'Action, Drama', 'Mihalis Kakogiannis, Giorgos Arvanitis', 'Mihalis Kakogiannis', 'Irene Papas, Kostas Kazakos, Kostas Karras, Tatiana Papamoschou, Christos Tsagas, Panos Mihalopoulos, Angelos Yannoulis, Dimitris Aronis', 'NR', 'The Greek army is about to set sail to a great battle, but the winds refuse to blow. Their leader, King Agamemnon, seeks to provide better food, but accidentally slays a sacred deer. His punishment from the gods, the sacrifice of his daughter Iphigenia.', 'The Greek army is about to set sail to a great battle, but the winds refuse to blow. Their leader, King Agamemnon, seeks to provide better food, but accidentally slays a sacred deer. His punishment from the gods, the sacrifice of his daughter Iphigenia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qg5TioXNMquPUPXPwnNohbb0REC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46278'),
  ('502464984725960330', 'iPossessed', 2025, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Carl Rimi, Jerry Sommer, Jose J. Ferrer', 'Carl Rimi, Javier Mayol', 'Carl Rimi, Meghan Carrasquillo, Chris Moss, Tami Lee Boothby, Natalie Stavola, Sanfa L. Johnson, Jerry Sommer, Jack Covington III', 'NR', 'A group of celebrating friends make a pact with a demon to stay the night or someone loses their soul, only to find out the demons they are fighting might be the ones they carry inside.', 'A group of celebrating friends make a pact with a demon to stay the night or someone loses their soul, only to find out the demons they are fighting might be the ones they carry inside.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kmnaCRTinFPN8iplWgdGQZ52WzY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1052558'),
  ('39177838442362536', 'Iqbal', 1998, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Stefano Pancaldi, Cinzia TH Torrini', 'James Carrington, Francesco Marcucci, Andrea Purgatori', 'Lucky Dias, Trelicia Gunawardena, Veena Jayakody, Rajindra Jayasinghe, Ravindra Randeniya, Mohamed Rizlan, Prageeth Sanjeeva, Iranganie Serasinghe', null, 'Iqbal is about an Asian boy who gets sold by his father to a small carpentry production company in which child labour is supported. His "master" is a cruel man, imposing a ridiculous behaviour catalogue with strict charges. The children, about 5-10 years of age, have to work all day and they´re not allowed to go to toilet while at work, let alone visit their parents. Iqbal soon realizes that this is a massive injustice, especially when a member of the (unindentified) country´s Communist and Anti-child labour party takes photographs of the children.', 'Iqbal is about an Asian boy who gets sold by his father to a small carpentry production company in which child labour is supported. His "master" is a cruel man, imposing a ridiculous behaviour catalogue with strict charges. The children, about 5-10 years of age, have to work all day and they´re not allowed to go to toilet while at work, let alone visit their parents. Iqbal soon realizes that this is a massive injustice, especially when a member of the (unindentified) country´s Communist and Anti-child labour party takes photographs of the children.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5UazUE2KSXUeVL7TEjbyMhiMN5N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47465'),
  ('1147928737281500156', 'Iqbal', 2005, 'Drama', 'Nagesh Kukunoor', 'Nagesh Kukunoor', 'Shreyas Talpade, Naseeruddin Shah, Girish Karnad, Shweta Basu Prasad, Prateeksha Lonkar, Yatin Karyekar, Dilip Salgaonkar, Jyoti Joshi', null, 'This is all about chasing your dreams, no matter what the obstacles. The story involves a young deaf and dumb boy who is crazy about cricket.', 'This is all about chasing your dreams, no matter what the obstacles. The story involves a young deaf and dumb boy who is crazy about cricket.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oPdtscy3BYDsM83wddWkmQxcTEg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21567'),
  ('701763171993369382', 'Iqbal, a Tale of a Fearless Child', 2015, 'Animation, Adventure, Comedy, Family, Drama', 'Michel Fuzellier, Babak Payami', 'Paolo Bonaldi, Lara Fremder, Michel Fuzellier', 'Victor Quilichini, Audrey Sablé, Clara Quilichini, Yvan Le Bolloc''h, Jacques Bouanich, Bruno Solo', null, 'A little boy, Iqbal, is kidnapped by a carpet dealer who forces him to work in his workshop. With no fear or reproach, he will do everything he can to save himself and his unfortunate friends.', 'A little boy, Iqbal, is kidnapped by a carpet dealer who forces him to work in his workshop. With no fear or reproach, he will do everything he can to save himself and his unfortunate friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v7k1KEnyefY9IqoNF8aXYPQUQst.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:369235'),
  ('84264645000326906', 'Ira & Abby', 2006, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Robert Cary, Harlan Bosmajian', 'Jennifer Westfeldt', 'Chris Messina, Jennifer Westfeldt, David Margulies, Kali Rocha, Kevin Sussman, Marylouise Burke, Judith Light, Robert Klein', 'R', 'A neurotic, young psychology student, with low self-esteem, has a chance encounter with a free-spirited, extremely gregarious woman who works at the Paris Health Club in New York City, and who suggests that they immediately get married to see how it will work out. Both of the student''s parents are analysts, and they provide the happy couple with a gift certificate for a year of marriage counseling as a wedding present.', 'A neurotic, young psychology student, with low self-esteem, has a chance encounter with a free-spirited, extremely gregarious woman who works at the Paris Health Club in New York City, and who suggests that they immediately get married to see how it will work out. Both of the student''s parents are analysts, and they provide the happy couple with a gift certificate for a year of marriage counseling as a wedding present.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gK2XUjqWoqqYw6auny29W8tFwUG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38007'),
  ('1059096192440515264', 'Iracema', 1976, 'Drama', 'Jorge Bodanzky, Orlando Senna, Wolf Gauer', 'Orlando Senna', 'Edna de Cássia, Paulo César Peréio, Conceição Senna, Rose Rodrigues, Fernando Neves, Sidnei Piñon, Natal, Elma Martins', 'NR', 'A girl from the countryside goes to the city of Belém to take part in the Círio de Nazaré celebrations. Led to prostitution, she wishes to move to the wealthiest Southeast region of Brazil. In a dance club, she meets a truck driver that transports wood. Dreaming with the big city, she asks for a ride, and the two begin a journey through the Trans-Amazon road. In tension with the Brazilian military authorities of the time, the film registers several aspects of the Amazon social tragedy – forest fires, slave work and child prostitution. Awarded in several international festivals, the film was forbidden by the Brazilian censorship. It was only released years later, winning the Brasília Film Festival in 1981.', 'A girl from the countryside goes to the city of Belém to take part in the Círio de Nazaré celebrations. Led to prostitution, she wishes to move to the wealthiest Southeast region of Brazil. In a dance club, she meets a truck driver that transports wood. Dreaming with the big city, she asks for a ride, and the two begin a journey through the Trans-Amazon road. In tension with the Brazilian military authorities of the time, the film registers several aspects of the Amazon social tragedy – forest fires, slave work and child prostitution. Awarded in several international festivals, the film was forbidden by the Brazilian censorship. It was only released years later, winning the Brasília Film Festival in 1981.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9K7gLUmhjlQJSIp9Nn4PfoXKrHG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116146'),
  ('745924960127232045', 'Irada', 2017, 'Thriller', 'Aparna Singh, Ravi Walia', 'Aparna Singh', 'Arshad Warsi, Naseeruddin Shah, Sharad Kelkar, Divya Dutta, Sagarika Ghatge, Rumana Molla, Rajesh Sharma, Rajeev Mehta', null, 'A mysterious bomb blast in a business tycoon''s factory prompts the state CM to hire an NIA officer. He meets an ex-army man seeking revenge for his dead daughter and a journalist demanding justice for her slain boyfriend. Nothing is what it seems. The film raises contemporary ecological issue with lot of thrill.', 'A mysterious bomb blast in a business tycoon''s factory prompts the state CM to hire an NIA officer. He meets an ex-army man seeking revenge for his dead daughter and a journalist demanding justice for her slain boyfriend. Nothing is what it seems. The film raises contemporary ecological issue with lot of thrill.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p7D7sc1cqY1CullErh55wuw5Bwx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:441751'),
  ('370733133647438850', 'Iraq for Sale: The War Profiteers', 2006, 'Documentary', 'Robert Greenwald', null, 'Shereef Akeel, Chris Dodd, Carl Levin, Byron Dorgan', 'PG', 'Documentary portraying the actions of U.S. corporate contractors in the U.S.-Iraq war. Interviews with employees and former employees of such companies as Halliburton, CACI, and KBR suggest that government cronyism is behind apparent "sweetheart" deals that give such contractors enormous freedom to profit from supplying support and material to American troops while providing little oversight. Survivors of employees who were killed discuss the claim that the companies cared more for profit than for the welfare of their own workers, and soldiers indicate that the quality of services provided is sub-standard and severely in contradiction to the comparatively huge profits being generated. Also depicted are the unsuccessful attempts by the filmmakers to get company spokesmen to respond to the charges made by the interviewees.', 'Documentary portraying the actions of U.S. corporate contractors in the U.S.-Iraq war. Interviews with employees and former employees of such companies as Halliburton, CACI, and KBR suggest that government cronyism is behind apparent "sweetheart" deals that give such contractors enormous freedom to profit from supplying support and material to American troops while providing little oversight. Survivors of employees who were killed discuss the claim that the companies cared more for profit than for the welfare of their own workers, and soldiers indicate that the quality of services provided is sub-standard and severely in contradiction to the comparatively huge profits being generated. Also depicted are the unsuccessful attempts by the filmmakers to get company spokesmen to respond to the charges made by the interviewees.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nIAgVj3KtdJiyFRUmUFdGAMxcRE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40862'),
  ('466291918592315425', 'Irati', 2023, 'Drama, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Gorka Gómez Andreu, Javier Arsuaga Lekuona, Txabe Atxa', 'Paul Urkijo Alijo', 'Eneko Sagardoy, Edurne Azkarate, Itziar Ituño, Ramon Agirre, Patxi Bisquert, Karlos Arguiñano, Elena Uriz, Kepa Errasti', null, 'Western Pyrenees, year 778. When his land is threatened by the ruthless armies of the Frankish emperor, a Basque warlord asks for help from his ancestral gods.', 'Western Pyrenees, year 778. When his land is threatened by the ruthless armies of the Frankish emperor, a Basque warlord asks for help from his ancestral gods.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jVUpT8PIWU9mpUWQqEyYDqmFN2y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:726274'),
  ('147630074657837635', 'Iratta', 2023, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Rohith Krishnan, Vijay, Arjun Sethu', 'Rohith Krishnan', 'Joju George, Srikant Murali, Arya Salim, Manoj K U, Sabumon Abdusamad, Abhiram Radhakrishnan, Sreeja Ajith, Anjali', null, 'After a cop is found dead, a policeman''s investigation sparks a chilling search for the truth connected to his estranged twin and their fraught past.', 'After a cop is found dead, a policeman''s investigation sparks a chilling search for the truth connected to his estranged twin and their fraught past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1SEN2ymA9NrqBD8hbakBDFCO6r2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:945167'),
  ('270989780877500142', 'Irena''s Vow', 2024, 'War, Drama, History', 'Louise Archambault, Paul Sarossy, Agnieszka Cichocka', 'Dan Gordon', 'Sophie Nélisse, Dougray Scott, Andrzej Seweryn, Maciej Nawrocki, Sharon Azrieli, Eliza Rycembel, Aleksandar Milićević, Agata Turkot', 'R', '19 year old Irena Gut is promoted to housekeeper in the home of a highly respected Nazi officer in Poland when she finds out that the Jewish ghetto is about to be liquidated. Determined to help twelve Jewish workers, she decides to shelter them in the safest place she can think of – the basement of the German Major''s house. Over the next eight months, Irena uses her wit, humour and immense courage to hide her friends as long as possible.', '19 year old Irena Gut is promoted to housekeeper in the home of a highly respected Nazi officer in Poland when she finds out that the Jewish ghetto is about to be liquidated. Determined to help twelve Jewish workers, she decides to shelter them in the safest place she can think of – the basement of the German Major''s house. Over the next eight months, Irena uses her wit, humour and immense courage to hide her friends as long as possible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lN6iCgTgpNlylelUctrA29wJx4W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1026880'),
