  ('986914375308957531', 'Irene', 2014, null, 'Alexandra Latishev, Nicolás Wong', 'Alexandra Latishev', 'Liliana Biamonte, Rosibel Carvajal, Óscar González, Javier Reyes, Enio Arroyo', null, 'Irene is a single mother who works in a photocopying business. She lives with Santiago, her seven year old son, and her controlling mother Dinia. Then she meets Diego. They go out, she gets drunk, and the failed date triggers in Irene a crisis concerning her sexuality, her motherhood, and the relationship with her mother.', 'Irene is a single mother who works in a photocopying business. She lives with Santiago, her seven year old son, and her controlling mother Dinia. Then she meets Diego. They go out, she gets drunk, and the failed date triggers in Irene a crisis concerning her sexuality, her motherhood, and the relationship with her mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cenGnGrEsah8KI4NcRDFhvc2qEm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:290552'),
