  ('679247451320078227', 'Is It Wrong to Try to Pick Up Girls in a Dungeon?: Arrow of the Orion', 2019, 'Animation, Action, Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy, Romance', 'Yuuta Takamura, Shingo Fukuyo, Jin Aketagawa', 'Fujino Omori', 'Yoshitsugu Matsuoka, Inori Minase, Maaya Sakamoto, Saori Onishi, Maaya Uchida, Saori Hayami, Ai Kayano, Yoshimasa Hosoya', null, 'The goddess Artemis has sworn to destroy a powerful monster lurking in a distant, ancient city, and she needs Bell’s help to do it. But there is more to Artemis’ quest than meets the eye, and victory will not come easily for Bell and all his friends!', 'The goddess Artemis has sworn to destroy a powerful monster lurking in a distant, ancient city, and she needs Bell’s help to do it. But there is more to Artemis’ quest than meets the eye, and victory will not come easily for Bell and all his friends!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/78x3RRydNXvdB8BhJAwZz42g1Q1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:553835'),
