  ('912508347753883684', 'Is the Order a Rabbit?? Dear My Sister', 2017, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Hiroyuki Hashimoto, Kentaro Minegishi', 'Hiroyuki Hashimoto', 'Ayane Sakura, Inori Minase, Risa Taneda, Maaya Uchida, Satomi Sato, Motomu Kiyokawa, Rie Murakawa, Sora Tokui', null, 'Cocoa visits her family, in the mountains, after quite some time again after her sister Mocha wrote her, through a letter, to come back soon. Her friends will have to spend a week in the town without her, while Cocoa has time with her family that she hasn''t seen for a long time. But Chino, Cocoa''s self proclaimed little sister, wants to go watch, with Cocoa and all her friends, the fireworks in the fireworks festival, which is coming up in less than a week. Cocoa decides to return early as she misses them all, but will she arrive in time for the climax of the festival?', 'Cocoa visits her family, in the mountains, after quite some time again after her sister Mocha wrote her, through a letter, to come back soon. Her friends will have to spend a week in the town without her, while Cocoa has time with her family that she hasn''t seen for a long time. But Chino, Cocoa''s self proclaimed little sister, wants to go watch, with Cocoa and all her friends, the fireworks in the fireworks festival, which is coming up in less than a week. Cocoa decides to return early as she misses them all, but will she arrive in time for the climax of the festival?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x6LpFNSKb140SRClJdWC7U8qpFq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:486727'),
  ('645973845938082831', 'Is There a Doctor in the Mouse?', 1964, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Chuck Jones, Maurice Noble', null, 'Mel Blanc', null, 'Jerry mixes and drinks a high-acceleration potion which renders him so fast that he eats all of Tom''s food before the bewildered cat can even see him.', 'Jerry mixes and drinks a high-acceleration potion which renders him so fast that he eats all of Tom''s food before the bewildered cat can even see him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2RRIO23uOPN1c6u5zUfIcjUmrIs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:223032'),
  ('538502230892525648', 'Is There a Frenchman in the House?', 1982, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Jean-Pierre Mocky, Michel Kelber', 'Frédéric Dard, Jean-Pierre Mocky', 'Victor Lanoux, Jacques Dutronc, Jacqueline Maillan, Michel Galabru, Dominique Lavanant, Andréa Ferréol, Jean-François Stévenin, Jean-Luc Bideau', null, 'An official''s earlier rise to power had some sordid aspects that are about to be uncovered by the death of his uncle. While he is trying to contain any potential scandal, the man becomes enamored of the daughter of his uncle''s maid. This new romance inspires him to forget worries about a public image and focus on a new life -- not any easy objective when unsavory friends and foes have their own agendas in mind.', 'An official''s earlier rise to power had some sordid aspects that are about to be uncovered by the death of his uncle. While he is trying to contain any potential scandal, the man becomes enamored of the daughter of his uncle''s maid. This new romance inspires him to forget worries about a public image and focus on a new life -- not any easy objective when unsavory friends and foes have their own agendas in mind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8gg6eOMoxWZ4uueJmRoUo9YEShb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64336'),
  ('185930976225839018', 'Is There a Killer in My Family?', 2020, 'Thriller, TV Movie, Mystery', 'Leo Scherman, Scott McClellan, Colin Seepersad', 'Patrick Powell', 'Anna Hopkins, Christopher Jacot, Alex Paxton-Beesley, Erin Agostino, Carlos Gonzalez-Vio, Kim Roberts, Joan Gregson, Vickie Papavs', null, 'True-crime author, Carly, and her husband Kevin take a vacation at a historical mansion on Crawford Island. Kevin thinks it will be a chance for them to reconnect, but Carly plans to research the puzzling unsolved murder of Diana Crawford.', 'True-crime author, Carly, and her husband Kevin take a vacation at a historical mansion on Crawford Island. Kevin thinks it will be a chance for them to reconnect, but Carly plans to research the puzzling unsolved murder of Diana Crawford.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zk7fYRNr063kggg9Coy4zdHtaa0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:673228'),
  ('890984861273952374', 'Is There a Place Like This in Korea?! Visiting a Cheongdam Skin Care Shop', 2021, null, null, null, 'Yoon Yool, Min Do-yoon', null, 'Tina, a young woman who has lost her way in life, rents a room from the vibrant Megi, thanks to whom she gradually starts to discover what it’s like to be free and to be able to make her own decisions without being reliant on men… Self-assured in its directorial style, this authentic film portrays millennials in contemporary Tbilisi and points to the influence of patriarchal thinking on Georgian society.', 'Tina, a young woman who has lost her way in life, rents a room from the vibrant Megi, thanks to whom she gradually starts to discover what it’s like to be free and to be able to make her own decisions without being reliant on men… Self-assured in its directorial style, this authentic film portrays millennials in contemporary Tbilisi and points to the influence of patriarchal thinking on Georgian society.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xbN65PvfBKVJ7bXl1LVDJV7EjZf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1432053'),
  ('662544338284946741', 'Is This Goodbye, Charlie Brown?', 1983, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, TV Movie', 'Nick Vasu, Phil Roman', 'Charles M. Schulz', 'Brad Kesten, Jeremy Schoenberg, Angela Lee Sloan, Michael Dockery, Stacy Heather Tolkin, Victoria Vargas, Kevin Brando, Bill Melendez', null, 'Linus has to break devastating news, his father has a new job and has to relocate his family. Charlie Brown and the gang make their goodbyes and prepare for Linus and Lucy''s departure.', 'Linus has to break devastating news, his father has a new job and has to relocate his family. Charlie Brown and the gang make their goodbyes and prepare for Linus and Lucy''s departure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4XLs5aTKxRjbD7kcUjN3doErNm4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40375'),
  ('570207290536773071', 'Is This Love?', 2018, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Ömer Uğur', 'Cüneyt İnay', 'Afra Saraçoğlu, Kubilay Aka, Salih Kalyon, Şerif Erol, Evrim Doğan, Sadi Celil Cengiz, Cemil Şahin, Uğurtan Sayıner', null, 'Umut has been a thief since he was a kid. He constantly seeks the opportunity of his life and his family. He can''t find either. Gülüm is a young girl who has no problems in her life, who has completed her schooling on time and is only a step away from her dreams. But before she takes that step towards her dreams, she hangs and falls. It is understood that Gülüm has liver failure. She''ll die if she doesn''t have a liver transplant. The fate of Umut and Gülüm merge at this point. Umut found the opportunity he had waited for the rest of his life. But this opportunity drags Umut into very difficult situations, and finds itself in a position that risks the lives of all loved ones. For Umut to come out of this vortex, he has to make very serious decisions. And love is worth everything? Is this love?', 'Umut has been a thief since he was a kid. He constantly seeks the opportunity of his life and his family. He can''t find either. Gülüm is a young girl who has no problems in her life, who has completed her schooling on time and is only a step away from her dreams. But before she takes that step towards her dreams, she hangs and falls. It is understood that Gülüm has liver failure. She''ll die if she doesn''t have a liver transplant. The fate of Umut and Gülüm merge at this point. Umut found the opportunity he had waited for the rest of his life. But this opportunity drags Umut into very difficult situations, and finds itself in a position that risks the lives of all loved ones. For Umut to come out of this vortex, he has to make very serious decisions. And love is worth everything? Is this love?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2C4KmYpWOagIXHvHGbR8RwFxAuf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:613976'),
  ('1023105771433372947', 'Is This Reasonable?', 1981, 'Comedy, Action, Romance', 'Georges Lautner', 'Michel Audiard, Jean-Marie Poiré', 'Gérard Lanvin, Miou-Miou, Henri Guybet, Michel Galabru, Julien Guiomar, Jean-Pierre Darroussin, Max Montavon, Renée Saint-Cyr', null, 'A young journalist comes from Nice to Paris to meet with the famous judge, Simon, hoping he will help her understand a case. She does not know that, according to the will of fate, in the office of judge was fugitive criminal. The couple hit the road.', 'A young journalist comes from Nice to Paris to meet with the famous judge, Simon, hoping he will help her understand a case. She does not know that, according to the will of fate, in the office of judge was fugitive criminal. The couple hit the road.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dI2km95dipJQNTHL8YofNY2BAWJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78460'),
  ('862025859093763141', 'Is This Thing On?', 2025, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Bradley Cooper, Matthew Libatique, Peter Thorell', 'Will Arnett, Mark Chappell, Bradley Cooper', 'Will Arnett, Laura Dern, Andra Day, Bradley Cooper, Christine Ebersole, Ciarán Hinds, Amy Sedaris, Sean Hayes', 'R', 'As their marriage quietly unravels, Alex faces middle age and an impending divorce, seeking new purpose in the New York comedy scene while Tess confronts the sacrifices she made for their family—forcing them to navigate co-parenting, identity, and whether love can take a new form.', 'As their marriage quietly unravels, Alex faces middle age and an impending divorce, seeking new purpose in the New York comedy scene while Tess confronts the sacrifices she made for their family—forcing them to navigate co-parenting, identity, and whether love can take a new form.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/YD6QzcokTMe3EViM0hLbNCxf4y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1140498'),
  ('64486443777118777', 'Isaac', 2020, 'Drama', 'David Matamoros, Ángeles Hernández, Gina Ferrer', 'Ángeles Hernández, David Matamoros, Antonio Hernández Centeno', 'Iván Sánchez, Pepe Ocio, Erika Bleda, Nacho San José, Albert Pérez, Ivan Lapadula, Teresa Manresa, Maria Ribera', null, 'Two childhood friends, Denis and Nacho, meet again years after having an intense relationship as teenagers. Now with their respective partners, the couples grow close and end up fulfilling each other''s needs while breaking rules to discover their truths in the process.', 'Two childhood friends, Denis and Nacho, meet again years after having an intense relationship as teenagers. Now with their respective partners, the couples grow close and end up fulfilling each other''s needs while breaking rules to discover their truths in the process.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fuqVRCKtx8P2DXdYuYee6bWzsBz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:679896'),
  ('880311492725345209', 'Isaac Asimov: A Message to the Future', 2022, 'Science Fiction, Documentary, TV Movie', 'Mathias Théry', null, 'Isaac Asimov', null, 'With over 500 publications to his name, from the 50’s to the 80’s, he had anticipated computers and electronic gadgets invading the household, autonomous vehicles and man’s withdrawal from nature. Science fiction and anticipation stories have never been as popular as today. It inspires literature, drama series, films, even politics and the military. As the world we live in faces an unprecedented technological acceleration, we are more concerned than ever by the issue of our future.', 'With over 500 publications to his name, from the 50’s to the 80’s, he had anticipated computers and electronic gadgets invading the household, autonomous vehicles and man’s withdrawal from nature. Science fiction and anticipation stories have never been as popular as today. It inspires literature, drama series, films, even politics and the military. As the world we live in faces an unprecedented technological acceleration, we are more concerned than ever by the issue of our future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7kvDMqxK5I8zn4i44TypHtVBj2X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1030152'),
