  ('780720432979566397', 'Isabella, Duchess of the Devils', 1969, 'Adventure', 'Bruno Corbucci', 'Mario Amendola', 'Brigitte Skay, Mimmo Palmara, Fred Williams, Elina De Witt, Sal Borgese, Mario Novelli, Renato Baldini, Enzo Andronico', null, 'An Alsacian Baron massacres the family of a French Duke, and takes his lands and his title. Isabella, the Duke''s baby child, escapes the massacre, is raised by gypsies, and comes back twenty years later to exact revenge.', 'An Alsacian Baron massacres the family of a French Duke, and takes his lands and his title. Isabella, the Duke''s baby child, escapes the massacre, is raised by gypsies, and comes back twenty years later to exact revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/erxZAEZV4Dvm2LGGQwZbYa6zlJW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:180011'),
