  ('673124426922806793', 'Isadora''s Children', 2019, 'Drama', 'Damien Manivel, Noé Bach', 'Damien Manivel', 'Agathe Bonitzer, Manon Carpentier, Marika Rizzi, Elsa Wolliaston, Julien Dieudonné', null, 'Following the death of her two children, Isadora Duncan created the solo Mother in which a mother cradles her child in a moment of extreme tenderness, then lets it go. A century later, four women encounter this heart-rending dance.', 'Following the death of her two children, Isadora Duncan created the solo Mother in which a mother cradles her child in a moment of extreme tenderness, then lets it go. A century later, four women encounter this heart-rending dance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wnejukO7o7FHogujwp2AotJVMfy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:589745'),
