  ('1041411633152718968', 'Ishq', 1997, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama, Action', 'Indra Kumar', 'Rajeev Kaul', 'Ajay Devgn, Aamir Khan, Kajol, Juhi Chawla Mehta, Dalip Tahil, Johny Lever, Mohan Joshi, Deven Verma', null, 'The children of two wealthy businessman fall in love with someone from a poor background, much to their parents'' disapprovals.', 'The children of two wealthy businessman fall in love with someone from a poor background, much to their parents'' disapprovals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/38xVYSuVXIJS1iyEaRm8wtjotZB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29988'),
  ('970310944329608046', 'Ishq Vishk', 2003, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Ken Ghosh, Amit Roy', 'Vinod Ranganathan', 'Shahid Kapoor, Amrita Rao, Shenaz Treasury, Yash Tonk, Satish Shah, Vishal Malhotra, Upasna Singh, Neelima Azim', null, 'Rajiv Mathur decides to go conditionally steady with fellow collegian, Payal, so that be can be permitted to go on an outing. Payal accepts, and accompanies him. During the outing, he gets intoxicated, and attempts to molest her, and she decides to dump him. Thereafter, slighted but not beaten - Rajiv turns on his charms on another beauty - the gorgeous Alisha Sahay. But will she be as permissible as Payal?', 'Rajiv Mathur decides to go conditionally steady with fellow collegian, Payal, so that be can be permitted to go on an outing. Payal accepts, and accompanies him. During the outing, he gets intoxicated, and attempts to molest her, and she decides to dump him. Thereafter, slighted but not beaten - Rajiv turns on his charms on another beauty - the gorgeous Alisha Sahay. But will she be as permissible as Payal?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h3ipvgyBjWS6nTeO4iB75vKulgL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41901'),
  ('207502543477385006', 'Ishqa''n De Lekhe', 2026, 'Drama, Romance, Music', 'Manvir Brar', 'Jassi Lohka', 'Gurnam Bhullar, Isha Malviya, Rana Ranbir, Mintu Kapa, Balwinder Bullet, Mohini Toor, arshdeep kaur bhatti, Shanaya Khanna', null, 'Starring the sensational Gurnam Bhullar alongside the stunning Isha Malviya, this Punjabi cinema is crafted for every soul that has ever loved deeply. Directed by the talented Manvir Brar, Ishqa''n De Lekhe is set to redefine Punjabi romance on the big screen.', 'Starring the sensational Gurnam Bhullar alongside the stunning Isha Malviya, this Punjabi cinema is crafted for every soul that has ever loved deeply. Directed by the talented Manvir Brar, Ishqa''n De Lekhe is set to redefine Punjabi romance on the big screen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g3EpAFlNGqkYxkw8cHOANzi8u1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1643729'),
  ('76298634974374327', 'Ishqan De Lekhe', 2026, 'Romance, Drama, Music', 'Manvir Brar', 'Jassi Lohka', 'Gurnam Bhullar, Isha Malviya, Rana Ranbir', null, 'Charismatic student leader Samar sweeps reserved Jasneet off her feet, but campus politics and jealousy fuel a devastating misunderstanding. When she believes he''s betrayed her, tragedy strikes before he can set things right.', 'Charismatic student leader Samar sweeps reserved Jasneet off her feet, but campus politics and jealousy fuel a devastating misunderstanding. When she believes he''s betrayed her, tragedy strikes before he can set things right.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2Fg3EpAFlNGqkYxkw8cHOANzi8u1.jpg', 'plex:movie:ishqan-de-lekhe'),
  ('764660443977203099', 'Ishqiya', 2010, 'Thriller, Comedy', 'Abhishek Chaubey, Jogi Malang, Mohana Krishna', 'Vishal Bhardwaj, Abhishek Chaubey, Sabrina Dhawan', 'Naseeruddin Shah, Vidya Balan, Arshad Warsi, Salman Shahid, Adil Hussain, Anupama Kumar, Alok Kumar, Gauri Malla', null, 'While on the run from goons, a man and his nephew fall for a kidnapper''s seductive widow.', 'While on the run from goons, a man and his nephew fall for a kidnapper''s seductive widow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zljQDSFyBvrhrzwJWNEOVyQzaIo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33556'),
  ('453642472038042232', 'Ishtar', 1987, 'Comedy, Adventure', 'Vittorio Storaro, Elaine May, Lee Cleary', 'Elaine May', 'Warren Beatty, Dustin Hoffman, Isabelle Adjani, Charles Grodin, Jack Weston, Tess Harper, Carol Kane, Aharon Ipalé', 'PG-13', 'Two terrible lounge singers get booked to play a gig in a Moroccan hotel but somehow become pawns in an international power play between the CIA, the Emir of Ishtar, and the rebels trying to overthrow his regime.', 'Two terrible lounge singers get booked to play a gig in a Moroccan hotel but somehow become pawns in an international power play between the CIA, the Emir of Ishtar, and the rebels trying to overthrow his regime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2n6cDGd84I1KvCeYlTju7MBC9sN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12704'),
  ('272505766251258235', 'Isi & Disi: alto voltaje', 2006, 'Adventure, Music, Comedy', 'Teo Delgado, Miguel Ángel Lamata', 'Miguel Ángel Aijón, Miguel Ángel Lamata', 'Santiago Segura, Florentino Fernández, Kira Miró, El Gran Wyoming, Miguel Ángel Rodríguez ''El Sevilla'', Pilar Rubio, Jaime Ordóñez, Ruth Zanon', null, 'Isi and Disi, the more thugs Leganés heavys return. This time Disi falls in love for the sexy Angie, former rock singer and girlfriend of a big shot record, Berdún. After being recognized as the most brutal band in the equally brutal contest presented by Angie, Disi not only have to save his group Ratamuerta, his friendship with Isi, and the temple of rock "The Kampana of Hell", but also rescue Angie from the clutches of machiavellian Berdún. Once again, rock triumph over evil ...', 'Isi and Disi, the more thugs Leganés heavys return. This time Disi falls in love for the sexy Angie, former rock singer and girlfriend of a big shot record, Berdún. After being recognized as the most brutal band in the equally brutal contest presented by Angie, Disi not only have to save his group Ratamuerta, his friendship with Isi, and the temple of rock "The Kampana of Hell", but also rescue Angie from the clutches of machiavellian Berdún. Once again, rock triumph over evil ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/74beRdQGnkCmzkCt2Tu8g2WnAYZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95932'),
  ('373969169298372750', 'Isi & Ossi', 2020, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Oliver Kienle, Yoshi Heimrath', 'Oliver Kienle', 'Lisa Vicari, Dennis Mojen, Lisa Hagmeister, Ernst Stötzner, Christina Hecke, Hans-Jochen Wagner, Walid Al-Atiyat, Zoë Straub', null, 'Isi and Ossi couldn''t be any more different: She''s a billionaire''s daughter from Heidelberg, he''s a struggling boxer from the nearby town of Mannheim. But when Isi meets Ossi, the two quickly realize that they can take advantage of one another: She dates the broke boxer to provoke her parents and get them to fund a long-desired chef training in New York. He tries to rip off the rich daughter to finance his first professional boxing match. Their plans soon develop into emotional chaos that challenges everything the two believe to know about money, career and love.', 'Isi and Ossi couldn''t be any more different: She''s a billionaire''s daughter from Heidelberg, he''s a struggling boxer from the nearby town of Mannheim. But when Isi meets Ossi, the two quickly realize that they can take advantage of one another: She dates the broke boxer to provoke her parents and get them to fund a long-desired chef training in New York. He tries to rip off the rich daughter to finance his first professional boxing match. Their plans soon develop into emotional chaos that challenges everything the two believe to know about money, career and love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bZ7H0kCwEM6CQ0dyCs2H4RkU130.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:658760'),
  ('1077858261000203078', 'Isi/Disi - Amor a lo bestia', 2004, 'Comedy, Music, Romance', 'Chema de la Peña, José M. Serrano, Javier Sánchez', 'Miguel Ángel Fernández, Joaquín Górriz', 'Santiago Segura, Florentino Fernández, Jaydy Michel, Ana Risueño, Ruth Zanon, José Luis Coll, Manolo de Vega, Joaquín Sabina', null, 'Will love compromise one man''s devotion to heavy rock? That''s the all-important question behind this broad comedy from Spain. Isi (Santiago Segura) and Disi (Florentino Fernandez) are two best friends who live in a lower middle-class neighborhood near Madrid. Isi and Disi aren''t especially bright, but their devotion to heavy metal is complete and unquestioned, and they wouldn''t be caught dead listening to a lame pop singer like, say , Joaquin Sabina. However, one day Isi sees Vane (Jaydy Michel), a beautiful girl who attends a nearby college, and immediately falls head over heels in love.', 'Will love compromise one man''s devotion to heavy rock? That''s the all-important question behind this broad comedy from Spain. Isi (Santiago Segura) and Disi (Florentino Fernandez) are two best friends who live in a lower middle-class neighborhood near Madrid. Isi and Disi aren''t especially bright, but their devotion to heavy metal is complete and unquestioned, and they wouldn''t be caught dead listening to a lame pop singer like, say , Joaquin Sabina. However, one day Isi sees Vane (Jaydy Michel), a beautiful girl who attends a nearby college, and immediately falls head over heels in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bn8JLZHxuHdwpjWdpXl1yld8TBG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48635'),
  ('522547583276318947', 'Isidoro: la película', 2007, 'Comedy, Animation', 'José Luis Massa, Marcelo Del Castillo, Diego Monk', 'Daniel García Molt, Axel Nacher', 'Dady Brieva, Luciana Salazar, Gustavo Bonfigli, Miguel Torres del Sel, Mario Pereyra, Mariano Chiesa, Hernán Chiozza, Sebastian Costa', null, 'Isidoro is a lazy guy, who loves parties and casinos, but has never worked, so he lives off his father''s inheritance and making his uncle suffer. But because his uncle, Colonel Cañones, is accused of a crime against the nation, Isidoro must work for the first time in his life to find the true culprit.', 'Isidoro is a lazy guy, who loves parties and casinos, but has never worked, so he lives off his father''s inheritance and making his uncle suffer. But because his uncle, Colonel Cañones, is accused of a crime against the nation, Isidoro must work for the first time in his life to find the true culprit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b1actuoqtWtnAcz0iwFGsfQ5NhL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:412327'),
  ('608130420428313070', 'Isla bonita', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Fernando Colomo, Alfonso Sanz', 'Fernando Colomo, Olivia Delcán, Miguel Ángel Furones', 'Fernando Colomo, Olivia Delcán, Tim Borys, Miguel Ángel Furones, Nuria Román, Lluís Marquès, Alberto Pacheco, Olga Román', null, 'Summer in Menorca. The young Olivia has lost all understanding for the world. She just ended an affair in order to begin a real relationship, but no sooner had it started than this also ends. She is comforted and receives prosaic advice from her sculptor mother Nuria. When pensioned advertisement filmmaker Fernando moves into their guesthouse, a fresh wind blows over the island. While Olivia sees him as a father figure, Fernando tries to seduce Nuria. ISLA BONITA is a charming, wonderfully cheerful comedy full of misunderstandings – and a bijou homage to the idyllic holiday island of Menorca. Director and main actor Fernando Colomo delights us with this semi-autobiographic fiction film.', 'Summer in Menorca. The young Olivia has lost all understanding for the world. She just ended an affair in order to begin a real relationship, but no sooner had it started than this also ends. She is comforted and receives prosaic advice from her sculptor mother Nuria. When pensioned advertisement filmmaker Fernando moves into their guesthouse, a fresh wind blows over the island. While Olivia sees him as a father figure, Fernando tries to seduce Nuria. ISLA BONITA is a charming, wonderfully cheerful comedy full of misunderstandings – and a bijou homage to the idyllic holiday island of Menorca. Director and main actor Fernando Colomo delights us with this semi-autobiographic fiction film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2crOBSJVF8RvSdEcFG3dbaAyzft.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:355594'),
  ('888319104706413392', 'Isla bonita', 2023, 'Comedy, Adventure', 'Ani Alva Helfer', 'Ani Alva Helfer, Dorian Fernández-Moris, Rogger Vergara Adrianzén', 'Patricia Barreto, Emilia Drago, Saskia Bernaola, César Ritter, Wales Pana, Alejandro Villagomes, Patricia Portocarrero, Hernán Romero', null, 'Three friends travel towards Iquitos in search of fun and will decide if it''s time to put an end to the routine life they have.', 'Three friends travel towards Iquitos in search of fun and will decide if it''s time to put an end to the routine life they have.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fhQBj1lqwCpC4oCiX2eVuVKtHVV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1168733'),
  ('16579384127126563', 'Island', 1973, 'Animation', 'Fyodor Khitruk', 'Fyodor Khitruk', 'Elena Chepoy, Eduard Nazarov', null, 'A castaway is interrogated by Interpol, conquered by an imperialist ship, loses his lone palm tree to greedy loggers, is consoled by a missionary who promptly abandons him, is thoroughly examined by scientists, and harassed by journalists.', 'A castaway is interrogated by Interpol, conquered by an imperialist ship, loses his lone palm tree to greedy loggers, is consoled by a missionary who promptly abandons him, is thoroughly examined by scientists, and harassed by journalists.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/omtVsvtxU2U37RTAmLoTfcbHKCO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:339438'),
  ('955630863082734265', 'Island', 2018, 'Drama', 'Glenda Nicácio, Ary Rosa, Thamires Vieira', 'Ary Rosa', 'Aldri Anunciação, Renan Motta, Arlete Dias, Thacle de Souza, Valdineia Soriano, Sérgio Laurentino, Aline Brune, Caíque Neres', null, 'Emerson and his friend Thacle kidnap Henrique, a famous brazilian filmmaker, in order to get his help in the making of a movie on their home island.', 'Emerson and his friend Thacle kidnap Henrique, a famous brazilian filmmaker, in order to get his help in the making of a movie on their home island.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b5FgLtdpH4NhOmoHQzUzZyUaUnS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:540014'),
  ('312878027295344550', 'Island Claws', 1980, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Hernan Cardenas, James Pergola', 'Jack Cowden, Ricou Browning', 'Robert Lansing, Steve Hanks, Nita Talbot, Jo McDonnell, Martina Deignan, Barry Nelson, Tony Rigo, Raymond Forchion', 'PG', 'A biological experiment in Florida goes awry. The result: 8-foot long land crabs which roar loudly and kill everything in sight.', 'A biological experiment in Florida goes awry. The result: 8-foot long land crabs which roar loudly and kill everything in sight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2fLuqmK1cox7qboPuARvzVQxTNm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126487'),
  ('749461931451476833', 'Island in Between', 2023, 'Documentary', 'S. Leo Chiang, Yen-Lin Chen, S. Leo Chiang', 'S. Leo Chiang', 'Sen-Po Tung, Ja-Shin Wu, Ya-Ping Hu, Qiao-Ling Lin, Ying-Lung Chiang, Yue-Ling Lai, Wun-Siang Cheng, Li-Hung Lin', null, 'The rural Taiwanese outer islands of Kinmen sit merely 2 miles off the coast of China. Kinmen attracts tourists for its remains from the 1949 Chinese Civil War. It also marks the frontline for Taiwan in its escalating tension with China.', 'The rural Taiwanese outer islands of Kinmen sit merely 2 miles off the coast of China. Kinmen attracts tourists for its remains from the 1949 Chinese Civil War. It also marks the frontline for Taiwan in its escalating tension with China.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2tTXYn0BulJurNxtiSMV6eAfrTF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1203439'),
  ('170028252416620398', 'Island in the Sky', 1953, 'Adventure, Drama', 'William A. Wellman, Archie Stout, Andrew V. McLaglen', 'Ernest K. Gann', 'John Wayne, Lloyd Nolan, Walter Abel, James Arness, Andy Devine, Allyn Joslyn, Jimmy Lydon, Harry Carey, Jr.', 'NR', 'A C-47 transport plane, named the Corsair, makes a forced landing in the frozen wastelands of Labrador, and the plane''s pilot, Captain Dooley, must keep his men alive in deadly conditions while awaiting rescue.', 'A C-47 transport plane, named the Corsair, makes a forced landing in the frozen wastelands of Labrador, and the plane''s pilot, Captain Dooley, must keep his men alive in deadly conditions while awaiting rescue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z4SFfn5f4a2RrXAqVue9P8lTCLi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40577'),
