  ('73773300161511724', 'Island of Blood', 1982, 'Horror', 'William T. Naud, Thomas E. Spalding', 'William T. Naud', 'Marie-Alise Recasner, Rick Dean, Ron Gardner, Terence Goodman, Richard Helm, Jeanine Marie, Jared McVay, G. Rockett Phillips', null, 'The cast and crew of a low budget movie, filming on an island, are murdered one by one in accordance with the lethal lyrics of a punk rock song.', 'The cast and crew of a low budget movie, filming on an island, are murdered one by one in accordance with the lethal lyrics of a punk rock song.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qdznivG5GNcJABmoWY8lWLqBB6B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85200'),
  ('817248128527030035', 'Island of Death', 1976, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Nico Mastorakis, Nikos Gardelis, Nico Mastorakis', 'Nico Mastorakis', 'Robert Behling, Jane Lyle, Jessica Dublin, Gerard Gonalons, Jannice McConnell, Clay Half, Mike Murtagh, Jeremy Rousseau', 'R', 'A British couple on a break on a small Greek Island spreads terror beyond anything the Islanders could ever have imagined, only stopping every once in a while to shag anything that moves, be it man, woman or animal. But will they go unpunished, or will the inspector from London be able to put an end to their killing spree?', 'A British couple on a break on a small Greek Island spreads terror beyond anything the Islanders could ever have imagined, only stopping every once in a while to shag anything that moves, be it man, woman or animal. But will they go unpunished, or will the inspector from London be able to put an end to their killing spree?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vWfz11ffaHL2kMja0iwz8skFsIP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40043'),
  ('704232074861834657', 'Island of Doomed Men', 1940, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Charles Barton, Morris Stoloff, Benjamin H. Kline', 'Robert Hardy Andrews', 'Peter Lorre, Rochelle Hudson, Robert Wilcox, Don Beddoe, George E. Stone, Kenneth MacDonald, Charles Middleton, Stanley Brown', 'NR', 'An undercover agent wrongly punished for murder is paroled to a remote tropical island with a diamond mine slave labor run by a sadistic foreigner.', 'An undercover agent wrongly punished for murder is paroled to a remote tropical island with a diamond mine slave labor run by a sadistic foreigner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hm263P1rFxzMyuFnn9QlnEy7hsT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98092'),
  ('959030988175479548', 'Island of Fire', 1990, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Kevin Chu, Tu Fu-Ping, Chan Foo-Fai', 'Fu Li, Yip Wan-Chiu', 'Tony Leung Ka-fai, Sammo Hung Kam-Bo, Jackie Chan, Andy Lau, Jimmy Wang Yu, Tou Tsung-hua, Jack Kao, Ko Chun-Hsiung', null, 'Someone in a prison run by a corrupt warden fakes the deaths of convicts to later use them as expendable assassins. A police officer is sent into the prison to gather evidence of the corruption.', 'Someone in a prison run by a corrupt warden fakes the deaths of convicts to later use them as expendable assassins. A police officer is sent into the prison to gather evidence of the corruption.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1sGDNO8HlpcVmXpBxOAKEV270cI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18767'),
  ('1044635873483627385', 'Island of Greed', 1997, 'Drama, Thriller, Action, Crime', 'Michael Mak Tong-Kit, Jingle Ma Choh-Sing', 'Johnny Mak Tong-Hung', 'Andy Lau, Tony Leung Ka-fai, Annie Wu, Paulyn Sun, Kelly Kuo, Winston Chao, Lee Li-Chun, King Shih-chieh', null, 'A gutsy police detecive and his team of cops probe into the widespread illegal dealings of a criminal mastermind who schemes to redeem himself by running for government office in taiwan.', 'A gutsy police detecive and his team of cops probe into the widespread illegal dealings of a criminal mastermind who schemes to redeem himself by running for government office in taiwan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wwZxZzApGeQAmZheTbYCkwFoy1m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42855'),
  ('316136827907946443', 'Island of Lost Souls', 1932, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Karl Struss, Erle C. Kenton', 'Philip Wylie, Waldemar Young', 'Charles Laughton, Richard Arlen, Leila Hyams, Bela Lugosi, Kathleen Burke, Arthur Hohl, Stanley Fields, Paul Hurst', 'NR', 'An obsessed scientist conducts profane experiments in evolution, eventually establishing himself as the self-styled demigod to a race of mutated, half-human abominations.', 'An obsessed scientist conducts profane experiments in evolution, eventually establishing himself as the self-styled demigod to a race of mutated, half-human abominations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g7K7r1FojQC52YHxfmuXgwYBq5Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3031'),
  ('45226411410238731', 'Island of Lost Souls', 2007, 'Fantasy, Adventure, Family, Drama', 'Nikolaj Arcel, Rasmus Videbæk', 'Rasmus Heisterberg, Nikolaj Arcel', 'Sara Langebæk Gaarmann, Lucas Munk Billing, Lasse Borg, Nicolaj Kopernikus, Lars Mikkelsen, Anette Støvelbæk, Anders W. Berthelsen, Beate Bille', null, '14-year-old Lulu moves to a small provincial town with her mother and younger brother. One night, her brother is struck by a beam of white light - actually the spirit of Herman Hartmann from the 19th-century. To her despair, Lulu realizes that Herman has possessed her brother, and the two of them are whirled into a fevered adventure.', '14-year-old Lulu moves to a small provincial town with her mother and younger brother. One night, her brother is struck by a beam of white light - actually the spirit of Herman Hartmann from the 19th-century. To her despair, Lulu realizes that Herman has possessed her brother, and the two of them are whirled into a fevered adventure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xkuiAd022FPEkDn8hfGF3LuaxDV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13626'),
  ('870224343150871540', 'Island of Lost Women', 1959, 'Adventure, Drama', 'John F. Seitz, Frank Tuttle', 'Ray Buffum', 'Jeff Richards, John Smith, Venetia Stevenson, Alan Napier, Diane Jergens, June Blair, Gavin Muir, George Brand', 'NR', 'A plane crash-lands on a jungle island inhabited by a scientist and his nubile young daughters. Complications ensue.', 'A plane crash-lands on a jungle island inhabited by a scientist and his nubile young daughters. Complications ensue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iKUtLCGrv30iHGaAOk1uLNd2lDU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116336'),
  ('265281373664264985', 'Island of Mistakes', 1955, 'Animation', 'Zinaida Brumberg, Valentina Brumberg, Elena Petrova', 'Mikhail Volpin, Nikolay Erdman', 'Vera Bendina, Liliya Gritsenko, Irina Gosheva, Olga Androvskaya, Galina Novozhilova, Pavel Bryansky, Serafima Birman, Vladimir Gribkov', null, 'A short animated film about poor student Kolya Sorokin, who is dragged by two swans to the island of errors. On the island, incorrect solutions cause a lot of problems for Kolya. These trials force the hero to approach his responsibilities in a different way.', 'A short animated film about poor student Kolya Sorokin, who is dragged by two swans to the island of errors. On the island, incorrect solutions cause a lot of problems for Kolya. These trials force the hero to approach his responsibilities in a different way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5rRxeZBVUQYL6iFFdpKhsVchl6a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:448487'),
  ('240175809829746869', 'Island of Terror', 1966, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Terence Fisher, Reginald H. Wyer', 'Al Ramsen, Edward Mann', 'Peter Cushing, Edward Judd, Carole Gray, Eddie Byrne, Sam Kydd, Niall MacGinnis, James Caffrey, Liam Gaffney', null, 'A small island community is overrun with creeping, blobbish, tentacled monsters which liquefy and digest the bones from living creatures. The community struggles to fight back.', 'A small island community is overrun with creeping, blobbish, tentacled monsters which liquefy and digest the bones from living creatures. The community struggles to fight back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xbKgZjvMw5FiSfsmPYephSNChST.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28763'),
  ('640455025405720060', 'Island of the Blue Dolphins', 1964, 'Adventure, Drama, Family, History', 'James B. Clark, Phil Bowles, Leo Tover', 'Ted Sherdeman, Jane Klove', 'Celia Milius, Larry Domasin, Ann Daniel, Carlos Romero, George Kennedy, Hal Jon Norman, Julie Payne, Martín Garralaga', 'NR', 'Based on the beloved book by Scott O''Dell, this family movie tells the adventures of a young Native American girl. After her father is killed by a malevolent white trapper, Karana joins her community as they leave their island home in the Pacific to live on the mainland. Upon her departure, Karana realizes that her brother has been left behind. She immediately swims back to be with him and the two remain on the abandoned island. Though Karana is able to domesticate a wolf, her brother is not so fortunate with the animals and is killed by a pack of wild dogs. She is left to survive against the odds.', 'Based on the beloved book by Scott O''Dell, this family movie tells the adventures of a young Native American girl. After her father is killed by a malevolent white trapper, Karana joins her community as they leave their island home in the Pacific to live on the mainland. Upon her departure, Karana realizes that her brother has been left behind. She immediately swims back to be with him and the two remain on the abandoned island. Though Karana is able to domesticate a wolf, her brother is not so fortunate with the animals and is killed by a pack of wild dogs. She is left to survive against the odds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Cy89UfnqHHaCCkJbNLXYam4Jvk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85827'),
