  ('290694570039651968', 'Islands', 2017, 'Drama, Fantasy, Horror, Romance', 'Yann Gonzalez, Marie-Béatrice Frugier, Simon Beaufils', 'Yann Gonzalez', 'Sarah-Megan Allouch, Mathilde Mennetrier, Alphonse Maitrepierre, Romain Merle, Simone Thiébaut, Thomas Ducasse, Félix Maritaud, Pierre-Ange Carlotti', 'NR', 'A sexual reverie unfolds over the course of one ethereal night. Characters wander through an erotic maze of love and lust, blurring the lines between wet dream and lucid nightmare as a macabre, erotic stage performance sends a ripple of lustful desires through its audience and performers.', 'A sexual reverie unfolds over the course of one ethereal night. Characters wander through an erotic maze of love and lust, blurring the lines between wet dream and lucid nightmare as a macabre, erotic stage performance sends a ripple of lustful desires through its audience and performers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sRINgACuZN3lNfREPBDpySvT1jY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:456931'),
  ('360785531273598185', 'Islands', 2025, 'Thriller, Drama, Crime', 'Jan Ole Gerster, Juan Sarmiento G.', 'Jan Ole Gerster, Blaž Kutin, Lawrie Doran', 'Sam Riley, Stacy Martin, Jack Farthing, Dylan Torrell, Agnes Lindström Bolmgren, Bruna Cusí, Pep Ambròs, Fatima Adoum', 'NR', 'In this twisty thriller, a tennis coach at a tropical resort finds himself at the center of a missing persons mystery. Tom teaches tennis during the day and parties at night. When an enigmatic tourist arrives, Tom is unable to shake the feeling he has met her before. Tension and attraction grow, until her husband disappears, and the police suspect Tom.', 'In this twisty thriller, a tennis coach at a tropical resort finds himself at the center of a missing persons mystery. Tom teaches tennis during the day and parties at night. When an enigmatic tourist arrives, Tom is unable to shake the feeling he has met her before. Tension and attraction grow, until her husband disappears, and the police suspect Tom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mnNYETN1kxmf3DbUSDTGGaUBEHs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1128547'),
  ('533283721374863764', 'Islands in the Stream', 1977, 'Drama', 'Franklin J. Schaffner, Fred J. Koenekamp', 'Denne Bart Petitclerc', 'George C. Scott, David Hemmings, Gilbert Roland, Hart Bochner, Susan Tyrrell, Richard Evans, Claire Bloom, Julius Harris', 'PG', 'An isolated sculptor is visited by his three sons just before the start of WWII.', 'An isolated sculptor is visited by his three sons just before the start of WWII.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5b8WIyAXdoY8ik2ZmqMw53MIcDQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70926'),
  ('926396743247532554', 'Islands of Fire', 1955, 'Documentary', 'Vittorio De Seta, Vittorio De Seta, Vera Gherarducci', 'Vittorio De Seta', null, null, 'The first light of dawn. The sound of a boat and the screech of birds fill the wide expanse of sea. Black rocks emerge from the water, the “sciara” – the volcanic scoria – of Stromboli, the underwater sulfurous emanations, the layers of reddish rock eroded by the sea. The roar of the volcano can be heard, the flames and the liquid lava are thrown skyward. As nature unleashes itself, the fishermen row toward the shore, the sheep stray and the women return home.', 'The first light of dawn. The sound of a boat and the screech of birds fill the wide expanse of sea. Black rocks emerge from the water, the “sciara” – the volcanic scoria – of Stromboli, the underwater sulfurous emanations, the layers of reddish rock eroded by the sea. The roar of the volcano can be heard, the flames and the liquid lava are thrown skyward. As nature unleashes itself, the fishermen row toward the shore, the sheep stray and the women return home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/coW4nCeOqyEgPwHoPwdyhXXVGWF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:129971'),
  ('812363049350947988', 'Isle of Darkness', 1997, 'Horror, Thriller, Mystery', 'Trygve Allister Diesen, Harald Gunnar Paalgard', 'Nikolaj Scherfig, Trygve Allister Diesen', 'Sofie Gråbøl, Paul-Ottar Haga, Sina Langfeldt, Martin Slaatto, Trini Lund, John Sigurd Kristensen, Juni Dahr, Terje Strømdahl', null, 'Julie is a young and newly qualified teacher from Copenhagen, Denmark. Fed up with her unfaithful boyfriend and big city life, she takes a job as a teacher on an idyllic island in southern Norway. Julie finds it difficult to be accepted in the closed-net community of the island. Slowly but surely, she discovers that the idyllic island hides many dark secrets.', 'Julie is a young and newly qualified teacher from Copenhagen, Denmark. Fed up with her unfaithful boyfriend and big city life, she takes a job as a teacher on an idyllic island in southern Norway. Julie finds it difficult to be accepted in the closed-net community of the island. Slowly but surely, she discovers that the idyllic island hides many dark secrets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2L3nUzvasELIXYTuLCB7epSG8Nv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:169030'),
  ('240933570939499901', 'Isle of Dogs', 2018, 'Adventure, Comedy, Animation', 'Wes Anderson, Tristan Oliver, David Greenbaum', 'Wes Anderson', 'Bryan Cranston, Koyu Rankin, Bob Balaban, Edward Norton, Bill Murray, Jeff Goldblum, Kunichi Nomura, Fisher Stevens', 'PG-13', 'In the future, an outbreak of canine flu leads the mayor of a Japanese city to banish all dogs to an island used as a garbage dump. The outcasts must soon embark on an epic journey when a 12-year-old boy arrives on the island to find his beloved pet.', 'In the future, an outbreak of canine flu leads the mayor of a Japanese city to banish all dogs to an island used as a garbage dump. The outcasts must soon embark on an epic journey when a 12-year-old boy arrives on the island to find his beloved pet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c0nUX6Q1ZB0P2t1Jo6EeFSVnOGQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:399174'),
  ('500684813197451716', 'Isle of Flowers', 1989, 'Documentary', 'Sérgio Amon, Roberto Henkin, Jorge Furtado', 'Jorge Furtado', 'Paulo José, Júlia Barth, Luciane Azevedo, Ciça Reckziegel, Igor Costa, Douglas Trainini, Irene Schmidt, Gosei Kitajima', null, 'A tomato is planted, harvested and sold at a supermarket, but it rots and ends up in the trash. But it doesn’t end there: Isle of Flowers follows it up until its real end, among animals, trash, women and children. And then the difference between tomatoes, pigs and human beings becomes clear.', 'A tomato is planted, harvested and sold at a supermarket, but it rots and ends up in the trash. But it doesn’t end there: Isle of Flowers follows it up until its real end, among animals, trash, women and children. And then the difference between tomatoes, pigs and human beings becomes clear.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cghvWnWK5AuIKPY92YRV9tCeNhw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45318'),
  ('193897386335535328', 'Isle of Fury', 1936, 'Adventure, Drama', 'Frank McDonald, Frank B. Good, Frank Heath', 'Robert Hardy Andrews, William Jacobs', 'Humphrey Bogart, Margaret Lindsay, Donald Woods, E. E. Clive, Paul Graetz, Gordon Hart, George Regas, Sidney Bracey', 'NR', 'An island pearl merchant and his new wife make room for a mysterious shipwrecked man.', 'An island pearl merchant and his new wife make room for a mysterious shipwrecked man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lzUhoEjUya4imvpy6kiio81oRbJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121848'),
  ('242257273660131013', 'Isle of the Dead', 1945, 'Horror, Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Jack MacKenzie, Mark Robson', 'Ardel Wray', 'Boris Karloff, Ellen Drew, Marc Cramer, Katherine Emery, Helene Thimig, Alan Napier, Jason Robards Sr., Ernst Deutsch', null, 'On a Greek island during the 1912 war, several people are trapped by quarantine for the plague. If that isn''t enough worry, one of the people—a superstitious old peasant—suspects a young woman of being a vampiric demon.', 'On a Greek island during the 1912 war, several people are trapped by quarantine for the plague. If that isn''t enough worry, one of the people—a superstitious old peasant—suspects a young woman of being a vampiric demon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eHnxz2K8fuUR5qwmkhdurBpZ5z0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30348'),
  ('615926633824328442', 'Isle of the Snake People', 1971, 'Horror', 'Juan Ibáñez, Jack Hill, Austin McKinney', 'Juan Ibáñez, Luis Enrique Vergara, Jack Hill', 'Boris Karloff, Julissa, Carlos East, Rafael Bertrand, Yolanda Montes ''Tongolele'', Quintín Bulnes, Santanón, Julia Marichal', null, 'The inhabitants of a small, remote island have been practicing voodoo rites and worshipping an evil priest named Damballah for years, but the local law officials generally turn a blind eye to this death cult''s bizarre activities. Captain Labesch arrives from the mainland, determined to crack down on the island''s lawlessness and clean up the ineffectual, hard-drinking police force. He appeals for assistance from wealthy plantation tycoon Carl Van Molder, who owns nearly half of the island and wields a great deal of influence over the population. Van Molder has made the study of parapsychology his life''s work and believes in the secret powers of the mind. He warns Labesch not to interfere with this forgotten island''s ancient ways. Also visiting is Van Molder''s niece, Annabella, a temperance crusader who wants her uncle to help fund the International Anti-Saloon League. She falls in love with handsome police lieutenant Andrew Wilhelm', 'The inhabitants of a small, remote island have been practicing voodoo rites and worshipping an evil priest named Damballah for years, but the local law officials generally turn a blind eye to this death cult''s bizarre activities. Captain Labesch arrives from the mainland, determined to crack down on the island''s lawlessness and clean up the ineffectual, hard-drinking police force. He appeals for assistance from wealthy plantation tycoon Carl Van Molder, who owns nearly half of the island and wields a great deal of influence over the population. Van Molder has made the study of parapsychology his life''s work and believes in the secret powers of the mind. He warns Labesch not to interfere with this forgotten island''s ancient ways. Also visiting is Van Molder''s niece, Annabella, a temperance crusader who wants her uncle to help fund the International Anti-Saloon League. She falls in love with handsome police lieutenant Andrew Wilhelm', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/me3KWsJkzNjdgWzdcJgFB6lfiCX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50688'),
  ('915885488748693933', 'Ismael', 2013, 'Drama', 'Marcelo Piñeyro', null, 'Mario Casas, Belén Rueda, Juan Diego Botto, Sergi López, Ella Kweku, Larsson do Amaral, Mikel Iglesias', null, 'An aging couple follows after Ismael Tchou, an 8-year-old, who is trying to find his way to his estranged biological father all by himself.', 'An aging couple follows after Ismael Tchou, an 8-year-old, who is trying to find his way to his estranged biological father all by himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rSBDObfZLedaoxpJy8LYuCroD6F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:220620'),
  ('37748431535820697', 'Ismael''s Ghosts', 2017, 'Drama, Mystery, Romance, Thriller', 'Arnaud Desplechin, Clémentine Castel, Elise Lahouassa', 'Arnaud Desplechin, Julie Peyr, Léa Mysius', 'Mathieu Amalric, Marion Cotillard, Charlotte Gainsbourg, Louis Garrel, Alba Rohrwacher, László Szabó, Hippolyte Girardot, Jacques Nolot', 'R', 'Just as the disheveled and alcoholic filmmaker Ismaël embarks on a difficult new film project, his life is sent into a tailspin. His wife Carlotta, presumed dead for 20 years, come crashing back into his life creating chaos in his work and his current romantic relationship with the starry-eyed astronomer Sylvia.', 'Just as the disheveled and alcoholic filmmaker Ismaël embarks on a difficult new film project, his life is sent into a tailspin. His wife Carlotta, presumed dead for 20 years, come crashing back into his life creating chaos in his work and his current romantic relationship with the starry-eyed astronomer Sylvia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rQc8aGHeJ65pkFabXVjPZpcodVh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:429070'),
  ('131065167667504358', 'Isn''t It Romantic', 2019, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Romance', 'Todd Strauss-Schulson, Simon Duggan, Marco Londoner', 'Erin Cardillo, Dana Fox, Katie Silberman', 'Rebel Wilson, Liam Hemsworth, Adam Devine, Priyanka Chopra Jonas, Betty Gilpin, Brandon Scott Jones, Tom Ellis, Jennifer Saunders', 'PG-13', 'For a long time, Natalie, an Australian architect living in New York City, had always believed that what she had seen in rom-coms is all fantasy. But after thwarting a mugger at a subway station only to be knocked out while fleeing, Natalie wakes up and discovers that her life has suddenly become her worst nightmare—a romantic comedy—and she is the leading lady.', 'For a long time, Natalie, an Australian architect living in New York City, had always believed that what she had seen in rom-coms is all fantasy. But after thwarting a mugger at a subway station only to be knocked out while fleeing, Natalie wakes up and discovers that her life has suddenly become her worst nightmare—a romantic comedy—and she is the leading lady.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5xNBYXuv8wqiLVDhsfqCOr75DL7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:449563'),
  ('164030057781829404', 'Isn''t Life Wonderful', 1924, 'Drama, Romance', 'D.W. Griffith, Harold S. Sintzenich, Hendrik Sartov', 'D.W. Griffith', 'Carol Dempster, Neil Hamilton, Erville Alderson, Helen Lowell, Marcia Harris, Frank Puglia, Lupino Lane, Hans Adalbert Schlettow', 'NR', 'A family from Poland has been left homeless in the wake of World War I. They move to Germany and struggle to survive the conditions there, during the Great Inflation. Inga is a Polish war orphan who has only accumulated a small amount of money from the rubble and hopes to marry Paul. Weakened by poison gas, Paul begins to invest in Inga''s future and he serves as their symbol of optimism.', 'A family from Poland has been left homeless in the wake of World War I. They move to Germany and struggle to survive the conditions there, during the Great Inflation. Inga is a Polish war orphan who has only accumulated a small amount of money from the rubble and hopes to marry Paul. Weakened by poison gas, Paul begins to invest in Inga''s future and he serves as their symbol of optimism.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/htjvWPsdGpy8mI1xh8VEPTHvIL2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:165354'),
  ('55204628277082517', 'Isn''t She Great', 2000, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Andrew Bergman, Karl Walter Lindenlaub', 'Paul Rudnick', 'Bette Midler, Nathan Lane, Stockard Channing, David Hyde Pierce, John Cleese, John Larroquette, Amanda Peet, Dina Spybey-Waters', 'R', 'An unsuccessful over-the-top actress becomes a successful over-the-top authoress in this biography of Jacqueline Susann.', 'An unsuccessful over-the-top actress becomes a successful over-the-top authoress in this biography of Jacqueline Susann.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ikmulTGVfW6jYYNz4iO5yoN7dla.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75531'),
  ('732211185244937775', 'Isn''t She Lovely?', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Solange Cicurel, Vincent van Gelder', 'Solange Cicurel', 'Elsa Zylberstein, Lucien Jean-Baptiste, Hélène Vincent, Ioni Matos, Tania Garbarski, Stéphanie Crayencour, Roger Van Hool, Max Boublil', null, 'A couple of parents get in over their heads when they decide to use Scandinavian alternative teaching methods for their teenager.', 'A couple of parents get in over their heads when they decide to use Scandinavian alternative teaching methods for their teenager.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tkKwXdHgYK4hC0U1ChJ11cSWype.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:701437'),
  ('1022937569363995545', 'Isola: Multiple Personality Girl', 2000, 'Horror, Drama, Science Fiction', 'Toshiyuki Mizutani, Shûji Kuriyama', 'Toshiyuki Mizutani, Hiroshi Hatajima, Mugita Kinoshita', 'Yoshino Kimura, Yû Kurosawa, Ken Ishiguro, Makiko Watanabe, Satomi Tezuka, Susumu Terajima, Kazuhiro Yamaji, Hideo Murota', null, 'When a woman, able to read the thoughts of others, comes to help survivors of the 1995 Kobe earthquake, she encounters a girl with Multiple Personality Disorder whose dangerous 13th personality, Isola, must be stopped', 'When a woman, able to read the thoughts of others, comes to help survivors of the 1995 Kobe earthquake, she encounters a girl with Multiple Personality Disorder whose dangerous 13th personality, Isola, must be stopped', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8RB1hnwqNnJnRTC25Vht706QnJI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68820'),
  ('891796208993704910', 'Isolados', 2014, 'Thriller, Horror, Mystery', 'Tomás Portella, Gustavo Hadba, Leonardo Teatini', 'Mariana Vielmond', 'Bruno Gagliasso, Regiane Alves, José Wilker, Juliana Alves, Sílvio Guindane, Orã Figueiredo, Fernanda Pontes, Debora Olivieri', null, 'A couple, Lauro and Renata, travels to a remote area surrounded by rain forest in Rio De Janeiro. Once they are there, Lauro is told by a bar owner that gruesome murders are taking place in that area. Intending to keep this information hidden from his girlfriend, Lauro and Renata discover they might be not alone when staying in a isolated house.', 'A couple, Lauro and Renata, travels to a remote area surrounded by rain forest in Rio De Janeiro. Once they are there, Lauro is told by a bar owner that gruesome murders are taking place in that area. Intending to keep this information hidden from his girlfriend, Lauro and Renata discover they might be not alone when staying in a isolated house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vDL7tdkqn0UxCThTlM5T39QStOF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:228172'),
  ('665252554713590831', 'Isolation', 2005, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Billy O''Brien, Robbie Ryan', 'Billy O''Brien', 'John Lynch, Essie Davis, Sean Harris, Marcel Iureș, Ruth Negga, Crispin Letts, Stanley Townsend', 'R', 'On a remote Irish farm, five people become unwilling participants in an experiment that goes nightmarishly wrong.', 'On a remote Irish farm, five people become unwilling participants in an experiment that goes nightmarishly wrong.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6CpGHO5cnZgWKKeqjCXaEwvk8Q8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25967'),
  ('966181099431239848', 'Isoroku Yamamoto, the Commander-in-Chief of the Combined Fleet', 2011, 'History, War', 'Izuru Narushima, Takahide Shibanushi, Toshihisa Yamada', 'Kenzaburô Iida, Yasuo Hasegawa', 'Koji Yakusho, Hiroshi Abe, Akira Emoto, Hiroshi Tamaki, Teruyuki Kagawa, Bandō Mitsugorō X, Nobuko Miyamoto, Toshiro Yanagiba', null, 'Admiral Isoroku Yamamoto (1884-1943) was the Japanese Naval commander who was given the order to attack Pearl Harbour, an order he was duty bound to obey which went against his own personal beliefs. While this infamous attack is a low point in Japanese and US history it wouldn’t have happened if the Japanese government had listened to Yamamoto in 1939 and searched for a more peaceful way to end their war campaign, proving his many ominous presages of the outcomes of the attack to come true.', 'Admiral Isoroku Yamamoto (1884-1943) was the Japanese Naval commander who was given the order to attack Pearl Harbour, an order he was duty bound to obey which went against his own personal beliefs. While this infamous attack is a low point in Japanese and US history it wouldn’t have happened if the Japanese government had listened to Yamamoto in 1939 and searched for a more peaceful way to end their war campaign, proving his many ominous presages of the outcomes of the attack to come true.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/96va8I9758w2f2LmZ6sspELBUg8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:131739'),
  ('206496269592875713', 'Ispansi (¡Españoles!)', 2011, 'Drama', 'Carlos Iglesias', 'Carlos Iglesias', 'Carlos Iglesias, Esther Regina, Bruto Pomeroy, Isabel Blanco, Isabelle Stoffel, Francisco Conde', null, 'Shortly after the outbreak of the Spanish Civil War, the Republic sent 3,000 children to Russia to protect domestic bombings. The first to leave were the children in the orphanages. Beatriz, daughter of a wealthy family of right, whose father and brother were Phalangists, became pregnant with a man who refused to marry her and decided to hide her son in an orphanage in Madrid. Upon learning of the impending trip to Russia child, steals the identity of a dead republican (Paula) and volunteers to babysit. Undertake and a terrible journey, surrounded by enemies, and thousands of miles from their country and their world. On June 41, Hitler invaded Russia. The continuous arrival of fresh troops for the defense of Moscow and again hinder the journey of the Spanish. At one of these stops are joined by Alvaro, a political commissar of the Communist Party of Spain.', 'Shortly after the outbreak of the Spanish Civil War, the Republic sent 3,000 children to Russia to protect domestic bombings. The first to leave were the children in the orphanages. Beatriz, daughter of a wealthy family of right, whose father and brother were Phalangists, became pregnant with a man who refused to marry her and decided to hide her son in an orphanage in Madrid. Upon learning of the impending trip to Russia child, steals the identity of a dead republican (Paula) and volunteers to babysit. Undertake and a terrible journey, surrounded by enemies, and thousands of miles from their country and their world. On June 41, Hitler invaded Russia. The continuous arrival of fresh troops for the defense of Moscow and again hinder the journey of the Spanish. At one of these stops are joined by Alvaro, a political commissar of the Communist Party of Spain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yNp95Gmafu2dsZE