  ('328781017656866956', 'Istanbul Beneath My Wings', 1996, 'Adventure, History, Drama', 'Mustafa Altıoklar, Uğur İçbak', 'Mustafa Altıoklar', 'Ege Aydan, Beatriz Rico, Okan Bayülgen, Savaş Ay, Haluk Bilginer, Zuhal Olcay, Burak Sergen, Cüneyt Çalışkur', null, 'During the sea battle which took place between the Ottoman Empire and the Italians, a ship which had been seized in the Mediterranean Sea is brought to Istanbul, and a young wounded lady named Francesca, the daughter of the killed Captain, becomes a slave for Hezarfen Ahmet Celebi.', 'During the sea battle which took place between the Ottoman Empire and the Italians, a ship which had been seized in the Mediterranean Sea is brought to Istanbul, and a young wounded lady named Francesca, the daughter of the killed Captain, becomes a slave for Hezarfen Ahmet Celebi.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3eOvoCVTawMjBYJsieG5EfBTl7C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103790'),
