  ('934669800565083670', 'Isy Way Out', 2018, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Max Eipp, Mark Monheim, Jana Lämmerer', 'Max Eipp, Mark Monheim', 'Michelangelo Fortuzzi, Milena Tscharntke, Claudia Michelsen, Claudia Mehnert, Hans Löw, Ludwig Simon, Jakob Schmidt, Runa Greiner', null, '16-year-old Jonas is in love with his best friend Isy, but she likes older boys. When Isy takes drugs at a party and loses control in the intoxication, Jonas friends Lenny and Martin make fun of it with Jonas. But then the situation escalates and the three boys rape the unconscious girl.', '16-year-old Jonas is in love with his best friend Isy, but she likes older boys. When Isy takes drugs at a party and loses control in the intoxication, Jonas friends Lenny and Martin make fun of it with Jonas. But then the situation escalates and the three boys rape the unconscious girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vXRVqc62arEEFhcjPJ8wfWGwNW0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:546837'),
  ('99567641525924704', 'It', 1927, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Clarence G. Badger, Vernon Keays', 'Hope Loring, Louis D. Lighton, George Marion Jr.', 'Clara Bow, Antonio Moreno, William Austin, Priscilla Bonner, Jacqueline Gadsden, Julia Swayne Gordon, Elinor Glyn, Elmo Billings', 'NR', 'A flapper shopgirl woos her rich boss with animal magnetism -- the captivating personal quality otherwise known as "it."', 'A flapper shopgirl woos her rich boss with animal magnetism -- the captivating personal quality otherwise known as "it."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nkkhsKik9GILqn3S5BxoZdyml21.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82283'),
