  ('304900088946792573', 'It Ain''t Hay', 1943, 'Comedy', 'Erle C. Kenton, Charles Previn, Charles Van Enger', 'John Grant, Allen Boretz', 'Bud Abbott, Lou Costello, Grace McDonald, Cecil Kellaway, Eugene Pallette, Patsy O''Connor, Leighton Noble, Shemp Howard', 'NR', 'Abbot and Costello must find a replacement for a woman''s horse they accidentally killed after feeding it some candy. They head for the racetrack, find a look-a-like and take it. They do not realize that the nag is "Tea Biscuit," a champion racehorse.', 'Abbot and Costello must find a replacement for a woman''s horse they accidentally killed after feeding it some candy. They head for the racetrack, find a look-a-like and take it. They do not realize that the nag is "Tea Biscuit," a champion racehorse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r3VBe1jMmGnROn7WCWUYwUqdDNC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52743'),
