  ('1023860828059532582', 'It Boy', 2013, 'Comedy', 'David Moreau, Laurent Tangy', 'David Moreau, Amro Hamzawi', 'Virginie Efira, Pierre Niney, Gilles Cohen, Amélie Glenn, Charles Berling, Michaël Abiteboul, Camille Japy, Diana Stewart', 'PG-13', '38-year-old Alice has everything to become the next editor-in-chief of Rebelle magazine except for her uptight image. But when the young and charming Balthazar, barely 20, crosses Alice''s path, she realizes that he holds the key to her promotion.', '38-year-old Alice has everything to become the next editor-in-chief of Rebelle magazine except for her uptight image. But when the young and charming Balthazar, barely 20, crosses Alice''s path, she realizes that he holds the key to her promotion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7PbiUzPjM6ZvD9sGppBtdLcDdwx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:173185'),
  ('1039969786987172526', 'It Came from Beneath the Sea', 1955, 'Science Fiction, Adventure, Horror', 'Henry Freulich, Leonard Katzman, Robert Gordon', 'George Worthing Yates, Harold Jacob Smith', 'Kenneth Tobey, Faith Domergue, Donald Curtis, Chuck Griffiths, Ian Keith, Dean Maddox Jr., Harry Lauter, Richard W. Peterson', null, 'A giant octopus, whose feeding habits have been affected by radiation from H-Bomb tests, rises from the Mindanao Deep to terrorize the California Coast.', 'A giant octopus, whose feeding habits have been affected by radiation from H-Bomb tests, rises from the Mindanao Deep to terrorize the California Coast.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Uhq7FinrZIpvoz8OUUL6yziHtO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29959'),
  ('114673258977160640', 'It Came from Hollywood', 1982, 'Comedy, Documentary', 'Malcolm Leo, Andrew Solt, Fred J. Koenekamp', 'Dana Olsen', 'Dan Aykroyd, John Candy, Cheech Marin, Tommy Chong, Gilda Radner, Don E. Carney, Honey Sheperd, Teena Nickolas', 'PG', 'Dan Aykroyd, John Candy, Gilda Radner and Cheech and Chong present this compilation of classic bad films from the 50''s, 60''s and 70''s. Special features on gorilla pictures, anti-marijuana films and a special tribute to the worst film maker of all-time, Ed Wood.', 'Dan Aykroyd, John Candy, Gilda Radner and Cheech and Chong present this compilation of classic bad films from the 50''s, 60''s and 70''s. Special features on gorilla pictures, anti-marijuana films and a special tribute to the worst film maker of all-time, Ed Wood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jf65NC2N5JsKj5h8iM8bXRnVdI5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30168'),
  ('1113657283570232711', 'It Came from Outer Space', 1953, 'Science Fiction, Horror', 'Jack Arnold, Clifford Stine, Joseph E. Kenney', 'Harry Essex', 'Richard Carlson, Barbara Rush, Charles Drake, Joe Sawyer, Russell Johnson, Kathleen Hughes, Dave Willock, Alan Dexter', null, 'Author and amateur astronomer John Putnam and schoolteacher Ellen Fields witness an enormous meteorite come down near a small town in Arizona. Putnam becomes a local object of scorn when, after examining the object up close, he announces that it is a spacecraft, and that it is inhabited...', 'Author and amateur astronomer John Putnam and schoolteacher Ellen Fields witness an enormous meteorite come down near a small town in Arizona. Putnam becomes a local object of scorn when, after examining the object up close, he announces that it is a spacecraft, and that it is inhabited...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zPXff8iRma28YQFApfzuWadZXzP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19483'),
  ('1105928479948464271', 'It Came from the Desert', 2018, 'Horror, Action, Comedy', 'Marko Mäkilaakso, Juge Heikkilä, Kasimir Högnäs', 'Trent Haaga, Hank Woon Jr', 'Mark Arnold, Harry Lister Smith, Vanessa Grasse, Alex Mills, Claudia Trujillo, James Alper, Callum McGowan, Aino Sirje', null, 'New Mexico, present day. Brian and Lukas are off to the desert to join a kegger party and to celebrate Lukas’ victory in a motocross competition. His winning prize includes meeting The Deathinator, the biggest action star in the world. The party gets started under the hot desert sun, but Brian isn’t in the mood, so he wanders off and is soon joined by his friend, Lukas. They discover something strange in the desert which leads them into a secret military laboratory, where they discover the disturbing truth of what the government has been doing. Secret experiments on ants and spiders using DNA found in a meteorite which fell to Earth in 1951 has given birth to mutated giant ants which have overrun the facility. Now, it''s up to Brian and Lukas to save the world from a giant ant invasion!', 'New Mexico, present day. Brian and Lukas are off to the desert to join a kegger party and to celebrate Lukas’ victory in a motocross competition. His winning prize includes meeting The Deathinator, the biggest action star in the world. The party gets started under the hot desert sun, but Brian isn’t in the mood, so he wanders off and is soon joined by his friend, Lukas. They discover something strange in the desert which leads them into a secret military laboratory, where they discover the disturbing truth of what the government has been doing. Secret experiments on ants and spiders using DNA found in a meteorite which fell to Earth in 1951 has given birth to mutated giant ants which have overrun the facility. Now, it''s up to Brian and Lukas to save the world from a giant ant invasion!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mZsLtCJW1eJabOxlZrZfaalGIki.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:408490'),
  ('507708033235558262', 'It Came from the Sky', 1999, 'Comedy, Drama, TV Movie', 'Jack Bender', 'Jack Bender', 'Yasmine Bleeth, Christopher Lloyd, John Ritter, JoBeth Williams, Kevin Zegers', null, 'Jarvis and Pepper crash land their small plane on the roof of the Bridges family. Pepper finds herself having a positive effect on the households'' autistic son Andy.', 'Jarvis and Pepper crash land their small plane on the roof of the Bridges family. Pepper finds herself having a positive effect on the households'' autistic son Andy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kfu2G4ERdgIk2QxzHcPn6zwPLmO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46005'),
  ('805513921757377698', 'It Came from the Water', 2022, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Marta Kownacka, Xawery Żuławski, Marian Prokop', 'Xawery Żuławski, Krzysztof Bernaś, Maciej Kazula', 'Mikołaj Kubacki, Waleria Gorobets, Monika Mikołajczak, Mariusz Urbaniec, Alicja Wieniawa-Narkiewicz, Pitry Pitry, Aleksander Kaleta, Mikołaj Matczak', null, 'Fed up with pandemics, quarantines and news about ecological disasters, worried about their own uncertain future and the fate of the world, a group of high school students are invited by Kamil, a millionaire''s son, to a party at his father''s seaside residance.', 'Fed up with pandemics, quarantines and news about ecological disasters, worried about their own uncertain future and the fate of the world, a group of high school students are invited by Kamil, a millionaire''s son, to a party at his father''s seaside residance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lwNpYB35nBgEU8ln0kRJQAKl5Bb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:999114'),
  ('757614787946130312', 'It Can Be Done Amigo', 1972, 'Comedy, Western', 'Maurizio Lucidi, Aldo Tonti', 'Rafael Azcona', 'Bud Spencer, Jack Palance, Renato Cestiè, Francisco Rabal, Dany Saval, Luciano Catenacci, Roberto Camardiel, Franco Giacobini', 'PG', 'An outspoken boy and a gunfighter-pimp save a drifter''s life from hanging. The boy''s uncle dies, leaving a house and some dry, useless land to the boy. The dying uncle has obtained the drifter''s promise to help the boy get what is his. Meanwhile the gunfighter has decided that the drifter should marry his daughter after being with her previously. The two get into a series of brawls and shoot-outs until they arrive in the town and find the boy''s inheritance -which turns out not to be as useless as it first appears.', 'An outspoken boy and a gunfighter-pimp save a drifter''s life from hanging. The boy''s uncle dies, leaving a house and some dry, useless land to the boy. The dying uncle has obtained the drifter''s promise to help the boy get what is his. Meanwhile the gunfighter has decided that the drifter should marry his daughter after being with her previously. The two get into a series of brawls and shoot-outs until they arrive in the town and find the boy''s inheritance -which turns out not to be as useless as it first appears.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h28MHKOKoxbJRcZM5bLlwuIqQo5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46567'),
  ('776961539153757339', 'It Can''t Be!', 1975, 'Comedy', 'Leonid Gaidai, Sergei Poluyanov, Raisa Margachyova', 'Vladlen Bakhnov, Leonid Gaidai', 'Mikhail Pugovkin, Nina Grebeshkova, Vyacheslav Nevinnyy, Mikhail Svetin, Oleg Dal, Svetlana Kryuchkova, Mikhail Kokshenov, Natalya Seleznyova', null, 'The film includes three short stories based on the stories of Mikhail Zoshchenko: "Crime and Punishment", "Fun Adventure", and "Wedding Event" about the negative phenomena of the provincial life of the young country of the Soviets: stupidity, drunkenness, money-grubbing, lack of spirituality.', 'The film includes three short stories based on the stories of Mikhail Zoshchenko: "Crime and Punishment", "Fun Adventure", and "Wedding Event" about the negative phenomena of the provincial life of the young country of the Soviets: stupidity, drunkenness, money-grubbing, lack of spirituality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rmxoa3hYcQxweULdO34BRoViqss.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42275'),
  ('56042838900342577', 'It Chapter Two', 2019, 'Horror, Thriller, Drama', 'Andy Muschietti, Checco Varese, Adam Bocknek', 'Gary Dauberman', 'Jessica Chastain, James McAvoy, Bill Hader, Isaiah Mustafa, Jay Ryan, James Ransone, Andy Bean, Bill Skarsgård', 'R', '27 years after overcoming the malevolent supernatural entity Pennywise, the former members of the Losers'' Club, who have grown up and moved away from Derry, are brought back together by a devastating phone call.', '27 years after overcoming the malevolent supernatural entity Pennywise, the former members of the Losers'' Club, who have grown up and moved away from Derry, are brought back together by a devastating phone call.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zfE0R94v1E8cuKAerbskfD3VfUt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:474350'),
  ('89663638011639900', 'It Comes', 2018, 'Mystery, Drama, Horror', 'Tetsuya Nakashima, Koji Takado, Ryoken Okamura', 'Tetsuya Nakashima, Hideto Iwai, Nobuhiro Monma', 'Junichi Okada, Nana Komatsu, Satoshi Tsumabuki, Haru Kuroki, Takako Matsu, Munetaka Aoki, Aijyu Shida, Rie Shibata', null, 'To protect his family from a mysterious being, a man joins forces with a journalist and an exorcist - but they come to learn what they are dealing with is beyond their imagination.', 'To protect his family from a mysterious being, a man joins forces with a journalist and an exorcist - but they come to learn what they are dealing with is beyond their imagination.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g1UY8rdb5PKENPsNxk134prANbG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:505916'),
  ('824841702027569711', 'It Comes at Night', 2017, 'Drama, Horror, Mystery', 'Drew Daniels, Scott Winston, David Ketterer', 'Trey Edward Shults', 'Joel Edgerton, Christopher Abbott, Carmen Ejogo, Riley Keough, Kelvin Harrison Jr., Griffin Robert Faulkner, David Pendleton, Mikey', 'R', 'Secure within a desolate home as an unnatural threat terrorizes the world, a man has established a tenuous domestic order with his wife and son, but this will soon be put to test when a desperate young family arrives seeking refuge.', 'Secure within a desolate home as an unnatural threat terrorizes the world, a man has established a tenuous domestic order with his wife and son, but this will soon be put to test when a desperate young family arrives seeking refuge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rNKJpFMlOZn5zkzBPZxEJrQn5Km.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:418078'),
  ('341636477187794295', 'It Conquered the World', 1956, 'Science Fiction, Thriller, Horror', 'Roger Corman, Frederick E. West', 'Charles B. Griffith', 'Lee Van Cleef, Beverly Garland, Peter Graves, Sally Fraser, Russ Bender, Jonathan Haze, Dick Miller, Paul Harbor', null, 'An alien from Venus tries to take over the world with the help of a disillusioned human scientist, as his wife, his best friend and the friend''s wife try to intervene.', 'An alien from Venus tries to take over the world with the help of a disillusioned human scientist, as his wife, his best friend and the friend''s wife try to intervene.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ed5aKwjf0xJ0yoX2faFUULVLqJJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27625'),
  ('738432331287484496', 'It Could Happen to You', 1994, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Andrew Bergman, Caleb Deschanel, Julie A. Bloom', 'Jane Anderson', 'Nicolas Cage, Bridget Fonda, Rosie Perez, Wendell Pierce, Isaac Hayes, Víctor Rojas, Seymour Cassel, Stanley Tucci', 'PG', 'Charlie Lang is a simple, kindhearted New York City cop. When he realizes he has no money to tip waitress Yvonne Biasi, Lang offers her half the winnings of his lottery ticket. Amazingly, the ticket happens to be a winner, in the sum of $4 million. True to his word, Lang proceeds to share the prize money with Biasi, which infuriates his greedy wife, Muriel. Not content with the arrangement, Muriel begins scheming to take all the money.', 'Charlie Lang is a simple, kindhearted New York City cop. When he realizes he has no money to tip waitress Yvonne Biasi, Lang offers her half the winnings of his lottery ticket. Amazingly, the ticket happens to be a winner, in the sum of $4 million. True to his word, Lang proceeds to share the prize money with Biasi, which infuriates his greedy wife, Muriel. Not content with the arrangement, Muriel begins scheming to take all the money.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6UOaeLDOdwwTMQtbl5YL6EGjqy0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10660'),
  ('58453417951452663', 'It Couldn''t Happen Here', 1988, 'Music, Drama, Adventure', 'Jack Bond, Simon Archer', 'Jack Bond, James Dillon', 'Neil Tennant, Chris Lowe, Barbara Windsor, Joss Ackland, Neil Dickson, Gareth Hunt, Dominique Barnes, Carmen du Sautoy', null, 'Pet Shop Boys Chris Lowe and Neil Tennant embark upon a journey across England - but which England? Is it the half-remembered England of their childhoods, or the brutal reality of Mrs Thatcher''s late-eighties England? Along the way they come across many familiar (and sinister) faces. The movie also features some of the Pet Shop Boys'' most popular records.', 'Pet Shop Boys Chris Lowe and Neil Tennant embark upon a journey across England - but which England? Is it the half-remembered England of their childhoods, or the brutal reality of Mrs Thatcher''s late-eighties England? Along the way they come across many familiar (and sinister) faces. The movie also features some of the Pet Shop Boys'' most popular records.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sQmkzAf7TDN9GYFpc92l07T2fYz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30580'),
  ('1024916237713394185', 'It Doesn''t Hurt Me', 2006, 'Drama, Romance', 'Aleksei Balabanov, Sergey Astakhov, Tatyana Chistova', 'Valeri Mnatsakanov, Aleksei Balabanov', 'Renata Litvinova, Aleksandr Yatsenko, Dmitriy Dyuzhev, Nikita Mikhalkov, Inga Strelkova-Oboldina, Sergey Makovetskiy, Marina Solopchenko, Valentin Kuznetsov', null, 'Three friends are in the entrance of a luxury home in the heart of the city. They are young, full of strength and energy, they have the talent, skill and thirst for life and ... - well, they have all but one. But money...', 'Three friends are in the entrance of a luxury home in the heart of the city. They are young, full of strength and energy, they have the talent, skill and thirst for life and ... - well, they have all but one. But money...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fxBIVkqWLYTMKvqBHnWcLFlBjNo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65839'),
  ('75577586157310023', 'It Ends', 2025, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Alexander Ullom, Evan Draper, Jazleana Jones', 'Alexander Ullom', 'Phinehas Yoon, Akira Jackson, Noah Toth, Mitchell Cole, Jenny Doyle, Jon Linstad, Ian Weir, Alexander Ullom', 'R', 'A group of recent grads head out on a late night drive for grub, hoping to enjoy one final hangout before their paths diverge. Instead, they accidentally turn onto a never-ending, two-lane hellscape surrounded by untold horrors and cosmic forces beyond their understanding. Cramped together inside a Jeep Cherokee and with the miles stretching infinitely ahead, they face a choice: embrace their new existence or fight to escape it.', 'A group of recent grads head out on a late night drive for grub, hoping to enjoy one final hangout before their paths diverge. Instead, they accidentally turn onto a never-ending, two-lane hellscape surrounded by untold horrors and cosmic forces beyond their understanding. Cramped together inside a Jeep Cherokee and with the miles stretching infinitely ahead, they face a choice: embrace their new existence or fight to escape it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x76Fsd65aUwS3W8S1L6NClpmhWP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1422011'),
  ('275457804063845691', 'It Ends with Us', 2024, 'Drama, Romance', 'Justin Baldoni, Barry Peterson, Julie A. Bloom', 'Christy Hall', 'Blake Lively, Justin Baldoni, Jenny Slate, Brandon Sklenar, Hasan Minhaj, Kevin McKidd, Amy Morton, Alex Neustaedter', 'PG-13', 'When a woman''s first love suddenly reenters her life, her relationship with a charming, but abusive neurosurgeon is upended, and she realizes she must learn to rely on her own strength to make an impossible choice for her future.', 'When a woman''s first love suddenly reenters her life, her relationship with a charming, but abusive neurosurgeon is upended, and she realizes she must learn to rely on her own strength to make an impossible choice for her future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AjV6jFJ2YFIluYo4GQf13AA1tqu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1079091'),
