  ('424746063750446404', 'It Felt Like a Kiss', 2009, 'History, Music, Documentary', 'Adam Curtis', 'Adam Curtis', 'H. Rap Brown, Nikita Khrushchev, Richard Nixon', null, 'The story of America''s rise to power starting with 1959, using archival footage and US pop music to highlight the consequences to the rest of the world and in the peoples'' minds.', 'The story of America''s rise to power starting with 1959, using archival footage and US pop music to highlight the consequences to the rest of the world and in the peoples'' minds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2HX5LilTMgJbaM3yJXioyX1GkLo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34835'),
