  ('484781412289457104', 'It Had to be You', 2007, 'Comedy', 'Marc Gibaja, Gilles Porte', 'Laurent Sarfati, Marc Gibaja', 'Gilles Lellouche, Marie Gillain, Laurent Ournac, Soko, Philippe Lefebvre, Frédérique Bel, Raphaëline Goupilleau, Vincent Bowen', null, 'In this romantic comedy Thomas moves back in with his parents after his girlfriend throws him out. He runs into Florence, an old school friend, who invites him to dinner with her husband and two children.', 'In this romantic comedy Thomas moves back in with his parents after his girlfriend throws him out. He runs into Florence, an old school friend, who invites him to dinner with her husband and two children.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9QulqvSdfpWH5gFCx5eeltjQsr3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49389'),
  ('940885578014022117', 'It Had to Be You', 2000, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Steven Feder, Kevin Moore, Linda Perkins', 'Steven Feder', 'Natasha Henstridge, Michael Vartan, Michael Rispoli, Olivia D''Abo, Faith Prince, George DiCenzo, Phyllis Newman, Joelle Carter', 'PG', 'Sparks fly when Anna Penn and Charlie Hudson meet. Unfortunately, they''re both engaged to other people. In fact, they''re staying at the same New York City hotel in order to work on wrapping up the last details of their nuptials. Over days and evenings of joint wedding planning, the two grow closer -- and start to wonder if they''re getting married to the right people after all.', 'Sparks fly when Anna Penn and Charlie Hudson meet. Unfortunately, they''re both engaged to other people. In fact, they''re staying at the same New York City hotel in order to work on wrapping up the last details of their nuptials. Over days and evenings of joint wedding planning, the two grow closer -- and start to wonder if they''re getting married to the right people after all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3V96hEwWBywA0RNY6nvsl2tWcry.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44388'),
