  ('139486979357128091', 'It Happened at the Police Station', 1954, 'Comedy', 'Giorgio Simonelli, Gastone Ramazzotti, Paolo Bianchini', 'Giovanni Grimaldi, Ettore Scola, Ruggero Maccari', 'Nino Taranto, Alberto Sordi, Walter Chiari, Lucia Bosè, Mario Riva, Riccardo Billi, Carlo Dapporto, Lauretta Masiero', null, 'Everyday all kind of people pass through a Police Station, especially if it is downtown. Today, however, the chief of police has bought his first car and he has decided to test it with his wife going to Ostia. But first a theatrical company sent out of the theatre, last Alfredo Todini arrested while walking wearing a gown and in the mean a series of human cases, ranging from the pathetic to the funny one, get in the way of his wish.', 'Everyday all kind of people pass through a Police Station, especially if it is downtown. Today, however, the chief of police has bought his first car and he has decided to test it with his wife going to Ostia. But first a theatrical company sent out of the theatre, last Alfredo Todini arrested while walking wearing a gown and in the mean a series of human cases, ranging from the pathetic to the funny one, get in the way of his wish.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/etDX0tzjyce4TE2WktA1LlHEr7N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45208'),
  ('410861952287531697', 'It Happened at the World''s Fair', 1963, 'Comedy, Music, Romance', 'Joseph Ruttenberg, Al Jennings, Norman Taurog', 'Si Rose, Seaman Jacobs', 'Elvis Presley, Joan O''Brien, Gary Lockwood, Vicky Tiu, H.M. Wynant, Edith Atwater, Guy Raymond, Dorothy Green', 'NR', 'Mike and Danny fly a cropduster, but because of Danny''s gambling debts, a local sheriff takes custody of it. Trying to earn money, they hitch-hike to the World''s Fair in Seattle and, while Danny tries to earn money playing poker, Mike takes care of a small girl whose father has disappeared. Being a ladies'' man, he also finds the time to court a young nurse.', 'Mike and Danny fly a cropduster, but because of Danny''s gambling debts, a local sheriff takes custody of it. Trying to earn money, they hitch-hike to the World''s Fair in Seattle and, while Danny tries to earn money playing poker, Mike takes care of a small girl whose father has disappeared. Being a ladies'' man, he also finds the time to court a young nurse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ZyMccwiHjf79pmd1Tw65XTyGVL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8745'),
  ('1055316969433570335', 'It Happened Here', 1966, 'Drama, Science Fiction, War', 'Peter Suschitzky, Andrew Mollo, Kevin Brownlow', 'Andrew Mollo, Kevin Brownlow', 'Pauline Murray, Sebastian Shaw, Bart Allison, Frank Bennett, Nicolette Bernard, Rex Collett, Peter Dyneley, Honor Fearson', null, 'World War II, 1940. When the Nazi hordes invade and occupy Great Britain, the English citizens are soon divided between those who choose to submissively collaborate and those who are willing to fight.', 'World War II, 1940. When the Nazi hordes invade and occupy Great Britain, the English citizens are soon divided between those who choose to submissively collaborate and those who are willing to fight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oSbcDgGofczdeQw43uWMpm4Izy4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54195'),
