  ('357187992417437572', 'It Happened in Saint-Tropez', 2013, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Danièle Thompson, Jean-Marc Fabre', 'Christopher Thompson, Danièle Thompson', 'Éric Elmosnino, Lou de Laâge, Kad Merad, Clara Ponsot, Max Boublil, Monica Bellucci, Ivry Gitlis, Valérie Bonneton', null, 'Zef’s stormy relationship with his brother Roni is further aggravated when Roni marries his daughter just as he is attending to his wife’s funeral. The two brothers have never got on with each other. One is faithful to his religion, the other lives only for the present. Between London, Paris, Saint-Tropez and New York, a series of confrontations and betrayals threatens to drive the family further apart, but out of this confusion will come a great love story, perhaps even two...', 'Zef’s stormy relationship with his brother Roni is further aggravated when Roni marries his daughter just as he is attending to his wife’s funeral. The two brothers have never got on with each other. One is faithful to his religion, the other lives only for the present. Between London, Paris, Saint-Tropez and New York, a series of confrontations and betrayals threatens to drive the family further apart, but out of this confusion will come a great love story, perhaps even two...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z1t9TdvgFyf0JWq7SE42xxCBKsO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:184020'),
  ('122219318690452109', 'It Happened in the Penitentiary', 1955, 'Comedy', 'Silvana Mangini Colizzi, Raffaele Crivaro, Giorgio Bianchi', 'Ruggero Maccari, Ettore Scola, Giovanni Grimaldi', 'Aldo Fabrizi, Alberto Sordi, Mara Berni, Walter Chiari, Peppino De Filippo, Nino Besozzi, Mario Riva, Riccardo Billi', null, 'A prison warden keeps a diary in which he writes about the convicts he meets and their lives.', 'A prison warden keeps a diary in which he writes about the convicts he meets and their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9e7Lovh5Yjj9ymJCSpiTE44tsmq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45811'),
  ('1099466526229320570', 'It Happened on Fifth Avenue', 1947, 'Comedy, Romance, Music', 'Roy Del Ruth, Henry Sharp, Frank Fox', 'Everett Freeman', 'Don DeFore, Ann Harding, Charles Ruggles, Victor Moore, Gale Storm, Grant Mitchell, Edward Brophy, Alan Hale Jr.', 'NR', 'A New Yorker hobo moves into a mansion and along the way he gathers friends to live in the house with him. Before he knows it, he is living with the actual home owners.', 'A New Yorker hobo moves into a mansion and along the way he gathers friends to live in the house with him. Before he knows it, he is living with the actual home owners.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4iYAKgBIh8fKY7fdzSKee2t2VIa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52844'),
  ('900313382646578848', 'It Happened on July 20th', 1955, 'Drama, War, History', 'G.W. Pabst, Kurt Hasse', 'Werner P. Zibaso, Gustav Machatý', 'Bernhard Wicki, Karl Ludwig Diehl, Carl Wery, Erik Frey, Albert Hehn, Til Kiwe, Jochen Hauer, Siegfried Lowitz', null, 'A dramatic reconstruction of the July 1944 attempt by German Army Officers to assassinate Hitler with a bomb and end the war before Germany was totally destroyed.', 'A dramatic reconstruction of the July 1944 attempt by German Army Officers to assassinate Hitler with a bomb and end the war before Germany was totally destroyed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qAp8vp7LkL4VVbCpih0egQ8LhsQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46913'),
  ('176706960676919261', 'It Happened One Christmas', 1977, 'TV Movie, Comedy', 'Donald Wrye, Conrad Hall, Phil Cook', 'Lionel Chetwynd', 'Marlo Thomas, Orson Welles, Wayne Rogers, Cloris Leachman, Barney Martin, Karen Carlson, Dick O''Neill, Doris Roberts', null, 'It''s Christmas Eve 1944 in the small town of Bedford Falls, New York. A despondent and suicidal Mary Bailey Hatch is praying for guidance on what to do about an incident no fault of her own which threatens her name and the community standing of her longtime family business, the Bailey Building and Loan, which she took over after the passing of her father. What Mary does not know is that most in town, including her husband George Hatch and their children, are also praying for her. All the prayers are heard by Joseph, God''s gatekeeper of prayers. As there are no other angels available on such a busy day, Joseph assigns Clara Oddbody, angel second class (i.e. she has yet to receive her wings), to Mary''s case, which he reluctantly does as Clara has never been assigned a case on her own in the two hundred years she''s been in heaven for good reason.', 'It''s Christmas Eve 1944 in the small town of Bedford Falls, New York. A despondent and suicidal Mary Bailey Hatch is praying for guidance on what to do about an incident no fault of her own which threatens her name and the community standing of her longtime family business, the Bailey Building and Loan, which she took over after the passing of her father. What Mary does not know is that most in town, including her husband George Hatch and their children, are also praying for her. All the prayers are heard by Joseph, God''s gatekeeper of prayers. As there are no other angels available on such a busy day, Joseph assigns Clara Oddbody, angel second class (i.e. she has yet to receive her wings), to Mary''s case, which he reluctantly does as Clara has never been assigned a case on her own in the two hundred years she''s been in heaven for good reason.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x9WNo51VUi4mNr5rJCOvaRjUe9o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146393'),
  ('524325155474447290', 'It Happened to Jane', 1959, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Richard Quine, Charles Lawton Jr.', 'Norman Katkov', 'Doris Day, Jack Lemmon, Ernie Kovacs, Steve Forrest, Teddy Rooney, Russ Brown, Walter Greaza, Parker Fennelly', 'NR', 'Jane Osgood runs a lobster business, which supports her two young children. Railroad staff inattention ruins her shipment, so with her lawyer George, Jane sues Harry Foster Malone, director of the line and the "meanest man in the world".', 'Jane Osgood runs a lobster business, which supports her two young children. Railroad staff inattention ruins her shipment, so with her lawyer George, Jane sues Harry Foster Malone, director of the line and the "meanest man in the world".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iyMFwzRZnS0qewOEhtvwNS9RZPM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40957'),
  ('614399773119513238', 'It Happened Tomorrow', 1944, 'Fantasy, Comedy, Romance', 'Archie Stout, René Clair, Henry S. Kesler', 'René Clair, Dudley Nichols', 'Dick Powell, Linda Darnell, Jack Oakie, Edgar Kennedy, John Philliber, Edward Brophy, George Cleveland, Sig Ruman', null, 'A young turn-of-the-century newspaper man finds he can get hold of the next day''s paper. This brings more problems than fortune, especially as his new girlfriend is part of a phony clairvoyant act.', 'A young turn-of-the-century newspaper man finds he can get hold of the next day''s paper. This brings more problems than fortune, especially as his new girlfriend is part of a phony clairvoyant act.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rLiYy3ipKeTk5YurD6nxFaZ1DIN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3589'),
  ('1065229052664019392', 'It Happens', 2024, 'Drama', 'David Lucchini, Sabrina Nouchi', 'Catherine Sorolla, Sabrina Nouchi', 'Milo Chiarini, Andrea Dolente, Catherine Sorolla', null, 'In a police station in the 1st arrondissement of Marseille, three investigators, two men and a woman, face the stories of rapes which are perpetrated daily in the Phocaean city. Every day, they receive victims of all ages, genders and social backgrounds. Every day, they bring their professionalism to the service of this colorful brigade, where drama rubs shoulders with humor, and darkness with hope.', 'In a police station in the 1st arrondissement of Marseille, three investigators, two men and a woman, face the stories of rapes which are perpetrated daily in the Phocaean city. Every day, they receive victims of all ages, genders and social backgrounds. Every day, they bring their professionalism to the service of this colorful brigade, where drama rubs shoulders with humor, and darkness with hope.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v2GxbaffhI01cSN1NlNa0jNrN5Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1314434'),
  ('71813032133017339', 'It Happens Every Spring', 1949, 'Comedy', 'Lloyd Bacon, Joseph MacDonald, Jasper Blystone', 'Valentine Davies', 'Ray Milland, Jean Peters, Paul Douglas, Ed Begley, Ted de Corsia, Ray Collins, Jessie Royce Landis, Alan Hale Jr.', null, 'A scientist discovers a formula that makes a baseball which is repelled by wood. He promptly sets out to exploit his discovery.', 'A scientist discovers a formula that makes a baseball which is repelled by wood. He promptly sets out to exploit his discovery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7tjnehLSx0NBmywRR9NIRzHhugd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88288'),
