  ('420017139971118776', 'It Is Not the Homosexual Who Is Perverse, But the Society in Which He Lives', 1971, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Rosa von Praunheim, Robert van Ackeren, Rosa von Praunheim', 'Rosa von Praunheim, Martin Dannecker, Sigurd Wurl', 'Berryt Bohlen, Bernd Feuerhelm, Ernst Kuchling, Norbert Losch, Steven Adamczewski, Dietmar Kracht, Manfred Salzgeber', null, 'Daniel, a young man from the provinces come to the city and moves from one gay subculture to the next. His adventures begin on the streets of Berlin, where the shy brunette Daniel meets the blonde Clemens, who invites him home for coffee and offers him a place to stay. Soon Daniel is living with Clemens and believes he has found the love of his life. The two try to imitate a bourgeois marriage and its lifestyle. But after four months of tedium, Daniel is cruised by a rich older man who entices him to move into his villa, where he encounters a group of older gays, pretentious in their appreciations of fine art and classical music, who fawn over him.', 'Daniel, a young man from the provinces come to the city and moves from one gay subculture to the next. His adventures begin on the streets of Berlin, where the shy brunette Daniel meets the blonde Clemens, who invites him home for coffee and offers him a place to stay. Soon Daniel is living with Clemens and believes he has found the love of his life. The two try to imitate a bourgeois marriage and its lifestyle. But after four months of tedium, Daniel is cruised by a rich older man who entices him to move into his villa, where he encounters a group of older gays, pretentious in their appreciations of fine art and classical music, who fawn over him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fHjduhNt6O7LPPg4Wpvv9B4KO3l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:130961'),
  ('872676037122205382', 'It Lives Again', 1978, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Larry Cohen, Fenton Hamilton, Reid Freeman', 'Larry Cohen', 'Frederic Forrest, Kathleen Lloyd, John P. Ryan, John Marley, Eddie Constantine, Andrew Duggan, James Dixon, Dennis O''Flaherty', 'R', 'Maternity wards echo with the patter of tiny claws as more murderous baby-faced monsters are born. But rather than kill their monstrous offspring during delivery, cursed parents flee to secret incubation hideouts.', 'Maternity wards echo with the patter of tiny claws as more murderous baby-faced monsters are born. But rather than kill their monstrous offspring during delivery, cursed parents flee to secret incubation hideouts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kMQUMhYc6PipkMRsShYr0yGwi5a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28155'),
  ('745452749085540379', 'It Lives Inside', 2023, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Bishal Dutta, Matthew Lynn', 'Bishal Dutta', 'Megan Suri, Neeru Bajwa, Mohana Krishnan, Betty Gabriel, Vik Sahay, Gage Marsh, Beatrice Kitsos, Jamie Ives', 'PG-13', 'Desperate to fit in at school, Sam rejects her Indian culture and family to be like everyone else. However, when a mythological demonic spirit latches onto her former best friend, she must come to terms with her heritage to defeat it.', 'Desperate to fit in at school, Sam rejects her Indian culture and family to be like everyone else. However, when a mythological demonic spirit latches onto her former best friend, she must come to terms with her heritage to defeat it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/73gIfV8gDwkVgUrFDzt4TfZC9Zc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1024773'),
