  ('736439101945751417', 'It Must Schwing: The Blue Note Story', 2018, 'Documentary', 'Eric Friedler', 'Eric Friedler', 'Alfred Lion, Herbie Hancock, Quincy Jones, Wayne Shorter, Thelonious Monk, George Benson, Sonny Rollins, Ron Carter', null, 'A documentary about the legendary jazz label Blue Note Records and its German founders Alfred Lion and Francis Wolff. As jews they had to flee Germany and the Hitler regime in the late 1930s. In New York they wrote music history with their record label Blue Note Records.', 'A documentary about the legendary jazz label Blue Note Records and its German founders Alfred Lion and Francis Wolff. As jews they had to flee Germany and the Hitler regime in the late 1930s. In New York they wrote music history with their record label Blue Note Records.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x1MTHlITydRifdDHdn8yaiGCXrn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:534597'),
