  ('968986677741794185', 'It Rains on Our Love', 1946, 'Drama, Romance', 'Göran Strindberg, Ingmar Bergman, Hilding Bladh', 'Ingmar Bergman, Herbert Grevenius', 'Barbro Kollberg, Birger Malmsten, Gösta Cederlund, Ludde Gentzel, Douglas Håge, Hjördis Petterson, Benkt-Åke Benktsson, Sture Ericson', null, 'A young couple, penniless, break into a summer cottage; the owner offers to rent to them but he has ulterior motives. By living together, the lovers must face their pasts and contend with the meddling neighbors and authorities.', 'A young couple, penniless, break into a summer cottage; the owner offers to rent to them but he has ulterior motives. By living together, the lovers must face their pasts and contend with the meddling neighbors and authorities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mzovDBejDqkuEu158bLwebrPSw5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96067'),
  ('1080459108494276013', 'It Runs in the Family', 1994, 'Comedy, Family', 'Bob Clark, Stephen M. Katz', 'Leigh Brown, Bob Clark, Jean Shepherd', 'Charles Grodin, Kieran Culkin, Mary Steenburgen, Christian Culkin, Al Mancini, Troy Evans, Roy Brocksmith, Glenn Shadix', 'PG', 'It is now summer in the Parker family; and the usual amount of numerous events are happening in their separate lives. Ralphie is searching for the perfect top to use to beat the school bully with, the Old Man is in battle with their hillbilly neighbors, the Bumpus, while eagerly awaiting the discovery of the perfect fishing spot, and the Mother is attempting to collect all of the pieces of a glass china set at a local movie theater.', 'It is now summer in the Parker family; and the usual amount of numerous events are happening in their separate lives. Ralphie is searching for the perfect top to use to beat the school bully with, the Old Man is in battle with their hillbilly neighbors, the Bumpus, while eagerly awaiting the discovery of the perfect fishing spot, and the Mother is attempting to collect all of the pieces of a glass china set at a local movie theater.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u0uPPOs7nkoDgMfFhEvPz5OUMZL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81828'),
