  ('172376402430613425', 'It Seemed Like a Good Idea at the Time', 1975, 'Comedy', 'John Trent, Harry Makin', 'David Main, John Trent', 'Anthony Newley, Stefanie Powers, Isaac Hayes, Lloyd Bochner, Yvonne De Carlo, Henry Ramer, Lawrence Dane, John Candy', 'PG', 'Sweeney is a playwright on a career decline. He spends much of his time wheedling money and beer out of his artistic friend Moriarty. One of his few highlights is weekly sex with his ex-wife Georgia. She is remarried to a rich but vile construction developer, but Sweeney and Gorgina are still in love.', 'Sweeney is a playwright on a career decline. He spends much of his time wheedling money and beer out of his artistic friend Moriarty. One of his few highlights is weekly sex with his ex-wife Georgia. She is remarried to a rich but vile construction developer, but Sweeney and Gorgina are still in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/olTsZ85gdCJRE8ABsNDgcxB4udw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:163692'),
  ('658969756944674343', 'It Should Happen to You', 1954, 'Comedy, Romance', 'George Cukor, Earl Bellamy, Morris Stoloff', 'Garson Kanin', 'Judy Holliday, Peter Lawford, Jack Lemmon, Michael O''Shea, Vaughn Taylor, Connie Gilchrist, Walter Klavun, Whit Bissell', 'NR', 'Gladys Glover has just lost her modeling job when she meets filmmaker Pete Sheppard shooting a documentary in Central Park. For Pete it''s love at first sight, but Gladys has her mind on other things, making a name for herself. Through a fluke of advertising she winds up with her name plastered over 10 billboards throughout city.', 'Gladys Glover has just lost her modeling job when she meets filmmaker Pete Sheppard shooting a documentary in Central Park. For Pete it''s love at first sight, but Gladys has her mind on other things, making a name for herself. Through a fluke of advertising she winds up with her name plastered over 10 billboards throughout city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rj4hPdJmoRivGhApCEidPFtxVku.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20127'),
  ('162323369594873306', 'It Smells Like Someone Died Here... But It Wasn''t Me!', 1990, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Álvaro Sáenz de Heredia, Michel Malka, Andrés Sáenz de Heredia', 'Alejandro Pose, Álvaro Sáenz de Heredia', 'Josema Yuste, Millán Salcedo, Ana Álvarez, Raúl Fraire, Pilar Alcón, Paul Naschy, Raf Taylor, Raquel Rodrigo', null, 'The Count of Capranegra, accompanied by his chamberlain, travels to Soborlskaia to claim the castle of his great-great-grandfather who died in strange circumstances. But to get the fortune he must first pass a difficult test.', 'The Count of Capranegra, accompanied by his chamberlain, travels to Soborlskaia to claim the castle of his great-great-grandfather who died in strange circumstances. But to get the fortune he must first pass a difficult test.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lDuL5fPaGtq92N9qu3ZdcwZAUW2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77301'),
  ('1069332152590138453', 'It Snows in Benidorm', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jean-Claude Larrieu, Isabel Coixet', 'Isabel Coixet', 'Timothy Spall, Sarita Choudhury, Pedro Casablanc, Carmen Machi, Ana Torrent, Édgar Vittorino, Leonardo Ortizgris, Ben Temple', null, 'Peter has worked all his life at a Manchester bank. When he is awarded an early retirement, he decides to visit his brother in Benidorm, only to discover that he''s disappeared.', 'Peter has worked all his life at a Manchester bank. When he is awarded an early retirement, he decides to visit his brother in Benidorm, only to discover that he''s disappeared.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gildS9NpEO7DP5Jy01peQ0BBHJV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:645693'),
