  ('1077859879951172109', 'It Started in Naples', 1960, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Melville Shavelson, Robert Surtees', 'Suso Cecchi d''Amico, Melville Shavelson, Jack Rose', 'Clark Gable, Sophia Loren, Vittorio De Sica, Marietto Angeletti, Paolo Carlini, Giovanni Filidoro, Claudio Ermelli, Bob Cunningham', 'PG', 'Mike Hamilton, a Philadelphia lawyer, comes to Naples to settle the estate of his long estranged "black sheep" brother. Once there, he discovers that the deceased has left an 8 year old boy who is being raised by Michael''s sister-in-law Lucia Curcio. To complicate matters, Lucia happens to be a sexy nightclub performer.', 'Mike Hamilton, a Philadelphia lawyer, comes to Naples to settle the estate of his long estranged "black sheep" brother. Once there, he discovers that the deceased has left an 8 year old boy who is being raised by Michael''s sister-in-law Lucia Curcio. To complicate matters, Lucia happens to be a sexy nightclub performer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cqgViygbWqqGJs1AOPKRcKEj4rg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38151'),
  ('795977112618161481', 'It Started with a Kiss', 1959, 'Comedy, Romance', 'George Marshall, Robert J. Bronner, Al Jennings', 'Charles Lederer', 'Glenn Ford, Debbie Reynolds, Eva Gabor, Gustavo Rojo, Fred Clark, Edgar Buchanan, Harry Morgan, Robert Warwick', 'NR', 'While on leave in New York, a serviceman both weds a chorus girl and wins a red convertible in a charity raffle. Both his wife and the car turn out to be problematic.', 'While on leave in New York, a serviceman both weds a chorus girl and wins a red convertible in a charity raffle. Both his wife and the car turn out to be problematic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zuuxkL2dIBn5DDcGrxNgT7gAr5T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:175681'),
  ('275258889837710641', 'It Started with Eve', 1941, 'Comedy, Romance, Music', 'Henry Koster, Martin Obzina, Charles Previn', 'Leo Townsend', 'Deanna Durbin, Charles Laughton, Robert Cummings, Guy Kibbee, Margaret Tallichet, Catherine Doucet, Walter Catlett, Charles Coleman', null, 'A young man asks a hat check girl to pose as his fiancée in order to make his dying father''s last moments happy. However, the old man''s health takes a turn for the better and now his son doesn''t know how to break the news that he''s engaged to someone else, especially since his father is so taken with the impostor.', 'A young man asks a hat check girl to pose as his fiancée in order to make his dying father''s last moments happy. However, the old man''s health takes a turn for the better and now his son doesn''t know how to break the news that he''s engaged to someone else, especially since his father is so taken with the impostor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5lWnLdq0MRMPH3Rfm0FLQN1ywc8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33112'),
  ('161841546815747422', 'It Stopped Raining', 2020, 'Drama, Romance', 'Keitaro Sakon, Ryutaro Nakagawa, Yuki Kondo', 'Ryutaro Nakagawa, Eiji Umehara', 'Taiga Nakano, Misa Eto, Toko Miura, Ryota Bando, Kanji Furutachi, Yohta Kawase, Naomi Kawase, Masato Hagiwara', null, 'A young bioarchaeologist Yukisuke is attracted to a girl Koyomi, who runs a small stand of taiyaki pastry that he often buys. Koyomi is hospitalized, however, by a car accident on a rainy day after they go out together, and wakes up with short term memory loss, where she cannot remember anything beyond the present day. Yukisuke tries to live close to her as before but the lack of collective memory starts to stagger him.', 'A young bioarchaeologist Yukisuke is attracted to a girl Koyomi, who runs a small stand of taiyaki pastry that he often buys. Koyomi is hospitalized, however, by a car accident on a rainy day after they go out together, and wakes up with short term memory loss, where she cannot remember anything beyond the present day. Yukisuke tries to live close to her as before but the lack of collective memory starts to stagger him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sCiuljgIwMifRJSrSNYcUGaI61i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:637182'),
  ('576170107969855581', 'It Takes a Village', 2026, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Łukasz Kośmicki, Jeremi Prokopowicz, Tomasz Dukszta', 'Katarzyna Golenia, Karolina Frankowska', 'Anna Seniuk, Artur Barciś, Filip Gurłacz, Joanna Trzepiecińska, Anna Szymańczyk, Cezary Żak, Mateusz Janicki, Wiktor Zborowski', 'PG-13', 'When financial trouble forces Halina to call off her wedding, her friends and family decide to hatch a wild plan to bring in tourist money.', 'When financial trouble forces Halina to call off her wedding, her friends and family decide to hatch a wild plan to bring in tourist money.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/znUVVJh0WSCHAhiJ6Att5qhmAzG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1561758'),
  ('735940987426337711', 'It Takes Two', 1988, 'Comedy, Romance', 'David Beaird, Peter Deming', 'Richard Christian Matheson, Tom Szollosi', 'George Newbern, Leslie Hope, Kimberly Foster, Barry Corbin, Anthony Geary, Frances Lee McCain, Patrika Darbo, John Hawkes', 'PG-13', 'Travis is due to marry Stephanie in a few days when he is convinced by beautiful saleswoman Jonni to buy a fancy sports car. The car looks good, but it turns out to be a piece of junk. Travis is determined to get satisfaction and he and Jonni hit the road to confront the crooked car dealer.', 'Travis is due to marry Stephanie in a few days when he is convinced by beautiful saleswoman Jonni to buy a fancy sports car. The car looks good, but it turns out to be a piece of junk. Travis is determined to get satisfaction and he and Jonni hit the road to confront the crooked car dealer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/56FzmVL5c8Dc8Hjzej73RBz6RIU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110538'),
  ('713039475165127024', 'It Takes Two', 1995, 'Comedy, Family, Romance', 'Andy Tennant, Mick MacKay, Rocco Gismondi', 'Deborah Dean Davis', 'Kirstie Alley, Steve Guttenberg, Ashley Olsen, Mary-Kate Olsen, Jane Sibbett, Philip Bosco, Michelle Grisom, Desmond Robertson', 'PG', 'Identical 9-year-olds from very different backgrounds: orphaned Amanda and wealthy Alyssa meet at summer camp and decide to switch places -- and play matchmaker between Alyssa''s dad, Roger, and the kind social worker who cares for Amanda.', 'Identical 9-year-olds from very different backgrounds: orphaned Amanda and wealthy Alyssa meet at summer camp and decide to switch places -- and play matchmaker between Alyssa''s dad, Roger, and the kind social worker who cares for Amanda.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4CptjFLiIJXtjc3dykS7vkEHMbw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33689'),
  ('430157502562518489', 'It Takes Two To Tango', 2025, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Jean-Pierre Améris, Pierre Milon, Nina Boussad', 'Jean-Pierre Améris, Marion Michau', 'Valérie Lemercier, Gérard Darmon, Patrick Timsit, Alice de Lencquesaing, Aurélien Cavagna, Éric Viellard, Sophie Mounicot, François Berland', null, 'Antoine Toussaint is a famous, disillusioned 70 year-old crooner. On a train to Geneva where he plans to end his life, Antoine meets Victoire, a good-natured fan with a few loose wires. This unlikely encounter thwarts all Antoine’s plans, for better or worse!', 'Antoine Toussaint is a famous, disillusioned 70 year-old crooner. On a train to Geneva where he plans to end his life, Antoine meets Victoire, a good-natured fan with a few loose wires. This unlikely encounter thwarts all Antoine’s plans, for better or worse!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gBT1mJ2E7K8QqOM0HVtStlBElvV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1306293'),
  ('397615502824973665', 'It Waits', 2005, 'Horror', 'Steven R. Monroe, Jon Joffin', null, 'Cerina Vincent, Dominic Zamprogna, Greg Kean, Eric Schweig, Matthew Jordon, Miranda Frigon, Sean Wei Mah, Tinsel Korey', 'NR', 'A lone female park ranger tries to track down a vicious creature killing various people and terrorizing her at a remote national park.', 'A lone female park ranger tries to track down a vicious creature killing various people and terrorizing her at a remote national park.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dAJd3tW4EEeP6RTzLirDgTefSYs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24090'),
  ('99031112606795770', 'It Was a Short Summer, Charlie Brown', 1969, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, TV Movie', 'Bill Melendez', 'Charles M. Schulz', 'Peter Robbins, Pamelyn Ferdin, Glenn Gilger, Ann Altieri, David Carey, John Daschback, Christopher DeFaria, Gail DeFaria', 'G', 'School is out for the summer and Charlie Brown, Linus, Schroeder and Pig Pen are planning to spend it reading every comic book, watching television, practicing ballplay, and classical music, and having clean thoughts. However, Lucy tells them that she signed them up for camp. The girls are eager to go, but the boys hate the idea.(Linus adding that its like finding out that he was drafted.) The boys shove each other to get on the bus, while the girls line up in order. At camp, Charlie Brown is chosen captain of the boys camp. The boys and girls have a swim race which the girls win easily. Then they have a softball game, which the boys lose with only one run. Other competitions are just as lopsided. Afterwards, the boys sit around the campfire and reflect on how miserable they are. In one scene, the colors of the shirts of Schroder and Linus are mixed up during this scene.', 'School is out for the summer and Charlie Brown, Linus, Schroeder and Pig Pen are planning to spend it reading every comic book, watching television, practicing ballplay, and classical music, and having clean thoughts. However, Lucy tells them that she signed them up for camp. The girls are eager to go, but the boys hate the idea.(Linus adding that its like finding out that he was drafted.) The boys shove each other to get on the bus, while the girls line up in order. At camp, Charlie Brown is chosen captain of the boys camp. The boys and girls have a swim race which the girls win easily. Then they have a softball game, which the boys lose with only one run. Other competitions are just as lopsided. Afterwards, the boys sit around the campfire and reflect on how miserable they are. In one scene, the colors of the shirts of Schroder and Linus are mixed up during this scene.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5AHXzz4NB4yrirsB5uneDurq0xv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52955'),
  ('387920181881386604', 'It Was Always You', 2021, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'Stephanie Wells, Tamara Malczewska, Michael Robison', null, 'Erin Krakow, Tyler Hynes, Giles Panton, Elysia Rotaru, Nelson Wong, Frances Flanagan, Paula Shaw, Morgana Wyllie', 'G', 'Elizabeth''s engagement plans are thrown into disarray when her fiancée''s free-spirited brother David returns home. David''s unexpected influence prompts Elizabeth to question her life decisions.', 'Elizabeth''s engagement plans are thrown into disarray when her fiancée''s free-spirited brother David returns home. David''s unexpected influence prompts Elizabeth to question her life decisions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y3EoplS3g78FuFz8qzOptGinM3Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:784391'),
  ('796088059782603894', 'It Was Just an Accident', 2025, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime, Mystery', 'Jafar Panahi, Amin Jafari, Shahrokh Panahi', 'Jafar Panahi', 'Vahid Mobasseri, Mariam Afshari, Ebrahim Azizi, Hadis Pakbaten, Majid Panahi, Mohamad Ali Elyasmehr, George Hashemzadeh, Delmaz Najafi', 'PG-13', 'An unassuming mechanic is reminded of his time in an Iranian prison when he encounters a man he suspects to be his sadistic jailhouse captor.', 'An unassuming mechanic is reminded of his time in an Iranian prison when he encounters a man he suspects to be his sadistic jailhouse captor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eNYGj2DG3n8OrVPTfYunpPW9uas.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1456349'),
  ('1150950401295842796', 'It Was My Best Birthday Ever, Charlie Brown!', 1997, 'Comedy, Animation, Family, TV Movie', 'Bill Melendez', 'Charles M. Schulz', 'Steven Hartman, Anthony Burch, Jamie Cronin, Danielle Keaton, Brandon Taylor, Megan Ellis, Bill Melendez', null, 'Linus is planning a birthday party. While trying out his new in-line skates in the neighborhood park, he meets a nice little girl with a beautiful singing voice. Linus invites his new friend to the party. The party should be wonderful, but Linus will only be satisfied if the little girl attends. He is completely smitten!', 'Linus is planning a birthday party. While trying out his new in-line skates in the neighborhood park, he meets a nice little girl with a beautiful singing voice. Linus invites his new friend to the party. The party should be wonderful, but Linus will only be satisfied if the little girl attends. He is completely smitten!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kRlFNgedeJmq6PyWU2Xz5FvQDjd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:270432'),
  ('73394556828037779', 'It Was the Son', 2012, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Daniele Ciprì, Daniele Ciprì, Francesca Lattanzi', 'Miriam Rizzo', 'Toni Servillo, Giselda Volodi, Alfredo Castro, Fabrizio Falco, Aurora Quattrocchi, Benedetto Raneli, Giacomo Civiletti, Gino Carista', null, 'The Ciraulo family lives in the miserable district of Palermo called "Zen". When one of their children dies in a shootout between mafia gangsters they receive compensation and buy a luxury black Volvo. Things go wrong when Trancredi, another son, takes the car out and damages the car door.', 'The Ciraulo family lives in the miserable district of Palermo called "Zen". When one of their children dies in a shootout between mafia gangsters they receive compensation and buy a luxury black Volvo. Things go wrong when Trancredi, another son, takes the car out and damages the car door.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3KRKbDrCUZFIZl8VgACYS5ISkuv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121998'),
  ('788770765609570452', 'It Will Find You', 2026, 'Horror', 'Chris Broadbent, Enzo Tedeschi', 'Chris Broadbent', 'Kylah Day, Luke Ford, Tom Jackson, Barbara Bingham, Aaron Pedersen', null, 'Emily''s mother''s pendant awakens a 25-year dormant family curse. Called insane, she must explore her heritage to stop the "Giniirr" spirit before it claims her life and others as payment for ancestral wrongs.', 'Emily''s mother''s pendant awakens a 25-year dormant family curse. Called insane, she must explore her heritage to stop the "Giniirr" spirit before it claims her life and others as payment for ancestral wrongs.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F3Hn2RAbU9lGdtooayLDpo6iZCQv.jpg', 'plex:movie:it-will-find-you-2026'),
  ('710084491301865369', 'It Would Be Night in Caracas', 2025, 'Action, Adventure, Drama', 'Mariana Rondón, Marité Ugás', 'Mariana Rondón, Marité Ugás', 'Natalia Reyes, Moisés Angola, Sheila Monterola, Edgar Ramírez, Samantha Castillo, Boris Schoemann, Kala Martínez, Vicente Peña', null, 'While struggling to withstand the chaos of modern Venezuela, Adelaida sees a chance to survive—and takes it: leaving everything behind, even her own name. In a land with no future, her only way out is to become someone else.', 'While struggling to withstand the chaos of modern Venezuela, Adelaida sees a chance to survive—and takes it: leaving everything behind, even her own name. In a land with no future, her only way out is to become someone else.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s41i9MQeqKqIFtCTfXKTPM9X9MG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1516445'),
  ('211095991795980156', 'It!', 1967, 'Horror', 'Herbert J. Leder, Davis Boulton', 'Herbert J. Leder', 'Roddy McDowall, Jill Haworth, Paul Maxwell, Aubrey Richards, Ernest Clark, Oliver Johnston, Noel Trevarthen, Ian McCulloch', null, 'After a warehouse fire, museum director Grove and assistant Pimm find everything destroyed, only one statue withstood the fire mysteriously undamaged. Suddenly Grove is lying dead on the ground, killed by the statue? Pimm finds out that the cursed statue has been created by Rabbi Loew in 16th century and will withstand every human attempt to destroy it. Pimm decides to use it to his own advantage.', 'After a warehouse fire, museum director Grove and assistant Pimm find everything destroyed, only one statue withstood the fire mysteriously undamaged. Suddenly Grove is lying dead on the ground, killed by the statue? Pimm finds out that the cursed statue has been created by Rabbi Loew in 16th century and will withstand every human attempt to destroy it. Pimm decides to use it to his own advantage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sBMFTviUDt6bm8LROkAWAvw1Ts5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31232'),
  ('433856437100635024', 'It! The Terror from Beyond Space', 1958, 'Science Fiction, Horror', 'Edward L. Cahn, Kenneth Peach, Ralph E. Black', 'Jerome Bixby', 'Marshall Thompson, Shirley Patterson, Kim Spalding, Ann Doran, Dabbs Greer, Paul Langton, Robert Bice, Richard Benedict', 'NR', 'The first manned expedition to Mars is invaded by an unknown life form, which stows away on the rescue ship.', 'The first manned expedition to Mars is invaded by an unknown life form, which stows away on the rescue ship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/scPw7bBH3PDAHHT48W0fevQeMO8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27179'),
  ('350665542901528125', 'It''s a Beautiful Day', 2013, 'Horror', 'Kayoko Asakura', 'Kayoko Asakura', 'Kim Kkob-bi, Nanako Ohata, Akihiro Kitamura, Shijimi, Chika Kanamoto, Tomoyasu Abe, Adam LaFramboise, Julian Curtis', null, 'Korean international student A-Joong (Kim Kkobbi) takes part in a camp at a country village, located in the suburbs of Los Angeles. A-Joong isn''t happy with the Japanese international students who seem to be addicted to alcohol, drugs or sex. At that time, some brothers, who make a living through murders and burglary, target the cottage where the international students stay.', 'Korean international student A-Joong (Kim Kkobbi) takes part in a camp at a country village, located in the suburbs of Los Angeles. A-Joong isn''t happy with the Japanese international students who seem to be addicted to alcohol, drugs or sex. At that time, some brothers, who make a living through murders and burglary, target the cottage where the international students stay.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sIoGZKiz1dKrtuCJpmwZGcv9ZAR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:333322'),
  ('1013270443201538937', 'It''s a Bikini World', 1967, 'Comedy', 'Stephanie Rothman, Alan Stensvold', 'Stephanie Rothman, Charles S. Swartz', 'Deborah Walley, Tommy Kirk, Bobby Pickett, Suzie Kaye, Jack Bernardi, William O''Connell, Jim Begg, Lori Williams', null, 'Male chauvinist Mike attempts to get an intelligent burgeoning feminist Delilah into his harem. When she resists, Mike then poses as his brother Herbert, but in the process falls in love with Delilah.', 'Male chauvinist Mike attempts to get an intelligent burgeoning feminist Delilah into his harem. When she resists, Mike then poses as his brother Herbert, but in the process falls in love with Delilah.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rMzzFKHgtUjOK9XDk3Z4e6Rcc1Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91063'),
  ('171584780111642874', 'It''s a Bird', 1930, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Harold L. Muller', 'Lowell Thomas', 'Charles R. Bowers, Lowell Thomas', null, 'Charlie, working on a junkjard, always trying to help people in the most impossible ways with junk from his work place, hears from a German professor, that there is a bird, a Belgish Kongo, that eats metal. Charlie sets out on a ridiculous hunting expedition to catch one. With some music - the birds love music - and a strange worm he is able to catch one, but even then the bird offers some even more over-the-top surprises.', 'Charlie, working on a junkjard, always trying to help people in the most impossible ways with junk from his work place, hears from a German professor, that there is a bird, a Belgish Kongo, that eats metal. Charlie sets out on a ridiculous hunting expedition to catch one. With some music - the birds love music - and a strange worm he is able to catch one, but even then the bird offers some even more over-the-top surprises.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iY1mQfUOdAUXcy6SVWpxourl8bj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:195617'),
  ('359303031749196479', 'It''s a Bird, It''s a Plane, It''s Superman!', 1975, 'Comedy, TV Movie, Science Fiction, Action, Music', 'Jack Regas, Borden Newman, Urve Kuusik', 'Lee Adams, Robert Benton, David Newman', 'David Wilson, Lesley Ann Warren, David Wayne, Loretta Swit, Kenneth Mars, Gary Owens, Phil Leeds, Harvey Lembeck', null, 'TV adaptation of the campy 1960s Broadway musical about the Man of Steel, his friends, his enemies, and his self-image problems.', 'TV adaptation of the campy 1960s Broadway musical about the Man of Steel, his friends, his enemies, and his self-image problems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3gX8k0zksgycB2HOuGCa7n30eOe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:142064'),
  ('465461461971519694', 'It''s a Boy Girl Thing', 2006, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Romance', 'Nick Hurran, Steve Danyluk', 'Geoff Deane', 'Kevin Zegers, Samaire Armstrong, Sherry Miller, Robert Joy, Sharon Osbourne, Maury Chaykin, Mpho Koaho, Emily Hampshire', 'PG-13', 'A visit to a natural history museum proves catastrophic for two high school rivals, an overachiever and a jock, when an ancient Aztec statue casts a spell that causes them to switch bodies and see exactly what it''s like to walk in the other''s shoes.', 'A visit to a natural history museum proves catastrophic for two high school rivals, an overachiever and a jock, when an ancient Aztec statue casts a spell that causes them to switch bodies and see exactly what it''s like to walk in the other''s shoes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uA4ZJdlILmIGSqBjfM4mkWvtcTt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37725'),
  ('404088255943511879', 'It''s a Disaster', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Nancy Schreiber, Todd Berger', 'Todd Berger', 'Julia Stiles, David Cross, America Ferrera, Rachel Boston, Jeff Grace, Erinn Hayes, Kevin M. Brennan, Blaise Miller', 'R', 'Four couples meet for Sunday brunch only to discover they are stuck in a house together as the world may be about to end.', 'Four couples meet for Sunday brunch only to discover they are stuck in a house together as the world may be about to end.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lIDXD8YUivHISG3uhtXtYTLofhE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114779'),
  ('1075233218106824585', 'It''s a Fairy!', 2016, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Cris D''amato, Felipe Reinheimer, Guto Graça Melo', 'Fernando Ceylão, Sylvio Gonçalves', 'Kéfera Buchmann, Klara Castanho, Sílvio Guindane, Mariana Santos, Bruna Griphao, Isabella Moreira, Clara Tiezzi, João Fernandes', null, 'Geraldine is a fairy who lost their wings by using unconventional methods in their missions. Her last chance to retrieve them will be the mission "Julia".', 'Geraldine is a fairy who lost their wings by using unconventional methods in their missions. Her last chance to retrieve them will be the mission "Julia".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/krowYpPk8PiINjZLnbFkk3Nvd5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:409317'),
  ('1069549741978762262', 'It''s a Flickering Life', 2021, 'Drama', 'Masashi Chikamori, Yoji Yamada, Tomoaki Sasae', 'Yoji Yamada, Yuzo Asahara', 'Kenji Sawada, Masaki Suda, Mei Nagano, Yojiro Noda, Keiko Kitagawa, Shinobu Terajima, Nenji Kobayashi, Nobuko Miyamoto', null, 'The story centers on a man who loves movies, having once worked at movie studio in pursuit of his dreams, surrounded by great directors and famous actors. In this tale of love and friendship spanning a lifetime, the "god of cinema" that Go has worshipped since he was young will transcend time, and work a miracle in the lives of one family.', 'The story centers on a man who loves movies, having once worked at movie studio in pursuit of his dreams, surrounded by great directors and famous actors. In this tale of love and friendship spanning a lifetime, the "god of cinema" that Go has worshipped since he was young will transcend time, and work a miracle in the lives of one family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/53Tw4usRzHYn9sldE4o1HKpQJMS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:751519'),
  ('118159825744137870', 'It''s a Free World...', 2007, 'Drama', 'Nigel Willoughby, Ken Loach', 'Paul Laverty', 'Kierston Wareing, Juliet Ellis, Lesław Żurek, Colin Caughlin, Joe Siffleet, Frank Gilhooley, Davoud Rastgou, David Doyle', 'NR', 'Angie is a working class woman. After being fired, she decides to set up a recruitment agency of her own, running it from her kitchen with her friend, Rose. Taking advantage of the desperation of immigrants, Angie builds a successful business extremely quickly.', 'Angie is a working class woman. After being fired, she decides to set up a recruitment agency of her own, running it from her kitchen with her friend, Rose. Taking advantage of the desperation of immigrants, Angie builds a successful business extremely quickly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mf21jW15cjoe95yIW1DvlYUN4YO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7992'),
  ('643082424346588926', 'It''s a Gift', 1934, 'Comedy', 'Norman Z. McLeod, Henry Sharp, Edward Montagne', 'Jack Cunningham', 'W.C. Fields, Baby LeRoy, Kathleen Howard, Jean Rouverol, Julian Madison, Tommy Bupp, Tammany Young, Morgan Wallace', 'NR', 'After he inherits some money, Harold Bissonette ("pronounced bis-on-ay") decides to give up the grocery business, move to California and run an orange grove. Despite his family''s objections and the news that the land he bought is worthless, Bissonette packs up and drives out to California with his nagging wife Amelia and children.', 'After he inherits some money, Harold Bissonette ("pronounced bis-on-ay") decides to give up the grocery business, move to California and run an orange grove. Despite his family''s objections and the news that the land he bought is worthless, Bissonette packs up and drives out to California with his nagging wife Amelia and children.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3DlYiSh3S7A9GO15gUu7zg92bD0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28001'),
  ('461686438103351174', 'It''s a Great Feeling', 1949, 'Comedy, Music', 'David Butler, Wilfrid M. Cline', 'Melville Shavelson, Jack Rose', 'Dennis Morgan, Doris Day, Jack Carson, Bill Goodwin, Irving Bacon, Claire Carleton, Jean Andren, Lois Austin', 'NR', 'A waitress at the Warner Brothers commissary is anxious to break into pictures. She thinks her big break may have arrived when actors Jack Carson and Dennis Morgan agree to help her.', 'A waitress at the Warner Brothers commissary is anxious to break into pictures. She thinks her big break may have arrived when actors Jack Carson and Dennis Morgan agree to help her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jjZ1dQZ7TX4pU4XGKD3ZQ6ixWSv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32552'),
  ('9646218522293481', 'It''s a Hard Life', 1964, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Carlo Lizzani, Erico Menczer, Giovanni Vento', 'Luciano Vincenzoni, Sergio Amidei, Carlo Lizzani', 'Ugo Tognazzi, Giovanna Ralli, Rossana Martini, Enzo Jannacci, Giampiero Albertini, Maria Pia Arcangeli, Elio Crovetto, Paola Dapino', null, 'Luciano Bianchi lives with his wife and son in the small town of Guastalla. As an intellectual and bibliophile, he works as head of cultural initiatives at a mining plant.', 'Luciano Bianchi lives with his wife and son in the small town of Guastalla. As an intellectual and bibliophile, he works as head of cultural initiatives at a mining plant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t4fSd8pKyYpIgVUCOC1NBRPJ7eQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80443'),
  ('123782479417005260', 'It''s a Jungle Out There', 1995, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Hans-Christian Schmid, Klaus Eichhammer', 'Michael Gutmann, Hans-Christian Schmid, David Howard', 'Franka Potente, Axel Milberg, Dagmar Manzel, Farina Brock, Sibylle Canonica, Peter Ender, Thomas Schmauser, Johann von Bülow', null, 'Anna, 17 years old, is happy to throw her first big birthday party without her parents, but some of her guests are so stoned that they leave a big chaos and, even worse, destroy the favorite record of Anna''s father. After the return of her shocked and angry parents, Anna runs away to Munich with her admirer Simon. They discover the nightlife jungle and get to know some typical urban guys. Meanwhile, Anna''s parents get in touch with Simon''s and try to find their children. On the way across Munich, they remember their own wild and restless youth…', 'Anna, 17 years old, is happy to throw her first big birthday party without her parents, but some of her guests are so stoned that they leave a big chaos and, even worse, destroy the favorite record of Anna''s father. After the return of her shocked and angry parents, Anna runs away to Munich with her admirer Simon. They discover the nightlife jungle and get to know some typical urban guys. Meanwhile, Anna''s parents get in touch with Simon''s and try to find their children. On the way across Munich, they remember their own wild and restless youth…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8ZxgQlwKItuICjzdCckuap43WqV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4285'),
  ('782684398333361474', 'It''s a Long Road', 1998, 'Drama', 'Anna Komninou, Nestoras Ladas, Pantelis Voulgaris', 'Pantelis Voulgaris, Giorgios Skabardonis', 'Thanasis Veggos, Giorgos Armenis, Dimitris Katalifos, Kostas Kazanas, Stella Kazazi, Angeliki Lemoni, Agapios Agapiou, Chrysa Avrami', 'PG', 'Three stories dealing with three men and their stance towards life, given their personal background. All stories are held in Northern Greece (Macedonia and Thrace), covering all the spectrum from urban to rural settings.', 'Three stories dealing with three men and their stance towards life, given their personal background. All stories are held in Northern Greece (Macedonia and Thrace), covering all the spectrum from urban to rural settings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w1O7wnL3DaKA0JLMY5B8m4XlOIo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:167021'),
  ('744576706927036676', 'It''s a Mad World', 2019, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Marco Bocci, Federico Annicchiarico, Marita D''Elia', 'Marco Bocci', 'Libero De Rienzo, Andrea Sartoretti, Giorgio Colangeli, Carlo D''Ursi, Giordano De Plano, Lorenza Guerrieri, Lorenzo Lazzarini, Antónia Lišková', null, 'In the difficult Roman neighborhood of Tor Bella Monaca, Mauro, recently abandoned by his girlfriend, is about to discover whether evil is something one is born being, or one becomes.', 'In the difficult Roman neighborhood of Tor Bella Monaca, Mauro, recently abandoned by his girlfriend, is about to discover whether evil is something one is born being, or one becomes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sdEz1cuxv7Fhp8sp3C1mgW6ujrz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:641510'),
  ('721920110266558330', 'It''s a Mad, Mad, Mad World', 1987, 'Comedy, Family', 'Clifton Ko Chi-Sum, Derek Wan Man-Kit, Chan Yuk-Ming', 'Clifton Ko Chi-Sum', 'Bill Tung Biu, Lydia Shum Tin-Ha, Eric Tsang Chi-Wai, Elsie Chan Yik-Si, David Chiang Da-Wei, Loletta Lee Lai-Chun, Pauline Kwan, Danny Summer', null, 'Bill, a TV news reporter, tries to make ends meet to support himself, his wife and three daughters in urban Hong Kong. In the mist of the misadventures of Bill and his family, their luck and lives ultimately change when Bill''s wife suddenly wins the lottery.', 'Bill, a TV news reporter, tries to make ends meet to support himself, his wife and three daughters in urban Hong Kong. In the mist of the misadventures of Bill and his family, their luck and lives ultimately change when Bill''s wife suddenly wins the lottery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rFqI70gcRm9V8OFBRAkJmSQxHY6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:154353'),
  ('842898917814170945', 'It''s a Mad, Mad, Mad World II', 1988, 'Comedy', 'Clifton Ko Chi-Sum, Derek Wan Man-Kit, Rosanna Ng Wai-San', 'Clifton Ko Chi-Sum, John Ng Chong-Chow, Chim Si-Yuen', 'Bill Tung Biu, Lydia Shum Tin-Ha, Lowell Lo Koon-Ting, Elsie Chan Yik-Si, Loletta Lee Lai-Chun, Pauline Kwan, Teddy Yip Wing-Cho, Wong San', null, 'After losing their lottery winnings during the bank''s closure, the Biu family''s luck changes again as Bill''s job promotion and daughters'' education and work careers sent them and the entire family to lead their new lives in Canada, where new misadventures await.', 'After losing their lottery winnings during the bank''s closure, the Biu family''s luck changes again as Bill''s job promotion and daughters'' education and work careers sent them and the entire family to lead their new lives in Canada, where new misadventures await.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9LbMGsSY8oM0pcw2516j4H86ELQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:154357'),
  ('877731281656555183', 'It''s a Mad, Mad, Mad World III', 1989, 'Comedy', 'Stephen Shin Kei-Yin, Stanley Ko Moon-Kai, File Ip Kwok-Wing', 'John Chan Kin-Chung, Pang Cha-Choi, Kim Yip Kwong-Kim', 'Bill Tung Biu, Lydia Shum Tin-Ha, Elsie Chan Yik-Si, Loletta Lee Lai-Chun, Pauline Kwan, Frances Yip, Lowell Lo Koon-Ting, Eric Tsang Chi-Wai', null, 'The Biu Family collects their lottery winnings in Canada and returns to Hong Kong to start a new life together, minus the second daughter due to a family quarrel of her involvement with her boyfriend. After Mrs. Biu shows off her money to her old friends at her bank, she loses it all in a robbery. Now, void of their new found wealth, the Biu Family must start over from scratch again.', 'The Biu Family collects their lottery winnings in Canada and returns to Hong Kong to start a new life together, minus the second daughter due to a family quarrel of her involvement with her boyfriend. After Mrs. Biu shows off her money to her old friends at her bank, she loses it all in a robbery. Now, void of their new found wealth, the Biu Family must start over from scratch again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/TxiABUZfNMJr1B6LP6LxuHarJ4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:154359'),
  ('1110155418052922441', 'It''s a Mad, Mad, Mad, Mad World', 1963, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Crime', 'Stanley Kramer, Ernest Laszlo, Bert Chervin', 'William Rose, Tania Rose', 'Spencer Tracy, Milton Berle, Sid Caesar, Buddy Hackett, Ethel Merman, Mickey Rooney, Dick Shawn, Phil Silvers', 'G', 'A group of strangers come across a man dying after a car crash who proceeds to tell them about the $350,000 he buried in California. What follows is the madcap adventures of those strangers as each attempts to claim the prize for himself.', 'A group of strangers come across a man dying after a car crash who proceeds to tell them about the $350,000 he buried in California. What follows is the madcap adventures of those strangers as each attempts to claim the prize for himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j4mWzOisSHFkaqIkq34l2mm8a5K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11576'),
  ('1126431739874890827', 'It''s a Mystery, Charlie Brown', 1974, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, TV Movie, Mystery', 'Phil Roman', 'Charles M. Schulz', 'Todd Barbee, Melanie Kohn, Stephen Shea, Donna Le Tourneau, Jimmy Ahrens, Lynn Mortensen, Tom Muller, Bill Melendez', null, 'When Woodstock''s fancy new nest disappears one afternoon, he turns to Snoopy for help. Adopting the guise of Sherlock Holmes (complete with cloak, deerstalker cap and bubble pipe), Snoopy and Woodstock go on the hunt for the missing nest.', 'When Woodstock''s fancy new nest disappears one afternoon, he turns to Snoopy for help. Adopting the guise of Sherlock Holmes (complete with cloak, deerstalker cap and bubble pipe), Snoopy and Woodstock go on the hunt for the missing nest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q5t6TLrGbTHeA2lNcbKSV4Frtkc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52956'),
  ('779721910963595107', 'It''s a SpongeBob Christmas!', 2012, 'Family, Animation, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Mark Caballero, Seamus Walsh', 'Luke Brookshier, Marc Ceccarelli, Derek Iversen', 'Tom Kenny, Bill Fagerbakke, Rodger Bumpass, Clancy Brown, Carolyn Lawrence, Mr. Lawrence, Jill Talley, Lori Alan', 'NR', 'At Christmastime in Bikini Bottom, everyone''s excited except Plankton, who always gets a lump of coal from Santa. But he vows this year he''ll finally get his wish – the Krabby Patty formula! And it won''t be by being good. He''s gonna make everyone in Bikini Bottom bad!', 'At Christmastime in Bikini Bottom, everyone''s excited except Plankton, who always gets a lump of coal from Santa. But he vows this year he''ll finally get his wish – the Krabby Patty formula! And it won''t be by being good. He''s gonna make everyone in Bikini Bottom bad!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ewcwsytxHGoa3tIUdfwffzphuzc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:298016'),
  ('701748364044181699', 'It''s a Summer Film!', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance, Science Fiction', 'Hiroshi Iwanaga, Hironori Yamasaki, Soushi Matsumoto', 'Soushi Matsumoto, Miura Naoyuki', 'Marika Ito, Daichi Kaneko, Yuumi Kawai, Kilala Inori, Shunya Itabashi, Ryo Shinoda, Seiichi Kohinata, Eikichi Ikeda', null, 'Barefoot and her friends decide to make a samurai movie, gather a unique cast and staff for the production, and try to screen it at their school festival.', 'Barefoot and her friends decide to make a samurai movie, gather a unique cast and staff for the production, and try to screen it at their school festival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zAEI0nAXkWp5tOsceWDirF8bNIC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:747983'),
  ('889105089174547727', 'It''s a Very Merry Muppet Christmas Movie', 2002, 'Comedy, Family', 'Randal Platt, Tracey Poirier, Patrice Leung', 'Jim Lewis, Tom Martin', 'Steve Whitmire, Dave Goelz, Bill Barretta, Eric Jacobson, David Arquette, Joan Cusack, Matthew Lillard, William H. Macy', 'PG', 'The owner of a bank (Miss Bitterman) wants to own the Muppet Theatre so she can build a nightclub over it. After she tricks Pepe into giving her the only copy of the contract between her father and the Muppets, she changes it so the Muppets have very little time to pay a debt they owe. Meanwhile, the Muppets are trying to put on a Christmas show. After the Muppets are confronted by Bitterman, they make a lot of sacrifices to save up so they can keep the Theatre.', 'The owner of a bank (Miss Bitterman) wants to own the Muppet Theatre so she can build a nightclub over it. After she tricks Pepe into giving her the only copy of the contract between her father and the Muppets, she changes it so the Muppets have very little time to pay a debt they owe. Meanwhile, the Muppets are trying to put on a Christmas show. After the Muppets are confronted by Bitterman, they make a lot of sacrifices to save up so they can keep the Theatre.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j5O65ITSvFGalNI2wRHHAPymO5R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13352'),
  ('338335854586594307', 'It''s a Woman''s War', 1971, 'Comedy', 'Ettore Maria Fizzarotti, Fausto Zuccoli, Adolfo Dragone', 'Luciano Ferri, Carlo Veo, Pasquale Curatola', 'Katia Christine, Gianni Nazzaro, Fiammetta Baralla, Giuliano Bonafede, Franco Rosi, Nino Taranto, Franco Franchi, Ciccio Ingrassia', null, 'A girl is drafted due to a misunderstanding and this gives her the occasion to check on her boy-friend, whom she believes to be a womanizer.', 'A girl is drafted due to a misunderstanding and this gives her the occasion to check on her boy-friend, whom she believes to be a womanizer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/785iCHZ8QVHoVdX3DbgEPrslv0X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:278914'),
  ('132863953924685052', 'It''s a Wonderful Binge', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Jordan VanDina, Kat Hess', 'Jordan VanDina', 'Eduardo Franco, Dexter Darden, Zainne Saleh, Kaitlin Olson, Marta Piekarz, Danny Trejo, Tony Cavalero, Nick Swardson', 'R', 'Like the original film, the sequel is set in a near future where all drinking and drugs are banned except for on one glorious day known as The Binge. This year, that day happens to miraculously land on Christmas.', 'Like the original film, the sequel is set in a near future where all drinking and drugs are banned except for on one glorious day known as The Binge. This year, that day happens to miraculously land on Christmas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hU9ouAPcg2LG7n85WUxjKwPq2y4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1026624'),
  ('230095127200383629', 'It''s a Wonderful Knife', 2023, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Tyler MacIntyre, Nicholas Piatnik, Jill Wilson', 'Michael Kennedy', 'Jane Widdop, Jess McLeod, Joel McHale, Katharine Isabelle, William B. Davis, Justin Long, Aiden Howard, Erin Boyes', 'R', 'Winnie''s life is less than wonderful one year after saving her town from a psychotic killer on Christmas Eve. When she wishes she was never born, she finds herself magically transported to a nightmarish parallel universe. With the murderous maniac now back, she must team up with a misfit to identify the culprit and get back to her own reality.', 'Winnie''s life is less than wonderful one year after saving her town from a psychotic killer on Christmas Eve. When she wishes she was never born, she finds herself magically transported to a nightmarish parallel universe. With the murderous maniac now back, she must team up with a misfit to identify the culprit and get back to her own reality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bnm5NntrQBcG3P7DbO00v2FmXm8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1113278'),
  ('944911897282263277', 'It''s a Wonderful Life', 1946, 'Drama, Family, Fantasy', 'Joseph F. Biroc, Joseph Walker, Frank Capra', 'Frances Goodrich, Frank Capra, Albert Hackett', 'James Stewart, Donna Reed, Lionel Barrymore, Thomas Mitchell, Henry Travers, Beulah Bondi, Frank Faylen, Ward Bond', 'PG', 'George Bailey has spent his entire life giving to the people of Bedford Falls. All that prevents rich skinflint Mr. Potter from taking over the entire town is George''s modest building and loan company. But on Christmas Eve the business''s $8,000 is lost and George''s troubles begin.', 'George Bailey has spent his entire life giving to the people of Bedford Falls. All that prevents rich skinflint Mr. Potter from taking over the entire town is George''s modest building and loan company. But on Christmas Eve the business''s $8,000 is lost and George''s troubles begin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bSqt9rhDZx1Q7UZ86dBPKdNomp2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1585'),
  ('590654569783386937', 'It''s a Wonderful Life', 1994, 'Comedy', 'Clifton Ko Chi-Sum, Sander Lee, Lee Kin-Keung', 'Raymond To Kwok-Wai', 'Leslie Cheung, Tony Leung Ka-fai, Teresa Mo Shun-Kwan, Anita Yuen Wing-Yee, Raymond Wong Pak-Ming, Petrina Fung Bo-Bo, Carol Cheng, Sean Lau Ching-wan', null, 'This 1994 Chinese New Year offering takes place over a period of time between one Christmas and Chinese New Year''s eve. We are introduced to thirteen "Big Rich" people, learn of their particular dispositions and dilemmas, are witness to the former either getting changed or developed and see the latter (re)solved. Teresa Mo as the daughter just returned from studying in France; Leslie Cheung as the friend who came in tow; Tony Leung Kar Fai as the cartoonist son who can only speak normally when he is anxious; Anita Yuen as the woman who Tony Leung''s character falls in love with; Carol "Do Do" Cheng as her flat-chested, disciplinary-cum-art teacher sister; Raymond Wong as the eldest son who cannot handle alcohol well; Petrina Fung Bo Bo as his estranged wife; Sean Lau as the marriage-minded cousin; and Kwan Tak Hing as the eccentric-but-definitely-not-senile grandfather.', 'This 1994 Chinese New Year offering takes place over a period of time between one Christmas and Chinese New Year''s eve. We are introduced to thirteen "Big Rich" people, learn of their particular dispositions and dilemmas, are witness to the former either getting changed or developed and see the latter (re)solved. Teresa Mo as the daughter just returned from studying in France; Leslie Cheung as the friend who came in tow; Tony Leung Kar Fai as the cartoonist son who can only speak normally when he is anxious; Anita Yuen as the woman who Tony Leung''s character falls in love with; Carol "Do Do" Cheng as her flat-chested, disciplinary-cum-art teacher sister; Raymond Wong as the eldest son who cannot handle alcohol well; Petrina Fung Bo Bo as his estranged wife; Sean Lau as the marriage-minded cousin; and Kwan Tak Hing as the eccentric-but-definitely-not-senile grandfather.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gfcBhy6eKknXLC3oVGXVfdChpAn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:318635'),
  ('492844849550578748', 'It''s a Wonderful World', 1939, 'Comedy, Romance, Crime, Mystery', 'W.S. Van Dyke, Oliver T. Marsh, Hugh Boswell', 'Ben Hecht', 'Claudette Colbert, James Stewart, Guy Kibbee, Nat Pendleton, Frances Drake, Edgar Kennedy, Ernest Truex, Richard Carle', 'NR', 'Detective Guy Johnson''s client, Willie Heywood, is framed for murder. While Guy hides him so he can catch the real killer, both of them are nabbed by the police, tried, convicted and sentenced to jail: Guy for a year with Willie to be executed. On the way to jail, Guy comes across a clue and escapes from the police.', 'Detective Guy Johnson''s client, Willie Heywood, is framed for murder. While Guy hides him so he can catch the real killer, both of them are nabbed by the police, tried, convicted and sentenced to jail: Guy for a year with Willie to be executed. On the way to jail, Guy comes across a clue and escapes from the police.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9hhZwERR4bOzkqK3kJ6UAnJ3fY7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47156'),
  ('684483420217861309', 'It''s Alive', 1969, 'Horror, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Larry Buchanan, Robert B. Alcott, Conrad Lee Reed', 'Larry Buchanan', 'Tommy Kirk, Shirley Bonne, Bill Thurman, Annabelle Weenick, Corveth Ousterhouse', null, 'A farmer traps three people in a cave with his pet prehistoric monster.', 'A farmer traps three people in a cave with his pet prehistoric monster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tXNFe9Ke2HNUAD6wB2PwYBLviCy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97298'),
  ('340426798268889638', 'It''s Alive', 1974, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Larry Cohen, Fenton Hamilton, Jeffrey L. Kimball', 'Larry Cohen', 'John P. Ryan, Sharon Farrell, Andrew Duggan, Guy Stockwell, James Dixon, Michael Ansara, Robert Emhardt, William Wellman Jr.', 'PG', 'The Davises are expecting a baby, which turns out to be a monster with a nasty habit of killing people whenever scared. And it''s easily scared.', 'The Davises are expecting a baby, which turns out to be a monster with a nasty habit of killing people whenever scared. And it''s easily scared.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jRxJV0N5nox3IVwkculuytkzSjt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28153'),
  ('23231531031649468', 'It''s Alive', 2009, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Josef Rusnak', 'James Portolese, Larry Cohen, Paul Sopocy', 'Bijou Phillips, James Murray, Raphaël Coleman, Owen Teale, Ty Glaser, Jack Ellis, Arkie Reece, Skye Bennett', 'R', 'When Lenore Harker learns that she''s pregnant, she leaves graduate school to set up a home with her boyfriend Frank in the country. The happy new family''s lives takes a gruesome turn when animals and people end up brutally dead – all with a mysterious connection to their newborn.', 'When Lenore Harker learns that she''s pregnant, she leaves graduate school to set up a home with her boyfriend Frank in the country. The happy new family''s lives takes a gruesome turn when animals and people end up brutally dead – all with a mysterious connection to their newborn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uDm89EnXGswts0v5l8TSoqAvyij.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23174'),
  ('204046907768972497', 'It''s Alive III: Island of the Alive', 1987, 'Horror', 'Larry Cohen, Daniel Pearl, Ira Halberstadt', 'Larry Cohen', 'Michael Moriarty, Karen Black, Laurene Landon, James Dixon, Gerrit Graham, Macdonald Carey, Neal Israel, Art Lund', 'R', 'The mutant babies have been placed by court order on a deserted island. Appalled by the cynicism and exploitation by the legal system and the media, the man responsible leads an expedition to the island to free them.', 'The mutant babies have been placed by court order on a deserted island. Appalled by the cynicism and exploitation by the legal system and the media, the man responsible leads an expedition to the island to free them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rmi6F3qtYnP0NdLiL0zkABtg1MY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49684'),
