  ('994482941912919925', 'It''s Impossible to Learn to Plow by Reading Books', 1988, 'Drama', 'Richard Linklater', 'Richard Linklater', 'Richard Linklater, James Goodwin, Dan Kratochvil, Linda Finney, Tracy Crabtree, Linda Levine, Lisa Schiebold, Erin McAfee', 'NR', 'A nameless young man travels the country by bus and train, visiting friends and making new ones, having banal conversations, and dedicating his existence to mundane activities.', 'A nameless young man travels the country by bus and train, visiting friends and making new ones, having banal conversations, and dedicating his existence to mundane activities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/npL7AhufNjyLHNuTS12Sl6ZQHNi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83346'),
