  ('1079601837124935035', 'It''s Never Over, Jeff Buckley', 2025, 'Documentary, Music', 'Amy J. Berg, Alex Takats, Curren Sheldon', null, 'Jeff Buckley, Mary Guibert, Ben Harper, Aimee Mann, Rebecca Moore, Joan Wasser, Mick Grondahl, Parker Kindred', 'NR', 'Rising musician Jeff Buckley had only released one album when he died suddenly in 1997. Now, never-before-seen footage, exclusive voice messages, and accounts from those closest to him offer a portrait of the captivating singer.', 'Rising musician Jeff Buckley had only released one album when he died suddenly in 1997. Now, never-before-seen footage, exclusive voice messages, and accounts from those closest to him offer a portrait of the captivating singer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rrKe8bC6UKFKvfZHvbwA9Bq5hkR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1400381'),
