  ('381035861727588545', 'It''s Nifty in the Navy', 1965, 'Family, Comedy', 'Finn Henriksen, Henning Bendtsen', 'Carl Ottosen', 'Dirch Passer, Ghita Nørby, Ove Sprogøe, Paul Hagen, Hans W. Petersen, Kai Holm, Jan Priiskorn Schmidt, Christine Broe', null, 'The three young fishermen, Svend, Knud, and Valdemar, have bought a new cutter, but haven''t paid it off yet. It is a real fishing film, but it is not JUST a fishing film. They have been granted deferments from the military several times, but suddenly the bell rings and they are called up as sailors in the Royal Danish Navy.', 'The three young fishermen, Svend, Knud, and Valdemar, have bought a new cutter, but haven''t paid it off yet. It is a real fishing film, but it is not JUST a fishing film. They have been granted deferments from the military several times, but suddenly the bell rings and they are called up as sailors in the Royal Danish Navy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aHGuqJZy7NM74vmm7Z9MMwlIpxS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40361'),
  ('625500718891205901', 'It''s Not a Cowboy Movie', 2012, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Benjamin Parent, Nicolas Loir, Guillaume Plumejeau', 'Joris Morio, Benjamin Parent', 'Malivaï Yakou, Finnegan Oldfield, Leïla Choukri, Garance Marillier, Damien Gomes', null, 'Last night, Brokeback Mountain aired on TV, Vincent watched it and found himself emotionally compelled by the story. Whilst chatting with a classmate in the school toilets, he takes advantage of the break to describe the film as only an adolescent can.', 'Last night, Brokeback Mountain aired on TV, Vincent watched it and found himself emotionally compelled by the story. Whilst chatting with a classmate in the school toilets, he takes advantage of the break to describe the film as only an adolescent can.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vmTKDQ1NxS5I7bAKn2HhFERPWYn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:162143'),
  ('460581454966465080', 'It''s Not Good for a Man to Be Alone', 1973, 'Horror, Drama', 'Pedro Olea', 'José Truchado, Pedro Olea, José Luis Garci', 'José Luis López Vázquez, Carmen Sevilla, Máximo Valverde, Eduardo Fajardo, José Franco, Helga Liné, Lolita Merino, Betsabé Ruiz', null, 'Martín is a tormented and solitary man who hides a shameful and unspeakable secret: he lives with a life-size doll which he treats as if it were his wife. This idyliic, loving existence will be gravely threatened when a prostitute, her daughter, and a pimp enter his life.', 'Martín is a tormented and solitary man who hides a shameful and unspeakable secret: he lives with a life-size doll which he treats as if it were his wife. This idyliic, loving existence will be gravely threatened when a prostitute, her daughter, and a pimp enter his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iVA7xHAWkdrTwjFF6xhi6lS87Io.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:257306'),
