  ('1104947382594496705', 'It''s Not Me, It''s Him', 1980, 'Comedy, Adventure', 'Pierre Richard, Claude Agostini', 'Alain Godard, Pierre Richard', 'Pierre Richard, Aldo Maccione, Valérie Mairesse, Danielle Minazzoli, Annette Poivre, Marie-Christine Deshayes, Gérard Hernandez, Franca Valeri', null, 'Pierre Renard is the blackboy of the writer George Vallier. At the time of a reception, the Italian actor Aldo Barazutti takes him for the writer and proposes to him to come to work with him in Tunisia with the development of a scenario. In fact Barazutti wants only to flee her wife to find her mistress Valerie. Misunderstandings when Vallier joined them. They must flee in the desert a jealous husband...', 'Pierre Renard is the blackboy of the writer George Vallier. At the time of a reception, the Italian actor Aldo Barazutti takes him for the writer and proposes to him to come to work with him in Tunisia with the development of a scenario. In fact Barazutti wants only to flee her wife to find her mistress Valerie. Misunderstandings when Vallier joined them. They must flee in the desert a jealous husband...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j7yaAiAo11kMUJRFpjw1V7utnmc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52877'),
  ('206164651135496517', 'It''s Not You, It''s Me', 2004, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Juan Taratuto, Marcelo Iaccarino', 'Cecilia Dopazo, Juan Taratuto', 'Diego Peretti, Soledad Villamil, Cecilia Dopazo, Marcos Mundstock, Alberto Suárez, Hernán Jiménez, Mariana Briski, Roly Serrano', null, 'Thirty-year-old Javier is a surgeon and in his free time works as a disc jockey. He decides to marry and move to the United States with his girlfriend María. They make all their plans; they wed, and then María is the first to move and make contacts in their new home, while Javier packs up in Argentina and prepares to start his new life in the States. While he is on the way to the airport, he receives a call from María telling him that she is confused and has been seeing someone else.', 'Thirty-year-old Javier is a surgeon and in his free time works as a disc jockey. He decides to marry and move to the United States with his girlfriend María. They make all their plans; they wed, and then María is the first to move and make contacts in their new home, while Javier packs up in Argentina and prepares to start his new life in the States. While he is on the way to the airport, he receives a call from María telling him that she is confused and has been seeing someone else.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9E0cpXrBagDb7uHnAG4eT9C2qLf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83266'),
  ('397747202791731351', 'It''s Not You, It''s Me', 2010, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Celiana Cárdenas, Nadia Ayala Tabachnik, Alejandro Springall', 'Alejandro Springall, Luis Aura', 'Eugenio Derbez, Alejandra Barros, Martina García, Juan Ríos, Juan Ramírez, Mariana Gajá, Blanca Sánchez, Aarón Hernán', 'R', 'Javier se ha casado con María, el amor de su vida, y ahora lo único que desea es estar feliz con ella el resto de su vida, pero el destino se la quita poco después de la boda. Ahora Javier está enredado en sus emociones: ¿cómo aceptará la muerte de su mujer para encontrar nuevamente el amor?', 'Javier se ha casado con María, el amor de su vida, y ahora lo único que desea es estar feliz con ella el resto de su vida, pero el destino se la quita poco después de la boda. Ahora Javier está enredado en sus emociones: ¿cómo aceptará la muerte de su mujer para encontrar nuevamente el amor?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bE1ifeGhr7gkJP9z8lAFGkEhlv6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64694'),
