  ('957626686227627875', 'It''s OK', 2026, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Yang Lina', 'Xiaoying You', 'Wen Qi, Qin Hailu, White-K, Li Xueqin, Niu Li, Liu Jia, Chuai Ni, Wang He', null, 'Daughter Xu Ke wants to have surgery to remove the polyp from her uterus during the vacation, while her mother Hu Chunrong also plans to run away from home to escape the long-standing problems in her marriage. As the two, who both love and hurt each other, resolve to face their respective predicaments, they unexpectedly find forgiveness for each other’s fragility and imperfection in a sudden, unforeseen moment.', 'Daughter Xu Ke wants to have surgery to remove the polyp from her uterus during the vacation, while her mother Hu Chunrong also plans to run away from home to escape the long-standing problems in her marriage. As the two, who both love and hurt each other, resolve to face their respective predicaments, they unexpectedly find forgiveness for each other’s fragility and imperfection in a sudden, unforeseen moment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y59gJxZWdiUzVcusxEH8mLKkZZw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1546855'),
  ('311982013446142655', 'It’s Okay!', 2025, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Kim Hye-young, Lee Seok-min, Jang Deok-jae', 'Kim Hye-young', 'Lee Re, Jin Seo-yeon, Chung Su-bin, Lee Jung-ha, Son Suk-ku, Kim Hae-sook, Shim Yi Young, Jang Yi-jung', null, 'In-young, a high school student who is alone due to her parents'' sudden death, is forced out because of her overdue rent and stays hidden in the Korean Dance Art Troupe where she belongs. In-young, who is still living bravely and brightly despite the sad situation, is caught by the director of the art troupe who is known for being rough, and the director who could not put In-young in the art troupe eventually begins to live with her.', 'In-young, a high school student who is alone due to her parents'' sudden death, is forced out because of her overdue rent and stays hidden in the Korean Dance Art Troupe where she belongs. In-young, who is still living bravely and brightly despite the sad situation, is caught by the director of the art troupe who is known for being rough, and the director who could not put In-young in the art troupe eventually begins to live with her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dmgJPkwSQOzNWVaM2grAqQvP1AY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1174188'),
  ('191236452873605862', 'It''s Only Money', 1962, 'Comedy, Mystery', 'Frank Tashlin, Ralph Axness, W. Wallace Kelley', 'John Fenton Murray', 'Jerry Lewis, Joan O''Brien, Zachary Scott, Jack Weston, Jesse White, Mae Questel, Pat Dahl, Barbara Pepper', 'NR', 'Lester is a clumsy and awkward TV repair man who is nevertheless gifted technically. In helping out a friend, he is drawn into a mystery involving a missing heir in a rich family. He begins to notice little things, like how much those family portraits look like him. Surely..no..he can''t be...can he ?', 'Lester is a clumsy and awkward TV repair man who is nevertheless gifted technically. In helping out a friend, he is drawn into a mystery involving a missing heir in a rich family. He begins to notice little things, like how much those family portraits look like him. Surely..no..he can''t be...can he ?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3sozdkPAA3ZeLBi8HQfq1ZIeaoJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41028'),
  ('996154364453501213', 'It''s Only Talk', 2006, 'Drama', 'Ryuichi Hiroki, Kazuhiro Suzuki', 'Haruhiko Arai', 'Shinobu Terajima, Etsushi Toyokawa, Shunsuke Matsuoka, Tomorowo Taguchi, Satoshi Tsumabuki, Nao Omori, Akira Emoto, Kinuo Yamada', null, 'Based on an award winning novel, It''s Only Talk is about the life of Yuko, a 35-year old woman. She is single and unemployed, and suffers from manic depression. The movie begins with Yuko moving to Kamata Town.', 'Based on an award winning novel, It''s Only Talk is about the life of Yuko, a 35-year old woman. She is single and unemployed, and suffers from manic depression. The movie begins with Yuko moving to Kamata Town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fn5YybPmo37qpiuWWjPf7IfxXkO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19497'),
  ('214864255031039388', 'It''s Only the End of the World', 2016, 'Drama', 'Xavier Dolan, André Turpin, Sinan Saber', 'Xavier Dolan', 'Gaspard Ulliel, Nathalie Baye, Vincent Cassel, Marion Cotillard, Léa Seydoux, Antoine Desrochers, William Boyce Blanchette, Sasha Samar', 'NR', 'Louis, a terminally ill writer, returns home after a long absence to tell his family that he is dying.', 'Louis, a terminally ill writer, returns home after a long absence to tell his family that he is dying.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/riWa3WZrO3n8lLWuaEVMgaqAZGn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:338189'),
  ('579037774819621151', 'It''s Pat', 1994, 'Comedy', 'Adam Bernstein, Jeffrey Jur, David J. Frederick', 'Jim Emerson, Julia Sweeney, Stephen Hibbert', 'Julia Sweeney, Dave Foley, Charles Rocket, Kathy Griffin, Julie Hayden, Timothy Stack, Mary Scheer, Beverly Leech', 'PG-13', 'Pat Riley, an obnoxious busybody of indeterminable sex, meets and falls in love with Chris, a sensitive, caring person also of indeterminable sex. Their relationship suffers because Pat''s a lout, and cannot decide on a direction for their life. Meanwhile, Pat''s neighbor Kyle falls further and further into obsession with Pat, fascinated by their indeterminate sexuality.', 'Pat Riley, an obnoxious busybody of indeterminable sex, meets and falls in love with Chris, a sensitive, caring person also of indeterminable sex. Their relationship suffers because Pat''s a lout, and cannot decide on a direction for their life. Meanwhile, Pat''s neighbor Kyle falls further and further into obsession with Pat, fascinated by their indeterminate sexuality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tydslMVgc6DpEvwYT0MWW9byL1a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33783'),
  ('345453916044557717', 'It''s Spring Training, Charlie Brown!', 1996, 'Family, Animation, TV Movie, Comedy', 'Nick Vasu, Sam Jaimes', 'Charles M. Schulz', 'Justin Shenkarow, Marnette Patterson, John Christian Graas, Gregory Grudt, Travis Boles, Elisabeth Moss, Michael Sandler, Noley Thornton', null, 'As springtime rolls around, Charlie Brown''s team is performing the usual hopeless task of getting in shape for the new season. To improve the team''s morale, Charlie Brown manages to find a potential team sponsor who agrees to provide uniforms, provided that the team wins the first game of the season. However, considering the usual competence of the team, including new members like Leland who is too young to even tie his shoes, the challenge seems impossible.', 'As springtime rolls around, Charlie Brown''s team is performing the usual hopeless task of getting in shape for the new season. To improve the team''s morale, Charlie Brown manages to find a potential team sponsor who agrees to provide uniforms, provided that the team wins the first game of the season. However, considering the usual competence of the team, including new members like Leland who is too young to even tie his shoes, the challenge seems impossible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lK8ROtVrpewUIqcf0AHU4JRF5gT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54920'),
  ('709915191472130696', 'It''s Such a Beautiful Day', 2011, 'Animation, Drama, Comedy', 'Don Hertzfeldt, Don Hertzfeldt', 'Don Hertzfeldt', 'Don Hertzfeldt, Sara Cushman', null, 'Dark and troubling events force Bill to reckon with the meaning of his life.', 'Dark and troubling events force Bill to reckon with the meaning of his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gZIBj1iJAbz5d0pi01FZ4HJLAAq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86517'),
  ('1140079995030068468', 'It''s the Easter Beagle, Charlie Brown', 1974, 'Family, Animation, TV Movie, Comedy', 'Phil Roman', 'Charles M. Schulz', 'Todd Barbee, Melanie Kohn, Stephen Shea, Linda Ercoli, Lynn Mortensen, Jimmy Ahrens, Bill Melendez', 'G', 'Charlie Brown, Linus and the entire Peanuts gang are off on a lively Easter egg hunt. They suspect they''ve spotted the Easter Bunny … but the trouble is, he looks a lot like a certain beagle who''s near and dear to Charlie Brown''s heart. Is it truly the Easter Bunny, or is it just the irrepressible Snoopy playing a trick on the kids?', 'Charlie Brown, Linus and the entire Peanuts gang are off on a lively Easter egg hunt. They suspect they''ve spotted the Easter Bunny … but the trouble is, he looks a lot like a certain beagle who''s near and dear to Charlie Brown''s heart. Is it truly the Easter Bunny, or is it just the irrepressible Snoopy playing a trick on the kids?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lzDobxxKOw2XiHmNxhqnozHhoDb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28550'),
  ('598419842530980814', 'It''s the Girl in the Red Truck, Charlie Brown', 1988, 'Animation, Family', 'Charles L. Barbee, Walter C. Miller, Jerry Ballew', 'Charles M. Schulz, Monte Schulz', 'Jill Schulz, Bill Melendez, Greg Deason, Molly Boice, Jason Riffle, Steve Stoliar', null, 'Spike waves to a young woman driving a red pickup truck through the desert of Needles, California every day; it is the highlight of his day. In this combined animated and live-action special, we meet an aerobics instructor, Jenny, who wants to be a big city jazz dancer. She and Spike drive around looking at the desert scenery and spending some time at a roller rink. However, when Spike is accidentally thrown out of the skating rink he runs off and is pursued by people on a nighttime coyote hunt.', 'Spike waves to a young woman driving a red pickup truck through the desert of Needles, California every day; it is the highlight of his day. In this combined animated and live-action special, we meet an aerobics instructor, Jenny, who wants to be a big city jazz dancer. She and Spike drive around looking at the desert scenery and spending some time at a roller rink. However, when Spike is accidentally thrown out of the skating rink he runs off and is pursued by people on a nighttime coyote hunt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/udND5RuDsTRs3f9SIabOp8bnBY1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:215503'),
  ('174832421308455989', 'It''s the Great Pumpkin, Charlie Brown', 1966, 'Family, Animation, TV Movie, Comedy', 'Bill Melendez', 'Charles M. Schulz', 'Peter Robbins, Christopher Shea, Sally Dryer, Bill Melendez, Cathy Steinberg, Gail DeFaria, Glenn Mendelson, Ann Altieri', 'G', 'Join the Peanuts gang for a timeless adventure as Charlie Brown preps for a party, Snoopy sets his sights on the Red Baron, and Linus patiently awaits a pumpkin patch miracle.', 'Join the Peanuts gang for a timeless adventure as Charlie Brown preps for a party, Snoopy sets his sights on the Red Baron, and Linus patiently awaits a pumpkin patch miracle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/59wp9OWexYsxlSPHYmVLsl5xlFt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13353'),
  ('468898922435344277', 'It’s the Law', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Gianni Costantino, Ferran Paredes, Christian Bonatesta', 'Salvatore Ficarra, Valentino Picone, Nicola Guaglianone', 'Salvatore Ficarra, Valentino Picone, Vincenzo Amato, Tony Sperandeo, Leo Gullotta, Sergio Friscia, Antonio Catania, Gaetano Bruno', null, 'A small Sicilian town elects a new, honest major but quickly learns that playing by the rules is not as easy as it seems.', 'A small Sicilian town elects a new, honest major but quickly learns that playing by the rules is not as easy as it seems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wiYW7gBAF70aGiuYkfH928vfmng.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:435921'),
  ('851510789896743723', 'It''s the Old Army Game', 1926, 'Comedy', 'A. Edward Sutherland, Alvin Wyckoff', 'Thomas J. Geraghty, J. Clarkson Miller, Ralph Spence', 'W.C. Fields, Louise Brooks, Blanche Ring, William Gaxton, Mary Foy, Mickey Bennett, Josephine Dunn, Jack Luden', 'NR', 'Druggist Elmer Prettywillie is sleeping. A woman rings the night bell only to buy a two-cent stamp. Then garbage collectors waken him. Next it''s firemen on a false alarm. And then a real fire.', 'Druggist Elmer Prettywillie is sleeping. A woman rings the night bell only to buy a two-cent stamp. Then garbage collectors waken him. Next it''s firemen on a false alarm. And then a real fire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9J75u84HLuY2a3swLLNzMtrmjz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:189531'),
  ('420993943822678543', 'It''s the Pied Piper, Charlie Brown', 2000, 'Comedy, Family, Adventure, Animation, TV Movie', 'Bill Melendez', 'Charles M. Schulz, Robert Browning', 'Quinn Beswick, Ashley Edner, Rachel Davey, Frank Welker, Neil Ross, Pat Musick, Joan Van Ark, Bill Melendez', null, 'Based on the legend of the Pied Piper, it stars Snoopy as the title character, who tries to rid the Peanuts'' gang''s hometown of mice by playing his concertina, in return for a year''s supply of dog food.', 'Based on the legend of the Pied Piper, it stars Snoopy as the title character, who tries to rid the Peanuts'' gang''s hometown of mice by playing his concertina, in return for a year''s supply of dog food.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2e3PL7aNjHryfaDtWueRSQDnfqu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35020'),
  ('127411960523459490', 'It''s Tough for Everybody', 1975, 'Comedy', 'Christian Gion', 'Jean-Louis Richard, Christian Gion', 'Bernard Blier, Francis Perrin, Claude Piéplu, Robert Castel, Bernard Le Coq, Hubert Deschamps, Caroline Cartier, Nicole Rouge', null, 'After losing his job, an idealistic adman starts his own agency, putting himself in the crosshairs of his jaded ex-boss.', 'After losing his job, an idealistic adman starts his own agency, putting himself in the crosshairs of his jaded ex-boss.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/95lnW8MHoprGwvEQVBhayKXzX2X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:152499'),
  ('839151633804219287', 'It''s Tough to Be a Bird', 1969, 'Documentary, Animation', 'Ward Kimball', 'Ward Kimball, Ted Berman', 'Ruth Buzzi, Ricahrd Bakalyan, Paul Frees, Ward Kimball, John Emerson, Jim Swain, Ann Lord, Hank Schloss', 'G', 'Part cartoon and part documentary, this film offers a humorous look at birds and the ways people perceive them.', 'Part cartoon and part documentary, this film offers a humorous look at birds and the ways people perceive them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2GIYxLd28lFJRCvIOukV2wqYwxw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58143'),
  ('199703035465666320', 'It''s Trad, Dad!', 1962, 'Comedy, Music', 'Richard Lester, Gilbert Taylor', 'Milton Subotsky', 'Helen Shapiro, Craig Douglas, John Leyton, Chubby Checker, Del Shannon, Gary U.S. Bonds, Felix Felton, Arthur Mullard', null, 'The hero and heroine want to popularize trad jazz in their town. Some older people feel displeased about trad jazz, and prevent their trying. The hero and heroine go to a London television studio to ask trad jazz musicians to perform in concert.', 'The hero and heroine want to popularize trad jazz in their town. Some older people feel displeased about trad jazz, and prevent their trying. The hero and heroine go to a London television studio to ask trad jazz musicians to perform in concert.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zrLfWK7VfiNLOui8q1Y2OVtL7Q9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92713'),
  ('4655267526257387', 'It''s What''s Inside', 2024, 'Comedy, Mystery, Science Fiction', 'Greg Jardin, Ryan Spindell, Rachel Brock', 'Greg Jardin', 'James Morosini, Brittany O''Grady, David Thompson, Alycia Debnam-Carey, Gavin Leatherwood, Nina Bloomgarden, Reina Hardesty, Devon Terrell', 'R', 'A pre-wedding reunion descends into a psychological nightmare for a group of college friends when a surprise guest arrives with a mysterious suitcase.', 'A pre-wedding reunion descends into a psychological nightmare for a group of college friends when a surprise guest arrives with a mysterious suitcase.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6jzwaLoDurD6Jn2ILb42nFcn3xq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1052280'),
  ('1075886533772147514', 'It''s Your First Kiss, Charlie Brown', 1977, 'Family, Animation, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Phil Roman', 'Charles M. Schulz', 'Arrin Skelley, Daniel Anderson, Michelle Muller, Bill Melendez, Laura Planting, Ronald Hendrix, Hilary Powers', 'G', 'At the school homecoming, Charlie Brown learns that he is be the escort at the banquet for the red headed girl that he has pined for all his life. With that added pressure, he hopes to put in a good showing at the football where he is placekicker. Unfortunately, Lucy is supposed to hold the ball for him.. It''s homecoming night, and Charlie Brown is not only the escort for the homecoming queen (which happens to be the red-haired girl he''s been drooling over for goodness knows how long), he is also the kicker for the school''s football team (and Lucy''s the holder. Need I say more?) Despite a certain person''s old habit that won''t die young, Charlie brown is blamed for their team''s loss, but he ends up becoming the life of the homecoming dance. However, we never see it, and Charlie Brown doesn''t remember it, which brings the question; did it really happen?', 'At the school homecoming, Charlie Brown learns that he is be the escort at the banquet for the red headed girl that he has pined for all his life. With that added pressure, he hopes to put in a good showing at the football where he is placekicker. Unfortunately, Lucy is supposed to hold the ball for him.. It''s homecoming night, and Charlie Brown is not only the escort for the homecoming queen (which happens to be the red-haired girl he''s been drooling over for goodness knows how long), he is also the kicker for the school''s football team (and Lucy''s the holder. Need I say more?) Despite a certain person''s old habit that won''t die young, Charlie brown is blamed for their team''s loss, but he ends up becoming the life of the homecoming dance. However, we never see it, and Charlie Brown doesn''t remember it, which brings the question; did it really happen?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/25gxjItxw9uoCJ65zTeDU1oH6rQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40484'),
  ('516668221631881588', 'It’s Your Turn, Honey!', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Sven Unterwaldt Jr., Stephan Schuh', 'Matthieu Delaporte, Alexandre de La Patellière, Claudius Pläging', 'Carolin Kebekus, Axel Stein, Jasmin Schwiers, Thomas Heinze, Maxim Mehmet, Arina Prokofyeva, Arsseni Bultmann, Ludger Pistor', null, 'Toni and Marc want to divorce, because the great passion seems to be extinguished after 15 years of marriage. It should be a consensual separation, but the new beginning is not so easy: Both have just the chance of a job abroad.', 'Toni and Marc want to divorce, because the great passion seems to be extinguished after 15 years of marriage. It should be a consensual separation, but the new beginning is not so easy: Both have just the chance of a job abroad.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fiW45Fxqu8DMeq8RxA40JKegK12.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:422735'),
  ('558298268294851323', 'Italia 1982, una storia azzurra', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Coralla Ciccolini', 'Coralla Ciccolini, Andrea Felici, Claudio Moretti', 'Marco Tardelli, Bruno Conti, Claudio Gentile, Fulvio Collovati, Dino Zoff, Giancarlo Antognoni, Franco Selvaggi, Beppe Dossena', null, 'Through interviews with key figures and previously unseen period images, the story of the 1982 World Cup and the Italian national team, seen also from a private perspective, is contrasted with that of a country led by President Sandro Pertini.', 'Through interviews with key figures and previously unseen period images, the story of the 1982 World Cup and the Italian national team, seen also from a private perspective, is contrasted with that of a country led by President Sandro Pertini.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lITIHDpOa60xjK3NVXMBaP8P8h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:992117'),
