  ('416422285608421597', 'Ito', 2021, 'Drama', 'Takashi Matsuo, Satoko Yokohama, Katsumi Yanagijima', 'Satoko Yokohama', 'Ren Komai, Etsushi Toyokawa, Mei Kurokawa, Mayuu Yokota, Ayumu Nakajima, Daimaou Kosaka, Jonagold, Shohei Uno', null, 'A shy country girl chooses a part-time job at a maid cafe where she serves customers while dressed up as a maid.', 'A shy country girl chooses a part-time job at a maid cafe where she serves customers while dressed up as a maid.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/issbGbpkKI3sVU4mfjUvgsX0p77.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:796258'),
  ('142106788537167856', 'Itsy Bitsy', 2019, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Micah Gallo, Marcos Durian, Cosmos Kiindarius', 'Jason Alvino, Bryan Dick, Micah Gallo', 'Bruce Davison, Denise Crosby, Elizabeth Roberts, Arman Darbo, Chloe Perrin, Treva Etienne, Eileen Dietz, Matthew Cardarople', null, 'A family moves into a secluded mansion where they soon find themselves being targeted by an entity taking the form of a giant spider.', 'A family moves into a secluded mansion where they soon find themselves being targeted by an entity taking the form of a giant spider.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8PS6uPVN2lFwVeNrEnC3j7sv8ed.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:513208'),
  ('114245920417875869', 'Ittefaq', 1969, 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Yash Chopra, Salil Chowdhury, K.G. Koregaonkar', 'G.R. Kamath', 'Rajesh Khanna, Nanda, Iftekhar, Gajanan Jagirdar, Sujit Kumar, Bindu Desai, Madan Puri, Jagdish Raj', null, 'Taking place almost entirely over the course of one stormy night, a woman is terrified when an accused murderer escapes from a mental hospital and seeks refuge in her home.', 'Taking place almost entirely over the course of one stormy night, a woman is terrified when an accused murderer escapes from a mental hospital and seeks refuge in her home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oBDwBk0Hxp3LXvLLTPRfp2mtXkH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:166874'),
  ('665042800341784814', 'Ittefaq', 2017, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Abhay Chopra, Michał Łuka', 'Abhay Chopra, Shreyas Jain', 'Sidharth Malhotra, Sonakshi Sinha, Akshaye Khanna, Pavail Gulati, Mandira Bedi, Mir Sarwar, Himanshu Kohli, Ajay Jadhav', null, 'Police officer Dev investigates a double murder case that has only two witnesses - an acclaimed writer Vikram and a young homemaker Maya, who also happen to be the prime suspects in the case. He finds himself being torn between their own version''s of what happened on the fateful night, and takes it upon himself to figure out the real story and capture the real murderer.', 'Police officer Dev investigates a double murder case that has only two witnesses - an acclaimed writer Vikram and a young homemaker Maya, who also happen to be the prime suspects in the case. He finds himself being torn between their own version''s of what happened on the fateful night, and takes it upon himself to figure out the real story and capture the real murderer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nwLVjxsBpTF6sDs1BJrx5OzJuAA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:464458'),
  ('747296980405197217', 'Itty Bitty Titty Committee', 2007, 'Comedy', 'Christine A. Maier, Jamie Babbit, Clarissa Thieme', 'Tina Mabry, Abigail Shafran', 'Melonie Díaz, Nicole Vicius, Daniel Sea, Deak Evgenikos, Lauren Mollica, Guinevere Turner, Carly Pope, Melanie Mayron', 'NR', 'High School grad and all American gal, Anna, finds her purpose and herself after she hooks up with the radical feminists in The Itty Bitty Titty Committee.', 'High School grad and all American gal, Anna, finds her purpose and herself after she hooks up with the radical feminists in The Itty Bitty Titty Committee.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xWJMF9xb4OfWRU7QcOxOosgIElE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10520'),
  ('2741535175555813', 'Ivalu', 2023, 'Drama', 'Anders Walter, Pipaluk K. Jørgensen, Rasmus Heise', 'Anders Walter, Morten Dürr', 'Mila Heilmann Kreutzmann, Nivi Larsen, Angunnguaq Larsen', null, 'Ivalu is gone. Her little sister is desperate to find her and her father does not care. The vast Greenlandic nature holds secrets. Where is Ivalu?', 'Ivalu is gone. Her little sister is desperate to find her and her father does not care. The vast Greenlandic nature holds secrets. Where is Ivalu?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8xCrLSfayOEEK2uMyDN191pqURg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1042171'),
  ('1011055526986095062', 'Ivan', 1932, 'Drama', 'Oleksandr Dovzhenko, Danylo Demutsky, Yuri Yekelchik', null, 'Konstantin Bondarevsky, Dmytro Holubynskyi, Elena Golik, Mikhail Gornatko, Aleksandr Zapolski, Petro Masokha, Mykola Nademskyi, Terentiy Yura', null, 'A young farmer Ivan and his lazy father Stepan try to help with the construction of the Dniprohes, but he learns that strength is not enough for a worker and joins the Communist party.', 'A young farmer Ivan and his lazy father Stepan try to help with the construction of the Dniprohes, but he learns that strength is not enough for a worker and joins the Communist party.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vejDwXEQqFgOeR4Tpug0kFRqJTe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:156354'),
  ('128320900547068597', 'Ivan & Abraham', 1993, 'Drama', 'Jean-Marc Fabre, Yolande Zauberman', 'Yolande Zauberman', 'Vladimir Mashkov, Mariya Lipkina, Aleksandr Kalyagin, Rolan Bykov, Zinoviy Gerdt, Daniel Olbrychski, Oleg Yankovskiy, Aleksey Serebryakov', null, 'In 1930s Poland Christian boy Ivan goes to live with a Jewish family to learn a trade. He becomes friends with Abraham, the son of the family. However, anti-Semitism is rife in their environment, and they flee to escape an upcoming conflict. Journeying together, they demonstrate their inseparability.', 'In 1930s Poland Christian boy Ivan goes to live with a Jewish family to learn a trade. He becomes friends with Abraham, the son of the family. However, anti-Semitism is rife in their environment, and they flee to escape an upcoming conflict. Journeying together, they demonstrate their inseparability.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/22H9DyONTpf8dXLVNszcOnXNUIr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:194147'),
  ('1044334267886135632', 'Ivan the Terrible, Part I', 1944, 'Drama, History', 'Sergei Eisenstein, Andrey Moskvin, Eduard Tisse', 'Sergei Eisenstein', 'Nikolai Cherkasov, Lyudmila Tselikovskaya, Serafima Birman, Mikhail Nazvanov, Mikhail Zharov, Amvrosii Buchma, Mikhail Kuznetsov, Pavel Kadochnikov', 'NR', 'Set during the early part of his reign, Ivan faces betrayal from the aristocracy and even his closest friends as he seeks to unite the Russian people. Sergei Eisenstein''s final film, this is the first part of a three-part biopic of Tsar Ivan IV of Russia, which was never completed due to the producer''s dissatisfaction with Eisenstein''s attempts to use forbidden experimental filming techniques and excessive cost overruns. The second part was completed but not released for a decade after Eisenstein''s death and a change of heart in the USSR government toward his work; the third part was only in its earliest stage of filming when shooting was stopped altogether.', 'Set during the early part of his reign, Ivan faces betrayal from the aristocracy and even his closest friends as he seeks to unite the Russian people. Sergei Eisenstein''s final film, this is the first part of a three-part biopic of Tsar Ivan IV of Russia, which was never completed due to the producer''s dissatisfaction with Eisenstein''s attempts to use forbidden experimental filming techniques and excessive cost overruns. The second part was completed but not released for a decade after Eisenstein''s death and a change of heart in the USSR government toward his work; the third part was only in its earliest stage of filming when shooting was stopped altogether.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rzFWfdq6CXLCnlfXTTZs9W9dMR2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9797'),
  ('318045554442563140', 'Ivan the Terrible, Part II: The Boyars'' Plot', 1958, 'History, Drama', 'Sergei Eisenstein, Eduard Tisse, Andrey Moskvin', 'Sergei Eisenstein', 'Nikolai Cherkasov, Serafima Birman, Pavel Kadochnikov, Mikhail Zharov, Amvrosii Buchma, Vsevolod Pudovkin, Mikhail Kuznetsov, Alexander Mgebrov', 'NR', 'This is the second part of a projected three-part epic biopic of Russian Czar Ivan Grozny, undertaken by Soviet film-maker Sergei Eisenstein at the behest of Josef Stalin. Production of the epic was stopped before the third part could be filmed, due to producer dissatisfaction with Eisenstein''s introducing forbidden experimental filming techniques into the material, more evident in this part than the first part. As it was, this second part was banned from showings until after the deaths of both Eisenstein and Stalin, and a change of attitude by the subsequent heads of the Soviet government. In this part, as Ivan the Terrible attempts to consolidate his power by establishing a personal army, his political rivals, the Russian boyars, plot to assassinate him.', 'This is the second part of a projected three-part epic biopic of Russian Czar Ivan Grozny, undertaken by Soviet film-maker Sergei Eisenstein at the behest of Josef Stalin. Production of the epic was stopped before the third part could be filmed, due to producer dissatisfaction with Eisenstein''s introducing forbidden experimental filming techniques into the material, more evident in this part than the first part. As it was, this second part was banned from showings until after the deaths of both Eisenstein and Stalin, and a change of attitude by the subsequent heads of the Soviet government. In this part, as Ivan the Terrible attempts to consolidate his power by establishing a personal army, his political rivals, the Russian boyars, plot to assassinate him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9VufNqHN0EIkZAsJIv5vDYIitPo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43118'),
  ('471496169422294461', 'Ivan Tsarevich & the Grey Wolf', 2011, 'Animation, Family', 'Vladimir Toropchin', 'Rostislav Khait, Sergey Petreykov, Aleksandr Boyarsky', 'Nikita Efremov, Artur Smolyaninov, Ivan Okhlobystin, Viktor Sukhorukov, Liya Akhedzhakova, Kristina Asmus, Mikhail Boyarskiy, Sergey Garmash', null, 'With a cheeky wolf as a travel companion, a prince from a faraway kingdom embarks on a quest to win a princess''s heart.', 'With a cheeky wolf as a travel companion, a prince from a faraway kingdom embarks on a quest to win a princess''s heart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h4TKV0PTnQNOPPhvPfkiLYcjk6F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83865'),
  ('243957306310131675', 'Ivan Tsarevitch and the Changing Princess', 2016, 'Romance, Animation, Comedy, Family, Fantasy', 'Michel Ocelot', 'Michel Ocelot', 'Olivia Brunaux, Isabelle Guiard, Marine Griset, Julien Béramis, Yves Barsacq, Asil Raïs, Olivier Claverie, Michel Elias', null, 'Four tales about princesses and adventurers around the world: The Mistress of Monsters, The Wizard Student, The Ship''s Boy and His Cat, and Ivan Tsarevitch and his changeable princess.', 'Four tales about princesses and adventurers around the world: The Mistress of Monsters, The Wizard Student, The Ship''s Boy and His Cat, and Ivan Tsarevitch and his changeable princess.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AfSbVYWfj8UQZDoHEpmGWrd2p5j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:419981'),
  ('278998780627912909', 'Ivan Vasilyevich Changes Everything', 2023, 'Comedy, Science Fiction, Adventure, TV Movie', 'Roman Kim, Mikhail Semichev, Evgeniy Mlukov', 'Andrey Shelkov, Maksim Tkachenko', 'Timur Batrutdinov, Demis Karabidis, Maksim Lagashkin, Marina Kravets, Pavel Derevyanko, Olga Buzova, Garik Martirosyan, Olga Kartunkova', null, 'Shurik is trying to bring Tsar Ivan the Terrible home with the help of a time machine. But the VPN on which the miracle machine runs constantly breaks down and moves the would-be inventor and the tsar to different countries and times.', 'Shurik is trying to bring Tsar Ivan the Terrible home with the help of a time machine. But the VPN on which the miracle machine runs constantly breaks down and moves the would-be inventor and the tsar to different countries and times.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/juGUSPm98PuNhWEttXjw7USt7Co.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1223845'),
  ('811233557085865558', 'Ivanhoe', 1952, 'Adventure, Romance, History', 'Richard Thorpe, Freddie Young', 'Noel Langley, Marguerite Roberts', 'Robert Taylor, Elizabeth Taylor, Joan Fontaine, George Sanders, Emlyn Williams, Robert Douglas, Finlay Currie, Felix Aylmer', 'NR', 'Sir Walter Scott''s classic story of the chivalrous Ivanhoe who joins with Robin of Locksley in the fight against Prince John and for the return of King Richard the Lionheart.', 'Sir Walter Scott''s classic story of the chivalrous Ivanhoe who joins with Robin of Locksley in the fight against Prince John and for the return of King Richard the Lionheart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bH2cat7MemIGLevYqCUrXkBCDiC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26175'),
  ('307640959194766719', 'Ivanhoe', 1982, 'History, Adventure, TV Movie', 'Douglas Camfield, David Tomblin, John Coquillon', 'Walter Scott, John Gay', 'Anthony Andrews, James Mason, Sam Neill, Michael Hordern, Julian Glover, Ronald Pickup, David Robb, Stuart Wilson', 'NR', 'Ivanhoe, a worthy and noble knight, the champion of justice returns to England after the holy wars, and finds England under the reign of Prince John and his henchmen and finds himself being involved in the power-struggle for the throne of England.', 'Ivanhoe, a worthy and noble knight, the champion of justice returns to England after the holy wars, and finds England under the reign of Prince John and his henchmen and finds himself being involved in the power-struggle for the throne of England.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rxlRUnpg8bFF1r2kBfB3w2rUAH4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39382'),
  ('59098989690402876', 'Ivanna', 2022, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Patrick Tashadian, Sanjay Mulani, Kimo Stamboel', 'Lele Laila', 'Caitlin Halderman, Taskya Namya, Junior Roberts, Shandy William, Tanta Ginting, Jovarel Callum, Sonia Alyssa, Yayu Unru', null, 'Ambar & Dika have just begun with a new chapter of life when years-old grudge of a malicious entity unfolds before their eyes. With a gift she unwillingly has, Ambar is now forced to finish the vengeance of the entity, a headless Dutch spirit, Ivanna.', 'Ambar & Dika have just begun with a new chapter of life when years-old grudge of a malicious entity unfolds before their eyes. With a gift she unwillingly has, Ambar is now forced to finish the vengeance of the entity, a headless Dutch spirit, Ivanna.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dEk0kC7uq54g7cVheQBgiAcCuNH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:786535'),
  ('996721245719114648', 'ivans xtc.', 2000, 'Drama', 'Bernard Rose, Bernard Rose, Ron Forsythe', 'Bernard Rose, Lisa Enos', 'Danny Huston, Peter Weller, Lisa Enos, Joanne Duckman, Angela Featherstone, Caroleen Feeney, Valeria Golino, Adam Krentzman', 'R', 'Ivan Beckman, Hollywood''s most sought-after talent agent, the darling and crown prince of La La Land, is dead. How and why did it happen? Was it drugs, murder, or perhaps something altogether more mundane? We begin with an ending and then catapult back a number of days to the apex of Ivan''s brilliant career as he bags international megastar Don West onto his company''s books. We then follow Ivan through the highs, lows, and extreme excesses of his final days.', 'Ivan Beckman, Hollywood''s most sought-after talent agent, the darling and crown prince of La La Land, is dead. How and why did it happen? Was it drugs, murder, or perhaps something altogether more mundane? We begin with an ending and then catapult back a number of days to the apex of Ivan''s brilliant career as he bags international megastar Don West onto his company''s books. We then follow Ivan through the highs, lows, and extreme excesses of his final days.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xKaxXiyUAOEQpfxWY3oLNZJbovL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33994'),
  ('1132279809640759886', 'Ivashka from the Palace of Pioneers', 1981, 'Animation', 'Gennadiy Sokolskiy, Mikhail Druyan, Vladimir Kutuzov', 'Eduard Uspensky, Gennadiy Sokolskiy', 'Efim Katsirov, Svetlana Kharlap, Garri Bardin', null, 'Animation film about boy Ivashka''s adventures in the country of fairy tales.', 'Animation film about boy Ivashka''s adventures in the country of fairy tales.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pwGCzyCh4Xpsbgrcy9ReKntwbN9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:246592'),
  ('47396085308695777', 'Iverson', 2014, 'Documentary', 'Zatella Beatty', null, 'Allen Iverson, Tom Brokaw, Dwyane Wade, Carmelo Anthony, Larry Brown', 'NR', 'Iverson is the ultimate legacy of NBA legend Allen Iverson, who rose from a childhood of crushing poverty in Hampton, Virginia, to become an 11-time NBA All-Star and universally recognized icon of his sport. Off the court, his audacious rejection of conservative NBA convention and unapologetic embrace of hip hop culture sent shockwaves throughout the league and influenced an entire generation. Told largely in Iverson''s own words, the film charts the career highs and lows of one of the most distinctive and accomplished figures the sport of basketball has ever seen.', 'Iverson is the ultimate legacy of NBA legend Allen Iverson, who rose from a childhood of crushing poverty in Hampton, Virginia, to become an 11-time NBA All-Star and universally recognized icon of his sport. Off the court, his audacious rejection of conservative NBA convention and unapologetic embrace of hip hop culture sent shockwaves throughout the league and influenced an entire generation. Told largely in Iverson''s own words, the film charts the career highs and lows of one of the most distinctive and accomplished figures the sport of basketball has ever seen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8JKFYFOzsW4ScokxzjlkyTgxVb1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:266442'),
  ('971206854615950957', 'Ivko''s Feast', 2005, 'Comedy', 'Zdravko Šotra', 'Miroslav Momčilović, Zdravko Šotra', 'Zoran Cvijanović, Dragan Bjelogrlić, Milorad Mandić, Srđan ''Žika'' Todorović, Nikola Đuričko, Anica Dobra, Nataša Ninković, Dragoslav ''Dragan'' Nikolić', null, 'The story takes place in Nis, towards the end of the nineteenth century, during the calm down of the stormy historic events which led to final liberation of southern Serbian parts from Turkish occupation. The comedy is about celebrating traditional saint''s day feast, organized by Ivko and how his guests test the Serbian hospitality.', 'The story takes place in Nis, towards the end of the nineteenth century, during the calm down of the stormy historic events which led to final liberation of southern Serbian parts from Turkish occupation. The comedy is about celebrating traditional saint''s day feast, organized by Ivko and how his guests test the Serbian hospitality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iIyMjxmO3iRlvigqFllrKlr6BeF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55125'),
